  ('482795865792300200', 'All Fall Down', 1962, 'Drama', 'John Frankenheimer, Lionel Lindon, Hal W. Polaire', 'William Inge', 'Eva Marie Saint, Warren Beatty, Karl Malden, Angela Lansbury, Brandon De Wilde, Constance Ford, Barbara Baxley, Evans Evans', 'NR', 'Ralph and Annabell Willart are a feuding couple who are constantly bickering over their worthless, good-for-nothing son Berry-Berry. When Berry-Berry begins yet another meaningless love affair, this time with an older woman named Echo O’Brien, he really gets his parents at each others’ throats.', 'Ralph and Annabell Willart are a feuding couple who are constantly bickering over their worthless, good-for-nothing son Berry-Berry. When Berry-Berry begins yet another meaningless love affair, this time with an older woman named Echo O’Brien, he really gets his parents at each others’ throats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY826mLuUOc8CXEyWSXiPUAb0xv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86240'),
  ('773291331395213902', 'All Fired Up', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Pierre Lhomme', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Élisabeth Rappeneau, Joyce Buñuel', 'Yves Montand, Isabelle Adjani, Lauren Hutton, Alain Souchon, Jean-Luc Bideau, Pinkas Braun, Jean-Pierre Miquel, Jean Rougerie', null, 'Victor Valance, an absent father and gambler, works with shady casino operations abroad. When he returns to Paris in need of money, he plans to take advantage that Pauline, his eldest daughter now fully responsible for the whole family, has begun to work for the Ministry of Finance. Pauline thwarts his new projects but when she realizes gangsters are looking for Victor she will put her life at risk to help him and save their family.', 'Victor Valance, an absent father and gambler, works with shady casino operations abroad. When he returns to Paris in need of money, he plans to take advantage that Pauline, his eldest daughter now fully responsible for the whole family, has begun to work for the Ministry of Finance. Pauline thwarts his new projects but when she realizes gangsters are looking for Victor she will put her life at risk to help him and save their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKHyy1skNuNF1vRkG1g3i8l5u6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80587'),
  ('303833008901318743', 'All for a Rose', 2017, 'Drama', 'Marco Sgorbati, Marco Bellocchio', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Elena Bellocchio, Vanessa Scalera, Corrado Invernizzi, Irene Baratta, Jacopo Di Nuzzo, Francesco Manuel Barigozzi', null, 'Elena has just turned 18 and this is her first day working in a coffee bar in Bobbio, a town in the north of Italy. It''s summer and the coffee bar is very busy. The first day at work is a chance for Elena to meet lots of different people. Each person has a different story to tell - not just in words but also through simple gestures and actions. These characters can sometimes be quite odd and reflect the countless nuances of the human soul.', 'Elena has just turned 18 and this is her first day working in a coffee bar in Bobbio, a town in the north of Italy. It''s summer and the coffee bar is very busy. The first day at work is a chance for Elena to meet lots of different people. Each person has a different story to tell - not just in words but also through simple gestures and actions. These characters can sometimes be quite odd and reflect the countless nuances of the human soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rg7xTDfd0oxnUDm5KkXP7nrFBKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469193'),
  ('942999893223039175', 'All for Ella', 2022, 'Music, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Teresa Hoerl, Fabian Rösler', 'Anja Scharf, Timo Baer, Teresa Hoerl', 'Lina Larissa Strahl, Safira Robens, Malene Becker, Tijan Marei, Gustav Schmidt, Lorenzo Germeno, Lavinia Wilson, Milan Peschel', null, 'Ella and her friends sign up for a song contest that offers her the chance to make it big in the music business. Her strongest competitor is rapper alfaMK, who already has a fan base and is also outrageously good-looking.', 'Ella and her friends sign up for a song contest that offers her the chance to make it big in the music business. Her strongest competitor is rapper alfaMK, who already has a fan base and is also outrageously good-looking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h361ZPOmkBg0jWxfQOno9z1TbJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915885'),
  ('1113517277064311690', 'All for Love', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Min Kyu-dong', 'Oh Sun-hee, Min Kyu-dong, Yu Seong-hyeob', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Hwang Jung-min, Cheon Ho-jin, Im Chang-jung, Seo Young-hee, Yoon Jin-seo, Kim Soo-ro, Jung Kyung-ho', null, 'A romantic comedy which portrays the most beautiful period in the lives of different couples who have just fallen in love.', 'A romantic comedy which portrays the most beautiful period in the lives of different couples who have just fallen in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izQ82BNvijkOckyPsKEaiGP2ibo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208874'),
  ('385467856936565210', 'All for One', 2025, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Houda Benyamina, Nicolas Dessommes, Frédéric Gérard', 'Houda Benyamina, Juliette Sales, Fabien Suarez', 'Oulaya Amamra, Sabrina Ouazani, Déborah Lukumuena, Daphné Patakia, Georgina Amorós, Kacey Mottet Klein, Némo Schiffman, Martin Karmann', null, 'France, 1625. Women! They’re women! With fake beards, chest binders and pants underneath their outfits, they are indeed women. Sara, a young girl on the run, unmasks the true nature of the three musketeers, protectors of the Queen of France. She decides to join these powerful women and their dangerous idea: dress as men to live free, even at the risk of their very own lives.', 'France, 1625. Women! They’re women! With fake beards, chest binders and pants underneath their outfits, they are indeed women. Sara, a young girl on the run, unmasks the true nature of the three musketeers, protectors of the Queen of France. She decides to join these powerful women and their dangerous idea: dress as men to live free, even at the risk of their very own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZlEeLJPJZ61DzJ1DDXYpnGeBCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995797'),
  ('586448205279617305', 'All for the Moral Majority!', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alberto Sordi, Paola Scola, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Augusto Caminito, Alberto Sordi, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Joe Pesci, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Giorgia Moll, Armando Francioli, Tino Bianchi, Carlo Demi, Gianni Rizzo', null, 'The incorruptible judge Annibale Salvemini, starts investigating over a classic Italian business/politics/corruption affair. He start to operate, as usual, very strongly. He orders numberless arrests. But the reaction of counterparts won''t take long. In fact his strong energetic manners, drive him unintentionally on the opposite situation. Who is the real guilty the judge or the corrupted Italian society?', 'The incorruptible judge Annibale Salvemini, starts investigating over a classic Italian business/politics/corruption affair. He start to operate, as usual, very strongly. He orders numberless arrests. But the reaction of counterparts won''t take long. In fact his strong energetic manners, drive him unintentionally on the opposite situation. Who is the real guilty the judge or the corrupted Italian society?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvf7Jwygza3EaNh4YAiz8sRB6nj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48953'),
  ('587061280804518061', 'All for the Winner', 1990, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Corey Yuen, Chan Yuen-Kai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Ng See-Yuen', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sharla Cheung, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Paul Chun Pui, Angelina Lo, Corey Yuen, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'G', 'Sing, a dumb, lovable mainlander with supernatural powers comes to China to visit his uncle Tat. When it''s revealed that Sing can see through objects, Tat employs him as "The Saint of Gamblers," and proceeds to set him loose in the gambling world.', 'Sing, a dumb, lovable mainlander with supernatural powers comes to China to visit his uncle Tat. When it''s revealed that Sing can see through objects, Tat employs him as "The Saint of Gamblers," and proceeds to set him loose in the gambling world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/499lpFBmfvKgqxROaP1PiUkFja5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40346'),
  ('586635559652937499', 'All for Uma', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Elly Senger-Weiss, Susy Laude', 'Paola Pessot, Elly Senger-Weiss, Sole Tonnini', 'Marco Valerio Bartocci, Gabriele Ansanelli, Laura Bilgeri, Pietro Sermonti, Lillo Petrolo, Antonio Catania, Dino Abbrescia, Elisa Lepore', null, 'After taking a job at a family’s previously thriving vineyard, a young woman looks to save its dysfunctional owners from debt and themselves.', 'After taking a job at a family’s previously thriving vineyard, a young woman looks to save its dysfunctional owners from debt and themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akS3yzKcjvD0rpoPmbNoakF52LM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788413'),
  ('878488642159172583', 'All Fowled Up', 1955, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Intending to catch a chicken for his dinner, little Henery the Chicken Hawk ventures onto the farm of the eternally feuding Foghorn Leghorn and barnyard dog. Foghorn tries to dump a load of concrete on top of the dog, but the chute for dropping the concrete suddenly extends itself to a position directly above Foghorn, who is covered over by the concrete and frozen in a "Thinker" pose. Little Henery attaches a rope to the cement-laden Foghorn and drags him home for a tough-to-chew chicken dinner.', 'Intending to catch a chicken for his dinner, little Henery the Chicken Hawk ventures onto the farm of the eternally feuding Foghorn Leghorn and barnyard dog. Foghorn tries to dump a load of concrete on top of the dog, but the chute for dropping the concrete suddenly extends itself to a position directly above Foghorn, who is covered over by the concrete and frozen in a "Thinker" pose. Little Henery attaches a rope to the cement-laden Foghorn and drags him home for a tough-to-chew chicken dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjNSUUc658ePi9TNc8X05lAmS76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226819'),
  ('1102416595132934658', 'All Fun and Games', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ricardo Diaz, Ari Costa, Eren Celeboglu', 'J.J. Braider, Eren Celeboglu, Ari Costa', 'Asa Butterfield, Natalia Dyer, Benjamin Evan Ainsworth, Laurel Marsden, Annabeth Gish, Kolton Stewart, Summer H. Howell, Erik Athavale', 'R', 'A group of Salem teens discover a cursed knife that unleashes a demon that forces them to play gruesome, deadly versions of childhood games where there can be no winners, only survivors.', 'A group of Salem teens discover a cursed knife that unleashes a demon that forces them to play gruesome, deadly versions of childhood games where there can be no winners, only survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m0CTxlotr8H8GaoioL2IJHL1gW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926599'),
  ('593104894886438805', 'All Good', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Ersoy Güler', null, 'Burçin Bildik, Fulya Zenginer, Alper Saldıran, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Kenan Ece, Murat Akkoyunlu, Kamil Güler, Kevork Türker', null, 'While delivering a deceased man''s body for burial, a naive village courier encounters a host of eccentrics and implicates himself in dark crimes.', 'While delivering a deceased man''s body for burial, a naive village courier encounters a host of eccentrics and implicates himself in dark crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coCanvmNLFhD07LrFPV8BMtRetS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140485'),
  ('478450009880878648', 'All Good', 2018, 'Drama', 'Eva Trobisch, Julian Krubasik', 'Eva Trobisch', 'Aenne Schwarz, Andreas Döhler, Hans Löw, Tilo Nest, Lisa Hagmeister, Lina Wendel, Falk Rockstroh, Annika Blendl', null, 'A woman sexually assaulted by her new boss''s brother-in-law tries to move on as if nothing happened, but the night weighs heavily on her mind and body.', 'A woman sexually assaulted by her new boss''s brother-in-law tries to move on as if nothing happened, but the night weighs heavily on her mind and body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ssKuD8wdTvrKUu0SsRxCBwqKd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504859'),
  ('964507804805938380', 'All Good 2 Back To Square One', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ersoy Güler', null, 'Burçin Bildik, Ezgi Asaroğlu, Murat Akkoyunlu, Nazlı Tosunoğlu, Yakup Yavru, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Metin Yıldız, Erkan Bektaş', null, 'Salim decides to take the coffin of a deserted body to his hometown. But this journey turns into an adventure where Salih and his travel buddy Nihal fight against serial killers and bad guys. When Nihal''s mom is taken hostage for revenge, things take an unplanned turn. Now they''re wanted as serial killers and have to wear disguise to not get caught.', 'Salim decides to take the coffin of a deserted body to his hometown. But this journey turns into an adventure where Salih and his travel buddy Nihal fight against serial killers and bad guys. When Nihal''s mom is taken hostage for revenge, things take an unplanned turn. Now they''re wanted as serial killers and have to wear disguise to not get caught.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/495lDj8Cne3uJzYi9ojcaW1m9H7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271910'),
  ('725077915359873434', 'All Good Things', 2010, 'Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Andrew Jarecki, Michael Seresin', 'Marcus Hinchey, Marc Smerling', 'Ryan Gosling, Kirsten Dunst, Frank Langella, Lily Rabe, Philip Baker Hall, Michael Esper, Diane Venora, Nick Offerman', 'R', 'Newly-discovered facts, court records and speculation are used to elaborate the true love story and murder mystery of the most notorious unsolved murder case in New York history.', 'Newly-discovered facts, court records and speculation are used to elaborate the true love story and murder mystery of the most notorious unsolved murder case in New York history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RM8SyB0yHanJbYeHdgi5eLv21C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46503'),
  ('957457674407433160', 'All Hail', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Horacio Maira, Eliana Roses, Adriana Vior', 'Nicolás Giacobone, Fernando Balmayor', 'Guillermo Francella, Romina Fernandes, Peto Menahem, Martín Seefeld, Laurita Fernández, Nicolás Scarpino, Viviana Saccone, Pompeyo Audivert', null, 'A famous TV weatherman, Miguel Flores, becomes public enemy number one when he fails to predict a terrible hailstorm. He is forced out of the big city, Buenos Aires, fleeing the capital for his birthplace of Córdoba. The result will be a voyage of rediscovery that is as absurd as it is human.', 'A famous TV weatherman, Miguel Flores, becomes public enemy number one when he fails to predict a terrible hailstorm. He is forced out of the big city, Buenos Aires, fleeing the capital for his birthplace of Córdoba. The result will be a voyage of rediscovery that is as absurd as it is human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zVyqx5WKb0iCkk46wDUxuwAiMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682344'),
  ('723371318514633474', 'All Hallow''s Eve', 2016, 'Family', 'Olivia Kuan, Charlie Vaughn', 'Jake Helgren, Brandon Alexander III', 'Lexi Giovagnoli, Ashley Argota, John DeLuca, Diane Salinger, Martin Klebba, Dee Wallace, Tracey Gold, Pilot Saraceno', null, 'Eve Hallows'' 18th birthday comes with an unexpected family legacy of magic. When Eve attempts a spell to speak with her deceased mother, she accidentally summons a vengeful witch who threatens to wreak havoc. As a Halloween party goes wrong and a theater becomes the stage for disaster, it is up to Eve to believe in herself and take control of her destiny.', 'Eve Hallows'' 18th birthday comes with an unexpected family legacy of magic. When Eve attempts a spell to speak with her deceased mother, she accidentally summons a vengeful witch who threatens to wreak havoc. As a Halloween party goes wrong and a theater becomes the stage for disaster, it is up to Eve to believe in herself and take control of her destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eU9IBodwp3RnTgIJzwKjHow1LI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416261'),
  ('521927684879837035', 'All Hallows'' Eve', 2013, 'Horror', 'Damien Leone, Christopher Cafaro, Christopher Eadicicco', 'Damien Leone', 'Katie Maguire, Catherine A. Callahan, Marie Maser, Kayla Lian, Mike Giannelli, Sydney Freihofer, Cole Mathewson, Michael Chmiel', 'R', 'While watching two children on Halloween night, a babysitter finds an old VHS tape in the kids'' trick or treat bag. The tape features three tales of terror, all linked together by a murderous clown.', 'While watching two children on Halloween night, a babysitter finds an old VHS tape in the kids'' trick or treat bag. The tape features three tales of terror, all linked together by a murderous clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSe8CBqK8HkbP6sqZWzcJfQV9Ci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231001'),
  ('195156893556005717', 'All Hallows'' Eve 2', 2015, 'Horror', 'Antonio Padovan, Michael Jari Davidson, Kyle Stryker', 'Mike Kochansky, Michael Koehler, Elias Benavidez', 'Andrea Monier, Damien Monier, Griffin Gluck, Helen Rogers, Tyler Rossell, Brazen, Steve Anderson Jr., Ron Basch', null, 'A woman finds a VHS tape on her doorstep that shows a series of gruesome tales that could be real. But the true danger is the pumpkin-faced killer that''s using the tape to find his next victim.', 'A woman finds a VHS tape on her doorstep that shows a series of gruesome tales that could be real. But the true danger is the pumpkin-faced killer that''s using the tape to find his next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1dKe1xL7ZyMDMx4d12A0Z0Ny3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361043'),
  ('588177537962950357', 'All Hands on Deck!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Guilhem Amesland, Carla Hennequart, Guillaume Brac', 'Catherine Paillé, Guillaume Brac', 'Éric Nantchouang, Salif Cissé, Édouard Sulpice, Asma Messaoudene, Ana Blagojević, Lucie Gallo, Martin Mesnier, Nicolas Pietri', null, 'An unlikely oddball trio bond during an impromptu trip to the French countryside on a foolhardy romantic mission.', 'An unlikely oddball trio bond during an impromptu trip to the French countryside on a foolhardy romantic mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymwEpKb4XnVdhdhDfKmR6EScxhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665753'),
