  ('751108105647309065', 'All I Need for Christmas', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David I. Strasser, Koty Bannouvong, Masha Jenkins', 'Heidi R. Kling, Betsy Morris', 'Mallory Jansen, Dan Jeannotte, Emily Tennant, Mike Dopud, Azriel Dalman, Jaime M. Callica, Veronica Long, Iris Quinn', 'NR', 'Struggling singer/songwriter Maggie is worried she''s unable to compete with such a tech-savvy world. Upon returning home to help her parents on their farm she meets Archer, an entrepreneur who has come back to town to spend the holidays alone.', 'Struggling singer/songwriter Maggie is worried she''s unable to compete with such a tech-savvy world. Upon returning home to help her parents on their farm she meets Archer, an entrepreneur who has come back to town to spend the holidays alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qH9VoUVO2rOVT3BrzP2SHOHtwrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361253'),
  ('1147279192552935606', 'All I See Is You', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Marc Forster, Matthias Koenigswieser', 'Marc Forster, Sean Conway', 'Blake Lively, Jason Clarke, Ahna O''Reilly, Miquel Fernández, Xavi Sánchez, Yvonne Strahovski, Wes Chatham, Danny Huston', 'R', 'After a successful experimental surgery restores her eyesight, a young woman sees her marriage spiral in a disturbing direction.', 'After a successful experimental surgery restores her eyesight, a young woman sees her marriage spiral in a disturbing direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wc9MgFWuBl3VS72w6VtiZXTgN79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345923'),
  ('74849698664337754', 'All I Want for Christmas', 2007, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Family', 'Harvey Frost, Dane Peterson', 'Marc Prey', 'Gail O''Grady, Greg Germann, Amanda Foreman, Jimmy ''Jax'' Pinchak, Robert Mailhouse, Robert Pine, Gloria Gifford, Gia Mantegna', 'PG-13', 'Tis the season for making dreams true. If everything goes according to plan for one young boy, he just may be sharing this Christmas with a new dad. Ever since her husband died, Sarah Armstrong has divided her time between working at a community center and caring for her nine-year-old son, Jesse. When Jesse wins the All I Want for Christmas contest sponsored by a toy company, his wish comes as no surprise to find a new dad. Just in time for the holidays, All I Want for Christmas is a surprise romantic treat for anyone who believes in the magic of love, friendship, and family.', 'Tis the season for making dreams true. If everything goes according to plan for one young boy, he just may be sharing this Christmas with a new dad. Ever since her husband died, Sarah Armstrong has divided her time between working at a community center and caring for her nine-year-old son, Jesse. When Jesse wins the All I Want for Christmas contest sponsored by a toy company, his wish comes as no surprise to find a new dad. Just in time for the holidays, All I Want for Christmas is a surprise romantic treat for anyone who believes in the magic of love, friendship, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4hSrTPrVSBG7GLJCXL1t18tJRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144097'),
  ('297310114882644829', 'All I Want For Christmas', 1991, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Lieberman, Robert Fechtman, J. Michael Haynie', 'Thom Eberhardt, Richard Kramer', 'Harley Jane Kozak, Jamey Sheridan, Thora Birch, Ethan Embry, Kevin Nealon, Andrea Martin, Lauren Bacall, Amy Oberer', 'G', 'Siblings Ethan and Hallie O''Fallon plot to get their divorced parents back together in time for Christmas.', 'Siblings Ethan and Hallie O''Fallon plot to get their divorced parents back together in time for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Fcyjwyg7Qjp0qUKo4HfoC7JIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13644'),
  ('709270742515283101', 'All I Wish', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Susan Walter, Pedro Gómez Millán', 'Susan Walter', 'Sharon Stone, Tony Goldwyn, Ellen Burstyn, Famke Janssen, Liza Lapira, Caitlin FitzGerald, Gilles Marini, Erica Ash', null, 'A woman struggles to escape the clutches of her overbearing, co-dependent mother, while gradually falling for a sexy, sophisticated attorney.', 'A woman struggles to escape the clutches of her overbearing, co-dependent mother, while gradually falling for a sexy, sophisticated attorney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Cm7htvkYRB4M04LzEAIgKoS0n9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462723'),
  ('118542275891615245', 'All in a Night''s Work', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joseph Anthony, Joseph LaShelle, Daniel McCauley', 'Sidney Sheldon, Edmund Beloin, Maurice Richlin', 'Dean Martin, Shirley MacLaine, Cliff Robertson, Charles Ruggles, Norma Crane, Jack Weston, John Hudson, Jerome Cowan', null, 'After the sudden death of magazine publisher Colonel Ryder, his nephew, Tony inherits the magazine and has big plans to expand it. While negotiating a loan from the bank, Tony gets a call from a detective surrounding his uncle''s death. It turns out Colonel Ryder died in his hotel room with a smile on his face and a young woman was seen fleeing his room wearing only a towel. Suspicious of this woman and afraid the magazine''s wholesome image may be tarnished and their loan denied, Tony asks the detective to stick around and find her.', 'After the sudden death of magazine publisher Colonel Ryder, his nephew, Tony inherits the magazine and has big plans to expand it. While negotiating a loan from the bank, Tony gets a call from a detective surrounding his uncle''s death. It turns out Colonel Ryder died in his hotel room with a smile on his face and a young woman was seen fleeing his room wearing only a towel. Suspicious of this woman and afraid the magazine''s wholesome image may be tarnished and their loan denied, Tony asks the detective to stick around and find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gml0rogF8lvS3vEjTyPjQvpdbxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88930'),
