  ('810728882836073606', 'All in Favor', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Santiago Requejo, Kiko de la Rica, Tono Escudero', 'Santiago Requejo', 'Raúl Fernández de Pablo, Clara Lago, Tito Valverde, Gonzalo de Castro, Christian Checa, Neus Sanz, Charo Reina, Pepe Carrasco', null, 'At a downtown Madrid building, an ordinary meeting of neighbors commune to vote on a change of elevator. However, the event escalates into a full-blown conflict after the unexpected announcement that a new, mentally ill tenant will rent an apartment.', 'At a downtown Madrid building, an ordinary meeting of neighbors commune to vote on a change of elevator. However, the event escalates into a full-blown conflict after the unexpected announcement that a new, mentally ill tenant will rent an apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVYEP9R8fBe6sxrqc3gP1cAehYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380651'),
  ('404574484374050728', 'All in Good Taste', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Anthony Kramreither, Robert Appelbe, Dennis Miller', 'Robert C. Diez d''Aux, Rick Green, Anthony Kramreither', 'Jonathan Welsh, Harvey Atkin, Jack Creley, James B. Douglas, Joanne Kirwan-Clarke, Linda Rennhofer, Patti Oatman, Don Cullen', null, 'A filmmaker is upset to find out that his wholesome script about an orphan and his dog has been warped into a film about strippers.', 'A filmmaker is upset to find out that his wholesome script about an orphan and his dog has been warped into a film about strippers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thpzhk1JXs5Jqyrh1Hu0vl3cdl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79679'),
  ('668382535142700594', 'All in the Family', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Chu Mu, Chris Chen Ching-Chu', 'Si-Ma Ke', 'Wang Lai, Wang Han-Chen, Lau Yat-Fan, Nancy Liang Lan-Shih, Ma Chien-Tang, Ha Man, Dean Shek Tin, Tanny Tien-Ni', null, 'A family gathers to be with its dying father. The reunion brings to the surface old rivalries.', 'A family gathers to be with its dying father. The reunion brings to the surface old rivalries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgRHKgvfkVNOoNiln8apMlLHQvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69482'),
  ('691048311357510648', 'All In: The Fight for Democracy', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Lisa Cortés, Liz Garbus', 'Jack Youngelson', 'Stacey Abrams, Debo Adegbile, Jayla Allen, Carol Anderson, Eric Foner, Marcia Fudge, Lauren Groh-Wargo, Luci Baines Johnson', 'PG-13', 'Examines the often overlooked, yet insidious issue of voter suppression in the United States in anticipation of the 2020 presidential election. With the perspective and expertise of Stacey Abrams, the former Minority Leader of the Georgia House of Representatives, the film offers an insider’s look into laws and barriers to voting that most people don’t even know is a threat to their basic rights as citizens of the United States.', 'Examines the often overlooked, yet insidious issue of voter suppression in the United States in anticipation of the 2020 presidential election. With the perspective and expertise of Stacey Abrams, the former Minority Leader of the Georgia House of Representatives, the film offers an insider’s look into laws and barriers to voting that most people don’t even know is a threat to their basic rights as citizens of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17nj0QAJy3xqVZawSj0sxpCUDVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727705'),
  ('70862795170835658', 'All Inclusive', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Diego Levy, Pablo Levy, Martín Armoya', 'Diego Levy, Pablo Levy, Ignacio Sánchez Mestre', 'Alan Sabbagh, Julieta Zylberberg, Mike Amigorena, Marina Bellati, Mariana Chaud, Santiago Korovsky, Martín Campilongo, Martín Garabal', null, 'Pablo and Lucia live together. Pablo buys an All-Inclusive in Brazil online as a surprise for Lucia but his boss firing him, so Pablo tries to cancel the trip but he can''t. They travel anyway, but Brazil waits with nothing but trouble..', 'Pablo and Lucia live together. Pablo buys an All-Inclusive in Brazil online as a surprise for Lucia but his boss firing him, so Pablo tries to cancel the trip but he can''t. They travel anyway, but Brazil waits with nothing but trouble..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW1cPQq7G7yZfLUXMETl8PHHfue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555311'),
