  ('738552492527763535', 'All Is Bright', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phil Morrison, W. Mott Hupfel III', 'Melissa James Gibson', 'Paul Giamatti, Paul Rudd, Sally Hawkins, Amy Landecker, Peter Hermann, Emory Cohen, Michael Drayer, Tatyana Richaud', 'R', 'Two ne’er-do-wells from Quebec travel to New York City with a scheme to get rich quick selling Christmas trees.', 'Two ne’er-do-wells from Quebec travel to New York City with a scheme to get rich quick selling Christmas trees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spCLVHZnOCcjrGwCEaVi8ADKRsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174311'),
  ('195674269126090298', 'All Is Forgiven', 2007, 'Drama, Family', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Pascal Auffray', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Paul Blain, Marie-Christine Friedrich, Victoire Rousseau, Constance Rousseau, Carole Franck, Olivia Ross, Alice Langlois, Pascal Bongard', null, 'A father and daughter are reunited some 11 years after the father''s drug addiction tore the family apart.', 'A father and daughter are reunited some 11 years after the father''s drug addiction tore the family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvc8qGCTKKK7ZPIg87TSUi9IDFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80799'),
  ('172903996779879177', 'All Is Lost', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'J.C. Chandor, Frankie DeMarco, Peter Zuccarini', 'J.C. Chandor', 'Robert Redford', 'PG-13', 'During a solo voyage in the Indian Ocean, a veteran mariner awakes to find his vessel taking on water after a collision with a stray shipping container. With his radio and navigation equipment disabled, he sails unknowingly into a violent storm and barely escapes with his life. With any luck, the ocean currents may carry him into a shipping lane -- but, with supplies dwindling and the sharks circling, the sailor is forced to face his own mortality.', 'During a solo voyage in the Indian Ocean, a veteran mariner awakes to find his vessel taking on water after a collision with a stray shipping container. With his radio and navigation equipment disabled, he sails unknowingly into a violent storm and barely escapes with his life. With any luck, the ocean currents may carry him into a shipping lane -- but, with supplies dwindling and the sharks circling, the sailor is forced to face his own mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cVA4oX2xHgiglv6hemxwAaofsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152747'),
  ('378646553683137061', 'All Is One. Except 0', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Tanja Schwerdorf, Klaus Maeck, Timo Großpietsch', null, 'Wau Holland, Peter Glaser, Steffen Wernéry, Linus Neumann, Andy Müller-Maguhn', null, 'In 1981, Wau Holland and other hackers established the Hamburg based Chaos Computer Club (CCC). The idiosyncratic freethinkers were inspired by Californian technology visionaries and committed themselves to hacker ethics. All information must be free. Use public data, protect private data. But not everyone followed the rules. Computer technology was still in its infancy and the emerging Internet became a projection screen for social utopias. What has become of them? The story of the German hackers, told by the protagonists themselves in a montage of found video and audio material.', 'In 1981, Wau Holland and other hackers established the Hamburg based Chaos Computer Club (CCC). The idiosyncratic freethinkers were inspired by Californian technology visionaries and committed themselves to hacker ethics. All information must be free. Use public data, protect private data. But not everyone followed the rules. Computer technology was still in its infancy and the emerging Internet became a projection screen for social utopias. What has become of them? The story of the German hackers, told by the protagonists themselves in a montage of found video and audio material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLU8YLvlwJVE3zSRtz8czycsNMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757815'),
  ('52092481811510961', 'All Is True', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'Charlotte Hutchings, Kenneth Branagh, Zac Nicholson', 'Ben Elton', 'Kenneth Branagh, Judi Dench, Ian McKellen, Kathryn Wilder, Lydia Wilson, Hadley Fraser, Jack Colgrave Hirst, John Dagleish', 'PG-13', 'London, June 29th, 1613. The Globe Theater, ran by the famous playwright William Shakespeare, accidentally burns to ashes. Seriously affected, he stops writing and returns to his hometown, where his wife Anne and daughters Judith and Susanna get surprised to hear he intends to stay there definitively, after two decades working in the capital, neglecting his sincere affections for them.', 'London, June 29th, 1613. The Globe Theater, ran by the famous playwright William Shakespeare, accidentally burns to ashes. Seriously affected, he stops writing and returns to his hometown, where his wife Anne and daughters Judith and Susanna get surprised to hear he intends to stay there definitively, after two decades working in the capital, neglecting his sincere affections for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yae0QoZuPQ6yC8HleRYXXfttPLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558095'),
  ('503442502156064233', 'All Is Well', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Umesh Shukla', 'Sumit Arora, Niren Bhatt', 'Rishi Kapoor, Abhishek Bachchan, Asin Thottumkal, Supriya Karnik, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Herry Tangiri', null, 'A road trip, undertaken by Rishi Kapoor and Abhishek Bachchan, is later joined by their mother.', 'A road trip, undertaken by Rishi Kapoor and Abhishek Bachchan, is later joined by their mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsruH6BJCDy5ELSB7u9oZKryf2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355279'),
  ('738855118662182300', 'All Love Songs', 2018, 'Romance', 'Joana Mariani, Maria Gadú, Gustavo Hadba', 'Juliana Araripe, Márcio Alemão', 'Marina Ruy Barbosa, Bruno Gagliasso, Luíza Mariani, Júlio Andrade, Gilberto Gil', null, 'Chico and Ana move to an apartment in São Paulo. As they unpack Ana found a cassette tape. It''s a mix-tape that Clarisse made 20 years earlier to her husband Daniel. Albeit separated by time, both stories will cross paths in a unique way.', 'Chico and Ana move to an apartment in São Paulo. As they unpack Ana found a cassette tape. It''s a mix-tape that Clarisse made 20 years earlier to her husband Daniel. Albeit separated by time, both stories will cross paths in a unique way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33R4G252vCNs1yf2JEzt7nD6HjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549246'),
  ('1026718659592519464', 'All Men Are Brothers', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Wu Ma, Chang Cheh, Kuang Han-Lu', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Fan Mei-Sheng, Chen Kuan-Tai, Wong Chung, Danny Lee Sau-Yin, Wang Kuang-Yu, Yu Feng, Ti Lung', null, 'Based on one of China''s enduring epic novels, written in the 14th century, "All Men Are Brothers" continues the patriotic story of righteous warriors battling despotic leaders, featuring mythic characters familiar to every Chinese, and with a cast that has achieved an equally celebrated status among Shaw Brothers devotees.', 'Based on one of China''s enduring epic novels, written in the 14th century, "All Men Are Brothers" continues the patriotic story of righteous warriors battling despotic leaders, featuring mythic characters familiar to every Chinese, and with a cast that has achieved an equally celebrated status among Shaw Brothers devotees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weQtElhXeBwiFCLhhMWqWk5ttiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56277'),
