  ('50291567595919760', 'All Mine to Give', 1957, 'Drama, Romance, Family', 'Allen Reisner', 'Dale Eunson, Katherine Albert', 'Glynis Johns, Cameron Mitchell, Rex Thompson, Patty McCormack, Ernest Truex, Hope Emerson, Alan Hale Jr., Sylvia Field', null, 'This is a story based on fact that follows a husband and wife who emigrate from Scotland to Wisconsin in the 1850s. They work very hard and become welcome citizens of their new town, Eureka. They have six children. They prosper in the husband''s boat-building business. But when their eldest is 12, tragedy strikes the family, and the 12-year-old is burdened with a terrible task which he handles as well as any adult could.', 'This is a story based on fact that follows a husband and wife who emigrate from Scotland to Wisconsin in the 1850s. They work very hard and become welcome citizens of their new town, Eureka. They have six children. They prosper in the husband''s boat-building business. But when their eldest is 12, tragedy strikes the family, and the 12-year-old is burdened with a terrible task which he handles as well as any adult could.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Cd1bpE34FWGRZ41vzwXuNjDzsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80521'),
  ('528594441875186369', 'All Mixed Up', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Josiane Balasko, François Catonné', 'Jacques Audiard, Josiane Balasko', 'Isabelle Huppert, Josiane Balasko, Farid Chopel, Jean Carmet, Coluche, Dominique Lavanant, Michel Albertini, Jean-Pierre Coffe', null, 'After the death of her little boy, Anita wants to take her own life.', 'After the death of her little boy, Anita wants to take her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MOnNxC2rkwuQNeDAyDC80TUAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192324'),
