  ('1101848528875066376', 'All Monsters Attack', 1969, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Ishirō Honda, Masaaki Hisamatsu, Ishirō Honda', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Tomonori Yazaki, Hideyo Amamoto, Sachio Sakai, Kazuo Suzuki, Kenji Sahara, Machiko Naka, Shigeki Ishida, Midori Uchiyama', 'G', 'Ichiro Miki is a child living in the industrial district of Kawasaki, where his parents'' constant struggle to make ends meet often leaves the schoolboy alone. Constantly teased by a bully nicknamed Gabara, his only friends are toy consultant Shinpei and fellow classmate Sachiko. Ichiro turns to escapist dreams of Monster Island where he befriends the equally bullied Minilla.', 'Ichiro Miki is a child living in the industrial district of Kawasaki, where his parents'' constant struggle to make ends meet often leaves the schoolboy alone. Constantly teased by a bully nicknamed Gabara, his only friends are toy consultant Shinpei and fellow classmate Sachiko. Ichiro turns to escapist dreams of Monster Island where he befriends the equally bullied Minilla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0LQ38Z1eAM0Hz8EbfyTF0oZZYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39462'),
  ('869891069882519616', 'All My Friends Are Dead', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Aneja Belcl, Karolina Galicka, Patryk Sielecki', 'Jan Belcl', 'Julia Wieniawa, Mateusz Więcławek, Adam Woronowicz, Monika Krzywkowska, Paulina Gałązka, Aleksandra Pisula, Adam Turczyk, Nikodem Rozbicki', 'NR', 'A group of friends at a New Year’s Eve party go through a whirlwind of events that exposes secrets, breaks hearts — and leads to a shocking outcome.', 'A group of friends at a New Year’s Eve party go through a whirlwind of events that exposes secrets, breaks hearts — and leads to a shocking outcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GGF9oW3b8qqjvig3n8Qftl4P1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780154'),
  ('1075689004730398784', 'All My Friends Hate Me', 2022, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Andrew Gaynord, Ben Moulden, Tim Robinson-Boulton', 'Tom Palmer, Tom Stourton', 'Tom Stourton, Georgina Campbell, Charly Clive, Antonia Clarke, Joshua McGuire, Dustin Demri-Burns, Graham Dickson, Christopher Fairbank', 'R', 'A college reunion goes awry when Pete suspects his friends may be out to get him... As their weekend getaway grows more and more uncomfortable, should Pete be worried about his safety, or is it all in his head?', 'A college reunion goes awry when Pete suspects his friends may be out to get him... As their weekend getaway grows more and more uncomfortable, should Pete be worried about his safety, or is it all in his head?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j5ZLDGWQ4U3iAD2wLNhs0CjpuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821489'),
  ('1105876351988949185', 'All My Good Countrymen', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Vojtěch Jasný, Jaromír Dvořáček, Lubomír Břinčil', 'Vojtěch Jasný', 'Radoslav Brzobohatý, Věra Galatíková, Vlastimil Brodský, Eva Blažková, Waldemar Matuška, Marie Málková, Vladimír Menšík, Pavel Pavlovský', null, 'The lives of 7 friends in a small Czech town from 1945 to some time after 1958.', 'The lives of 7 friends in a small Czech town from 1945 to some time after 1958.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hn0F5V3ZIjYbi7xTAkdGfRug6l6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46659'),
  ('470603121347412143', 'All My Life', 1966, 'Music', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'The film is made up of one single take. The camera pans to the left, focusing on a dilapidated fence in a rural field, as Ella Fitzgerald''s "All My Life" plays on the soundtrack. At the end of the 3 minute film, the camera tilts up to the blue sky just as the song ends.', 'The film is made up of one single take. The camera pans to the left, focusing on a dilapidated fence in a rural field, as Ella Fitzgerald''s "All My Life" plays on the soundtrack. At the end of the 3 minute film, the camera tilts up to the blue sky just as the song ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rrzM4vxnTHSEy1mpJNoW8awwvl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94512'),
  ('978206876003023035', 'All My Loved Ones', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Matej Mináč, Dodo Šimončič, Petr Hartl', 'Jiří Hubač', 'Josef Abrhám, Libuše Šafránková, Jiří Bartoška, Ondřej Vetchý, Braňo Holiček, Lucia Cúlková, Tereza Brodská, Marián Labuda', null, 'Told from the perspective of man reflecting on his childhood in Prague in the early years of World War II and the eventual destruction of his family as the Nazis rise to power. The storyline focuses heavily on Jewish-Czech Silberstein family members. Drama was filmed on the real events as a tribute to Mr. Nicholas Winton, the British humanitarian who organized the rescue of 669 children, most of them Jewish, from Czechoslovakia on the eve of the Second World War in an operation later known as the Czech Kindertransport from German-occupied Czechoslovakia and likely death in the Holocaust.', 'Told from the perspective of man reflecting on his childhood in Prague in the early years of World War II and the eventual destruction of his family as the Nazis rise to power. The storyline focuses heavily on Jewish-Czech Silberstein family members. Drama was filmed on the real events as a tribute to Mr. Nicholas Winton, the British humanitarian who organized the rescue of 669 children, most of them Jewish, from Czechoslovakia on the eve of the Second World War in an operation later known as the Czech Kindertransport from German-occupied Czechoslovakia and likely death in the Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57oFPLFv4JxguTV8iOgVzRpjyBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136478'),
  ('705672730849102571', 'All My Loving', 2019, 'Drama', 'Edward Berger, Jens Harant', 'Nele Mueller-Stöfen, Edward Berger', 'Lars Eidinger, Nele Mueller-Stöfen, Hans Löw, Manfred Zapatka, Christine Schorn, Godehard Giese, Mathilde Berger, Franziska Hartmann', null, 'Three siblings have all reached a point of their life, at which they realize the need to quickly change some things before they step into the second half of their lifetime. In the midst of chaos, insufficiency and loss they are searching for the path that just might lead them to happiness.', 'Three siblings have all reached a point of their life, at which they realize the need to quickly change some things before they step into the second half of their lifetime. In the midst of chaos, insufficiency and loss they are searching for the path that just might lead them to happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKXT5ETtX6HzO4FucXPoIeU7xeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547102'),
  ('322793696265836096', 'All My Puny Sorrows', 2022, 'Drama', 'Daniel Grant, Michael McGowan', 'Michael McGowan', 'Alison Pill, Sarah Gadon, Amybeth McNulty, Mare Winningham, Donal Logue, Mimi Kuzyk, Michael Musi, Aly Mawji', 'R', 'The story of two Mennonite sisters who have left their strict religious upbringing behind. While one sibling struggles in love and life, the other is a world-famous concert pianist.', 'The story of two Mennonite sisters who have left their strict religious upbringing behind. While one sibling struggles in love and life, the other is a world-famous concert pianist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqtPK4LHbuXwiHMlXwUD4hU4S2D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782092'),
  ('374261802506520681', 'All My Sons', 1948, 'Drama', 'Russell Metty, Irving Reis, Frank Shaw', 'Chester Erskine', 'Edward G. Robinson, Burt Lancaster, Mady Christians, Louisa Horton, Howard Duff, Frank Conroy, Lloyd Gough, Arlene Francis', 'NR', 'During WWII, industrialist Joe Keller commits a crime and frames his business partner Herbert Deever. Years later, his sin comes back to haunt him when his son plans to marry Deever''s daughter.', 'During WWII, industrialist Joe Keller commits a crime and frames his business partner Herbert Deever. Years later, his sin comes back to haunt him when his son plans to marry Deever''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEtpSNIQy2wW8ZDpT4MaF7O18Ha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45166'),
  ('446628233181415632', 'All Night Long', 1962, 'Drama, Music', 'Basil Dearden, Edward Scaife', 'Nel King, Paul Jarrico', 'Patrick McGoohan, Keith Michell, Betsy Blair, Paul Harris, Marti Stevens, Richard Attenborough, Bernard Braden, Harry Towb', 'NR', 'Over the course of one eventful evening, the anniversary celebration of the musical and romantic partners Aurelius Rex and Delia Lane, a jealous, ambitious drummer, Johnny Cousin, attempts to tear the interracial couple apart.', 'Over the course of one eventful evening, the anniversary celebration of the musical and romantic partners Aurelius Rex and Delia Lane, a jealous, ambitious drummer, Johnny Cousin, attempts to tear the interracial couple apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL0JqtS5LSvDNDvebw5J0IaBVgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37038'),
  ('581026364122971400', 'All Night Long', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Claude Tramont, Philip H. Lathrop', 'W.D. Richter', 'Gene Hackman, Barbra Streisand, Diane Ladd, Dennis Quaid, Kevin Dobson, William Daniels, Ann Doran, James Nolan', 'R', 'Executive George Dupler loses his temper and is demoted to the night manager at a 24 hour drugstore. After he suggests to his teenage son Freddie that he stop having an affair with suburban housewife Cheryl Gibbons, who is a distant cousin, Cheryl tries to seduce George. At home, in front of his mother, Freddie accuses his dad of stealing his girl, because he found Cheryl serving George a meal in the middle of the night, while her husband Bobby was on duty at the fire station. George then separates from his wife Helen, quits his job, moves into a warehouse, and asks Cheryl to move in with him.', 'Executive George Dupler loses his temper and is demoted to the night manager at a 24 hour drugstore. After he suggests to his teenage son Freddie that he stop having an affair with suburban housewife Cheryl Gibbons, who is a distant cousin, Cheryl tries to seduce George. At home, in front of his mother, Freddie accuses his dad of stealing his girl, because he found Cheryl serving George a meal in the middle of the night, while her husband Bobby was on duty at the fire station. George then separates from his wife Helen, quits his job, moves into a warehouse, and asks Cheryl to move in with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUe694KlHdlVvtgSRsGdrEkbtSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140413'),
  ('236409978682678056', 'All Night Long', 1992, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Katsuya Matsumura, Satoshi Murakawa', 'Katsuya Matsumura', 'Eisuke Tsunoda, Ryosuke Suzuki, Yoji Ietomi, Hiromasa Taguchi, Third Nagashima, Sachiko Wakayama, Yumi Goto, Ryoka Yuzuki', null, 'Three teenagers witness the brutal murder of a high school girl by an insane salaryman. The teenagers find themselves united by this event and become friends. Later the teenagers hold a party to take their mind off things. Their party is crashed by a local gang of thugs and one teenager finds his newly found girlfriend being raped. The teenagers deal with the thugs by using extreme violence.', 'Three teenagers witness the brutal murder of a high school girl by an insane salaryman. The teenagers find themselves united by this event and become friends. Later the teenagers hold a party to take their mind off things. Their party is crashed by a local gang of thugs and one teenager finds his newly found girlfriend being raped. The teenagers deal with the thugs by using extreme violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp352LoQFvrSTJn14DvndKW8M6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40030'),
  ('1033131896844927946', 'All Night Long 2', 1995, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Katsuya Matsumura, Saburo Higashihara', 'Katsuya Matsumura', 'Masashi Endô, Ryoka Yuzuki, Masahito Takahashi, Takamitsu Ōkubo, Miroku Igarashi, Keiichi Mano, Kei Nakata, Jôichi Shimoide', null, 'In downtown Japan, a lonely computer nerd tries to maintain a peaceful existance while being stalked by a gang of deviant homosexuals who want to use him for their brutal S&M activities.', 'In downtown Japan, a lonely computer nerd tries to maintain a peaceful existance while being stalked by a gang of deviant homosexuals who want to use him for their brutal S&M activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LIXWgVA7B6INce42fJyh94UBZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150164'),
