  ('879600544349804926', 'All Nighter', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Seamus Tierney, Gavin Wiesen', 'Seth W. Owen', 'J.K. Simmons, Lio Tipton, Emile Hirsch, Meta Golding, Jon Daly, Kristen Schaal, Taran Killam, Hunter Parrish', 'R', 'When a globe-trotting, workaholic father trying to visit his daughter on a last minute layover in Los Angeles discovers that she’s disappeared, he forces her awkward, nervous ex-boyfriend, still nursing a broken heart, to help him find her over the course of one increasingly crazy night.', 'When a globe-trotting, workaholic father trying to visit his daughter on a last minute layover in Los Angeles discovers that she’s disappeared, he forces her awkward, nervous ex-boyfriend, still nursing a broken heart, to help him find her over the course of one increasingly crazy night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciNUrbNv871umQ3IqvIOjet4s4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352501'),
  ('987062650283318226', 'All Nothing', 1978, 'Animation', 'Frédéric Back', 'Frédéric Back', null, null, 'An illustration of beings in a world where countless plant and animal species rapidly become extinct, and resources run dry due to greed. However, it is possible to avoid disaster by conserving and sharing what we have.', 'An illustration of beings in a world where countless plant and animal species rapidly become extinct, and resources run dry due to greed. However, it is possible to avoid disaster by conserving and sharing what we have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40y7fsxXPb26G9krkpgubKl08J4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90826'),
