  ('121843448702278255', 'All of a Sudden', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Herman Yau, Puccini Yu Kwok-Ping', 'Chau Ting', 'Irene Wan, Simon Yam, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Lam Chiu-Wing, Rico Chung Kai-Cheong, William Leung Chi-Ming, Joseph Chi Chiong Chavez', null, 'An erotic mystery in which two couples engage in multiple layers of passion, betrayal and murder.', 'An erotic mystery in which two couples engage in multiple layers of passion, betrayal and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GI9mC21UyZCcghL1TU3sAOhJsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193551'),
  ('635023161278593042', 'All of a Sudden', 2026, 'Drama', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Alan Guichaoua', 'Ryusuke Hamaguchi, Léa Le Dimna, Maoko Miyano', 'Virginie Efira, Tao Okamoto, Gabriel Dahmani, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Kodai Kurosaki, Marie Bunel, Jean-Louis Garçon, Jean-Charles Clichet', null, 'Marie-Lou Fontaine, director of a nursing home in the Paris suburbs, defies convention by adopting the ''Humanitude'' method despite her team’s resistance. Her encounter with Mari Morisaki, a terminally ill Japanese playwright, transforms her life. Together, they turn the facility into a symbol of resistance and humanity against the system’s limits.', 'Marie-Lou Fontaine, director of a nursing home in the Paris suburbs, defies convention by adopting the ''Humanitude'' method despite her team’s resistance. Her encounter with Mari Morisaki, a terminally ill Japanese playwright, transforms her life. Together, they turn the facility into a symbol of resistance and humanity against the system’s limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpDQvjzTf72Q263moHWBXIgsOjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476614'),
  ('666564434596172628', 'All of Me', 1984, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Richard H. Kline, Carl Reiner', 'Phil Alden Robinson', 'Steve Martin, Lily Tomlin, Victoria Tennant, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Richard Libertini, Dana Elcar, Jason Bernard, Selma Diamond', 'PG', 'Just before stubborn millionaire Edwina Cutwater dies, she asks her uptight lawyer, Roger Cobb, to amend her will so that her soul will pass to the young, vibrant Terry Hoskins – but the spiritual transference goes awry. Edwina enters Roger''s body instead, forcing him to battle Edwina for control of his own being.', 'Just before stubborn millionaire Edwina Cutwater dies, she asks her uptight lawyer, Roger Cobb, to amend her will so that her soul will pass to the young, vibrant Terry Hoskins – but the spiritual transference goes awry. Edwina enters Roger''s body instead, forcing him to battle Edwina for control of his own being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psPV28pJfFXN3RNxPe2CPkZwUMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10631'),
  ('481883847370649231', 'All of My Heart', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter DeLuise, Adam Sliwinski, Bill Mizel', 'Karen Berger', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Ed Asner, Greyston Holt, Daniel Cudmore, Heather Doerksen, Paul McGillion, Patrick Sabongui', 'G', 'A young caterer’s life suddenly changes course when she inherits a country home and learns she must share it with a career obsessed Wall Street trader. At first, these opposites do not attract, but feelings begin to change when they find themselves having to work side-by-side to restore their newly acquired home.', 'A young caterer’s life suddenly changes course when she inherits a country home and learns she must share it with a career obsessed Wall Street trader. At first, these opposites do not attract, but feelings begin to change when they find themselves having to work side-by-side to restore their newly acquired home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCAvpheAApLv9LtvMW0tjywkz6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317121'),
  ('455320034219915316', 'All of My Heart: Inn Love', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'William McKnight, Terry Ingram, Jennifer Nelson', 'Karen Berger', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Ed Asner, Daniel Cudmore, Heather Doerksen, Lara Gilchrist, Drew Ray Tanner, Barbara Pollard', 'PG', 'Brian and Jenny are preparing for the grand opening of their bed and breakfast, Emily''s Country Inn, when a big storm hits Buck County. Brian agrees to go back to Wall Street to boost their funds, while Jenny scrambles to keep the opening on track.', 'Brian and Jenny are preparing for the grand opening of their bed and breakfast, Emily''s Country Inn, when a big storm hits Buck County. Brian agrees to go back to Wall Street to boost their funds, while Jenny scrambles to keep the opening on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrAH2x1qPKXzCyBV0gV3sRSvN8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478210'),
  ('1145447256208253119', 'All of My Heart: The Wedding', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram, Randal Platt', 'Karen Berger', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Pauline Egan, Heather Doerksen, Daniel Cudmore, Ed Asner, Patrick Sabongui, Barbara Pollard', 'PG', 'Brian and Jenny are planning their wedding at the Inn where they fell in love. When a distant relative arrives and stakes their claim to the Inn, Brian and Jenny must find a way to save their beloved Inn or risk having to sell.', 'Brian and Jenny are planning their wedding at the Inn where they fell in love. When a distant relative arrives and stakes their claim to the Inn, Brian and Jenny must find a way to save their beloved Inn or risk having to sell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1n8xrAuu8la18SXw852tzy46lNO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543342'),
  ('1008000238992438727', 'All of Them Witches', 1996, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Daniel Gruener, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Daniel Gruener', 'Susana Zabaleta, Alejandro Tommasi, Ricardo Blume, Delia Casanova, Francis Laboriel, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Lety Gómez', null, 'Something strange is going on in Dolores'' apartment house--or is it mainly in Dolores'' head that the strangeness lies... When her best friend Eva is murdered on her doorstep, and her husband begins to have violent nightmares, it appears that there is definately something amiss in the world of delusional Dolores.', 'Something strange is going on in Dolores'' apartment house--or is it mainly in Dolores'' head that the strangeness lies... When her best friend Eva is murdered on her doorstep, and her husband begins to have violent nightmares, it appears that there is definately something amiss in the world of delusional Dolores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4SDJkr8goXV2mlEmvjtYBYhg2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149167'),
  ('1100446556152092835', 'All of Us Strangers', 2023, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Bill Brown, Luke Deering, Andrew Haigh', 'Andrew Haigh', 'Andrew Scott, Paul Mescal, Carter John Grout, Jamie Bell, Claire Foy, Ami Tredrea, Sean Tizzard', 'R', 'One night in his near-empty tower block in contemporary London, Adam has a chance encounter with a mysterious neighbor Harry, which punctures the rhythm of his everyday life.', 'One night in his near-empty tower block in contemporary London, Adam has a chance encounter with a mysterious neighbor Harry, which punctures the rhythm of his everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aviJMFZSnnCAsCVyJGaPNx4Ef3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994108'),
  ('838277909406288712', 'All of You', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'William Bridges, Benoît Soler, Alex Tawney', 'Brett Goldstein, William Bridges', 'Imogen Poots, Brett Goldstein, Zawe Ashton, Steven Cree, Jenna Coleman, Éva Magyar, Alara-Star Khan, Tariq Rasheed', 'R', 'Laura and Simon have been best friends since college. Over the years, they''ve realized their bond is more than platonic. Can they—and should they—risk everything to explore a love that has existed all along?', 'Laura and Simon have been best friends since college. Over the years, they''ve realized their bond is more than platonic. Can they—and should they—risk everything to explore a love that has existed all along?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/U2KFjtXN9NL9eCENB28w42Jakp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319965'),
  ('202570119163205743', 'All or Nothing', 2002, 'Drama', 'Mike Leigh, Dick Pope, Josh Robertson', 'Mike Leigh', 'Timothy Spall, Lesley Manville, Alison Garland, James Corden, Ruth Sheen, Helen Coker, Sally Hawkins, Daniel Mays', 'R', 'Penny works at a supermarket and Phil is a gentle taxi-driver. Penny’s love for Phil has run dry and they lead joyless lives with their two children, Rachel, a cleaner, and Rory, who is unemployed and aggressive.', 'Penny works at a supermarket and Phil is a gentle taxi-driver. Penny’s love for Phil has run dry and they lead joyless lives with their two children, Rachel, a cleaner, and Rory, who is unemployed and aggressive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VRYeJ8DI3GkVzO7MUlug8v2BZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12454'),
  ('628858835398976880', 'All Our Desires', 2011, 'Drama', 'Philippe Lioret, Gilles Henry', 'Emmanuel Courcol, Philippe Lioret', 'Vincent Lindon, Marie Gillain, Amandine Dewasmes, Yannick Renier, Pascale Arbillot, Isabelle Renauld, Laure Duthilleul, Emmanuel Courcol', null, 'Claire and Stéphane are two Lyon-based judges who could hardly be more different. She is young and enthusiastic, committed to helping those unfortunates who find themselves in debt. He is older, wiser, but disillusioned with his work and his life. Under Claire’s influence, Stéphane discovers a new lease of life and at last finds a cause that is worth fighting for...', 'Claire and Stéphane are two Lyon-based judges who could hardly be more different. She is young and enthusiastic, committed to helping those unfortunates who find themselves in debt. He is older, wiser, but disillusioned with his work and his life. Under Claire’s influence, Stéphane discovers a new lease of life and at last finds a cause that is worth fighting for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOEauICjqF3Lc7ZAxxtLuGSEG0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71179'),
  ('78784546343473709', 'All Over Me', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alex Sichel, Joe DeSalvo', 'Sylvia Sichel', 'Alison Folland, Tara Subkoff, Cole Hauser, Wilson Cruz, Leisha Hailey, Shawn Hatosy, Vincent Pastore, Ann Dowd', 'R', 'Claude and Ellen are best friends who live in a not-so-nice area of New York. They''re involved in the subculture of 90s youth, complete with drugs, live music, and homophobia. All is changed one night when a violent and meaningless death rocks their lives.', 'Claude and Ellen are best friends who live in a not-so-nice area of New York. They''re involved in the subculture of 90s youth, complete with drugs, live music, and homophobia. All is changed one night when a violent and meaningless death rocks their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCsHKHWhKXI3YMWlP1tJ2NSvV2p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12793'),
  ('34195508454745076', 'All Over the Guy', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Julie Davis', 'Dan Bucatinsky', 'Dan Bucatinsky, Richard Ruccolo, Doris Roberts, Sasha Alexander, Adam Goldberg, Christina Ricci, Andrea Martin, Joanna Kerns', 'R', 'A contemporary romantic comedy exploring the unlikely pairing of two 20-somethings thrown together by their respective best friends in hopes of igniting their own romance.', 'A contemporary romantic comedy exploring the unlikely pairing of two 20-somethings thrown together by their respective best friends in hopes of igniting their own romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIO6jd2stGtM6pLvX8Jm85efw9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21055'),
  ('817978458873410550', 'All Quiet on the Western Front', 1979, 'War, Drama, TV Movie', 'Delbert Mann, John Coquillon', 'Paul Monash', 'Richard Thomas, Ernest Borgnine, Donald Pleasence, Ian Holm, Patricia Neal, Paul Mark Elliott, David Bradley, Matthew Evans', 'NR', 'At the start of World War I, Paul Baumer is a young German patriot, eager to fight. Indoctrinated with propaganda at school, he and his friends eagerly sign up for the army soon after graduation. But when the horrors of war soon become too much to bear, and as his friends die or become gravely wounded, Paul questions the sanity of fighting over a few hundreds yards of war-torn countryside.', 'At the start of World War I, Paul Baumer is a young German patriot, eager to fight. Indoctrinated with propaganda at school, he and his friends eagerly sign up for the army soon after graduation. But when the horrors of war soon become too much to bear, and as his friends die or become gravely wounded, Paul questions the sanity of fighting over a few hundreds yards of war-torn countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQdUlvbX6DfJruknXbyOmZK7RoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10912'),
  ('618513259144364096', 'All Quiet on the Western Front', 2022, 'War, Drama', 'James Friend, Jindřich Kočí, Bryce Tibbey', 'Lesley Paterson, Ian Stokell, Edward Berger', 'Felix Kammerer, Albrecht Schuch, Aaron Hilmer, Moritz Klaus, Adrian Grünewald, Edin Hasanović, Daniel Brühl, Thibault de Montalembert', 'R', 'Paul Baumer and his friends Albert and Muller, egged on by romantic dreams of heroism, voluntarily enlist in the German army. Full of excitement and patriotic fervour, the boys enthusiastically march into a war they believe in. But once on the Western Front, they discover the soul-destroying horror of World War I.', 'Paul Baumer and his friends Albert and Muller, egged on by romantic dreams of heroism, voluntarily enlist in the German army. Full of excitement and patriotic fervour, the boys enthusiastically march into a war they believe in. But once on the Western Front, they discover the soul-destroying horror of World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IRjbi9cADuDMKmHdLK7LaqQDKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49046'),
  ('794875521751918492', 'All Roads Lead to Rome', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gergely Pohárnok, Alessandro Pascuzzo, Ella Lemhagen', 'Josh Appignanesi, Cindy Myers', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Paz Vega, Claudia Cardinale, Raoul Bova, Rosie Day, Nadir Caselli, Marco Bonini, Shel Shapiro', 'PG-13', 'Maggie is an uptight, single mother and college writing teacher from New York City. In an effort to reconnect with her troubled teen daughter Summer, she decides to embark on a journey to a Tuscan village where she frequented in her younger days. Upon arrival, Maggie runs into Luca a handsome former lover who is still a bachelor and lives with his eighty-year-old mother Carmen. Summer (missing her “bad boy” boyfriend in NYC) and Carmen (secretly planning a wedding against Luca’s wishes to MARCELINO, her one true love in Rome) impulsively steal Luca’s car and race off to Rome. Maggie and Luca quickly pursue allowing the two mismatched couples to spend some time together and develop a new understanding of each other.', 'Maggie is an uptight, single mother and college writing teacher from New York City. In an effort to reconnect with her troubled teen daughter Summer, she decides to embark on a journey to a Tuscan village where she frequented in her younger days. Upon arrival, Maggie runs into Luca a handsome former lover who is still a bachelor and lives with his eighty-year-old mother Carmen. Summer (missing her “bad boy” boyfriend in NYC) and Carmen (secretly planning a wedding against Luca’s wishes to MARCELINO, her one true love in Rome) impulsively steal Luca’s car and race off to Rome. Maggie and Luca quickly pursue allowing the two mismatched couples to spend some time together and develop a new understanding of each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usBaQ6oqSBcooG36ClRuhC3W7dq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298583'),
  ('765292296153698492', 'All Russians Love Birch Trees', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pola Beck, Juan Sarmiento G.', 'Burkhardt Wunderlich', 'Aylin Tezel, Aleksandar Jovanović, Yuval Scharf, Heike Hanold-Lynch, Slavko Popadic, Meryem Moutaoukkil, Sohel Altan Gol, Marc Fischer', null, 'After her boyfriend becomes extremely ill, Mascha re-evaluates her path and decides to leave her previous life behind. But it''s only by returning home that she can find peace.', 'After her boyfriend becomes extremely ill, Mascha re-evaluates her path and decides to leave her previous life behind. But it''s only by returning home that she can find peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UBoZNxXZjdb8Ch7rk7GqgvkWnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854028'),
  ('1077894107476107724', 'All Saints', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Steve Gomer, Eduardo Enrique Mayén', 'Steve Armour', 'Cara Buono, John Corbett, Barry Corbin, David Keith, Gregory Alan Williams, Patrick Johnson, Nelson Lee, Jessejames Locorriere', 'PG', 'Michael Spurlock decides to trade in his corporate sales career to become a pastor. Unfortunately, his first assignment is to close a country church and sell the prime piece of land where it sits. He soon has a change of heart when the church starts to welcome refugees from Burma. Spurlock now finds himself working with the refugees to turn the land into a working farm to pay the church''s bills.', 'Michael Spurlock decides to trade in his corporate sales career to become a pastor. Unfortunately, his first assignment is to close a country church and sell the prime piece of land where it sits. He soon has a change of heart when the church starts to welcome refugees from Burma. Spurlock now finds himself working with the refugees to turn the land into a working farm to pay the church''s bills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIE5BafMU0gPYOqBSiYzTxmHqGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450806'),
  ('10338199459239423', 'All Screwed Up', 1974, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lina Wertmüller, Giuseppe Rotunno, Gianni Arduini', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Luigi Diberti, Nino Bignamini, Lina Polito, Sara Rapisarda, Giuliana Calandra, Isa Danieli, Cesare Gelli, Claudio Camaso', null, 'A group of workers from the south of Italy live collectively in Milan, where money isn''t everything, it''s the only thing, in 1974.', 'A group of workers from the south of Italy live collectively in Milan, where money isn''t everything, it''s the only thing, in 1974.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGFDigkV5D2pT78rDiviQhKYsQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155597'),
  ('453605781373797396', 'All Shades of Temptation', 2026, 'Romance, Thriller, History', 'Iryna Gromozda, Serhii Krutko, Viktoriia Syvanych', 'Serhii Korotun, Iryna Gromozda', 'Volodymyr Dantes, Daniel Salem, Oksana Cherkashyna, Olena Khokhlatkina, Oleksandr Kobzar', null, 'In Lemberg (Lviv) in 1897, Amelia Kryzhevska-Zeg returns to the family estate where she grew up after her honeymoon. She is full of hope for the future and dreams of opening her own pharmacy. But gradually, her childhood home turns into a treacherous trap, and Amelia''s plans become unfulfillable desires.', 'In Lemberg (Lviv) in 1897, Amelia Kryzhevska-Zeg returns to the family estate where she grew up after her honeymoon. She is full of hope for the future and dreams of opening her own pharmacy. But gradually, her childhood home turns into a treacherous trap, and Amelia''s plans become unfulfillable desires.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fur9NPjYIcsM1BM096mmiWW53w7J.jpg', 'plex:movie:all-shades-of-temptation-2026'),
  ('829046181399983607', 'All Shall Be Well', 2024, 'Drama', 'Leung Ming-kai, Ray Yeung', 'Ray Yeung', 'Patra Au Ga-Man, Maggie Lee, Hui So-Ying, Tai Bo, Leung Chung-Hang, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Rachel Leung, Lai Chai Ming', null, 'Angie and Pat are a couple living in Hong Kong who have been together for over four decades. After Pat''s unexpected death, Angie finds herself at the mercy of her extended family as she struggles to retain both her dignity and the home that they shared for over thirty years.', 'Angie and Pat are a couple living in Hong Kong who have been together for over four decades. After Pat''s unexpected death, Angie finds herself at the mercy of her extended family as she struggles to retain both her dignity and the home that they shared for over thirty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/intFSM3ife6zq10O6Chqwk8Qz2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157680'),
  ('466150277781011786', 'All Souls', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Emmanuelle Pickett, Turner Fair', 'Anthony Ragnone II', 'Mikey Madison, G-Eazy, Samuel Roukin, Mia Love Disnard, Zach Villa, Xavier Jiménez, Jess Gabor, Joseph H. Johnson Jr.', 'R', 'A young confidential informant is sent on a dangerous undercover operation. It''s a no-holds-barred look at the vulnerable foot soldiers of the War on Drugs, young criminals who are pressured to work for the police.', 'A young confidential informant is sent on a dangerous undercover operation. It''s a no-holds-barred look at the vulnerable foot soldiers of the War on Drugs, young criminals who are pressured to work for the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfqgfy277NmKS6GIujIs3leLASX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940143'),
  ('964388364102979110', 'All Souls Day: Dia de los Muertos', 2005, 'Horror', 'Jeremy Kasten, Christopher Duddy', 'Mark A. Altman', 'Marisa Ramirez, Travis Wester, Nichole Hiltz, Laz Alonso, Laura Harring, David Keith, Julia Vera, Danielle Burgio', null, 'During a Day of the Dead celebration, the dead come to life to prey upon the living. In the remote Mexican village of Santa Bonita, a nightmare lay buried for over a century. But when a group of hard-partying students from the OC are stranded in this strange town, they discover an innkeeper with a dark secret a sheriff with a shocking past and a holiday that demands the most horrific sacrifice of all. Now the ceremony can commence. The hordes of the undead have been unleashed. And on this day, an unstoppable feast of human flesh has begun!', 'During a Day of the Dead celebration, the dead come to life to prey upon the living. In the remote Mexican village of Santa Bonita, a nightmare lay buried for over a century. But when a group of hard-partying students from the OC are stranded in this strange town, they discover an innkeeper with a dark secret a sheriff with a shocking past and a holiday that demands the most horrific sacrifice of all. Now the ceremony can commence. The hordes of the undead have been unleashed. And on this day, an unstoppable feast of human flesh has begun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knT8Jzy9B5NfQlIYGChKn3hbyz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37005'),
  ('841552195676045152', 'All Star Superman', 2011, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Sam Liu', 'Dwayne McDuffie', 'James Denton, Christina Hendricks, Anthony LaPaglia, Ed Asner, Linda Cardellini, Matthew Gray Gubler, Arnold Vosloo, Frances Conroy', 'PG', 'Lex Luthor enacts his plan to rid the world of Superman, once and for all. Succeeding with solar radiation poisoning, the Man of Steel is slowly dying. With what little times remains, the Last Son of Krypton must confront the revealing of his secret identity to Lois Lane and face Luthor in a final battle.', 'Lex Luthor enacts his plan to rid the world of Superman, once and for all. Succeeding with solar radiation poisoning, the Man of Steel is slowly dying. With what little times remains, the Last Son of Krypton must confront the revealing of his secret identity to Lois Lane and face Luthor in a final battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30GAgK0SvrRoopHlEcrchXqD0hf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56590'),
  ('1023540450843886838', 'All Stars', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean van de Velde, Jules van den Steenhoven', 'Mischa Alexander, Jean van de Velde', 'Antonie Kamerling, Danny de Munk, Thomas Acda, Peter Paul Muller, Plien van Bennekom, Raymi Sambo, Kasper van Kooten, Nora Mullens', null, 'Seven young men who played soccer together since their early youth grow apart and are forced to think about the nature of their friendship. In a comic way and a very Dutch setting, All Stars is about pregnant girlfriends and homosexuality, career plans and the power of parents.', 'Seven young men who played soccer together since their early youth grow apart and are forced to think about the nature of their friendship. In a comic way and a very Dutch setting, All Stars is about pregnant girlfriends and homosexuality, career plans and the power of parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iF6qvTRIVafyqxlcZCIZEfRxxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2764'),
  ('750868165624261376', 'All Stirred Up!', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Manon Briand, Jean-François Lord', 'Manon Briand', 'Julie Le Breton, Édouard Baer, Sylvain Marcel, Élodie Fontaine, Oussama Fares, Douaa Kachache, Normand Chouinard, Michèle Deslauriers', null, 'A French chef in search of fame tries to help the young Lili-Beth win a culinary competition. But to do so he must contend with the hostility of an entire village towards Sonia, the intransigent local customs officer.', 'A French chef in search of fame tries to help the young Lili-Beth win a culinary competition. But to do so he must contend with the hostility of an entire village towards Sonia, the intransigent local customs officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAnkZUvY6oBbIYY5392YFUYFQyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988373'),
  ('942516825192986096', 'All Summer in a Day', 1982, 'Family, Science Fiction', 'Robert Elswit, Ed Kaplan', 'Ray Bradbury', 'Reesa Mallen, Tammy Simpson, Jerry Marshak, Bridget Meade, Edith Fields, Keith Coogan', 'G', 'Based on the story by Ray Bradbury. Set on a planet where the sun shines for just a few minutes once every nine years, this is a classic tale of suffering and forgiveness. A classroom full of young children are excited to hear that today the rain will stop. However, they are also resentful of a new classmate from Earth who remembers what it''s like to see the sun. "This gripping, unsettling production softens the original story’s abrupt conclusion without diminishing its punch. A masterful work." - Booklist. Winner of a CINE Golden Eagle, and honored by Instructor Magazine as one of the 25 Best Films of the Year.', 'Based on the story by Ray Bradbury. Set on a planet where the sun shines for just a few minutes once every nine years, this is a classic tale of suffering and forgiveness. A classroom full of young children are excited to hear that today the rain will stop. However, they are also resentful of a new classmate from Earth who remembers what it''s like to see the sun. "This gripping, unsettling production softens the original story’s abrupt conclusion without diminishing its punch. A masterful work." - Booklist. Winner of a CINE Golden Eagle, and honored by Instructor Magazine as one of the 25 Best Films of the Year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld3te6i65GQz9FtwHwG5jAG7eNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68067'),
  ('35846240914105856', 'All Summers End', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kyle Wilamowski, Wyatt Garfield', 'Kyle Wilamowski', 'Tye Sheridan, Kaitlyn Dever, Austin Abrams, Ryan Lee, Beau Mirchoff, Annabeth Gish, Pablo Schreiber, Paula Malcomson', null, 'A teenager tries to deal with his guilty conscience after his role in a prank that causes the death of his girlfriend''s older brother.', 'A teenager tries to deal with his guilty conscience after his role in a prank that causes the death of his girlfriend''s older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An55LrWu0q6Nvh09xjMNAwE9Pnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322517'),
  ('1071398290975827683', 'All That Breathes', 2022, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Riju Das, Saumyananda Sahi, Ben Bernhard', null, 'Nadeem Shehzad, Mohammad Saud, Salik Rehman', null, 'Against the darkening backdrop of New Delhi''s apocalyptic air and escalating violence, two brothers devote their lives to protecting one casualty of the turbulent times: the bird known as the black kite.', 'Against the darkening backdrop of New Delhi''s apocalyptic air and escalating violence, two brothers devote their lives to protecting one casualty of the turbulent times: the bird known as the black kite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgTyGlmOYnDwUugITwd8MY5AQ5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913838'),
  ('1126558669994133865', 'All That Divides Us', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Thierry Klifa, Julien Hirsch', 'Thierry Klifa, Cédric Anger', 'Catherine Deneuve, Diane Kruger, Nekfeu, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Sébastien Houbani, Michaël Cohen, Olivier Loustau, Brigitte Sy', null, 'A middle-class house in the middle of nowhere. A council estate in Sète. A mother and daughter. Two childhood friends. A vanishing. Blackmail. A clash between two worlds.', 'A middle-class house in the middle of nowhere. A council estate in Sète. A mother and daughter. Two childhood friends. A vanishing. Blackmail. A clash between two worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeWMS0Vu6egl2M6YdGlK619yoCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432614'),
  ('573937281060686502', 'All That Glitters', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Géraldine Nakache, Hervé Mimran, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Géraldine Nakache, Hervé Mimran, Ariane Fert', 'Leïla Bekhti, Géraldine Nakache, Audrey Lamy, Virginie Ledoyen, Linh-Dan Pham, Simon Buret, Daniel Cohen, Manu Payet', null, 'Best friends Ely and Lila share everything together, including their dream of a life beyond the Paris suburb they''ve lived in since childhood. One night they venture into the capital and meet a pair of wealthy young friends at a night club. Ashamed of their working-class background, and seeing an opportunity to escape, Ely and Lila begin to lie their way into this glamorous new world. Falling deeper into their web of lies, the young women begin to lose sight of themselves as their friendship is pushed to the limit.', 'Best friends Ely and Lila share everything together, including their dream of a life beyond the Paris suburb they''ve lived in since childhood. One night they venture into the capital and meet a pair of wealthy young friends at a night club. Ashamed of their working-class background, and seeing an opportunity to escape, Ely and Lila begin to lie their way into this glamorous new world. Falling deeper into their web of lies, the young women begin to lose sight of themselves as their friendship is pushed to the limit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDVRDQOvM4aE4UgxMFlS94WvoEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44269'),
  ('296965689542096048', 'All That Heaven Allows', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Douglas Sirk, Russell Metty, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Peggy Thompson', 'Jane Wyman, Rock Hudson, Agnes Moorehead, Conrad Nagel, Virginia Grey, Gloria Talbott, William Reynolds, Charles Drake', null, 'Two different social classes collide when Cary Scott, a wealthy upper-class widow, falls in love with her much younger and down-to-earth gardener, prompting disapproval and criticism from her children and country club friends.', 'Two different social classes collide when Cary Scott, a wealthy upper-class widow, falls in love with her much younger and down-to-earth gardener, prompting disapproval and criticism from her children and country club friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BZRrJK3iMILX0KP8eLb2E4sPqs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43316'),
  ('167498807641082864', 'All That I Love', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jacek Borcuch, Michał Englert', 'Jacek Borcuch', 'Mateusz Kościukiewicz, Olga Frycz, Jakub Gierszał, Andrzej Chyra, Anna Radwan, Katarzyna Herman, Mateusz Banasiuk, Igor Obłoza', null, 'Follows four friends in their quest to form a punk band. As workers protests sweep across the country, Janek and Staszek, the sons of a navy man, the rebellious Kazik, and the affluent Diabel gel as a band, but their disparate lives are touched by social turmoil and outside perceptions.', 'Follows four friends in their quest to form a punk band. As workers protests sweep across the country, Janek and Staszek, the sons of a navy man, the rebellious Kazik, and the affluent Diabel gel as a band, but their disparate lives are touched by social turmoil and outside perceptions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oxNnR7jrKMQ64crLiJyFcXZURM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39936'),
  ('575407763038507969', 'All That Jazz', 1979, 'Drama', 'Bob Fosse, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Robert Alan Aurthur, Bob Fosse', 'Roy Scheider, Jessica Lange, Ann Reinking, Leland Palmer, Cliff Gorman, Ben Vereen, Erzsebet Foldi, Michael Tolan', 'R', 'Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.', 'Joe Gideon is at the top of the heap, one of the most successful directors and choreographers in musical theater. But he can feel his world slowly collapsing around him - his obsession with work has almost destroyed his personal life, and only his bottles of pills keep him going.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/culCEdj4srLljefgn4XKd6k3C5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16858'),
  ('804378757399132000', 'All That Money Can Buy', 1941, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'William Dieterle, Joseph H. August, W. Argyle Nelson', 'Stephen Vincent Benet, Dan Totheroh', 'Edward Arnold, Walter Huston, Jane Darwell, Simone Simon, Gene Lockhart, John Qualen, H.B. Warner, Frank Conlan', 'NR', 'Farmer Jabez Stone, about to lose his land, agrees to sell his soul to the devil, known as Mr. Scratch, who gives Jabez seven years to enjoy the fruits of his sale before he collects. Over that time, Jabez pays off his debts and helps many neighboring farmers, then becomes an advocate for the upstanding Sen. Daniel Webster. When Jabez''s contract with Mr. Scratch concludes, he desperately turns to Webster to represent him in a trial for his soul.', 'Farmer Jabez Stone, about to lose his land, agrees to sell his soul to the devil, known as Mr. Scratch, who gives Jabez seven years to enjoy the fruits of his sale before he collects. Over that time, Jabez pays off his debts and helps many neighboring farmers, then becomes an advocate for the upstanding Sen. Daniel Webster. When Jabez''s contract with Mr. Scratch concludes, he desperately turns to Webster to represent him in a trial for his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GUZ0Yg3DKlZpc3HEF5qJz7KqD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29451'),
  ('275555718901737505', 'All That We Destroy', 2019, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Chelsea Stardust, Mark Evans', 'Jim Agnew, Sean Keller', 'Israel Broussard, Samantha Mathis, Aurora Perrineau, Dora Madison, Shi Ne Nielson, Frank Whaley, Damien Bray', 'NR', 'A geneticist who fears that her son may be becoming a serial killer creates a group of clones in an attempt to cure him of his psychopathic tendencies by allowing him to relive the murder of his first victim.', 'A geneticist who fears that her son may be becoming a serial killer creates a group of clones in an attempt to cure him of his psychopathic tendencies by allowing him to relive the murder of his first victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJMbwUm5jwVqEukUNoRFmkxW4XP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599724'),
  ('955411401359103465', 'All That... for This?!', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Claude Lelouch, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty, Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Fabrice Luchini, Vincent Lindon, Jacques Gamblin, Francis Huster, Marie-Sophie L., Gérard Darmon, Évelyne Bouix, Alessandra Martines', null, 'The plot is about a trial against three men who tried to earn loads of money by illegal methods to get to Canada and about the lawyers and the judge who get on with the trial and who are being unfaithful to their couples.', 'The plot is about a trial against three men who tried to earn loads of money by illegal methods to get to Canada and about the lawyers and the judge who get on with the trial and who are being unfaithful to their couples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fuw8j4tM47POn32VKRZ0IhF46u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33489'),
  ('261039142691272041', 'All That''s Left of You', 2025, 'Drama', 'Christopher Aoun, Cherien Dabis', 'Cherien Dabis', 'Saleh Bakri, Cherien Dabis, Adam Bakri, Maria Zreik, Mohammad Bakri, Muhammad Abed Elrahman, Sanad Alkabareti, Salah Al Din', 'NR', 'In the Occupied West Bank in Palestine of the 1980s, a Palestinian teenager is swept into a protest that changes the course of his family''s life. Reeling from its aftermath, his mother, Hanan, shares the story that led them to that fateful moment. Spanning seven decades, this epic drama traces the hopes and heartaches of one uprooted family, revealing not only the scars of ethnic cleansing, but the unbreakable spirit of survival.', 'In the Occupied West Bank in Palestine of the 1980s, a Palestinian teenager is swept into a protest that changes the course of his family''s life. Reeling from its aftermath, his mother, Hanan, shares the story that led them to that fateful moment. Spanning seven decades, this epic drama traces the hopes and heartaches of one uprooted family, revealing not only the scars of ethnic cleansing, but the unbreakable spirit of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqMHedzcFA9rOnlWPuazaKMzV0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219620'),
  ('1069584671201176135', 'All the Beauty and the Bloodshed', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Laura Poitras', null, 'Nan Goldin, Marina Berio, Noemi Bonazzi, Harry Cullen, Megan Kapler, Annatina Miescher, Mike Quinn, Patrick Radden Keefe', 'NR', 'The life of internationally renowned artist and activist Nan Goldin is told through her slideshows, intimate interviews, ground-breaking photography, and rare footage of her personal fight to hold the Sackler family accountable for the overdose crisis.', 'The life of internationally renowned artist and activist Nan Goldin is told through her slideshows, intimate interviews, ground-breaking photography, and rare footage of her personal fight to hold the Sackler family accountable for the overdose crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvO51xxtIUHc5w5ZgFsigiFaUaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004663'),
  ('1062497181699639491', 'All the Beauty of the World', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Esposito, Antoine Roch', 'Marc Esposito', 'Marc Lavoine, Zoé Félix, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Albane Duterc, Pierre-Olivier Mornas, Tom Mitaux, Lucie Phan, H.I.M. Damsyik', null, 'This is the story of Franck and Tina. Franck loves Tina, but she can''t love him. The man of her life has just died and she''s having a nervous breakdown. During a journey to Asia, where Tina attempts rediscover her zest for life, Franck gradually becomes indispensable as a guide, traveling companion and, soon, friend... Will Tina eventually fall in love with him?', 'This is the story of Franck and Tina. Franck loves Tina, but she can''t love him. The man of her life has just died and she''s having a nervous breakdown. During a journey to Asia, where Tina attempts rediscover her zest for life, Franck gradually becomes indispensable as a guide, traveling companion and, soon, friend... Will Tina eventually fall in love with him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZJi7ZU1wEaYOqXZF8H1c1LkJFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43622'),
  ('719658390686616045', 'All the Best: Fun Begins', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Music', 'Rohit Shetty', 'Farhad Samji, Sajid Samji', 'Ajay Devgn, Sanjay Dutt, Fardeen Khan, Bipasha Basu, Mugdha Godse, Ashwini Kalsekar, Mukesh Tiwari, Asrani', null, 'In order to increase his monthly allowance, Veer lies to his stepbrother Dharm about being married. When Dharm unexpectedly arrives in Goa, he mistakes Prem''s wife for Veer''s. This case of mistaken identities leads to chaotic and hilarious situations.', 'In order to increase his monthly allowance, Veer lies to his stepbrother Dharm about being married. When Dharm unexpectedly arrives in Goa, he mistakes Prem''s wife for Veer''s. This case of mistaken identities leads to chaotic and hilarious situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PFqM3uF5FUEctVGJa7IToZyq7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24603'),
  ('1025060014271732706', 'All the Boys Are Called Patrick', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Michel Latouche', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Anne Collette, Nicole Berger', null, 'A pickup artist/womanizer named Patrick inadvertently pursues two young women who happen to be roommates.', 'A pickup artist/womanizer named Patrick inadvertently pursues two young women who happen to be roommates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYQkJyulUz92NCApG46ApfXZnaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78572'),
  ('553649630311152623', 'All the Boys Love Mandy Lane', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jonathan Levine, Darren Genet', 'Jacob Forman', 'Amber Heard, Michael Welch, Whitney Able, Anson Mount, Edwin Hodge, Aaron Himelstein, Luke Grimes, Melissa Price', 'R', 'Beautiful Mandy Lane isn''t a party girl but, when classmate Chloe invites the Texas high school student to a bash in the countryside, she reluctantly accepts. After hitching a ride with a vaguely scary older man, the teens arrive at their destination. Partying ensues, and Mandy''s close pal, Emmet, keeps a watchful eye on the young males making a play for Mandy. Then two of the students are murdered.', 'Beautiful Mandy Lane isn''t a party girl but, when classmate Chloe invites the Texas high school student to a bash in the countryside, she reluctantly accepts. After hitching a ride with a vaguely scary older man, the teens arrive at their destination. Partying ensues, and Mandy''s close pal, Emmet, keeps a watchful eye on the young males making a play for Mandy. Then two of the students are murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9t7n7K0xqw0gMvrxyhdiyqEF3W1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9022'),
  ('153041501503210302', 'All the Brothers Were Valiant', 1953, 'Adventure', 'Richard Thorpe, Al Jennings, George J. Folsey', 'Harry Brown', 'Robert Taylor, Stewart Granger, Ann Blyth, Lewis Stone, Betta St. John, Keenan Wynn, James Whitmore, Kurt Kasznar', 'NR', 'In the South Pacific islands, two brothers, one good and one bad, fight over the same girl and over a bag of pearls.', 'In the South Pacific islands, two brothers, one good and one bad, fight over the same girl and over a bag of pearls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPbkZYWHdCePuP0qdJU9zdzaBpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91419'),
  ('932637858043813496', 'All the Cats Join In', 1946, 'Animation, Music', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Benny Goodman', 'NR', 'A hep teen hears a tune on the jukebox at the malt shop and calls his girl; She rounds up a crowd and soon the whole place is jumping.', 'A hep teen hears a tune on the jukebox at the malt shop and calls his girl; She rounds up a crowd and soon the whole place is jumping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/is51X97ETH3GXgYsHxMuLJBFuaG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247614'),
  ('835395426437882192', 'All the Colors of Giallo', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Federico Caddeo', null, 'Lamberto Bava, Barbara Bouchet, Luciano Ercoli, Edwige Fenech, Lucio Fulci, Ernesto Gastaldi, George Hilton, Umberto Lenzi', 'NR', '''Giallo'' is Italian for ''yellow'', the color of the lurid pulp novels that inspired one of the most intense, extreme and influential genres in movie history. In this unprecedented collection, experience the full chronological evolution of giallo with more than 100 rare and classic trailers from such masters as Mario Bava, Dario Argento, Lucio Fulci, Sergio Martino, Antonio Margheriti, Umberto Lenzi and many more. Then slip on black leather gloves and set the mood with a Bonus CD of legendary soundtrack music from composers that include Ennio Morricone, Riz Ortolani, Bruno Nicolai, Stelvio Cipriani and others, along with all-new featurettes that thrust even deeper into the genre. "But be warned," says Gizmodo.com, "Once you start going down the blood- slicked giallo rabbit hole, you may become dangerously obsessed."', '''Giallo'' is Italian for ''yellow'', the color of the lurid pulp novels that inspired one of the most intense, extreme and influential genres in movie history. In this unprecedented collection, experience the full chronological evolution of giallo with more than 100 rare and classic trailers from such masters as Mario Bava, Dario Argento, Lucio Fulci, Sergio Martino, Antonio Margheriti, Umberto Lenzi and many more. Then slip on black leather gloves and set the mood with a Bonus CD of legendary soundtrack music from composers that include Ennio Morricone, Riz Ortolani, Bruno Nicolai, Stelvio Cipriani and others, along with all-new featurettes that thrust even deeper into the genre. "But be warned," says Gizmodo.com, "Once you start going down the blood- slicked giallo rabbit hole, you may become dangerously obsessed."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1rtSk9Qb7HzoD7v3xwJhlIuElx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579697'),
  ('323586822460544802', 'All the Colours of the Dark', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sergio Martino, Miguel Fernández Mila, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Sauro Scavolini', 'George Hilton, Edwige Fenech, Ivan Rassimov, Julián Ugarte, George Rigaud, Maria Cumani Quasimodo, Nieves Navarro, Marina Malfatti', 'R', 'After a car accident that caused the loss of her baby, Jane experiences an increasing amount of nightmares that shake her to her core. After seeking professional help, her haunting visions turn into an even more frightening reality, one full of black magic, blood orgies, and murder.', 'After a car accident that caused the loss of her baby, Jane experiences an increasing amount of nightmares that shake her to her core. After seeking professional help, her haunting visions turn into an even more frightening reality, one full of black magic, blood orgies, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O8ZQ9tCIdpT1dAMvwWX9hToW2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30901'),
  ('784790578326191323', 'All the Creatures Were Stirring', 2018, 'Horror', 'David Ian McKendry, Rebekah McKendry', 'David Ian McKendry, Rebekah McKendry', 'Katie Parker, Amanda Fuller, Constance Wu, Jocelin Donahue, Ashley Clements, Brea Grant, Jonathan Kite, Chase Williamson', null, 'When an awkward date on Christmas Eve leads a couple into a strange theater, they''re treated to a bizarre and frightening collection of Christmas stories, featuring a wide ensemble of characters doing their best to avoid the horrors of the holidays. From boring office parties and last-minute shopping, to vengeful stalkers and immortal demons, there''s plenty out there to fear this holiday season.', 'When an awkward date on Christmas Eve leads a couple into a strange theater, they''re treated to a bizarre and frightening collection of Christmas stories, featuring a wide ensemble of characters doing their best to avoid the horrors of the holidays. From boring office parties and last-minute shopping, to vengeful stalkers and immortal demons, there''s plenty out there to fear this holiday season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJCTXnfN3AEfgiwsMEXmMxDvIqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512474'),
  ('16204570733315638', 'All the Crows in the World', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tang Yi, Yilei Zhou, Tang Yi', 'Tang Yi', 'Chen Xuanyu, Xue Baohe, Shujun Huang, Ge Wu, Guanying Xian, Ming Sen, Haihau Li, Dashu Li', null, '18-year-old Shengnan is invited to a mysterious party by her cousin. Upon arrival, Shengnan finds herself surrounded by greasy middle-aged men, with the exception of Jianguo, who is different. Shengnan and Jianguo decide to bail on the party, embarking on a night of adventures in the adult world.', '18-year-old Shengnan is invited to a mysterious party by her cousin. Upon arrival, Shengnan finds herself surrounded by greasy middle-aged men, with the exception of Jianguo, who is different. Shengnan and Jianguo decide to bail on the party, embarking on a night of adventures in the adult world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reNIRDL1gkYN1cuBAY1AiESrurF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843024'),
  ('850404569279074136', 'All the Devil''s Men', 2018, 'Action', 'Matthew Hope, Robin Whenary', 'Matthew Hope', 'Sylvia Hoeks, William Fichtner, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Milo Gibson, Elliot Cowan, Joseph Millson, Mingus Johnston, Saif Al-Warith', 'R', 'A battle-scarred War on Terror bounty hunter is forced to go to London on a manhunt for a disavowed CIA operative, which leads him into a deadly running battle with a former military comrade and his private army.', 'A battle-scarred War on Terror bounty hunter is forced to go to London on a manhunt for a disavowed CIA operative, which leads him into a deadly running battle with a former military comrade and his private army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXrGFSIKNfKtTV3vqEtKg4kceE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481203'),
  ('662139209708412673', 'All the Devils Are Here', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Barnaby Roper, Peter Flinckenberg, Barney Shakespeare', 'John Patrick Dover', 'Eddie Marsan, Sam Claflin, Burn Gorman, Suki Waterhouse, Tienne Simon, Rory Kinnear, Benjamin Dilloway', 'R', 'After a heist, four criminals lay low in a remote safehouse, waiting for orders. As paranoia builds, one thing becomes clear — the real threat may not be outside, but among them.', 'After a heist, four criminals lay low in a remote safehouse, waiting for orders. As paranoia builds, one thing becomes clear — the real threat may not be outside, but among them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GJTUSjbCGynQo4PpTTNzzxYfBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1530875'),
  ('128624265327138532', 'All the Empty Rooms', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Joshua Seftel, Matt Porwoll', null, 'Steve Hartman, Meryl Hartman, Bryan Muehlberger, Gloria Cazares, Javier Cazares, Lou Bopp', 'PG-13', 'A journalist and a photographer set out to memorialize the bedrooms left behind by children killed in school shootings.', 'A journalist and a photographer set out to memorialize the bedrooms left behind by children killed in school shootings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajOXPpgh96rxxaHqqQCoxPP6dH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1525091'),
  ('1102433205033447962', 'All the Freckles in the World', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Yibrán Asuad, Matías Penachino, Marco Aguilar', 'Yibrán Asuad, Gibrán Portela', 'Loreto Peralta, Hanssel Casillas, Luis de la Rosa, Abraham Kleinfinger, Montserrat Marañon, Andrea Sutton Chávez, Ceci Flores, Emiliano Castro Amador', 'NR', 'Teen comedy set in the school-year of 1994. José is the new kid on high-school, falling immediately for the popular and freckled Christina. Trying to impress her, he''s going to unsuccessfully join the soccer try-outs. Is he shooting way out of his league?', 'Teen comedy set in the school-year of 1994. José is the new kid on high-school, falling immediately for the popular and freckled Christina. Trying to impress her, he''s going to unsuccessfully join the soccer try-outs. Is he shooting way out of his league?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPnyPMtFLHjx77CXASOXYC3urhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613183'),
  ('583541149816893098', 'All the Gods in the Sky', 2019, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Marine Durand, Mickaël Cohen, Thibaut Quentric', 'Quarxx', 'Jean-Luc Couchard, Melanie Gaydos, Zélie Rixhon, Thierry Frémont, Albert Delpy, Loïc Houdré, Xavier Mussel, Adeline Walter', null, '30-year-old factory worker Simon lives a solitary existence on a decrepit farm in the remote French countryside. Devoting his time to caring for his sister Estelle, who was left severely disabled when a childhood game went horribly wrong, Simon is plagued by guilt and depression. But he sees a way out, looking to otherworldly forces as a means of liberating both himself and his sister from the corporeal prisons in which they are confined.', '30-year-old factory worker Simon lives a solitary existence on a decrepit farm in the remote French countryside. Devoting his time to caring for his sister Estelle, who was left severely disabled when a childhood game went horribly wrong, Simon is plagued by guilt and depression. But he sees a way out, looking to otherworldly forces as a means of liberating both himself and his sister from the corporeal prisons in which they are confined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v44ETaVtn9kaLbiNEZdb1vd21O0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545573'),
  ('1046809470313741525', 'All the Gold in the World', 1961, 'Comedy', 'René Clair, Pierre Petit', 'René Clair', 'Bourvil, Philippe Noiret, Claude Rich, Michel Modo, Claude Véga, Annie Fratellini, Françoise Dorléac, Catherine Langeais', null, 'Businessman Victor Hardy wants to buy the entire area around the small village of Cabosse. He claims that he wants to return to nature, but he also intends to profit by selling the water from the village fountain, which is reputed to enhance longevity. However old farmer Mathieu and his sons don''t want to sell...', 'Businessman Victor Hardy wants to buy the entire area around the small village of Cabosse. He claims that he wants to return to nature, but he also intends to profit by selling the water from the village fountain, which is reputed to enhance longevity. However old farmer Mathieu and his sons don''t want to sell...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAKldXXJtzu2ZwYY4AXrsP1fA9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78312'),
