  ('499387593105081099', 'All the Old Knives', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Charlotte Bruus Christensen, Grant Bailey, Claire Peerless', 'Olen Steinhauer', 'Chris Pine, Thandiwe Newton, Jonathan Pryce, Laurence Fishburne, Corey Johnson, Jonjo O''Neill, Ahd Kamel, David Dawson', 'R', 'When the CIA discovers one of its agents leaked information that cost more than 100 people their lives, veteran operative Henry Pelham is assigned to root out the mole with his former lover and colleague Celia Harrison.', 'When the CIA discovers one of its agents leaked information that cost more than 100 people their lives, veteran operative Henry Pelham is assigned to root out the mole with his former lover and colleague Celia Harrison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4tMniKxol1TBJrHlAtiDjjlx4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294793'),
  ('1097518907171363632', 'All the Places', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Pablo Ojeda, Pedro Pablo Ibarra', 'Adriana Pelusi', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Ana Serradilla, David Chocarro, Diana Bovio, Irán Castillo, Ana Claudia Talancón', null, 'Two siblings who haven''t seen each other in 15 years mend their relationship while fulfilling a childhood dream: a motorcycle road trip through Mexico.', 'Two siblings who haven''t seen each other in 15 years mend their relationship while fulfilling a childhood dream: a motorcycle road trip through Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mdYZDqYcRjD4yF8MCh8OPtXApI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078862'),
  ('201454342353915182', 'All the Pretty Horses', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Pamela Altieri-Paterra, Fred Murphy', 'Ted Tally', 'Matt Damon, Henry Thomas, Lucas Black, Penélope Cruz, Rubén Blades, Robert Patrick, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Angelina Torres', 'PG-13', 'The year is 1949. A young Texan named John Grady finds himself without a home after his mother sells the ranch where he has spent his entire life. Lured south of the border by the romance of cowboy life and the promise of a fresh start, Cole and his pal embark on an adventure that will test their resilience, define their maturity, and change their lives forever.', 'The year is 1949. A young Texan named John Grady finds himself without a home after his mother sells the ranch where he has spent his entire life. Lured south of the border by the romance of cowboy life and the promise of a fresh start, Cole and his pal embark on an adventure that will test their resilience, define their maturity, and change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6E4E7wYXw1DE2321F2hVNryLSk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21355'),
  ('87692477733096764', 'All the Queen''s Men', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, History, War', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Peter Kappel, Wedigo von Schultzendorff', 'David Schneider', 'Matt LeBlanc, Eddie Izzard, James Cosmo, Nicolette Krebitz, David Tristan Birkin, Edward Fox, Udo Kier, Oliver Korittke', 'PG-13', 'A mismatched team of British Special Services agents led by an American must infiltrate, in disguise, a female-run Enigma factory in Berlin and bring back the decoding device that will end the war.', 'A mismatched team of British Special Services agents led by an American must infiltrate, in disguise, a female-run Enigma factory in Berlin and bring back the decoding device that will end the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oU5qvvUCj1DTCk2kKKTPQDIx7nd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31668'),
  ('253861128998759802', 'All the Rage', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roland Tec', null, 'Mitchell Mullen, John-Michael Lander, David Vincent, Jay Corcoran, Paul Outlaw, Peter Bubriski, Alan Natale, Christian Matyi', null, 'ALL THE RAGE takes a satirical and poignant look at one gay man''s obsessive pursuit of physical, sexual, and romantic perfection. Christopher Bedford is everyone''s fantasy. He''s gorgeous, young, clever, rich, and above all, totally buffed and every boy in Boston seems to want him. At thirty-one, he''s gliding through life, celebrating himself as the 90''s gay playboy ideal, without ever realizing what a mess he''s become.', 'ALL THE RAGE takes a satirical and poignant look at one gay man''s obsessive pursuit of physical, sexual, and romantic perfection. Christopher Bedford is everyone''s fantasy. He''s gorgeous, young, clever, rich, and above all, totally buffed and every boy in Boston seems to want him. At thirty-one, he''s gliding through life, celebrating himself as the 90''s gay playboy ideal, without ever realizing what a mess he''s become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pX1AhCBmDabAhfaIrMUqW1kpK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15773'),
  ('477419610644802114', 'All the Rage', 1999, 'Comedy', 'James D. Stern, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Keith Reddin', 'Joan Allen, Jeff Daniels, Robert Forster, Andre Braugher, Bokeem Woodbine, Anna Paquin, Wayne Morse, David Schwimmer', 'R', 'A rich cross-section of urban USA find their lives changed when their fates collide at gunpoint. At the centre of it all are Helen and Warren Harding, an up-scale couple on the brink of divorce, whose awakening in the night by a burglar sets off a catastrophic series of events.', 'A rich cross-section of urban USA find their lives changed when their fates collide at gunpoint. At the centre of it all are Helen and Warren Harding, an up-scale couple on the brink of divorce, whose awakening in the night by a burglar sets off a catastrophic series of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ug180c08YBK7kaRi5HGrqmCWNLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30946'),
  ('260150264254722349', 'All the Real Girls', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Gordon Green, Stewart Griffin, Jeff Huston', 'David Gordon Green', 'Paul Schneider, Zooey Deschanel, Shea Whigham, Danny McBride, Maurice Compte, Heather McComb, Benjamin Mouton, John Kirkland', 'R', 'In a sleepy little mill town in North Carolina, Paul is the town Romeo. But when his best friend''s sister returns home from boarding school, he finds himself falling for her innocent charm. In spite of her lack of experience and the violent protests of her brother, the two find themselves in a sweet, dreamy and all-consuming love.', 'In a sleepy little mill town in North Carolina, Paul is the town Romeo. But when his best friend''s sister returns home from boarding school, he finds himself falling for her innocent charm. In spite of her lack of experience and the violent protests of her brother, the two find themselves in a sweet, dreamy and all-consuming love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ6dMkwPIFucYSmFQcr38WBYzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13132'),
  ('70036627247117234', 'All the Reasons to Forget', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Pedro Coutinho', 'Pedro Coutinho', 'Johnny Massaro, Bianca Comparato, Regina Braga, Maria Laura Nogueira, Victor Mendes, Thiago Amaral, Rafael Primot, Eduardo Mossri', null, 'After ending his long-term relationship, Antonio is sure that he can quickly get over Sofia. But nothing is as simple as it seems. And realizing the impossibility of controlling his own feelings, he begins to boycott them, using all sorts of contemporary palliative measures to free himself from the memories of his ex: cognitive psychoanalysis, prescription drugs, Tinder, among others. Ergo, Antonio will go through several tragicomic situations.', 'After ending his long-term relationship, Antonio is sure that he can quickly get over Sofia. But nothing is as simple as it seems. And realizing the impossibility of controlling his own feelings, he begins to boycott them, using all sorts of contemporary palliative measures to free himself from the memories of his ex: cognitive psychoanalysis, prescription drugs, Tinder, among others. Ergo, Antonio will go through several tragicomic situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzSmyG4OF2dtdkDhaIUO5aARZo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478650'),
  ('51237300725358257', 'All the Right Moves', 1983, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michael Chapman, Emmitt-Leon O''Neill, Jerry Grandey', 'Michael Kane', 'Tom Cruise, Craig T. Nelson, Lea Thompson, Charles Cioffi, Gary Graham, Paul Carafotes, Chris Penn, Sandy Faison', 'R', 'Sensitive study of a headstrong high school football star who dreams of getting out of his small Western Pennsylvania steel town with a football scholarship. His equally ambitious coach aims at a college position, resulting in a clash which could crush the player''s dreams.', 'Sensitive study of a headstrong high school football star who dreams of getting out of his small Western Pennsylvania steel town with a football scholarship. His equally ambitious coach aims at a college position, resulting in a clash which could crush the player''s dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8OSutSNEi84ROcqyV7Tu7p8xYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18172'),
  ('667974423789134809', 'All the Right Noises', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gerry O''Hara, Gerry Fisher', 'Gerry O''Hara', 'Tom Bell, Olivia Hussey, Judy Carne, John Standing, Roy Herrick, Edward Higgins, Chloe Franks, Gareth Wright', null, 'A married man with two small children begins an affair with a beautiful young actress which quickly blossoms into a full blown romance, until she tells him that she is only 15 years old…', 'A married man with two small children begins an affair with a beautiful young actress which quickly blossoms into a full blown romance, until she tells him that she is only 15 years old…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fafwju3C6XavPVGWkoxzeVOW0W8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44198'),
  ('21472465264570697', 'All the Silence', 2023, 'Drama', 'Octavio Arauz, Diego Del Río', 'Lucía Carreras', 'Adriana Llabrés, Ludwika Paleta, Moisés Melchor, Arcelia Ramírez, Diana Bracho, Montserrat Marañon, Eugenio Rubio, Vicky Araico', null, 'Miriam teaches sign language in the mornings and is part of a professional theater production in the afternoons, maintaining a stable and passionate relationship with her girlfriend Lola. Although her life is very much connected to the routine of a deaf person, her world begins to crumble when she discovers that she is losing her hearing.', 'Miriam teaches sign language in the mornings and is part of a professional theater production in the afternoons, maintaining a stable and passionate relationship with her girlfriend Lola. Although her life is very much connected to the routine of a deaf person, her world begins to crumble when she discovers that she is losing her hearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3fANYTq19wRoZWSEKCbKSEbLJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131443'),
  ('663033901071964611', 'All the Sins of Sodom', 1968, 'Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno, Steve Silverman, Bruce G. Sparks', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Sue Akers, Morris Kaplan, Maria Lease, Peggy Steffans, Dan Machuen, Marianne Prevost, Cherie Winters', null, 'Henning is a fashion photographer driven by visions of artistic glory. He is encouraged by a literary agent to produce a volume of erotic nudes and works to create the perfect layout with his favorite model, Leslie. All seems to be going well until the mysterious Joyce appears; dark and sensual, Joyce plays games with the photographer''s ego, driving a wedge between Henning and Leslie and seducing one of his other models. Blinded by his own ambitions, Henning is unable to see the ruinous web that Joyce is weaving', 'Henning is a fashion photographer driven by visions of artistic glory. He is encouraged by a literary agent to produce a volume of erotic nudes and works to create the perfect layout with his favorite model, Leslie. All seems to be going well until the mysterious Joyce appears; dark and sensual, Joyce plays games with the photographer''s ego, driving a wedge between Henning and Leslie and seducing one of his other models. Blinded by his own ambitions, Henning is unable to see the ruinous web that Joyce is weaving', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lO62IKAexCoDUtcNzzIek0w9EQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77158'),
  ('582708548851427492', 'All The Souls... Except the Dead', 1977, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Pasquale Rachini, Cesare Bastelli, Pupi Avati', 'Pupi Avati, Antonio Avati, Gianni Cavina', 'Gianni Cavina, Francesca Marciano, Carlo Delle Piane, Greta Vayan, Michele Mirabella, Flavia Giorgi, Giulio Pizzirani, Bob Tonelli', null, 'Dante arrives at the castle of the recently deceased Marquis Zanetti to sell a book which contains a prophecy that the death of nine members of the Zanetti family will reveal a hidden treasure.', 'Dante arrives at the castle of the recently deceased Marquis Zanetti to sell a book which contains a prophecy that the death of nine members of the Zanetti family will reveal a hidden treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCq1Mfi9WRBp0JZLbJ8mo72k1Ik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168977'),
  ('254124623391016016', 'All the Vermeers in New York', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jon Jost, Jon Jost', 'Jon Jost', 'Emmanuelle Chaulet, Stephen Lack, Katie Garner, Grace Phillips, Laurel Lee Kiefer, Gracie Mansion, Gordon Joseph Weiss, Roger Ruffin', null, 'A parable of the missteps of life enacted in the hothouse world of late 1980’s New York, in which the art market and the stock market each boomed, and in process spawned a smorgasbord of “yuppie” delusions which still persist. Anna, a French actress studying in New York, crosses paths with a successful stock-broker, Mark, standing before a Vermeer portrait at the Metropolitan, thence ensues a peculiar romance of missed meanings and connections, with tangential asides to the steaming arts world and stock market, loft-mate conflicts, and, perhaps, love. Wrapped up in their blindered worlds, Anna and Mark deflect away from their chances, leaving at the conclusion the wistful face of Vermeer’s portrait enigmatically asking questions. All the Vermeers in New York is a comedy of manners which, as gently as a Vermeer, looks beneath the skin of this time and place, and of these characters.', 'A parable of the missteps of life enacted in the hothouse world of late 1980’s New York, in which the art market and the stock market each boomed, and in process spawned a smorgasbord of “yuppie” delusions which still persist. Anna, a French actress studying in New York, crosses paths with a successful stock-broker, Mark, standing before a Vermeer portrait at the Metropolitan, thence ensues a peculiar romance of missed meanings and connections, with tangential asides to the steaming arts world and stock market, loft-mate conflicts, and, perhaps, love. Wrapped up in their blindered worlds, Anna and Mark deflect away from their chances, leaving at the conclusion the wistful face of Vermeer’s portrait enigmatically asking questions. All the Vermeers in New York is a comedy of manners which, as gently as a Vermeer, looks beneath the skin of this time and place, and of these characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQmBGBIjDvX2nMwUHI3yQv4YAJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123757'),
  ('770652243757154401', 'All the Way', 2016, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Jay Roach, Jim Denault, Josh King', 'Robert Schenkkan', 'Bryan Cranston, Anthony Mackie, Melissa Leo, Frank Langella, Bradley Whitford, Stephen Root, Todd Weeks, Ray Wise', null, 'Lyndon B. Johnson''s amazing 11-month journey from taking office after JFK''s assassination, through the fight to pass the 1964 Civil Rights Act and his own presidential campaign, culminating on the night LBJ is actually elected to the office – no longer the ''accidental President.''', 'Lyndon B. Johnson''s amazing 11-month journey from taking office after JFK''s assassination, through the fight to pass the 1964 Civil Rights Act and his own presidential campaign, culminating on the night LBJ is actually elected to the office – no longer the ''accidental President.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4AEurmnYoRsA1nHhRK9AE4j2CL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347123'),
  ('970054475175427690', 'All the Way Boys', 1972, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Giuseppe Colizzi, Marcello Masciocchi, Diamante Luling Buschetti', 'Giuseppe Colizzi, Barbara Alberti, Amedeo Pagani', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Riccardo Pizzuti, Marcello Verziera, Sergio Bruzzichini, Cyril Cusack, Alexander Allerson', 'PG-13', 'The "Trinity" crew makes another modern era film. Plata and Salud are pilots ditching aircraft for insurance money. They wind up crashing for real in the jungles of South America. The plot involves "Mr. Big", who is buying the diamonds from the miners for much too little, and has thugs who keep the price down. Of course, Plata and Salud side with the miners', 'The "Trinity" crew makes another modern era film. Plata and Salud are pilots ditching aircraft for insurance money. They wind up crashing for real in the jungles of South America. The plot involves "Mr. Big", who is buying the diamonds from the miners for much too little, and has thugs who keep the price down. Of course, Plata and Salud side with the miners', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWhBysh8ejHqKBcv5cGaA5FCCcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1721'),
  ('650904298954386186', 'All the Women in the World', 1966, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Mário Carneiro, Domingos de Oliveira', 'Domingos de Oliveira', 'Leila Diniz, Paulo José, Flávio Migliaccio, Joana Fomm, Ivan de Albuquerque, Irma Álvarez, Isabel Ribeiro, Fauzi Arap', null, 'When womanizer Paulo meets a friend’s fiancée, she changes the way he looks at the opposite sex. He falls in love, and believes she is in fact all women in one. Because of that, he has to face an important decision: to go on with his old life, or embrace this special relationship and become a monogamous man.', 'When womanizer Paulo meets a friend’s fiancée, she changes the way he looks at the opposite sex. He falls in love, and believes she is in fact all women in one. Because of that, he has to face an important decision: to go on with his old life, or embrace this special relationship and become a monogamous man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfKC5NFysIBuOtIyXBqUaBCH78H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251766'),
  ('960179839697704315', 'All the World''s a Stooge', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'John Grey', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Lelah Tyler, Emory Parnell, Poppy Wilde, Olaf Hytten', 'NR', 'The stooges are window washers who lose their jobs after Moe impersonates the dentist in whose office they were cleaning. On the run, they are hired by a millionaire to pose as children. It seems the man''s wife wants to adopt some refugees to impress her society friends. Moe is Johnny, Curly is Frankie and Larry is Mabel. Everything goes fairly well as the lady shows off the stooges to her friends, but they finally irritate her husband so much that he goes after them with an ax.', 'The stooges are window washers who lose their jobs after Moe impersonates the dentist in whose office they were cleaning. On the run, they are hired by a millionaire to pose as children. It seems the man''s wife wants to adopt some refugees to impress her society friends. Moe is Johnny, Curly is Frankie and Larry is Mabel. Everything goes fairly well as the lady shows off the stooges to her friends, but they finally irritate her husband so much that he goes after them with an ax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64DItgMHTMBLYTzHbyxsRRxuxiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115991'),
  ('644122089473124431', 'All the World''s Memory', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Alain Resnais, André Heinrich, Jean-Charles Lauthe', null, 'Jacques Dumesnil, Agnès Varda', null, 'A documentary about the Bibliothèque Nationale in Paris. It presents the building, with its processes of cataloguing and preserving all sorts of printed material, as both a monument of cultural memory and as a monstrous, alien being.', 'A documentary about the Bibliothèque Nationale in Paris. It presents the building, with its processes of cataloguing and preserving all sorts of printed material, as both a monument of cultural memory and as a monstrous, alien being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuJ9u9kO83bRNiV5CB60N5BzPMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15377'),
  ('1105757917661563179', 'All the Wrong Clues', 1981, 'Comedy, Action', 'Tsui Hark, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, O Sing-Pui', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Sze-To Cheuk-Hon', 'George Lam Tsz-Cheung, Teddy Robin, Karl Maka, Tang Kei-Chan, Yiu Wai, David Wu, Chan Chi-Wing, John Shum Kin-Fun', null, 'A private investigator and a police inspector team up to pursue a notorious mobster, who is plotting to milk an old millionaire out of his highly-valued stocks and bonds. Along the way, the investigator crosses paths with a femme fatale and silly gangsters.', 'A private investigator and a police inspector team up to pursue a notorious mobster, who is plotting to milk an old millionaire out of his highly-valued stocks and bonds. Along the way, the investigator crosses paths with a femme fatale and silly gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30aV7jZPFMlRO2t4mVUCC1VxoKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239914'),
  ('401063164244783253', 'All These Women', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Sven Nykvist, Ingmar Bergman', 'Ingmar Bergman, Erland Josephson', 'Jarl Kulle, Bibi Andersson, Harriet Andersson, Eva Dahlbeck, Karin Kavli, Gertrud Fridh, Mona Malm, Barbro Hiort af Ornäs', null, 'Pretentious critic Cornelius is writing a biography on a famous cellist and to do some research he stays in the cellist''s house for a few days. He doesn''t manage to get an interview with the man, but by talking to all the women who live with him, he comes to learn a lot about the musician''s private life none the less. Cornelius then decides to use this information to blackmail the cellist into performing a composition that he, Cornelius, has written.', 'Pretentious critic Cornelius is writing a biography on a famous cellist and to do some research he stays in the cellist''s house for a few days. He doesn''t manage to get an interview with the man, but by talking to all the women who live with him, he comes to learn a lot about the musician''s private life none the less. Cornelius then decides to use this information to blackmail the cellist into performing a composition that he, Cornelius, has written.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOOLYdOUbXL5ufuxP6Xr8llajKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96118'),
  ('438102303183118048', 'All These Years', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Layla Zhuqing Ji', 'Layla Zhuqing Ji', 'Zhang Xincheng, Sun Qian, Sun Meilin, Zhang Ruonan, Wu Junting, Liu Dan, Li Guangfu, Tao Hai', null, 'Chen Jianxia grew up in a patriarchal environment. At Zhenhua, she meets school delinquent Li Ran, and he becomes the only light in Chen Jianxia''s life. They redeem each other but regrettably part ways.', 'Chen Jianxia grew up in a patriarchal environment. At Zhenhua, she meets school delinquent Li Ran, and he becomes the only light in Chen Jianxia''s life. They redeem each other but regrettably part ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcoCNx1eRimtz8DZJMv71fuqBVk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089953'),
  ('833921089056410147', 'All Things Fair', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Bo Widerberg, Morten Bruus', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Johan Widerberg, Marika Lagercrantz, Tomas von Brömssen, Karin Huldt, Nina Gunke, Kenneth Milldoff, Björn Kjellman, Frida Lindholm', null, 'In 1943 Malmö, 15-year-old Stig is attracted to his teacher Viola, 22 years his senior, who, drawn to his youth and innocence, believes the lad is a God-sent relief from her miserable marriage to a drunken, unfaithful lout.', 'In 1943 Malmö, 15-year-old Stig is attracted to his teacher Viola, 22 years his senior, who, drawn to his youth and innocence, believes the lad is a God-sent relief from her miserable marriage to a drunken, unfaithful lout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1oFNynXrIzlPUe4CXKMR2dpNep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27098'),
  ('534751112268081144', 'All Things Must Pass', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Colin Hanks, Bridger Nielson, Neil Lisk', 'Steven Leckart', 'Dave Grohl, Elton John, Bruce Springsteen, Chris Cornell, Questlove, Heidi Cotler, Chuck D, Rudy Danzinger', 'NR', 'The explosive trajectory and tragic demise of iconic music retailer Tower Records, and the legacy of its rebellious founder Russ Solomon. Two hundred stores in thirty countries on five continents. In 1999 it made $1 billion. In 2006 it filed for bankruptcy. What went wrong?', 'The explosive trajectory and tragic demise of iconic music retailer Tower Records, and the legacy of its rebellious founder Russ Solomon. Two hundred stores in thirty countries on five continents. In 1999 it made $1 billion. In 2006 it filed for bankruptcy. What went wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oO565fLtDlx2Ief7Jn7YVsY0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324253'),
  ('857726698355440286', 'All Things To All Men', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime', 'George Isaac, Howard Atherton', 'George Isaac', 'Toby Stephens, Rufus Sewell, Gabriel Byrne, Leo Gregory, Pierre Mascolo, Terence Maynard, Julian Sands, Elsa Pataky', 'PG-13', 'A thief is caught up in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse between a maverick cop and London crime boss.', 'A thief is caught up in a deadly game of cat-and-mouse between a maverick cop and London crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/extIADIhwJMkNF9AtQGdorN5WiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183258'),
  ('650894688643817024', 'All Things Valentine', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Brendan Uegama, Daniella Bonan, Gary Harvey', 'J.B. White', 'Sarah Rafferty, Sam Page, Jeremy Guilbaut, Heather Doerksen, Kimberley Sustad, Brenda Crichlow, Daryl Shuttleworth, Beverley Elliott', 'G', 'Avery, a blogger with a string of disappointing Valentine’s Days, is ready to give up on love when she meets handsome veterinarian Brenden. When Avery finds out Brenden blames his recent break up on her blog and is the one leaving her angry comments, she begins to question whether the bond they’ve began to build is a true love story or yesterday’s news.', 'Avery, a blogger with a string of disappointing Valentine’s Days, is ready to give up on love when she meets handsome veterinarian Brenden. When Avery finds out Brenden blames his recent break up on her blog and is the one leaving her angry comments, she begins to question whether the bond they’ve began to build is a true love story or yesterday’s news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iU19KivcXMk27837pwsVv6wcTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377428'),
  ('454903600348634304', 'All This and Rabbit Stew', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Mel Blanc, Darrell Payne', null, 'Bugs Bunny heckles a black hunter and escapes from a bear. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'Bugs Bunny heckles a black hunter and escapes from a bear. One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeLX1Lwl74NO5rwOjifvN62eaoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205874'),
  ('121457814250911810', 'All This Mayhem', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Eddie Martin, Lee Jake Mariano, Germain McMicking', 'Eddie Martin', 'Tas Pappas, Ben Pappas, Tommy Caudill, Lance Conklin, Dom Kekich, Danny Minnick, Tony Hawk, Steve-O', null, 'A searing account of what happens when raw talent and extreme personalities collide. In this unflinching, never-before-seen account of drugs and the dark side of professional skateboarding, brothers Tas and Ben Pappas'' intense bond and charisma take them from the pinnacle of their sport into a spiraling world of self-destruction.', 'A searing account of what happens when raw talent and extreme personalities collide. In this unflinching, never-before-seen account of drugs and the dark side of professional skateboarding, brothers Tas and Ben Pappas'' intense bond and charisma take them from the pinnacle of their sport into a spiraling world of self-destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jbwLGjsy2vvWAabKBtXBr8Hhnc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275657'),
  ('126598391914581677', 'All This, and Heaven Too', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anatole Litvak, Ernest Haller, Irving Rapper', 'Rachel Field', 'Bette Davis, Charles Boyer, Jeffrey Lynn, Barbara O''Neil, Virginia Weidler, Helen Westley, Walter Hampden, Henry Daniell', 'NR', 'When lovely and virtuous governess Henriette Deluzy comes to educate the children of the debonair Duc de Praslin, a royal subject to King Louis-Philippe and the husband of the volatile and obsessive Duchesse de Praslin, she instantly incurs the wrath of her mistress, who is insanely jealous of anyone who comes near her estranged husband. Though she saves the duchess''s little son from a near-death illness and warms herself to all the children, she is nevertheless dismissed by the vengeful duchess. Meanwhile, the attraction between the duke and Henriette continues to grow, eventually leading to tragedy.', 'When lovely and virtuous governess Henriette Deluzy comes to educate the children of the debonair Duc de Praslin, a royal subject to King Louis-Philippe and the husband of the volatile and obsessive Duchesse de Praslin, she instantly incurs the wrath of her mistress, who is insanely jealous of anyone who comes near her estranged husband. Though she saves the duchess''s little son from a near-death illness and warms herself to all the children, she is nevertheless dismissed by the vengeful duchess. Meanwhile, the attraction between the duke and Henriette continues to grow, eventually leading to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4KbLsCLnJVALXuV3djKOI8sUfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43807'),
  ('226223687720240072', 'All Three of Us', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kheiron, Jean-François Hensgens, Richard Rousseau', 'Kheiron', 'Kheiron, Leïla Bekhti, Gérard Darmon, Zabou Breitman, Alexandre Astier, Kyan Khojandi, Arsène Mosca, Jonathan Cohen', null, 'An Iranian family survives the shah and the ayatollah and moves to France. This story follows the family through it all. Despite the politics, revolution, prison, beatings, assassinations and suicides this is a comedy.', 'An Iranian family survives the shah and the ayatollah and moves to France. This story follows the family through it all. Despite the politics, revolution, prison, beatings, assassinations and suicides this is a comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPYtRdJwt85OgZIUBZ5tHgmfyCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364137'),
  ('971568318482891485', 'All Through the House', 2015, 'Horror', 'Todd Nunes, Ryan J. Anderson', 'Todd Nunes', 'Jessica Cameron, Ashley Mary Nunes, Melynda Kiring, Natalie Montera, Lito Velasco, Jason Ray Schumacher, Johanna Rae, Matt Poeschl', 'NR', 'A deranged masked Santa-Slayer comes to town for some yuletide-terror. He leaves behind a bloody trail of mutilated bodies as he hunts his way to the front steps of the town''s most feared and notorious home.', 'A deranged masked Santa-Slayer comes to town for some yuletide-terror. He leaves behind a bloody trail of mutilated bodies as he hunts his way to the front steps of the town''s most feared and notorious home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f6SDQW6fH5jojqXkN3fQwPgUWNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373048'),
