  ('785344593968006517', 'All You Can Eat Buddha', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Ian Lagarde', 'Ian Lagarde', 'Ludovic Berthillot, Yaité Ruiz, David La Haye, Sylvio Arriola, Daydi Diaz Cabrera, Nathalie Coupal, Alexis Díaz de Villegas, Alexander Guerrero', null, 'At the Palacio, an all-inclusive resort in the carribean, Mike''s arrival complicates the normal flow of operations. His voracious appetite, mysterious magnetism and unexpected miracles bring him the curious, among which he makes three friends and meeets a few admirers, a jealous salsa teacher and an enamored octopus. All of whom will accompany him in a gargantuan downward spiral mixing civil unrest and intestinal meltdown; a change of administration held up by the most attentive staff in the world.', 'At the Palacio, an all-inclusive resort in the carribean, Mike''s arrival complicates the normal flow of operations. His voracious appetite, mysterious magnetism and unexpected miracles bring him the curious, among which he makes three friends and meeets a few admirers, a jealous salsa teacher and an enamored octopus. All of whom will accompany him in a gargantuan downward spiral mixing civil unrest and intestinal meltdown; a change of administration held up by the most attentive staff in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEwa24Uz3bEabJ3fBb0CpDE7TTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473336'),
  ('438336169408546138', 'All You Need is Crime', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Natalia Piervincenzi, Giulia Dappio, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Andrea Bassi, Menotti, Nicola Guaglianone', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Marco Giallini, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Edoardo Leo, Ilenia Pastorelli, Massimiliano Bruno, Emanuel Bevilacqua, Antonello Fassari', null, 'In the present day, three friends to make ends meet invent a "criminal tour" for the places which were scenes of the Banda della Magliana criminal acts, even with vintage clothes. Suddenly they are catapulted in the 1982, during the Spain World Cup, facing the real Banda della Magliana, which at that time had the control over illegal bets.', 'In the present day, three friends to make ends meet invent a "criminal tour" for the places which were scenes of the Banda della Magliana criminal acts, even with vintage clothes. Suddenly they are catapulted in the 1982, during the Spain World Cup, facing the real Banda della Magliana, which at that time had the control over illegal bets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDGL90fBZs0vNDdl0qPxmCMlkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563907'),
  ('903094074317057959', 'All You Need Is Death', 2024, 'Horror', 'Paul Duane, Conor Rotherham', 'Paul Duane', 'Simone Collins, Charlie Maher, Catherine Siggins, Nigel O''Neill, Olwen Fouéré, Barry McKiernan, David McDermott, Gary Whelan', null, 'A young couple who collect rare folk ballads discover the dark side of love when they surreptitiously record and translate an ancient, taboo folk song from the deep, forgotten past.', 'A young couple who collect rare folk ballads discover the dark side of love when they surreptitiously record and translate an ancient, taboo folk song from the deep, forgotten past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiEkGNiXPKgyRGyqy3MfCVEoRx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116984'),
  ('407355320174387278', 'All You Need Is Kill', 2026, 'Anime, Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Mystery', 'Kenichiro Akimoto, Yukinori Nakamura, Tomonari Nakajima, Hisato Tokumaru, Takanori Nakajima', 'Yuichiro Kido, Hiroshi Sakurazaka', 'Ai Mikami, Natsuki Hanae, Kana Hanazawa, Hiccorohee, Mo Chugakusei', 'R', 'In a time loop during an alien invasion, a resourceful but isolated young woman must navigate the repetition of death until she crosses paths with a shy young man trapped in the same cycle. Together, they fight to break free from the loop.', 'In a time loop during an alien invasion, a resourceful but isolated young woman must navigate the repetition of death until she crosses paths with a shy young man trapped in the same cycle. Together, they fight to break free from the loop.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd10f9b8006312363d03657ee30768e8e.jpg', 'plex:movie:all-you-need-is-kill-2026'),
  ('481546367195950647', 'All You Need is Lie', 2021, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Gabriel Julien-Laferrière, Cyrill Renaud', 'Carole Greep', 'Julie de Bona, Samir Boitard, Frédéric Chau, Émilie Caen, Emilie Piponnier, Souad Amidou, Vincent Nemeth, Julien Prévost', null, 'In the jungle that is celibacy and dating apps, Zoé just found the man of her life. An idyll which lasts - 2 hours - before Robinson falls into a coma. One misunderstanding later, she is now engaged to this man and responsible for his two children while he is hospitalized. Playing along, Zoé will have to play the perfect girlfriend to man she barely knows - But along the line of lies and time passed in the world of this charming stranger, won''t she end up by believing in this love? What will happen once Robinson wakes up?', 'In the jungle that is celibacy and dating apps, Zoé just found the man of her life. An idyll which lasts - 2 hours - before Robinson falls into a coma. One misunderstanding later, she is now engaged to this man and responsible for his two children while he is hospitalized. Playing along, Zoé will have to play the perfect girlfriend to man she barely knows - But along the line of lies and time passed in the world of this charming stranger, won''t she end up by believing in this love? What will happen once Robinson wakes up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKqtL7jnnuaV99QCrko7rx6kURq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864759'),
  ('252271729965806381', 'All You Need Is Love', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Edzard Onneken', 'Kerstin Österlin, Jessica Schellack', 'Saskia Vester, Jürgen Tonkel, Jenny Elvers, Helgi Schmid, Manuel Witting, Franziska Traub, Johannes Herrschmann, Heide Ackermann', null, 'When Katharina got an unexpected letter from her son Hans announcing that he was getting married and that he and his fiancé Nicki were leaving Berlin to come visit her...', 'When Katharina got an unexpected letter from her son Hans announcing that he was getting married and that he and his fiancé Nicki were leaving Berlin to come visit her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjvdUaWf2Ib8aI3bRFi4oEDhQrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54548'),
  ('1005772277823407142', 'All Yours', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Lambert, Johan Legraie, Christophe Hermans', 'Hélène Girard, David Lambert', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Monia Chokri, Jean-Michel Balthazar, Augustin Legrand, Vittoria Scognamiglio, Achille Ridolfi, Anne-Marie Loop, Jean-Michel Charlier', null, 'A penniless Argentine male escort meets a solitary, lonely Belgian baker who wants to help him leave the world of prostitution, explores intimate gay relationship.', 'A penniless Argentine male escort meets a solitary, lonely Belgian baker who wants to help him leave the world of prostitution, explores intimate gay relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCoM6PQ0Jc8BquQcAQ7EPowfK7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292619'),
  ('1004733958464188116', 'All-American Co-Ed', 1941, 'Comedy, Music', 'LeRoy Prinz, Edward Montagne, Robert Pittack', 'Cortland Fitzsimmons', 'Frances Langford, Johnny Downs, Marjorie Woodworth, Harry Langdon, Esther Dale, Noah Beery Jr., Alan Hale Jr., Marie Windsor', 'NR', 'Fraternity brothers enter one of their own into a scholarship lottery after a women''s college insults them. Though the Zeta boys are celebrated for their comedy drag revue, staying undercover as a woman at an all-girls'' school wasn''t part of the rehearsal!', 'Fraternity brothers enter one of their own into a scholarship lottery after a women''s college insults them. Though the Zeta boys are celebrated for their comedy drag revue, staying undercover as a woman at an all-girls'' school wasn''t part of the rehearsal!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TWoyPl3ftUwWZAWLtAywzivpgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96139'),
  ('890672965782991353', 'All-American Murder', 1991, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Anson Williams, Geoffrey Schaaf', 'Barry Sandler', 'Christopher Walken, Charlie Schlatter, Josie Bissett, Joanna Cassidy, Richard Kind, Woody Watson, Mitchell Anderson, Amy Moore Davis', null, 'Artie Logan is the new guy on Campus. Suddenly, he meets Tally Fuller: the most popular and beautiful girl at Fairfield college and she finally agrees to go on a date with him. But that night she is brutally killed by a blowtorch-wielding maniac and Artie is wrongfully arrested. Despite protests from other Police officers, detective P.J. Decker believes Artie''s story and gives him 24 hours to track down the real killer.', 'Artie Logan is the new guy on Campus. Suddenly, he meets Tally Fuller: the most popular and beautiful girl at Fairfield college and she finally agrees to go on a date with him. But that night she is brutally killed by a blowtorch-wielding maniac and Artie is wrongfully arrested. Despite protests from other Police officers, detective P.J. Decker believes Artie''s story and gives him 24 hours to track down the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zciadDmvP6CUNM0hYIzFVACFm3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123863'),
  ('881763627266154771', 'All-Round Appraiser Q: The Eyes of Mona Lisa', 2014, 'Fantasy, Mystery', 'Taro Kawazu, Shinsuke Sato', 'Manabu Uda', 'Haruka Ayase, Tori Matsuzaka, Eriko Hatsune, Hiroaki Murakami, Jun Hashimoto, Seminosuke Murasugi, Kazue Tsunogae, Pierre Deladonchamps', null, 'In this adaptation of the popular eponymous mystery novel by Keisuke Matsuoka, Paris provides the gorgeous backdrop for a grand intrigue involving the world’s most iconic artistic treasure: the Mona Lisa. Minds will be blown, puzzles will be solved, but will a 500-year-old curse be removed?', 'In this adaptation of the popular eponymous mystery novel by Keisuke Matsuoka, Paris provides the gorgeous backdrop for a grand intrigue involving the world’s most iconic artistic treasure: the Mona Lisa. Minds will be blown, puzzles will be solved, but will a 500-year-old curse be removed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grnlOOIjdCajbJbl9kSFd6y009O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274795'),
  ('450031140460754006', 'All-Time High', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Koch, Manon Manucci, Julien Royal', 'Julien Royal, Nassim Lyes', 'Nassim Lyes, Zoé Marchal, Adrien Essamir, Yousef Ramal, Yovel Lewkowski, Yassine Stein, Eric Cullet, Hakim Jemili', null, 'A con artist in dire need of cash and a woman with a crypto fortune hit it off. Is she the target of his dreams, or is the scammer about to get scammed?', 'A con artist in dire need of cash and a woman with a crypto fortune hit it off. Is she the target of his dreams, or is the scammer about to get scammed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQvINIqpk81Ax0QCcQXxjGD7Dgv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034940'),
  ('793232460374898103', 'All''s Faire in Love', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Marshall, Mark Irwin', 'Scott Marshall, R.A. White, Jeffrey Ray Wine', 'Christina Ricci, Owen Benjamin, Ann-Margret, Matthew Lillard, Jason Ishmael Echols, Dave Sheridan, Chris Wylde, Cedric the Entertainer', null, 'Two rival medieval families compete for power and love in the fairytale world of the Renaissance. Will is a student who was sent by his professor to work in the fairgrounds after missing a few classes. Here he meets the kind and charming Kate, who quit her job at the bank to work at the fair. This is where this modern-day love story begins, in Renaissance garb!', 'Two rival medieval families compete for power and love in the fairytale world of the Renaissance. Will is a student who was sent by his professor to work in the fairgrounds after missing a few classes. Here he meets the kind and charming Kate, who quit her job at the bank to work at the fair. This is where this modern-day love story begins, in Renaissance garb!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1awVuRX4iJ1kSRy9mfynZppZMFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76297'),
  ('964871296091368577', 'All''s Well End''s Well, Too', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Sander Lee', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Leslie Cheung, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Sam Hui, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Money Lo Man-Yee, Richard Ng Man-Tat', null, 'Chow Tung is a licentious man who was arranged to get married along with his ugly sister Gut to partners not of their choice. Chow, being a filial son, agrees to go along with his mother''s plans. The plot thickens when Chow meets the beautiful Snow White and decides to marry her of which Matriarch Chow agrees whole-heartedly.', 'Chow Tung is a licentious man who was arranged to get married along with his ugly sister Gut to partners not of their choice. Chow, being a filial son, agrees to go along with his mother''s plans. The plot thickens when Chow meets the beautiful Snow White and decides to marry her of which Matriarch Chow agrees whole-heartedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Jh8cd87jzEBPpD5ELx9emC0bJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286184'),
  ('447957549236606338', 'All''s Well, End''s Well', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Tony Leung Siu-Hung, Chu Yat-Hung', 'Roman Cheung, Tessa Choy Ting-Ting, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu', 'Stephen Chow, Leslie Cheung, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Maggie Cheung, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Lee Heung-Kam', null, 'Three brothers living with their father fib and play pranks to win parental approval for themselves and their romances.', 'Three brothers living with their father fib and play pranks to win parental approval for themselves and their romances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7lMtQEzbSpM9OnDvmZAYPnZDIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60145'),
  ('461850333792027905', 'All''s Well, End''s Well ''97', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Adam Tam Chi-Wai, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', 'Roy Chiao, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Stephen Chow, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Amanda Lee Wai-Man, Christy Chung Lai-Tai', null, 'Old Mr. Lo has three sons and the youngest one Lo Kung is his favorite. However, Kung does nothing but fool around all day long. Old Mr. Lo is very annoyed about this. The relationship between father and son is thus affected. So on Kung''s birthday, his two brothers decide to play a joke on him. They trick him into believing he has won the lottery. Kung is so happy that he spends a tremendous amount of money. When he realizes he is in huge debt, he pretends to go insane and the whole family believes him.', 'Old Mr. Lo has three sons and the youngest one Lo Kung is his favorite. However, Kung does nothing but fool around all day long. Old Mr. Lo is very annoyed about this. The relationship between father and son is thus affected. So on Kung''s birthday, his two brothers decide to play a joke on him. They trick him into believing he has won the lottery. Kung is so happy that he spends a tremendous amount of money. When he realizes he is in huge debt, he pretends to go insane and the whole family believes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b4H77d8QRTZYXBwzYtn2ta5uZa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64083'),
  ('230991577019040197', 'All''s Well, End''s Well 2011', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Janet Chun Siu-Chun, Chan Hing-Kai, Horace Wong Wing-Hang', 'Ho Miu-Kei, Fung Ching-Ching, Chan Hing-Kai', 'Louis Koo, Margie Tsang Wah-Sin, JJ Jia, Yan Ni, Ah Duo, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Xie Nan, Cheng Qian', null, 'Popular beautician Sammy (Louis Koo) has the good fortune of being hired as the CEO of a cosmetics company, but quickly finds that he has his work cut out for him when the female employees reject him outright.', 'Popular beautician Sammy (Louis Koo) has the good fortune of being hired as the CEO of a cosmetics company, but quickly finds that he has his work cut out for him when the female employees reject him outright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nY5RHN8bFFo1bJaISuPA7SSZjI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54549'),
