  ('915285731485440900', 'Allá en el Rancho Grande', 1936, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Fernando de Fuentes, Gabriel Figueroa', 'Antonio Guzmán Aguilera, Fernando de Fuentes', 'Tito Guízar, Esther Fernández, René Cardona, Lorenzo Barcelata, Emma Roldán, Carlos López, Margarita Cortés, Dolores Camarillo', null, 'Two good friends — the owner and general manager of a ranch — fall in love with the same girl at the same time. The owner tries to ''buy'' the girl without knowing she is in love with the manager.', 'Two good friends — the owner and general manager of a ranch — fall in love with the same girl at the same time. The owner tries to ''buy'' the girl without knowing she is in love with the manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5n4UGrxTKLdXXZAnW2lOxRmUo2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240633'),
  ('530682132791158544', 'Allan Quatermain and the Lost City of Gold', 1986, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Gary Nelson, Stephen Chigorimbo, Michael Philips', 'Gene Quintano, Lee Reynolds', 'Richard Chamberlain, Sharon Stone, James Earl Jones, Henry Silva, Robert Donner, Doghmi Larbi, Cassandra Peterson, Martin Rabbett', 'PG', 'After his brother Robeson disappears without a trace while exploring Africa in search of a legendary ''white tribe'', Allan Quatermain decides to follow in his footsteps to learn what became of him. Soon after arriving, he discovers the Lost City of Gold, controlled by the evil lord Agon, and mined by his legions of white slaves.', 'After his brother Robeson disappears without a trace while exploring Africa in search of a legendary ''white tribe'', Allan Quatermain decides to follow in his footsteps to learn what became of him. Soon after arriving, he discovers the Lost City of Gold, controlled by the evil lord Agon, and mined by his legions of white slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fz9QrK7OF4EoQbdSO8KSPgJWiZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9710'),
  ('1089689070350086176', 'Allan Quatermain and the Temple of Skulls', 2008, 'Romance, Adventure, Action', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Erica Steele', 'Matthew Alson Thornbury, David Michael Latt', 'Sean Cameron Michael, Christopher Adamson, Natalie Stone, Daniel Bonjour, Wittly Jourdan, Nick Everhart, Thomas Fakude', 'R', 'Filmed on location in South Africa, a retelling of H. Rider Haggard''s classic novel "King Solomon''s Mines," featuring the adventurer who was the inspiration for Indiana Jones.', 'Filmed on location in South Africa, a retelling of H. Rider Haggard''s classic novel "King Solomon''s Mines," featuring the adventurer who was the inspiration for Indiana Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slkzY0iB1CVCvrgkJiK6Tahs2Jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14103'),
  ('773267116649732442', 'Allegheny Uprising', 1939, 'Western, Action, Adventure, History', 'William A. Seiter, Nicholas Musuraca, Kenneth Holmes', 'P.J. Wolfson', 'John Wayne, Claire Trevor, George Sanders, Brian Donlevy, Wilfrid Lawson, Robert Barrat, John F. Hamilton, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'South western Pennsylvania area of colonial America, 1760s. Colonial distaste and disapproval of the British government is starting to surface. Many local colonists have been killed by American Indians who are armed with rifles supplied by white traders.', 'South western Pennsylvania area of colonial America, 1760s. Colonial distaste and disapproval of the British government is starting to surface. Many local colonists have been killed by American Indians who are armed with rifles supplied by white traders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB1BolZCjLcW9XKkEN4pftpev1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43825'),
