  ('462381911036919645', 'Allure', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Sanchez, Jason Sanchez, Sara Mishara', 'Carlos Sanchez, Jason Sanchez', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Julia Sarah Stone, Denis O''Hare, Maxim Roy, Joe Cobden, Jonathan Shatzky, Max Laferriere, Yardly Kavanagh', null, 'Plagued by the abuse of her past and the turmoil of failed intimate encounters, Laura struggles to find a lover and a sense of normalcy. Her beacon of hope comes in sixteen year-old Eva, a talented pianist disillusioned by the life her mother imposes upon her. An unlikely relationship is formed between the two and Eva becomes an obsession to Laura. In light of Eva''s unhappiness, Laura convinces her to runaway to her house and they soon find themselves caught within an intense entanglement. Manipulation, denial and codependency fuel what ultimately becomes a fractured dynamic that can only sustain itself for so long.', 'Plagued by the abuse of her past and the turmoil of failed intimate encounters, Laura struggles to find a lover and a sense of normalcy. Her beacon of hope comes in sixteen year-old Eva, a talented pianist disillusioned by the life her mother imposes upon her. An unlikely relationship is formed between the two and Eva becomes an obsession to Laura. In light of Eva''s unhappiness, Laura convinces her to runaway to her house and they soon find themselves caught within an intense entanglement. Manipulation, denial and codependency fuel what ultimately becomes a fractured dynamic that can only sustain itself for so long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cQ4k9PN29QSwzf6BAmhAfF94gT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467916'),
  ('333945682608341248', 'Allures', 1961, 'Animation', 'Jordan Belson', null, null, null, 'Allures is a spectacular sequence of moving figures and points, a film which reaches out to the cosmic and the spiritual, where the spatial dimension becomes transcendental.', 'Allures is a spectacular sequence of moving figures and points, a film which reaches out to the cosmic and the spiritual, where the spatial dimension becomes transcendental.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOwNnc2DqgqUjZPUTnCr14EwozO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142191'),
  ('254684142586612429', 'Alma', 2009, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Rodrigo Blaas', 'Rodrigo Blaas', null, 'NR', 'Amidst the chilly white winter, bright-eyed Alma, wanders through Barcelona’s cobblestone streets. Suddenly, she spots an unassuming toy shop. Her gaze is drawn to a nearly identical figure staring back at her from the storefront window. As if by magic, the shop’s door swings open. But to her bewilderment, her elusive twin is nowhere to be found.', 'Amidst the chilly white winter, bright-eyed Alma, wanders through Barcelona’s cobblestone streets. Suddenly, she spots an unassuming toy shop. Her gaze is drawn to a nearly identical figure staring back at her from the storefront window. As if by magic, the shop’s door swings open. But to her bewilderment, her elusive twin is nowhere to be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh2ynavM1ADm7gSOCAE7fOV3fvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31160'),
  ('992884419891267722', 'Alma & the Wolf', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Patrick Jann, Joe Kessler', 'Abby Miller', 'Ethan Embry, Li Jun Li, Mather Zickel, Jeremie Harris, Alexandra Doke, Kevin Allison, Lukas Jann, Dana Millican', 'R', 'After a violent animal attack, paranoia spreads through Spiral Creek. But when Deputy Ren Accord gets too close, his son vanishes, and reality begins to fracture.', 'After a violent animal attack, paranoia spreads through Spiral Creek. But when Deputy Ren Accord gets too close, his son vanishes, and reality begins to fracture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4SUgmGGhMS4t9g0DJzAjRS5Hcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328956'),
