  ('349225906675207970', 'Alma mía', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Barone, Juan Pablo Laplace, Eduardo Ripari', 'Jorge Leyes', 'Araceli González, Pablo Echarri, Héctor Bidonde, Diego Peretti, Rita Cortese, Valeria Bertuccelli, Damián de Santo, Adriana Salonia', null, 'The lives of Alma (Araceli Gonzalez) and Leo (Pablo Echarri) did not seem destined to cross. She, a baker in the mouth, with her ​​family and her boyfriend Mario since adolescence. The, an architect with secure wedding date with Valeria. One night, fate brought them together and this unexpected encounter will not go unnoticed. Both Alma and Leo not be fidgety to what happens between them.', 'The lives of Alma (Araceli Gonzalez) and Leo (Pablo Echarri) did not seem destined to cross. She, a baker in the mouth, with her ​​family and her boyfriend Mario since adolescence. The, an architect with secure wedding date with Valeria. One night, fate brought them together and this unexpected encounter will not go unnoticed. Both Alma and Leo not be fidgety to what happens between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkHRuwwoA8dpJ27RzyfaPMQ0Lcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127298'),
  ('971386382719104975', 'Alma pura', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Roberto Salomone, Jorge Dumitre, Ramiro Gomez Bustamante', 'Roberto Salomone', 'Ingrid Grudke, Malena Sánchez, Guillermo Pfening, Mariano Bertolini, Néstor Rosso, Elisa Gagliano, Nora Sommavilla, Ambar Taborda Ceballos', null, 'A plastic artist is discharged from a rehabilitation where she was admitted for drugs and surménage. She is going to live alone in an old family house in the mountains, where the noises and the strange things that happen test her weakened nerves. She becomes suspicious of the few inhabitants of the place, who seem to be creating a world of conspiracies against her. Fantastic events end up showing that sensitive people can look out and see a world that is not ours, at the risk of their lives.', 'A plastic artist is discharged from a rehabilitation where she was admitted for drugs and surménage. She is going to live alone in an old family house in the mountains, where the noises and the strange things that happen test her weakened nerves. She becomes suspicious of the few inhabitants of the place, who seem to be creating a world of conspiracies against her. Fantastic events end up showing that sensitive people can look out and see a world that is not ours, at the risk of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vto5GLsj3J2mdW2uVQjsJQv4aPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:693019'),
  ('1063538498358149359', 'Alma Viva', 2022, 'Drama', 'Cristèle Alves Meira, Rui Poças, Inês Mingote', 'Cristèle Alves Meira, Laurent Lunetta', 'Lua Michel, Ana Padrão, Jacqueline Corado, Ester Cataläo, Duarte Pina, Arthur Brigas, Catherine Salée, Pedro Lacerda', null, 'Like every summer, little Salomé returns to her family village nestled in the Portuguese mountains for the holidays. As the vacations begin in a carefree atmosphere, her beloved grandmother suddenly dies. While the adults are tearing each other apart over the funeral, Salomé is haunted by the spirit of the one who was considered a witch.', 'Like every summer, little Salomé returns to her family village nestled in the Portuguese mountains for the holidays. As the vacations begin in a carefree atmosphere, her beloved grandmother suddenly dies. While the adults are tearing each other apart over the funeral, Salomé is haunted by the spirit of the one who was considered a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tf5d4OWsKoftpyO1Xp07khxE5nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958192'),
  ('925959724165392994', 'Almanya: Welcome to Germany', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yasemin Samdereli, Tobias Jäger, Ulla Bay Kronenberger', 'Yasemin Samdereli, Nesrin Samdereli', 'Denis Moschitto, Fahri Yardım, Arnd Schimkat, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Aylin Tezel, Aykut Kayacık, Anton Algrang, Lilay Huser', null, 'After living 45 years in Germany, the Turkish Hüseyin Yilmaz, seventy, announces to his family that he has bought a house in Turkey and they should return to make the necessary reforms. The idea is unwelcome and causes very heated discussions. In addition, Canan, a granddaughter of Hüseyin, announces she is pregnant and the father is her English boyfriend, and no one knew anything.', 'After living 45 years in Germany, the Turkish Hüseyin Yilmaz, seventy, announces to his family that he has bought a house in Turkey and they should return to make the necessary reforms. The idea is unwelcome and causes very heated discussions. In addition, Canan, a granddaughter of Hüseyin, announces she is pregnant and the father is her English boyfriend, and no one knew anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuEWm1r3cfxrnX4NxAXuJhtOmp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63849'),
  ('219704357751487626', 'Almayer''s Folly', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chantal Akerman, Raymond Fromont', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Stanislas Merhar, Marc Barbé, Aurora Marion, Zac Andrianasolo, Sakhna Oum, Solida Chan, Sun Yucheng, Bunthang Khim', null, 'In 1940s Malaysia, European merchant Kaspar Almayer is obsessed with finding a treasure to secure his daughter''s future. His dreams fall victim to the pressure of his own greed, which becomes a torment. Compounding this is the oppressive English domination dominating the country – and that which brings ruin to the remote village where he lives.', 'In 1940s Malaysia, European merchant Kaspar Almayer is obsessed with finding a treasure to secure his daughter''s future. His dreams fall victim to the pressure of his own greed, which becomes a torment. Compounding this is the oppressive English domination dominating the country – and that which brings ruin to the remote village where he lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2mDwohumCDQ81d9alJLtddtJnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86815'),
