  ('527351425605221437', 'Almost Famous', 2000, 'Drama, Music', 'John Toll, Cameron Crowe, David Kelley', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Billy Crudup, Frances McDormand, Kate Hudson, Jason Lee, Patrick Fugit, Zooey Deschanel, Michael Angarano, Anna Paquin', 'R', 'In 1973, 15-year-old William Miller''s unabashed love of music and aspiration to become a rock journalist lands him an assignment from Rolling Stone magazine to interview and tour with the up-and-coming band, Stillwater.', 'In 1973, 15-year-old William Miller''s unabashed love of music and aspiration to become a rock journalist lands him an assignment from Rolling Stone magazine to interview and tour with the up-and-coming band, Stillwater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rrkyLYbgLj84AYvjhdcJot4JPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786'),
  ('810942302695591793', 'Almost Friends', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mario Aguja, Jake Goldberger, Jeremy Mackie', 'Jake Goldberger', 'Freddie Highmore, Odeya Rush, Christopher Meloni, Haley Joel Osment, Jake Abel, Rita Volk, Marg Helgenberger, Taylor John Smith', null, 'A man in his mid-20s, still living at home with his mother and stepfather, puts all his eggs in one basket: the girl who works at his local coffee shop. The problem is, she has a serious boyfriend. As they become closer, the line between friendship and intimacy is blurred, and the situation forces both to examine where they are in their lives.', 'A man in his mid-20s, still living at home with his mother and stepfather, puts all his eggs in one basket: the girl who works at his local coffee shop. The problem is, she has a serious boyfriend. As they become closer, the line between friendship and intimacy is blurred, and the situation forces both to examine where they are in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJMknKxZagbhAYiiMjEaFnsZzRR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436459'),
  ('545007916810794914', 'Almost Heroes', 1998, 'Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Christopher Guest, Adam Kimmel, Kenneth MacMillan', 'Mark Nutter, Boyd Hale, Thomas R. Wolfe', 'Chris Farley, Matthew Perry, Bokeem Woodbine, Barry Del Sherman, Eugene Levy, Lisa Barbuscia, Christian Clemenson, Patrick Cranshaw', 'PG-13', 'Two hapless explorers lead an ill-fated 1804 expedition through the Pacific Northwest in a hopeless, doomed effort to reach the Pacific Ocean before Lewis and Clark.', 'Two hapless explorers lead an ill-fated 1804 expedition through the Pacific Northwest in a hopeless, doomed effort to reach the Pacific Ocean before Lewis and Clark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwZoIxl1RlsM0utYGt04CM20Kk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14342'),
  ('541405181271301076', 'Almost Home', 2014, 'Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Todd Wilderman', null, 'Steve Martin, Tom McGrath, David Soren', 'G', 'A group of aliens searching for a new planet on which to make home, with little success. Promotional short for Dreamworks Animation''s forthcoming feature, Home.', 'A group of aliens searching for a new planet on which to make home, with little success. Promotional short for Dreamworks Animation''s forthcoming feature, Home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwG6eNxGAy4qNJpzo6OjDFmKpFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256346'),
  ('928533404488917425', 'Almost Human', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Umberto Lenzi, Alessandro Metz, Federico Zanni', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Tomas Milian, Henry Silva, Laura Belli, Gino Santercole, Mario Piave, Luciano Catenacci, Pippo Starnazza, Lorenzo Piani', 'R', 'A psychotic small-time criminal realizes that the everyday robberies, rapes and murders he commits aren''t profitable enough, so he figures to hit the big time by kidnapping the daughter of a rich man.', 'A psychotic small-time criminal realizes that the everyday robberies, rapes and murders he commits aren''t profitable enough, so he figures to hit the big time by kidnapping the daughter of a rich man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEbwgT6fgKCJJWky77Q4TMErvmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50236'),
  ('851585473062178927', 'Almost Human', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joe Begos, Joe Begos', 'Joe Begos', 'Graham Skipper, Josh Ethier, Vanessa Leigh, Susan T. Travers, Anthony Amaral III, Michael A. LoCicero, Jeremy Furtado, Jami Tennille', 'NR', 'Mark Fisher disappeared from his home in a brilliant flash of blue light almost two years ago. His friend Seth Hampton was the last to see him alive. Now a string of grisly, violent murders leads Seth to believe that Mark is back, and something evil is living inside of him.', 'Mark Fisher disappeared from his home in a brilliant flash of blue light almost two years ago. His friend Seth Hampton was the last to see him alive. Now a string of grisly, violent murders leads Seth to believe that Mark is back, and something evil is living inside of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SxL9zFvBbeNe2A39eTqLOrDmrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210910'),
  ('926081996648958066', 'Almost King', 1977, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Bořivoj Zeman, Ivan Šlapeta, Stanislav Ulver', 'Bořivoj Zeman, Oldřich Kautský', 'Jiří Korn, Naďa Konvalinková, Marie Glázrová, Jorga Kotrbová, František Filipovský, Zdeněk Dítě, Josef Kemr, Jan Skopeček', null, 'A fairy tale about how those who have a heart and are not stingy will not fail. The most popular hero of Czech fairy tales, besides the brave prince and the beautiful princess, is undoubtedly Honza, who is often not stupid at all, but on the contrary brave, clever, handsome and cheerful.', 'A fairy tale about how those who have a heart and are not stingy will not fail. The most popular hero of Czech fairy tales, besides the brave prince and the beautiful princess, is undoubtedly Honza, who is often not stupid at all, but on the contrary brave, clever, handsome and cheerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D0JtMmxiQGh9B1vugWpXJtO9IB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78818'),
  ('534851910850404240', 'Almost Legal', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Max Mauroux, Thomas Brémond, Alain Braconnier', 'Max Mauroux', 'Marley Duboscq, Joseph Pierre, Marie-Anne Chazel, Jérôme Niel, Manel Benyoucef, Léo Castel, Sawsan Abès, Jean-Claude Muaka', null, 'Just out of their studies, Félix and Vincent are two young broken hands from the Atlantic coast who are struggling to find their place in the world of work... and in life in general. The two friends decide to clandestinely transform a small neighborhood grocery store into a nighttime business during the holidays. Helped by a team of specialists recruited for the occasion, they will keep the store running, until the real owner of the convenience store and the police start to smell something wrong...', 'Just out of their studies, Félix and Vincent are two young broken hands from the Atlantic coast who are struggling to find their place in the world of work... and in life in general. The two friends decide to clandestinely transform a small neighborhood grocery store into a nighttime business during the holidays. Helped by a team of specialists recruited for the occasion, they will keep the store running, until the real owner of the convenience store and the police start to smell something wrong...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqP1eueBBj9uBfzOdtSsVl5J7BN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995775'),
  ('616231495372922467', 'Almost Love', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Won Jin, Lee Han, Lee Jun-gyu', 'Lee Han', 'Kim Ha-neul, Kwon Sang-woo, Jang Mi-Inae, Lee Sang-woo, Park Ji-bin, Jung Min-ah, Jeong Gyu-su, Won Jin', null, 'Ji-hwan is a taekwondo student with a part time job as a stunt man, who dreams of becoming Korea''s answer to Jackie Chan. Dal-rae is a drama student and aspiring actress, but tends to fail auditions because of her timid personality.', 'Ji-hwan is a taekwondo student with a part time job as a stunt man, who dreams of becoming Korea''s answer to Jackie Chan. Dal-rae is a drama student and aspiring actress, but tends to fail auditions because of her timid personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLWthIm1tPEaahni2KlVSW4YaJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18383'),
  ('33913084245901113', 'Almost Normal', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Comedy', 'Marc Moody, Richie Sherman', 'Marc Moody', 'J. Andrew Keitch, Joan Lauckner, Tim Hammer, Nils Haaland, Kehry Anson Lane, Joel Egger, Virginia Smith, Brad Buffum', null, 'A gay man approaching a mid-life crisis is tired of being different because he is gay. He wants to be normal. Suddenly he is yanked back in time to when he was in high school. But this time, the world is gay and to be straight is considered deviant behavior. Then something else happens. He meets a girl. And suddenly normal becomes ...well almost normal.', 'A gay man approaching a mid-life crisis is tired of being different because he is gay. He wants to be normal. Suddenly he is yanked back in time to when he was in high school. But this time, the world is gay and to be straight is considered deviant behavior. Then something else happens. He meets a girl. And suddenly normal becomes ...well almost normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ERCU895RF078FrePLJS0djpUVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32633'),
  ('819249475220748222', 'Almost Paradise', 2024, 'Drama', 'Enrico Maria Artale, Francesco Di Giacomo, Matteo Damiani', 'Enrico Maria Artale', 'Edoardo Pesce, Margarita Rosa de Francisco, María del Rosario, Gabriel Montesi', null, 'Through salsa and merengue dance nights, shared memories, and limited earnings working for a local drug dealer, Julio Cesar and his mother struggle to maintain their love-filled but oppressive lifestyle. The arrival of Ines, an attractive young Colombian drug mule, threatens to unsettle their tenuous stability.', 'Through salsa and merengue dance nights, shared memories, and limited earnings working for a local drug dealer, Julio Cesar and his mother struggle to maintain their love-filled but oppressive lifestyle. The arrival of Ines, an attractive young Colombian drug mule, threatens to unsettle their tenuous stability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u8wglCqEzfb0ZnugkeMUK64mWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070997'),
  ('566137085426906221', 'Almost Peaceful', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michel Deville, André Diot', 'Rosalinde Deville', 'Simon Abkarian, Zabou Breitman, Vincent Elbaz, Lubna Azabal, Denis Podalydès, Julie Gayet, Malik Zidi, Stanislas Merhar', null, 'Set during the largely unexplored period immediately following World War II, the film follows a group of mostly Jewish Parisians who attempt to restart their lives and rekindle their capacity for happiness in the shadow of unspeakable horrors. Variety called it "thoroughly charming. Sad, gentle, and funny in the best French tradition of high quality cinema." A film by Marcelo Gomes', 'Set during the largely unexplored period immediately following World War II, the film follows a group of mostly Jewish Parisians who attempt to restart their lives and rekindle their capacity for happiness in the shadow of unspeakable horrors. Variety called it "thoroughly charming. Sad, gentle, and funny in the best French tradition of high quality cinema." A film by Marcelo Gomes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a9FYJm2LnFlV9bxUrqiVg0s7gS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61665'),
  ('471765718953645683', 'Almost Pregnant', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Michael DeLuise, Glenn Kershaw', 'Frederick Stroppel', 'Jeff Conaway, Tanya Roberts, John Calvin, Joan Severance, Dom DeLuise, Christopher Michael Moore, Angelo Tiffe, Bruce Lurie', null, 'Charlie (Conaway) is a happy man with a beautiful wife (Roberts), a wonderful career and every blessing a man could want except "...children". When the wife demands a "star child" and Charlie can''t deliver the goods, they turn to their crazy neighbor (Calvin) to get the job done, so to speak. Very hilarious and bawdy comedy where "one rooster to a hen-house" is not always the truth.', 'Charlie (Conaway) is a happy man with a beautiful wife (Roberts), a wonderful career and every blessing a man could want except "...children". When the wife demands a "star child" and Charlie can''t deliver the goods, they turn to their crazy neighbor (Calvin) to get the job done, so to speak. Very hilarious and bawdy comedy where "one rooster to a hen-house" is not always the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90SfRD7cFtalgFfN0UJZH6jiH2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34756'),
  ('57334911692519361', 'Almost Thirty', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Alejandro Sugich', null, 'Eiza González, Manuel Balbi, Livia Rangel, Marianna Burelli, Sara Maldonado, Adan Canto, Claudia Ramírez, Berenice Noriega', null, 'Hilarious romantic comedy which main essence is based on the maturation process that young people face when entering their thirties. When their options come to settling down and starting a family or pursuing and achieving what they''ve always dreamed of, even though this could become a risk for their economic and emotional stability.', 'Hilarious romantic comedy which main essence is based on the maturation process that young people face when entering their thirties. When their options come to settling down and starting a family or pursuing and achieving what they''ve always dreamed of, even though this could become a risk for their economic and emotional stability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qrOY6exah8GRkDGI8GPTrTahmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269572'),
  ('180223639033933511', 'Aloft', 2014, 'Drama', 'Claudia Llosa, Nicolas Bolduc, Eloi Bartolomé', 'Claudia Llosa', 'Jennifer Connelly, Cillian Murphy, Mélanie Laurent, William Shimell, Zen McGrath, Peter McRobbie, Winta McGrath, Nancy Drake', 'R', 'As we follow a mother and her son, we delve into a past marred by an accident that tears them apart. She will become a renowned artist and healer, and he will grow into his own and a peculiar falconer who bears the marks of a double absence. In the present, a young journalist will bring about an encounter between the two that puts the very meaning of life and art into question, so that we may contemplate the possibility of living life to its fullest, despite the uncertainties littering our paths.', 'As we follow a mother and her son, we delve into a past marred by an accident that tears them apart. She will become a renowned artist and healer, and he will grow into his own and a peculiar falconer who bears the marks of a double absence. In the present, a young journalist will bring about an encounter between the two that puts the very meaning of life and art into question, so that we may contemplate the possibility of living life to its fullest, despite the uncertainties littering our paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxwJywCV6XLAFi0FcqVyduw0Fu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251321'),
  ('655041751699371887', 'Aloha', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Cameron Crowe, Éric Gautier, Scott Robertson', 'Cameron Crowe', 'Bradley Cooper, Emma Stone, Rachel McAdams, Bill Murray, John Krasinski, Danny McBride, Alec Baldwin, Bill Camp', 'PG-13', 'A celebrated military contractor returns to the site of his greatest career triumphs and re-connects with a long-ago love while unexpectedly falling for the hard-charging Air Force watchdog assigned to him.', 'A celebrated military contractor returns to the site of his greatest career triumphs and re-connects with a long-ago love while unexpectedly falling for the hard-charging Air Force watchdog assigned to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58Y4CjcRX8AtMNtI0AXu9H7iebP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222936'),
  ('279367869450106598', 'Aloha Bobby and Rose', 1975, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'William A. Fraker, Floyd Mutrux', 'Floyd Mutrux, Don Simpson', 'Paul Le Mat, Dianne Hull, Tim McIntire, Leigh French, Martine Bartlett, Noble Willingham, Robert Carradine, Eric Hines', 'PG', 'Bobby and Rose, two youngsters who are in love, have to run away from home when they are falsely accused to have committed a robbery and an assassination.', 'Bobby and Rose, two youngsters who are in love, have to run away from home when they are falsely accused to have committed a robbery and an assassination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCGtAz6feHLWck0NRVGuK3PfhcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47178'),
  ('426329558171851702', 'Aloha Scooby-Doo!', 2005, 'Mystery, Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tim Maltby', 'Temple Mathews', 'Casey Kasem, Frank Welker, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle, Ray Bumatai, Tia Carrere, Teri Garr, Mario López', 'NR', 'The Mystery Gang goes to Hawaii for the Big Kahuna of Hanahuna Surfing Contest. However, the gang and the locals find the island invaded by the vengeful Wiki Tiki spirit and his demons.', 'The Mystery Gang goes to Hawaii for the Big Kahuna of Hanahuna Surfing Contest. However, the gang and the locals find the island invaded by the vengeful Wiki Tiki spirit and his demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26BP556PvenFfypUp10aFFMpQSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24615'),
  ('697451065574815085', 'Alone', 1931, 'Drama', 'Andrey Moskvin, Sergei Gerasimov, Grigori Kozintsev', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Leonid Trauberg', 'Yelena Kuzmina, Pyotr Sobolevsky, Sergei Gerasimov, Mariya Babanova, Liu-Sian Van, Yanina Zheymo, Boris Chirkov, Eliana Dugina', null, 'A young teacher is sent to a remote province, separating her from her lover, and sets about the difficult task of building a school there.', 'A young teacher is sent to a remote province, separating her from her lover, and sets about the difficult task of building a school there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k3LZDe7cq7cyB888fUJIjcIWrm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262745'),
  ('496119444604216577', 'Alone', 1999, 'Drama', 'Benito Zambrano, Tote Trenas, Fabrizio Aguilar', 'Benito Zambrano', 'María Galiana, Ana Fernández, Carlos Álvarez-Nóvoa, Juan Fernández, Antonio Dechent, Miguel Alcíbar, Concha Galán, Paco Tous', 'R', 'Maria has just moved into a decaying flat in a poor neighbourhood. She left her family in the countryside because she could no longer stand her father''s authority. Pregnant by a man who refuses to see her, Maria gets by as a cleaning-woman. When her father is brought to the city for an operation, her mother moves into her flat.', 'Maria has just moved into a decaying flat in a poor neighbourhood. She left her family in the countryside because she could no longer stand her father''s authority. Pregnant by a man who refuses to see her, Maria gets by as a cleaning-woman. When her father is brought to the city for an operation, her mother moves into her flat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ovtyHHDjyCXtf46w2Yv3yPeUDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80713'),
  ('1006731404524691873', 'Alone', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Thomas Durchschlag, Michael Wiesweg', 'Thomas Durchschlag', 'Lavinia Wilson, Maximilian Brückner, Richy Müller, Victoria Mayer, Tobias van Dieken, Holger Kunkel, Peter Fieseler, Daniel Drewes', null, 'Maria is a student at the university of Essen, Germany, living and working in a gray, unpleasant, and anonymous environment. While she has little problem finding someone for a one night stand, she rebuffs her lovers in such a rude way that they actually don''t know what''s going on. But what seems to be a negative attitude at first glance is in fact much worse: Maria is suffering from borderline syndrome, a serious psychotic disease that makes her fail to develop a continuous, reliable personality, from her own perspective as well as from the perspective of those she meets. Then one day, she bumps into Jan, a student who falls in love with her without delay. He''s awaiting a hard time when he has to learn how hard it is to stay loyal and faithful to a person who, in her own words, "has a different world inside of her head" and who feels that "there is something inside of me that eats me up."', 'Maria is a student at the university of Essen, Germany, living and working in a gray, unpleasant, and anonymous environment. While she has little problem finding someone for a one night stand, she rebuffs her lovers in such a rude way that they actually don''t know what''s going on. But what seems to be a negative attitude at first glance is in fact much worse: Maria is suffering from borderline syndrome, a serious psychotic disease that makes her fail to develop a continuous, reliable personality, from her own perspective as well as from the perspective of those she meets. Then one day, she bumps into Jan, a student who falls in love with her without delay. He''s awaiting a hard time when he has to learn how hard it is to stay loyal and faithful to a person who, in her own words, "has a different world inside of her head" and who feels that "there is something inside of me that eats me up."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcRdeDMxJZs1FwhrzyCDgshnYV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8846'),
  ('637336137147736529', 'Alone', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Banjong Pisanthanakun, Parkpoom Wongpoom, Pinn Jintanapornphan', 'Banjong Pisanthanakun, Parkpoom Wongpoom, Aummaraporn Phandintong', 'Marsha Vadhanapanich, Witaya Wasukraipaisarn, Ratchanoo Boonchuduang, Hatairat Egereff, Rutairat Egereff, Namo Tongkumnerd, Chutikan Vimuktananda, Chayakan Vimuktananda', null, 'When Pim and Ploy, twins conjoined at the stomach, are separated, the operation leaves Pim the surviving sister, haunted by Ploy''s vengeful ghost.', 'When Pim and Ploy, twins conjoined at the stomach, are separated, the operation leaves Pim the surviving sister, haunted by Ploy''s vengeful ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNsCrJSTsSLnldhdpc9koXf2IcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37973'),
  ('999107020282945347', 'Alone', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Çağan Irmak, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Cemal Hünal, Melis Birkan, Yıldız Kültür, Aslı Aybars, Şerif Bozkurt, Gözde Kansu, Tarık Ündüz, Pınar Şenol', null, 'Alper is a renowned chef in his 30s at his own luxury restaurant. He lives an isolated life and spends his nights with one-night stands and paid intercourses. One day, his life changes utterly when his path crosses with Ada and gets enamored by her casual and modest outlook at life. As they start to get romantically involved, Alper must also overcome his chronic feeling of desolateness.', 'Alper is a renowned chef in his 30s at his own luxury restaurant. He lives an isolated life and spends his nights with one-night stands and paid intercourses. One day, his life changes utterly when his path crosses with Ada and gets enamored by her casual and modest outlook at life. As they start to get romantically involved, Alper must also overcome his chronic feeling of desolateness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etJRmmWDEdmHIfZ7n8OTDkcu4To.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27952'),
  ('193191021903034634', 'Alone', 2015, 'Horror', 'Bhushan Patel', 'Shiirshak S. Anand, Shantanu Ray Chhibber', 'Bipasha Basu, Karan Singh Grover, Neena Gupta, Sulabha Arya, Zakir Hussain, Sanjay Sharma, Shruti Gupta', 'PG-13', 'Conjoined at birth, Anjana and Sanjana were twin sisters who lived by one promise made to each other - ''We will always be together. We will never separate''. Mysterious circumstances lead to the death of one while the other survived. Years later, the ghost of the dead comes back to haunt the surviving sister. Why was the promise broken?', 'Conjoined at birth, Anjana and Sanjana were twin sisters who lived by one promise made to each other - ''We will always be together. We will never separate''. Mysterious circumstances lead to the death of one while the other survived. Years later, the ghost of the dead comes back to haunt the surviving sister. Why was the promise broken?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftaw15yhtjPT9EBrXtqXpiyzXHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318898'),
  ('333445756420281985', 'Alone', 2017, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror, Family', 'Nicolas Loir, David Moreau', 'David Moreau', 'Sofia Lesaffre, Stéphane Bak, Thomas Doret, Kim Lockhart, Jean-Stan du Pac, Paul Scarfoglio, Renan Madelpuech, Renan Prévot', null, 'Five kids wake up in a world where everybody has disappeared.', 'Five kids wake up in a world where everybody has disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VjlQBcM5573XopM07a07dsI6BM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420950'),
  ('957150706040331866', 'Alone', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Vladislav Khesin', 'Olabode Olakanmi, Samuel Bandeira, Gabriel Legua', 'Elizabeth Arends, Sara Anne, Albina Katsman, Bailey Coppola, Dane Majors, Kyle Dondlinger, Graham Jenkins, Caesar James', null, '"Alone" follows a writer seeking peace and solitude in the countryside in an attempt to recover from tragedy and finish her book. However, as the welcoming country house turns into a living hell, she soon realizes that her inner demons are not the worst of her problems.', '"Alone" follows a writer seeking peace and solitude in the countryside in an attempt to recover from tragedy and finish her book. However, as the welcoming country house turns into a living hell, she soon realizes that her inner demons are not the worst of her problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muQIpXQD5I1ibJgxysDgtuayVHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664425'),
  ('1057285421539403019', 'Alone', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'José María Cicala', 'Gustavo Lencina, José María Cicala, Griselda Sánchez', 'Araceli González, Miguel Ángel Solá, Fabián Mazzei, Mariano Martínez, Luis Machín, Mónica Antonópulos, Griselda Sánchez, Mica Suárez', null, 'Laura Garland lost her husband on the war while she’s pregnant. She lives in a big house which is divided in two. Government pursuits her claiming she must occupy the whole house, if she doesn’t, they will take it from her. Laura leases the house to Ricky, an outlaw that will bring new trouble in her life. At least she has another plan.', 'Laura Garland lost her husband on the war while she’s pregnant. She lives in a big house which is divided in two. Government pursuits her claiming she must occupy the whole house, if she doesn’t, they will take it from her. Laura leases the house to Ricky, an outlaw that will bring new trouble in her life. At least she has another plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99OyDJoYWAgEpJHqUL9pOFnnm9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675799'),
  ('224268566968383045', 'Alone', 2025, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Emilio Martinez-Borso', 'Emilio Martinez-Borso', 'Aleida Torrent, David Marcé, Aida Flix, Víctor Blázquez, Ferran Herrera, Eli Iranzo, David Ramírez', null, 'A woman’s abusive partner dies suddenly during a seemingly ordinary dinner at home. Paramedics tell her they cannot remove the body for 48 hours due to overcrowding in local morgues. So, the body of the man is confined to their guest room which is then sealed. Yet, despite this, due to the nature of their relationship, the situation takes a severe toll on her and she suffers from being so alone in this situation. Now, locked up with the corpse of her tormentor for two days, she will have to face her fears, frustrations and worst demons…', 'A woman’s abusive partner dies suddenly during a seemingly ordinary dinner at home. Paramedics tell her they cannot remove the body for 48 hours due to overcrowding in local morgues. So, the body of the man is confined to their guest room which is then sealed. Yet, despite this, due to the nature of their relationship, the situation takes a severe toll on her and she suffers from being so alone in this situation. Now, locked up with the corpse of her tormentor for two days, she will have to face her fears, frustrations and worst demons…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePxLI1YIY3aaJEOh4qhoVSOsufv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1413643'),
  ('877375789964067091', 'Alone Across the Pacific', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Kon Ichikawa, Yoshihiro Yamazaki', 'Natto Wada', 'Yūjirō Ishihara, Masayuki Mori, Kinuyo Tanaka, Ruriko Asaoka, Hajime Hana, Masaru Kamiyama, Gannosuke Ashiya, Shirō Ōsaka', null, 'Kenichi Horie is determined to challenge his family, the law and the nature crossing the Pacific to America in a small sailboat. Despite his careful planning, many unforeseen events will test his determination.', 'Kenichi Horie is determined to challenge his family, the law and the nature crossing the Pacific to America in a small sailboat. Despite his careful planning, many unforeseen events will test his determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaykCIfxCAIhizAbKwBx4dwHVPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58504'),
  ('670303807950789796', 'Alone at Night', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jimmy Giannopoulos, Peter Buntaine', 'Jimmy Giannopoulos, Diomedes Raul Bermudez', 'Ashley Benson, Jon Foster, Sky Ferreira, Jake Weary, Duke Nicholson, John Robinson, Winnie Harlow, G-Eazy', 'NR', 'Having just been through a tumultuous breakup, cam-girl Vicky retreats to a friend’s remote cabin in the woods to clear her head. But when the power goes out, she discovers something terrifying awaiting her in the dark — a masked killer who’s hellbent on bringing her night to a grisly end.', 'Having just been through a tumultuous breakup, cam-girl Vicky retreats to a friend’s remote cabin in the woods to clear her head. But when the power goes out, she discovers something terrifying awaiting her in the dark — a masked killer who’s hellbent on bringing her night to a grisly end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIxE3cA2woR4q5AoJrHNO82CqW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:815136'),
  ('239153019708623539', 'Alone at Sea', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Eric Bellion', null, 'Eric Bellion', null, 'A feature-length documentary tracing Eric Bellion''s psychological journey during his race on the Vendée Globe 2016-2017, a yacht race around the globe, single-handed and without assistance. Eric Bellion filmed himself during the 99 days of his race. He has never sailed solo for more than 6 days. This is an unprecedented immersive document of a man facing himself, loneliness and natural elements.', 'A feature-length documentary tracing Eric Bellion''s psychological journey during his race on the Vendée Globe 2016-2017, a yacht race around the globe, single-handed and without assistance. Eric Bellion filmed himself during the 99 days of his race. He has never sailed solo for more than 6 days. This is an unprecedented immersive document of a man facing himself, loneliness and natural elements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHebXjjeIeKyrU2pFeFFoPQ4SNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559487'),
  ('641421338390033790', 'Alone in Berlin', 2016, 'War, Thriller, Drama', 'Vincent Perez, Howard Margolius, Andreas Olshausen', 'Vincent Perez', 'Emma Thompson, Brendan Gleeson, Daniel Brühl, Mikael Persbrandt, Katharina Schüttler, Louis Hofmann, Rafael Gareisen, Hildegard Schroedter', 'R', 'Berlin in June of 1940. While Nazi propaganda celebrates the regime’s victory over France, a kitchen-cum-living room in Prenzlauer Berg is filled with grief. Anna and Otto Quangel’s son has been killed at the front. This working class couple had long believed in the ‘Führer’ and followed him willingly, but now they realise that his promises are nothing but lies and deceit. They begin writing postcards as a form of resistance and in a bid to raise awareness: Stop the war machine! Kill Hitler! Putting their lives at risk, they distribute these cards in the entrances of tenement buildings and in stairwells. But the SS and the Gestapo are soon onto them, and even their neighbours pose a threat.', 'Berlin in June of 1940. While Nazi propaganda celebrates the regime’s victory over France, a kitchen-cum-living room in Prenzlauer Berg is filled with grief. Anna and Otto Quangel’s son has been killed at the front. This working class couple had long believed in the ‘Führer’ and followed him willingly, but now they realise that his promises are nothing but lies and deceit. They begin writing postcards as a form of resistance and in a bid to raise awareness: Stop the war machine! Kill Hitler! Putting their lives at risk, they distribute these cards in the entrances of tenement buildings and in stairwells. But the SS and the Gestapo are soon onto them, and even their neighbours pose a threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BuRgEY3dMw8usxelybUS1K3NMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334522'),
  ('666849426985724395', 'Alone in the Dark', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dee Dee Wehle, Jack Sholder, Matthew Malach', 'Jack Sholder', 'Jack Palance, Donald Pleasence, Martin Landau, Dwight Schultz, Erland van Lidth, Deborah Hedwall, Lee Taylor-Allan, Phillip Clark', 'R', 'A quartet of murderous psychopaths break out of a mental hospital during a power blackout and lay siege to their doctor''s house.', 'A quartet of murderous psychopaths break out of a mental hospital during a power blackout and lay siege to their doctor''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ybBuHOTUMtW000G15WHh31aMNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40952'),
  ('30219154049225070', 'Alone in the Dark', 2005, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Mathias Neumann, Uwe Boll, Robert Lee', 'Elan Mastai, Peter Scheerer, Michael Roesch', 'Christian Slater, Tara Reid, Stephen Dorff, Will Sanderson, Ona Grauer, Pak Ho-Sung, Sarah Deakins, Françoise Yip', 'R', 'Edward Carnby is a private investigator specializing in unexplainable supernatural phenomena. His cases delve into the dark corners of the world, searching for truth in the occult remnants of ancient civilizations. Now, the greatest mystery of his past is about to become the most dangerous case he has ever faced.', 'Edward Carnby is a private investigator specializing in unexplainable supernatural phenomena. His cases delve into the dark corners of the world, searching for truth in the occult remnants of ancient civilizations. Now, the greatest mystery of his past is about to become the most dangerous case he has ever faced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSxrbVCyWW077zhtpuYlo3zgyug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12142'),
  ('596348827188330526', 'Alone in the Dark 2', 2008, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Michael Roesch, Peter Scheerer, Zoran Popović', 'Michael Roesch, Peter Scheerer', 'Rick Yune, Lance Henriksen, Bill Moseley, Ralf Moeller, Danny Trejo, Zack Ward, Natassia Malthe, Jason Connery', 'PG-13', 'When the night falls, and the creatures of the dark are crawling out of the shadows, there is only one man who stands between us and evil: Edward Carnby.', 'When the night falls, and the creatures of the dark are crawling out of the shadows, there is only one man who stands between us and evil: Edward Carnby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGKQoqyYnleFrz3DIBANG00QccO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12683'),
  ('506758507792607800', 'Alone in the Night', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Takashi Ishii, Norimichi Kasamatsu, Kazuhiko Ishida', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Yui Natsukawa, Jinpachi Nezu, Toshiyuki Nagashima, Kippei Shiina, Minori Terada, Kimiko Yo, Naoto Takenaka, Noriko Hayami', null, 'An undercover narcotics officer is killed, and after his funeral some yakuza break into his apartment and rape his wife, Nami, while looking for the drugs they claim he stole from them. Afterwards Nami attempts to commit suicide, but after being rescued by a mysterious yakuza she decides to infiltrate the gang and get revenge.', 'An undercover narcotics officer is killed, and after his funeral some yakuza break into his apartment and rape his wife, Nami, while looking for the drugs they claim he stole from them. Afterwards Nami attempts to commit suicide, but after being rescued by a mysterious yakuza she decides to infiltrate the gang and get revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGd4Dgjo9j9QfRuy51m6CWNuRuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143687'),
  ('993986707121495138', 'Alone In The Night', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Guillermo Rojas', 'Guillermo Rojas', 'Pablo Gómez-Pando, Andrea Carballo, Alfonso Sánchez, Félix Gómez, Paula Usero, Beatriz Arjona, Jacinto Bobo, Vicente Vergara', null, 'A group of labour lawyers hide in a house when the coup d''état of 23F takes place in Spain. Unsure of what to do, they debate between fleeing the country, staying in hiding or trying to do something to defend Spain''s young democracy.', 'A group of labour lawyers hide in a house when the coup d''état of 23F takes place in Spain. Unsure of what to do, they debate between fleeing the country, staying in hiding or trying to do something to defend Spain''s young democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIR4praOsKJaRA3qUC2mbzDojan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244881'),
  ('427038935028278979', 'Alone in the Small Hours', 1978, 'Drama', 'José Luis Garci, Sinesio Isla, Ramiro Gómez', 'José Luis Garci, José María González Sinde', 'José Sacristán, Fiorella Faltoyano, Emma Cohen, María Casanova, Claudio Rodríguez, Germán Cobos, José María González Sinde, Eva Garci', null, 'Jose, a journalist and radio broadcaster, runs a daily program which has garnered a huge national audience as a satirical chronicle of Spanish society in the democratic transition of the late 1970s. Married and separated from Elena, Jose has two children, whom he only sees from time to time. Then he meets Maite, younger than him, outgoing and more open-minded than he wants. The emotional shock caused by his relationship with these two women will change his pessimistic view of life.', 'Jose, a journalist and radio broadcaster, runs a daily program which has garnered a huge national audience as a satirical chronicle of Spanish society in the democratic transition of the late 1970s. Married and separated from Elena, Jose has two children, whom he only sees from time to time. Then he meets Maite, younger than him, outgoing and more open-minded than he wants. The emotional shock caused by his relationship with these two women will change his pessimistic view of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pu4sBHNyQlzvmdoSushrG3vj8ab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221847'),
  ('1146550991494382764', 'Alone in the Wilderness', 2004, 'Documentary, History', 'Dick Proenneke, Bob Swerer Sr., Bob Swerer Jr.', 'Dick Proenneke, Sam Keith', 'Dick Proenneke, Bob Swerer Jr., Wendy Ishii, Pamela Guest, Bob Swerer Sr.', 'G', 'Dick Proenneke retired at age 50 in 1967 and decided to build his own cabin in the wilderness at the base of the Aleutian Peninsula, in what is now Lake Clark National Park. Using color footage he shot himself, Proenneke traces how he came to this remote area, selected a homestead site and built his log cabin completely by himself. The documentary covers his first year in-country, showing his day-to-day activities and the passing of the seasons as he sought to scratch out a living alone in the wilderness.', 'Dick Proenneke retired at age 50 in 1967 and decided to build his own cabin in the wilderness at the base of the Aleutian Peninsula, in what is now Lake Clark National Park. Using color footage he shot himself, Proenneke traces how he came to this remote area, selected a homestead site and built his log cabin completely by himself. The documentary covers his first year in-country, showing his day-to-day activities and the passing of the seasons as he sought to scratch out a living alone in the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOzc4vwTG9d9tlhX6EyPHu3cuiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14463'),
  ('549353266198917389', 'Alone Man', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Cláudia Jouvin, Adrian Teijido', 'Cláudia Jouvin', 'Vladimir Brichta, Mariana Ximenes, Otávio Müller, Ingrid Guimarães, Eliane Giardini, Daniel Aráoz, Milhem Cortaz, Aramis Trindade', null, 'The film tells the story of Arnaldo, that to get rid of his miserable life, seeks of a clinic that promises to copy people. With a copy occupying his place, he would take a new life. But, when having his request denied, Arnaldo has no choice but to try and change the course of his history. When he falls in love with Josie, the clerk of a pet cemetery, Arnaldo believes that he found a chance to finally be happy. But maybe he''s wrong. A Lone Man is an urban fable that addresses the complexity of relationships, with a good dose of irony, and humor.', 'The film tells the story of Arnaldo, that to get rid of his miserable life, seeks of a clinic that promises to copy people. With a copy occupying his place, he would take a new life. But, when having his request denied, Arnaldo has no choice but to try and change the course of his history. When he falls in love with Josie, the clerk of a pet cemetery, Arnaldo believes that he found a chance to finally be happy. But maybe he''s wrong. A Lone Man is an urban fable that addresses the complexity of relationships, with a good dose of irony, and humor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edeJIK4JhTzS4jvsgoPBzyWTTyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286258'),
  ('930839202882489594', 'Alone Together', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Katie Holmes, Amy Hutchings, Martim Vian', 'Katie Holmes', 'Katie Holmes, Jim Sturgess, Derek Luke, Becky Ann Baker, Zosia Mamet, Melissa Leo, Neal Benari, Ed Dixon', 'R', 'Strangers June and Charlie wind up double-booked in the same upstate New York Airbnb during the start of COVID-19. Exasperating the situation, the lockdown forces them both to stay and confront the unexpected feelings that develop between them.', 'Strangers June and Charlie wind up double-booked in the same upstate New York Airbnb during the start of COVID-19. Exasperating the situation, the lockdown forces them both to stay and confront the unexpected feelings that develop between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPESxHsPl5uYiJaCRwnnZbOtJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826113'),
  ('716674549654505007', 'Alone With Her', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Eric Nicholas', 'Eric Nicholas', 'Colin Hanks, Ana Claudia Talancón, Jordana Spiro, Jonathon Trent, Alex Boling, Tony Armatrading', null, 'The harrowing story of a disturbed young man''s attempts to win the affections of an unsuspecting young woman. When Doug first sees Amy, he instantly falls for her and begins to watch her every move, going so far as to set up spy cameras in her apartment. However, as his fascination grows into obsession he''s no longer satisfied with just watching.', 'The harrowing story of a disturbed young man''s attempts to win the affections of an unsuspecting young woman. When Doug first sees Amy, he instantly falls for her and begins to watch her every move, going so far as to set up spy cameras in her apartment. However, as his fascination grows into obsession he''s no longer satisfied with just watching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/636EGinwlVDyXuDo4l27hETmze2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18206'),
  ('31757671603925121', 'Alone With Her Dreams', 2019, 'Drama', 'Paolo Licata', 'Ugo Chiti', 'Tania Bambaci, Lucia Sardo, Ileana Riganò, Katia Greco, Nicoletta Cifariello, Gerlando Gramaglia, Claudio Collovà, Valentina Ferrante', null, 'Set in the late 1960s, the film explores the issues of immigration, community values and family devotion through the eyes of a young girl, Lucia, who is left behind with her grandmother while her parents emigrate to France to find work. Lucia pains to be with her family as she struggles to learn her role in the tiny, traditional village under the watchful guidance of her stern grandmother.', 'Set in the late 1960s, the film explores the issues of immigration, community values and family devotion through the eyes of a young girl, Lucia, who is left behind with her grandmother while her parents emigrate to France to find work. Lucia pains to be with her family as she struggles to learn her role in the tiny, traditional village under the watchful guidance of her stern grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7ionEyqvEcpI8nwrUHr7P9V1Zd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672686'),
  ('560899821178518521', 'Alone, at Last!', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio del Real, Alfredo Mayo, Patricia de Muns', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Lucía Lipschutz, Carlos Asorey', 'Alfredo Landa, María José Alfonso, Amparo Larrañaga, Juanjo Artero, Ayanta Barilli, Tomás Martín, Luis Merlo, Juan Luis Galiardo', null, 'Arturo is married to Elena and they have four grown children, they are wonderfull but they are still living at home. Arthur is writer and that''s a job that requires peace, silence and concentration, something imposible at Arturo''s home. His editor convince him to make his children go out from home so Arturo start a kind of "guerrilla war" to make his sons become independent.', 'Arturo is married to Elena and they have four grown children, they are wonderfull but they are still living at home. Arthur is writer and that''s a job that requires peace, silence and concentration, something imposible at Arturo''s home. His editor convince him to make his children go out from home so Arturo start a kind of "guerrilla war" to make his sons become independent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtaTil1EEuSGH3k64MHxaRFf933.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96190'),
  ('446481701814770486', 'Alone. Life Wastes Andy Hardy', 1998, 'Drama, Music', 'Martin Arnold', null, 'Mickey Rooney, Judy Garland, Lewis Stone, Fay Holden', null, 'In a deconstruction of classic Hollywood codes, using repetitive single frame images, the re-editing of teenager movies produces an intense Oedipal drama.', 'In a deconstruction of classic Hollywood codes, using repetitive single frame images, the re-editing of teenager movies produces an intense Oedipal drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptB8DqJOGuvghb6IUafe2j3uL66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93468'),
  ('337549819636404492', 'Aloners', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hong Sung-eun, Choi Young-ki, Cho Hyun-chul', 'Hong Sung-eun', 'Gong Seung-yeon, Jeong Da-eun, Seo Hyun-woo, Geum Hannah, Kim Mo-beom, Park Jeong-hak, Ju Seok-tae, Ahn Jeong-bin', null, 'Jina is the top employee at a credit card company call center. She avoids building close relationships, choosing instead to live and work alone – until she is suddenly tasked with training a new recruit.', 'Jina is the top employee at a credit card company call center. She avoids building close relationships, choosing instead to live and work alone – until she is suddenly tasked with training a new recruit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JJOsHjuILBuD9XyD9InbtERqxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805058'),
  ('995249338502588584', 'Along Came a Spider', 2001, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Lee Tamahori, Matthew F. Leonetti, Jim Brebner', 'Marc Moss', 'Morgan Freeman, Monica Potter, Michael Wincott, Dylan Baker, Mika Boorem, Anton Yelchin, Kim Hawthorne, Jay O. Sanders', 'R', 'After the harrowing death of his partner, forensic psychologist and best-selling author Alex Cross cannot forgive himself and has retreated to the peace of retirement. But when a brilliant criminal kidnaps a senator''s young daughter, he is lured back into action as the kidnapper wants to deal with Alex personally. Teamed with Jezzie Flanigan, the Secret Service agent assigned to protect the missing girl, Alex follows a serpentine trail of clues that leads him to a stunning discovery - the kidnapper wants more than just ransom.', 'After the harrowing death of his partner, forensic psychologist and best-selling author Alex Cross cannot forgive himself and has retreated to the peace of retirement. But when a brilliant criminal kidnaps a senator''s young daughter, he is lured back into action as the kidnapper wants to deal with Alex personally. Teamed with Jezzie Flanigan, the Secret Service agent assigned to protect the missing girl, Alex follows a serpentine trail of clues that leads him to a stunning discovery - the kidnapper wants more than just ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vipRsbIpwUNf1gjfOcVNizQ1o3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2043'),
  ('432565667638343574', 'Along Came Auntie', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol, Richard Wallace, Jean Yarbrough', 'Stan Laurel, Carl Harbaugh, Frank Wilson', 'Glenn Tryon, Vivien Oakland, Oliver Hardy, Tyler Brooke, Martha Sleeper, Lucy Beaumont', null, 'A divorced couple try to pretend they are still happily married in order to get $100,000 from the woman''s divorce-disapproving aunt.', 'A divorced couple try to pretend they are still happily married in order to get $100,000 from the woman''s divorce-disapproving aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96wbuTl2df7fh9A5EI1RiF1Twvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16599'),
  ('176380261918254763', 'Along Came Daffy', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Snowbound in a remote cabin, two starving men begin visualizing each other as food. When salesman Daffy Duck calls at their door, it doesn''t take long before the men set their minds on having Daffy as their dinner.', 'Snowbound in a remote cabin, two starving men begin visualizing each other as food. When salesman Daffy Duck calls at their door, it doesn''t take long before the men set their minds on having Daffy as their dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67PqbzEHxGuZ9EyUy0mQeNU1fSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237083'),
  ('765163650730945366', 'Along Came Jones', 1945, 'Western, Comedy', 'Stuart Heisler, Milton Krasner, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Gary Cooper, Loretta Young, William Demarest, Dan Duryea, Frank Sully, Don Costello, Walter Sande, Russell Simpson', null, 'An easy-going cowboy is mistaken by the townsfolk for a notorious gunman. The cowboy decides it would be best to leave town, until he meets the gunman''s girlfriend.', 'An easy-going cowboy is mistaken by the townsfolk for a notorious gunman. The cowboy decides it would be best to leave town, until he meets the gunman''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rVRbRvhHsKRN2FVPj2czV8rs4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72163'),
  ('671458715884479196', 'Along Came Love', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Katell Quillévéré, Tom Harari, Nicolas Guilleminot', 'Katell Quillévéré, Gilles Taurand', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Vincent Lacoste, Morgan Bailey, Hélios Karyo, Josse Capet, Paul Beaurepaire, Margot Ringard Oldra, Ambre Gollut', null, '1947. On a beach, Madeleine, a waitress in a hotel restaurant, mother of a little boy, meets François, a rich and cultivated student. The force of attraction that pushes them towards each other is commensurate with the secrecy that each carries. If we know what Madeleine wants to leave behind by following this young man, we discover over time, what François is desperately trying to flee by mixing Madeleine''s fate with his.', '1947. On a beach, Madeleine, a waitress in a hotel restaurant, mother of a little boy, meets François, a rich and cultivated student. The force of attraction that pushes them towards each other is commensurate with the secrecy that each carries. If we know what Madeleine wants to leave behind by following this young man, we discover over time, what François is desperately trying to flee by mixing Madeleine''s fate with his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NomjkG8UyFoZzKgTaeSOUnCWQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820696'),
  ('894398647157432859', 'Along Came Polly', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Seamus McGarvey, John Hamburg, Lisa Bloch-Tobey', 'John Hamburg', 'Ben Stiller, Jennifer Aniston, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Debra Messing, Alec Baldwin, Hank Azaria, Bryan Brown, Jsu Garcia', 'PG-13', 'Reuben Feffer is a guy who''s spent his entire life playing it safe. Polly Prince is irresistible as a free-spirit who lives for the thrill of the moment. When these two comically mismatched souls collide, Reuben''s world is turned upside down, as he makes an uproarious attempt to change his life from middle-of-the-road to totally-out-there.', 'Reuben Feffer is a guy who''s spent his entire life playing it safe. Polly Prince is irresistible as a free-spirit who lives for the thrill of the moment. When these two comically mismatched souls collide, Reuben''s world is turned upside down, as he makes an uproarious attempt to change his life from middle-of-the-road to totally-out-there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Tp16THdpHkMrqgoiDresDz9CWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5966'),
  ('373480438382759043', 'Along Came the Devil', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Jason DeVan', 'Dylan Matlock, Heather DeVan, Jason DeVan', 'Sydney Sweeney, Jessica Barth, Matt Dallas, Bruce Davison, Madison Lintz, Heather DeVan, Austin Filson, Ahmed Lucan', 'NR', 'After a troubled childhood, Ashley searches for a connection, and unknowingly invites in a demonic force, which leaves her loved ones fighting for her soul.', 'After a troubled childhood, Ashley searches for a connection, and unknowingly invites in a demonic force, which leaves her loved ones fighting for her soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEiu83QxMMWWD8gWUtXR4piF1Iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409056'),
  ('1020758257518700380', 'Along Came the Devil II', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jason DeVan', 'Jason DeVan', 'Bruce Davison, Laura Slade Wiggins, Mark Ashworth, Cassius DeVan, Tiffany Fallon, Heather DeVan, Viviana Chavez, Kylie Delre', null, 'After receiving an unsettling voicemail, Jordan (Wiggins) returns home, looking for answers, only to find her estranged father and even more questions. A demonic force has attached itself to the town and no one is safe. The only one who seems to know anything is the small town''s Reverend.', 'After receiving an unsettling voicemail, Jordan (Wiggins) returns home, looking for answers, only to find her estranged father and even more questions. A demonic force has attached itself to the town and no one is safe. The only one who seems to know anything is the small town''s Reverend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iumlx5A6XiYU79sc5B2IGKOArcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610743'),
  ('167947449479220888', 'Along for the Ride', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sofia Alvarez, Luca Del Puppo', 'Sofia Alvarez', 'Emma Pasarow, Belmont Cameli, Kate Bosworth, Andie MacDowell, Laura Kariuki, Dermot Mulroney, Genevieve Hannelius, Samia Finnerty', null, 'The summer before college, Auden meets the mysterious Eli, a fellow insomniac. While the seaside town of Colby sleeps, the two embark on nightly quests to help Auden experience the fun, carefree teen life she never knew she wanted.', 'The summer before college, Auden meets the mysterious Eli, a fellow insomniac. While the seaside town of Colby sleeps, the two embark on nightly quests to help Auden experience the fun, carefree teen life she never knew she wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5spmLeGR9kxBRQ6qxCFad1ljvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778106'),
  ('1031537215042481759', 'Along the Coast', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Quinto Albicocco, Raymond Castel', 'Agnès Varda', 'Roger Coggio, Anne Ollivier, Jacopo Nizi, Brigitte Bardot, Sophia Loren', null, 'Tongue-in-cheek look at the French Riviera, especially in summer when it overflows with tourists. Reviews its history and famous visitors; displays its faux-exotic buildings, its crowded beaches, its trees and monuments; and, pokes fun at the colors women wear and the vagaries of fashion. The film celebrates the use of "Eden" as a place name, suggesting that paradise comes to the coast after all are gone, perhaps only on a remote island beach.', 'Tongue-in-cheek look at the French Riviera, especially in summer when it overflows with tourists. Reviews its history and famous visitors; displays its faux-exotic buildings, its crowded beaches, its trees and monuments; and, pokes fun at the colors women wear and the vagaries of fashion. The film celebrates the use of "Eden" as a place name, suggesting that paradise comes to the coast after all are gone, perhaps only on a remote island beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bETPcUHBEPsSuNxquiisAs2uUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238952'),
  ('81960647577832372', 'Along the Great Divide', 1951, 'Western', 'Raoul Walsh, Oren Haglund, Sidney Hickox', 'Walter Doniger, Lewis Meltzer', 'Kirk Douglas, Virginia Mayo, John Agar, Walter Brennan, Ray Teal, Hugh Sanders, Morris Ankrum, James Anderson', 'NR', 'US marshal Len Merrick saves Tim Keith from lynching at the hands of the Roden clan, and hopes to get him to Santa Loma for trial. Vindictive Ned Roden, whose son Ed was killed, still wants personal revenge, and Tim would like to escape before Ned catches up with him again. Can the marshal make it across the desert with Tim and his daughter? Even if he makes it, will justice be served?', 'US marshal Len Merrick saves Tim Keith from lynching at the hands of the Roden clan, and hopes to get him to Santa Loma for trial. Vindictive Ned Roden, whose son Ed was killed, still wants personal revenge, and Tim would like to escape before Ned catches up with him again. Can the marshal make it across the desert with Tim and his daughter? Even if he makes it, will justice be served?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kj7QlTu82y8zj9IXBq1c943iAFm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43562'),
  ('728656796454243893', 'Along the Ridge', 2006, 'Drama', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Stefano Falivene', 'Linda Ferri', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Barbora Bobuľová, Alessandro Morace, Marta Nobili, Pietro De Silva, Loretta Rossi Stuart, Roberta Paladini, Sebastiano Tiraboschi', null, 'A young father and his two children struggle to find harmony after his wife leaves them for another man.', 'A young father and his two children struggle to find harmony after his wife leaves them for another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18byYqbhtF6azO3BnprPuP97Vv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30535'),
  ('1096760559472331764', 'Along the Way', 2012, 'Animation, Music', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, null, 'Through paintings that interact on the principle of Russian dolls, we are drawn along the swirling path of the thoughts of a pilgrim, a solitary walker.', 'Through paintings that interact on the principle of Russian dolls, we are drawn along the swirling path of the thoughts of a pilgrim, a solitary walker.', null, 'tmdb:movie:256648'),
  ('696538699965869821', 'Along Unknown Paths', 1982, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Mikhail Yuzovskiy, Oleg Kobzev, Valeriy Volskiy', 'Alla Akhundova', 'Roman Monastyrsky, Tatyana Pelttser, Leonid Kharitonov, Tatyana Aksyuta, Aleksandr Filippenko, Yuriy Chernov, Yuri Medvedev, Leonid Kanevsky', null, 'Going to vacation at his grandmother’s in a village, the boy Mitya could never imagine that he would become a participant of the extraordinary adventures in a fairy-tale land.', 'Going to vacation at his grandmother’s in a village, the boy Mitya could never imagine that he would become a participant of the extraordinary adventures in a fairy-tale land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOI09GxD0MAK7tSTc6V9v4cgKOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147007'),
  ('357649812500328021', 'Along with the Gods: The Two Worlds', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Kim Yong-hwa, Kim Byung-seo, Shin Kyung-man', 'Kim Yong-hwa', 'Ha Jung-woo, Cha Tae-hyun, Ju Ji-hoon, Kim Hyang-gi, Lee Jung-jae, Kim Dong-wook, Ye Su-jeong, Oh Dal-su', 'NR', 'Having died unexpectedly, firefighter Ja-hong is taken to the afterlife by 3 afterlife guardians. Only when he passes 7 trials over 49 days and proves he was innocent in human life, he’s able to reincarnate, and his 3 afterlife guardians are by his side to defend him in trial.', 'Having died unexpectedly, firefighter Ja-hong is taken to the afterlife by 3 afterlife guardians. Only when he passes 7 trials over 49 days and proves he was innocent in human life, he’s able to reincarnate, and his 3 afterlife guardians are by his side to defend him in trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJSvIsI6oQfFim0PGyuuiCYfqKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397567'),
  ('57708345461822033', 'Alouette', 1944, 'Animation, Music', 'René Jodoin, Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'This animated short co-animated by René Jodoin and Norman McLaren was produced for inclusion in the Let''s All Sing Together sing-along series. It illustrates the popular song Alouette, gentille alouette. The technique used is single-frame animation of paper cutouts.', 'This animated short co-animated by René Jodoin and Norman McLaren was produced for inclusion in the Let''s All Sing Together sing-along series. It illustrates the popular song Alouette, gentille alouette. The technique used is single-frame animation of paper cutouts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fo3Eet4ckAOZWn4wkhmwr8qXAoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257552'),
  ('233824923950298708', 'Aloys', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Tobias Nölle', 'Tobias Nölle', 'Georg Friedrich, Tilde von Overbeck, Kamil Krejčí, Yufei Lee, Koi Lee, Sebastian Krähenbühl, Peter Zumstein, Tobias Bienz', null, 'A lonely private investigator is contacted by a mysterious woman who pulls him into a mind game known as “telephone walking”. Fascinated by her voice, Aloys discovers an imaginary universe that allows him to break out of his isolation.', 'A lonely private investigator is contacted by a mysterious woman who pulls him into a mind game known as “telephone walking”. Fascinated by her voice, Aloys discovers an imaginary universe that allows him to break out of his isolation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jammoLDdyjGJoI1j7MhrbbI5G86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378813'),
  ('918260571608869229', 'Alpha', 2018, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Albert Hughes, Martin Gschlacht, James Steuart', 'Dan Wiedenhaupt', 'Kodi Smit-McPhee, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson, Marcin Kowalczyk, Jens Hultén, Natassia Malthe, Spencer Bogaert, Mercedes de la Zerda, Leonor Varela', 'PG-13', 'In the prehistoric past, Keda, a young and inexperienced hunter, struggles to return home after being separated from his tribe when bison hunting goes awry. On his way back he will find an unexpected ally.', 'In the prehistoric past, Keda, a young and inexperienced hunter, struggles to return home after being separated from his tribe when bison hunting goes awry. On his way back he will find an unexpected ally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afdZAIcAQscziqVtsEoh2PwsYTW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399360'),
  ('676809522571048823', 'Alpha', 2025, 'Horror, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Julia Ducournau, Ruben Impens, Alexis Brami', 'Julia Ducournau', 'Mélissa Boros, Tahar Rahim, Golshifteh Farahani, Emma Mackey, Finnegan Oldfield, Louai El Amrousy, Ambrine Trigo Ouaked, Zohra Benbetka', 'R', 'Alpha, a troubled 13-year-old lives with her single mom. Their world collapses the day she returns from school with a tattoo on her arm.', 'Alpha, a troubled 13-year-old lives with her single mom. Their world collapses the day she returns from school with a tattoo on her arm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PvdD2gTqSZfFWclP9ee4bqCn0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284460'),
  ('849871540139368628', 'Alpha and Omega', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Anthony Bell, Ben Gluck, Mehul Hirani', 'Chris Denk, Steve Moore', 'Justin Long, Hayden Panettiere, Dennis Hopper, Danny Glover, Larry Miller, Eric Price, Vicki Lewis, Chris Carmack', 'PG', 'Two young wolves at opposite ends of their pack''s social order are thrown together into a foreign land and need each other to return home, but love complicates everything.', 'Two young wolves at opposite ends of their pack''s social order are thrown together into a foreign land and need each other to return home, but love complicates everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YVyH5sS6kLQRsSDF5dhhR0BWeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12819'),
  ('885698381865379796', 'Alpha and Omega 2: A Howl-iday Adventure', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Rich, Steve Moore', null, 'Ben Diskin, Marieve Herington, Liza West, Tracy Pfau, Meryl Leigh, Shaun Gerardo, Blackie Rose, G.K. Bowes', 'G', 'Kate &amp; Humphrey and their three wolf cubs (Smokey, Claudette and Runt) are happily preparing to celebrate their first winter holidays together when their smallest cub, Runt, mysteriously disappears. They must now go on a new journey across the wilderness to find Runt before the winter festivities begin at home.', 'Kate &amp; Humphrey and their three wolf cubs (Smokey, Claudette and Runt) are happily preparing to celebrate their first winter holidays together when their smallest cub, Runt, mysteriously disappears. They must now go on a new journey across the wilderness to find Runt before the winter festivities begin at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryyVBJoZCoisC5DAmhFDqF3sqiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227425'),
  ('505354892608957539', 'Alpha and Omega 3: The Great Wolf Games', 2014, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Rich', null, 'Mella Leigh, Mike Jacobs, Ben Diskin, Kate Higgins, Marieve Herington, Debi Derryberry', 'G', 'Join the pack in this wild, warmhearted and totally pawsome adventure starring everyone''s favorite alphas and omegas! It''s time for "The Great Wolf Games," when all the alphas in the packs set aside their differences for some friendly competition. When an unexpected accident puts many of our pack''s star alpha wolves out of commission, a new team is assembled that includes forest friends not in the pack. Can Coach Humphrey lead his ragtag group of "underdogs" to victory? Find out in this thrilling movie that will leave you howling for more!', 'Join the pack in this wild, warmhearted and totally pawsome adventure starring everyone''s favorite alphas and omegas! It''s time for "The Great Wolf Games," when all the alphas in the packs set aside their differences for some friendly competition. When an unexpected accident puts many of our pack''s star alpha wolves out of commission, a new team is assembled that includes forest friends not in the pack. Can Coach Humphrey lead his ragtag group of "underdogs" to victory? Find out in this thrilling movie that will leave you howling for more!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHNjwY0C2OAWqGDAq6roJk3Hn5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258096'),
  ('199950924282829773', 'Alpha Dog', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Nick Cassavetes, Robert Fraisse', 'Nick Cassavetes', 'Emile Hirsch, Bruce Willis, Amanda Seyfried, Justin Timberlake, Shawn Hatosy, Ben Foster, Harry Dean Stanton, Matthew Barry', 'R', 'Johnny Truelove likes to see himself as tough. He''s the son of an underworld figure and a drug dealer. Johnny also likes to get tough when things don''t go his way. When Jake Mazursky fails to pay up for Johnny, things get worse for the Mazursky family, as Johnny and his ''gang'' kidnap Jake''s 15 year old brother and hold him hostage.', 'Johnny Truelove likes to see himself as tough. He''s the son of an underworld figure and a drug dealer. Johnny also likes to get tough when things don''t go his way. When Jake Mazursky fails to pay up for Johnny, things get worse for the Mazursky family, as Johnny and his ''gang'' kidnap Jake''s 15 year old brother and hold him hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9pirEsDxe102mSQGoDZWBbdcCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7457'),
  ('1074480185882224717', 'Alpha House', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jacob Cooney, Laura Beth Love', 'Jacob Cooney, Brandon Trenz', 'Julien Ari, Heather Paige Cohn, Jean Louise O''Sullivan, Chris O''Brien, D. C. Douglas, Sam Aotaki, Anna Beletzki, Eli Bildner', 'NR', 'When two freshmen pledges are accepted into the biggest party frat on campus, they think they have it all. That is, until the assistant dean forces the Alphas to share their house with a sorority or face expulsion from school. Not wanting to see their lifelong dream of becoming Alphas destroyed, the pledges convince the other members of the house to take back what''s theirs, waging an epic battle of the sexes to fight for their right to party.', 'When two freshmen pledges are accepted into the biggest party frat on campus, they think they have it all. That is, until the assistant dean forces the Alphas to share their house with a sorority or face expulsion from school. Not wanting to see their lifelong dream of becoming Alphas destroyed, the pledges convince the other members of the house to take back what''s theirs, waging an epic battle of the sexes to fight for their right to party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s00AwtusVVG8lpA3fquKaE63NWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269242'),
  ('676260892686251118', 'Alpha: Men Love Vengeance', 2026, 'Action', 'Vijay Naagendra', 'Masthi', 'Hemanth Kumar, Balu Nagendra, Gopika Suresh', null, 'Arjun, a fiery, determined young man, his father, Shakthi, An honest Police Inspector and Arjun''s role model, Shakthi dreams of seeing his son become an IPS officer. The film cuts to a different world.', 'Arjun, a fiery, determined young man, his father, Shakthi, An honest Police Inspector and Arjun''s role model, Shakthi dreams of seeing his son become an IPS officer. The film cuts to a different world.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:alpha-men-love-vengeance'),
  ('1083381592604789432', 'Alphabet', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Erwin Wagenhofer', 'Sabine Kriechbaum, Erwin Wagenhofer', 'Gerald Huether, Ken Robinson, Arno Stern, André Stern, Yang Dongping, Andreas Schleicher, Yakamoz Karakurt, Thomas Sattelberger', null, 'A documentary that analyzes the modern educational system and argues that it squelches children''s capacity for imagination, creativity, and independent thought.', 'A documentary that analyzes the modern educational system and argues that it squelches children''s capacity for imagination, creativity, and independent thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1VgPuS1l07Lp7BAu6wBvC2mCfE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236314'),
  ('479062536539084595', 'Alphabet City', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Amos Poe, Oliver Wood, Aaron Barsky', 'Amos Poe', 'Vincent Spano, Michael Winslow, Kate Vernon, Jami Gertz, Zohra Lampert, Raymond Serra, Daniel Jordano, Tom Mardirosian', 'R', 'A New York City drug dealer decides to get out of the business, but has to flee from mobsters.', 'A New York City drug dealer decides to get out of the business, but has to flee from mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6usQSU0ftXQMTa3yRCENxFqIn4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124167'),
  ('760170037048523504', 'AlphaGo', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Greg Kohs, Greg Kohs', null, 'Lee Se-dol, Demis Hassabis, David Silver, Aja Huang, Fan Hui, Frank Lantz, Cade Metz, Martin Rees', 'G', 'The ancient Chinese game of Go has long been considered a grand challenge for artificial intelligence. Yet in 2016, Google''s DeepMind team announced that they would be taking on Lee Sedol, the world''s most elite Go champion. AlphaGo chronicles the team as it prepares to test the limits of its rapidly-evolving AI technology. The film pits man against machine, and reveals as much about the workings of the human mind as it does the future of AI.', 'The ancient Chinese game of Go has long been considered a grand challenge for artificial intelligence. Yet in 2016, Google''s DeepMind team announced that they would be taking on Lee Sedol, the world''s most elite Go champion. AlphaGo chronicles the team as it prepares to test the limits of its rapidly-evolving AI technology. The film pits man against machine, and reveals as much about the workings of the human mind as it does the future of AI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDxZwTCX22gYREAy73wiibzu9H6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455008'),
  ('100219059572718736', 'Alphaville', 1965, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Raoul Coutard, Jean-Luc Godard, Jacques Barzaghi', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Eddie Constantine, Anna Karina, Akim Tamiroff, Valérie Boisgel, Jean-Louis Comolli, Michel Delahaye, Christa Lang, Jean-Pierre Léaud', 'NR', 'Lemmy Caution is on a mission to eliminate Professor Von Braun, the creator of a malevolent computer that rules the city of Alphaville. Befriended by the scientist’s daughter Natasha, Lemmy must unravel the mysteries of the strictly logical Alpha 60 and teach Natasha the meaning of the word “love.”', 'Lemmy Caution is on a mission to eliminate Professor Von Braun, the creator of a malevolent computer that rules the city of Alphaville. Befriended by the scientist’s daughter Natasha, Lemmy must unravel the mysteries of the strictly logical Alpha 60 and teach Natasha the meaning of the word “love.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFJP3D5fJDFxN7ChqSye1DZ0fTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8072'),
  ('826129186327721933', 'Alpine Antics', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Bernice Hansen, Tommy Bond', null, 'Prologue: various animals enjoy winter sports. Beans sees a notice of a ski race, and decides to enter. But so does a bad guy (who looks more than a little like Disney''s Pete). The bad guy sabotages the other contestants in various ways, takes short cuts, etc. But Beans manages to tie up the bad guy in his own trip line. A duck riding a dachshund knocks the bad guy out for a while; he and Beans trade places a few more times before Beans wins the race, just barely.', 'Prologue: various animals enjoy winter sports. Beans sees a notice of a ski race, and decides to enter. But so does a bad guy (who looks more than a little like Disney''s Pete). The bad guy sabotages the other contestants in various ways, takes short cuts, etc. But Beans manages to tie up the bad guy in his own trip line. A duck riding a dachshund knocks the bad guy out for a while; he and Beans trade places a few more times before Beans wins the race, just barely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYIKDmWM4EYetpDN8HvXHzab7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202007'),
  ('1095444833337673161', 'Alpine Climbers', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Hand', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Walt Disney, Clarence Nash, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Donald, Mickey, and Pluto climb the Alps. While up top, Donald has a run-in with a mountain goat over some edelweiss, Mickey has a row with an eagle over its eggs; one of them hatches, and gives Pluto some trouble (as does the grog a Saint Bernard gives him when he falls into a snowbank).', 'Donald, Mickey, and Pluto climb the Alps. While up top, Donald has a run-in with a mountain goat over some edelweiss, Mickey has a row with an eagle over its eggs; one of them hatches, and gives Pluto some trouble (as does the grog a Saint Bernard gives him when he falls into a snowbank).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FH7iNr0kEq2zLtLQnmawsbAeti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66819'),
  ('937279223935377795', 'Alpine Fire', 1985, 'Drama', 'Fredi M. Murer, Pio Corradi', 'Fredi M. Murer', 'Thomas Nock, Johanna Lier, Dorothea Moritz, Rolf Illig, Tilli Breidenbach, Jörg Odermatt', 'R', 'A year on an Alpine farm: an older couple have two children, Belli, who wanted to be a teacher, and the younger Franzi, deaf, and although he works like a man, child-like. Belli teaches him. In his work, he can become frustrated, so when he throws an expensive mower over a cliff in a fit of pique, his father banishes him to the outskirts of the farm, where he uses pubescent energy to break rocks and build walls and cairns. (It''s the tradition of the father''s family, called "The Irascibles" by neighbors, to spend puberty doing this.) Belli visits him and they begin sleeping together. By winter, the boy is back in the house and Belli is pregnant. Soon her parents must know.', 'A year on an Alpine farm: an older couple have two children, Belli, who wanted to be a teacher, and the younger Franzi, deaf, and although he works like a man, child-like. Belli teaches him. In his work, he can become frustrated, so when he throws an expensive mower over a cliff in a fit of pique, his father banishes him to the outskirts of the farm, where he uses pubescent energy to break rocks and build walls and cairns. (It''s the tradition of the father''s family, called "The Irascibles" by neighbors, to spend puberty doing this.) Belli visits him and they begin sleeping together. By winter, the boy is back in the house and Belli is pregnant. Soon her parents must know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYCbJXNKcEBhrrVDegxbWuZvwm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67263'),
  ('276573547688479337', 'Alps', 2011, 'Drama', 'Christos Voudouris, Yorgos Lanthimos, Kostas Papadakis', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Efthimis Filippou', 'Angeliki Papoulia, Aris Servetalis, Johnny Vekris, Ariane Labed, Stavros Psyllakis, Efthimis Filippou, Eftychia Stefanidou, Maria Kyrozi', null, 'A nurse, a paramedic, a gymnast and her coach offer a service for hire wherein they stand in for dead people by appointment, hired by relatives, friends or colleagues of the deceased, to assist with the grieving process.', 'A nurse, a paramedic, a gymnast and her coach offer a service for hire wherein they stand in for dead people by appointment, hired by relatives, friends or colleagues of the deceased, to assist with the grieving process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF5A64lC0MuuEK6qNmOfQpY6mRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81857'),
  ('361034120691035417', 'Already 20 years of Caméra Café', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Bruno Solo', 'Jérôme Aspergis, Frédéric Le Bolloc''h, Alexandre Aspergis', 'Bruno Solo, Yvan Le Bolloc''h, Karim Adda, Armelle, Shirley Bousquet, Alain Bouzigues, Gérard Chaillou, Philippe Cura', null, 'Now irrelevant in this 2.0 company, Jean-Claude is fired! Hervé is charged by the management to make Jean-Claude clear off quickly and without a scene. In doing so, they will tear down their memories, mixing the great and the small history of the past 20 years. Over the course of these memories, Hervé and Jean-Claude will renew the bonds of a lost friendship.', 'Now irrelevant in this 2.0 company, Jean-Claude is fired! Hervé is charged by the management to make Jean-Claude clear off quickly and without a scene. In doing so, they will tear down their memories, mixing the great and the small history of the past 20 years. Over the course of these memories, Hervé and Jean-Claude will renew the bonds of a lost friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0JH2eHCrwji2v1bFfv8rKHAgz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070220'),
  ('282626989184130741', 'Already Dead', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'Olivier Dahan, Pierre David', 'Olivier Massart, Olivier Dahan', 'Romain Duris, Benoît Magimel, Zoé Félix, Clément Sibony, Isaac Sharry, Carlo Brandt, Cylia Malki, Rudi Rosenberg', null, 'A young pizza-deliverer, Andréa, introduces Laure, a 20 year old girl he barely knows, to his friend David, a wealthy layabout who is looking for models for his porn photo agency. Eager for an easy escape from her dull life, Laure agrees to attend an audition with David’s boss, who proposes that she appears in hard core porn videos. She does not realise - until it is too late - that she has entered a world of hedonistic excess and brutal self-destruction...', 'A young pizza-deliverer, Andréa, introduces Laure, a 20 year old girl he barely knows, to his friend David, a wealthy layabout who is looking for models for his porn photo agency. Eager for an easy escape from her dull life, Laure agrees to attend an audition with David’s boss, who proposes that she appears in hard core porn videos. She does not realise - until it is too late - that she has entered a world of hedonistic excess and brutal self-destruction...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4YxRwg8CoiFr1oyZpL7PsKlwPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56351'),
  ('437585935519320730', 'Already Dead', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joe Otting, Eric Trageser', 'Joe Chappelle', 'Ron Eldard, Til Schweiger, Patrick Kilpatrick, Marisa Coughlan, Christopher Plummer, Geoff Pierson, Gregg Berger, Christian Stolte', 'R', 'When Thomas Archer''s happy and successful life is all but ruined following a horrific attack he is presented with a perfect opportunity to exact physical revenge upon the man who caused all his grief. However the immediate consequences of his actions and in-actions are much more complicated than he imagined.', 'When Thomas Archer''s happy and successful life is all but ruined following a horrific attack he is presented with a perfect opportunity to exact physical revenge upon the man who caused all his grief. However the immediate consequences of his actions and in-actions are much more complicated than he imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgYotrZoOwjcUKlkeItp3Oy5e6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14105'),
  ('466395922053140815', 'Already Tomorrow in Hong Kong', 2016, 'Romance', 'Emily Ting, Josh Silfen', 'Emily Ting', 'Jamie Chung, Bryan Greenberg, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Sarah Lian, Ines Laimins, Emily Ting, Leong Po-Chih, Joshua Wong', 'NR', 'Ruby, a Chinese American toy designer from LA, visits Hong Kong for the first time on business. Finding herself stranded, she meets Josh, an American expat who shows her the city.', 'Ruby, a Chinese American toy designer from LA, visits Hong Kong for the first time on business. Finding herself stranded, she meets Josh, an American expat who shows her the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t29XqPXlN5LBtzBoRo2pDsljrou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339148'),
  ('852821408924206505', 'Alsino and the Condor', 1982, 'Drama, War', 'Miguel Littín, Pablo Martínez, Jorge Herrera', 'Isidora Aguirre, Miguel Littín, Tomás Pérez Turrent', 'Dean Stockwell, Alan Esquivel, Carmen Bunster, Alejandro Parodi, Marta Lorena Pérez, Reynaldo Miravalles, Marcelo Gaete, Jan Kees De Roy', null, 'Alsino, a boy of 10 or 12, lives with his grandmother in a remote area of Nicaragua. He''s engulfed in the war between rebels and government troops when a US advisor orders the army to open a staging area by the boy''s hamlet. Alsino tries to be a child, climbing trees with a girl, looking through his grandfather''s trunk of mementos and trying to fly; he goes to town to sell a saddle, has his first drink and is taken to a brothel. But the war surrounds him. The US advisor takes Alsino on a chopper flight, but he''s unimpressed. The soldiers'' cruelties awake rebel sympathies in Alsino, and after an army assault backfires, the lad is fully baptized into the conflict.', 'Alsino, a boy of 10 or 12, lives with his grandmother in a remote area of Nicaragua. He''s engulfed in the war between rebels and government troops when a US advisor orders the army to open a staging area by the boy''s hamlet. Alsino tries to be a child, climbing trees with a girl, looking through his grandfather''s trunk of mementos and trying to fly; he goes to town to sell a saddle, has his first drink and is taken to a brothel. But the war surrounds him. The US advisor takes Alsino on a chopper flight, but he''s unimpressed. The soldiers'' cruelties awake rebel sympathies in Alsino, and after an army assault backfires, the lad is fully baptized into the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DSrf8RKgyDf5AyuMZAflPYbAc2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192721'),
  ('549046695461985704', 'Altar', 2014, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Nick Willing, Jan Richter-Friis', 'Nick Willing', 'Olivia Williams, Matthew Modine, Antonia Clarke, Steve Oram, Adam Thomas Wright, Richard Dillane, Rebecca Calder, Jonathan Jaynes', null, 'A young family find themselves in serious danger when they move to an isolated haunted house in the Yorkshire Moors.', 'A young family find themselves in serious danger when they move to an isolated haunted house in the Yorkshire Moors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5JEzIZ9ibVltkf8XtDG0VWTF2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314065'),
  ('836413907932786970', 'Alter Ego', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Lavaine, Nicolas Charlet, David Chizallet', 'Nicolas Charlet, Bruno Lavaine', 'Laurent Lafitte, Olga Kurylenko, Blanche Gardin, Marc Fraize, Zabou Breitman, Bertrand Goncalves, Giovanni Pucci, Léo Garcia', null, 'Alex, a quiet forty-something, leads an ordinary life until new neighbours move in. The husband is Alex’s perfect lookalike… except for one thing: he has hair. Alex sinks into a growing paranoia as he becomes preoccupied with this more charismatic, brilliant and accomplished mysterious double.', 'Alex, a quiet forty-something, leads an ordinary life until new neighbours move in. The husband is Alex’s perfect lookalike… except for one thing: he has hair. Alex sinks into a growing paranoia as he becomes preoccupied with this more charismatic, brilliant and accomplished mysterious double.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYOPEWwPz31cXNVPy4Q4SvdU8Kc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266791'),
  ('29981786446483175', 'Altered', 2006, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Eduardo Sánchez, Donald Dowd, Steve Yedlin', 'Jamie Nash', 'Adam Kaufman, Brad William Henke, Misty Rosas, Paul McCarthy-Boyington, Michael C. Williams, James Gammon, Catherine Mangan, Joe Unger', 'R', 'Fifteen years ago, five men were abducted by aliens. Only four returned. Now, these same four men have managed to capture one of the creatures who killed their friend and ruined their lives.', 'Fifteen years ago, five men were abducted by aliens. Only four returned. Now, these same four men have managed to capture one of the creatures who killed their friend and ruined their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhUA9wCbuZAdl1Nhq4bkwyZKst5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14458'),
  ('699438114552433093', 'Altered', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Timo Vuorensola, Anton Bakarski', 'Timo Vuorensola', 'Tom Felton, Aggy K. Adams, Elizaveta Bugulova, Igor Jijikine, Richard Brake, Aleksey Filimonov, Daniyar Alshinov, Atamura Mussakhanov', 'PG-13', 'In an alternate present, genetically enhanced humans dominate society. Outcasts Leon and Chloe fight for justice against corrupt politicians exploiting genetic disparity, risking everything to challenge the oppressive system.', 'In an alternate present, genetically enhanced humans dominate society. Outcasts Leon and Chloe fight for justice against corrupt politicians exploiting genetic disparity, risking everything to challenge the oppressive system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QlAcGRaUrgHcZ4WTBh5lsPnzKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309012'),
  ('6303127129716105', 'Altered Carbon: Resleeved', 2020, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiyuki Okada, Takeru Nakajima', 'Dai Sato, Tsukasa Kondo', 'Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Rina Sato, Ayaka Asai, Kenji Yamauchi, Kanehira Yamamoto, Koji Ishii, Jouji Nakata, Kaori Nakamura', 'R', 'On the planet Latimer, Takeshi Kovacs must protect a tattooist while investigating the death of a yakuza boss alongside a no-nonsense CTAC.', 'On the planet Latimer, Takeshi Kovacs must protect a tattooist while investigating the death of a yakuza boss alongside a no-nonsense CTAC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlIYzx7cc4Wvaoh7ShjF2HZG45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665251'),
  ('135968706877439282', 'Altered States', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ken Russell, Jordan Cronenweth, Bran Ferren', 'Paddy Chayefsky', 'William Hurt, Blair Brown, Bob Balaban, Charles Haid, Thaao Penghlis, Miguel Godreau, Dori Brenner, Peter Brandon', 'R', 'A research scientist explores the boundaries and frontiers of human consciousness. Using sensory deprivation and hallucinogenic mixtures from Native American shamans, he explores these altered states of cognizance and finds that memory, time, and reality itself are states of mind.', 'A research scientist explores the boundaries and frontiers of human consciousness. Using sensory deprivation and hallucinogenic mixtures from Native American shamans, he explores these altered states of cognizance and finds that memory, time, and reality itself are states of mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsoaPN5SWYgZ4B7GG9nRNj33so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11542'),
  ('512154295604512503', 'Alternate Weeks (and Half the Vacation)', 2009, 'Drama, Family', 'Ivan Calbérac, Denis Rouden, Ophélie Gelber', 'Ivan Calbérac', 'Mathilde Seigner, Bernard Campan, Bertille Chabert, Judith Davis, Grégori Derangère, Danièle Lebrun, Jean-Baptiste Fonck, Anne Charrier', null, 'A 12 year old girl and her 8 year old brother live one week with their mother and the next week with their father. The girl blamers her mother, a super businesswoman for the divorce and turns all her anger on her. She prefers the weeks with her father who is flat broke after leaving his bank job to give people free hugs on street corners. Her brother channels his sense of injustice into the battle to save the planet. As the school year progresses and her parents struggle to mend their lives and as the girl approaches her 13th birthday, she learns to see the world in a new way.', 'A 12 year old girl and her 8 year old brother live one week with their mother and the next week with their father. The girl blamers her mother, a super businesswoman for the divorce and turns all her anger on her. She prefers the weeks with her father who is flat broke after leaving his bank job to give people free hugs on street corners. Her brother channels his sense of injustice into the battle to save the planet. As the school year progresses and her parents struggle to mend their lives and as the girl approaches her 13th birthday, she learns to see the world in a new way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMni1wwdcmdQWyewfCyWpDkhTdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29379'),
  ('829548711513287998', 'Altiplano', 2009, 'Drama', 'Peter Brosens, Jessica Hope Woodworth, Francisco Gózon', 'Peter Brosens, Jessica Hope Woodworth', 'Jasmin Tabatabai, Magaly Solier, Olivier Gourmet, Arturo Anacarino Zarate, Malku Choquehuillca, Edgar Condori, Behi Djanati Atai, Kian Khalili', null, 'In the Andes, a Belgian doctor and his photojournalist wife become ensnared in a native tribe''s struggle with a mining company.', 'In the Andes, a Belgian doctor and his photojournalist wife become ensnared in a native tribe''s struggle with a mining company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GDlXz4yA1T8csNklfDXBvFi5nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83430'),
  ('47085513872669534', 'Altitude', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kaare Andrews, Norm Li', 'Paul A. Birkett', 'Jessica Lowndes, Julianna Guill, Ryan Donowho, Michelle Harrison, Ian Robison, Landon Liboiron, Chelah Horsdal, Mike Dopud', 'R', 'After a mysterious malfunction sends their small plane climbing out of control, a rookie pilot and her four teenage friends find themselves trapped in a deadly showdown with a supernatural force.', 'After a mysterious malfunction sends their small plane climbing out of control, a rookie pilot and her four teenage friends find themselves trapped in a deadly showdown with a supernatural force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MhCLk4TzLAQmj7SfUWO7X2iWQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44678'),
