  ('930270011711257153', 'Alucarda', 1977, 'Horror', 'Juan López Moctezuma, Xavier Cruz, Rafael Villaseñor Kuri', 'Alexis Arroyo, Juan López Moctezuma', 'Tina Romero, Susana Kamini, Claudio Brook, David Silva, Lily Garza, Tina French, Birgitta Segerskog, Adriana Roel', null, 'A young girl''s arrival at a convent after the death of her parents marks the beginning of a series of events that unleash an evil presence on the girl and her mysterious new friend, an enigmatic figure known as Alucarda. Demonic possession, Satan worship, and vampirism follows.', 'A young girl''s arrival at a convent after the death of her parents marks the beginning of a series of events that unleash an evil presence on the girl and her mysterious new friend, an enigmatic figure known as Alucarda. Demonic possession, Satan worship, and vampirism follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnTomUY0xeHF42f3LZFhCGIklW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40074'),
