  ('996867514195948055', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks', 2007, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Lissette Schettini, Tim Hill, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Chris Viscardi, Will McRobb, Jon Vitti', 'Jason Lee, David Cross, Cameron Richardson, Jane Lynch, Justin Long, Matthew Gray Gubler, Jesse McCartney, Allison Karman', 'PG', 'A struggling songwriter named Dave Seville finds success when he comes across a trio of singing chipmunks: mischievous leader Alvin, brainy Simon, and chubby, impressionable Theodore.', 'A struggling songwriter named Dave Seville finds success when he comes across a trio of singing chipmunks: mischievous leader Alvin, brainy Simon, and chubby, impressionable Theodore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3s3WvpKPXXeKAPketDDqiQTi20S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6477'),
  ('442369418350332742', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks Meet Frankenstein', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Kathi Castillo', 'John Loy', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Dee Bradley Baker, Michael Bell, Mary Kay Bergman, Janice Karman, Jim Meskimen, Kevin Michael Richardson, Frank Welker', 'G', 'The Chipmunks work in an amusement park attraction. After Alvin drives a crazy tour group, they miss their next performance and are locked in the park after closing time. Little do they know that the real Dr. Frankenstein has been hired in a new attraction called, "Frankenstein''s Castle"; figuring that the castle isn''t scary enough, the mad scientist recreates the real Monster.', 'The Chipmunks work in an amusement park attraction. After Alvin drives a crazy tour group, they miss their next performance and are locked in the park after closing time. Little do they know that the real Dr. Frankenstein has been hired in a new attraction called, "Frankenstein''s Castle"; figuring that the castle isn''t scary enough, the mad scientist recreates the real Monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiXOFmWtxQ3LdrGgP2uOuR1DHBp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3126'),
  ('314937346847250845', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks Meet the Wolfman', 2000, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Animation, Music', 'Kathi Castillo', 'John Loy', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman, Maurice LaMarche, Miriam Flynn, Rob Paulsen, April Winchell, E. G. Daily, Frank Welker', 'G', 'As Alvin struggles with nightmares involving werewolves, the school play of Jekyll & Hyde is in jeopardy when the lead, Alvin, is suspended. In an attempt to boost his confidence, the principal suggests Theodore, who''s suddenly going through some canine changes.', 'As Alvin struggles with nightmares involving werewolves, the school play of Jekyll & Hyde is in jeopardy when the lead, Alvin, is suspended. In an attempt to boost his confidence, the principal suggests Theodore, who''s suddenly going through some canine changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvAGKjbAl2F71hterQ6BpPzQMEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48246'),
  ('713171607976014283', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks: A Chipmunk Celebration', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Walt Kubiak', 'Janice Karman, Ross Bagdasarian, Jr.', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman', 'NR', 'Alvin, Simon and Theodore sign up for a community Thanksgiving play, but when the assignments are all scrambled, the boys are freaked out that they''ll bomb!', 'Alvin, Simon and Theodore sign up for a community Thanksgiving play, but when the assignments are all scrambled, the boys are freaked out that they''ll bomb!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DYlBJ02Og28ZMJKL5rpM2pZbpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57242'),
  ('451965462712616008', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks: Chipwrecked', 2011, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, Music, Animation', 'Thomas E. Ackerman, Mike Mitchell', 'Jonathan Aibel, Glenn Berger', 'Jason Lee, David Cross, Jenny Slate, Justin Long, Matthew Gray Gubler, Jesse McCartney, Amy Poehler, Anna Faris', 'G', 'Playing around while aboard a cruise ship, the Chipmunks and Chipettes accidentally go overboard and end up marooned in a tropical paradise. They discover their new turf is not as deserted as it seems.', 'Playing around while aboard a cruise ship, the Chipmunks and Chipettes accidentally go overboard and end up marooned in a tropical paradise. They discover their new turf is not as deserted as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npOXWVoZyl8UrF2wtByHtfmsWSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55301'),
  ('531531291508761764', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Road Chip', 2015, 'Family, Comedy, Music, Adventure, Animation', 'Paul D. Kelly, Thomas E. Ackerman, Jeff Ginn', 'Randi Mayem Singer, Adam Sztykiel', 'Jason Lee, Justin Long, Matthew Gray Gubler, Jesse McCartney, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Josh Green, Tony Hale, Bella Thorne', 'PG', 'Through a series of misunderstandings, Alvin, Simon and Theodore come to believe that Dave is going to propose to his new girlfriend in New York City - and dump them. They have three days to get to him and stop the proposal.', 'Through a series of misunderstandings, Alvin, Simon and Theodore come to believe that Dave is going to propose to his new girlfriend in New York City - and dump them. They have three days to get to him and stop the proposal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16OcuuW5z509WILR6BmscNdXgw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258509'),
  ('231248258580233618', 'Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel', 2009, 'Comedy, Family, Animation, Fantasy, Music', 'Betty Thomas, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Glenn Berger, Jonathan Aibel, Jon Vitti', 'Zachary Levi, David Cross, Jason Lee, Justin Long, Matthew Gray Gubler, Jesse McCartney, Amy Poehler, Anna Faris', 'PG', 'Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville''s twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school''s music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.', 'Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville''s twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school''s music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mdPqOga5fty15nXmaNcK1fsNMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23398'),
  ('94795699643869115', 'Alvin Purple', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Tim Burstall, Hal McElroy, Roy Bissell', 'Alan Hopgood', 'Graeme Blundell, Abigail, Lynette Curran, Christine Amor, Dina Mann, Dennis Miller, Jill Forster, Frederick Parslow', 'R', 'Alvin is your average guy, except for the fact women find him irresistible and chase him everywhere. He tries to avoid them and get psychiatric help but gets used by the psychiatrists as a gigolo to treat other patients instead.', 'Alvin is your average guy, except for the fact women find him irresistible and chase him everywhere. He tries to avoid them and get psychiatric help but gets used by the psychiatrists as a gigolo to treat other patients instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYvQU6Tv5gD8XcUUDBFR6hFzfB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33057'),
  ('328369532710447805', 'Alvin Rides Again', 1974, 'Comedy', 'David Bilcock, Robin Copping, Robin Copping', 'Alan Hopgood', 'Graeme Blundell, Alan Finney, Frank Thring, Noel Ferrier, Chantal Contouri, Abigail, Gus Mercurio, Jon Finlayson', null, 'Alvin Purple, a man who can''t hold down a job because of his voracious sexual appetite, impersonates a dead American Gangster.', 'Alvin Purple, a man who can''t hold down a job because of his voracious sexual appetite, impersonates a dead American Gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CzldHvon3n9ByRf1r3kQKSYg2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35000'),
  ('233968301111972938', 'Always', 1989, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Mikael Salomon, Steven Spielberg, Alexander Witt', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Holly Hunter, John Goodman, Brad Johnson, Audrey Hepburn, Roberts Blossom, Keith David, Ed Van Nuys', 'PG', 'The spirit of a recently deceased expert pilot mentors a newer pilot while watching him fall in love with the girlfriend that he left behind.', 'The spirit of a recently deceased expert pilot mentors a newer pilot while watching him fall in love with the girlfriend that he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh0WItAFrw3m66mDMlCCuXQwfMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11352'),
  ('379946104195316625', 'Always - Sunset on Third Street', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kiyoko Shibuya, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryota Kosawa', 'Maki Horikita, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Koyuki, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Kazuki Koshimizu, Kenta Suga, Masaya Takahashi', null, 'Teenage Mutsuko comes to Tokyo for work but ends up at a repair shop. She befriends the owner''s family. Neighbors Hiromi, writer Chagawa with admirer Junnosuke strive alongside them in postwar Tokyo''s evolution.', 'Teenage Mutsuko comes to Tokyo for work but ends up at a repair shop. She befriends the owner''s family. Neighbors Hiromi, writer Chagawa with admirer Junnosuke strive alongside them in postwar Tokyo''s evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20lchzT4J5v8VwEIud6CicAwBoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13430'),
  ('28329467457359244', 'Always Amore', 2022, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Fair, Shawn Seifert', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Autumn Reeser, Tyler Hynes, Patty McCormack, Lisa Marie DiGiacinto, Matthew Del Bel Belluz, Rachelle Goulding, Peter Bryant, Francisca Dennis', 'G', 'The movie centers around Elizabeth who, with the support of her mother-in-law Nonna, is doing everything she can to keep her late husband’s once acclaimed — but now struggling — Italian restaurant afloat. With business going downhill, she is forced to work with a professional restaurant consultant, Ben, to see if they can turn things around. At first, Elizabeth resists the changes Ben believes will save the restaurant, but as they get closer, Elizabeth realizes that not all change is bad. She rediscovers her passion for baking and might even open her heart to new love.', 'The movie centers around Elizabeth who, with the support of her mother-in-law Nonna, is doing everything she can to keep her late husband’s once acclaimed — but now struggling — Italian restaurant afloat. With business going downhill, she is forced to work with a professional restaurant consultant, Ben, to see if they can turn things around. At first, Elizabeth resists the changes Ben believes will save the restaurant, but as they get closer, Elizabeth realizes that not all change is bad. She rediscovers her passion for baking and might even open her heart to new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPJMl05qBhE98cwQz4TCfhPaQ2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937110'),
  ('252463191960468089', 'Always and Forever', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Chris Stokes', 'Chris Stokes, Marques Houston', 'Cynthia Addai-Robinson, Aundrea Smith, Wood Harris, Lauren London, Loretta Devine, Robbie Jones, Deborah Ayorinde, Matthew Hancock', null, 'After a tragedy reunites Nicole with her childhood friends, they each find themselves in danger, targets of a deranged stalker. Nicole knows this can''t be a coincidence. The secrets of their past are coming back to haunt them.', 'After a tragedy reunites Nicole with her childhood friends, they each find themselves in danger, targets of a deranged stalker. Nicole knows this can''t be a coincidence. The secrets of their past are coming back to haunt them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSYahzzFP7od6mFegr64V0aGoYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530789'),
  ('929715637085730673', 'Always Be My Maybe', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Matt Rebenkoff, Lorie Gibson, Cherie Kroll', 'Michael Golamco, Ali Wong, Randall Park', 'Ali Wong, Randall Park, James Saito, Michelle Buteau, Vivian Bang, Keanu Reeves, Susan Park, Daniel Dae Kim', 'PG-13', 'Reunited after 15 years, famous chef Sasha and hometown musician Marcus feel the old sparks of attraction, but struggle to adapt to each other''s worlds.', 'Reunited after 15 years, famous chef Sasha and hometown musician Marcus feel the old sparks of attraction, but struggle to adapt to each other''s worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BO6pPa7qDcpPYct061Luh9fvst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513576'),
  ('2542600889231409', 'Always for Pleasure', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Les Blank, Les Blank', null, 'Kid Thomas Valentine, Allen Toussaint, Blue Lu Barker, Irma Thomas, Professor Longhair, Aaron Neville, Art Neville, Charles Neville', null, 'An intense insider''s portrait of New Orleans'' street celebrations and unique cultural gumbo: Second-line parades, Mardi Gras, Jazz Fest. Features live music from Professor Longhair, the Wild Tchoupitoulas, the Neville Brothers and more. This glorious, soul-satisfying film is among Blank''s special masterworks. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 1999.', 'An intense insider''s portrait of New Orleans'' street celebrations and unique cultural gumbo: Second-line parades, Mardi Gras, Jazz Fest. Features live music from Professor Longhair, the Wild Tchoupitoulas, the Neville Brothers and more. This glorious, soul-satisfying film is among Blank''s special masterworks. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE1UO2QNeUNw9KO4FhKiX0emjzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85637'),
  ('73005842062428665', 'Always Kabhi Kabhi', 2011, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Roshan Abbas, Fuwad Khan, Jignesh Rathod', 'Roshan Abbas, Ranjit Raina, Ishita Moitra', 'Ali Fazal, Zoa Morani, Lillete Dubey, Satish Shah, Giselli Monteiro, Manoj Joshi, Ashwin Mushran, Vijay Raaz', 'PG', 'Four students come of age during a year at their school, St Marks with various encounters.', 'Four students come of age during a year at their school, St Marks with various encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JXS3QQMIZVWZGyjy6fXzcC520Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71900'),
  ('136052422952990182', 'Always Outnumbered', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Apted, Ashley Burnham, John Bailey', null, 'Laurence Fishburne, Daniel Williams, Bill Cobbs, Natalie Cole, Laurie Metcalf, Cicely Tyson, Bridgid Coulter, Bill Nunn', 'R', 'An ex-con moves to L.A. to find work and creates a disturbance by fighting for a position. More importantly he touches the lives of many of his neighbors including an older man dying of cancer, a young married couple whose husband is too proud to accept a lesser position which causes strife with his wife, and a young boy on the verge of getting in trouble with street gangs.', 'An ex-con moves to L.A. to find work and creates a disturbance by fighting for a position. More importantly he touches the lives of many of his neighbors including an older man dying of cancer, a young married couple whose husband is too proud to accept a lesser position which causes strife with his wife, and a young boy on the verge of getting in trouble with street gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4NjziVAOO7a7tu3YTfZ3xqD2uk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26622'),
  ('40699360277608958', 'Always Say Yes', 2019, 'Romance', 'Alberto Fuguet', 'Alberto Fuguet', 'Gerardo Torres Rodríguez, Pavel Akindog, Anty de la Vega, Lalo Santos, Irvin Morlag, Franco Ruiz, Andrés Sánchez, Effy Oropeza', 'NR', 'Héctor travels from Hermosillo to Mexico City in the hopes of posing naked for photography collective Feral. His friend Carlos chooses not to go with him. Héctor, determined to experiment with his desire without limits, promises himself to always say yes while in the Aztec capital.', 'Héctor travels from Hermosillo to Mexico City in the hopes of posing naked for photography collective Feral. His friend Carlos chooses not to go with him. Héctor, determined to experiment with his desire without limits, promises himself to always say yes while in the Aztec capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60lDXGfxTqnGitrCzKg6A2mywbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590215'),
  ('848436205376678745', 'Always Shine', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Sophia Takal, Mark Schwartzbard', 'Lawrence Michael Levine', 'Mackenzie Davis, Caitlin FitzGerald, Lawrence Michael Levine, Khan Baykal, Alexander Koch, Michael Lowry, Colleen Camp, Jane Adams', 'NR', 'On a trip to Big Sur, two friends, both actresses, try to reconnect with one another. Once alone, the women''s suppressed jealousies and deep-seated resentments begin to rise, causing them to lose their grasp on not only the true nature of their relationship, but also their identities.', 'On a trip to Big Sur, two friends, both actresses, try to reconnect with one another. Once alone, the women''s suppressed jealousies and deep-seated resentments begin to rise, causing them to lose their grasp on not only the true nature of their relationship, but also their identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTDt04LtD1IUn8FWamBbKUBOQXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385737'),
  ('168166798447231481', 'Always Was Tonight', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Todd Decker', 'Megan Wilding, Yaraman Thorne, Aaron Collins, Jay Wymarra, Dave Woodhead', 'Tony Armstrong, Megan Wilding, Clancy Whitley', null, 'Proud Gamilaroi man Tony Armstrong and a stellar line-up of First Nations talent are set to decolonise the news - one headline at a time. This fast, funny and unflinching special has an agenda to go where no other show dares.', 'Proud Gamilaroi man Tony Armstrong and a stellar line-up of First Nations talent are set to decolonise the news - one headline at a time. This fast, funny and unflinching special has an agenda to go where no other show dares.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8h1ZHT04Imgp8YAWLABqk6YTzMe.jpg', 'plex:movie:always-was-tonight'),
  ('51066579835116130', 'Always Watching: A Marble Hornets Story', 2015, 'Horror', 'James Moran, Ulf Soderqvist', 'Joseph DeLage, Ian Shorr', 'Christopher Rodriguez Marquette, Alexandra Breckenridge, Jake McDorman, Doug Jones, Michael Bunin, Alexandra Holden, Morgan Bastin, Elizabeth Payne', 'R', 'A small town news team discovers a box of videotapes wherein a faceless figure, dressed in a dark suit, haunts and torments a family...slowly driving them insane. Soon after, they realize that the ''Operator'' has begun to stalk them as well.', 'A small town news team discovers a box of videotapes wherein a faceless figure, dressed in a dark suit, haunts and torments a family...slowly driving them insane. Soon after, they realize that the ''Operator'' has begun to stalk them as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gL1OSeSYZc4kcqkYybPAzS21LY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329289'),
  ('1117320413115755194', 'Always: Sunset on Third Street ''64', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kiyoko Shibuya, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryota Kosawa', 'Hidetaka Yoshioka, Koyuki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Maki Horikita, Shota Sometani, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Tomokazu Miura, Masako Motai', null, 'The Tokyo Olympics are about to open, and Rynosuke Chagawa is excited to receive a new TV set to watch the upcoming events. His wife Hiromi is pregnant and he has built a second level on his shop to provide his adopted son Junnosuke with a private space to study for entrance to Tokyo University to set up a career with a major company. He dreams of sparing Junnosuke the struggles that he has faced as a writer. The family continues to rely upon Hiromi''s income from her bar. Meanwhile a rival story, The Virus, by a new writer has appeared in the periodical that has been publishing his stories "Boy''s Adventure Book" and he fears the new competition. Norifumi Suzuki also receives a new TV, but more of a deluxe model. Mutsuko Hoshino (Roku) is still the principal mechanic in the Suzuki family''s auto repair shop, but she dresses up some mornings to go to a nearby street with the hope of a "chance" meeting with Dr...', 'The Tokyo Olympics are about to open, and Rynosuke Chagawa is excited to receive a new TV set to watch the upcoming events. His wife Hiromi is pregnant and he has built a second level on his shop to provide his adopted son Junnosuke with a private space to study for entrance to Tokyo University to set up a career with a major company. He dreams of sparing Junnosuke the struggles that he has faced as a writer. The family continues to rely upon Hiromi''s income from her bar. Meanwhile a rival story, The Virus, by a new writer has appeared in the periodical that has been publishing his stories "Boy''s Adventure Book" and he fears the new competition. Norifumi Suzuki also receives a new TV, but more of a deluxe model. Mutsuko Hoshino (Roku) is still the principal mechanic in the Suzuki family''s auto repair shop, but she dresses up some mornings to go to a nearby street with the hope of a "chance" meeting with Dr...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj0nFiWJavNlYvBsDxzPh42NPX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121239'),
  ('389364847967127628', 'Always: Sunset on Third Street 2', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Shinsuke Kojima, Naoki Kawamura', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryota Kosawa', 'Hidetaka Yoshioka, Maki Horikita, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Kazuki Koshimizu, Koyuki, Tomokazu Miura, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Kenta Suga', null, 'Would-be writer Ryunosuke Chagawa is still living across the street from Norifumi Suzuki and his auto repair shop, though now he shares his home with Junnosuke, an orphan he''s taken under his wing at the urging of pretty Hiroi, who continues to manage a nearby tavern. Chagawa dreams of publishing a successful novel and settling down with Hiroi and Junnosuke, but his day job running the candy store keeps him busy, and Hiroi mistakes his tight schedule for a lack of interest in her. Hiroi has also embarked on a secret career as a burlesque dancer, which isn''t doing much to improve her opinion of men. At the Suzuki household, seven-year-old Ippei isn''t happy to be sharing the house with a guest, his distant cousin Mika who is the same age but far more demanding. Mutsuko, the apprentice female auto mechanic, is still staying with the Suzukis, and she''s becomes the object of the affections of Takeo, a downbeat young man who is studying cooking.', 'Would-be writer Ryunosuke Chagawa is still living across the street from Norifumi Suzuki and his auto repair shop, though now he shares his home with Junnosuke, an orphan he''s taken under his wing at the urging of pretty Hiroi, who continues to manage a nearby tavern. Chagawa dreams of publishing a successful novel and settling down with Hiroi and Junnosuke, but his day job running the candy store keeps him busy, and Hiroi mistakes his tight schedule for a lack of interest in her. Hiroi has also embarked on a secret career as a burlesque dancer, which isn''t doing much to improve her opinion of men. At the Suzuki household, seven-year-old Ippei isn''t happy to be sharing the house with a guest, his distant cousin Mika who is the same age but far more demanding. Mutsuko, the apprentice female auto mechanic, is still staying with the Suzukis, and she''s becomes the object of the affections of Takeo, a downbeat young man who is studying cooking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uu91ySPA3sh5tAZCWd6D1sa447K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41177'),
  ('574695702578883095', 'Alyce Kills', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jay Lee, Jay Lee', 'Jay Lee', 'Jade Dornfeld, Amara Zaragoza, James Duval, Larry Cedar, Eddie Rouse, Shannon Malone, Yorgo Constantine, Megan Gallagher', 'NR', 'After accidentally knocking her best friend off a roof, Alyce is haunted by guilt and delves into a brutal nightmare wonderland of sex, drugs and violence, her mind tearing itself apart… along with anyone else who gets in her way.', 'After accidentally knocking her best friend off a roof, Alyce is haunted by guilt and delves into a brutal nightmare wonderland of sex, drugs and violence, her mind tearing itself apart… along with anyone else who gets in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AxdAm6fpXmMKV1HFkcW0bZvb7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78093'),
  ('740275390891658494', 'Alyonka', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Boris Barnet, Igor Chernykh, I. Paramonov', 'Sergei Antonov', 'Natalya Ovodova, Irina Zarubina, Vasiliy Shukshin, Erast Garin, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Yevgeni Shutov, Maya Menglet, Natalya Seleznyova', null, 'Set in 1955 when many migrated from Russia to the Steppes of Kazakhstan, this is the trip back to the Canal from the frontier and farms by a number of people who tell their settler stories. Alenka Muratova (Ovodova) is a winsome 13 year old who talks Dmitry Prokovich, the chief mechanic for the Soviet, into giving up his seat in the truck to a young mother with her infant daughter. Then Alenka and Dmitry share the back of the open truck with a young woman, newly graduated dentist who has not been able to find a position, Stefan, a hitchhiker with a dog who hopes his upper-class wife will return to him and the countryside, and Vasselina Petrovolka, a woman who lost one of her twin daughters in a riding accident by the river shortly after they arrived, and now is returning to tell the other twin of her sister''s fate. A warm hearted look at common folks traveling in the frontier.', 'Set in 1955 when many migrated from Russia to the Steppes of Kazakhstan, this is the trip back to the Canal from the frontier and farms by a number of people who tell their settler stories. Alenka Muratova (Ovodova) is a winsome 13 year old who talks Dmitry Prokovich, the chief mechanic for the Soviet, into giving up his seat in the truck to a young mother with her infant daughter. Then Alenka and Dmitry share the back of the open truck with a young woman, newly graduated dentist who has not been able to find a position, Stefan, a hitchhiker with a dog who hopes his upper-class wife will return to him and the countryside, and Vasselina Petrovolka, a woman who lost one of her twin daughters in a riding accident by the river shortly after they arrived, and now is returning to tell the other twin of her sister''s fate. A warm hearted look at common folks traveling in the frontier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aJlZasq1ykvaHd9Iv1KrQXf850.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132041'),
  ('671829979094938884', 'Am Ende des Tages', 2011, null, 'Peter Payer', 'Kai Hensel, Peter Payer', 'Simon Schwarz, Anna Unterberger, Nicholas Ofczarek, Carmela Achleitner, Fritz Supper, Elena Ledochowski, Mikka Forcher, Ramses Ramsauer', null, 'The successful politician Robert is going on a romantic weekend trip with his pregnant wife Katharina as a unexpected old friend of Robert, Wolfgang, suddenly appears on the surface and starts to stalk the couple.', 'The successful politician Robert is going on a romantic weekend trip with his pregnant wife Katharina as a unexpected old friend of Robert, Wolfgang, suddenly appears on the surface and starts to stalk the couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qwltEConGq3oqgJa1dTETbIk5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134122'),
  ('749743621670021994', 'Am Hang', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Markus Imboden', 'Klaus Richter, Martin Gypkens', 'Henry Hübchen, Martina Gedeck, Maximilian Simonischek, Sophie Hutter', null, 'Felix is on the edge. He has got just one thing on his mind: Valerie - his wife, who has recently left him. He returns to the place of their final break-up. Valerie''s ex-lover Thomas is also here, but not for sentimental reasons. By chance the two men meet in a restaurant. By chance Felix discovers who he is facing. And then starts the inscrutable game.', 'Felix is on the edge. He has got just one thing on his mind: Valerie - his wife, who has recently left him. He returns to the place of their final break-up. Valerie''s ex-lover Thomas is also here, but not for sentimental reasons. By chance the two men meet in a restaurant. By chance Felix discovers who he is facing. And then starts the inscrutable game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIKgsS50YEmYV97upiQeO0ICsUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218072'),
  ('279681270546022101', 'Am I Beautiful?', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Theo Bierkens, Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie, Rolf Basedow, Ruth Stadler', 'Marie Zielcke, Carla Weindler, Julian Messner, Franka Potente, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Steffen Wink, Anica Dobra, Iris Berben', null, 'Between Munich and Seville, the destinies of sixteen characters intertwine and intersect, missing each other or colliding head-on. They are all, without knowing it, at a pivotal moment in their lives...', 'Between Munich and Seville, the destinies of sixteen characters intertwine and intersect, missing each other or colliding head-on. They are all, without knowing it, at a pivotal moment in their lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTbiGNjH15ogIBeHICPr1gWRH4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8556'),
  ('930755775509817621', 'Am I OK?', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Cristina Dunlap, Cédric Chabloz, Tomi Hutton', 'Lauren Pomerantz', 'Dakota Johnson, Sonoya Mizuno, Jermaine Fowler, Kiersey Clemons, Molly Gordon, Whitmer Thomas, Sean Hayes, Tig Notaro', 'R', 'Lucy and Jane have been best friends for most of their lives and think they know everything there is to know about each other. But when Jane announces she''s moving to London, Lucy reveals a long-held secret. As Jane tries to help Lucy, their friendship is thrown into chaos.', 'Lucy and Jane have been best friends for most of their lives and think they know everything there is to know about each other. But when Jane announces she''s moving to London, Lucy reveals a long-held secret. As Jane tries to help Lucy, their friendship is thrown into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKkaG7HVFVe7C1JuxTGwNz0eSyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641934'),
  ('223716909798980235', 'Am I Racist?', 2024, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Justin Folk', 'Matt Walsh, Justin Folk, Brian A. Hoffman', 'Matt Walsh, Robin DiAngelo, Regina Jackson, Saira Rao, Regan Byrd, Sarra Tekola, Maryna Biletska, Phil McGraw', 'PG-13', 'Matt Walsh goes deep undercover in the world of diversity, equity, and inclusion. Prepare to be shocked by how far race hustlers will go and how much further Matt Walsh will go to expose the grift, uncovering absurdities that will leave you laughing.', 'Matt Walsh goes deep undercover in the world of diversity, equity, and inclusion. Prepare to be shocked by how far race hustlers will go and how much further Matt Walsh will go to expose the grift, uncovering absurdities that will leave you laughing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0nfgpeRMORStotrouLoOBr00Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320637'),
  ('593369659556208457', 'AM1200', 2008, 'Horror', 'David Prior, Brian Hoodenpyle', 'David Prior', 'Eric Lange, John Billingsley, Ray Wise, Stephanie Venditto, Phil Trask Jr., Michael Ambrosini', null, 'Haunted by recent events and on the run, a man finds himself the unwitting pawn of a possessed evangelical radio station and like his unfortunate predecessor must ask himself whether it is better to reign in hell than serve in heaven.', 'Haunted by recent events and on the run, a man finds himself the unwitting pawn of a possessed evangelical radio station and like his unfortunate predecessor must ask himself whether it is better to reign in hell than serve in heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wxthxjqNIxLMrtBzn1YrUgz5e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39279'),
  ('942133160672395261', 'Ama', 2021, 'Drama', 'Júlia de Paz, Sandra Roca', 'Núria Dunjó, Júlia de Paz', 'Tamara Casellas, Leire Marín, Estefanía de los Santos, Ana Turpin, Manuel de Blas, Pablo Gómez-Pando, Chema del Barco, María Marrero', null, 'A portrait of the myth of maternity around the story of Pepa and her daughter, who are evicted from their home and forced to wander for a place to live with no support network.', 'A portrait of the myth of maternity around the story of Pepa and her daughter, who are evicted from their home and forced to wander for a place to live with no support network.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBKWFzXU1kxLj8V3bT9Rl45Be30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836950'),
  ('381018557895301650', 'Ama Gloria', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jean-Philippe Rouxel, Inès Tabarin, Louise Blachère', 'Marie Amachoukeli, Pauline Guéna', 'Ilça Moreno, Louise Mauroy-Panzani, Fredy Gomes Tavares, Abnara Gomes Varela, Arnaud Rebotini, Domingos Borges Almeida', null, 'Cleo is six years old, has a myopic look and has been madly in love with Gloria, her nanny, since she was born. When Gloria receives a call and must urgently return to her home in Cape Verde to care for her two children, whom she has not raised, Cleo makes her promise to meet one last time. Gloria accepts and invites Cleo to spend the summer vacations on her island. A last summer that they will spend together, in Gloria’s family, before inevitably saying goodbye.', 'Cleo is six years old, has a myopic look and has been madly in love with Gloria, her nanny, since she was born. When Gloria receives a call and must urgently return to her home in Cape Verde to care for her two children, whom she has not raised, Cleo makes her promise to meet one last time. Gloria accepts and invites Cleo to spend the summer vacations on her island. A last summer that they will spend together, in Gloria’s family, before inevitably saying goodbye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfi3h3ZemjWCyaCv3wUJXGE8aF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803688'),
  ('798048950010099803', 'Amadeus', 1984, 'History, Music, Drama', 'Miloš Forman, Miroslav Ondříček, Michael Hausman', 'Peter Shaffer', 'F. Murray Abraham, Tom Hulce, Elizabeth Berridge, Simon Callow, Roy Dotrice, Christine Ebersole, Jeffrey Jones, Charles Kay', 'PG', 'Disciplined Italian composer Antonio Salieri becomes consumed by jealousy and resentment towards the hedonistic and remarkably talented young Salzburger composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.', 'Disciplined Italian composer Antonio Salieri becomes consumed by jealousy and resentment towards the hedonistic and remarkably talented young Salzburger composer Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQRfiyfGvr1az0quaYyMram3Aqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279'),
  ('926344584284058021', 'Amado', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Erik de Castro, Edu Felistoque, Lucci Antunes', 'Erik de Castro', 'Sérgio Menezes, Gabriela Correa, Igor Cotrim, Alexandre Barillari, Brenda Lígia, Adriana Lessa, Neco Vila Lobos, Sergio Cavalcante', null, 'Directed by Edu Felistoque and Erik de Castro, the film "Amado" was inspired by a real events. Blind to color, creed or sex, the police officer doesn''t care if the individual is a thief or a policeman.', 'Directed by Edu Felistoque and Erik de Castro, the film "Amado" was inspired by a real events. Blind to color, creed or sex, the police officer doesn''t care if the individual is a thief or a policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niRzmV9YdeJvNTQxeEXfSFPm1Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980180'),
  ('10965874927881450', 'Amador', 2010, 'Drama', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Magaly Solier, Celso Bugallo, Pietro Sibille, Sonia Almarcha', null, 'A drama centered on a young woman who takes a summer job caring for a bed-ridden older man, and the intimate secrets they begin to share with one another.', 'A drama centered on a young woman who takes a summer job caring for a bed-ridden older man, and the intimate secrets they begin to share with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaK0iYDUYAzndqDHeMBcD5DupsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56440'),
  ('249063230409363884', 'Amagi Pass', 1983, 'Crime, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Haruhiko Mimura, Yoshimasa Hakata, Kinichi Hanawa', 'Haruhiko Mimura, Tai Katō', 'Tsunehiko Watase, Yuko Tanaka, Mikijiro Hira, Yōichi Itō, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Kenzo Kaneko, Ichirō Ogura, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'Japan in the 1940s. A high school boy went into a magic encounter with Ozuka Hana, a geisha (pub-girl) when he traveled through Amagi Pass. A mysterious murder took place afterwards, an Ozuka was held responsible. 40 years later, the boy, who became a printing shop owner, was visited by a retired policeman who came from Amagi Pass. The truth then started to reveal itself.', 'Japan in the 1940s. A high school boy went into a magic encounter with Ozuka Hana, a geisha (pub-girl) when he traveled through Amagi Pass. A mysterious murder took place afterwards, an Ozuka was held responsible. 40 years later, the boy, who became a printing shop owner, was visited by a retired policeman who came from Amagi Pass. The truth then started to reveal itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5DEOzJu0k84ihgfgJbvABQ3R3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208855'),
  ('526356003600248452', 'Amal', 2007, 'Drama', 'Richie Mehta', 'Shaun Mehta, Richie Mehta', 'Rupinder Nagra, Seema Biswas, Naseeruddin Shah, Koel Purie, Vik Sahay, Roshan Seth', null, 'Autorickshaw driver Amal is content with the small, but vital, role he serves - driving customers around New Delhi as quickly and safely as possible. But his sense of duty is tested by an eccentric, aging billionaire, who, moved by Amal''s humility, bequeaths him his entire estate before passing away. With only one month to discover and claim the inheritance, Amal''s struggles with duty and wealth are threatened by all those around him - from a young injured beggar girl and a lovely store merchant, to the danger of the old man''s upper-caste friends and siblings, all seeking to claim their share of the riches.', 'Autorickshaw driver Amal is content with the small, but vital, role he serves - driving customers around New Delhi as quickly and safely as possible. But his sense of duty is tested by an eccentric, aging billionaire, who, moved by Amal''s humility, bequeaths him his entire estate before passing away. With only one month to discover and claim the inheritance, Amal''s struggles with duty and wealth are threatened by all those around him - from a young injured beggar girl and a lovely store merchant, to the danger of the old man''s upper-caste friends and siblings, all seeking to claim their share of the riches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VlgLuSE7QRote3WnAtCF4Sb7vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25803'),
  ('811369152562064523', 'Amal', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jawad Rhalib, Lisa Willame, Charlotte Cristin', 'Jawad Rhalib, Chloé Léonil, David Lambert', 'Lubna Azabal, Fabrizio Rongione, Catherine Salée, Babetida Sadjo, Johan Heldenbergh, Ingrid Heiderscheidt, Malek Akhmiss, Kenza Benbouchta', null, 'An idealistic and passionate literature teacher in a suburban Brussels school becomes the target of intense hostility from students and colleagues tied to Islamic extremism when she chooses to help a teenage Muslim girl accused of homosexuality.', 'An idealistic and passionate literature teacher in a suburban Brussels school becomes the target of intense hostility from students and colleagues tied to Islamic extremism when she chooses to help a teenage Muslim girl accused of homosexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RhHl2sbbLsYY5bGyxaGDIbqinf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181011'),
  ('370762753645633907', 'Amalfi: Rewards of the Goddess', 2009, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Hideo Yamamoto, Hiroshi Nishitani', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Yuichi Shinpo', 'Yuji Oda, Yuki Amami, Erika Toda, Koichi Sato, Masaharu Fukuyama, Nene Otsuka, Atsushi Ito, Akira Onodera', null, 'A man arrives in the city upon news of a potential terrorist strike in Italy. He is Japanese foreign diplomat, Kosaku Kuroda, and he’s here under orders of his supervisor at the Foreign Ministry, Hiroshi Kataoka (Kiichi Nakai), to aid in the safeguarding of Japanese citizens. Kuroda’s main contacts at the Japanese embassy consist of Ambassador Kikuhara, Counselor Nishino, and fellow diplomatic envoys Haba and Tanimoto. All are busy preparing for the visit of Japanese Foreign Minister Kawagoe due to arrive for the high-profile G8 foreign minister’s meeting. Meanwhile, somewhere on the festively-lit streets of the city, a young Japanese girl has suddenly gone missing. Is it an abduction simply for ransom? Or could it be a prelude to terror?', 'A man arrives in the city upon news of a potential terrorist strike in Italy. He is Japanese foreign diplomat, Kosaku Kuroda, and he’s here under orders of his supervisor at the Foreign Ministry, Hiroshi Kataoka (Kiichi Nakai), to aid in the safeguarding of Japanese citizens. Kuroda’s main contacts at the Japanese embassy consist of Ambassador Kikuhara, Counselor Nishino, and fellow diplomatic envoys Haba and Tanimoto. All are busy preparing for the visit of Japanese Foreign Minister Kawagoe due to arrive for the high-profile G8 foreign minister’s meeting. Meanwhile, somewhere on the festively-lit streets of the city, a young Japanese girl has suddenly gone missing. Is it an abduction simply for ransom? Or could it be a prelude to terror?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lt5ZyFUktv5N7OvZV0pnc9OumD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46194'),
  ('453227775700327915', 'Amalgam', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Cuarón, Alfredo Altamirano', 'Carlos Cuarón, Luis Usabiaga', 'Manolo Cardona, Miguel Rodarte, Tony Dalton, Stephanie Cayo, Francis Cruz, Alejandro Calva, Ximena Herrera, Clement Dávila', null, 'Four dentists, three men and a woman, meet at a yearly dental convention in Mexico’s Mayan Riviera. While two of them are old friends and rivals, the other two have only gotten to know each other at past conventions.', 'Four dentists, three men and a woman, meet at a yearly dental convention in Mexico’s Mayan Riviera. While two of them are old friends and rivals, the other two have only gotten to know each other at past conventions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoBXUWujQdWtH3a5jwtIcn9z9vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755977'),
  ('181795573473135958', 'Amália', 2008, 'Drama, Music', 'Carlos Coelho da Silva, Carlos Santana', 'João Tordo', 'Sandra Barata Belo, Ricardo Carriço, José Fidalgo, António Pedro Cerdeira, Sofia Grillo, Ricardo Pereira, Adriano Carvalho, Carla de Sá', null, 'You already know the legendary singer. For the first time, you''ll get to know the woman behind the myth. The story of singing legend Amália Rodrigues who ruled the famous Portuguese acoustic guitar and vocals based music genre called fado.', 'You already know the legendary singer. For the first time, you''ll get to know the woman behind the myth. The story of singing legend Amália Rodrigues who ruled the famous Portuguese acoustic guitar and vocals based music genre called fado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W334WYqaWhNptfVDPvfuVoY8tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31294'),
  ('222018781458973469', 'Amanda', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mikhaël Hers, Sébastien Buchmann', 'Maud Ameline, Mikhaël Hers', 'Vincent Lacoste, Isaure Multrier, Stacy Martin, Ophélia Kolb, Marianne Basler, Jonathan Cohen, Greta Scacchi, Claire Tran', null, 'David, who gets by doing odd jobs, meets Léna, who has just moved up to Paris, and falls in love. But soon after, his life is brutally interrupted by the sudden death of his sister. Beyond the shock, and the pain, David now finds himself alone with his young niece Amanda to care for.', 'David, who gets by doing odd jobs, meets Léna, who has just moved up to Paris, and falls in love. But soon after, his life is brutally interrupted by the sudden death of his sister. Beyond the shock, and the pain, David now finds himself alone with his young niece Amanda to care for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyebNlYE2iV3D0xLrjMTigTuHmN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485166'),
  ('51634595706405430', 'Amanda', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lorenzo Levrini, Carolina Cavalli', 'Carolina Cavalli', 'Benedetta Porcaroli, Galatea Bellugi, Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Michele Bravi, Monica Nappo, Margherita Missoni, Ana Cecilia Ponce, Amelia Elisabetta Biuso', null, 'Amanda, 24, lives mostly isolated and has never had any friends, even if it''s the thing she wants the most. Amanda chooses her new mission as to convince her childhood friend to believe that they are still best friends.', 'Amanda, 24, lives mostly isolated and has never had any friends, even if it''s the thing she wants the most. Amanda chooses her new mission as to convince her childhood friend to believe that they are still best friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGWPFd71ygELIkPf9SjcOBkLAZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004642'),
  ('794879288312230128', 'Amanda & the Alien', 1998, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Romance', 'Gary Tieche, Jon Kroll, Athena Alexander', 'Jon Kroll', 'Nicole Eggert, Michael Bendetti, Stacy Keach, Michael Dorn, John Diehl, David Millbern, Dan O''Connor, Raymond D. Turner', 'R', 'Amanda, an employee at an upscale clothing store, is leading a relatively lonely and unremarkable life. All this changes when an alien that''s been held a secret military installation excapes by taking over the body of one of the base employees. Amanda finds the fugitive alien and decides to help it hide from the government agents chasing it, a seemingly easy task, as the alien must change host bodies every few days. Will she be able to help her new companion make a clean getaway?', 'Amanda, an employee at an upscale clothing store, is leading a relatively lonely and unremarkable life. All this changes when an alien that''s been held a secret military installation excapes by taking over the body of one of the base employees. Amanda finds the fugitive alien and decides to help it hide from the government agents chasing it, a seemingly easy task, as the alien must change host bodies every few days. Will she be able to help her new companion make a clean getaway?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAXSdJuKBYkaOv37V5FCWVO6QB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140176'),
  ('604698654530214024', 'Amanda Knox', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Rod Blackhurst, Brian McGinn, Rod Blackhurst', 'Matthew Hamachek, Brian McGinn', 'Amanda Knox, Raffaele Sollecito, Rudy Guede', null, 'This gripping, atmospheric documentary recounts the infamous trial, conviction and eventual acquittal of Seattle native Amanda Knox for the 2007 murder of a British exchange student in Italy.', 'This gripping, atmospheric documentary recounts the infamous trial, conviction and eventual acquittal of Seattle native Amanda Knox for the 2007 murder of a British exchange student in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/he85BGyoCi42KWtwkC2sXlqdkWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411009'),
  ('306808288594257527', 'Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Dornhelm, Gian Enrico Bianchi, Roy Bava', 'Wendy Battles', 'Hayden Panettiere, Vincent Riotta, Paolo Romio, Marcia Gay Harden, Amanda Fernando Stevens, Heather Cave, Djibril Kébé, Timothy Martin', null, 'Based on the events surrounding the murder of British student Meredith Kercher. Hayden Panettiere (Heroes) and Marcia Gay Harden (Academy Award winner for Pollock) star in the Lifetime Original Movie Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy based on the international headline-grabbing story of the now infamous American exchange student accused by Italian authorities of brutally killing her roommate. Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy poses the question of whether Knox (Panettiere), the Seattle honors student accused of murdering her college roommate Meredith Kercher (Amanda Fernando Stevens) in 2007 with her boyfriend Raffaele Sollecito (Paolo Romio) and acquaintance Rudy Guede (Djirbi Kebe), actually committed the crime or was herself a victim.', 'Based on the events surrounding the murder of British student Meredith Kercher. Hayden Panettiere (Heroes) and Marcia Gay Harden (Academy Award winner for Pollock) star in the Lifetime Original Movie Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy based on the international headline-grabbing story of the now infamous American exchange student accused by Italian authorities of brutally killing her roommate. Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy poses the question of whether Knox (Panettiere), the Seattle honors student accused of murdering her college roommate Meredith Kercher (Amanda Fernando Stevens) in 2007 with her boyfriend Raffaele Sollecito (Paolo Romio) and acquaintance Rudy Guede (Djirbi Kebe), actually committed the crime or was herself a victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9dqpOjKNt7V3wlGaFiJuYPsfF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58105'),
  ('177553122626892803', 'Amante para dos', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Alberto Olmedo, Tato Bores, Moria Casán, Estela Molly, Carlos del Burgo, Cristina Allende, Luisa Albinoni, Jorgelina Aranda', null, 'Mauricio and Alberto are friends and work in an insurance company. Apparently they have very dissimilar personalities, since Alberto is a hummingbird who lives courting as many women as he can and Mauricio is serious and lover of his wife. In reality, Mauricio maintains a hidden relationship with a vedette named Monica, who constantly puts him in trouble when he asks him to separate from his wife and go live with her. Alberto, aware of this, proposes to Mauricio that he pass his lover to him, and Monica becomes his stable lover. Mauricio and Alberto''s women become suspicious and everything gets complicated, and they come to the conclusion that keeping Monica is very dangerous for both of them.', 'Mauricio and Alberto are friends and work in an insurance company. Apparently they have very dissimilar personalities, since Alberto is a hummingbird who lives courting as many women as he can and Mauricio is serious and lover of his wife. In reality, Mauricio maintains a hidden relationship with a vedette named Monica, who constantly puts him in trouble when he asks him to separate from his wife and go live with her. Alberto, aware of this, proposes to Mauricio that he pass his lover to him, and Monica becomes his stable lover. Mauricio and Alberto''s women become suspicious and everything gets complicated, and they come to the conclusion that keeping Monica is very dangerous for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwJTRe6yW2ikvGDE9BfQiVfmAPy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367102'),
  ('1068353982056206331', 'Amante por excelencia', 2015, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Martín', 'Juan Carlos Martín', 'Javier De la Vega, Anna Cepinska, Luis Felipe Montoya, Oscar Traven, Sissi Ducoing, Elizabeth Valencia, Claudia Raya, Dulce Santana', null, 'Marco is a handsome man with an peculiar job: pleasing women who are willing to pay for his services. When Jenny, an upper-class woman tired of her marriage, meets Marco by chance, his life is in danger.', 'Marco is a handsome man with an peculiar job: pleasing women who are willing to pay for his services. When Jenny, an upper-class woman tired of her marriage, meets Marco by chance, his life is in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffYuaQLMnZ4eITx3VBdytFFs5y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:815979'),
  ('547492753400729396', 'Amapola', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Eugenio Zanetti, Ueli Steiger', 'Eugenio Zanetti', 'Camilla Belle, François Arnaud, Geraldine Chaplin, Elena Roger, Luciano Cáceres, Lito Cruz, Leonor Benedetto, Esmeralda Mitre', 'R', 'A romantic reimagining of William Shakespeare’s A Midsummer Night’s Dream set against the turbulent backdrops of the 1962 Argentinian military coup and the 1982 war for the Falkland Islands.', 'A romantic reimagining of William Shakespeare’s A Midsummer Night’s Dream set against the turbulent backdrops of the 1962 Argentinian military coup and the 1982 war for the Falkland Islands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gURbh0SDn56GqIt4l5VZr3GQkXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308425'),
  ('162030738109076955', 'Amar', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Luis Ernesto Franco, Diana García, Tony Dalton, María Aura, Martín Altomaro, Pedro Damián, Katharine Towne, Bruno Bichir', null, 'Five stories blend with love, sex, the emptiness of being unloved, passion and desire: Carlos and Susana go to some uncle´s apartment to make love. Meanwhile, Benito, an 80-year-old, performs a serenade to his wife. His neighbor Adela is told that her mother has Alzheimer and that she will be relocated since the Buenos Aires building she lives in will be demolished. Amado catches his son Carlos stealing his money. Gabriel asks Martha´s parents for her hand in marriage but they condition them to get married at their favorite church. And Patricia, 40, a creative agent, sexually abuses Joel, who directs a beer commercial.', 'Five stories blend with love, sex, the emptiness of being unloved, passion and desire: Carlos and Susana go to some uncle´s apartment to make love. Meanwhile, Benito, an 80-year-old, performs a serenade to his wife. His neighbor Adela is told that her mother has Alzheimer and that she will be relocated since the Buenos Aires building she lives in will be demolished. Amado catches his son Carlos stealing his money. Gabriel asks Martha´s parents for her hand in marriage but they condition them to get married at their favorite church. And Patricia, 40, a creative agent, sexually abuses Joel, who directs a beer commercial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGZgpYMBC3eIxQpYZt4DuZVAuek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44122'),
  ('929169817624740032', 'Amar a Morir', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fernando Lebrija, Masanobu Takayanagi', 'Fernando Lebrija, Harrison Reiner', 'Martina García, José María de Tavira, Alberto Estrella, Silverio Palacios, Luis Roberto Guzmán, José Sefami, Antonio Gaona, Jimena Guerra', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GQgjvDmTEm2Ns2rJv3MXmP0AIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44148'),
  ('760015114396829818', 'Amar Akbar Anthony', 1977, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Music, Crime', 'Manmohan Desai', 'K.K. Shukla, J.M. Desai', 'Vinod Khanna, Rishi Kapoor, Amitabh Bachchan, Parveen Babi, Shabana Azmi, Neetu Singh, Pran Sikand, Nirupa Roy', null, 'Three brothers, each raised in different religious households, reunite after many years in a chance encounter. They set out to take revenge on those responsible for separating them.', 'Three brothers, each raised in different religious households, reunite after many years in a chance encounter. They set out to take revenge on those responsible for separating them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnK0pJj3Ntk8P2ED5kuxwezzVph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38022'),
  ('821381328826518762', 'Amar no es Querer', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guillermo Barba', 'Guillermo Barba, Milly Cohen', 'Adriana Louvier, Tony Dalton, Benny Emmanuel, Adan Canto, Mayra Batalla', null, 'Jakie es una joven que disfruta de ayudar a los más necesitados, pero su esposo Samuel no comparte este sentimiento. El mundo de Jakie giraba alrededor de la ayuda a niños con cáncer en una clínica, el mundo de él giraba alrededor de los negocios, no le interesaba el altruismo de su mujer. Un trágico accidente deja en coma a Samuel, después de meses de espera Jackie decide seguir su vida y volverse a enamorar.', 'Jakie es una joven que disfruta de ayudar a los más necesitados, pero su esposo Samuel no comparte este sentimiento. El mundo de Jakie giraba alrededor de la ayuda a niños con cáncer en una clínica, el mundo de él giraba alrededor de los negocios, no le interesaba el altruismo de su mujer. Un trágico accidente deja en coma a Samuel, después de meses de espera Jackie decide seguir su vida y volverse a enamorar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl8KPgSce9W1dlLHNeykD2OdvzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96836'),
  ('879327717960580967', 'Amar Prem', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shakti Samanta, Aloke Dasgupta', 'Arabinda Mukhopadhyay', 'Sharmila Tagore, Rajesh Khanna, Madan Puri, Sujit Kumar, Vinod Mehra, Leela Mishra, Satyendra Kapoor, Rammohan Sharma', 'G', 'A village woman abandoned by her husband is forced into prostitution in Kolkata and forms nameless yet strong relations with a wealthy patron as well as an abused boy in the neighbourhood.', 'A village woman abandoned by her husband is forced into prostitution in Kolkata and forms nameless yet strong relations with a wealthy patron as well as an abused boy in the neighbourhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojV06b1ULi6PA1hJ3QsnhlX6N68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29534'),
  ('1036957232980996877', 'Amar Singh Chamkila', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Sylvester Fonseca, Mukesh Chhabra, Imtiaz Ali', 'Imtiaz Ali, Sajid Ali', 'Diljit Dosanjh, Parineeti Chopra, Apindereep Singh, Anjum Batra, Rahul Mittra, Nisha Bano, Udaybir Sandhu, Tushar Dutt', null, 'A humble singer’s brash lyrics ignite fame and fury across Punjab as he grapples with soaring success and brutal criticism before his untimely death.', 'A humble singer’s brash lyrics ignite fame and fury across Punjab as he grapples with soaring success and brutal criticism before his untimely death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9wSGgaPfbGUBBlne7xw8GaArvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086729'),
  ('104747642762076412', 'Amaram', 1991, 'Drama', 'Bharathan, Madhu Ambat', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mammootty, Maathu, Murali, Ashokan, KPAC Lalitha, Balan K Nair, Kuthiravattam Pappu', null, 'Achootty, an uneducated fisherman, wants his daughter Radha to be educated and also want her to become a doctor. His dreams get shattered when Radha falls in love with her childhood friend.', 'Achootty, an uneducated fisherman, wants his daughter Radha to be educated and also want her to become a doctor. His dreams get shattered when Radha falls in love with her childhood friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Lszw3GArY4v1NaPnwqOYM4KXRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237725'),
  ('71728394032798447', 'Amaran', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Adventure, War', 'C. H. Sai, Rajkumar Periasamy', 'Rajkumar Periasamy', 'Sivakarthikeyan, Sai Pallavi, Rahul Bose, Bhuvan Arora, Lallu Prasath, Shyam Mohan, Mir Salman, Shyamaprasad', null, 'A heroic true story of Major Mukund Varadarajan, an Indian Army officer who displayed extraordinary bravery during a counterterrorism mission in Kashmir’s Shopian district. The film captures his courage in protecting his nation and the devotion of his wife Indhu Rebecaa Varghese.', 'A heroic true story of Major Mukund Varadarajan, an Indian Army officer who displayed extraordinary bravery during a counterterrorism mission in Kashmir’s Shopian district. The film captures his courage in protecting his nation and the devotion of his wife Indhu Rebecaa Varghese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCB06m1KUGilEOlIzb40nkQhVY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927342'),
  ('643981859405837091', 'Amarkalam', 1999, 'Action, Romance, Drama', 'Saran', 'Saran', 'Ajith Kumar, Shalini, Raghuvaran, Nassar, Ambika, Radikaa Sarathkumar, Vinu Chakravarthy, Charle', null, 'Vasu is a tough street crook who lives at a movie theater. One day while transporting the reels of a new film, he clashes with a music student Mohana. Mohana is the daughter of the Police Commissioner, who Tulsidas an ex-gang leader released from jail has an old grudge against. He tells Vasu to kidnap Mohana for two days in order to ruin the family''s honor. While being held captive by Vasu, Mohana falls in love with him after hearing him sing. Vasu rejects her love, but on learning of it, Tulsidas pays him to pretend to be in love with her. By the time Tulsidas learns that his enmity with the police commissioner is false and tells Vasu to stay away from Mohana it is too late, Vasu''s love has become real.', 'Vasu is a tough street crook who lives at a movie theater. One day while transporting the reels of a new film, he clashes with a music student Mohana. Mohana is the daughter of the Police Commissioner, who Tulsidas an ex-gang leader released from jail has an old grudge against. He tells Vasu to kidnap Mohana for two days in order to ruin the family''s honor. While being held captive by Vasu, Mohana falls in love with him after hearing him sing. Vasu rejects her love, but on learning of it, Tulsidas pays him to pretend to be in love with her. By the time Tulsidas learns that his enmity with the police commissioner is false and tells Vasu to stay away from Mohana it is too late, Vasu''s love has become real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m811mOJFIGSmf2vGbPRhwhgngaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69427'),
  ('711185317189271971', 'Amarsi un po''...', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Cirillo', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Claudio Amendola, Tahnee Welch, Riccardo Garrone, Virna Lisi, Mario Brega, Fabrizio Bracconeri, Nicoletta Elmi, Giacomo Rosselli', null, 'In an accident the young mechanic Marco Coccia meets Cristiana. The two fall in love with one another. Cristiana confesses only later that she is a genuine princess. For Marco it is not a problem, but for Cristiana''s parents it is a very big problem. The two must separate. When one evening Cristiana calls Marco and lets him know about her forthcoming wedding, Marco with the car races toward Paris and has an accident...', 'In an accident the young mechanic Marco Coccia meets Cristiana. The two fall in love with one another. Cristiana confesses only later that she is a genuine princess. For Marco it is not a problem, but for Cristiana''s parents it is a very big problem. The two must separate. When one evening Cristiana calls Marco and lets him know about her forthcoming wedding, Marco with the car races toward Paris and has an accident...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHYq4CXe2oSlF3BlxFeFgb8XUW9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58087'),
  ('304363366159615075', 'Amatemi', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Renato De Maria, Alessandro Feira Chios, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Francesco Piccolo, Renato De Maria', 'Isabella Ferrari, Pierfrancesco Favino, Donatella Finocchiaro, Branko Đurić, Marco Giallini, Marco Cocci, Giampaolo Morelli, Camilla Filippi', null, 'Married for most of her adult life, Nina plunges into depression after being suddenly deserted by her husband. Eventually, she''ll find a way out by having multiple affairs with strangers.', 'Married for most of her adult life, Nina plunges into depression after being suddenly deserted by her husband. Eventually, she''ll find a way out by having multiple affairs with strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpXclWkyqhGpvxwTrjdPvHRsbIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156591'),
  ('267536928024108699', 'Amateur', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ryan Koo', 'Ryan Koo', 'Michael Rainey Jr., Josh Charles, Sharon Leal, Brian J. White, Corey Parker Robinson, Ashlee Brian, Tekola Cornetet, Ted Maritz', 'R', '14-year-old basketball phenom Terron Forte has to navigate the under-the-table world of amateur athletics when he is recruited to an elite NCAA prep school.', '14-year-old basketball phenom Terron Forte has to navigate the under-the-table world of amateur athletics when he is recruited to an elite NCAA prep school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWUvlNxKSMdegAoY5eMOqPwMKIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515333'),
  ('817154173813766933', 'Amateur Night', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lisa Addario, Joe Syracuse, Cody Boesen', 'Lisa Addario, Joe Syracuse', 'Jason Biggs, Janet Montgomery, Jenny Mollen, Ashley French, Bria L. Murphy, Steven Weber, Adrian Voo, Robert Hoffman', 'NR', 'Guy Carter, an insecure expectant father unable to find work in his field, accepts a job driving hookers around Los Angeles. One long and crazy evening proves to our hero that he is, in fact, up to the task of fatherhood.', 'Guy Carter, an insecure expectant father unable to find work in his field, accepts a job driving hookers around Los Angeles. One long and crazy evening proves to our hero that he is, in fact, up to the task of fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzJFu1F0miZKHbR7tRIX6cQcI8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376581'),
  ('21320263558822872', 'Amateur Porn Star Killer', 2006, 'Horror, Crime', 'Shane Ryan-Reid, Shane Ryan-Reid, Michiko Jimenez', 'Shane Ryan-Reid, Michiko Jimenez', 'Shane Ryan-Reid, Michiko Jimenez, Jan Gould', null, 'The unofficial story of a killer who kidnaps and kills three girls is told through the tale of his last victim, ''Amateur Porn Star Killer'' is about a girl he picks up on the street and convinces to go back to his hotel room. The girl is shy, unnerved, and yet unable to take herself out of a bad situation. The killer is a guy who seems at first nothing more than your standard, 18 year old pervert with a penchant for filming his sexual escapades. An unsettling darkness descends.', 'The unofficial story of a killer who kidnaps and kills three girls is told through the tale of his last victim, ''Amateur Porn Star Killer'' is about a girl he picks up on the street and convinces to go back to his hotel room. The girl is shy, unnerved, and yet unable to take herself out of a bad situation. The killer is a guy who seems at first nothing more than your standard, 18 year old pervert with a penchant for filming his sexual escapades. An unsettling darkness descends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXSlkLk6UIi9Qsth5gKyw9DNB24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35733'),
  ('612806774942929803', 'Amateur Teens', 2015, 'Drama', 'Niklaus Hilber, Tobias Dengler, Rémy Majer', 'Patrick Tönz, Niklaus Hilber', 'Fabrizio Borsani, Jérôme Humm, Benjamin Dangel, Annina Walt, Chiara Carla Bär, Luna Wedler, Cem Kütükcüoglu, Zoë Pastelle Holthuizen', null, 'A group of normal 14-year-old teenagers at a secondary school in Zürich with the normal yearnings for love and acceptance. But the power of social media, with its high-gloss selfies and perpetual pressure towards cooler and sexier, increasingly forces the kids to deny their true feelings. So a tragedy runs its course, one in which it is almost impossible to differentiate between perpetrator and victim, guilt and innocence.', 'A group of normal 14-year-old teenagers at a secondary school in Zürich with the normal yearnings for love and acceptance. But the power of social media, with its high-gloss selfies and perpetual pressure towards cooler and sexier, increasingly forces the kids to deny their true feelings. So a tragedy runs its course, one in which it is almost impossible to differentiate between perpetrator and victim, guilt and innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeITRQv73iIsZrD4HOmg7dHr2F4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356814'),
  ('1106468678574913018', 'Amazing - Fabio de Luigi', 2023, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Alessio Muzi, Massimo Schiavon', null, 'Fabio De Luigi, Virginia Raffaele, Elio, Giorgio Gherarducci, Marco Santin, Carlo Cracco, Diego Abatantuono, Marco Mengoni', null, 'Comic actor Fabio De Luigi is about to have a very special evening: he has received a lifetime achievement award, but he is so shy that he would do without it, avoiding celebrations that are embarrassing to him. In spite of himself, he finds himself in a luxurious hotel starring in a night in which he will discover, along with the audience, that the award is an expedient for a comic and dreamlike journey among prestigious friends and unexpected surprises, all the way to the stage and the well-deserved statuette.', 'Comic actor Fabio De Luigi is about to have a very special evening: he has received a lifetime achievement award, but he is so shy that he would do without it, avoiding celebrations that are embarrassing to him. In spite of himself, he finds himself in a luxurious hotel starring in a night in which he will discover, along with the audience, that the award is an expedient for a comic and dreamlike journey among prestigious friends and unexpected surprises, all the way to the stage and the well-deserved statuette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeA6jITAPEkRWQJ510OYXMGwUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200613'),
  ('62253386352092404', 'Amazing Elisa', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sadrac González-Perellón', 'Sadrac González-Perellón', 'Jana San Antonio, Silvia Abascal, Asier Etxeandia, Ivan Massagué, Milo Taboada, Blanca Valletbó, Claudia Bouza', null, 'Elisa is a twelve-year-old girl who, after her mother’s accidental death, tries to convince her father that she has been gifted the same superpowers as the heroine from her favorite comic and that she can use them to take revenge on whoever was responsible for the fatal accidenti.', 'Elisa is a twelve-year-old girl who, after her mother’s accidental death, tries to convince her father that she has been gifted the same superpowers as the heroine from her favorite comic and that she can use them to take revenge on whoever was responsible for the fatal accidenti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aV9m5UnvvqmPhyS8cMOXfta9Kfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002482'),
  ('495277063565872463', 'Amazing Grace', 2006, 'Drama', 'Michael Apted, Remi Adefarasin', 'Steven Knight', 'Ioan Gruffudd, Romola Garai, Benedict Cumberbatch, Albert Finney, Michael Gambon, Rufus Sewell, Youssou N''Dour, Ciarán Hinds', 'PG', 'The true story of William Wilberforce and his courageous quest to end the British slave trade. Along the way, Wilberforce meets intense opposition, but his minister urges him to see the cause through.', 'The true story of William Wilberforce and his courageous quest to end the British slave trade. Along the way, Wilberforce meets intense opposition, but his minister urges him to see the cause through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zr48JEuwxcYM03NcdJU6qWMHPtq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15163'),
  ('1014913259614412738', 'Amazing Grace', 2018, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alan Elliott', null, null, 'G', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary about the recording of Aretha Franklin''s best-selling album finally sees the light of day more than four decades after the original footage was shot.', 'A behind-the-scenes documentary about the recording of Aretha Franklin''s best-selling album finally sees the light of day more than four decades after the original footage was shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eABsBr5TnW8FBSSSsAKFnwDW1BW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356199'),
  ('587013032348104695', 'Amazing Grace and Chuck', 1987, 'Drama', 'Robert Elswit, Mike Newell', 'David Field', 'Joshua Zuehlke, Alex English, Jamie Lee Curtis, William Petersen, Gregory Peck, Harvey Martin, Michael Bowen, J.P. Gabriel', 'PG', 'Average American boy Chuck Murdock goes on a school outing to a nuclear weapons facility, where he learns about the destructive power that sits at the fingertips of the military. Knowing that the world could end with the push of a button, he protests against nuclear war by walking out on his Little League team during a game. Chuck''s stunt ends up in the local paper, and as the story snowballs, basketball star "Amazing Grace" Smith decides to boycott sports, too.', 'Average American boy Chuck Murdock goes on a school outing to a nuclear weapons facility, where he learns about the destructive power that sits at the fingertips of the military. Knowing that the world could end with the push of a button, he protests against nuclear war by walking out on his Little League team during a game. Chuck''s stunt ends up in the local paper, and as the story snowballs, basketball star "Amazing Grace" Smith decides to boycott sports, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEp2ZuH22RN4uPXRX6Y40XCcqWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74340'),
  ('281359441208905022', 'Amazing Racer', 2009, 'Family', 'Frank E. Johnson, Dean Cundey', 'Linda Morris, Larry Richert, John Mowod', 'Julianne Michelle, Daryl Hannah, Michael Madsen, Joanna Pacula, Eric Roberts, Scott Eastwood, Krista Allen, Claire Forlani', 'PG', 'After the sudden death of her father leaves a teenage girl without a family, she becomes lost in her own anger and sadness. Her family doctor informs her that her father had a secret, that the mother she never knew was alive and well. When she travels to meet her, she befriends a horse trainer and discovers that in caring for the horse, she is able to overcome her hardships and emotional trauma. Together they begin to win many races and upset the favorites, owned by an egocentric mogul . Through the victories and new friendships she forms, she learns to find her way back to happiness.', 'After the sudden death of her father leaves a teenage girl without a family, she becomes lost in her own anger and sadness. Her family doctor informs her that her father had a secret, that the mother she never knew was alive and well. When she travels to meet her, she befriends a horse trainer and discovers that in caring for the horse, she is able to overcome her hardships and emotional trauma. Together they begin to win many races and upset the favorites, owned by an egocentric mogul . Through the victories and new friendships she forms, she learns to find her way back to happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvaUUhYMBkUwOKvoIFhVELT9FB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157763'),
  ('708157201492681574', 'Amazing Stories', 1986, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Horror', 'William Dear, Steven Spielberg, Robert Zemeckis', null, 'Kevin Costner, Christopher Lloyd, Casey Siemaszko, Kiefer Sutherland, J.J. Cohen, John Philbin, Gary Mauro, Glen Mauro', null, 'A feature film edited from three episodes of Amazing Stories (1985): The Mission, Mummy Daddy, and Go to the Head of the Class.', 'A feature film edited from three episodes of Amazing Stories (1985): The Mission, Mummy Daddy, and Go to the Head of the Class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XJb9oEnpLtMoOx4Za6JVMA8vqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576510'),
  ('684822342102185085', 'Amazing Winter Romance', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Charles Lavack, Jason Bourque', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Jessy Schram, Marshall Williams, Zoe Fish, Paul Magel, Nancy Sorel, Kate Yacula, Daina Leitold, Stephanie Sy', null, 'When journalist Julia goes back home to find inspiration, she discovers her childhood friend has built a giant snow maze which prompts her to find her way to true love.', 'When journalist Julia goes back home to find inspiration, she discovers her childhood friend has built a giant snow maze which prompts her to find her way to true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WCT88z4TZOK1JXjXHc6jSORLVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656850'),
  ('244240662486323056', 'Amazon', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Timo Salminen', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Richard Reitinger', 'Kari Väänänen, Robert Davi, Rae Dawn Chong, Minna Sovio, Aili Sovio, Pirkko Hämäläinen, Expedito Barreira, Ana Mel', null, 'Widowed and broke Finnish businessman Kari takes his two teenage daughters with him to Brazil. A bush pilot introduces him to the idea of gold mining in the jungle, but a beautiful and educated local woman warns him about the possible consequences to the rain forest. Kari has mixed feelings about the project, until an accident puts him in the care of a local Indian tribe.', 'Widowed and broke Finnish businessman Kari takes his two teenage daughters with him to Brazil. A bush pilot introduces him to the idea of gold mining in the jungle, but a beautiful and educated local woman warns him about the possible consequences to the rain forest. Kari has mixed feelings about the project, until an accident puts him in the care of a local Indian tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hKw5mBCeg7zbADw67b1BElopr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134705'),
  ('280141221189488183', 'Amazon', 1997, 'Documentary', 'Kieth Merrill, Mike Hoover', 'Kieth Merrill, Loren McIntyre', 'Linda Hunt, Adrian Villanueva, Jesse Corti, Sydney Possuelo, Mark Plotkin', null, 'Explore the mysterious Amazon through the amazing IMAX experience. Amazon celebrates the beauty, vitality and wonder of the rapidly disappearing rain forest.', 'Explore the mysterious Amazon through the amazing IMAX experience. Amazon celebrates the beauty, vitality and wonder of the rapidly disappearing rain forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbd9b6V8kPfIquM7XLwN8yvUnbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13796'),
  ('1019899656188149912', 'Amazon', 2000, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean-François Robin, Denis Berghone', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Arielle Dombasle, Patrick Bouchitey, André Penvern, Thylda Barès, Carlos Padrón, Fernando Hechavarría, Jackie de la Nuez', null, 'On an observatory set high on a mountain, astronomers make a stunning discovery somewhere out in the galaxy. A flying object in the depths of the cosmos is showing signs of life, emitting an intelligent signal. The UFO has just landed on Earth somewhere in the midst of a rainforest. Margot, the enthusiastic young woman heading up the research team, decides to go to the spot and check out this phenomenon. Meanwhile Edouard, our hero, studies the flora and fauna of the tree tops in the rainforest. He perches on an enormous net that stretches over the still pure, unadulterated forest that spreads out beneath him. He discovers a naked little twelve-year old girl seated on the net. He covers her with a broad banana leaf and asks where she comes from. She quickly replies, in perfect French ''from another world''.', 'On an observatory set high on a mountain, astronomers make a stunning discovery somewhere out in the galaxy. A flying object in the depths of the cosmos is showing signs of life, emitting an intelligent signal. The UFO has just landed on Earth somewhere in the midst of a rainforest. Margot, the enthusiastic young woman heading up the research team, decides to go to the spot and check out this phenomenon. Meanwhile Edouard, our hero, studies the flora and fauna of the tree tops in the rainforest. He perches on an enormous net that stretches over the still pure, unadulterated forest that spreads out beneath him. He discovers a naked little twelve-year old girl seated on the net. He covers her with a broad banana leaf and asks where she comes from. She quickly replies, in perfect French ''from another world''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sCHH8MXGUz0n71maDNECyp71NZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81040'),
  ('520501681226089810', 'Amazon Bullseye', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Chang-ju, Hong Jae-sik, Cho Sung-hyun', 'Bae Se-young', 'Ryu Seung-ryong, Jin Sun-kyu, Igor Pedroso, Luan Brum, J.B. Oliveira, Yeom Hye-ran, Go Kyung-pyo, Jun Suk-ho', null, 'Once an Olympic medalist in archery but now the top target for restructuring, Jin-bong heads to the Amazon to seize one last chance offered by his company. After barely surviving a life-threatening ordeal, Jin-bong arrives in the Amazon, where he meets three warriors with god-given archery skills: Sika, Eba, and Walbu! Believing he has found a way to save himself, Jin-bong teams up with Bbang-sik, a Korean-Bolédorian interpreter, and brings the three archery masters to Korea… Now, Jin-bong’s comeback depends entirely on the Amazon trio!', 'Once an Olympic medalist in archery but now the top target for restructuring, Jin-bong heads to the Amazon to seize one last chance offered by his company. After barely surviving a life-threatening ordeal, Jin-bong arrives in the Amazon, where he meets three warriors with god-given archery skills: Sika, Eba, and Walbu! Believing he has found a way to save himself, Jin-bong teams up with Bbang-sik, a Korean-Bolédorian interpreter, and brings the three archery masters to Korea… Now, Jin-bong’s comeback depends entirely on the Amazon trio!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCjySaFZBQASHASRAQFbe7XrJKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148558'),
  ('1151972915142489845', 'Amazon Jail', 1982, 'Thriller, Adventure, Action', 'Oswaldo de Oliveira, Gyula Kolozsvary, Alberto Gieco', 'Oswaldo de Oliveira, Alfredo Palácios', 'Elizabeth Hartmann, Maurício do Valle, Sandra Graffi, Lígia de Paula, Elys Cardoso, Shirley Benny, Márcia Fraga, Regina Lopes', 'NR', 'Young women in the Amazon are kidnapped by a ring of devil-worshipers, who plan to sell them as sex slaves. Some of the women escape, but are pursued into the jungle by their captors. The women must band together to turn the tables on their kidnappers.', 'Young women in the Amazon are kidnapped by a ring of devil-worshipers, who plan to sell them as sex slaves. Some of the women escape, but are pursued into the jungle by their captors. The women must band together to turn the tables on their kidnappers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob0TfLdSvNvRCPM09a9E4iAbugX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80785'),
  ('781272138945077700', 'Amazon Music Live with Peso Pluma', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Micah Bickham', null, 'Peso Pluma', null, 'Peso Pluma takes on Apple Music Live!', 'Peso Pluma takes on Apple Music Live!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXBVNz4KvKMJD1OE5jmP84SFMoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1194028'),
  ('755163888183107560', 'Amazon Women on the Moon', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Joe Dante, Carl Gottlieb, Peter Horton', 'Michael Barrie, Jim Mulholland', 'Arsenio Hall, Donald F. Muhich, Monique Gabrielle, Lou Jacobi, Erica Yohn, Debbi A. Davison, Rob Krausz, Phil Hartman', 'R', 'Centered on a television station which features a 1950s-style sci-fi movie interspersed with a series of wild commercials, wacky shorts and weird specials, this lampoon of contemporary life and pop culture skewers some of the silliest spectacles ever created in the name of entertainment.', 'Centered on a television station which features a 1950s-style sci-fi movie interspersed with a series of wild commercials, wacky shorts and weird specials, this lampoon of contemporary life and pop culture skewers some of the silliest spectacles ever created in the name of entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p77UlHHzyBUCKgdbLosrAnltDgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5709'),
  ('922340709735820535', 'Amazonia', 2013, 'Family, Adventure', 'Thierry Ragobert, Gustavo Hadba, Jérôme Bouvier', 'Johanne Bernard, Luiz Bolognesi, Louis-Paul Desanges', 'Martin Sheen, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Isabelle Drummond, Billy Dobson, Ana Sofia Clara, Maria Jark, Nico Roberto Billy, Nico Roberto Bart', 'G', 'After a plane crash, Saï, a capuchin monkey born and raised in captivity, finds himself alone and lost in the wilderness of the Amazon jungle.', 'After a plane crash, Saï, a capuchin monkey born and raised in captivity, finds himself alone and lost in the wilderness of the Amazon jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f9aXXuLvjrH9GfD7Fr12bjoXwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214418'),
  ('709745860293751844', 'Amazonia: The Catherine Miles Story', 1985, 'Adventure, Drama, Horror', 'Mario Gariazzo, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Franco Prosperi', 'Elvire Audray, Will Gonzales, Andrea Coppola, Dick Campbell, Dick Marshall, Alma Vernon, Grace Williams, Sara Fleszer', 'R', 'A young woman seeks vengeance and finds love when her parents are killed in the Amazon and she is taken prisoner by an indigenous tribe of headhunters.', 'A young woman seeks vengeance and finds love when her parents are killed in the Amazon and she is taken prisoner by an indigenous tribe of headhunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvRjoKZkHgZxP7I9QY45Gw8M5hE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28676'),
  ('439835619316862602', 'Amazons', 1986, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Alejandro Sessa, Leonardo Rodríguez Solís', 'Charles R. Saunders', 'Ty Randolph, Penelope Reed, Joseph Whipp, Danitza Kingsley, Jacques Arndt, Wolfram Hecht, Charles Finch, Francisco Cocuzza', 'PG', 'An epic from the dark ages about the legendary lost tribe of warrior women! The girls fly into danger, come up against fierce tribes, fall prey to sorcery, put to rest a family rivalry of centuries past and battle to victory!', 'An epic from the dark ages about the legendary lost tribe of warrior women! The girls fly into danger, come up against fierce tribes, fall prey to sorcery, put to rest a family rivalry of centuries past and battle to victory!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYiwXG8UBkSSbtiDiZH48aEZYLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48180'),
  ('865133617998848734', 'Ámbar', 2020, 'Drama', 'Esteban Ramírez, Sebastián Gallo', 'Esteban Ramírez, Agustina Liendo', 'Jorge Marrale, Paula Sartor, Agustín Pardella, Freddy Viquez, Alex Costa, Giulliana Seravalli, Michelle Jones', null, 'Helmut has been working as a private investigator in San José for almost ten years. One night he receives a call from his ex-partner: their teenage daughter, Ámbar, is in a coma as a result of a run over. After fifteen years without knowing anything about Ámbar, Helmut discovers unusual circumstances surrounding the supposed traffic accident, which will result in an obsessive investigation that will force him to face his lost fatherhood.', 'Helmut has been working as a private investigator in San José for almost ten years. One night he receives a call from his ex-partner: their teenage daughter, Ámbar, is in a coma as a result of a run over. After fifteen years without knowing anything about Ámbar, Helmut discovers unusual circumstances surrounding the supposed traffic accident, which will result in an obsessive investigation that will force him to face his lost fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2M8g7GptuaIQ7dZnlcnRGXoXX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775906'),
  ('1037192136640353523', 'Amber Alert', 2012, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kerry Bellessa', 'Joshua Oram, Kerry Bellessa', 'Jasen Wade, Summer Bellessa, Chris Hill, Caleb Thompson, Brooke Thompson, Tom Murray', null, 'When a group of friends decides to follow a car they''ve seen posted on an Amber Alert, things start to go very wrong.', 'When a group of friends decides to follow a car they''ve seen posted on an Amber Alert, things start to go very wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jP8nszewPaJvSPprobpItyRbsB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135670'),
  ('520136203865697273', 'Amber Alert', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kerry Bellessa, Luka Bazeli', 'Kerry Bellessa, Joshua Oram', 'Hayden Panettiere, Tyler James Williams, Kevin Dunn, Saidah Arrika Ekulona, Kurt Oberhaus, Katie McClellan, Ducky Cash, Claire Slemmer', 'PG-13', 'A ride-share turns into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse after it follows a car fitting the description of an AMBER Alert.', 'A ride-share turns into a high-stakes game of cat and mouse after it follows a car fitting the description of an AMBER Alert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sI0WxsgVFE5RkPA7G6PznWRxBEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248753'),
  ('252599931114828162', 'Ambiguous', 2003, 'Drama', 'Toshiya Ueno, Yasumasa Konishi', 'Hidekazu Takahara', 'Hidehisa Ebata, Noriko Murayama, Nikki Sasaki, Minami Aoyama, Akio Kurauchi, Yohta Kawase, Suzuka Takaki, Mika Ogawa', null, 'Five suicidal people meet on the Internet and form a ''suicide group''. They arrange to meet at one of the member''s homes to spend their last hours together.', 'Five suicidal people meet on the Internet and form a ''suicide group''. They arrange to meet at one of the member''s homes to spend their last hours together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL29Xp2vRdViu6vsqVbBevSxRAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67235'),
  ('879267878154132867', 'Ambition', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller', 'Hal Hartley', 'George Feaster, Hannah Sullivan, Rick Groel, James McCauley, David Troup, Chris Buck, Bill Sage, Bob Gosse', null, 'Follows a day in the life of a young artist who longs for professional success and the attention of beautiful women, but who encounters only frustration and violence.', 'Follows a day in the life of a young artist who longs for professional success and the attention of beautiful women, but who encounters only frustration and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCpXVBhpChgS8U5tTume0zVkZhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162480'),
  ('351055557679900652', 'Ambition', 2014, 'Science Fiction, History, Mystery', 'Tomek Bagiński, Wojciech Zieliński', 'Afolabi Kuti, Tomek Bagiński', 'Aidan Gillen, Aisling Franciosi', null, 'A young apprentice struggles to master nanotechnology on an alien world and prove herself to her enigmatic master. Will her herculean goals remain tantalizingly out of reach, or will she fulfill them and in the process, change life as we know it?', 'A young apprentice struggles to master nanotechnology on an alien world and prove herself to her enigmatic master. Will her herculean goals remain tantalizingly out of reach, or will she fulfill them and in the process, change life as we know it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42WGSYe1jVTf2EucWPaT1ykVW1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298077'),
  ('684848832579069840', 'Ambitious', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Catherine Corsini, Hélène Louvart, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Catherine Corsini, Benoît Graffin, Cédric Kahn', 'Karin Viard, Éric Caravaca, Jacques Weber, Gilles Cohen, Hélène Babu, Jacqueline Danno, Claire Maurier, Chantal Neuwirth', null, 'On the one hand you have Judith Zahn, an arrogant, snobbish, Parisian editor. On the other hand meet Julien Demarsay: an insecure, timid, young bookseller from the East of France who has just written his first autobiographic novel, with what it takes of navel-contemplating and soul-searching. What do they have in common? Nothing much, except that sex will unite them, ambition part them before true love is born between them at last.', 'On the one hand you have Judith Zahn, an arrogant, snobbish, Parisian editor. On the other hand meet Julien Demarsay: an insecure, timid, young bookseller from the East of France who has just written his first autobiographic novel, with what it takes of navel-contemplating and soul-searching. What do they have in common? Nothing much, except that sex will unite them, ambition part them before true love is born between them at last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOOEg5RyFsaYtLBtVhEo41xGUly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57306'),
  ('185081224462084740', 'Amblin''', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Steven Spielberg, Allen Daviau', 'Steven Spielberg', 'Pamela McMyler, Richard Levin, Henry Axelrod', 'R', 'Two wanderers, a young man and a young woman, meet in the desert and decide to travel on together. The two travellers walk and hitch-hike their way down the road to their destination, the beach, becoming friends and lovers.', 'Two wanderers, a young man and a young woman, meet in the desert and decide to travel on together. The two travellers walk and hitch-hike their way down the road to their destination, the beach, becoming friends and lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1By3fBCDxIkkeLIY3Vn2p1i0agC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97105'),
  ('483574919437088109', 'Ambulance', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Roberto De Angelis, Jace Ford, Gary McMonnies', 'Lars Andreas Pedersen, Laurits Munch-Petersen', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Eiza González, Garret Dillahunt, Keir O''Donnell, Jackson White, Olivia Stambouliah, Moses Ingram', 'R', 'Decorated veteran Will Sharp, desperate for money to cover his wife''s medical bills, asks for help from his adoptive brother Danny. A charismatic career criminal, Danny instead offers him a score: the biggest bank heist in Los Angeles history: $32 million.', 'Decorated veteran Will Sharp, desperate for money to cover his wife''s medical bills, asks for help from his adoptive brother Danny. A charismatic career criminal, Danny instead offers him a score: the biggest bank heist in Los Angeles history: $32 million.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUbgg3mMSbY9PlpTxBo4IFUVSd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763285'),
  ('1124922610783495207', 'Ambush', 1950, 'Western', 'Sam Wood, Harold Lipstein', 'Marguerite Roberts', 'Robert Taylor, John Hodiak, Arlene Dahl, Don Taylor, Jean Hagen, Leon Ames, Chief Thundercloud, Ray Teal', null, 'A Westerner searches for a white woman held by the Apaches.', 'A Westerner searches for a white woman held by the Apaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmmfwAJH1AxV6moF8cqJPdgFfMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151310'),
  ('915526719558200928', 'Ambush', 1973, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Ho Meng-Hua, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Patrick Kong Yeung', 'Li Ching, Chao Hsiung, Yang Chi-Ching, Wang Hsieh, Dean Shek Tin, Kong Ling, Tung Lam, Lee Pang-Fei', null, 'An officer of the law and his father are framed for a robbery they did not commit. With only his father''s sword at the scene and the man nowhere to be found the officer flees in order to discover who really stole the jewels so that he may clear the family name.', 'An officer of the law and his father are framed for a robbery they did not commit. With only his father''s sword at the scene and the man nowhere to be found the officer flees in order to discover who really stole the jewels so that he may clear the family name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY64qdSXcKLiFtK8p5z8EB5zfrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107891'),
  ('433055296372716776', 'Ambush', 1999, 'Drama, War', 'Olli Saarela, Kjell Lagerroos', 'Antti Tuuri', 'Peter Franzén, Irina Björklund, Kari Heiskanen, Kari Väänänen, Tommi Eronen, Taisto Reimaluoto, Pekka Heikkinen, Pekka Huotari', null, 'It is the summer of 1941 and the Finnish army has been mobilized along the border with Russia. A platoon led by Lt. Eero Perkola is waiting for orders to go on the offensive. The platoon receives orders for a recon mission through the wilderness around the Lieksa lake to search for possible Russian defensive positions.', 'It is the summer of 1941 and the Finnish army has been mobilized along the border with Russia. A platoon led by Lt. Eero Perkola is waiting for orders to go on the offensive. The platoon receives orders for a recon mission through the wilderness around the Lieksa lake to search for possible Russian defensive positions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fVl9Sw94BIv5MMr0Rn5nqh9cCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49320'),
  ('947897482753391779', 'Ambush', 2001, 'Action', 'John Frankenheimer, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Clive Owen, Tomas Milian, Franklin Dennis Jones', null, 'While escorting an elderly man to an undisclosed location, The Driver is confronted by a van full of armed men and is warned that the old man has stolen a large amount of diamonds. The old man claims to have swallowed the diamonds and that the men will likely cut him open to retrieve them. The Driver decides at the last minute to help him, participating in a car chase and shootout with the van. The Driver eventually evades his pursuers and watches their destruction. He then delivers the old man to a town nearby and asks the merchant if he did indeed swallowed the diamonds. The client merely chuckles and walks away. The Driver then leaves.', 'While escorting an elderly man to an undisclosed location, The Driver is confronted by a van full of armed men and is warned that the old man has stolen a large amount of diamonds. The old man claims to have swallowed the diamonds and that the men will likely cut him open to retrieve them. The Driver decides at the last minute to help him, participating in a car chase and shootout with the van. The Driver eventually evades his pursuers and watches their destruction. He then delivers the old man to a town nearby and asks the merchant if he did indeed swallowed the diamonds. The client merely chuckles and walks away. The Driver then leaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLgVJm9ArF3mPCDIe9dzWQtfW3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38183'),
  ('824679941006390712', 'Ambush', 2023, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Mark Burman, Dan Frantz, Ana María Cabrera', 'Johnny Lozano, Michael McClung, Mark Burman', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Connor Paolo, Aaron Eckhart, Mara Lane, Patrick Walker, Jason Genao, Mac Brandt, Jordan Johnson-Hinds', 'R', 'When a small outpost is ambushed, a US Army squad must take the battle below ground on a high-stakes mission in a new type of warfare the likes of which they have never seen.', 'When a small outpost is ambushed, a US Army squad must take the battle below ground on a high-stakes mission in a new type of warfare the likes of which they have never seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QjtDMS7PB4SMj0nAJQiE86Lo0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1074034'),
  ('90152737533870948', 'Ambush at Cimarron Pass', 1958, 'Action, War, Western', 'Jodie Copelan, John M. Nickolaus Jr.', 'Richard G. Taylor, John K. Butler', 'Scott Brady, Margia Dean, Clint Eastwood, Irving Bacon, Frank Gerstle, Ray Boyle, Baynes Barron, William Vaughn', 'NR', 'A small Army patrol unit and a couple of former Confederates reluctantly throw in their lot together after being attacked by a band of Native Americans.', 'A small Army patrol unit and a couple of former Confederates reluctantly throw in their lot together after being attacked by a band of Native Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKCGCnLeqDx0FG7yjElapALJsAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112672'),
  ('1080749259444574504', 'Ambush at Tomahawk Gap', 1953, 'Western, Action', 'Fred F. Sears, James Nicholson, Ross DiMaggio', 'David Lang', 'John Hodiak, John Derek, David Brian, María Elena Marqués, Ray Teal, John Qualen, Otto Hulett, Percy Helton', 'NR', 'Hodiak, Brian, Derek and Teal have just been released from prison. They return to Tomahawk Gap, now a ghost town, to retrieve the money that they stole and was buried by a partner somewhere in the town. While hunting, the Indians attack, and a life and death battle ensues.', 'Hodiak, Brian, Derek and Teal have just been released from prison. They return to Tomahawk Gap, now a ghost town, to retrieve the money that they stole and was buried by a partner somewhere in the town. While hunting, the Indians attack, and a life and death battle ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSSBXorkLSlAKNMdbpVPA2Ahx0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126891'),
  ('909896660584422259', 'Ambush Bay', 1966, 'War, Drama', 'Read Killgore, Ron Winston, Emmanuel I. Rojas', 'Ib Melchior, Marve Feinberg', 'Hugh O''Brian, Mickey Rooney, James Mitchum, Greg Amsterdam, Peter Masterson, Tisa Chang, Harry Lauter, Bruno Punzalan', 'NR', 'A Marine unit on a Japanese-held island in the Philippines tries to hook up with local Filipino guerrillas.', 'A Marine unit on a Japanese-held island in the Philippines tries to hook up with local Filipino guerrillas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rRhb2cl9t4GVNKt5A5gXYUVUQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89132'),
  ('337514428518453073', 'Ambushed', 1998, 'Thriller, Action, TV Movie, Drama', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Phil Oetiker, Michael G. Jefferson', 'Andrew Miles', 'Courtney B. Vance, Virginia Madsen, Jer Adrianne Lelliott, William Forsythe, David Keith, Bill Nunn, Charles Hallahan, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'Jim Natter, the leader of a violent Ku Klux Klan lodge, is shot dead. His teenage son Eric Natter is found nearby, and taken into police custody for his protection pending the investigation. While four cops drive him to a safe-house, they are ambushed. Three of them shot dead, including Deputy Lawrence, and his black partner Jerry Robinson is accused of the murders.', 'Jim Natter, the leader of a violent Ku Klux Klan lodge, is shot dead. His teenage son Eric Natter is found nearby, and taken into police custody for his protection pending the investigation. While four cops drive him to a safe-house, they are ambushed. Three of them shot dead, including Deputy Lawrence, and his black partner Jerry Robinson is accused of the murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiQ4TjjXjZKntgthCaGVVm78TQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151564'),
  ('178153831305874959', 'Amelia', 2009, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Mira Nair, Stuart Dryburgh, John Marzano', 'Anna Hamilton Phelan, Ronald Bass', 'Hilary Swank, Richard Gere, Aaron Abrams, Ewan McGregor, Christopher Eccleston, Joe Anderson, Cherry Jones, Mia Wasikowska', 'PG', 'A look at the life of legendary American pilot Amelia Earhart, who disappeared while flying over the Pacific Ocean in 1937 in an attempt to make a flight around the world.', 'A look at the life of legendary American pilot Amelia Earhart, who disappeared while flying over the Pacific Ocean in 1937 in an attempt to make a flight around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c7QMp7JZl70K8x5oJuY40mckWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8915'),
  ('1052948088602667299', 'Amelia and the Angel', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ken Russell, Anthony G. Evans', 'Anthony G. Evans, Ken Russell', 'Mercedes Quadros, Míka van Bloemen, Helen Ulman, E. Collins, Elisha Manasseh, Helen May, Nicolas O''Brien, Evangaline Averre', null, 'A young girl (Amelia) is distressed and feeling guilty about losing the wings she was to wear in her school play. Then she notices an angel and follows the angel into a dark building. Upstairs in the attic, bathed in heavenly light, is an artist''s model - the ANGEL. The painter ascends a ladder until he is out of shot - supposedly to heaven-and reappears to restore Amelia''s joy with a pair of wings.', 'A young girl (Amelia) is distressed and feeling guilty about losing the wings she was to wear in her school play. Then she notices an angel and follows the angel into a dark building. Upstairs in the attic, bathed in heavenly light, is an artist''s model - the ANGEL. The painter ascends a ladder until he is out of shot - supposedly to heaven-and reappears to restore Amelia''s joy with a pair of wings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1P10KxybRoDNdaLyw87J0IsC5o4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165913'),
  ('353953027550577711', 'Amelia’s Children', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Vasco Viana, André Silva Santos, Gabriel Abrantes', 'Gabriel Abrantes', 'Jack Haven, Carloto Cotta, Anabela Moreira, Alba Baptista, Rita Blanco, Beatriz Maia, Nuno Nolasco, Sónia Balacó', 'NR', 'When Edward’s search for his biological family leads him and his girlfriend Ryley to a magnificent villa high in the mountains of Northern Portugal, he is full of excitement at meeting his long-lost mother and twin brother. Finally, he will discover who he is and where he comes from. But nothing is as it seems, and Edward will soon learn that he is linked to them by a monstrous secret.', 'When Edward’s search for his biological family leads him and his girlfriend Ryley to a magnificent villa high in the mountains of Northern Portugal, he is full of excitement at meeting his long-lost mother and twin brother. Finally, he will discover who he is and where he comes from. But nothing is as it seems, and Edward will soon learn that he is linked to them by a monstrous secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri9cazZeb7QKlmJpLZ7PpJelHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082063'),
  ('502287762391283019', 'Amélie', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Daniel Kolarov', 'Guillaume Laurant, Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Audrey Tautou, Mathieu Kassovitz, Rufus, Serge Merlin, Jamel Debbouze, Clotilde Mollet, Claire Maurier, Isabelle Nanty', 'R', 'At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?', 'At a tiny Parisian café, the adorable yet painfully shy Amélie accidentally discovers a gift for helping others. Soon Amelie is spending her days as a matchmaker, guardian angel, and all-around do-gooder. But when she bumps into a handsome stranger, will she find the courage to become the star of her very own love story?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSxDa3M9aMvGVLoItzWTepQ5h5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194'),
  ('244098715790948895', 'Amélie au pays des Bodin''s', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Éric Le Roch, Wilfrid Sempé', 'Vincent Dubois, Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Éric Le Roch', 'Jean-Christian Fraiscinet, Vincent Fraiscinet, Vincent Dubois, Muriel Dubois, Rebecca Hampton, Jean-Pierre Durand, Thierry Liagre, Pierre Aucaigne', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX9O6PRtMBGHXOLBGCOYEHMtYLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491392'),
  ('730201081762945006', 'Amen', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ye-na, Kim Ki-duk', null, 'A woman goes to France in search for a man who she lost contact with, only to find that he has moved on to Venice. On her way to Venice, she faces a horrible incident in the train which makes her painfully question herself about life and relationships. And when she makes a frightening conclusion, the question becomes the share of the audiences.', 'A woman goes to France in search for a man who she lost contact with, only to find that he has moved on to Venice. On her way to Venice, she faces a horrible incident in the train which makes her painfully question herself about life and relationships. And when she makes a frightening conclusion, the question becomes the share of the audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weM4n1OhGPHiVr7qMnllWlsSbeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155096'),
  ('930313034164998821', 'Amen.', 2002, 'Drama, History', 'Costa-Gavras, Patrick Blossier, Anne Abitbol', 'Costa-Gavras, Jean-Claude Grumberg', 'Ulrich Tukur, Mathieu Kassovitz, Ulrich Mühe, Michel Duchaussoy, Marcel Iureș, Ion Caramitru, Friedrich von Thun, Antje Schmidt', 'NR', 'Kurt Gerstein—a member of the Institute for Hygiene of the Waffen-SS—is appalled to discover that a poison gas he helped discover is being used to kill Jews. Driven by his conscience to alert the rest of the world, Gerstein teams up with a young Jesuit priest, Riccardo Fontana, but their protestations fall on deaf ears in the Vatican.', 'Kurt Gerstein—a member of the Institute for Hygiene of the Waffen-SS—is appalled to discover that a poison gas he helped discover is being used to kill Jews. Driven by his conscience to alert the rest of the world, Gerstein teams up with a young Jesuit priest, Riccardo Fontana, but their protestations fall on deaf ears in the Vatican.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duNRweZ6PBpFSVNLJYexZ2XEqr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9045'),
  ('759081273253165194', 'Amer', 2009, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Hélène Cattet, Bruno Forzani, Joël Godfroid', 'Hélène Cattet, Bruno Forzani', 'Cassandra Forêt, Charlotte Eugène Guibeaud, Marie Bos, Biancamaria D''Amato, Harry Cleven, Jean-Michel Vovk, Bernard Marbaix, Thomas Bonzani', 'NR', 'Ana is confronted with body and desire at three key moments of her life. As a young girl, she brings her dead grandpa back to life. In her puberty, she discovers the power of decay and sexuality. Finally, she wrestles with loss and loneliness when she returns to her parental home, now derelict.', 'Ana is confronted with body and desire at three key moments of her life. As a young girl, she brings her dead grandpa back to life. In her puberty, she discovers the power of decay and sexuality. Finally, she wrestles with loss and loneliness when she returns to her parental home, now derelict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3O3F28FVnle4CgZM0i324wntxZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43950'),
  ('6413932782874501', 'America', 1924, 'Drama, History, Action', 'D.W. Griffith, Billy Bitzer, Marcel Le Picard', 'Robert W. Chambers', 'Neil Hamilton, Erville Alderson, Carol Dempster, Charles Emmett Mack, Lee Beggs, Lionel Barrymore, Arthur Donaldson, Downing Clarke', 'NR', 'The story of a family caught up in the American Revolutionary War.', 'The story of a family caught up in the American Revolutionary War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uz1MMMXolkP6kL6vjuEIPkYOYu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104067'),
  ('1137889807013209504', 'America', 2018, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Claus Drexel, Sylvain Leser', 'Claus Drexel', 'John Vlasnik, Lori Winkler, Corinne Kurzmann, Mike Burch, Sandy Coleman', null, 'November 2016 : The United States of America are about to elect their new president. AMERICA is a deep dive into the heart of Arizona, meeting the inhabitants of a little town crossed by Road 66, the broken inheritors of the American Dream who deliver us their hopes and fears.', 'November 2016 : The United States of America are about to elect their new president. AMERICA is a deep dive into the heart of Arizona, meeting the inhabitants of a little town crossed by Road 66, the broken inheritors of the American Dream who deliver us their hopes and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwSJeLfuBOnOMsCZBAvRg5Hf3X9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501145'),
  ('270138645585510496', 'America 3000', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'David Gurfinkel, David Engelbach, Michal Engel', 'David Engelbach', 'Chuck Wagner, Laurene Landon, William Wallace, Sue Giosa, Victoria Barrett, Galyn Görg, Shaike Ophir, Camilla Sparv', 'PG-13', '900 years after a nuclear war in the USA, mankind is back to the stone ages. Amazon women rule the tribes, while the men are weak and dumb - either kept as slaves or living wild as animals. Only Korvis and a friend are intelligent enough to flee and found a tribe of their own. Will they manage to teach the women to love men again?', '900 years after a nuclear war in the USA, mankind is back to the stone ages. Amazon women rule the tribes, while the men are weak and dumb - either kept as slaves or living wild as animals. Only Korvis and a friend are intelligent enough to flee and found a tribe of their own. Will they manage to teach the women to love men again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RwuEJ5Xho0Bsfj3oleZHntEPHC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27270'),
  ('327378579872941171', 'America America', 1963, 'Drama, History', 'Elia Kazan, Haskell Wexler', 'Elia Kazan', 'Stathis Giallelis, Frank Wolff, Harry Davis, Elena Karam, Estelle Hemsley, Gregory Rozakis, Lou Antonio, Salem Ludwig', 'PG', 'A young Anatolian Greek, entrusted with his family''s fortune, loses it en route to Istanbul and dreams of going to America.', 'A young Anatolian Greek, entrusted with his family''s fortune, loses it en route to Istanbul and dreams of going to America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76RffKrNPrfA4TWYkx5wIIOzOlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47249'),
  ('372708385573590758', 'America as Seen by a Frenchman', 1960, 'Documentary', 'François Reichenbach, Bill Flores, François Reichenbach', 'Franz M. Lang, François Reichenbach, Chris Marker', 'Jean Cocteau, Paul Klinger, June Richmond', null, 'At the end of the 1950s, French documentarian François Reichenbach spent eighteen months traveling the United States, documenting its diverse regions, their inhabitants, and their pastimes. The result is a journey through a multitude of different Americas, filtered through a French sensibility.', 'At the end of the 1950s, French documentarian François Reichenbach spent eighteen months traveling the United States, documenting its diverse regions, their inhabitants, and their pastimes. The result is a journey through a multitude of different Americas, filtered through a French sensibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loLIpftlhbxUkiyUUrZmAeapnMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198913'),
  ('16586191424165067', 'America Is Sinking', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Mario N. Bonassin, Hayden Rusk, Kevin Manalo Torres', 'Steve Doucette, Jeremiah Crothers', 'Chelsea Gilson, Andrew Rogers, Johnny Pacar, Paul Logan, Mindy Montavon, Jamel King, Vincent Duvall, Lindsey Marie Wilson', 'NR', 'When glacial flooding causes a ripple effect of earthquakes and tsunamis, scientists must create sinkholes to absorb the water and make the Arctic cold once more.', 'When glacial flooding causes a ripple effect of earthquakes and tsunamis, scientists must create sinkholes to absorb the water and make the Arctic cold once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJPnqK2kSM257FESP69HPTSWt3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217986'),
