  ('147677767599492383', 'American Dragons', 1998, 'Action, Crime', 'Ernest Holzman, Ralph Hemecker, Robert Lee', 'Erik Saltzgaber', 'Michael Biehn, Park Joong-hoon, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Don Stark, Byron Mann, Ben Immanuel, Lorena Gale, Hiro Kanagawa', 'R', 'Murders in Seoul, Korea and in America pair two cops from each of the countries together to solve the crimes. The investigation leads to a gang war between the Mafia and the Yakuza, but one that may not be of either of their making. A shadowy assassin is killing the leaders and an Italian assassin may have his own agenda.', 'Murders in Seoul, Korea and in America pair two cops from each of the countries together to solve the crimes. The investigation leads to a gang war between the Mafia and the Yakuza, but one that may not be of either of their making. A shadowy assassin is killing the leaders and an Italian assassin may have his own agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ty7ST4V6fj7SzZMIHXEviO853s4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88297'),
  ('193239996415782731', 'American Dream', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Barbara Kopple, Peter Gilbert, Kevin Keating', null, null, 'PG-13', 'When workers at the Hormel meatpacking plant in Austin, Minnesota are asked to take a substantial pay cut in a highly profitable year, the local labor union decides to go on strike and fight for a wage they believe is fair. But as the work stoppage drags on and the strikers face losing everything, friends become enemies, families are divided and the very future of this typical mid American town is threatened.', 'When workers at the Hormel meatpacking plant in Austin, Minnesota are asked to take a substantial pay cut in a highly profitable year, the local labor union decides to go on strike and fight for a wage they believe is fair. But as the work stoppage drags on and the strikers face losing everything, friends become enemies, families are divided and the very future of this typical mid American town is threatened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/da6DPUrYsi3K2HzwalUpphtOHec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41326'),
  ('775386310778618977', 'American Dreamer', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Rick Rosenthal, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'David Greenwalt, Jim Kouf', 'JoBeth Williams, Tom Conti, Giancarlo Giannini, Coral Browne, James Staley, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Huckleberry Fox, Jean Rougerie', 'PG', 'American housewife Cathy Palmer loses her memory on a trip to Paris after being hit by a car. She wakes up in the hospital believing she''s the fictional international spy, Rebecca Ryan.', 'American housewife Cathy Palmer loses her memory on a trip to Paris after being hit by a car. She wakes up in the hospital believing she''s the fictional international spy, Rebecca Ryan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ktp34gT3sohJrS1Vby70e5GDpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52471'),
  ('174024308761993676', 'American Dreamer', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Paul Dektor, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Theodore Melfi', 'Peter Dinklage, Shirley MacLaine, Kimberly Quinn, Danny Pudi, Matt Dillon, Danny Glover, Michelle Mylett, Peter Kelamis', null, 'In this winsome comedy, an entitled Economics professor pursues a tactic to buy an ailing widow’s mansion for nothing, but he quickly realizes that his seemingly foolproof strategy won’t be as easy as he thought.', 'In this winsome comedy, an entitled Economics professor pursues a tactic to buy an ailing widow’s mansion for nothing, but he quickly realizes that his seemingly foolproof strategy won’t be as easy as he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bUsa318eCnztKZlcG86s8xk9Rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931461'),
  ('906115711416863871', 'American Dreams (Lost and Found)', 1984, 'Documentary', 'James Benning', null, null, null, 'Scrolling excerpts from the diary of George Wallace''s would-be assassin Arthur Bremer at screen bottom, Hank Aaron cards and ephemera from his entire career up top, and alternating audio clips of popular songs and highlights from the news throughout Aaron''s career.', 'Scrolling excerpts from the diary of George Wallace''s would-be assassin Arthur Bremer at screen bottom, Hank Aaron cards and ephemera from his entire career up top, and alternating audio clips of popular songs and highlights from the news throughout Aaron''s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwy7sFyy7kLkTCBTXojjfzzzIVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139185'),
  ('53881698701622587', 'American Dreams in China', 2013, 'Drama', 'Peter Chan Ho-Sun, Christopher Doyle', 'Zhou Zhiyong, Aubrey Lam Oi-Wah, Zhang Ji', 'Huang Xiaoming, Deng Chao, Tong Dawei, Du Juan, Tong Lei, Liu Tianzuo, Yang Yi, Wang Zhener', null, 'Three Chinese friends build a successful English language school to help Chinese teenagers fulfil their dreams.', 'Three Chinese friends build a successful English language school to help Chinese teenagers fulfil their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0kzXrad3qqNcz6L0G2DP6M7NVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196325'),
  ('147186904947291391', 'American Dreamz', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Weitz, Robert Elswit', 'Paul Weitz', 'Hugh Grant, Dennis Quaid, Mandy Moore, Willem Dafoe, Chris Klein, Jennifer Coolidge, Sam Golzari, Marcia Gay Harden', 'PG-13', 'The new season of "American Dreamz," the wildly popular television singing contest, has captured the country''s attention, as the competition looks to be between a young Midwestern gal and a showtunes-loving young man from Orange County. Recently awakened President Staton even wants in on the craze, as he signs up for the potential explosive season finale.', 'The new season of "American Dreamz," the wildly popular television singing contest, has captured the country''s attention, as the competition looks to be between a young Midwestern gal and a showtunes-loving young man from Orange County. Recently awakened President Staton even wants in on the craze, as he signs up for the potential explosive season finale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwRbRvfJR7jjsaGfS741Tl3DRr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9310'),
  ('432299916846945738', 'American Drug War: The Last White Hope', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Kevin Booth', null, 'Ron Paul, Joe Rogan, Jello Biafra, Joe Arpaio, Jeff Blackburn', null, 'Texas filmmaker Kevin Booth delves into a world of deceit and corruption controlled by a drug dealing government who''s only allegiance is to its corporate masters.', 'Texas filmmaker Kevin Booth delves into a world of deceit and corruption controlled by a drug dealing government who''s only allegiance is to its corporate masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0vpYFhUlBh6abcGKZgU53UOOst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25572'),
  ('688487117414337905', 'American Fable', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Wyatt Garfield, Anne Hamilton, Alicia Zaragoza', 'Anne Hamilton', 'Peyton Kennedy, Richard Schiff, Kip Pardue, Zuleikha Robinson, Rusty Schwimmer, Marci Miller, Gavin Macintosh, Theresa Tilly', 'NR', 'When 11-year-old Gitty discovers that her father, Abe, a good and beloved farmer, is holding a wealthy man hostage in their abandoned silo in order to save their suffering farm, she befriends the captive in secret. As the truth unfolds about who he is and what will happen if he escapes, Gitty chooses to confront the thin line between reality and fiction.', 'When 11-year-old Gitty discovers that her father, Abe, a good and beloved farmer, is holding a wealthy man hostage in their abandoned silo in order to save their suffering farm, she befriends the captive in secret. As the truth unfolds about who he is and what will happen if he escapes, Gitty chooses to confront the thin line between reality and fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5D1dsGCh09cJlla924hnVYror6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381064'),
  ('775579460506602397', 'American Factory', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Julia Reichert, Steven Bognar, Steven Bognar', null, 'Junming ''Jimmy'' Wang, Sherrod Brown, Dave Burrows, John Gauthier, Rob Haerr, Cynthia Harper, Wong He, Jill Lamantia', 'NR', 'In post-industrial Ohio, a Chinese billionaire opens a new factory in the husk of an abandoned General Motors plant, hiring two thousand blue-collar Americans. Early days of hope and optimism give way to setbacks as high-tech China clashes with working-class America.', 'In post-industrial Ohio, a Chinese billionaire opens a new factory in the husk of an abandoned General Motors plant, hiring two thousand blue-collar Americans. Early days of hope and optimism give way to setbacks as high-tech China clashes with working-class America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jH3dQOJ3CHMrp9tWsI3rRCDiaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565716'),
  ('29905605036961999', 'American Fiction', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cristina Dunlap, Emily Baeza, Cord Jefferson', 'Cord Jefferson', 'Jeffrey Wright, John Ortiz, Erika Alexander, Leslie Uggams, Sterling K. Brown, Skyler Wright, John Ales, Patrick Fischler', 'R', 'A novelist fed up with the establishment profiting from "Black" entertainment uses a pen name to write a book that propels him into the heart of hypocrisy and the madness he claims to disdain.', 'A novelist fed up with the establishment profiting from "Black" entertainment uses a pen name to write a book that propels him into the heart of hypocrisy and the madness he claims to disdain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57MFWGHarg9jid7yfDTka4RmcMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056360'),
  ('1109428578579516500', 'American Fighter', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Reuben Steinberg, Shaun Paul Piccinino', 'Carl Morris, Shaun Paul Piccinino', 'Tommy Flanagan, Sean Patrick Flanery, Bryan Craig, Allison Paige, Salome Azizi, Vince Hill-Bedford, Anna Zielinski, Christina Moore', 'R', 'A desperate teenager is forced into the dangerous world of underground fighting to win enough money to save his ailing mother. He finds out what he''s made of in the face of these violent hungry competitors.', 'A desperate teenager is forced into the dangerous world of underground fighting to win enough money to save his ailing mother. He finds out what he''s made of in the face of these violent hungry competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a90uavKBXjpjsiQNuc0qVVuAaC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579221'),
  ('968036749182533325', 'American Flyers', 1985, 'Drama', 'John Badham, Donald Peterman, Gregg Champion', 'Steve Tesich', 'Kevin Costner, David Marshall Grant, Rae Dawn Chong, Alexandra Paul, Janice Rule, Luca Bercovici, Robert Townsend, John Amos', 'PG-13', 'When Dr. Marcus Sommers realizes that he and his troubled, estranged brother David may be prone a fatal brain disease that runs in their family, he decides to make peace with his sibling, and invites him on a trip to the Rockies. There, the brothers bond over their shared enthusiasm for cycling and decide to enter a grueling bike race through the mountains. However, Marcus'' health soon begins to fail, and David must compete without his brother at his side.', 'When Dr. Marcus Sommers realizes that he and his troubled, estranged brother David may be prone a fatal brain disease that runs in their family, he decides to make peace with his sibling, and invites him on a trip to the Rockies. There, the brothers bond over their shared enthusiasm for cycling and decide to enter a grueling bike race through the mountains. However, Marcus'' health soon begins to fail, and David must compete without his brother at his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa8otETzs4ZJ77s7LypCmD0zzQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14040'),
  ('486083726267716223', 'American Friends', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tristram Powell, Philip Bonham-Carter', 'Michael Palin, Tristram Powell', 'Michael Palin, Trini Alvarado, Connie Booth, Alfred Molina, Bryan Pringle, Jonathan Firth, Susan Denaker, David Calder', null, 'Francis Ashby, a senior Oxford don on holiday alone in the Alps, meets holidaying American Caroline and her companion Elinor, the blossoming Irish-American girl she adopted many years before. Ashby finds he enjoys their company, particularly that of Elinor, and both the women are drawn to him. Back at Oxford he is nevertheless taken aback when they arrive unannounced. Women are not allowed in the College grounds, let alone the rooms. Indeed any liaison, however innocent, is frowned on by the upstanding Fellows.', 'Francis Ashby, a senior Oxford don on holiday alone in the Alps, meets holidaying American Caroline and her companion Elinor, the blossoming Irish-American girl she adopted many years before. Ashby finds he enjoys their company, particularly that of Elinor, and both the women are drawn to him. Back at Oxford he is nevertheless taken aback when they arrive unannounced. Women are not allowed in the College grounds, let alone the rooms. Indeed any liaison, however innocent, is frowned on by the upstanding Fellows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDMaiL24iF9RJCnfX477YxFzbY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75350'),
  ('1093976894528861112', 'American Gangster', 2007, 'Drama, Crime', 'Harris Savides, Ridley Scott, Alexander Witt', 'Steven Zaillian', 'Denzel Washington, Russell Crowe, Josh Brolin, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Cuba Gooding Jr., Lymari Nadal, Ted Levine, Armand Assante', 'R', 'Loosely based on the criminal career of Frank Lucas, a gangster from La Grange, North Carolina, who smuggled heroin into the United States on American service planes returning from the Vietnam War, before being detained by a task force led by Newark Detective Richie Roberts.', 'Loosely based on the criminal career of Frank Lucas, a gangster from La Grange, North Carolina, who smuggled heroin into the United States on American service planes returning from the Vietnam War, before being detained by a task force led by Newark Detective Richie Roberts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sX9idXDqRUxE5ffww3n3RV5gL55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4982'),
  ('648121255755324196', 'American Gigolo', 1980, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Paul Schrader, John Bailey, Peter Bogart', 'Paul Schrader', 'Richard Gere, Lauren Hutton, Héctor Elizondo, Nina van Pallandt, Bill Duke, Brian Davies, K Callan, Tom Stewart', 'R', 'Julian makes a lucrative living as an escort to older women in the Los Angeles area. He begins a relationship with Michelle, a local politician''s wife, without expecting any pay. One of his clients is murdered and Detective Sunday begins pumping him for details on his different clients, something he is reluctant to do considering the nature of his work. Julian begins to suspect he''s being framed. Meanwhile Michelle begins to fall in love with him.', 'Julian makes a lucrative living as an escort to older women in the Los Angeles area. He begins a relationship with Michelle, a local politician''s wife, without expecting any pay. One of his clients is murdered and Detective Sunday begins pumping him for details on his different clients, something he is reluctant to do considering the nature of his work. Julian begins to suspect he''s being framed. Meanwhile Michelle begins to fall in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igXGCwti23PHOjLKQX6eGIGzQiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2768'),
  ('798603496071045845', 'American Girl', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jordan Brady, David Hennings', 'Scott Sandoe', 'Jena Malone, Michelle Forbes, Brad Renfro, Chris Mulkey, Alicia Witt, Clifton Collins Jr., Kevin Gage, O-Lan Jones', null, 'A pregnant teenager is determined to leave her trailer park home with the hope of living a happy family life.', 'A pregnant teenager is determined to leave her trailer park home with the hope of living a happy family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Zrzagu8IAeffUGtDnRE6shHXMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15041'),
  ('1039793753530416466', 'American Girl', 2021, 'Drama', 'Giorgos Valsamis, Fiona Roan', 'Fiona Roan', 'Caitlin Fang, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Kaiser Chuang, Audrey Lin, Bowie Tsang, Hsia Yu-chiao, Brando Huang, Winnie Chang', null, 'When her mother gets sick, 13-year-old Fen moves back to Taiwan, where she struggles to fit in amid the 2003 SARS epidemic.', 'When her mother gets sick, 13-year-old Fen moves back to Taiwan, where she struggles to fit in amid the 2003 SARS epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRWpwTW5YSbZSu6xUqIBy2VCvKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878987'),
  ('1034989676405217238', 'American Gothic', 1987, 'Horror', 'John Hough, Harvey Harrison', 'Michael Vines, Burt Wetanson', 'Rod Steiger, Yvonne De Carlo, Michael J. Pollard, Fiona Hutchison, Stephen Shellen, Janet Wright, Sarah Torgov, Mark Lindsay Chapman', 'R', 'When six friends fly off on a weekend getaway and are suddenly plagued by engine trouble, they''re forced to land on a remote island. Looking for shelter, they''re grateful to encounter Ma and Pa and their children - an eccentric family living in the island''s backwoods. But what begins as simple hospitality turns into a terrifying race for survival as the friends start disappearing one by one ... and turning up dead.', 'When six friends fly off on a weekend getaway and are suddenly plagued by engine trouble, they''re forced to land on a remote island. Looking for shelter, they''re grateful to encounter Ma and Pa and their children - an eccentric family living in the island''s backwoods. But what begins as simple hospitality turns into a terrifying race for survival as the friends start disappearing one by one ... and turning up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKal4piPoNlIGC0swuiHb7QfCiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51442'),
  ('717297849515875449', 'American Graffiti', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama', 'George Lucas, Jan D''Alquen, Ron Eveslage', 'George Lucas, Gloria Katz, Willard Huyck', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Ron Howard, Paul Le Mat, Charles Martin Smith, Cindy Williams, Candy Clark, Mackenzie Phillips, Wolfman Jack', 'PG', 'A couple of high school graduates spend one final night cruising the strip with their buddies before they go off to college.', 'A couple of high school graduates spend one final night cruising the strip with their buddies before they go off to college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tjLivPad2PX8FAzWko7FPIb8d2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838'),
  ('852232523780635555', 'American Grindhouse', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Elijah Drenner, Dan Greene', 'Calum Waddell, Elijah Drenner', 'Robert Forster, Allison Anders, John Landis, Kim Morgan, Fred Olen Ray, Joe Dante, Herschell Gordon Lewis, William Lustig', 'NR', 'This documentary explores the hidden history of the American Exploitation Film. The movie digs deep into this often overlooked category of U.S. cinema and unearths the shameless and occasionally shocking origins of this popular entertainment.', 'This documentary explores the hidden history of the American Exploitation Film. The movie digs deep into this often overlooked category of U.S. cinema and unearths the shameless and occasionally shocking origins of this popular entertainment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vysYoEj5XFrfcSBrJyWQ4YeHks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70862'),
  ('96723111730791', 'American Guerrilla in the Philippines', 1950, 'Drama, War', 'Fritz Lang, Harry Jackson', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Tyrone Power, Micheline Presle, Tom Ewell, Robert Patten, Tommy Cook, Juan Torena, Jack Elam, Robert Barrat', 'NR', 'American soldiers stranded in the Philippines after the Japanese invasion form guerrilla bands to fight back. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2001.', 'American soldiers stranded in the Philippines after the Japanese invasion form guerrilla bands to fight back. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/765vfp2mKDY4ZdU99lapFTnwi5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74512'),
  ('1116825419347445052', 'American Gun', 2005, 'Drama', 'Aric Avelino, Nancy Schreiber', 'Steven Bagatourian, Aric Avelino', 'Forest Whitaker, Marcia Gay Harden, Donald Sutherland, Lisa Long, Chris Warren, Amanda Seyfried, Nikki Reed, Tony Goldwyn', null, 'Seemingly disparate portraits of people -- among them a single mother, a high school principal, and an ace student -- Distinctly American -- all affected by the proliferation of guns in American society.', 'Seemingly disparate portraits of people -- among them a single mother, a high school principal, and an ace student -- Distinctly American -- all affected by the proliferation of guns in American society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GikvdDanJwSQOb0oCWY5FqFTxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15366'),
  ('567121297572505460', 'American Hangman', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Mark Irwin, Wilson Coneybeare', 'Wilson Coneybeare', 'Donald Sutherland, Vincent Kartheiser, Oliver Dennis, Paul Braunstein, Matt Baram, Dan Beirne, Joanne Boland, Al Sapienza', 'R', 'An unidentified man posts a live feed on social media showing that he has kidnapped two strangers and intends to kill one before the day is out. His intention is to hold a capital ''trial'' online. As the authorities recognize what''s happening, it becomes apparent that the online public is going to act as judge and jury.', 'An unidentified man posts a live feed on social media showing that he has kidnapped two strangers and intends to kill one before the day is out. His intention is to hold a capital ''trial'' online. As the authorities recognize what''s happening, it becomes apparent that the online public is going to act as judge and jury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKoXpgqEk8RSezV05oRDCZP9fhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567738'),
  ('564524554284990410', 'American Hardcore', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Paul Rachman, Paul Rachman', 'Steven Blush', 'Henry Rollins, Ian MacKaye, Lucky Lehrer, Vic Bondi, Joe Keithley, Moby, Springa, Keith Morris', 'R', 'Inspired by Steven Blush''s book "American Hardcore: A tribal history" Paul Rachman''s feature documentary debut is a chronicle of the underground hardcore punk years from 1979 to 1986. Interviews and rare live footage from artists such as Black Flag, Bad Brains, Minor Threat, SS Decontrol and the Dead Kennedys.', 'Inspired by Steven Blush''s book "American Hardcore: A tribal history" Paul Rachman''s feature documentary debut is a chronicle of the underground hardcore punk years from 1979 to 1986. Interviews and rare live footage from artists such as Black Flag, Bad Brains, Minor Threat, SS Decontrol and the Dead Kennedys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0nxzzUYHrudMn32WVIYdKnxe2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16018'),
  ('360216944457561365', 'American Heart', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Bell, James R. Bagdonas', null, 'Jeff Bridges, Edward Furlong, Lucinda Jenney, Don Harvey, Tracey Kapisky, Margaret Welsh, John Boylan, Jayne Entwistle', 'R', 'An ex-convict is tracked down by his estranged teenage son, and the pair try to build a relationship and life together in Seattle.', 'An ex-convict is tracked down by his estranged teenage son, and the pair try to build a relationship and life together in Seattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QdqCjeC9AExknVdV4hRSXomIwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7015'),
  ('71403872390700526', 'American Heist', 2014, 'Action', 'Sarik Andreasyan, Antonio Calvache, Patrick Longman', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Hayden Christensen, Adrien Brody, Jordana Brewster, Akon, Tory Kittles, Laura Cayouette, Elena Sanchez, Luis Da Silva, Jr.', 'R', 'Two brothers, both with troubled paths, find themselves in the middle of one last bank job.', 'Two brothers, both with troubled paths, find themselves in the middle of one last bank job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/526uxanwv4mMK0YTxjVrsmMXXo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250066'),
  ('1152218378138022536', 'American Hero', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Nick Love, Simon Dennis', 'Nick Love', 'Stephen Dorff, Eddie Griffin, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Christopher Berry, Yohance Myles, Andrea Cohen, Raeden Greer, Countrified Wedman', 'R', 'Melvin, a reluctant hero who is far from super, has been suppressing his telekinetic powers for years with booze, drugs, and women. In the process, he has failed at practically everything, most of all as a parent to his son. After a brush with death, Melvin decides to use his powers for good and clean up the streets of New Orleans with the help of his best friend/definitely-not-a-sidekick, Lucille. For a man who can do the impossible, it might be a fight even he can’t win.', 'Melvin, a reluctant hero who is far from super, has been suppressing his telekinetic powers for years with booze, drugs, and women. In the process, he has failed at practically everything, most of all as a parent to his son. After a brush with death, Melvin decides to use his powers for good and clean up the streets of New Orleans with the help of his best friend/definitely-not-a-sidekick, Lucille. For a man who can do the impossible, it might be a fight even he can’t win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYHb5CG90zHp5CDj3dJDP98c77q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367551'),
  ('424408522089384869', 'American High School', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sean Patrick Cannon', 'Sean Patrick Cannon', 'Talan Torriero, Aubrey O''Day, Martin Klebba, Alex Murrel, Davida Williams, Madison Dylan, Cameron Goodman, Jillian Murray', 'R', 'Small lives begin at the end of high school for this surreal society. A senior who married young must contend with her life, love, and pursuit of individuality and femininity in a narcissistic, misogynistic world of irony. Gwen Adams, her husband Holden, and school rival Hilary complete the love triangle as Principal Mann makes their lives living hell.', 'Small lives begin at the end of high school for this surreal society. A senior who married young must contend with her life, love, and pursuit of individuality and femininity in a narcissistic, misogynistic world of irony. Gwen Adams, her husband Holden, and school rival Hilary complete the love triangle as Principal Mann makes their lives living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2TboRqfJiK3PiSJZMVHuxCdhqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16116'),
  ('436595530600068272', 'American History', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chris Graves, Trey Parker', 'Trey Parker', 'Junichi Nishimura', null, 'American history, from Columbus landing and found that George Bush becomes president. College Film by Trey Parker.', 'American history, from Columbus landing and found that George Bush becomes president. College Film by Trey Parker.', null, 'tmdb:movie:104380'),
  ('91684113700973727', 'American History X', 1998, 'Drama', 'Tony Kaye, Mark Cotone, David Larson', 'David McKenna', 'Edward Norton, Edward Furlong, Beverly D''Angelo, Jennifer Lien, Ethan Suplee, Fairuza Balk, Avery Brooks, Elliott Gould', 'R', 'Derek Vineyard is paroled after serving 3 years in prison for killing two African-American men. Through his brother, Danny Vineyard''s narration, we learn that before going to prison, Derek was a skinhead and the leader of a violent white supremacist gang that committed acts of racial crime throughout L.A. and his actions greatly influenced Danny. Reformed and fresh out of prison, Derek severs contact with the gang and becomes determined to keep Danny from going down the same violent path as he did.', 'Derek Vineyard is paroled after serving 3 years in prison for killing two African-American men. Through his brother, Danny Vineyard''s narration, we learn that before going to prison, Derek was a skinhead and the leader of a violent white supremacist gang that committed acts of racial crime throughout L.A. and his actions greatly influenced Danny. Reformed and fresh out of prison, Derek severs contact with the gang and becomes determined to keep Danny from going down the same violent path as he did.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2drgoXYZ8484lqyDj7L1CEVR4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73'),
  ('327168485643640564', 'American Honey', 2016, 'Drama', 'Andrea Arnold, Robbie Ryan, Nick Grau', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Sasha Lane, Shia LaBeouf, Riley Keough, Arielle Holmes, McCaul Lombardi, Crystal Ice, Veronica Ezell, Raymond Coalson', 'R', 'A restless teenager escapes her troubled home and joins a traveling crew of young drifters selling magazines across the American Midwest. Immersed in a world of reckless partying, risky hustles, and fleeting romances, she searches for freedom and belonging on the open road.', 'A restless teenager escapes her troubled home and joins a traveling crew of young drifters selling magazines across the American Midwest. Immersed in a world of reckless partying, risky hustles, and fleeting romances, she searches for freedom and belonging on the open road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41SVO0AElBAl7zks9dFhJ0OjHni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340485'),
  ('119266352089036883', 'American Hot Wax', 1978, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Floyd Mutrux, William A. Fraker', 'John Kaye', 'Tim McIntire, Fran Drescher, Jay Leno, Laraine Newman, Carl Weaver, Al Chalk, Sam Harkness, Arnold McCuller', 'PG', 'This is the story loosely based on Cleveland disc jockey Alan Freed, who introduced rock''n''roll to teenage American radio audiences in the 1950s. Freed was a source of great controversy: criticized by conservatives for corrupting youth with the "devil''s music"; hated by racists for promoting African American music for white consumption; persecuted by law enforcement officials and finally brought down by the "payola" scandals.', 'This is the story loosely based on Cleveland disc jockey Alan Freed, who introduced rock''n''roll to teenage American radio audiences in the 1950s. Freed was a source of great controversy: criticized by conservatives for corrupting youth with the "devil''s music"; hated by racists for promoting African American music for white consumption; persecuted by law enforcement officials and finally brought down by the "payola" scandals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WVolrSXzdehGWEFzgF4KhJmBEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42198'),
  ('769679634457236622', 'American Hustle', 2013, 'Drama, Crime', 'David O. Russell, Linus Sandgren, Xanthus Valan', 'David O. Russell, Eric Warren Singer', 'Christian Bale, Bradley Cooper, Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, Jennifer Lawrence, Louis C.K., Jack Huston, Michael Peña', 'R', 'A conman and his seductive partner are forced to work for a wild FBI agent, who pushes them into a world of Jersey power-brokers and the Mafia.', 'A conman and his seductive partner are forced to work for a wild FBI agent, who pushes them into a world of Jersey power-brokers and the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6O1KDhfWDTm5ZBr6Ovr0eg8LqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168672'),
  ('400119631351861976', 'American Insurrection', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'William Sullivan, Brandon Roots', 'Jarret Kerr, William Sullivan', 'Nadine Malouf, Nick Westrate, Brandon Perea, Sarah Wharton, Jarret Kerr, Michael Raymond-James, Toby Leonard Moore', null, 'Set in a dystopian America where all people who aren''t straight, white, Christian and cis gender are kept track of by the government with bar codes.', 'Set in a dystopian America where all people who aren''t straight, white, Christian and cis gender are kept track of by the government with bar codes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zrzecN98cNYij4hIYmIH4n2cg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851870'),
  ('1012315238425925811', 'American Kamasutra', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Beau Holland, Jacky St. James', 'Paul Fishbein, Jacky St. James', 'Ashlynn Yennie, Justin Berti, Victoria Levine, Kevin Nelson, Nika Khitrova, Brent Harvey, Richie Calhoun, Sara Luvv', null, 'A young woman finds herself involved in a dangerous love triangle when she gets involved with the writer of a popular steamy novel.', 'A young woman finds herself involved in a dangerous love triangle when she gets involved with the writer of a popular steamy novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PlW27Cnaa6mtKeDxZPPBStfRiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571346'),
  ('137467026631756075', 'American Kickboxer', 1991, 'Action', 'Frans Nel, Paul Morkel', 'Emil Kolbe', 'John Barrett, Keith Vitali, Terry Norton, Brad Morris, Ted Le Plat, Michael Huff, Len Sparrowhawk, Roger Yuan', 'R', 'Kickboxing champion B.J. is jailed for an accidental murder thanks to the testimony of his arch-nemesis Denard. A year later, B.J. is released and then challenged by Denard for $100,000. Will B.J. accept and get even with Denard?', 'Kickboxing champion B.J. is jailed for an accidental murder thanks to the testimony of his arch-nemesis Denard. A year later, B.J. is released and then challenged by Denard for $100,000. Will B.J. accept and get even with Denard?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s22Wz0QoLhFMDdnsmWRwMXitLDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110830'),
  ('502024006056228452', 'American Loser', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tod Harrison Williams, Michael Simmonds', 'Tod Harrison Williams', 'Seann William Scott, Gretchen Mol, Kevin Conway, Jeff Garlin, Jason Mantzoukas, Matt Mulhern, Deirdre O''Connell, Denis O''Hare', 'R', 'A dramatic comedy about a self-induced attention-deficit disordered, learning disabled, Tourette''s syndrome suffering, balance impaired, ex-alcoholic young man from the Upper East Side of Manhattan and the gold-digging girl who inspires him to try to get it together.', 'A dramatic comedy about a self-induced attention-deficit disordered, learning disabled, Tourette''s syndrome suffering, balance impaired, ex-alcoholic young man from the Upper East Side of Manhattan and the gold-digging girl who inspires him to try to get it together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvPmsEYxDLmosWcalo9zW2i3RqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13406'),
  ('183780220972544181', 'American Made', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Doug Liman, César Charlone, Elizabeth Cummings', 'Gary Spinelli', 'Tom Cruise, Domhnall Gleeson, Sarah Wright, Jesse Plemons, Caleb Landry Jones, Lola Kirke, Jayma Mays, Alejandro Edda', 'R', 'The true story of pilot Barry Seal, who transported contraband for the CIA and the Medellin cartel in the 1980s.', 'The true story of pilot Barry Seal, who transported contraband for the CIA and the Medellin cartel in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23ILgoPSO5ShKcTZOuiTVfqFAUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337170'),
  ('76029657158266799', 'American Madness', 1932, 'Drama, Crime', 'Joseph Walker, Frank Capra', null, 'Walter Huston, Pat O''Brien, Kay Johnson, Constance Cummings, Gavin Gordon, Arthur Hoyt, Robert Emmett O''Connor, Edwin Maxwell', null, 'Socially-conscious banker Thomas Dickson faces a crisis when his protégé is wrongly accused of robbing the bank, gossip of the robbery starts a bank run, and evidence suggests Dickson''s wife had an affair... all in the same day.', 'Socially-conscious banker Thomas Dickson faces a crisis when his protégé is wrongly accused of robbing the bank, gossip of the robbery starts a bank run, and evidence suggests Dickson''s wife had an affair... all in the same day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKMrLe7SXLjDaFqdAmcuGXM1HHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1773'),
  ('317246078182162984', 'American Mary', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jen Soska, Sylvia Soska, Brad Jubenville', 'Sylvia Soska, Jen Soska', 'Katharine Isabelle, Antonio Cupo, Tristan Risk, David Lovgren, Paula Lindberg, Clay St. Thomas, John Emmet Tracy, Twan Holliday', 'R', 'A young medical student struggling to pay tuition is drawn into the shady world of underground body-modification.', 'A young medical student struggling to pay tuition is drawn into the shady world of underground body-modification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHwyNKHm41Y6WPRCHL0zOzytGvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126277'),
  ('589668608486488733', 'American Me', 1992, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward James Olmos, Reynaldo Villalobos, Brian Ort', 'Floyd Mutrux, Desmond Nakano', 'Edward James Olmos, William Forsythe, Pepe Serna, Panchito Gómez, Steve Wilcox, Danny De La Paz, Sal Lopez, Dyana Ortelli', 'R', 'During his 18 years in Folsom Prison, street-gang leader Santana rules over all the drug-and-murder activities behind bars. Upon his release, Santana goes back to his old neighborhood, intending to lead a peaceful, crime-free life. But his old gang buddies force him back into his old habits.', 'During his 18 years in Folsom Prison, street-gang leader Santana rules over all the drug-and-murder activities behind bars. Upon his release, Santana goes back to his old neighborhood, intending to lead a peaceful, crime-free life. But his old gang buddies force him back into his old habits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrcdh66L6K1Nb5xPORuZufvE9aE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13199'),
  ('585904454928080695', 'American Moon', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Massimo Mazzucco', 'Massimo Mazzucco', 'Aldo Fallai, Peter Lindbergh, Danilo Pasqua, Nicola Pecorini, Christophe Terrasson, Toni Thorimbert, Oliviero Toscani, Daniele Vanoni', null, 'Has man really been to the moon? It’s been 50 years, and the debate rages on. For the firs time, a film compiles in a single piece of work, all the best evidence in favor of the moon landings and the evidence contrary to them. For the first time we can also analyze the Apollo pictures in detail, with the aid of some among the top photographers in the world. What was the Apollo project really? The biggest achievement in the history of mankind, or the biggest fakery of all times, watched on live television by more than half a billion people?', 'Has man really been to the moon? It’s been 50 years, and the debate rages on. For the firs time, a film compiles in a single piece of work, all the best evidence in favor of the moon landings and the evidence contrary to them. For the first time we can also analyze the Apollo pictures in detail, with the aid of some among the top photographers in the world. What was the Apollo project really? The biggest achievement in the history of mankind, or the biggest fakery of all times, watched on live television by more than half a billion people?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWNn2wm1sbAxoAIjPbrFO64E9uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492963'),
  ('146299051194020017', 'American Movie', 1999, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Chris Smith, Chris Smith', null, 'Mark Borchardt, Mike Schank, Tom Schimmels, Monica Borchardt, Alex Borchardt, Chris Borchardt, Ken Keen, Matt Weisman', 'R', 'American Movie documents the story of filmmaker Mark Borchardt, his mission, and his dream. Spanning over two years of intense struggle with his film, his family, financial decline, and spiritual crisis, American Movie is a portrayal of ambition, obsession, excess, and one man''s quest for the American Dream.', 'American Movie documents the story of filmmaker Mark Borchardt, his mission, and his dream. Spanning over two years of intense struggle with his film, his family, financial decline, and spiritual crisis, American Movie is a portrayal of ambition, obsession, excess, and one man''s quest for the American Dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8dJgWr1HeW0RRxwANDWvgIXdsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14242'),
  ('78222020757104804', 'American Murder: The Family Next Door', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jenny Popplewell', null, 'Nickole Atkinson, Jim Benemann, Luke Epple, Mark Jamieson, Nichol Kessinger, Marcelo Kopcow, Karen Leigh, Theresa Marchetta', 'R', 'Using raw, firsthand footage, this documentary examines the disappearance of Shanann Watts and her children, and the terrible events that followed.', 'Using raw, firsthand footage, this documentary examines the disappearance of Shanann Watts and her children, and the terrible events that followed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjs3hE3mQlVGTX3u5ZH2EJBJpf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743601'),
  ('115372304280125151', 'American Murderer', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Matthew Gentile, Kalilah Robinson', 'Matthew Gentile', 'Tom Pelphrey, Ryan Phillippe, Idina Menzel, Shantel VanSanten, Jacki Weaver, Laura Dennis, Paul Schneider, Moisés Arias', 'R', 'The True story of how charismatic con man Jason Derek Brown bankrolls his extravagant lifestyle through a series of scams. On Brown’s trail: Lance Leising, a dogged FBI special agent determined to put Brown behind bars. When Brown’s funds run low and his past catches up with him, he plots his most elaborate scheme yet, pitting himself against Leising in a deadly game of cat and mouse — and becoming the most unlikely and elusive fugitive on the FBI’s most-wanted list.', 'The True story of how charismatic con man Jason Derek Brown bankrolls his extravagant lifestyle through a series of scams. On Brown’s trail: Lance Leising, a dogged FBI special agent determined to put Brown behind bars. When Brown’s funds run low and his past catches up with him, he plots his most elaborate scheme yet, pitting himself against Leising in a deadly game of cat and mouse — and becoming the most unlikely and elusive fugitive on the FBI’s most-wanted list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfCmTkVVtwoW4yNu1Cs4ZDtCTa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774301'),
  ('781316312095022490', 'American Night', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ben Nott, Alessio Della Valle', 'Alessio Della Valle', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Paz Vega, Emile Hirsch, Michael Madsen, Jeremy Piven, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Mara Lane, Marco Leonardi', 'R', 'A neo-noir set in the New York City''s corrupt contemporary art world where the art dealer John Kaplan and the ruthless head of New York''s mafia, Michael Rubino, fight for money, art, power and love.', 'A neo-noir set in the New York City''s corrupt contemporary art world where the art dealer John Kaplan and the ruthless head of New York''s mafia, Michael Rubino, fight for money, art, power and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isN2CPsxUNyU8z5ig1xxoXfHOF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695080'),
  ('521421268308016505', 'American Nightmare', 1983, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Hugh McLean, Don McBrearty, Daniel Hainey', 'John Sheppard', 'Lawrence Day, Lora Staley, Neil Dainard, Lenore Zann, Claudia Udy, Page Fletcher, Michael Ironside, Larry Aubrey', 'R', 'A man investigates the disappearance of his sister with the help of her roommate. He uncovers a trail of prostitution, incest, blackmail...and murder.', 'A man investigates the disappearance of his sister with the help of her roommate. He uncovers a trail of prostitution, incest, blackmail...and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJItn1uHPelzimeuNMfT1nMnXGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85204'),
