  ('313785072636067646', 'American Star', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego, José David Montero, Vicky Wildman', 'Nacho Faerna', 'Ian McShane, Nora Arnezeder, Adam Nagaitis, Thomas Kretschmann, Fanny Ardant, Andrés Gertrúdix, Oscar Coleman, Sabela Arán', 'R', 'An assassin on a final assignment in Fuerteventura, to kill a man he has never met. When his target is delayed, he finds himself drawn to the island, people and a ghostly shipwreck. Instead of following protocol he stays. But when the target returns, the world has shifted. Before everything was simple, now nothing is.', 'An assassin on a final assignment in Fuerteventura, to kill a man he has never met. When his target is delayed, he finds himself drawn to the island, people and a ghostly shipwreck. Instead of following protocol he stays. But when the target returns, the world has shifted. Before everything was simple, now nothing is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFjxI9yMd142au1O74JlUttG4Ki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1170824'),
