  ('156208966860079461', 'American Taboo', 1983, 'Drama', 'Steve Lustgarten', 'Nicole Harrison, Jay Horenstein, Steve Lustgarten', 'Jay Horenstein, Nicole Harrison, Hester Schell, Walter Shane', null, 'Paul, a shy photographer of 30 years, avoids relationships in favor of the safety landscape photography. He is drawn into intimacy by a teenage youth who moves in next door and insinuates herself into his life.', 'Paul, a shy photographer of 30 years, avoids relationships in favor of the safety landscape photography. He is drawn into intimacy by a teenage youth who moves in next door and insinuates herself into his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KA0snkWGGQbCRoeXOKXRhxqmM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383572'),
