  ('98511178357954807', 'Americana', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller, Western, Action', 'Nigel Bluck, Tony Tost, Peter Etzweiler', 'Tony Tost', 'Sydney Sweeney, Paul Walter Hauser, Halsey, Simon Rex, Eric Dane, Zahn McClarnon, Derek Hinkey, Toby Huss', 'R', 'When a rare Lakota Ghost Shirt falls into the black market in a small town in South Dakota, the lives of local outsiders and outcasts violently intertwine.', 'When a rare Lakota Ghost Shirt falls into the black market in a small town in South Dakota, the lives of local outsiders and outcasts violently intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83Gis9pOKCvAdaKXCNChey4IZyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934456'),
  ('316809469778492551', 'Americano', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mathieu Demy, Georges Lechaptois', 'Mathieu Demy', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Mathieu Demy, Geraldine Chaplin, Chiara Mastroianni, Carlos Bardem, Jean-Pierre Mocky, André Wilms, Sabine Mamou', 'NR', 'A real estate agent from Paris arrives in Los Angeles to settle his late mother''s estate, but a found photograph sends him on an impromptu journey to Mexico to find a woman named Lola.', 'A real estate agent from Paris arrives in Los Angeles to settle his late mother''s estate, but a found photograph sends him on an impromptu journey to Mexico to find a woman named Lola.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67IURaphSVOSqkMRXUKf6cMF7bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103597'),
  ('17259616348119255', 'Americathon', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Neal Israel, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Michael Mislove, Neal Israel, Monica Johnson', 'John Ritter, Harvey Korman, Fred Willard, Chief Dan George, Richard Schaal, Peter Riegert, Nancy Morgan, Meat Loaf', 'PG', 'In a story told in narrative flashbacks, a young TV consultant is hired by the President of a bankrupt USA to organize a telethon in order to prevent the country from being repossessed by wealthy Native Americans.', 'In a story told in narrative flashbacks, a young TV consultant is hired by the President of a bankrupt USA to organize a telethon in order to prevent the country from being repossessed by wealthy Native Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GlEFedxZecTLRkl0Naesikn4KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47819'),
  ('1063738906750715326', 'Amerikalı', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Şerif Gören, Erdoğan Engin', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Şener Şen, Lale Mansur, Taner Barlas, İhsan Bilsev, Ilteray Ilter, Sırrı Elitaş, Haluk Bilginer, Melih Çardak', null, 'Revenge story in Istanbul. After being sent to prison, Şeref manages to escape and flee to the United States. Over the next twenty years, he works tirelessly and becomes a billionaire. With his vast fortune, he returns to Turkey after twenty years, driven by his longing for his homeland and his former lover. However, time has passed differently in Turkey than it has in America... Will Şeref, who returns to his country and loved ones with curiosity, be able to adapt to this change?', 'Revenge story in Istanbul. After being sent to prison, Şeref manages to escape and flee to the United States. Over the next twenty years, he works tirelessly and becomes a billionaire. With his vast fortune, he returns to Turkey after twenty years, driven by his longing for his homeland and his former lover. However, time has passed differently in Turkey than it has in America... Will Şeref, who returns to his country and loved ones with curiosity, be able to adapt to this change?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drj1SHRwaaxedpxJj7TeAZtjrkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54343'),
  ('577982225817155528', 'Amerikatsi', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael A. Goorjian, Astghik Vardanyan, Vardan Hakobyan', 'Michael A. Goorjian', 'Michael A. Goorjian, Hovik Keuchkerian, Mikhail Trukhin, Nelly Uvarova, Narine Grigoryan, Jean-Pierre Nshanian, Aram Karakhanyan, Lernik Harutyunyan', null, 'In 1948, decades after fleeing Armenia to the US as a child, Charlie returns in the hopes of finding a connection to his roots, but what he finds instead is a country crushed under Soviet rule. After being unjustly imprisoned, Charlie falls into despair, until he discovers that he can see into a nearby apartment from his cell window - the home of a prison guard.', 'In 1948, decades after fleeing Armenia to the US as a child, Charlie returns in the hopes of finding a connection to his roots, but what he finds instead is a country crushed under Soviet rule. After being unjustly imprisoned, Charlie falls into despair, until he discovers that he can see into a nearby apartment from his cell window - the home of a prison guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3u81LmEt6kx1uHGGaOCCZD4bSEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998757'),
  ('773290173170907695', 'Amiche da morire', 2013, 'Romance, Crime, Comedy', 'Giorgia Farina, Maurizio Calvesi, Gabriella Giannattasio', 'Giorgia Farina, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Claudia Gerini, Cristiana Capotondi, Sabrina Impacciatore, Vinicio Marchioni, Marina Confalone, Corrado Fortuna, Antonella Attili, Tommaso Ramenghi', null, 'Gilda has long since moved to a small southern island and earns her living as a prostitute in a context suspended between retrograde traditions and modernity. During one summer, his destiny intersects with that of Olivia and Crocetta, two women from the area, the former a happy wife and the latter an ugly, unlucky wife. The three are forced by fortuitous circumstances to come together to save themselves but their behavior attracts the suspicions of Nino Malachia, a brusque police commissioner who is convinced that they are hiding something.', 'Gilda has long since moved to a small southern island and earns her living as a prostitute in a context suspended between retrograde traditions and modernity. During one summer, his destiny intersects with that of Olivia and Crocetta, two women from the area, the former a happy wife and the latter an ugly, unlucky wife. The three are forced by fortuitous circumstances to come together to save themselves but their behavior attracts the suspicions of Nino Malachia, a brusque police commissioner who is convinced that they are hiding something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rD3eOOyyzVmEPfk1dBadNMcRGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173847'),
  ('882811504907601856', 'Amichemai', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Vincenzo Carpineta, Lorenzo Kovac Fabbro', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Angela Finocchiaro, Cristiana Mainardi', 'Angela Finocchiaro, Serra Yılmaz, Gelsomina Pascucci, Pia Paoletti, Maurizio Nichetti, Astrid Casali, Luca Lombardi, Vittorio Grezzi', null, 'Anna Ricca is an enthusiastic veterinarian who divides her time between managing the farm and the many family roles that, in turn, make her an enamored wife, an affectionate daughter, an anxious mother, a patient grandmother. The sudden death of Gino, Anna’s sick father, provides her with the opportunity to finally free herself of her father’s caregiver, Aysè, with whom she had never gotten along. In the company of Anna, Aysè Yildirim will return to Turkey with the old bed that Gino bequeathed to her, on a journey through the Balkans that is destined to change both their lives forever.', 'Anna Ricca is an enthusiastic veterinarian who divides her time between managing the farm and the many family roles that, in turn, make her an enamored wife, an affectionate daughter, an anxious mother, a patient grandmother. The sudden death of Gino, Anna’s sick father, provides her with the opportunity to finally free herself of her father’s caregiver, Aysè, with whom she had never gotten along. In the company of Anna, Aysè Yildirim will return to Turkey with the old bed that Gino bequeathed to her, on a journey through the Balkans that is destined to change both their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMxAe3hKaxVDAIZGpXClK1zjKBD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224481'),
  ('78676758767657259', 'Amici ahrarara', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Franco Amurri, Mauro Marchetti, Lorenzo Molossi', 'Franco Amurri, Bruno Arena, Max Cavallari', 'Max Cavallari, Bruno Arena, Giustino Durano, Sonia Aquino, Gianni Ferreri, Adelaide Aste, Sergio Baracco, Andrea Bruschi', null, 'Two penniless cousins have a common passion: to be inventors, but they never managed to make money out of their patents. Their only hope is represented by their hateful and rich uncle.', 'Two penniless cousins have a common passion: to be inventors, but they never managed to make money out of their patents. Their only hope is represented by their hateful and rich uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UhNTMhniGIGnuRFa51zL9qPqt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186683'),
  ('1015840678724297562', 'Amici come noi', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Lando, Massimo Schiavon', 'Gianluca Ansanelli, Aldo Augelli, Pio D''Antini', 'Pio D''Antini, Amedeo Grieco, Alessandra Mastronardi, Maria Di Biase, Alessandra Sarno, Anna Rita Del Piano, Giovanni Mancini, Nicola Valenzano', null, 'Pio and Amedeo, friends and partners in a strange funeral home, are forced to leave Foggia because of a sex tape circulating online, which ruins Pio''s wedding to Rosa. After a stop in Rome at Amedeo''s wealthy uncle''s, the two continue their road trip before returning to Foggia, passing through Milan and Amsterdam.', 'Pio and Amedeo, friends and partners in a strange funeral home, are forced to leave Foggia because of a sex tape circulating online, which ruins Pio''s wedding to Rosa. After a stop in Rome at Amedeo''s wealthy uncle''s, the two continue their road trip before returning to Foggia, passing through Milan and Amsterdam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fWTWPCQQO87rnprDTYKYHe643u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260088'),
  ('367231056640693908', 'Amici Come Prima', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Christian De Sica, Andrea Arnone', 'Fausto Brizzi, Marco Martani, Edoardo Falcone', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Regina Orioli, Lunetta Savino, Maurizio Casagrande, Francesco Bruni, Claudio Insegno, Claudio Abbiati', null, 'Cesare Proietti is the esteemed manager of the Relais Colombo, a luxury hotel in Milan. When a group of new Chinese business partners want to revolutionize everything, the hotel owner''s daughter, Luciana, decides to fire Cesare. When Cesare discovers Luciana is looking for a caregiver who can look after her father, he decides to dress up as a charming woman to apply for the role.', 'Cesare Proietti is the esteemed manager of the Relais Colombo, a luxury hotel in Milan. When a group of new Chinese business partners want to revolutionize everything, the hotel owner''s daughter, Luciana, decides to fire Cesare. When Cesare discovers Luciana is looking for a caregiver who can look after her father, he decides to dress up as a charming woman to apply for the role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaDKnCIIZ47BlCMC8YfsIDWaIy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563741'),
  ('304087744975962194', 'Amici comuni', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Marco Castaldi', 'Chiara Laudani', 'Raoul Bova, Francesca Inaudi, Beatrice Arnera', null, 'The theme of the fragility of bonds and contemporary family dynamics is the common thread between the parallel events of two couples, between unstable balances and new beginnings.', 'The theme of the fragility of bonds and contemporary family dynamics is the common thread between the parallel events of two couples, between unstable balances and new beginnings.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6tLRcsrHDpdBZQSJI234Mc3rTub.jpg', 'plex:movie:amici-comuni'),
  ('985367363261275042', 'Amiga do Inimigo', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Plinio Scambora, Plinio Scambora, Nia Santos', 'Vitória Moraes, Bruno Alcântara, Marian Macedo', 'Vitória Moraes, Bruno Alcântara, Jon Vlogs, Luiza Parente, Vee Castro, Muca Muriçoca, Thomaz Costa, João Marcos de Oliveira', null, 'A story full of mysteries and emotions. In this continuation of the webseries, Viih Tube and her gang need to find out who is the Anonymous Recanto, which is spreading the secrets of the school through social networks.', 'A story full of mysteries and emotions. In this continuation of the webseries, Viih Tube and her gang need to find out who is the Anonymous Recanto, which is spreading the secrets of the school through social networks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOyUPA1BdaryeFMAeAXMOVu0AZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716599'),
  ('374829689878383155', 'Amigo', 1980, 'Action, Drama', 'Tito Davison, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Eduardo Galindo, Tito Davison, Jorge Patiño', 'Alfredo Landa, Andrés García, Verónica Miriel, Guillermo Rivas, Pedro Fernández, Ricardo Cortés, Ricardo Carrión, Fernando Pinkus', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilSWwyp8pOFOO6vQ7IRSuTF4HPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266390'),
  ('998068871609190997', 'Amigos hasta la muerte', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Miguel P. Gilaberte, Javi Lopa, Santi Romero', 'Javier Veiga', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Marta Hazas, Javier Veiga, Xosé A. Touriñán, David Amor, Ledicia Sola, Fele Martínez, Xoel López', null, 'María, Nacho and Suso are three lifelong friends. The three have experienced many things together, some very beautiful and others not so much, things that united or separated them. And suddenly, in the middle of life, they must face death.', 'María, Nacho and Suso are three lifelong friends. The three have experienced many things together, some very beautiful and others not so much, things that united or separated them. And suddenly, in the middle of life, they must face death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcADsvCZuq7zm644zukH5Bv5M0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151238'),
  ('949617368395154124', 'Amigos...', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marcos Cabotá, Borja Manso, Mario Montero', 'Borja Cobeaga, Borja Manso', 'Ernesto Alterio, Diego Martín, Alberto Lozano, Goya Toledo, Manuela Velasco, Ramón Esquinas, Elisabet Castellví, Lola Cordón', null, 'The strong friendship between three friends is to be tested at the moment they learn that an old childhood companion has died and has left them his entire estate. To get it they must participate in a pre-planned wager devised by the deceased. This results in a mad spiral of competitiveness that will make the lives of the protagonists transformed forever.', 'The strong friendship between three friends is to be tested at the moment they learn that an old childhood companion has died and has left them his entire estate. To get it they must participate in a pre-planned wager devised by the deceased. This results in a mad spiral of competitiveness that will make the lives of the protagonists transformed forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSxwDghrlt2BYaVFrU55Kkm8YpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79711'),
  ('717638318017333291', 'Amin', 2018, 'Drama', 'Philippe Faucon, Laurent Fénart', 'Philippe Faucon, Mustapha Kharmoudi, Yasmina Nini-Faucon', 'Moustapha Mbengue, Emmanuelle Devos, Ouidad Elma, Fantine Harduin, Loubna Abidar, Marème N''Diaye, Noureddine Benallouche, Moustapha Naham', null, 'Amin has come from Senegal to work in France, leaving behind his wife Aïcha, and their three children. He leads a solitary life in France, where the only space he occupies is his home and the building sites on which he works. Most of his earnings are sent to Senegal. One day, he meets a woman, Gabrielle, and a relationship is born.', 'Amin has come from Senegal to work in France, leaving behind his wife Aïcha, and their three children. He leads a solitary life in France, where the only space he occupies is his home and the building sites on which he works. Most of his earnings are sent to Senegal. One day, he meets a woman, Gabrielle, and a relationship is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUlfkyjH2XQfJ7MyUO82ELaDUrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510641'),
  ('424856415337920589', 'Amina', 2021, 'War, History, Drama', 'Izu Ojukwu, Peter Kreil, Ishaq Sidi Ishaq', 'Frank Uba, Okechukwu Ogunjiofor', 'Lucy Ameh, Ali Nuhu, Clarion Chukwurah-Abiola, Chris Gbakann, Ibrahim Mijinyawa, Ummi Mohammed, Madaki Asabe, Yakubu Mohammed', 'PG-13', 'In 16th-century Zazzau, now Zaria, Nigeria, Amina must utilize her military skills and tactics to defend her family''s kingdom. Based on a true story.', 'In 16th-century Zazzau, now Zaria, Nigeria, Amina must utilize her military skills and tactics to defend her family''s kingdom. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMIQiwLpBfTfe3ZbRlNx4225Mgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885110'),
  ('382065461876521354', 'Amira & Sam', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Sean Mullin, Daniel Vecchione', 'Sean Mullin', 'Martin Starr, Dina Shihabi, Paul Wesley, Laith Nakli, David Rasche, Ross Marquand, Daniel Fox, Alexis Hughes', null, 'Sam, a soldier who had served in Afghanistan and Iraq, meets Amira when he visits her uncle, Bassam, who had served as Sam''s Iraqi translator. Bassam and Sam have a special bond due to their time together in the war. Initially Amira does not trust him because he was an American soldier and her brother was killed by a bomb from American troops in the war. Sam''s cousin, Charlie, asks Sam to help him with illegal hedge funds unbeknownst to Sam at the time. Amira is staying with her uncle Bassam since her father died. She sells bootlegged films on the street corner but is forced to stay with Sam after getting busted; immigration officials begin pursuing her. As the film progresses, Sam and Amira fall in love.', 'Sam, a soldier who had served in Afghanistan and Iraq, meets Amira when he visits her uncle, Bassam, who had served as Sam''s Iraqi translator. Bassam and Sam have a special bond due to their time together in the war. Initially Amira does not trust him because he was an American soldier and her brother was killed by a bomb from American troops in the war. Sam''s cousin, Charlie, asks Sam to help him with illegal hedge funds unbeknownst to Sam at the time. Amira is staying with her uncle Bassam since her father died. She sells bootlegged films on the street corner but is forced to stay with Sam after getting busted; immigration officials begin pursuing her. As the film progresses, Sam and Amira fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrvIQcbEwEyj7i0zhPdqj2WLJkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272602'),
  ('545996996406423489', 'Amis d''enfance', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Sam Karmann, Serge Khalfon', null, 'Anne Jacquemin, Nicolas Briançon, François Vincentelli, Isabelle Gélinas', null, 'Pierre and Aline, in their fifties, decide to take advantage of their guest house one last time by inviting friends. It''s the turn of Max, Pierre''s childhood friend, and his wife Charlotte to be invited. The week promises to be beautiful, between the Avignon Festival and good food and drink. But how can we keep these childhood friendships alive, when the life paths of each of them have diverged over time.', 'Pierre and Aline, in their fifties, decide to take advantage of their guest house one last time by inviting friends. It''s the turn of Max, Pierre''s childhood friend, and his wife Charlotte to be invited. The week promises to be beautiful, between the Avignon Festival and good food and drink. But how can we keep these childhood friendships alive, when the life paths of each of them have diverged over time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZRU0hsTkDOB51OXJWrEfKrjHlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996155'),
  ('363513176835112823', 'Amish Grace', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gregg Champion', 'Micky Levy, Teena Booth', 'Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Tammy Blanchard, Fay Masterson, Madison Mason, Gary Graham, Darcy Rose Byrnes, Karley Scott Collins, Eugene Byrd', null, 'When a gunman killed five Amish children and injured five others in a Nickel Mines, Pennsylvania schoolhouse shooting in October of 2006, the world media attention rapidly turned from the tragic events to the extraordinary forgiveness demonstrated by the Amish community.', 'When a gunman killed five Amish children and injured five others in a Nickel Mines, Pennsylvania schoolhouse shooting in October of 2006, the world media attention rapidly turned from the tragic events to the extraordinary forgiveness demonstrated by the Amish community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oKOrCykTlsT9QZE35P2yAvrvT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45792'),
  ('757536048650590599', 'Amistad', 1997, 'Drama, History, Mystery', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński', 'David Franzoni', 'Morgan Freeman, Nigel Hawthorne, Anthony Hopkins, Djimon Hounsou, Matthew McConaughey, David Paymer, Pete Postlethwaite, Stellan Skarsgård', 'R', 'In 1839, the slave ship Amistad set sail from Cuba to America. During the long trip, Cinque leads the slaves in an unprecedented uprising. They are then held prisoner in Connecticut, and their release becomes the subject of heated debate. Freed slave Theodore Joadson wants Cinque and the others exonerated and recruits property lawyer Roger Baldwin to help his case. Eventually, John Quincy Adams also becomes an ally.', 'In 1839, the slave ship Amistad set sail from Cuba to America. During the long trip, Cinque leads the slaves in an unprecedented uprising. They are then held prisoner in Connecticut, and their release becomes the subject of heated debate. Freed slave Theodore Joadson wants Cinque and the others exonerated and recruits property lawyer Roger Baldwin to help his case. Eventually, John Quincy Adams also becomes an ally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6QqNyIHKow0jngiQgTNBOBrLILM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11831'),
  ('1064503447788338127', 'Amityville 1992: It''s About Time', 1992, 'Horror', 'Tony Randel, Franklin A. Vallette, Christopher Taylor', 'Christopher DeFaria, Antonio Toro', 'Stephen Macht, Shawn Weatherly, Megan Ward, Damon Martin, Jonathan Penner, Nita Talbot, Dean Cochran, Kevin Bourland', 'R', 'A hot-shot architect returns home from his latest business trip with a surprise: an ornate old clock rescued out of a soon-to-be-demolished mansion in Amityville, New York, that brings about a seemingly unstoppable demonic force.', 'A hot-shot architect returns home from his latest business trip with a surprise: an ornate old clock rescued out of a soon-to-be-demolished mansion in Amityville, New York, that brings about a seemingly unstoppable demonic force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpNTpxVQu6YnLm8GvpvGyAGMg5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41671'),
  ('183950765593371500', 'Amityville 3-D', 1983, 'Horror', 'Richard Fleischer, Fred Schuler, Joseph P. Reidy', 'David Ambrose', 'Tony Roberts, Tess Harper, Robert Joy, Candy Clark, Leora Dana, John Beal, John Harkins, Lori Loughlin', 'PG', 'To debunk the Amityville house''s infamous reputation and take advantage of a rock-bottom asking price, skeptical journalist John Baxter buys the place and settles in to write his first novel.', 'To debunk the Amityville house''s infamous reputation and take advantage of a rock-bottom asking price, skeptical journalist John Baxter buys the place and settles in to write his first novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYvFL6REedBvjTSzVAhyk5imJgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27214'),
  ('496821449491231447', 'Amityville II: The Possession', 1982, 'Horror', 'Damiano Damiani, Franco Di Giacomo, David Ticotin', 'Dardano Sacchetti', 'James Olson, Burt Young, Rutanya Alda, Jack Magner, Andrew Prine, Diane Franklin, Moses Gunn, Ted Ross', 'R', 'Anthony and Dolores Montelli, along with their four children, move into their dream house in Amityville and are immediately plagued by a string of paranormal experiences. When the abusive Anthony wrongly places the blame on their children, Dolores recruits a local Catholic priest to exorcise the house.', 'Anthony and Dolores Montelli, along with their four children, move into their dream house in Amityville and are immediately plagued by a string of paranormal experiences. When the abusive Anthony wrongly places the blame on their children, Dolores recruits a local Catholic priest to exorcise the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xx9K2m2Arr5EZUQtmggKtEK1f2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16235'),
  ('849367924013744476', 'Amityville: A New Generation', 1993, 'Horror', 'John Murlowski, Jennifer Marchese, Wally Pfister', 'Christopher DeFaria, Antonio Toro', 'Ross Partridge, Julia Nickson, Lala Sloatman, David Naughton, Barbara Howard, Jack Orend, Richard Roundtree, Terry O''Quinn', 'R', 'Keyes, a successful photographer who lives at the border of Skid Row, notices a homeless man with a strange old mirror. Immediately struck by it for reasons he cannot explain, he convinces the man to sell it to him, soon behaving in increasingly erratic and unhinged ways.', 'Keyes, a successful photographer who lives at the border of Skid Row, notices a homeless man with a strange old mirror. Immediately struck by it for reasons he cannot explain, he convinces the man to sell it to him, soon behaving in increasingly erratic and unhinged ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjWkIHRRj2kOgVMXpK8im4KOcTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33519'),
  ('160380073864936720', 'Amityville: Dollhouse', 1996, 'Horror', 'Steve White, Thomas L. Callaway, Eddie Ziv', 'Joshua Michael Stern', 'Robin Thomas, Starr Andreeff, Allen Cutler, Rachel Duncan, Jarrett Lennon, Clayton Murray, Franc Ross, Lenore Kasdorf', 'R', 'Bill Martin has just finished construction on a picturesque new home for his family, but unknown to him, the previously barren property was once the site of the infamous Amityville murder house, which contains demonic entities with murderous sights on the family.', 'Bill Martin has just finished construction on a picturesque new home for his family, but unknown to him, the previously barren property was once the site of the infamous Amityville murder house, which contains demonic entities with murderous sights on the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6DVwjJ71jzk3DXqrkuvuM6BxW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52263'),
  ('1140222621483596710', 'Amityville: The Awakening', 2017, 'Horror', 'Franck Khalfoun, Matthew L. Henderson, John David Denison', 'Franck Khalfoun', 'Bella Thorne, Cameron Monaghan, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Thomas Mann, Jennifer Morrison, Kurtwood Smith, Mckenna Grace, Taylor Spreitler', 'PG-13', 'Belle, her little sister, and her comatose twin brother move into a new house with their single mother in order to save money to help pay for her brother''s expensive healthcare. But when strange phenomena begin to occur including the miraculous recovery of her brother, Belle begins to suspect her mother isn''t telling her everything and soon learns they moved into the infamous Amityville house.', 'Belle, her little sister, and her comatose twin brother move into a new house with their single mother in order to save money to help pay for her brother''s expensive healthcare. But when strange phenomena begin to occur including the miraculous recovery of her brother, Belle begins to suspect her mother isn''t telling her everything and soon learns they moved into the infamous Amityville house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9Nyu8YZfLsWWbze4DEGPbnwCcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203835'),
  ('23498997803111545', 'Amityville: The Evil Escapes', 1989, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Sandor Stern, Tom Richmond, Karen Gaviola', 'Sandor Stern', 'Patty Duke, Jane Wyatt, Fredric Lehne, Lou Hancock, Brandy Gold, Zoe Trilling, Aron Eisenberg, Norman Lloyd', 'R', 'After moving into their matriarch''s gothic seaside mansion, the Evans family soon becomes host to an uninvited demonic force in the form of a mysterious lamp that once resided in the Amityville house.', 'After moving into their matriarch''s gothic seaside mansion, the Evans family soon becomes host to an uninvited demonic force in the form of a mysterious lamp that once resided in the Amityville house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbR4WSOG87BqFgBExKya2abgUrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55377'),
  ('527778570548316925', 'Amityville: Where the Echo Lives', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Carlos Ayala', 'Carlos Ayala', 'Sarah McDonald, Breanna Rossi, Adela Perez, Nicholas J. Barelli, Hector De Alva, Eugenia Preciado, Adelina Topleva, Olya Marynets', 'PG-13', 'When paranormal investigator Heather West receives a call from a terrified woman who claims her house is inhabited by a ghost, she discovers the building has a horrifying history. After a presence from beyond our world reaches out to her, Heather begins to feel a pull to the other side of the spirit plane. Can this hunter of specters deliver an innocent soul to a place of peace and discover an eternal truth in time to save her own life?', 'When paranormal investigator Heather West receives a call from a terrified woman who claims her house is inhabited by a ghost, she discovers the building has a horrifying history. After a presence from beyond our world reaches out to her, Heather begins to feel a pull to the other side of the spirit plane. Can this hunter of specters deliver an innocent soul to a place of peace and discover an eternal truth in time to save her own life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqhAgE9ceTX8f9xTcqBlmXSuMG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328814'),
  ('436984490334053365', 'Ammonite', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Francis Lee, Stéphane Fontaine, Fiona Weir', 'Francis Lee, Jesse Jeune', 'Kate Winslet, Saoirse Ronan, Gemma Jones, James McArdle, Alec Secăreanu, Fiona Shaw, Sarah White, Liam Thomas', 'R', 'In 1840s England, palaeontologist Mary Anning and a young woman sent by her husband to convalesce by the sea develop an intense relationship. Despite the chasm between their social spheres and personalities, Mary and Charlotte discover they can each offer what the other has been searching for: the realisation that they are not alone. It is the beginning of a passionate and all-consuming love affair that will defy all social bounds and alter the course of both lives irrevocably.', 'In 1840s England, palaeontologist Mary Anning and a young woman sent by her husband to convalesce by the sea develop an intense relationship. Despite the chasm between their social spheres and personalities, Mary and Charlotte discover they can each offer what the other has been searching for: the realisation that they are not alone. It is the beginning of a passionate and all-consuming love affair that will defy all social bounds and alter the course of both lives irrevocably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lx4pUHWZoOKJWsVsvurRRNW9FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568467'),
  ('147833592023644316', 'Ammutta Muddica al Cinema', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Arturo Brachetti, Morgan Bertacca', 'Morgan Bertacca, Arturo Brachetti', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Silvana Fallisi', null, 'Film adaptation of the theatrical show Ammutta muddica performed by the trio composed of Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo. The protagonist of the various sketches is the common everyday life, full of bizarre characters and comic situations.', 'Film adaptation of the theatrical show Ammutta muddica performed by the trio composed of Aldo, Giovanni and Giacomo. The protagonist of the various sketches is the common everyday life, full of bizarre characters and comic situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3T93MN5GKj0mcgYNFC57RuZIT8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270479'),
  ('224347027858118912', 'Amnesia', 2015, 'Drama', 'Barbet Schroeder, Luciano Tovoli', 'Emilie Bickerton, Peter Steinbach, Susan Hoffman', 'Max Riemelt, Marthe Keller, Bruno Ganz, Corinna Kirchhoff, Marie Leuenberger, Fermí Reixach, Fèlix Pons, Florentin Groll', null, 'A young composer moves from Berlin to the island of Ibiza and begins a friendship with an elderly woman whose painful past has caused her to reject everything to do with Germany, including her native language.', 'A young composer moves from Berlin to the island of Ibiza and begins a friendship with an elderly woman whose painful past has caused her to reject everything to do with Germany, including her native language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xu0b7fLpDPMwSMVQ1Yl5jB97Mu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336197'),
  ('166975581338722345', 'Amnèsia', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Andrea Garello', 'Diego Abatantuono, Sergio Rubini, Martina Stella, Bebo Storti, Juanjo Puigcorbé, Rubén Ochandiano, María Jurado, Antonia San Juan', null, 'On the Spanish island of Ibiza, porn filmmaker Sandro and Angelino, the manager of a beachside watering hole, find their very different lives overlapping. Meanwhile, the island police chief, who is currently at odds with his rebellious son Jorge, is investigating the death of a drug dealer (which was accidentally brought on by Angelino). Jorge''s plans to move to America have so far been thwarted by his father, but when he finds out about the affair his dad had been having with a male nightclub dancer, he uses it as blackmail fodder.', 'On the Spanish island of Ibiza, porn filmmaker Sandro and Angelino, the manager of a beachside watering hole, find their very different lives overlapping. Meanwhile, the island police chief, who is currently at odds with his rebellious son Jorge, is investigating the death of a drug dealer (which was accidentally brought on by Angelino). Jorge''s plans to move to America have so far been thwarted by his father, but when he finds out about the affair his dad had been having with a male nightclub dancer, he uses it as blackmail fodder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQCwWatKqoY404wgvG0lCOzKyHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57342'),
  ('643398695218039051', 'Amnesiac', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Michael Polish, Jayson Crothers', 'Mike Le, Amy Kolquist', 'Kate Bosworth, Wes Bentley, Shashawnee Hall, Richard Riehle, Patrick Bauchau, Olivia Rose Keegan', 'R', 'The story of a man who wakes up in bed suffering from memory loss after being in an accident, only to begin to suspect that his wife may not be his real wife and that a web of lies and deceit deepen inside the house where he soon finds himself a prisoner.', 'The story of a man who wakes up in bed suffering from memory loss after being in an accident, only to begin to suspect that his wife may not be his real wife and that a web of lies and deceit deepen inside the house where he soon finds himself a prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dazYq2JoKpKjtVySA9vmLCv16J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351043'),
  ('1005778974704949031', 'Amok', 1934, 'Drama', 'Curt Courant, Fyodor Otsep', 'H.R. Lenormand, André Lang', 'Marcelle Chantal, Jean Yonnel, Valéry Inkijinoff, Jean Servais, Fréhel, Pierre Magnier, Hubert Daix, Madeleine Guitty', null, 'Dr. Holk leads an isolated and lonely existence in a small, Dutch colony in the tropics. Having fled from love and civilization, his only companions now are alcohol and his work, which takes him to villages ravaged by dirt, fever and a strange illness which turns innocent people into madmen: Amok. One day, he is called on by Helene Haviland, who asks him to abort her lover''s child before her husband returns from abroad. Even though Holk is enchanted by her seductive beauty, he haughtily refuses her request. Rejected, the woman turns to a Chinese practitioner. When Holk tracks her down in a dirty dive, it''s already too late for the two of them.', 'Dr. Holk leads an isolated and lonely existence in a small, Dutch colony in the tropics. Having fled from love and civilization, his only companions now are alcohol and his work, which takes him to villages ravaged by dirt, fever and a strange illness which turns innocent people into madmen: Amok. One day, he is called on by Helene Haviland, who asks him to abort her lover''s child before her husband returns from abroad. Even though Holk is enchanted by her seductive beauty, he haughtily refuses her request. Rejected, the woman turns to a Chinese practitioner. When Holk tracks her down in a dirty dive, it''s already too late for the two of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiUnJyBUZd2Q51cIb2YNRAbWXFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170608'),
  ('517067929021610508', 'Amon Saga', 1986, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Shunji Oga, Susumu Nishizawa, Michi Himeno', 'Noboru Shiroyama', 'Kenyu Horiuchi, Banjo Ginga, Mugihito, Koji Totani, Yoshino Takamori, Ichiro Nagai, Kiyoshi Kobayashi', null, 'Set in a world of fantasy and adventure, Amon is a young warrior embarking on a quest to avenge the death of his mother. When the hunt leads him ultimately to the kingdom of Valhiss, Amon enlists in the ranks of the Emperor''s army in order to gain an opportunity to exact his revenge. However, a chance encounter with the Princess Lichia, being held captive by the Emperor in an effort to ransom a map away from his main rival, King Darai-Sem, Amon must decide whether to follow his path of revenge or to help rescue the Princess in an effort to save a lost kingdom.', 'Set in a world of fantasy and adventure, Amon is a young warrior embarking on a quest to avenge the death of his mother. When the hunt leads him ultimately to the kingdom of Valhiss, Amon enlists in the ranks of the Emperor''s army in order to gain an opportunity to exact his revenge. However, a chance encounter with the Princess Lichia, being held captive by the Emperor in an effort to ransom a map away from his main rival, King Darai-Sem, Amon must decide whether to follow his path of revenge or to help rescue the Princess in an effort to save a lost kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n86GPjcd51wMNgGJj7dwCJhG4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88852'),
  ('265139111900697947', 'Among Adults', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Stéphane Brizé', null, 'Edith Mérieau, Vincent Dubois, Jeanne Ferron, Philippe Fauconnier, Céline Gorget, Vincent Rocher, France Ducateau, Cyril Couton', null, 'Six women and six men. Twelve adults who love, lie, manipulate, cheat, trust and break up. So goes life...', 'Six women and six men. Twelve adults who love, lie, manipulate, cheat, trust and break up. So goes life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PRz3jjT1ExzTAoq6qRZ12OKFd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51858'),
  ('226020636978116932', 'Among Friends', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Danielle Harris', 'Alyssa Lobit', 'Christopher Backus, Jennifer Blanc, AJ Bowen, Dana Daurey, Brianne Davis, Kamala Jones, Alyssa Lobit, Chris Meyer', 'R', 'A twisted horror about a dinner party gone wrong. Set against an 80s backdrop, the good time takes a dark turn when one in the group hijacks the evening in an attempt to help the others come clean about their secret betrayals against one another–and is willing to cut through the bone in order to expose the truth.', 'A twisted horror about a dinner party gone wrong. Set against an 80s backdrop, the good time takes a dark turn when one in the group hijacks the evening in an attempt to help the others come clean about their secret betrayals against one another–and is willing to cut through the bone in order to expose the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iy2golngZQWB424znah0qvhv93O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125558'),
  ('1150562558298535568', 'Among Friends', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux, Régis Blondeau', 'Éric Besnard, Richard Grandpierre', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gérard Jugnot, François Berléand, Zabou Breitman, Mélanie Doutey, Isabelle Gélinas, Jean-Philippe Ricci, Justine Bruneau', null, 'Three longtime friends set off on a boat trip with their romantic partners, but inclement weather, jealousy and confessions, will put to test their friendships.', 'Three longtime friends set off on a boat trip with their romantic partners, but inclement weather, jealousy and confessions, will put to test their friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUs2lmyZBAmAyvXEpeFrVVXhYYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333549'),
  ('737729866721234858', 'Among the Living', 1941, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Stuart Heisler, Theodor Sparkuhl', 'Garrett Fort, Lester Cole', 'Albert Dekker, Susan Hayward, Harry Carey, Frances Farmer, Gordon Jones, Jean Phillips, Ernest Whitman, Maude Eburne', 'NR', 'A mentally unstable man, who has been kept in isolation for years, escapes and causes trouble for his identical twin brother.', 'A mentally unstable man, who has been kept in isolation for years, escapes and causes trouble for his identical twin brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aoAdkSaUmIFlxQtt5vgD0lHHYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37039'),
  ('605004742892696229', 'Among the Living', 2014, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Julien Maury, Antoine Sanier, Alexandre Bustillo', 'Julien Maury, Alexandre Bustillo', 'Anne Marivin, Théo Fernandez, Francis Renaud, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Damien Ferdel, Fabien Jegoudez, Nicolas Giraud, Béatrice Dalle', 'NR', 'Three teenagers skip school in order to explore an abandoned film studio lot where they catch sight of a woman being dragged by a masked man.', 'Three teenagers skip school in order to explore an abandoned film studio lot where they catch sight of a woman being dragged by a masked man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnenGxU08EzNpjz7LYPj4pBEFYf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254186'),
  ('880845735440932892', 'Among the Living', 2022, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Rob Worsey', 'Rob Worsey', 'Dean Michael Gregory, George Newton, Melissa Worsey, Leon Worsey, Emily Rose Holt, Alexander King, Emma Wise, Rob Humphries', 'NR', 'Stranded in the aftermath of a deadly outbreak, a brother fights to protect his sister while he desperately searches to find refuge and avoid an infected population with a thirst for blood.', 'Stranded in the aftermath of a deadly outbreak, a brother fights to protect his sister while he desperately searches to find refuge and avoid an infected population with a thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q7XqJ0QObvtY1hJB3hmAOgNtRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985890'),
  ('9916266958098925', 'Among the Shadows', 2019, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Tiago Mesquita, Patrice Michaux, Tiago Mesquita', 'Mark Morgan', 'Lindsay Lohan, Charlotte Beckett, Gianni Capaldi, Dominik Madani, Reynald Bialès, Barry Jay Minoff, Kristoffel Verdonck, John Flanders', null, 'A private investigator must unravel the murder of her uncle while keeping the secret that she is a descendant from a line of werewolves.', 'A private investigator must unravel the murder of her uncle while keeping the secret that she is a descendant from a line of werewolves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AceMLZlylJ62T3lfWpjLvALysVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510689'),
  ('806018223429884797', 'Among Those Present', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Fred C. Newmeyer', 'Hal Roach, Sam Taylor', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, James T. Kelley, Aggie Herring, Vera White, William Gillespie, H.C. Simmons', 'NR', 'An ambitious coat-room checker impersonates an English nobleman.', 'An ambitious coat-room checker impersonates an English nobleman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enrEcxpzQ8g4drjM3r0a0cvwzHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53525'),
  ('744677760872800454', 'Among Wolves', 2010, 'Drama', 'Gerardo Olivares, Óscar Durán', 'Gerardo Olivares', 'Juan José Ballesta, Manuel Camacho, Sancho Gracia, Carlos Bardem, Eduardo Gómez, Àlex Brendemühl, Dafne Fernández, Luisa Martín', null, 'Entre lobos (Among Wolves) tells the remarkable story of a poor country boy named Marcos, who at the age of 7 is handed over to his father''s employer, a rich landowner, who in turn delivers him to a life of labor with a hermetic goatherd in an isolated valley. The old man, who lives in a cave, is unused to human company and at first seems not very interested in having a live-in apprentice. The boy, who was abused by his parents, is frightened and equally aloof initially. Despite this, the shepherd begins teaching Marcos how to herd the goats, as well as how to care for himself and how to survive in the wilderness by trapping and fishing.', 'Entre lobos (Among Wolves) tells the remarkable story of a poor country boy named Marcos, who at the age of 7 is handed over to his father''s employer, a rich landowner, who in turn delivers him to a life of labor with a hermetic goatherd in an isolated valley. The old man, who lives in a cave, is unused to human company and at first seems not very interested in having a live-in apprentice. The boy, who was abused by his parents, is frightened and equally aloof initially. Despite this, the shepherd begins teaching Marcos how to herd the goats, as well as how to care for himself and how to survive in the wilderness by trapping and fishing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiW0ZyV08G7f9Z1tCnN3RnRzJhY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59835'),
  ('548448383122798531', 'Amor Bandido', 1979, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lauro Escorel, Angelo Gastal, Fábio Barreto', 'Leopoldo Serran, José Louzeiro', 'Paulo Gracindo, Cristina Aché, Paulo Guarnieri, Ligia Diniz, Flávio São Thiago, Hélio Ary, Vinícius Salvatori, José Dumont', null, 'Police investigator Galvão is pursuing two trails, one professional and one personal. While he looks for a serial killer, he also searches for his estranged daughter, Sandra, whom he kicked out of the house. Lives intersect when the serial killer, Toninho, befriends Sandra, now an exotic dancer and prostitute living and working in the seamy underside of late 1970s Rio.', 'Police investigator Galvão is pursuing two trails, one professional and one personal. While he looks for a serial killer, he also searches for his estranged daughter, Sandra, whom he kicked out of the house. Lives intersect when the serial killer, Toninho, befriends Sandra, now an exotic dancer and prostitute living and working in the seamy underside of late 1970s Rio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42KXfedXmrL2aRQgS6BT25yvWSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75024'),
  ('1015161697631908252', 'Amor Bandido', 2021, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Manuel Rebella, Daniel Werner, Esteban Trivisonno', 'Daniel Werner, Diego Ezequiel Ávalos', 'Renato Quattordio, Romina Ricci, Rafael Ferro, Mónica Gonzaga, Sergio Prina, Susana Manchini, Carlos Mena, Jorge Prado', null, 'Joan is a naïve, 16-year-old who falls in love easily. One day he decides to escape to the provinces with Luciana, a beautiful 35-year-old woman and a teacher at his school, in order to give free rein to his love. Soon, Joan discovers with horror that he has fallen into a trap that is a mix between sex, money, politics and violence.', 'Joan is a naïve, 16-year-old who falls in love easily. One day he decides to escape to the provinces with Luciana, a beautiful 35-year-old woman and a teacher at his school, in order to give free rein to his love. Soon, Joan discovers with horror that he has fallen into a trap that is a mix between sex, money, politics and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qb3YySysqo8ikQoagBIz29BZOmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:792001'),
  ('756979070270534250', 'Amor de hombre', 1997, 'Drama', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Juan Luis Iborra', 'Yolanda García Serrano, Juan Luis Iborra', 'Loles León, Andrea Occhipinti, Pedro Mari Sánchez, Armando del Río, Roberto Álvarez, Romà Sánchez', 'NR', 'Set in Madrid, Spain, this engaging comedy chronicles the complex relationship between single female Esperanza, who can''t buy a date, and her best friend Ramón, a gay divorce attorney whose bed is never empty. The pair''s friendship is put to the test when Esperanza introduces Ramón to her fellow teacher -- who soon sends Ramón''s life spinning out of control.', 'Set in Madrid, Spain, this engaging comedy chronicles the complex relationship between single female Esperanza, who can''t buy a date, and her best friend Ramón, a gay divorce attorney whose bed is never empty. The pair''s friendship is put to the test when Esperanza introduces Ramón to her fellow teacher -- who soon sends Ramón''s life spinning out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdL87ZaQxot8a1ayHv364YwhuVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23429'),
  ('847543490421508296', 'Amor en el aire', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Luis César Amadori, Roberto Cirla, Antonio L. Ballesteros', 'Jesús María de Arozamena, Luis César Amadori', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Palito Ortega, Fernando Rey, Amalia de Isaura, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Alberto Dalbés, Tomás Blanco, Manuel Alexandre', null, 'An Argentine travels to Spain to begin his studies. During the flight, he causes so much troubles to a flight attendant that she is fired. At home, the ex flight attendant discovers some dresses that belonged to her grandmother and decides to try her luck with an artist representative. There she will find the guy who caused his dismissal. Both fail to act in Barcelona, ​​but the boy''s father attended the performance, being surprised, because he believed his son was studying in Madrid.', 'An Argentine travels to Spain to begin his studies. During the flight, he causes so much troubles to a flight attendant that she is fired. At home, the ex flight attendant discovers some dresses that belonged to her grandmother and decides to try her luck with an artist representative. There she will find the guy who caused his dismissal. Both fail to act in Barcelona, ​​but the boy''s father attended the performance, being surprised, because he believed his son was studying in Madrid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOwtVbxsuj8xNNWmjjQFlLeJYXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102706'),
  ('209125540359584148', 'Amor letra por letra', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Luis Eduardo Reyes', null, 'Silvia Navarro, Alan Estrada, Octavio Ocaña, Shakti Urrutia, Rafael Amaya, Plutarco Haza, Helena Rojo, Patricia Reyes Spíndola', null, 'Work colleagues Hanna and Amanda are unexpectedly laid off. Since Amanda is leaving town, Hanna deposits both of their severance checks into her account. Unfortunately, Hanna screwed up and the money went somewhere it wasn’t intended – which puts her on a direct collision course with some eligible and not so eligible bachelors. Now, between her search for a new job and her hilarious forays into babysitting Amanda’s son, Hanna has to find and retrieve the loot in this hilarious misadventure that proves romance happens where and when you least expect it.', 'Work colleagues Hanna and Amanda are unexpectedly laid off. Since Amanda is leaving town, Hanna deposits both of their severance checks into her account. Unfortunately, Hanna screwed up and the money went somewhere it wasn’t intended – which puts her on a direct collision course with some eligible and not so eligible bachelors. Now, between her search for a new job and her hilarious forays into babysitting Amanda’s son, Hanna has to find and retrieve the loot in this hilarious misadventure that proves romance happens where and when you least expect it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxH7NfCWLlDuZcJKvmL1G9ay9qM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66768'),
  ('1090231310837596093', 'Amor tóxico', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror, Romance', 'César Pujol, Norberto Ramos del Val', 'Toni Junyent, Pablo Vázquez', 'Eduardo Ferrés, Ann M. Perelló, Daniel Castro, Ana Rujas, Antonio Trashorras, Mariu Bárcena, Álvaro Lafora, Diana Gómez', null, 'A young man racks up a series of disastrous first dates, until he spends the night with an unconventional young woman who upends his life.', 'A young man racks up a series of disastrous first dates, until he spends the night with an unconventional young woman who upends his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOnEuRLaOLFuc3k2SVl1W4JCuHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371303'),
  ('1146638767701727209', 'Amore 14', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Federico Moccia, Marcello Montarsi', 'Chiara Barzini, Federico Moccia, Luca Infascelli', 'Veronica Olivier, Beatrice Flammini, Flavia Roberto, Raniero Monaco Di Lapio, Giuseppe Maggio, Emiliana Franzone, Isabelle Adriani, Pietro De Silva', null, 'Come ogni 14enne Carolina, detta Caro,è impegnata a districarsi tra la scuola, gli amici e il rapporto spesso conflittuale con i genitori, si trova improvvisamente alle prese con i turbamenti legati al primo amore che ha il nome e il volto di Massimiliano. Ad aiutarla nel suo cammino verso la scoperta delle gioie e dei dolori sentimentali ci saranno le sue amiche del cuore e la sua famiglia', 'Come ogni 14enne Carolina, detta Caro,è impegnata a districarsi tra la scuola, gli amici e il rapporto spesso conflittuale con i genitori, si trova improvvisamente alle prese con i turbamenti legati al primo amore che ha il nome e il volto di Massimiliano. Ad aiutarla nel suo cammino verso la scoperta delle gioie e dei dolori sentimentali ci saranno le sue amiche del cuore e la sua famiglia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUgig89OMhOPPshIsIWzuE0MEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35885'),
  ('996153982683484608', 'Amore a prima vista', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Olivier Gérard, Mauro Marchetti', 'Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Maurizio Casagrande, Biagio Izzo, Carlo Buccirosso, Nando Paone, Mandala Tayde, Tosca D''Aquino, Linda Moretti', null, 'A man falls in love with a dude after a corneal transplantation.', 'A man falls in love with a dude after a corneal transplantation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7g7SWqVFe5ak0oCqL3sF4hnkC7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59044'),
  ('929867563348546421', 'Amore Mio', 2023, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Gouix, Jeanne Tassy, Ronan Leroy', 'Camille Lugan, Guillaume Gouix, Fanny Burdino', 'Alysson Paradis, Élodie Bouchez, Félix Maritaud, Viggo Ferreira Redier, Pierre Cévaër, Nicole Barrière, Lucile Durant, Youness Polastron', null, 'Today is Raphael’s funeral. His young wife Lola doesn’t know what to do with her sadness, or with her 7-year-old son’s, or with anyone’s. Her sister Margaux is here, though they have been estranged for years. On their way to the ceremony, Lola forces Margaux to flee the procession and to take them away from this sad reality. During this improvised trip, the two sisters will rediscover each other and relearn freedom. The freedom of not wanting to bury the man you love.', 'Today is Raphael’s funeral. His young wife Lola doesn’t know what to do with her sadness, or with her 7-year-old son’s, or with anyone’s. Her sister Margaux is here, though they have been estranged for years. On their way to the ceremony, Lola forces Margaux to flee the procession and to take them away from this sad reality. During this improvised trip, the two sisters will rediscover each other and relearn freedom. The freedom of not wanting to bury the man you love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f61XyzSquDjEEm6xh0zyU3frEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958189'),
  ('1103190753124535471', 'Amore, bugie e calcetto', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Luca Lucini', 'Luca Lucini', 'Claudio Bisio, Filippo Nigro, Claudia Pandolfi, Giuseppe Battiston, Chiara Mastalli, Andrea De Rosa, Pietro Sermonti, Max Mazzotta', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQQdIfS5PmQ4aoP0M3XbS0Vsmlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57114'),
  ('155017510486180815', 'Amorosa', 1986, 'Drama', 'Mai Zetterling, Mischa Gavrjusjov, Rune Ericson', 'Mai Zetterling', 'Stina Ekblad, Erland Josephson, Philip Zandén, Lena T. Hansson, Peter Schildt, Catherine de Seynes, Olof Thunberg, Börje Ahlstedt', null, 'About the Swedish author Agnes Von Krusenstjerna during the period of her marriage to David Sprengel. In the hallucinatory opening sequence she is brought in a straitjacket by her husband and two psychiatric nurses through the Venice Carnival nocturnal antics to a mental hospital in the city. With her is a manuscript of her autobiography, which she calls "her child". The book is Agnes showdown with her family, and in flashbacks presented, Agnes progress from the author of innocent girls'' books to serious and self-consuming novelist.', 'About the Swedish author Agnes Von Krusenstjerna during the period of her marriage to David Sprengel. In the hallucinatory opening sequence she is brought in a straitjacket by her husband and two psychiatric nurses through the Venice Carnival nocturnal antics to a mental hospital in the city. With her is a manuscript of her autobiography, which she calls "her child". The book is Agnes showdown with her family, and in flashbacks presented, Agnes progress from the author of innocent girls'' books to serious and self-consuming novelist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJTaLsIi1vx0gMrtOUfXLInZc9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204128'),
  ('629948377171672930', 'Amorth, the Exorcist', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Giacomo Franciosa', null, 'Gabriele Amorth, Francoise Dermine, Maurizio Pincherle, Vincenzo Scarpello, Francesco Vaiasuso', null, 'The intriguing life of Father Gabriele Amorth, the famed exorcist, and witness his confrontations with the devil''s influence on humanity in this revealing biopic.', 'The intriguing life of Father Gabriele Amorth, the famed exorcist, and witness his confrontations with the devil''s influence on humanity in this revealing biopic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLXWUgpaegguxnhKpCfue5kWPN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887957'),
  ('1060389921966402349', 'Amos', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Tuchner, Fred J. Koenekamp, Jodi Ehrlich', null, 'Kirk Douglas, Elizabeth Montgomery, Dorothy McGuire, Pat Morita, James Sloyan, Ray Walston, Jerry Hausner, Don Keefer', null, 'Amos Lasher loses his wife and home in an accident, finding himself in the care of the state, or specifically speaking, the Sunset Nursing Home. Here he finds the head nurse, Daisy Daws, ruling the cowed patients with an iron hand, but as his determination to get out of Sunset grows, the more sinister his situation becomes.', 'Amos Lasher loses his wife and home in an accident, finding himself in the care of the state, or specifically speaking, the Sunset Nursing Home. Here he finds the head nurse, Daisy Daws, ruling the cowed patients with an iron hand, but as his determination to get out of Sunset grows, the more sinister his situation becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRFyCqIAKDWtfFynpI4Vaw0ooCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263057'),
  ('41778490981116682', 'Amos & Andrew', 1993, 'Action, Comedy', 'E. Max Frye, Walt Lloyd, Henry J. Bronchtein', 'E. Max Frye', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Nicolas Cage, Michael Lerner, Margaret Colin, Dabney Coleman, Brad Dourif, Chelcie Ross, Jordan Lund', 'PG-13', 'When Andrew Sterling, a successful black urbanite writer, buys a vacation home on a resort in New England the police mistake him for a burglar. After surrounding his home with armed men, Chief Tolliver realizes his mistake and to avoid the bad publicity offers a thief in his jail, Amos Odell a deal.', 'When Andrew Sterling, a successful black urbanite writer, buys a vacation home on a resort in New England the police mistake him for a burglar. After surrounding his home with armed men, Chief Tolliver realizes his mistake and to avoid the bad publicity offers a thief in his jail, Amos Odell a deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD2fem9pVsODpUQUgWgoEfdNZyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31000'),
  ('746820863322206291', 'Amour Fou', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jessica Hausner, Martin Gschlacht', 'Jessica Hausner', 'Christian Friedel, Stephan Grossmann, Katharina Schüttler, Hana Sofia Lopes, Eva-Maria Kurz, Sandra Hüller, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Peter Jordan', null, 'Heinrich wishes to conquer death through love, and when he meets Henriette, the wife of a business acquaintance, she expresses interest in a suicide pact when she learns she has a terminal illness.', 'Heinrich wishes to conquer death through love, and when he meets Henriette, the wife of a business acquaintance, she expresses interest in a suicide pact when she learns she has a terminal illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apP5NBwevSugvjssfoUvZ0KMj3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266044'),
  ('72425847294353531', 'Amours à mort', 2019, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Olivier Barma', 'David Crozier, Camille Guichard', 'Jérôme Robart, Jeanne Bournaud, Sam Karmann, Jean-Pierre Malo, Alex Fondja, Marie Narbonne, Pierre Laplace, Christian Drillaud', null, 'Deep in the heart of the Moselle, in the Uckange furnace Park, is a crime scene as spectacular as it is baffling. The victim is the former Director of the site. When the relentless but sensitive Clément Leroy, captain of the criminal section of the Metz gendarmerie, sets out to investigate, he reconnects with his childhood love, Laure Thouvenin, the victim''s daughter and a specialist in industrial history. As this free and unconventional woman becomes increasingly involved in the case, she and Leroy unravel the shocking story of their respective families running over three generations.', 'Deep in the heart of the Moselle, in the Uckange furnace Park, is a crime scene as spectacular as it is baffling. The victim is the former Director of the site. When the relentless but sensitive Clément Leroy, captain of the criminal section of the Metz gendarmerie, sets out to investigate, he reconnects with his childhood love, Laure Thouvenin, the victim''s daughter and a specialist in industrial history. As this free and unconventional woman becomes increasingly involved in the case, she and Leroy unravel the shocking story of their respective families running over three generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfCUlDogOQug2Em9b6eCSauXq8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735477'),
  ('214578555048583167', 'Amparo', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Simón Mesa Soto', 'Simón Mesa Soto', 'Sandra Melissa Torres, Luciana Gallego Alvarez, Diego Aleandro Tobon, John Jairo Montoya Mazo', null, 'Colombia, 1990’s. A single mother attempts to keep her family together after her son is drafted by the army and assigned to the front in the country’s most dangerous war zone. To do this, she embarks on a journey against time in a society ruled by men, corruption and violence.', 'Colombia, 1990’s. A single mother attempts to keep her family together after her son is drafted by the army and assigned to the front in the country’s most dangerous war zone. To do this, she embarks on a journey against time in a society ruled by men, corruption and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85uHIklLaXg4UpuImeGgJgAv29N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766710'),
  ('839360192033044915', 'Amphibian Man', 1962, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Vladimir Chebotaryov, Gennadi Kazansky, Eduard Rozovsky', 'Akiba Golburt, Aleksei Kapler, Aleksandr Ksenofontov', 'Vladimir Korenev, Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Mikhail Kozakov, Nikolai Simonov, Anatoliy Smiranin, Vladlen Davydov, Albert Antonyan, Nina Bolshakova', null, 'People living at a seashore town are frightened by reports of an unknown creature called "the sea devil". Nobody knows what it is, but it''s really the son of doctor Salvator. The doctor performed surgery on his son and now young Ichtiander can live under water. This gives him certain advantages, but also creates a lot of problems.', 'People living at a seashore town are frightened by reports of an unknown creature called "the sea devil". Nobody knows what it is, but it''s really the son of doctor Salvator. The doctor performed surgery on his son and now young Ichtiander can live under water. This gives him certain advantages, but also creates a lot of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nICdk7XHOzX2KuiDH8NpadqUzh1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43685'),
  ('643455832297805682', 'Amreeka', 2009, 'Drama', 'Cherien Dabis, Tobias Datum', 'Cherien Dabis', 'Nisreen Faour, Melkar Muallem, Hiam Abbass, Alia Shawkat, Jenna Kawar, Joseph Ziegler, Yussuf Abu-Warda, Selena Haddad', null, 'Eager to provide a better future for her son, Fadi, divorcée Muna Farah leaves her Palestinian homeland and takes up residence in rural Illinois -- just in time to encounter the domestic repercussions of America''s disastrous war in Iraq. Now, the duo must reinvent their lives with some help from Muna''s sister, Raghda, and brother-in-law, Nabeel.', 'Eager to provide a better future for her son, Fadi, divorcée Muna Farah leaves her Palestinian homeland and takes up residence in rural Illinois -- just in time to encounter the domestic repercussions of America''s disastrous war in Iraq. Now, the duo must reinvent their lives with some help from Muna''s sister, Raghda, and brother-in-law, Nabeel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMQEHscCqKLz7JXFfU87kdZU8uE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29134'),
  ('693597221337910990', 'Amrum', 2025, 'Drama', 'Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Monique Akin, Jacqueline Rietz', 'Fatih Akin, Hark Bohm', 'Jasper Billerbeck, Diane Kruger, Kian Köppke, Laura Tonke, Hark Bohm, Matthias Schweighöfer, Lisa Hagmeister, Detlev Buck', null, 'On Amrum Island in spring 1945, twelve-year-old Nanning hunts seals, fishes at night, and works the fields to help feed his family. When the war ends, his mother sinks into depression, and he must navigate new conflicts while struggling to find his own path.', 'On Amrum Island in spring 1945, twelve-year-old Nanning hunts seals, fishes at night, and works the fields to help feed his family. When the war ends, his mother sinks into depression, and he must navigate new conflicts while struggling to find his own path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrFHlsSa5bK2LrV0oN6xpdodyBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1269644'),
  ('728044081473800236', 'Amrutanjan', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Jothirao Mohit', 'Jothirao Mohit', 'Payal Chengappa, Shree Bhavya, Sudhakar Gowda, Pallavi Parva, Karthik Ruvary', null, 'One mad father, one fearless son, unlimited friendship, and a love story that turns life upside down. This roller-coaster of laughter and emotion delivers nonstop entertainment.', 'One mad father, one fearless son, unlimited friendship, and a love story that turns life upside down. This roller-coaster of laughter and emotion delivers nonstop entertainment.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYmJkMmYyMTQtOGZlNC00YzA5LTg3ZDMtZjIxZjE5NDY4YzQ1XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:amrutanjan'),
  ('1086993438500312947', 'Amsterdam', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Stefan Miljevic', 'Stefan Miljevic, Louis Champagne, Gabriel Sabourin', 'Gabriel Sabourin, Louis Champagne, Robin Aubert, Fanny Mallette, Suzanne Clément, Marie-Chantal Perron, Norman Helms, Charlie Dagelet', null, 'Three friends go on a fishing trip. Well ... that''s what everyone believes.', 'Three friends go on a fishing trip. Well ... that''s what everyone believes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLJR1p1bc6jnHJjz3k96P3kDwb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222006'),
  ('874062295550448096', 'Amsterdam', 2022, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Kristina Massie, Christina Fong, Alexander Linde', 'David O. Russell', 'Christian Bale, Margot Robbie, John David Washington, Alessandro Nivola, Andrea Riseborough, Anya Taylor-Joy, Chris Rock, Matthias Schoenaerts', 'R', 'In the 1930s, three friends—a doctor, a nurse, and an attorney—witness a murder, become suspects themselves and uncover one of the most outrageous plots in American history.', 'In the 1930s, three friends—a doctor, a nurse, and an attorney—witness a murder, become suspects themselves and uncover one of the most outrageous plots in American history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6sJcVzGCwrDCBMV0DU6eRzA2UxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664469'),
  ('566604943072402228', 'Amsterdam Global Village', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Johan van der Keuken', 'Johan van der Keuken', null, null, '"I am far away on a distant journey through my own city", filmmaker Johan van der Keuken says at the end of his four-hour portrait of Amsterdam. The city is presented as a place where people from all corners of the world live, who all exert their cultural influence on the life in the city. With a motor courier as his central figure, the filmmaker introduces the audience to birds of different feathers. We see diverse cultural expressions, like the house scene, the entry of St. Nicholas and a Ghanese mourning ritual. The binding factor in the film is the concept of ''travelling'', in other words Amsterdam as a global village. The camera travels through the film in three ways: over land, over water (canals) and through the air.', '"I am far away on a distant journey through my own city", filmmaker Johan van der Keuken says at the end of his four-hour portrait of Amsterdam. The city is presented as a place where people from all corners of the world live, who all exert their cultural influence on the life in the city. With a motor courier as his central figure, the filmmaker introduces the audience to birds of different feathers. We see diverse cultural expressions, like the house scene, the entry of St. Nicholas and a Ghanese mourning ritual. The binding factor in the film is the concept of ''travelling'', in other words Amsterdam as a global village. The camera travels through the film in three ways: over land, over water (canals) and through the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73eV0lriytctUoXg3BFv7PwYtKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193150'),
  ('690811265246081354', 'Amsterdamned', 1988, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Marc Felperlaan, Dick Maas', 'Dick Maas', 'Huub Stapel, Monique van de Ven, Serge-Henri Valcke, Lou Landré, Tatum Dagelet, Jaap Stobbe, Bert Haanstra, Tanneke Hartzuiker', 'R', 'A mysterious diver hiding in Amsterdam''s canal system embarks on a rampage of gruesome murders, terrifying city officials and leaving few clues for the city''s best detective, who doesn''t suspect that both his new girlfriend and twelve-year-old daughter may be closer than he is to finding the killer.', 'A mysterious diver hiding in Amsterdam''s canal system embarks on a rampage of gruesome murders, terrifying city officials and leaving few clues for the city''s best detective, who doesn''t suspect that both his new girlfriend and twelve-year-old daughter may be closer than he is to finding the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNPQUEd13n9fIDliOYfOyxfyY4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2093'),
  ('1108376624434404509', 'Amuck!', 1972, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Silvio Amadio, Teo Usuelli', 'Silvio Amadio', 'Barbara Bouchet, Farley Granger, Rosalba Neri, Dino Mele, Umberto Raho, Patrizia Viotti, Nino Segurini, Petar Martinovitch', 'R', 'A beautiful American woman infiltrates the home of a novelist and his wife so she can investigate the disappearance of her lover — who was her employers’ previous secretary — and soon finds herself the target of the couple''s erotic desires and a murder plot.', 'A beautiful American woman infiltrates the home of a novelist and his wife so she can investigate the disappearance of her lover — who was her employers’ previous secretary — and soon finds herself the target of the couple''s erotic desires and a murder plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RHmaVuiePevU1RD1mjZ5AstadD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64528'),
  ('64295535424939701', 'Amulet', 2020, 'Horror', 'Alice Caronna, Irene Maffei, Romola Garai', 'Romola Garai', 'Carla Juri, Alec Secăreanu, Imelda Staunton, Angeliki Papoulia, Anah Ruddin, Paul O''Kelly, Elowen Harris, Jacqueline Roberts', 'R', 'Tomaz, an ex-soldier now homeless in London, is offered a place to stay at a decaying house, inhabited by a young woman and her dying mother. As he starts to fall for Magda, Tomaz cannot ignore his suspicion that something insidious might also be living alongside them.', 'Tomaz, an ex-soldier now homeless in London, is offered a place to stay at a decaying house, inhabited by a young woman and her dying mother. As he starts to fall for Magda, Tomaz cannot ignore his suspicion that something insidious might also be living alongside them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEVyAkEkpwpfyx4oZMg22A8ivDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653615'),
  ('1035874665130294999', 'Amundsen', 2019, 'Drama, History, Adventure', 'Espen Sandberg, Pål Ulvik Rokseth, Tomáš Pavlacký', 'Ravn Lanesskog', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Katherine Waterston, Christian Rubeck, Trond Espen Seim, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Ole Christoffer Ertvaag, Ida Ursin-Holm, Fridtjov Såheim', null, 'The story of Norwegian explorer Roald Amundsen, the leader of the first expedition to reach the South Pole in 1911, and the first person to reach both the North and South Poles in 1926. Follows his all-consuming drive as a polar explorer and the tragedy he brought on himself and others by sacrificing everything in the icy wastelands to achieve his dream.', 'The story of Norwegian explorer Roald Amundsen, the leader of the first expedition to reach the South Pole in 1911, and the first person to reach both the North and South Poles in 1926. Follows his all-consuming drive as a polar explorer and the tragedy he brought on himself and others by sacrificing everything in the icy wastelands to achieve his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvz9rsCnqq1F0MauURPzps11Y6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545836'),
  ('863533627922975788', 'Amusement', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John Simpson, Mark Garrett, Gábor Gajdos', 'Jake Wade Wall', 'Keir O''Donnell, Tad Hilgenbrink, Katheryn Winnick, Laura Breckenridge, Jessica Lucas, Reid Scott, Rena Owen, Kevin Gage', 'R', 'While being interrogated by a police psychiatrist, the near-catatonic Tabitha tries to explain why she and two of her childhood friends are being hunted by a serial killer. The truth that''s dying to come out weaves together three tragic secrets from their past. Two of the girls'' boyfriends become unwitting targets in their deadly game.', 'While being interrogated by a police psychiatrist, the near-catatonic Tabitha tries to explain why she and two of her childhood friends are being hunted by a serial killer. The truth that''s dying to come out weaves together three tragic secrets from their past. Two of the girls'' boyfriends become unwitting targets in their deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XosEzjwTxL4NrVhn7ldunA3kfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13803'),
  ('1096300865530866029', 'Amy', 1981, 'Family, Drama', 'Vincent McEveety, Leonard J. South, Howard Grace', 'Noreen Stone', 'Jenny Agutter, Barry Newman, Kathleen Nolan, Lou Fant, Margaret O''Brien, Nanette Fabray, Frances Bay, Lance LeGault', 'G', 'A woman leaves her husband after the death of her child to teach deaf children how to speak. Her own child was deaf and although she has no formal training she successfully teaches one boy.', 'A woman leaves her husband after the death of her child to teach deaf children how to speak. Her own child was deaf and although she has no formal training she successfully teaches one boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5trg8FZd1Jd9gAPHeN2KVB9Y3S2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217977'),
  ('1120377485673358300', 'Amy', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nadia Tass, David Parker, Keith Wagstaff', 'David Parker', 'Alana De Roma, Rachel Griffiths, Ben Mendelsohn, Nick Barker, Kerry Armstrong, Jeremy Trigatti, William Zappa, Torquil Neilson', null, 'Amy''s father, Franco, was a popular rock musician accidentally electrocuted while performing on stage. The psychological trauma leaves Amy mute and deaf. So the 8-year-old is brought by her mother, Tanya, to Melbourne to diagnose the reasons for her continued silence.', 'Amy''s father, Franco, was a popular rock musician accidentally electrocuted while performing on stage. The psychological trauma leaves Amy mute and deaf. So the 8-year-old is brought by her mother, Tanya, to Melbourne to diagnose the reasons for her continued silence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8s2BUyvDUWQbkm6xZ3gBWwGD9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31768'),
  ('905052482032858339', 'Amy', 2015, 'Documentary, Music', 'Asif Kapadia, Jake Clennell, Ernesto Herrmann', 'Asif Kapadia', 'Amy Winehouse, Mark Ronson, Tony Bennett, Pete Doherty, Juliette Ashby, Yasiin Bey, Mitch Winehouse, Tyler James', 'R', 'A documentary on the life of Amy Winehouse, the immensely talented yet doomed songstress. We see her from her teen years, where she already showed her singing abilities, to her finding success and then her downward spiral into alcoholism and drugs.', 'A documentary on the life of Amy Winehouse, the immensely talented yet doomed songstress. We see her from her teen years, where she already showed her singing abilities, to her finding success and then her downward spiral into alcoholism and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qL0RepWSNUuZoeDXfyhqowVYhrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331781'),
  ('555677728193212648', 'Amy Fisher: My Story', 1992, 'Drama', 'Bradford May, Bradford May', 'Phil Penningroth', 'Ed Marinaro, Noelle Parker, Boyd Kestner, Pierrette Grace, Lawrence Dane, Kate Lynch, Kathleen Laskey, Rino Romano', null, 'This sensational true story of a near fatal attraction left Mary Jo Buttafuoco paralyzed for life and made Amy Fisher America''s most infamous teenager. Imprisoned 5-15 years for a crime she confessed to Fisher has nothing to lose by telling how it was-her way, her story. Deception, Promiscuous Sex, and Violence', 'This sensational true story of a near fatal attraction left Mary Jo Buttafuoco paralyzed for life and made Amy Fisher America''s most infamous teenager. Imprisoned 5-15 years for a crime she confessed to Fisher has nothing to lose by telling how it was-her way, her story. Deception, Promiscuous Sex, and Violence', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymaLZERsJTu03aqHjEScg4Byzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107987'),
  ('463101977765065183', 'Amy Schumer: Emergency Contact', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer', 'R', 'Amy Schumer gets real about lasering her face, postpartum sex, her baby-naming disaster and chewable Viagra in this cheekily candid stand-up special.', 'Amy Schumer gets real about lasering her face, postpartum sex, her baby-naming disaster and chewable Viagra in this cheekily candid stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yi3rC99fntOrrdX3Dg54cM5cKK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128612'),
  ('509541400554658743', 'Amy Schumer: Growing', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Monica Rose, Jim Cimarrusti, Tyler Roach', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer', null, 'Amy Schumer''s live stand-up set performed in Chicago where she jokes about marriage, pregnancy and personal growth.', 'Amy Schumer''s live stand-up set performed in Chicago where she jokes about marriage, pregnancy and personal growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQa9lkX1fYCpsG5Uq8ONOsqlbQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581958'),
  ('373543176153179561', 'Amy Schumer: Live at the Apollo', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Chris Rock', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer', null, 'With her unique blend of honesty and unapologetic humor, Amy Schumer is one of the funniest, freshest faces in the industry today. This October, Schumer''s provocative and hilariously wicked mind will be on full display as she headlines her first HBO stand-up comedy special: ''Amy Schumer: Live at the Apollo.'' Directed by Chris Rock, the one-hour special features the comedian talking about her life and was taped before a live audience at New York’s iconic Apollo Theater.', 'With her unique blend of honesty and unapologetic humor, Amy Schumer is one of the funniest, freshest faces in the industry today. This October, Schumer''s provocative and hilariously wicked mind will be on full display as she headlines her first HBO stand-up comedy special: ''Amy Schumer: Live at the Apollo.'' Directed by Chris Rock, the one-hour special features the comedian talking about her life and was taped before a live audience at New York’s iconic Apollo Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZji0NPuue5QkO9K5ypvb4CoRnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355178'),
  ('106538682402685781', 'Amy Schumer: The Leather Special', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Amy Schumer, Christopher Landy, Dylan Sanford', 'Amy Schumer', 'Amy Schumer', 'NR', 'Comic sensation Amy Schumer riffs on sex, dating and the absurdities of fame in a bold and uncensored stand-up set at Denver''s Bellco Theater.', 'Comic sensation Amy Schumer riffs on sex, dating and the absurdities of fame in a bold and uncensored stand-up set at Denver''s Bellco Theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilM07h1EfcudkfRhmTjelpRl5IQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444513'),
  ('1107239958327341892', 'An Acceptable Loss', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anthony E. Cabral, Joe Chappelle, Petra Korner', 'Joe Chappelle', 'Tika Sumpter, Jamie Lee Curtis, Ben Tavassoli, Jeff Hephner, Deanna Dunagan, Alex Weisman, Ali Burch, Clarke Peters', 'R', 'Former top U.S. security adviser Elizabeth "Libby" Lamm is threatened by associates from her dark past including Rachel Burke a steely, commanding politician with an unwavering knack for achieving her goals. Colluding with Rachel is Adrian, an unyielding, patriotic chief of staff. Martin harbors another type of obsession with Libby in this story of betrayal and regret.', 'Former top U.S. security adviser Elizabeth "Libby" Lamm is threatened by associates from her dark past including Rachel Burke a steely, commanding politician with an unwavering knack for achieving her goals. Colluding with Rachel is Adrian, an unyielding, patriotic chief of staff. Martin harbors another type of obsession with Libby in this story of betrayal and regret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa9y5TuaFagYRGVPLGAUhDStlds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553882'),
  ('579384220809023300', 'An Ache in Every Stake', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Lloyd French', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Gino Corrado, Vernon Dent, Bess Flowers, Bud Jamison', 'NR', 'The stooges are icemen who, while delivering ice to a house on the top of a high hill, destroy several cakes that a wealthy man is trying to bring home. When their antics cause the servants at their customer''s house to quit, the boys are hired to take their place and prepare a dinner party. What they don''t know is that the party is for the man whose cakes they wrecked. When Moe''s gas filled cake explodes and the man realizes who they are, they must leave in a hurry.', 'The stooges are icemen who, while delivering ice to a house on the top of a high hill, destroy several cakes that a wealthy man is trying to bring home. When their antics cause the servants at their customer''s house to quit, the boys are hired to take their place and prepare a dinner party. What they don''t know is that the party is for the man whose cakes they wrecked. When Moe''s gas filled cake explodes and the man realizes who they are, they must leave in a hurry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwbDNCbmqZmoJWKVWnMb93FxLsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115993'),
