  ('908000059919754161', 'An Action Hero', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'Anirudh Iyer, Kaushal Shah, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Neeraj Yadav', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Jaideep Ahlawat, Gautam Joglekar, Harsh Chhaya, Neeraj Madhav, Jitender Hooda, Sumit Singh, Sumit Gahlawat', 'NR', 'At the age of just 30, Maanav at the peak of his acting career gets caught up in a murder accusation, which turns his own life into an eccentric action thriller as he flees the country, with a vengeful politician hot on his heels.', 'At the age of just 30, Maanav at the peak of his acting career gets caught up in a murder accusation, which turns his own life into an eccentric action thriller as he flees the country, with a vengeful politician hot on his heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92hQUSB4vqkOH97znKLD8YFheZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882826'),
  ('411773784617440291', 'An Actor''s Revenge', 1963, 'Drama', 'Kon Ichikawa, Masaya Nakamura, Akira Inoue', 'Natto Wada', 'Kazuo Hasegawa, Fujiko Yamamoto, Ayako Wakao, Eiji Funakoshi, Naritoshi Hayashi, Eijirō Yanagi, Chūsha Ichikawa, Saburo Date', null, 'In Edo Japan, a kabuki actor seeks revenge against the three men who drove his parents to their deaths years ago.', 'In Edo Japan, a kabuki actor seeks revenge against the three men who drove his parents to their deaths years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNjcjBVbXoUQGsJqCkOJvog88kD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27197'),
  ('158997458696164911', 'An Adolescent', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eiji Okuda', 'Izuru Narushima, Mikihiko Renjo, Katsuhiko Manabe', 'Eiji Okuda, Mayu Ozawa, Akira Shoji, Mari Natsuki, Hideo Murota, Katsuhiko Hibino, Akihiro Yoshimura, Kazuhiko Kanayama', null, 'Incredibly indolent cop Tomokawa spends his time making fun of his mentally challenged friend Sukemasa, riding his bike all over the city and sleeping with married women. But his whole world changes when he meets Yoko.', 'Incredibly indolent cop Tomokawa spends his time making fun of his mentally challenged friend Sukemasa, riding his bike all over the city and sleeping with married women. But his whole world changes when he meets Yoko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8TB3TrTJ4613moX81tVFapEZN55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106438'),
  ('240239949438481860', 'An Adventure in Space and Time', 2013, 'Drama', 'Terry McDonough, John Pardue, Andy Pryor', 'Mark Gatiss', 'David Bradley, Jessica Raine, Sacha Dhawan, Brian Cox, Lesley Manville, Jeff Rawle, Claudia Grant, Jemma Powell', 'PG', 'Actor William Hartnell felt trapped by a succession of hard-man roles while wannabe producer Verity Lambert was frustrated by the TV industry''s glass ceiling. Both of them were to find unlikely hope and unexpected challenges in the form of a Saturday tea-time drama. Allied with a team of unusual but brilliant people, they went on to create the longest running science fiction series ever made.', 'Actor William Hartnell felt trapped by a succession of hard-man roles while wannabe producer Verity Lambert was frustrated by the TV industry''s glass ceiling. Both of them were to find unlikely hope and unexpected challenges in the form of a Saturday tea-time drama. Allied with a team of unusual but brilliant people, they went on to create the longest running science fiction series ever made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRrmdPMvCPGcLF6FrvS66STXAyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210024'),
  ('830347398370084787', 'An Adventurous Automobile Trip', 1905, 'Adventure', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Fernande Albany, Henry Fragson, Félix Galipaux, Jane Ivon, Harry Relph', null, 'A man needs to get to Monte Carlo from Paris, but finds out that a train will take 17 hours to get there. He decides to go with a man with a special car, who claims that he can get there in just two hours. Complications ensue.', 'A man needs to get to Monte Carlo from Paris, but finds out that a train will take 17 hours to get there. He decides to go with a man with a special car, who claims that he can get there in just two hours. Complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ3vfT0RkMZ6hYTWCIq43qkD4i8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191625'),
  ('1060188227224152114', 'An Affair', 1998, 'Drama', 'E J-yong, Kim Yeong-cheol', 'E J-yong, Kim Dae-woo', 'Lee Mi-sook, Lee Jung-jae, Song Young-chang, Jung Kyung-soon, Min Kim, Kim Dong-ho', null, 'Seo-hyun is an ordinary housewife in her late thirties with a ten-year-old son and a successful architect husband. For her, life is a series of banal routines. Her sheltered life is suddenly threatened with the appearance of Woo-in, her much younger sister''s attractive new fiancé.', 'Seo-hyun is an ordinary housewife in her late thirties with a ten-year-old son and a successful architect husband. For her, life is a series of banal routines. Her sheltered life is suddenly threatened with the appearance of Woo-in, her much younger sister''s attractive new fiancé.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eN83E4gvGrxg5nxThqkgzWfZqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160270'),
  ('74392120315077782', 'An Affair', 2018, 'Drama', 'Karianne Jungård Nilsen, Katinka Lotherington, Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken', 'Andrea Bræin Hovig, Tarjei Sandvik Moe, Anneke von der Lippe, Carsten Bjørnlund, Lea Meyer, Mattis Herman Nyquist, Ingjerd Egeberg, Anders T. Andersen', null, 'A newly appointed high school teacher begins her job hoping for a fresh start, but her life takes an unsettling turn when a troubled student becomes fixated on her. As boundaries blur and personal and professional lines are tested, the situation escalates, forcing her to confront the consequences of desire, power, and responsibility.', 'A newly appointed high school teacher begins her job hoping for a fresh start, but her life takes an unsettling turn when a troubled student becomes fixated on her. As boundaries blur and personal and professional lines are tested, the situation escalates, forcing her to confront the consequences of desire, power, and responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPu4ytXPm39BW7g257LoMlEmwrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480681'),
