  ('253958533427246201', 'An Affair: A Dangerous Sexual Play', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Min-hwan', null, 'Kim Si-eon, Baek In-kwon, Kim Do-hee', null, 'Ga-eul is six years into her marriage but her trouble with her husband brings her to depend on alcohol. Hee-mang is a writer who lives next door but can''t stand the fighting going on at Ga-eul''s house and makes his way over there one day. Ever since then, Ga-eul goes over to Hee-mang''s house to have sex everytime she fights with her husband. Hee-mang is confused at her behavior and gradually falls for her. Then Ga-eul slowly resolves things with her husband but Hee-mang asks to talk with the three of them...', 'Ga-eul is six years into her marriage but her trouble with her husband brings her to depend on alcohol. Hee-mang is a writer who lives next door but can''t stand the fighting going on at Ga-eul''s house and makes his way over there one day. Ever since then, Ga-eul goes over to Hee-mang''s house to have sex everytime she fights with her husband. Hee-mang is confused at her behavior and gradually falls for her. Then Ga-eul slowly resolves things with her husband but Hee-mang asks to talk with the three of them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXyz4zRt3lFVoJOW4cs2IIxGRIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387843'),
  ('1099760676947490797', 'An Affair: My Friend''s Mom', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kwak Yeong-geun', 'Gi Dae-ho', 'Kim Ji-yeon, Jo Wan-jin, Hayashi Risa, Kim Seung-goo, Ga Bin', null, 'A young mother takes interest in her friend''s son. Her interest in him makes her forget herself and drives her to pursue him.', 'A young mother takes interest in her friend''s son. Her interest in him makes her forget herself and drives her to pursue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzODeFmANKzUAknaNplB0QGqQqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481891'),
  ('1146514751945478127', 'An Affair: My Sister-in-law''s Love', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Min', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Do Mo-se, Kim Ji-yeon', null, 'Eun-joo is a twenty-year-old pre-college student who lives with her sister Eun-hee. Eun-hee is worried about her sister''s academics and hires Je-hyuk as her tutor. Eun-joo falls for Je-hyuk as time goes by. They end up making love. A few months later, Eun-joo improves her grades and passes her tests. However, Eun-hee announces that she''s getting married to Je-hyuk and Eun-joo doesn''t want to lose him...', 'Eun-joo is a twenty-year-old pre-college student who lives with her sister Eun-hee. Eun-hee is worried about her sister''s academics and hires Je-hyuk as her tutor. Eun-joo falls for Je-hyuk as time goes by. They end up making love. A few months later, Eun-joo improves her grades and passes her tests. However, Eun-hee announces that she''s getting married to Je-hyuk and Eun-joo doesn''t want to lose him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4roDAaF9Kpvd9ob6XLkoCRoDLkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554776'),
  ('384414055786024463', 'An Affair: My Wife''s Friend', 2018, 'Romance', 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Kim Hee-jeong, Yoon Da-hyeon, Moon Sung-sik, Choi Woo-suk-I, Yoo Sul-young', null, 'The wife''s friend fills in for the wife on lonely nights! Hyun-joo quits her job and gets kicked out of the house she can''t pay for. In the end, she stays at Hye-jin''s while she looks for a job.', 'The wife''s friend fills in for the wife on lonely nights! Hyun-joo quits her job and gets kicked out of the house she can''t pay for. In the end, she stays at Hye-jin''s while she looks for a job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYSkdwCYZlg1Dr7pZjxPFOyLVqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:559638'),
  ('122753223595489554', 'An Affair: My Wife''s Friend 2', 2019, null, 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Yoon Da-hyeon, Yoo Sul-young, Kim Hee-jeong', null, 'Hyunsoo is lodging at the house of his senior worker, Hyejin. Hyejin has a husband Sang-woo, but in fact, it is an affair with Hyun-soo who makes love secretly. Hyeon-ju, a friend who had been lodging at Hyejin''s house before Hin Pyeon, also beats his job and comes in with a pack of luggage. In the end, Hyejin, Sangwoo, Hyunsu, and Hyunjoo. Four people''s uncomfortable but dizzying cohabitation begins...', 'Hyunsoo is lodging at the house of his senior worker, Hyejin. Hyejin has a husband Sang-woo, but in fact, it is an affair with Hyun-soo who makes love secretly. Hyeon-ju, a friend who had been lodging at Hyejin''s house before Hin Pyeon, also beats his job and comes in with a pack of luggage. In the end, Hyejin, Sangwoo, Hyunsu, and Hyunjoo. Four people''s uncomfortable but dizzying cohabitation begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71F5nIcReEDckIY2FvHE54E0PvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764339'),
  ('224756601143586483', 'An Alan Smithee Film: Burn, Hollywood, Burn', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Hiller, Alan Smithee, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Joe Eszterhas', 'Eric Idle, Ryan O''Neal, Coolio, Chuck D, Sylvester Stallone, Whoopi Goldberg, Jackie Chan, Richard Jeni', 'R', 'Filmmaker Alan Smithee finds himself the unwilling puppet of a potentially bad big budget action film, for which he proceeds to steal the reels, and leaves the cast and crew in a frenzy.', 'Filmmaker Alan Smithee finds himself the unwilling puppet of a potentially bad big budget action film, for which he proceeds to steal the reels, and leaves the cast and crew in a frenzy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KSGv5uV6SJS7mUMlttvLfWA6Lv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78149'),
  ('203753432733473769', 'An Alibi', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Yves Cape, Orso Miret, Yves Cape', 'Emmanuel Mauro, Laurent Roggero', 'Sara Martins, Pascal Demolon, Annelise Hesme, Grégori Derangère, Aurélia Petit, Michaël Cohen, Yannick Choirat', null, 'A group of friends who have known each other for many years meet at Max and Lucie''s house to celebrate Lucie''s birthday. When they arrive, the three guests discover Max kneeling in front of the body of his wife who has been murdered. He is sure that the police will charge him because everything accuses him. Convinced of his innocence, his friends decide to give him an alibi. But the investigation tightens around Max.', 'A group of friends who have known each other for many years meet at Max and Lucie''s house to celebrate Lucie''s birthday. When they arrive, the three guests discover Max kneeling in front of the body of his wife who has been murdered. He is sure that the police will charge him because everything accuses him. Convinced of his innocence, his friends decide to give him an alibi. But the investigation tightens around Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wei2WoPJka60ITevLP9f73guSNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:935412'),
  ('899209639919409888', 'An All Dogs Christmas Carol', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Paul Sabella, Maria Estrada, Gary Selvaggio', 'Jymn Magon', 'Steven Weber, Dom DeLuise, Bebe Neuwirth, Sheena Easton, Ernest Borgnine, Charles Nelson Reilly, Beth Andersen, Taylor Emerson', 'G', 'Charlie, Itchy and Sasha itch and scratch their way through everything and anything in an effort to save Christmas from the wicked hellhound Belladonna, who wants to use dogs from all over the world to ruin Christmas.', 'Charlie, Itchy and Sasha itch and scratch their way through everything and anything in an effort to save Christmas from the wicked hellhound Belladonna, who wants to use dogs from all over the world to ruin Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7J8qq1O1kAjVdpDJnxuzNC5tH3H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51985'),
