  ('492665570177354585', 'An Almost Ordinary Summer', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Simone Godano, Daniele Ciprì', 'Giulia Louise Steigerwalt', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Alessandro Gassmann, Jasmine Trinca, Filippo Scicchitano, Lunetta Savino, Anna Galiena, Rosa Diletta Rossi, Clara Ponsot', null, 'Two families meet for a marriage that neither want, and things take a turn when the respective patriarchs fall in love.', 'Two families meet for a marriage that neither want, and things take a turn when the respective patriarchs fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOMlD3Th68hm3ixh8w6ZP2AooFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575568'),
  ('354116914746734809', 'An Almost Perfect Country', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Massimo Gaudioso', 'Fabio Volo, Silvio Orlando, Carlo Buccirosso, Nando Paone, Miriam Leone, Gea Martire, Francesco De Vito, Maria Paiato', null, 'Pietramezzana, a remote village in the Lucan Dolomites, is likely to disappear. Its inhabitants, led by the volcanic Dominic do not give up and, believing that the opening of a factory may be the solution to all their troubles, they want to make sure that the project is successful ...', 'Pietramezzana, a remote village in the Lucan Dolomites, is likely to disappear. Its inhabitants, led by the volcanic Dominic do not give up and, believing that the opening of a factory may be the solution to all their troubles, they want to make sure that the project is successful ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6lD6Rnexw3TeyuPNYKgzbJUF2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389371'),
  ('147628264556263884', 'An Amazing Couple', 2002, 'Drama', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Ornella Muti, Valérie Mairesse, Catherine Frot, Dominique Blanc, François Morel, Gilbert Melki, Lucas Belvaux, Jean-Baptiste Montagut', null, 'A woman, concerned by her husband''s eccentric behavior, hires a detective to follow his every move -- which yields unexpected results.', 'A woman, concerned by her husband''s eccentric behavior, hires a detective to follow his every move -- which yields unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCfNIZuDMcKQTzcNDSCP4DkL3KK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44539'),
  ('303962862418423626', 'An Ambiguous Report About the End of the World', 1997, 'Mystery, Fantasy', 'Juraj Jakubisko, Petr Hartl, Ján Ďuriš', 'Juraj Jakubisko', 'Deana Horváthová, Milan Bahul, Joachim Kemmer, Jiří Krytinář, Jana Švandová, Pavel Landovský, Vladimír Javorský, Klára Issová', null, 'Set over a two-decade period in a tiny Central European village, this drama not only chronicles a couple''s tragic star-crossed love, it also serves as a metaphor for the tragedy of lost traditions. After opening in the snowy wilds as two people spectacularly die, the story jumps back 20 years as young Verona prepares to marry. Unfortunately, voracious wolves descend upon the ceremony and all but Verona and her courageous 10-year-old brother-in-law Goran, who saves her, perish. That day, Verona gives birth to Veronika and promptly betroths her daughter to the heroic Goran. A decade passes and on Veronika''s 10th birthday, her engagement to Goran is formally announced at a big party. Festivities halt when a troupe of female circus performers and their sly employer Madina show up. Veronika soon finds herself more interested in Madina''s young son Michal than she is in the adult Goran. Meanwhile, the worldly Madina attempts to adjust to life in an old-fashioned village.', 'Set over a two-decade period in a tiny Central European village, this drama not only chronicles a couple''s tragic star-crossed love, it also serves as a metaphor for the tragedy of lost traditions. After opening in the snowy wilds as two people spectacularly die, the story jumps back 20 years as young Verona prepares to marry. Unfortunately, voracious wolves descend upon the ceremony and all but Verona and her courageous 10-year-old brother-in-law Goran, who saves her, perish. That day, Verona gives birth to Veronika and promptly betroths her daughter to the heroic Goran. A decade passes and on Veronika''s 10th birthday, her engagement to Goran is formally announced at a big party. Festivities halt when a troupe of female circus performers and their sly employer Madina show up. Veronika soon finds herself more interested in Madina''s young son Michal than she is in the adult Goran. Meanwhile, the worldly Madina attempts to adjust to life in an old-fashioned village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6c9PunuVD7IRVeFaLntn5pPxCkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162599'),
  ('771390251312831847', 'An American Affair', 2008, 'Drama', 'William Olsson, Dave Insley', 'Alex Metcalf', 'Gretchen Mol, James Rebhorn, Cameron Bright, Noah Wyle, Mark Pellegrino, Perrey Reeves, Jimmy Bellinger, Jermaine Crawford', 'R', 'In the early 1960s, teenager Adam Stafford (Cameron Bright) becomes obsessed with his new neighbor, Catherine Caswell (Gretchen Mol), a divorcée and free spirit. Stafford spies on Caswell as she meets with strange men, and, despite the warnings of his conservative parents, he begins working for her as a gardener. Amid rumors of her affair with President Kennedy, the two become close, but political intrigue surrounding her acquaintances soon infringes on their friendship.', 'In the early 1960s, teenager Adam Stafford (Cameron Bright) becomes obsessed with his new neighbor, Catherine Caswell (Gretchen Mol), a divorcée and free spirit. Stafford spies on Caswell as she meets with strange men, and, despite the warnings of his conservative parents, he begins working for her as a gardener. Amid rumors of her affair with President Kennedy, the two become close, but political intrigue surrounding her acquaintances soon infringes on their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvvxmZJich3ai0f8T65PAXPMeYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20263'),
  ('212569468391756632', 'An American Carol', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Brian Baugh, David Zucker', 'Lewis Friedman, Myrna Sokoloff, David Zucker', 'Kevin Farley, Kelsey Grammer, Leslie Nielsen, Trace Adkins, Robert Davi, Geoffrey Arend, Travis Schuldt, Jon Voight', 'PG-13', 'A cynical anti-American Hollywood filmmaker sets out on a crusade to abolish the 4th of July holiday. He is visited by three spirits who take him on a hilarious journey in an attempt to show him the true meaning of America.', 'A cynical anti-American Hollywood filmmaker sets out on a crusade to abolish the 4th of July holiday. He is visited by three spirits who take him on a hilarious journey in an attempt to show him the true meaning of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEDdzt1ZTB1BRo95gMkBytl0NqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13948'),
  ('800847320589832197', 'An American Christmas Carol', 1979, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Eric Till, Rocco Gismondi, David M. Robertson', null, 'Henry Winkler, David Wayne, Chris Wiggins, R.H. Thomson, Ken Pogue, Gerard Parkes, Susan Hogan, Will Bermender', 'NR', 'In Depression-era New England, a miserly businessman named Benedict Slade receives a long-overdue attitude adjustment one Christmas Eve when he is visited by three ghostly figures who resemble three of the people whose possessions Slade had seized to collect on unpaid loans. Assuming the roles of the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present, and Future from Charles Dickens'' classic story, the three apparitions force Slade to face the consequences of his skinflint ways, and he becomes a caring, generous, amiable man.', 'In Depression-era New England, a miserly businessman named Benedict Slade receives a long-overdue attitude adjustment one Christmas Eve when he is visited by three ghostly figures who resemble three of the people whose possessions Slade had seized to collect on unpaid loans. Assuming the roles of the Ghosts of Christmas Past, Present, and Future from Charles Dickens'' classic story, the three apparitions force Slade to face the consequences of his skinflint ways, and he becomes a caring, generous, amiable man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLGpoMTIgVXeV6vmRozjpRtpuL4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52055'),
  ('756020200710556270', 'An American Crime', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Tommy O''Haver, Byron Shah, Chad Rosen', 'Tommy O''Haver, Irene Turner', 'Elliot Page, Catherine Keener, Hayley McFarland, Nick Searcy, Romy Rosemont, Ari Graynor, Scout Taylor-Compton, Tristan Jarred', 'R', 'The true story of suburban housewife Gertrude Baniszewski, who kept a teenage girl locked in the basement of her Indiana home during the 1960s.', 'The true story of suburban housewife Gertrude Baniszewski, who kept a teenage girl locked in the basement of her Indiana home during the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLsE0sMI1bycBxZX7QNYghy5iyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13008'),
  ('138672423145479870', 'An American Girl: Chrissa Stands Strong', 2009, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Martha Coolidge, Catherine Marie McDonald, Jill Maxcy', 'Christine Coyle Johnson, Julie Prendiville Roux', 'Sammi Hanratty, Annabeth Gish, Timothy Bottoms, Michael Learned, Austin Thomas, Adair Tishler, Ariela Barer, Kaitlyn Dever', 'G', 'A fourth grader and her friends deal with bullying from a more popular girl in their class.', 'A fourth grader and her friends deal with bullying from a more popular girl in their class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBrOirXNgvm2YsaydZhZCEiKKPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18182'),
  ('775201801770906546', 'An American Haunting', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adrian Biddle, Courtney Solomon, Andreea Popa', 'Courtney Solomon', 'Donald Sutherland, Sissy Spacek, Rachel Hurd-Wood, James D''Arcy, Matthew Marsh, Thom Fell, Zoe Thorne, Gaye Brown', 'PG-13', 'An invisible entity haunts a 19th century family, and family secrets soon begin to surface. Based on the true events of the only case in US History where a spirit caused the death of a man.', 'An invisible entity haunts a 19th century family, and family secrets soon begin to surface. Based on the true events of the only case in US History where a spirit caused the death of a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ePaCimd7cA9zYNib8WfIbWnrCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10008'),
  ('482632040603738063', 'An American Hippie in Israel', 1972, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Amos Sefer, Ya''ackov Kallach, John Stodel', 'Amos Sefer', 'Asher Tzarfati, Shmuel Wolf, Lilli Avidan, Tzila Karney, Fran Liberman-Avni, Suzan Devor', 'R', 'Incited by a disillusioned young man who has decided to flee from civilization, a group of 4 people go searching for freedom and happiness on an isolated island . When their boat goes astray and they are left without food, their animal instincts take over, bringing the film to its catastrophic end.', 'Incited by a disillusioned young man who has decided to flee from civilization, a group of 4 people go searching for freedom and happiness on an isolated island . When their boat goes astray and they are left without food, their animal instincts take over, bringing the film to its catastrophic end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FP7fw0kXPwjDHC1lgqb1lZJ4wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158828'),
  ('395528047197315755', 'An American in Austen', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Clare Niederpruem, Desi Apostolova, Natasha Roth', 'Cameron Johann', 'Eliza Bennett, Nicholas Bishop, Nell Barlow, Catherine Hannay, Erica Ford, Grace Hogg-Robinson, Calypso Cragg, Robin Weaver', 'G', 'Harriet, who thinks that no real man compares to Mr. Darcy, is transported into Pride and Prejudice and gets an unexpected chance to find out. Starring Eliza Bennett and Nicholas Bishop.', 'Harriet, who thinks that no real man compares to Mr. Darcy, is transported into Pride and Prejudice and gets an unexpected chance to find out. Starring Eliza Bennett and Nicholas Bishop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPurbvRNfJ3KOlSLXFPoD07Cazg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221678'),
  ('212746499457599034', 'An American in Paris', 1951, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Alfred Gilks, Hugh Boswell', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Gene Kelly, Leslie Caron, Oscar Levant, Georges Guétary, Nina Foch, Robert Ames, Joan Anderson, Larry Arnold', 'G', 'Jerry Mulligan is an exuberant American expatriate in Paris trying to make a reputation as a painter. His friend Adam is a struggling concert pianist who''s a long time associate of a famous French singer, Henri Baurel. A lonely society woman, Milo Roberts, takes Jerry under her wing and supports him, but is interested in more than his art.', 'Jerry Mulligan is an exuberant American expatriate in Paris trying to make a reputation as a painter. His friend Adam is a struggling concert pianist who''s a long time associate of a famous French singer, Henri Baurel. A lonely society woman, Milo Roberts, takes Jerry under her wing and supports him, but is interested in more than his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyDXkvG53ldz6Cf7dbjJl7TaoP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2769'),
  ('1076221678732039029', 'An American in Rome', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Lucio Fulci, Carlo Montuori', 'Sandro Continenza, Lucio Fulci, Ettore Scola', 'Alberto Sordi, Maria Pia Casilio, Ilse Peterson, Anita Durante, Giulio Calì, Galeazzo Benti, Carlo Delle Piane, Rocco D''Assunta', null, 'Nando Moriconi is a young Italian living in Rome obsessed with all-things American.', 'Nando Moriconi is a young Italian living in Rome obsessed with all-things American.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFaNi1GmVMdXLFkKhdNKx3gc3kL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43294'),
  ('948331977878516272', 'An American Pickle', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Brandon Trost, John Guleserian, Frederic Roth', 'Simon Rich', 'Seth Rogen, Sarah Snook, Molly Evensen, Eliot Glazer, Kalen Allen, Kevin O''Rourke, Sean Whalen, Geoffrey Cantor', 'PG-13', 'An immigrant worker at a pickle factory is accidentally preserved for 100 years and wakes up in modern day Brooklyn. He learns his only surviving relative is his great grandson, a computer coder who he can’t connect with.', 'An immigrant worker at a pickle factory is accidentally preserved for 100 years and wakes up in modern day Brooklyn. He learns his only surviving relative is his great grandson, a computer coder who he can’t connect with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ziUp2q71vCmMgYY2MRCwI3mSs5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628917'),
  ('1103398185512306117', 'An American Rhapsody', 2001, 'Drama, Family', 'Éva Gárdos, Elemér Ragályi, Piroska Szabady', 'Éva Gárdos', 'Scarlett Johansson, Nastassja Kinski, Tony Goldwyn, Ágnes Bánfalvy, Zoltán Seress, András Szöke, Erzsi Pásztor, Colleen Camp', 'PG-13', 'A Hungarian family forced to flee the Communist country for the United States must leave a young daughter behind. Six years later, the family arranges to bring the absent daughter to the United States where she has trouble adjusting. The daughter then decides to travel to Budapest to discover her identity.', 'A Hungarian family forced to flee the Communist country for the United States must leave a young daughter behind. Six years later, the family arranges to bring the absent daughter to the United States where she has trouble adjusting. The daughter then decides to travel to Budapest to discover her identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXkWyYiMKx3o187CYH7fcrzEjAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37920'),
  ('504900267486571974', 'An American Romance', 1944, 'Romance, Drama', 'King Vidor, Harold Rosson', 'William Ludwig', 'Brian Donlevy, Ann Richards, Walter Abel, John Qualen, Stephen McNally, Mary McLeod, Bob Lowell, Erville Alderson', 'NR', 'A European immigrant becomes a master of industry but almost loses his family.', 'A European immigrant becomes a master of industry but almost loses his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpYQsGg1uCenH9spvs2UtdKJ4zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118059'),
  ('651105961565821341', 'An American Tail', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Don Bluth, Sue Shakespeare, David J. Steinberg', 'Judy Freudberg, Tony Geiss', 'Phillip Glasser, Erica Yohn, Nehemiah Persoff, Amy Green, Christopher Plummer, John Finnegan, Will Ryan, Hal Smith', 'G', 'A young mouse named Fievel and his family decide to migrate to America, a "land without cats," at the turn of the 20th century. But somehow, Fievel ends up in the New World alone and must fend off not only the felines he never thought he''d have to deal with again but also the loneliness of being away from home.', 'A young mouse named Fievel and his family decide to migrate to America, a "land without cats," at the turn of the 20th century. But somehow, Fievel ends up in the New World alone and must fend off not only the felines he never thought he''d have to deal with again but also the loneliness of being away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjhUy9af89vc9CviKcPgTNTrmIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4978'),
  ('560969991628713816', 'An American Tail: Fievel Goes West', 1991, 'Animation, Family, Western, Adventure, Comedy', 'Simon Wells, Phil Nibbelink', 'Flint Dille', 'Phillip Glasser, James Stewart, Erica Yohn, Cathy Cavadini, Nehemiah Persoff, Dom DeLuise, Amy Irving, John Cleese', 'G', 'Some time after the Mousekewitz''s have settled in America, they find that they are still having problems with the threat of cats. That makes them eager to try another home out in the west, where they are promised that mice and cats live in peace. Unfortunately, the one making this claim is an oily con artist named Cat R. Waul who is intent on his own sinister plan.', 'Some time after the Mousekewitz''s have settled in America, they find that they are still having problems with the threat of cats. That makes them eager to try another home out in the west, where they are promised that mice and cats live in peace. Unfortunately, the one making this claim is an oily con artist named Cat R. Waul who is intent on his own sinister plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4aLupAkHWwHiEDwvqsZFAnUYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10380'),
  ('1083132288414259670', 'An American Tail: The Mystery of the Night Monster', 1999, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Mystery, Family', 'Larry Latham', 'David Kirschner', 'Thomas Dekker, Lacey Chabert, Jane Singer, Nehemiah Persoff, Susan Boyd, Robert Hays, Pat Musick, Dom DeLuise', 'G', 'Follow the clues to fun and excitement as the beloved little mouse takes on a big monster in this charming, full-length adventure. When a ferocious, mouse-nabbing creature puts fear into the hearts of New York City''s rodents, Fievel and his friends team up with a reporter to chase after the scoop of the century and -- just maybe -- get a close-up look at the bad guy himself!', 'Follow the clues to fun and excitement as the beloved little mouse takes on a big monster in this charming, full-length adventure. When a ferocious, mouse-nabbing creature puts fear into the hearts of New York City''s rodents, Fievel and his friends team up with a reporter to chase after the scoop of the century and -- just maybe -- get a close-up look at the bad guy himself!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTV5TwZ4i6wDcWxoNpczk4CQBbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27653'),
  ('72423947359957656', 'An American Tail: The Treasure of Manhattan Island', 1998, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Larry Latham', 'Len Uhley', 'Thomas Dekker, Lacey Chabert, Nehemiah Persoff, Erica Yohn, Dom DeLuise, Elaine Bilstad, Pat Musick, René Auberjonois', 'G', 'Fievel and his friend Tony Toponi find a map that they believe points to a treasure buried somewhere beneath Old New York, and the plucky rodent is determined to find it. However, what he discovers under the city is a tribe of Native American mice who were driven underground by prejudiced European immigrants.', 'Fievel and his friend Tony Toponi find a map that they believe points to a treasure buried somewhere beneath Old New York, and the plucky rodent is determined to find it. However, what he discovers under the city is a tribe of Native American mice who were driven underground by prejudiced European immigrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tHRV61S9NWgme1pOHeXeDRBYvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31473'),
