  ('1005806437839707653', 'An American Vampire Story', 1997, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Luis Esteban', 'Rollin Jarrett', 'Trevor Lissauer, Johnny Venokur, Adam West, Sydney Lassick, Carmen Electra, Daisy Tormé, Debra Beatty, Danny Hitt', 'PG-13', 'A group of friends go on a vacation with some new friends that turn out to be vampires, they hire a famous vampire killer to help them.', 'A group of friends go on a vacation with some new friends that turn out to be vampires, they hire a famous vampire killer to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgBCHBPe2KwMFEHHiMKi8gnHkzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65416'),
  ('395356598163287416', 'An American Werewolf in London', 1981, 'Comedy, Horror', 'John Landis, Robert Paynter, Peter Childs', 'John Landis', 'David Naughton, Jenny Agutter, Griffin Dunne, John Woodvine, Don McKillop, Brian Glover, David Schofield, Lila Kaye', 'R', 'American tourists David and Jack are savagely attacked by an unidentified animal while hiking on the Yorkshire Moors. After retiring to the home of a beautiful nurse to recuperate, David soon begins experiencing disturbing changes to his body and mind.', 'American tourists David and Jack are savagely attacked by an unidentified animal while hiking on the Yorkshire Moors. After retiring to the home of a beautiful nurse to recuperate, David soon begins experiencing disturbing changes to his body and mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVEqUASJmCQaolkKFEySCHZ8uKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814'),
