  ('1119422975342007461', 'An Amish Murder', 2013, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stephen Gyllenhaal, Derick V. Underschultz', 'Mark Malone', 'Neve Campbell, Noam Jenkins, C. Thomas Howell, Christian Campbell, Jilon VanOver, Irone Singleton, Alec McClure, Linda Kash', null, 'The Amish farming community of Painter’s Mill, Ohio, is shattered when a series of brutal murders leaves the town with a sense of frailty and loss of innocence. Among the most affected by the tragedy was Kate Burkholder, a young girl who survived the terror and, as a result, left the Amish life behind. Fifteen years later, Kate returns to Painter’s Mill as its Chief of Police. Certain she’s come to terms with her past, Kate’s renewed life in her hometown is shattered when a murder investigation triggers deep-seated emotions from her childhood and exposes a dark secret that could destroy her.', 'The Amish farming community of Painter’s Mill, Ohio, is shattered when a series of brutal murders leaves the town with a sense of frailty and loss of innocence. Among the most affected by the tragedy was Kate Burkholder, a young girl who survived the terror and, as a result, left the Amish life behind. Fifteen years later, Kate returns to Painter’s Mill as its Chief of Police. Certain she’s come to terms with her past, Kate’s renewed life in her hometown is shattered when a murder investigation triggers deep-seated emotions from her childhood and exposes a dark secret that could destroy her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7J2VlkFU2xiuUfloW8byOijb8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159937'),
  ('399752680497137272', 'An Amorous Woman of Tang Dynasty', 1984, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'Eddie Fong Ling-Ching, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah', 'Chun Tin-Nam, Chiu Kang-Chien, Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Pat Ha Man-Jik, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Chang Kuo-Chu, Lam Hoi-Ling, Tom Poon, Ku Feng, Wang Lai, Wong Shu-Tong', null, 'Rebellious Yu Yuan-gi becomes a Taoist priestess in order to avoid traditional roles designated to her as a woman by the society and focus on her studies and poetry. However, her trysts with both her maid and a ronin lead to trouble.', 'Rebellious Yu Yuan-gi becomes a Taoist priestess in order to avoid traditional roles designated to her as a woman by the society and focus on her studies and poetry. However, her trysts with both her maid and a ronin lead to trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3AKLf3zFFfRzhGLOrj9zzqHFmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184068'),
  ('448486575435838951', 'An Angel at My Table', 1990, 'Drama, History', 'Jane Campion, Stuart Dryburgh', 'Laura Jones', 'Kerry Fox, Alexia Keogh, Karen Fergusson, Iris Churn, Jessie Mune, Kevin J. Wilson, Edith Campion, Francesca Collins', 'R', 'Based on the autobiographical work of New Zealand writer Janet Frame, this production depicts the author at various stage of her life. Afflicted with mental and emotional issues, Frame grows up in an impoverished family and experiences numerous tragedies while still in her youth, including the deaths of two of her siblings. Portrayed as an adult by Kerry Fox, Frame finds acclaim for her writing while still in a mental institution, and her success helps her move on with her life.', 'Based on the autobiographical work of New Zealand writer Janet Frame, this production depicts the author at various stage of her life. Afflicted with mental and emotional issues, Frame grows up in an impoverished family and experiences numerous tragedies while still in her youth, including the deaths of two of her siblings. Portrayed as an adult by Kerry Fox, Frame finds acclaim for her writing while still in a mental institution, and her success helps her move on with her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDICHxQRDkS4TvIDcUgO9URJxu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2891'),
  ('1116054875675482240', 'An Angel for May', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Harley Cokeliss', 'Melvin Burgess, Peter Milligan', 'Julie Cox, Charlotte Wakefield, Matthew Beard, Matthew McNulty, Anna Massey, Angeline Ball, Tom Wilkinson, Hugo Speer', null, 'When Tom accidentally travels back in time through a fireplace in a ruined farmhouse he meets May, an orphan who needs help. Now that he knows his friends'' fate and his own, he will try to reorder the events and change their history.', 'When Tom accidentally travels back in time through a fireplace in a ruined farmhouse he meets May, an orphan who needs help. Now that he knows his friends'' fate and his own, he will try to reorder the events and change their history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mx3qTzOW2WF8GlkSSnR5733Tg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127052'),
  ('903476679907197719', 'An Angel for Satan', 1966, 'Horror', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Giuseppe Aquari, Fabrizio Gianni', 'Giuseppe Mangione, Camillo Mastrocinque', 'Barbara Steele, Anthony Steffen, Claudio Gora, Mario Brega, Marina Berti, Ursula Davis, Vassili Karis, Aldo Berti', null, 'At the end of the 19th century, in a little Italian village by a lake an old statue is recovered. Soon a series of crimes start and the superstitious people of the village believe that the statue carries an ancient malediction.', 'At the end of the 19th century, in a little Italian village by a lake an old statue is recovered. Soon a series of crimes start and the superstitious people of the village believe that the statue carries an ancient malediction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hL4mqhDMmRKbbC98xwAPhlhyG4I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69777'),
  ('1071326473095046525', 'An Angel on Wheels', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Géza von Radványi, Mike Mossotti, Olivier Gérard', 'René Barjavel, Géza von Radványi', 'Romy Schneider, Henri Vidal, Michèle Mercier, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Margarete Haagen, Erika von Thellmann, Ernst Waldow, Jean Tissier', null, 'Heralded racing driver Pierre Chaillot has never noticed the pretty young flight attendant who dotes on him adoringly. But when his fiancée''s infidelity drives him to the brink of suicide, Pierre''s guardian angel takes the form of this stewardess to urge him to choose life. Though the angel confesses her divinity, Pierre is skeptical of the existence of angels. But, despite their difference, the two bond during her brief sojourn in human form.', 'Heralded racing driver Pierre Chaillot has never noticed the pretty young flight attendant who dotes on him adoringly. But when his fiancée''s infidelity drives him to the brink of suicide, Pierre''s guardian angel takes the form of this stewardess to urge him to choose life. Though the angel confesses her divinity, Pierre is skeptical of the existence of angels. But, despite their difference, the two bond during her brief sojourn in human form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sscjyCMMZMAw1gYKmbQFM23gYOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81598'),
  ('621134064042484582', 'An Argentinian Crime', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Lucas Combina, Víctor González, Javier Stavropulos', 'Sebastián Pivotto, Jorge Bechara, Matías Bertilotti', 'Nicolás Francella, Matías Mayer, Malena Sánchez, Darío Grandinetti, Alberto Ajaka, César Bordón, Rita Cortese, Luis Luque', null, 'Rosario in the 80s. The disappearance of a man during the military dictatorship. Two young people from the court must do everything possible to solve the case while facing police corruption and various dangers that put their lives at risk.', 'Rosario in the 80s. The disappearance of a man during the military dictatorship. Two young people from the court must do everything possible to solve the case while facing police corruption and various dangers that put their lives at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdNog6ueztBWUAw8tsKlebmngRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:941959'),
  ('810592186819879517', 'An Argentinian in New York', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Juan José Jusid, Juan Carlos Lenardi', 'Cristina Civale, Graciela Maglie', 'Guillermo Francella, Natalia Oreiro, Diana Lamas, Jessica Schultz, Boris Rubaja, Cristina Alberó, Miguel Guerberof, Gabriel Goity', null, 'An Argentinian girl, about to turn 18, leaves on a study trip to New York, and then decides to stay there. Her caring father goes after her to get her back before her mother can get too worried.', 'An Argentinian girl, about to turn 18, leaves on a study trip to New York, and then decides to stay there. Her caring father goes after her to get her back before her mother can get too worried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9QVHtGrLGfpi3MHkAJjLSwUVNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259971'),
  ('536509615574825936', 'An Aria on Gazes', 1992, 'Drama, Horror', 'Hisayasu Satō, Masashi Inayoshi, Shinji Imaoka', 'Shirō Yumeno', 'Kiyomi Itō, Momori Asano, Kyoko Nakamura, Issei Sagawa, Kōichi Imaizumi, Taketoshi Watari, Hiromi Hirose, Mineo Sugiura', null, 'Housewife Kyoko begins moonlighting at a mysterious sex club as a means of rebelling against her boring salaryman husband Akihito. The Bedroom isn’t like any normal club, though: the female hostesses all take the powerful sedative Halcion to sleep through their encounters with the male clientele.', 'Housewife Kyoko begins moonlighting at a mysterious sex club as a means of rebelling against her boring salaryman husband Akihito. The Bedroom isn’t like any normal club, though: the female hostesses all take the powerful sedative Halcion to sleep through their encounters with the male clientele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFuuAHhmNF9jC9bxSh8EPwsHZ1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143730'),
  ('227275115303952513', 'An Audience with Adele', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Liz Clare', null, 'Adele, Alan Carr, Emma Thompson, Samuel L. Jackson, Idris Elba, Emma Watson, Olly Alexander, Catherine O''Hara', null, 'Joining multi-Grammy Award winning and one of the biggest UK artists of all time, Adele, for a unique and special night at the legendary London Palladium, where she performs her chart-topping single Easy On Me, as well as tracks from her new album, 30.', 'Joining multi-Grammy Award winning and one of the biggest UK artists of all time, Adele, for a unique and special night at the legendary London Palladium, where she performs her chart-topping single Easy On Me, as well as tracks from her new album, 30.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zctubRROrjE9HcsZ8FBCYBnmCvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:901047'),
  ('425371495069812808', 'An Audience with Billy Connolly', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Alasdair Macmillan', 'Billy Connolly', 'Billy Connolly, Michael Parkinson, Clive James, Janet Brown, Michael Aspel, Barbara Dickson, Ringo Starr, Bill Wyman', null, 'Billy Connolly delivers his special brand of stand-up comedy and abrasive humour in front of a celebrity audience.', 'Billy Connolly delivers his special brand of stand-up comedy and abrasive humour in front of a celebrity audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42U4c0vwDaqN72Kum5zHitVFS5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24492'),
  ('126621631877152671', 'An Autumn Romance', 2021, 'Romance, Drama, Family', 'Bradley Walsh, Jonathan Yapp', 'Emily Golden', 'Jessica Lowndes, Chad Michael Murray, Dennis Andres, Michael Brown, Kent Sheridan, Jenni Burke, Delia Lisette Chambers, Darlene Cooke', 'G', 'When librarian Taylor Harris suddenly loses her job, she decides to visit her brother in a small town in Montana. There, she gets involved in the fight to help save her brother''s hotel from tycoon Joel Sheenan, who wants to renovate it.', 'When librarian Taylor Harris suddenly loses her job, she decides to visit her brother in a small town in Montana. There, she gets involved in the fight to help save her brother''s hotel from tycoon Joel Sheenan, who wants to renovate it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvJzRrdivLX3QYoG0UHQhA5QOyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810223'),
  ('608532313429148207', 'An Autumn Without Berlin', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lara Izagirre, Gaizka Bourgeaud', 'Lara Izagirre', 'Irene Escolar, Tamar Novas, Ramón Barea, Lier Quesada, Patricia López Arnaiz, Naiara Carmona, Mariano Estudillo, María Isabel Díaz Lago', null, 'After traveling far from home in pursuit of a better future, June comes back to her hometown to try to restore broken bonds with Diego, her first love, and her father. She will try to bring back their teenage years dream of moving to Berlin. However, she will soon realize that years have changed Diego, he is now reclusive and never leaves his house.', 'After traveling far from home in pursuit of a better future, June comes back to her hometown to try to restore broken bonds with Diego, her first love, and her father. She will try to bring back their teenage years dream of moving to Berlin. However, she will soon realize that years have changed Diego, he is now reclusive and never leaves his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaa7e6EhBrhdGj6BkqsHkpGOkdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324298'),
  ('27549863978901577', 'An Autumn''s Tale', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mabel Cheung Yuen-Ting, David Chung, James Hayman', 'Chi-Yeuh Low, Alex Law Kai-Yui', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Cherie Chung Cho-Hung, Danny Chan Bak-Keung, Gigi Wong, Wu Fu-Sheng, Huang Man, Ming-Suen Jeng, Brenda Lo', null, 'Hong Kong native Lee Kay moves to NYC''s Chinatown while attending college. When she learns that her boyfriend''s cheating, her cousin comforts her.', 'Hong Kong native Lee Kay moves to NYC''s Chinatown while attending college. When she learns that her boyfriend''s cheating, her cousin comforts her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q7CAw4lC5T12u9d2Zn9t7MuMww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64015'),
  ('999719214447821987', 'An Average Little Man', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Mario Vulpiani, Amanzio Todini', 'Sergio Amidei, Mario Monicelli', 'Alberto Sordi, Shelley Winters, Vincenzo Crocitti, Romolo Valli, Paolo Paoloni, Renato Malavasi, Renzo Carboni, Enrico Beruschi', null, 'A middle-aged government accountant is determined to secure a stable job for his son before retiring, willing to go to great lengths to achieve his goal.', 'A middle-aged government accountant is determined to secure a stable job for his son before retiring, willing to go to great lengths to achieve his goal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXaY6crK5zFh0W77FuQNeTBgJsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54561'),
  ('202936006945316734', 'An Awfully Big Adventure', 1995, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Newell, Dick Pope', 'Charles Wood', 'Georgina Cates, Hugh Grant, Alan Rickman, Alun Armstrong, Peter Firth, Prunella Scales, Rita Tushingham, Alan Cox', 'R', 'Liverpool. 1947. Right after World War II, a star struck naive teenage girl joins a shabby theatre troupe in Liverpool. During a winter production of Peter Pan, the play quickly turns into a dark metaphor for youth as she becomes drawn into a web of sexual politics and intrigue and learns about the grown-up world of the theater.', 'Liverpool. 1947. Right after World War II, a star struck naive teenage girl joins a shabby theatre troupe in Liverpool. During a winter production of Peter Pan, the play quickly turns into a dark metaphor for youth as she becomes drawn into a web of sexual politics and intrigue and learns about the grown-up world of the theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfXBuRBMbyu9IF9KCFz3kXeWQDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22279'),
  ('600663614925540419', 'An Early Frost', 1985, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Woody Omens, John Erman', null, 'Aidan Quinn, Gena Rowlands, Ben Gazzara, Sylvia Sidney, D.W. Moffett, John Glover, Sydney Walsh, Terry O''Quinn', 'NR', 'Successful lawyer Michael Pierson is gay, but he has always hidden this part of his life from his mother, Katherine, father, Nick, and grandmother Beatrice. But when Michael discovers he has AIDS and is dying of complications from the disease, he must open up to his parents and the rest of his family. Though fearful of their reactions, he introduces them to his longtime lover, Peter, and looks to them for support.', 'Successful lawyer Michael Pierson is gay, but he has always hidden this part of his life from his mother, Katherine, father, Nick, and grandmother Beatrice. But when Michael discovers he has AIDS and is dying of complications from the disease, he must open up to his parents and the rest of his family. Though fearful of their reactions, he introduces them to his longtime lover, Peter, and looks to them for support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCYnDyi8UYqzJx8gL0DswHYAFhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84884'),
  ('230054966602081615', 'An Eastern Westerner', 1920, 'Comedy, Western', 'Hal Roach, Walter Lundin', 'Frank Terry, H.M. Walker', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Noah Young, James T. Kelley, Sammy Brooks, Mark Jones, Wally Howe, J. Miller', 'NR', 'A young man in New York has exasperated his father because of his constant carousing and irresponsibility, so his father sends him to his uncle''s ranch in the west. The young man arrives in the town of Piute Pass, which is being terrorized by Tiger Lip Tompkins and his gang, the Masked Angels. The Easterner befriends a young woman whose father is being held captive by Tompkins, and he decides to help her.', 'A young man in New York has exasperated his father because of his constant carousing and irresponsibility, so his father sends him to his uncle''s ranch in the west. The young man arrives in the town of Piute Pass, which is being terrorized by Tiger Lip Tompkins and his gang, the Masked Angels. The Easterner befriends a young woman whose father is being held captive by Tompkins, and he decides to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVLZhUOhYdcoMSZ6R9mc3dgZ6OS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40575'),
  ('775586752957061681', 'An Easy Girl', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Georges Lechaptois, Jean-Baptiste Pouilloux', 'Teddy Lussi-Modeste', 'Mina Farid, Zahia Dehar, Benoît Magimel, Nuno Lopes, Clotilde Courau, Lakdhar Dridi, Loubna Abidar, Henri-Noël Tabary', 'R', 'Naïma has just turned 16. This summer, she will have to decide what she wants from life if she doesn’t want to miss out. Then her cousin Sofia arrives, with an amazing body and a dangerously seductive lifestyle. Naïma desires only to follow her own path, so long as it leads upwards… Despite the warnings of her best friend Dodo, she and Sofia will live through unforgettable encounters during a long summer that will mark them forever.', 'Naïma has just turned 16. This summer, she will have to decide what she wants from life if she doesn’t want to miss out. Then her cousin Sofia arrives, with an amazing body and a dangerously seductive lifestyle. Naïma desires only to follow her own path, so long as it leads upwards… Despite the warnings of her best friend Dodo, she and Sofia will live through unforgettable encounters during a long summer that will mark them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AhB1u1vUXoumoHbcGhw7VnS0L2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575479'),
  ('490243749050494928', 'An Easy Life', 1964, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Venyamin Dorman, Konstantin Arutyunov, Dmitri Flyangolts', 'Vladlen Bakhnov', 'Yuriy Yakovlev, Faina Ranevskaya, Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Ninel Myshkova, Vsevolod Safonov, Vera Maretskaya, Rostislav Plyatt, Ivan Zhevago', null, 'A chemist by training, Alexandr Bochkin manages a Moscow dry-cleaning operation, but lives a very comfortable life, taking orders on the side for his speculative "private enterprise," run in conjunction with "Queen Margot". But when his old friend from the chemical institute, Yuri Lebedev arrives in Moscow from the Siberian city of Dalnegorsk, along with a traveling companion, Olga, Bochkin becomes uncomfortable with his job title.', 'A chemist by training, Alexandr Bochkin manages a Moscow dry-cleaning operation, but lives a very comfortable life, taking orders on the side for his speculative "private enterprise," run in conjunction with "Queen Margot". But when his old friend from the chemical institute, Yuri Lebedev arrives in Moscow from the Siberian city of Dalnegorsk, along with a traveling companion, Olga, Bochkin becomes uncomfortable with his job title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56IqN4zKHOmSADvo98HWjj5iIfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148441'),
  ('252355450058274806', 'An Eater', 1963, 'Horror', 'Fujino Kazutomo, Nobuhiko Obayashi, Nobuhiko Obayashi', null, 'Kazuo Tai, Daigo Kusano, Tamaro Araki, Tadashi Terasawa, Shin Kishida, Sakio Hirata, Yoshiyuki Oka, Ayako Takahashi', null, 'A meditation on eating people and quiet waitresses.', 'A meditation on eating people and quiet waitresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkGYp2HEczSSKmGoYU6FdavweMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104337'),
  ('166595678672888711', 'An Education', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lone Scherfig, John de Borman, Joe Geary', 'Nick Hornby', 'Carey Mulligan, Peter Sarsgaard, Dominic Cooper, Rosamund Pike, Olivia Williams, Alfred Molina, Cara Seymour, Sally Hawkins', 'PG-13', 'Despite her sheltered upbringing, Jenny is a teen with a bright future; she''s smart, pretty, and has aspirations of attending Oxford University. When David, a charming but much older suitor, motors into her life in a shiny automobile, Jenny gets a taste of adult life that she won''t soon forget.', 'Despite her sheltered upbringing, Jenny is a teen with a bright future; she''s smart, pretty, and has aspirations of attending Oxford University. When David, a charming but much older suitor, motors into her life in a shiny automobile, Jenny gets a taste of adult life that she won''t soon forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLIvvUdlocGjm8XVLxhWHAKWrRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24684'),
  ('722299590447590866', 'An Egg Scramble', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', null, 'On Porky Pig''s farm, Miss Prissy, a slow-witted hen, has never laid an egg. So, one of her fellow hens paints Prissy''s name on an egg and places it in Prissy''s nest. Prissy believes she laid the egg and proudly refuses to let Porky have it to give to a market''s truck. Porky takes the egg from her and gives it to the driver of the truck. Prissy follows the truck to a nearby city, determined to regain her egg.', 'On Porky Pig''s farm, Miss Prissy, a slow-witted hen, has never laid an egg. So, one of her fellow hens paints Prissy''s name on an egg and places it in Prissy''s nest. Prissy believes she laid the egg and proudly refuses to let Porky have it to give to a market''s truck. Porky takes the egg from her and gives it to the driver of the truck. Prissy follows the truck to a nearby city, determined to regain her egg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PkggUKXhkeM2In8IeKzoeHozdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201634'),
  ('1034641482743006043', 'An Egyptian Story', 1982, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Youssef Chahine, Ahmed Mehrez, Mohsen Nasr', 'Yousef Idris, Youssef Chahine', 'Nour El-Sherif, Yousra, Soheir El-Bably, Magda El Khatib, Mahmoud El Meligy, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Laila Hamada, Mohamed Mounir', null, 'After we last see him in "Alexandria, Why?" Egyptian filmmaker Yehia Mourad is in his thirties, and successful in his work, he has grown distant from his wife and children and suﬀers a symbolic blockage of the heart while shooting the final scenes of his latest film. After being flown to England for evaluation, it''s determined that Yehia must undergo emergency surgery. Fact and fiction blend seamlessly—with healthy doses of cleverly absurdist fantasy—as the film explores the various personalities and forces that have made Yehia (and Youssef Chahine) the man he has become.', 'After we last see him in "Alexandria, Why?" Egyptian filmmaker Yehia Mourad is in his thirties, and successful in his work, he has grown distant from his wife and children and suﬀers a symbolic blockage of the heart while shooting the final scenes of his latest film. After being flown to England for evaluation, it''s determined that Yehia must undergo emergency surgery. Fact and fiction blend seamlessly—with healthy doses of cleverly absurdist fantasy—as the film explores the various personalities and forces that have made Yehia (and Youssef Chahine) the man he has become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0zDBvwtKA34DKFu4TAaeOt5fWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123651'),
  ('254331582314622310', 'An Elephant Sitting Still', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hu Bo, Xiaoyan Zhou, Fan Chao', 'Hu Bo', 'Peng Yuchang, Wang Yuwen, Zhang Yu, Li Congxi, Zhenghui Ling, Xiaolong Zhang, Li Danyi, Kong Wei', null, 'In the northern Chinese city of Manzhouli, they say there is an elephant that simply sits and ignores the world. Manzhouli becomes an obsession for the protagonists of this film, a longed-for escape from the downward spiral in which they find themselves.', 'In the northern Chinese city of Manzhouli, they say there is an elephant that simply sits and ignores the world. Manzhouli becomes an obsession for the protagonists of this film, a longed-for escape from the downward spiral in which they find themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qr9wpaa5dA7AGr5ndgYiioavIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499556'),
  ('103623772983219571', 'An Empress and the Warriors', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, History', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Chun Tin-Nam, James Yuen Sai-Sang, Charcoal Tan', 'Kelly Chen, Donnie Yen, Leon Lai Ming, Guo Xiaodong, Kau Jan-Hoi, Zhang Shan, Liu Weihua, Peng Zhi', null, 'After the death of her father, a woman is forced to take over as empress and fight to save her kingdom.', 'After the death of her father, a woman is forced to take over as empress and fight to save her kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/czFkHXSAWBYhurfGNVKotfBhso2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14539'),
  ('336961379749952121', 'An Endless Sunday', 2023, 'Drama', 'Andrea Benjamin Manenti, Mirko Vigliotti, Alain Parroni', 'Beatrice Puccilli, Alain Parroni, Giulio Pennacchi', 'Enrico Bassetti, Zackari Delmas, Federica Valentini, Lars Rudolph', null, 'Three Roman teenagers try to make their mark on the world: Brenda is pregnant; Ale has just turned 19 and is about to become a father; Kevin fills the city with his name. Always connected, they buzz between the coastal countryside and the Eternal City, trying to resist each in his own way the inexorable advance of time and heat.', 'Three Roman teenagers try to make their mark on the world: Brenda is pregnant; Ale has just turned 19 and is about to become a father; Kevin fills the city with his name. Always connected, they buzz between the coastal countryside and the Eternal City, trying to resist each in his own way the inexorable advance of time and heat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEiemiET4GKpHxJlzIktuUsdYvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156219'),
  ('796210436305652305', 'An Endless Wedding', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Patrick Cassir, Yannick Ressigeac', 'Andy Siara, Max Barbakow', 'Tarek Boudali, Camille Rowe, Bertrand Usclat, Youssef Hajdi, Claire Chust, Marie Papillon, Florence Muller, Jean-Michel Lahmi', null, 'During a wedding in a riad on the edge of the Moroccan desert, Paul meets Louna, the bride''s sister and witness. Following a paranormal event, they both find themselves trapped in the same space-time, forced to live the same day over and over again. And so begins a love story set against the backdrop of a time loop and a never-ending marriage…', 'During a wedding in a riad on the edge of the Moroccan desert, Paul meets Louna, the bride''s sister and witness. Following a paranormal event, they both find themselves trapped in the same space-time, forced to live the same day over and over again. And so begins a love story set against the backdrop of a time loop and a never-ending marriage…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvygZlicNXBIpklnLuAbgwkMMSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318856'),
  ('546366986326087541', 'An Enemy of the People', 1978, 'Drama', 'George Schaefer, Jack Aldworth, Edward Ledding', 'Alexander Jacobs', 'Steve McQueen, Charles Durning, Bibi Andersson, Eric Christmas, Michael Cristofer, Richard Dysart, Michael Higgins, Richard Bradford', 'G', 'A small forest town is trying to promote itself as a place for tourists to come enjoy the therapeutic hot springs and unspoiled nature. Dr. Stockmann, however, makes the inconvenient discovery that the nature around the village is not so unspoiled. In fact, the runoff from the local tanning mill has contaminated the water to a dangerous degree. The town fathers argue that cleaning up the mess would be far too expensive and the publicity would destroy the town''s reputation, so therefore news of the pollution should be suppressed. Dr. Stockmann decides to fight to get the word out to the people, but receives as very mixed reaction.', 'A small forest town is trying to promote itself as a place for tourists to come enjoy the therapeutic hot springs and unspoiled nature. Dr. Stockmann, however, makes the inconvenient discovery that the nature around the village is not so unspoiled. In fact, the runoff from the local tanning mill has contaminated the water to a dangerous degree. The town fathers argue that cleaning up the mess would be far too expensive and the publicity would destroy the town''s reputation, so therefore news of the pollution should be suppressed. Dr. Stockmann decides to fight to get the word out to the people, but receives as very mixed reaction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vV11P8ICDO1EE618dubk0KbNBiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121890'),
  ('718659599675828117', 'An Enemy of the People', 1990, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Barun Raha, Ramesh Sen', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Dipankar Dey, Ruma Guha Thakurta, Mamata Shankar, Subhendu Chatterjee, Manoj Mitra, Satya Banerjee', null, 'Ashoke Gupta is an idealistic doctor working in a town near Calcutta. He discovers that the water at a popular temple is the source of an outbreak of typhoid and hepatitis. In order to save lives, he risks his career to try and call attention to this polluted water source, while a local group of building contractors attempt to discredit him in various ways.', 'Ashoke Gupta is an idealistic doctor working in a town near Calcutta. He discovers that the water at a popular temple is the source of an outbreak of typhoid and hepatitis. In order to save lives, he risks his career to try and call attention to this polluted water source, while a local group of building contractors attempt to discredit him in various ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BzNywJnC3H22XDhx1OQeoUwIJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197562'),
  ('523400239577708898', 'An English Haunting', 2020, 'Horror', 'Michael Alden Lloyd, Charlie Steeds', 'Charlie Steeds', 'David Lenik, Tessa Wood, Barrington De La Roche, Emma Spurgin Hussey, Jéssica Alonso, Rory Wilton', 'PG-13', 'In 1960s England, Blake Cunningham and his alcoholic mother are forced to move into the mysterious Clemonte Hall, a vast isolated manor house, to care for his dying Grandfather who resides in the attic room. Soon, ghostly goings-on fill the house with dread, as it becomes apparent Grandfather''s illness may have a supernatural cause that can only be cured by uncovering the terrifying secrets of the house and its dark history.', 'In 1960s England, Blake Cunningham and his alcoholic mother are forced to move into the mysterious Clemonte Hall, a vast isolated manor house, to care for his dying Grandfather who resides in the attic room. Soon, ghostly goings-on fill the house with dread, as it becomes apparent Grandfather''s illness may have a supernatural cause that can only be cured by uncovering the terrifying secrets of the house and its dark history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wS5QNdov7LJYfxtCu6zwcy7HzGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643791'),
  ('1045938295957757332', 'An Englishman Abroad', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Schlesinger, Nat Crosby', 'Alan Bennett', 'Alan Bates, Coral Browne, Charles Gray, Harold Innocent, Douglas Reith, Peter Chelsom, Roger Hammond, Matthew Sim', null, 'Actress Coral Browne travels to Moscow, and meets a mysterious Englishman. Turns out he''s the notorious spy, Guy Burgess. Based on a true story, with Ms. Browne playing herself.', 'Actress Coral Browne travels to Moscow, and meets a mysterious Englishman. Turns out he''s the notorious spy, Guy Burgess. Based on a true story, with Ms. Browne playing herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gCiFxFjX5aLbbRNFoBzQm8Pz2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120729'),
  ('994361502407004880', 'An Englishman in New York', 2009, 'Drama', 'Richard Laxton, Yaron Orbach', 'Brian Fillis', 'John Hurt, Denis O''Hare, Jonathan Tucker, Cynthia Nixon, Swoosie Kurtz, Jeff Applegate, Silver Bramham, Twinkle Burke', null, 'Biographical drama based on the last 20 years of Crisp''s life. The literary figure and gay iconoclast emigrated to New York in 1981 and lived there until his death. The film observes Crisp in both his public and private lives, from his seemingly cavalier response to the outbreak of AIDS to his tender relationship with his friend Patrick Angus and his own response to growing old.', 'Biographical drama based on the last 20 years of Crisp''s life. The literary figure and gay iconoclast emigrated to New York in 1981 and lived there until his death. The film observes Crisp in both his public and private lives, from his seemingly cavalier response to the outbreak of AIDS to his tender relationship with his friend Patrick Angus and his own response to growing old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddADQWD3BL8Ozqe3T4dfpc6FRdz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34937'),
  ('1120288574664102199', 'An Ethics Lesson', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Park Myung-rang, Kim Min-jae, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Park Myung-rang', 'Lee Je-hoon, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Tae-hun, Kwak Do-won, Moon So-ri, Ko Sung-hee, Lee Na-ra, Kyul Hwi', null, 'A bad guy, a cruel guy, a lame guy, a cowardly guy and the meanest woman gets involved in a beautiful university student''s murder case.', 'A bad guy, a cruel guy, a lame guy, a cowardly guy and the meanest woman gets involved in a beautiful university student''s murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXyoVxP3MWG56Wjmm7nyj8fViCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172716'),
