  ('1007587025969639120', 'An Evening Song (for three voices)', 2026, 'Drama', 'Graham Swon, Barton Cortright', 'Graham Swon', 'Hannah Gross, Peter Vack, Deragh Campbell, Alex Lane', null, '1930''s, somewhere in the American Midwest: a former child-prodigy writer Barbara moves to the countryside with her pulp-fiction scribe husband Richard where they become entwined in a love triangle with their religious housekeeper Martha.', '1930''s, somewhere in the American Midwest: a former child-prodigy writer Barbara moves to the countryside with her pulp-fiction scribe husband Richard where they become entwined in a love triangle with their religious housekeeper Martha.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmuzAJ4sAqHMWFRfy2IcYZGENqps.jpg', 'plex:movie:an-evening-song-for-three-voices'),
