  ('542416532177866254', 'An Extraordinary Person', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Monia Chokri, Josée Deshaies', 'Monia Chokri', 'Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Anne Dorval, Sophie Cadieux, Evelyne Brochu, Émilie Bibeau, Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Laurence Leboeuf, Émilie Gilbert', null, 'A 30 year-old scholar, intelligent and beautiful yet socially crippled, is forced to attend a bachelorette party where her quest for authenticity leads to an unavoidable confrontation with old acquaintances.', 'A 30 year-old scholar, intelligent and beautiful yet socially crippled, is forced to attend a bachelorette party where her quest for authenticity leads to an unavoidable confrontation with old acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEfrz74bjje0rUaQf6x546z84Dc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215947'),
  ('118947387832284004', 'An Extremely Goofy Movie', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Douglas McCarthy, Bill Knoll, Terry Lennon', 'Hillary Carlip', 'Bill Farmer, Jason Marsden, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Brad Garrett, Vicki Lewis, Bebe Neuwirth, Rob Paulsen', 'G', 'It''s all extreme sports and a life of freedom as Max sets off for college -- but Goofy misses Max so much he loses his job and goes to finish college alongside Max and his friends. But as Goofy tries to get closer to Max, both must go to the extreme to learn how to live their own lives together.', 'It''s all extreme sports and a life of freedom as Max sets off for college -- but Goofy misses Max so much he loses his job and goes to finish college alongside Max and his friends. But as Goofy tries to get closer to Max, both must go to the extreme to learn how to live their own lives together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qr5Q3S7HC16XHQBqE4ZsJJvgUDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15653'),
  ('856897305798760135', 'An Extremely Nutty Teacher', 2011, 'Comedy, Family', 'Jacques Cheuiche, César Rodrigues, André Pinto', 'Ziraldo', 'Paolla Oliveira, Chico Anysio, Joaquim Lopes, Caio Manhente, Elisa Pinheiro, Suely Franco, Max Fercondini, Rodrigo Pandolfo', null, 'After studying in the capital, the young Cate, 18, returns to her small town in Minas Gerais, to teach in elementary school. Enthusiastic, free and communicative, she conquers the students in the act, but its leading behavior does not appeal to conservative teachers of the 40s. Every day she brings new ideas. While they discover the pleasure of learning, the school friends also have the first lessons about love, friendship and freedom. And the schoolmistress not only winning students: the most beautiful boys in town fall in love with her. Created by Tia Cida and niece of Bishop Aristides, Cate grew up with his uncle''s godson, Beto, who became a priest and return to the city after studying outside.', 'After studying in the capital, the young Cate, 18, returns to her small town in Minas Gerais, to teach in elementary school. Enthusiastic, free and communicative, she conquers the students in the act, but its leading behavior does not appeal to conservative teachers of the 40s. Every day she brings new ideas. While they discover the pleasure of learning, the school friends also have the first lessons about love, friendship and freedom. And the schoolmistress not only winning students: the most beautiful boys in town fall in love with her. Created by Tia Cida and niece of Bishop Aristides, Cate grew up with his uncle''s godson, Beto, who became a priest and return to the city after studying outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saprMKYWPlrVwtDNj9UaqHTTy4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81722'),
  ('152517455390993049', 'An Eye for an Eye', 1966, 'Western', 'Michael D. Moore, Lucien Ballard, James A. Rosenberger', 'Bing Russell, Sumner Williams', 'Robert Lansing, Patrick Wayne, Slim Pickens, Gloria Talbott, Strother Martin, Paul Fix, Clint Howard, Rance Howard', 'NR', 'A former bounty hunter teams up with a younger one, to track down and kill the wanted gang leader who murdered his wife and little boy.', 'A former bounty hunter teams up with a younger one, to track down and kill the wanted gang leader who murdered his wife and little boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygYFR79BQyxV1QBSAto233RCwG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317800'),
  ('1107696294823285686', 'An Eye for an Eye', 1981, 'Adventure, Action, Crime', 'Steve Carver, Yoram Ben-Ami, Louis S. Muscate', 'William Gray, James Bruner', 'Chuck Norris, Christopher Lee, Richard Roundtree, Matt Clark, Mako, Maggie Cooper, Rosalind Chao, Professor Toru Tanaka', 'R', 'Sean Kane is forced to resign from the San Francisco Police Department''s Narcotics Division when he goes berserk after his partner is murdered. He decides to fight alone and follows a trail of drug traffickers into unexpected high places.', 'Sean Kane is forced to resign from the San Francisco Police Department''s Narcotics Division when he goes berserk after his partner is murdered. He decides to fight alone and follows a trail of drug traffickers into unexpected high places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/389JSntj1J7LtTjUxvKCy3JJfuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42566'),
  ('882122145382814007', 'An Eye for an Eye', 1990, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'O Sing-Pui, Abdul M. Rumjahn', 'Chan Kiu-Ying', 'Joey Wong, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Lung Fong, Angela Fong Hiu-Hung, John Ching Tung, Melvin Wong, Ricky Wong Chun-Tong', null, 'When Fung''s cop boyfriend Tats puts her supposedly reformed triad father behind bars, her daughter Fung aims to rid the organization of it''s dirty ties, but one of Fung''s father chief goons, Cheong, plans for a very hostile takeover.', 'When Fung''s cop boyfriend Tats puts her supposedly reformed triad father behind bars, her daughter Fung aims to rid the organization of it''s dirty ties, but one of Fung''s father chief goons, Cheong, plans for a very hostile takeover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n14JGJIbxY1bpZ1GJrkSFAPW8Yz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396450'),
  ('717625038498938280', 'An Eye for Beauty', 2014, 'Drama', 'Denys Arcand, Nathalie Moliavko-Visotzky', 'Denys Arcand', 'Éric Bruneau, Mélanie Thierry, Melanie Merkosky, Marie-Josée Croze, Mathieu Quesnel, Michel Forget, Geneviève Boivin-Roussy, Magalie Lépine-Blondeau', null, 'An architect and his wife see their relationship challenged.', 'An architect and his wife see their relationship challenged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aToqnWuKIlqLHWbJXbaET0eo4OF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271826'),
  ('1014250248633470640', 'An Honest Liar', 2014, 'History, Comedy, Documentary', 'Tyler Measom, Justin Weinstein, Tyler Measom', 'Tyler Measom, Justin Weinstein, Greg O''Toole', 'James Randi, Adam Savage, Bill Nye, Uri Geller, Penn Jillette, Alice Cooper, Harry Houdini, Richard Wiseman', null, 'An Honest Liar tells the incredible story of the world-famous magician, escape artist, and world-renowned enemy of deception, James ''The Amazing'' Randi. The film brings to life Randi''s intricate investigations that publicly exposed psychics, faith healers, and con-artists with quasi-religious fervor. A master deceiver who came out of the closet at the age of 81, Randi created fictional characters, fake psychics, and even turned his partner of 25 years, Jose Alvarez, into a sham guru named Carlos.', 'An Honest Liar tells the incredible story of the world-famous magician, escape artist, and world-renowned enemy of deception, James ''The Amazing'' Randi. The film brings to life Randi''s intricate investigations that publicly exposed psychics, faith healers, and con-artists with quasi-religious fervor. A master deceiver who came out of the closet at the age of 81, Randi created fictional characters, fake psychics, and even turned his partner of 25 years, Jose Alvarez, into a sham guru named Carlos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXgXPtynmZnLLISonrrc7XtrLKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262481'),
  ('789821761192961694', 'An Honest Life', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mikael Marcimain, Joe Maples', 'Linn Gottfridsson', 'Simon Lööf, Nora Rios, Willy Ramnek Petri, Nathalie Merchant, Arvid von Heland, Peter Andersson, Christoffer Rigeblad, Fabian Hedlund', 'R', 'When a cynical law student in search of inspiration joins a band of anarchists, he becomes entangled in a web of crime where he is more pawn than player.', 'When a cynical law student in search of inspiration joins a band of anarchists, he becomes entangled in a web of crime where he is more pawn than player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hveI7tEISN8KU60UFJw1JRYKvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187436'),
  ('931657247309131371', 'An Hour Behind', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Lee Andrews, Alex Bryant, John Lyde', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Emily Rose, Barry Watson, Alesandra Durham, Casey Elliott, Scott Christopher, Aubrey Reynolds, Shona Kay, K. Danor Gerald', null, 'Trish''s friends set her up on a blind-date, but when she forgets to adjust her clocks to compensate for Daylight Savings Time, she inadvertently stands her potential sweetheart up. Instead, she arrives at the venue and meets Parker, a sweet-natured but troubled paramedic who decides to play along with the oblivious Trish. The pair hit it off, but their promising romance is threatened when the case of mistaken identity is revealed.', 'Trish''s friends set her up on a blind-date, but when she forgets to adjust her clocks to compensate for Daylight Savings Time, she inadvertently stands her potential sweetheart up. Instead, she arrives at the venue and meets Parker, a sweet-natured but troubled paramedic who decides to play along with the oblivious Trish. The pair hit it off, but their promising romance is threatened when the case of mistaken identity is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOTtUDTGHPJfV1wSLRSJkSnaxrq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481439'),
  ('471963981113322589', 'An Ideal Adventure', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Massimo Carocci, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Steno, Enrico Vanzina, Cesare Frugoni', 'Edwige Fenech, Diego Abatantuono, Liù Bosisio, Mauro Di Francesco, Enrico Maria Salerno, Cinzia de Ponti, Stefano Gragnani, Peter Berling', null, 'Patricia, a journalist, is fed up with all the stupid chores and being ridiculed by her colleagues. To show her talent, she challenges her director Eugenio to test her. She will write a good article, but if she fails she will sleep with him.', 'Patricia, a journalist, is fed up with all the stupid chores and being ridiculed by her colleagues. To show her talent, she challenges her director Eugenio to test her. She will write a good article, but if she fails she will sleep with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iemzePkSzDiloraM6VzHIzPnExl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65733'),
  ('392662581178953091', 'An Ideal Father', 2024, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Hélène Fillières, Laurent Perrot, Stephan Massis', 'Hélène Fillières, Claude Scasso', 'Laurent Gerra, Eddy Mitchell, Laure-Lucille Simon, Jérôme Kircher, Tess Barthélémy, Bérangère Bonvoisin, Denez Raoul, Alice Aliaga', null, 'Michel, the jovial owner of the only café in a small Normandy town, sees his life turned upside down when his teenage daughter is murdered. The community has his back but soon rumor spreads and Michel is singled out. From the ideal father, he becomes the ideal culprit.', 'Michel, the jovial owner of the only café in a small Normandy town, sees his life turned upside down when his teenage daughter is murdered. The community has his back but soon rumor spreads and Michel is singled out. From the ideal father, he becomes the ideal culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xJd3uwtL1vCuZgEfEc8JXI9Uyx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219685'),
  ('329190531002784814', 'An Ideal Husband', 1947, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexander Korda, Georges Périnal, Bluey Hill', 'Lajos Biró', 'Paulette Goddard, Michael Wilding, Diana Wynyard, Hugh Williams, C. Aubrey Smith, Glynis Johns, Constance Collier, Christine Norden', null, 'A prominent politician is preparing to expose a financial scandal. But then a woman who has invested heavily in the shady venture threatens to uncover a damaging secret in the politician''s past if he exposes the speculation as a fraud. His problem is compounded by his wife''s intolerance of the slightest character flaws.', 'A prominent politician is preparing to expose a financial scandal. But then a woman who has invested heavily in the shady venture threatens to uncover a damaging secret in the politician''s past if he exposes the speculation as a fraud. His problem is compounded by his wife''s intolerance of the slightest character flaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivoNvbYf82RRtTnqlKuWjypZdZP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32596'),
  ('726962445537494524', 'An Ideal Husband', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Oliver Parker, David Johnson', 'Oliver Parker', 'Cate Blanchett, Minnie Driver, Rupert Everett, Julianne Moore, Jeremy Northam, Peter Vaughan, Ben Pullen, Marsha Fitzalan', 'PG-13', 'Sir Robert Chiltern is a successful government minister, well-off and with a loving wife. All this is threatened when Mrs Cheveley appears in London with damning evidence of a past misdeed. Sir Robert turns for help to his friend Lord Goring, an apparently idle philanderer and the despair of his father. Goring knows the lady of old, and, for him, takes the whole thing pretty seriously.', 'Sir Robert Chiltern is a successful government minister, well-off and with a loving wife. All this is threatened when Mrs Cheveley appears in London with damning evidence of a past misdeed. Sir Robert turns for help to his friend Lord Goring, an apparently idle philanderer and the despair of his father. Goring knows the lady of old, and, for him, takes the whole thing pretty seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aac3Kw7qAszSotkTNle4bvu3uuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24137'),
  ('314950865475122492', 'An Impossible Balancing Feat', 1902, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A magician along with three doppelgangers perform an elaborate balancing act.', 'A magician along with three doppelgangers perform an elaborate balancing act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZILq1jPvFpbbMnt4em8nCCxJxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108289'),
  ('1106965136253989766', 'An Impossible Love', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Xiaomi Thomas, Thomas Salabert, Catherine Corsini', 'Catherine Corsini, Laurette Polmanss', 'Virginie Efira, Niels Schneider, Jehnny Beth, Estelle Lescure, Coralie Russier, Iliana Zabeth, Catherine Morlot, Ambre Hasaj', null, 'A chronicle of the unconditional love between a mother and her daughter, from 1958 to the present day, which is endangered by an unsteady and manipulative father.', 'A chronicle of the unconditional love between a mother and her daughter, from 1958 to the present day, which is endangered by an unsteady and manipulative father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phFDdkD7BHrKsISBOZrj9Q4gRIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451713'),
  ('1151500105008032599', 'An Impudent Girl', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claude Miller, Dominique Chapuis', 'Luc Béraud, Claude Miller, Annie Miller', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Bernadette Lafont, Jean-Claude Brialy, Julie Glenn, Clotilde Baudon, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Raoul Billerey, Richard Guerry', null, 'Charlotte Castang is a working-class 13-year-old girl, who lives in a drab, run-down neighbourhood, and is ready to become an adult. Her mother died giving birth to her, and she lives with her crass brother and a father whose attention is elsewhere. Her only friend is Lulu, a sick 10-year-old she regards as a pest. Charlotte is antisocial, bored and dreams of a better life. Her life improves when she meets Clara Bauman, a pianist prodigy.', 'Charlotte Castang is a working-class 13-year-old girl, who lives in a drab, run-down neighbourhood, and is ready to become an adult. Her mother died giving birth to her, and she lives with her crass brother and a father whose attention is elsewhere. Her only friend is Lulu, a sick 10-year-old she regards as a pest. Charlotte is antisocial, bored and dreams of a better life. Her life improves when she meets Clara Bauman, a pianist prodigy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMwEgLPSZ1Q8F2kp1GGgse9wd2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61991'),
  ('331808439628524576', 'An Inconvenient Sequel: Truth to Power', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Bonni Cohen, Jon Shenk, Jon Shenk', 'Al Gore', 'Al Gore, Barack Obama, Donald Trump, Angela Merkel, Justin Trudeau, Xi Jinping, Narendra Modi, Vladimir Putin', 'PG', 'A decade after An Inconvenient Truth brought climate change into the heart of popular culture comes the riveting and rousing follow-up that shows just how close we are to a real energy revolution. Vice President Al Gore continues his tireless fight, traveling around the world training an army of climate champions and influencing international climate policy. Cameras follow him behind the scenes—in moments private and public, funny and poignant—as he pursues the empowering notion that while the stakes have never been higher, the perils of climate change can be overcome with human ingenuity and passion.', 'A decade after An Inconvenient Truth brought climate change into the heart of popular culture comes the riveting and rousing follow-up that shows just how close we are to a real energy revolution. Vice President Al Gore continues his tireless fight, traveling around the world training an army of climate champions and influencing international climate policy. Cameras follow him behind the scenes—in moments private and public, funny and poignant—as he pursues the empowering notion that while the stakes have never been higher, the perils of climate change can be overcome with human ingenuity and passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WauUg4DcUxng5nwhisu7UFZq4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432602'),
  ('1135725868946241717', 'An Inconvenient Truth', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Davis Guggenheim, Robert Richman, Davis Guggenheim', 'Al Gore', 'Al Gore, Billy West, Ronald Reagan, George W. Bush, George H. W. Bush', 'PG', 'A documentary on Al Gore''s campaign to make the issue of global warming a recognized problem worldwide.', 'A documentary on Al Gore''s campaign to make the issue of global warming a recognized problem worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrYT5UHE2UIsofwkv6KK2Tsu5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1781'),
  ('151044171700650459', 'An Independent Life', 1992, 'Drama', 'Vitali Kanevsky, Vladimir Brylyakov', 'Vitali Kanevsky', 'Elena Popova, Pavel Nazarov, Dinara Drukarova, Toshihiro Watanabe, Lidiya Dorotenko, Larisa Zhvaniya, Natalya Ipatova, Tatyana Ivanova', null, 'This is the second installment of a three-part series of autobiographical films about the director''s life. The first, which won various awards for its maker, was entitled Zamri Oumi Voskresni and was later retitled Zari, Umri, Vokresni ("Freeze-Die-Come to Life"). At the end of that film, set at the conclusion of World War II, the young Valerka was striving hard to overcome the inertia of just getting by, along with his sometime friend Galiya. In this one, he is adjusting to Galiya''s death and is back in school and is living with his mother, a prostitute. After a girl at the school is found to have been gang-raped, the headmaster chooses Valerka to be one of the scapegoats, though he had nothing to do with the deed. The punishment seems mild enough, he was simply expelled from school. However, after quarrelling with his mother about the incident, he takes to the road, and discovers a society so bleak, degraded and hopeless that it is a wonder he remained alive.', 'This is the second installment of a three-part series of autobiographical films about the director''s life. The first, which won various awards for its maker, was entitled Zamri Oumi Voskresni and was later retitled Zari, Umri, Vokresni ("Freeze-Die-Come to Life"). At the end of that film, set at the conclusion of World War II, the young Valerka was striving hard to overcome the inertia of just getting by, along with his sometime friend Galiya. In this one, he is adjusting to Galiya''s death and is back in school and is living with his mother, a prostitute. After a girl at the school is found to have been gang-raped, the headmaster chooses Valerka to be one of the scapegoats, though he had nothing to do with the deed. The punishment seems mild enough, he was simply expelled from school. However, after quarrelling with his mother about the incident, he takes to the road, and discovers a society so bleak, degraded and hopeless that it is a wonder he remained alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdW2kiP8010nGmIPiuMzYdyOLHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196929'),
  ('49931737047303474', 'An Indian Tale', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes, Frédéric Noirhomme', 'Sebastián Borensztein, Héctor Cabello Reyes', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Alexandra Lamy, Pitobash, Anne Girouard, Jean-Philippe Lejeune, Sébastien Waroquier, Renaud Rutten, Olivier Bony', null, 'The life of two men changed unexpectedly when Ajith, an Indian sailor who was robbed and lost everything, appears out of nowhere in front of Pierre, a single and grumpy Frenchman.', 'The life of two men changed unexpectedly when Ajith, an Indian sailor who was robbed and lost everything, appears out of nowhere in front of Pierre, a single and grumpy Frenchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPczeOfiinfGoXdpqZSQePI0HQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459963'),
  ('363817229195135349', 'An Inn at Osaka', 1954, 'Drama', 'Heinosuke Gosho, Jōji Ohara, Akira Miwa', 'Heinosuke Gosho, Toshio Yasumi', 'Shūji Sano, Nobuko Otowa, Mitsuko Mito, Hiroko Kawasaki, Sachiko Hidari, Kyōko Anzai, Eiko Miyoshi, Haruo Tanaka', null, 'An Inn at Osaka, rarely seen outside Japan, follows the story of an insurance company executive from Tokyo, Mr. Mito, who is demoted to the Osaka office. He takes a room at a small inn and tries to rebuild his life. Notable for its exquisite framing and cinematography, An Inn at Osaka allows its complicated plotlines to disappear behind the minutiae of penury and humiliation that Mito and others suffer during the post-war economic and social reconstruction.', 'An Inn at Osaka, rarely seen outside Japan, follows the story of an insurance company executive from Tokyo, Mr. Mito, who is demoted to the Osaka office. He takes a room at a small inn and tries to rebuild his life. Notable for its exquisite framing and cinematography, An Inn at Osaka allows its complicated plotlines to disappear behind the minutiae of penury and humiliation that Mito and others suffer during the post-war economic and social reconstruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7hvVWnkn6Zcas1D0BFcJ8oo8xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181097'),
  ('550873707108875523', 'An Inn in Tokyo', 1935, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara', 'Tadao Ikeda, Masao Arata', 'Takeshi Sakamoto, Yoshiko Okada, Chōko Iida, Chishū Ryū, Tomio Aoki, Kazuko Ojima, Takayuki Suematsu', null, 'An unemployed Japanese man and his two sons wander the industrial flatlands of Depression-era Tokyo, until he chances upon an old friend and befriends a woman and her daughter, who are in a similar predicament.', 'An unemployed Japanese man and his two sons wander the industrial flatlands of Depression-era Tokyo, until he chances upon an old friend and befriends a woman and her daughter, who are in a similar predicament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSYWTdGQy1xbyZihhjeKXvmL0pD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89462'),
  ('300264378929018189', 'An Innocent Little Game', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Rapp', 'Bernard Rapp, Gérald Sibleyras', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Yvan Attal, Jean-Paul Rouve, Marina Foïs, Lionel Abelanski, Lizzie Brocheré, Michel Vuillermoz, Annick Blancheteau', null, 'Claire et Bruno forment depuis douze ans un couple établi, une "institution". Au cours d''une journée à la campagne réunissant tous leurs proches, ils vont, par jeu, prétendre qu''ils se séparent.', 'Claire et Bruno forment depuis douze ans un couple établi, une "institution". Au cours d''une journée à la campagne réunissant tous leurs proches, ils vont, par jeu, prétendre qu''ils se séparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrLpewqjM2txYujfMxCT194UGVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40187'),
  ('998930989333773729', 'An Innocent Man', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kelly Wimberly, Paul Deason, Jeff Okabayashi', 'Larry Brothers', 'Tom Selleck, F. Murray Abraham, Laila Robins, David Rasche, Todd Graff, M.C. Gainey, Peter Van Norden, Richard Young', 'R', 'Jimmie Rainwood was minding his own business when two corrupt police officers (getting an address wrong) burst into his house, expecting to find a major drug dealer. Rainwood is shot, and the officers frame him as a drug dealer. Rainwood is convicted of drug dealing, based on the perjured evidence of a police informant. Thrown into a seedy jail, fighting to prove his innocence is diffucult when he has to deal with the realities of prison life, where everyone claims they were framed.', 'Jimmie Rainwood was minding his own business when two corrupt police officers (getting an address wrong) burst into his house, expecting to find a major drug dealer. Rainwood is shot, and the officers frame him as a drug dealer. Rainwood is convicted of drug dealing, based on the perjured evidence of a police informant. Thrown into a seedy jail, fighting to prove his innocence is diffucult when he has to deal with the realities of prison life, where everyone claims they were framed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDgR7vq3fqtlo2w2wPN3pNXyDm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29185'),
  ('256062373881746658', 'An Inspector Calls', 1954, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Guy Hamilton, Edward Scaife, Ted Sturgis', 'J. B. Priestley', 'Alastair Sim, Olga Lindo, Arthur Young, Brian Worth, Eileen Moore, Bryan Forbes, Jane Wenham, George Woodbridge', null, 'An upper-crust family dinner is interrupted by a police inspector who brings news that a girl known to everyone present has died in suspicious circumstances. It seems that any or all of them could have had a hand in her death. But who is the mysterious Inspector and what can he want of them?', 'An upper-crust family dinner is interrupted by a police inspector who brings news that a girl known to everyone present has died in suspicious circumstances. It seems that any or all of them could have had a hand in her death. But who is the mysterious Inspector and what can he want of them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j637ICfPZPVnhoGPlRw9xVf6IqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18174'),
  ('109146566492669910', 'An Inspector Calls', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Aisling Walsh, Martin Fuhrer', 'Helen Edmundson', 'David Thewlis, Ken Stott, Finn Cole, Chloe Pirrie, Miranda Richardson, Sophie Rundle, Kyle Soller, Lucy Chappell', null, 'Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.', 'Northern England, 1912. The dinner of a wealthy family is interrupted by Inspector Goole, who only announces that a young woman has committed suicide. Then, he simply asks everyone present, one by one, if they knew her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZLDqf9poquJwY5uY6ZWK1yqsSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359305'),
  ('985351752199807189', 'An Interview with God', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Frank Prinzi, Perry Lang, Patrick Mangan', 'Ken Aguado', 'David Strathairn, Brenton Thwaites, Yael Grobglas, Charlbi Dean, Hill Harper, Bobby Di Cicco, Meagan Kimberly Smith', 'NR', 'An up-and-coming journalist finds his world and faith increasingly challenged when he''s granted the interview of a lifetime – with someone who claims to be God.', 'An up-and-coming journalist finds his world and faith increasingly challenged when he''s granted the interview of a lifetime – with someone who claims to be God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9TeB8VLCgwSph2OSYK3lcHGf1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534338'),
  ('226215659548453111', 'An Invisible Sign', 2010, 'Family, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Marilyn Agrelo, Lisa Rinzler', 'Pamela Falk, Michael Ellis', 'Jessica Alba, Bailee Madison, J.K. Simmons, Chris Messina, Sonia Braga, John Shea, Sophie Nyweide, Marylouise Burke', 'PG-13', 'Mona Gray is a 20-year-old loner who, as a child, turned to math for salvation after her father became ill. As an adult, Mona now teaches the subject and must help her students through their own crises.', 'Mona Gray is a 20-year-old loner who, as a child, turned to math for salvation after her father became ill. As an adult, Mona now teaches the subject and must help her students through their own crises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5bSVpGnqL2XDG22ddubcD9ik5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59435'),
  ('1115989393652065843', 'An Invisible Victim: The Eliza Samudio Case', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Juliana Antunes, Janice D''Avila', 'Carol Pires, Caroline Margoni', 'Eliza Samudio, Bruno Fernandes de Souza, Angela Romano, Alexandre Barroso, Caio Barbosa, Carla Bó, Carla Silene, Dayanne Rodrigues', null, 'A star goalkeeper threatens a woman who is pregnant with his child. Her pleas for help go unanswered in the shadow of his fame — then tragedy strikes.', 'A star goalkeeper threatens a woman who is pregnant with his child. Her pleas for help go unanswered in the shadow of his fame — then tragedy strikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4v9kjTA7liEIF0DJjn0QHOZtlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1354503'),
  ('373151738400159685', 'An Irish Goodbye', 2022, 'Drama', 'Tom Berkeley, Ross White, Graham Kinniburgh', 'Tom Berkeley, Ross White', 'Seamus O''Hara, James Martin, Paddy Jenkins, Michelle Fairley', null, 'In rural Northern Ireland, following the untimely death of their mother, a young man with Down syndrome and his estranged brother discover her unfulfilled bucket list.', 'In rural Northern Ireland, following the untimely death of their mother, a young man with Down syndrome and his estranged brother discover her unfulfilled bucket list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVVMyjGoW7AKG99Eukq0U2ijLIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889598'),
  ('423616132028260360', 'An Irrepressible Woman', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Laurent Heynemann', 'Luc Béraud, Laurent Heynemann', 'Elsa Zylberstein, Hippolyte Girardot, Émilie Dequenne, Mathilda May, Philippe Torreton, Grégori Derangère, Thomas Chabrol, Jérôme Deschamps', null, '1940, Jeanne Reichenbach turns her back on a peaceful life to link her destiny to Léon Blum. She''s been loving him since her teenage years, and is ready to sacrifice her freedom to mary him at Buchenwald, where he''s held prisoner. They will survive together.', '1940, Jeanne Reichenbach turns her back on a peaceful life to link her destiny to Léon Blum. She''s been loving him since her teenage years, and is ready to sacrifice her freedom to mary him at Buchenwald, where he''s held prisoner. They will survive together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nebPQQN7SH9KYXJBDifCkqsrvfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651838'),
  ('801831237019937229', 'An Italian girl from Kypseli', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis, Angelos Sideratos', 'Dinos Dimopoulos', 'Maro Kodou, Alekos Alexandrakis, Katerina Yioulaki, Giannis Vogiatzis, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Athinodoros Prousalis, Ketty Papanika', null, 'A young student (Alekos Alexandrakis) comes from Italy and presents to his sister (Katerina Gioulaki) the fiancée (Maro Kondou) as Italian, because the first insisted not to marry a Greek. The couple, however, in cooperation with the afflicted spouse (Giannis Vogiatzis) strict sister, managed to change the opinion.', 'A young student (Alekos Alexandrakis) comes from Italy and presents to his sister (Katerina Gioulaki) the fiancée (Maro Kondou) as Italian, because the first insisted not to marry a Greek. The couple, however, in cooperation with the afflicted spouse (Giannis Vogiatzis) strict sister, managed to change the opinion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znACYwdRBKrkGkQZd5820ugGWjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375539'),
  ('327881544206706396', 'An Italian in America', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Benito Frattari, Joe Pollini', 'Alberto Sordi, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio De Sica, Bill Dana, Alice Condon, Bettina Brenna, Franco Valobra, Valentino Macchi, Lou Perry', null, 'Giuseppe, an Italian gas station attendant, is invited to the United States to reconcile with his father, who he believed had been dead for years.', 'Giuseppe, an Italian gas station attendant, is invited to the United States to reconcile with his father, who he believed had been dead for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVFG2oxdBELTjnLv13X7l3vZTDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168387'),
  ('538099682908476103', 'An Italian Name', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Beatrice Tomassetti, Elisabetta Boni, Eugenia Ricceri', 'Francesco Piccolo, Francesca Archibugi', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Valeria Golino, Luigi Lo Cascio, Rocco Papaleo, Micaela Ramazzotti, Marco Baliani, Manuela Mandracchia, Giulia Salerno', null, 'Paolo is an outgoing and handsome real estate broker married to Simona, a beautiful woman from the rough outskirts of Rome who has become an author of spicy bestsellers and is pregnant with their child. Betta, Paolo’s sister and her husband Sandro organise a dinner party with Paolo, Simona and their childhood friend, the eccentric musician Claudio. During the lively gathering Paolo reveals what he would like to name his son, causing reactions to steam up and a torrent of revelations to follow reaching climactic proportions.', 'Paolo is an outgoing and handsome real estate broker married to Simona, a beautiful woman from the rough outskirts of Rome who has become an author of spicy bestsellers and is pregnant with their child. Betta, Paolo’s sister and her husband Sandro organise a dinner party with Paolo, Simona and their childhood friend, the eccentric musician Claudio. During the lively gathering Paolo reveals what he would like to name his son, causing reactions to steam up and a torrent of revelations to follow reaching climactic proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f17lML6pYWA5OAQe9tHiM480sVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320028'),
  ('303393005832855271', 'An Italian Romance', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Cinzia Castania, Luca Bigazzi', 'Claudio Piersanti, Carlo Mazzacurati, Doriana Leondeff', 'Stefano Accorsi, Maya Sansa, Marco Messeri, Anne Canovas, Roberto Citran, Marie-Christine Descouard, Pietro Fornaciari, Giacomo La Rosa', null, 'Giovanni, a married man with a child, meets on a train Maria, a former lover.', 'Giovanni, a married man with a child, meets on a train Maria, a former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfDz86qmIIyCtWLazKNP3WT4HoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62024'),
  ('427461631461847179', 'An Itch in Time', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', 'NR', 'Elmer threatens to give his dog a bath if he doesn''t stop scratching, but the poor pooch is the victim of a hungry flea whose tools of the trade include pickaxes and dynamite.', 'Elmer threatens to give his dog a bath if he doesn''t stop scratching, but the poor pooch is the victim of a hungry flea whose tools of the trade include pickaxes and dynamite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSnjn5R6m2giNbStMQemYqQhXh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100396'),
  ('967166342842160239', 'An Occasional Hell', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Salomé Breziner, Mauro Fiore', 'Anton Sanko', 'Tom Berenger, Valeria Golino, Kari Wührer, Robert Davi, Richard Edson, Stephen Lang, Danny Comden, Ellen Greene', 'R', 'A former policeman-turned college professor of forensics, is asked by a widow to solve the murder of her unfaithful husband and the disappearance of his mistress who may have been linked to some drug dealers.', 'A former policeman-turned college professor of forensics, is asked by a widow to solve the murder of her unfaithful husband and the disappearance of his mistress who may have been linked to some drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srt8XRL6vpDfiBffV9CWtO3qAnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109188'),
  ('420011645738357636', 'An Occurrence at Owl Creek Bridge', 1961, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Robert Enrico, Jean Boffety, Nat Lilienstein', 'Robert Enrico', 'Roger Jacquet, Anne Cornaly, Anker-Spang Larsen, Stéphane Fey, Jean-François Zeller, Pierre Danny, Louis Adelin', 'NR', 'During the American Civil War, a Southerner is about to be hanged from a bridge for sabotage when something unexpected happens.', 'During the American Civil War, a Southerner is about to be hanged from a bridge for sabotage when something unexpected happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GKfYhSuOOaJKjKOpoaDJKulCA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53218'),
  ('471921569784941836', 'An Odd Turn', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Francisco Lezama, Federico Lastra, Manuel Setton', 'Francisco Lezama', 'Laila Maltz, Paco Gorriz, Sofía Palomino, Jorge Prado, Cecilia Rainero, Marcela Guerty, Guillermo Massé, Susana Pampín', null, 'Buenos Aires, 2019. Lucrecia, who jobs as a museum security guard, foresees a sharp rise in the dollar’s value with her pendulum and falls in love with a currency exchange house employee.', 'Buenos Aires, 2019. Lucrecia, who jobs as a museum security guard, foresees a sharp rise in the dollar’s value with her pendulum and falls in love with a currency exchange house employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SXOhrqOtszamsvM0EvquOA0YKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233393'),
  ('306166023118614361', 'An Officer and a Gentleman', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Donald E. Thorin, Taylor Hackford, Pamela M. Eilerson', 'Douglas Day Stewart', 'Richard Gere, Debra Winger, Louis Gossett Jr., David Keith, Robert Loggia, Lisa Blount, Lisa Eilbacher, Harold Sylvester', 'R', 'Zack Mayo is an aloof, taciturn man who aspires to be a navy pilot. Once he arrives at training camp for his 13-week officer''s course, Mayo runs afoul of abrasive, no-nonsense drill Sergeant Emil Foley. Mayo is an excellent cadet, but a little cold around the heart, so Foley rides him mercilessly, sensing that the young man would be prime officer material if he weren''t so self-involved. Zack''s affair with a working girl is likewise compromised by his unwillingness to give of himself.', 'Zack Mayo is an aloof, taciturn man who aspires to be a navy pilot. Once he arrives at training camp for his 13-week officer''s course, Mayo runs afoul of abrasive, no-nonsense drill Sergeant Emil Foley. Mayo is an excellent cadet, but a little cold around the heart, so Foley rides him mercilessly, sensing that the young man would be prime officer material if he weren''t so self-involved. Zack''s affair with a working girl is likewise compromised by his unwillingness to give of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69adZbLeRk5TNQ3e0008dMnde9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2623'),
  ('731062588364396209', 'An Officer and a Spy', 2019, 'History, Drama, Thriller', 'Hubert Engammare, Roman Polanski, Paweł Edelman', 'Roman Polanski', 'Jean Dujardin, Louis Garrel, Emmanuelle Seigner, Grégory Gadebois, Hervé Pierre, Wladimir Yordanoff, Didier Sandre, Melvil Poupaud', null, 'In 1894, French Captain Alfred Dreyfus is wrongfully convicted of treason and sentenced to life imprisonment at the Devil’s Island penal colony.', 'In 1894, French Captain Alfred Dreyfus is wrongfully convicted of treason and sentenced to life imprisonment at the Devil’s Island penal colony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqlzmKVBpGz7OMWfOXlK4y1m9Uz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399121'),
  ('1106742703567971176', 'An Old Kung Fu Master', 1981, 'Action, Drama', 'Gwan Jing-Leung', 'Gwan Jing-Leung', 'Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Charles Heung, Cecilia Wong, Yuen Lung-Kui, Thompson Kao Kang, Chow Siu-Loi, Sai Gwa-Pau, Chan Lap-Ban', null, 'A movie starring Simon Yuen Siu-Tin as a Kung Fu master.', 'A movie starring Simon Yuen Siu-Tin as a Kung Fu master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z178DlVITgnC2YmWEbLWz0Yt6I2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46479'),
  ('714171161394273376', 'An Old Lady', 2020, 'Drama', 'Lim Sun-ae, Park Rodrigo Sehee, Kim Han-ul', 'Lim Sun-ae', 'Ye Su-jeong, Ki Joo-bong, Kim Jun-gyeong, Kim Tae-hun, Kim Joong-ki, Shin Hyeon-jong, Park Ga-young, Lee Myung-ha', null, 'Hyo-jeong, a 69-year-old woman, is raped—but few people, including the police, are willing to believe what she says.', 'Hyo-jeong, a 69-year-old woman, is raped—but few people, including the police, are willing to believe what she says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rj3Gxy8x11J6DXBBdntunTaZutO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638423'),
  ('1021220460481408133', 'An Old Maid', 2007, 'Drama', 'Hendrik Handloegten', null, 'Fritzi Haberlandt, Matthias Schweighöfer, Stipe Erceg, Justus von Dohnányi, Ingrid van Bergen, Ernst Stankovski, Oona von Maydell, Katharina Matz', null, 'Henriette lives alone in a luxurious old apartment in Wiesbaden, which she inherited from her parents. Her everyday life is as quiet and orderly as the large rooms around her. She works as a teacher at a nearby ballet school. She regularly writes letters to a composer whom she admires but has never met in person and spends her evenings with friends who are actually her parents'' friends. A chance encounter jolts Henriette out of her quiet life: she observes Felix, who is deaf and mute, stealing money in a café that was meant for the waiter. When she speaks to him on the train shortly afterwards, it is the beginning of an unusual relationship full of contrasts and unspoken passion.', 'Henriette lives alone in a luxurious old apartment in Wiesbaden, which she inherited from her parents. Her everyday life is as quiet and orderly as the large rooms around her. She works as a teacher at a nearby ballet school. She regularly writes letters to a composer whom she admires but has never met in person and spends her evenings with friends who are actually her parents'' friends. A chance encounter jolts Henriette out of her quiet life: she observes Felix, who is deaf and mute, stealing money in a café that was meant for the waiter. When she speaks to him on the train shortly afterwards, it is the beginning of an unusual relationship full of contrasts and unspoken passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLGgjSN7YFhPExVpIwWNUj3f4YV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221015'),
  ('419664310857725851', 'An Open Heart', 2012, 'Drama', 'Marion Laine, Antoine Héberlé', 'Marion Laine', 'Juliette Binoche, Edgar Ramírez, Hippolyte Girardot, Amandine Dewasmes, Aurélia Petit, Bernard Verley, Elsa Tauveron, Romain Rondeau', null, 'Mila and Javier, both renowned surgeons and both passionate about their work, have been madly in love for the past 10 years. They have always taken great care to preserve their extraordinary love for each other and refuse to succumb to the routine of everyday living. But Mila’s unexpected pregnancy, combined with increasing pressure from work at the hospital, drives Javier to drink more heavily and he ends up being suspended. Faced with his demons, Javier drifts further and further away from Mila. Yet, when their relationship is under serious threat, Javier is ready to do whatever it takes to win Mila back.', 'Mila and Javier, both renowned surgeons and both passionate about their work, have been madly in love for the past 10 years. They have always taken great care to preserve their extraordinary love for each other and refuse to succumb to the routine of everyday living. But Mila’s unexpected pregnancy, combined with increasing pressure from work at the hospital, drives Javier to drink more heavily and he ends up being suspended. Faced with his demons, Javier drifts further and further away from Mila. Yet, when their relationship is under serious threat, Javier is ready to do whatever it takes to win Mila back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmFpojOgnKmrWykBXkGrH4SDXlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116377'),
  ('572781191565604106', 'An Open Secret', 2014, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Amy J. Berg, Jenna Rosher', 'Billy McMillin, Lorien Haynes, Amy J. Berg', 'Evan Henzi, Michael Egan III, Todd Bridges, Joey Coleman, Nicholas Stojanovich, Michael Harrah, John Connolly, Anne Henry', 'PG-13', 'An investigation into accusations of teenagers being sexually abused within the film industry.', 'An investigation into accusations of teenagers being sexually abused within the film industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYaoQIfOpF6aRLfAtioPQhk4iXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294368'),
  ('427402993997255827', 'An Optical Illusion', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Juan Cavestany, Javier López Bermejo', 'Juan Cavestany', 'Carmen Machi, Pepón Nieto, Luis Bermejo, Lucía Juárez, Lola Cordón, Susana Sanabria', null, 'A couple from Burgos, Alfredo and Teresa, travel to New York where they intend to “switch off” and do all of the things listed in the guidebook. But the moment they land, they start to notice signs, some subtle and others rather less so, that in fact they’re not in the city sold to them by the travel agency. So where are they?', 'A couple from Burgos, Alfredo and Teresa, travel to New York where they intend to “switch off” and do all of the things listed in the guidebook. But the moment they land, they start to notice signs, some subtle and others rather less so, that in fact they’re not in the city sold to them by the travel agency. So where are they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YcGLliFPVCcd0mVlqbnOmCECdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734818'),
  ('1062673113462898034', 'An Optical Poem', 1938, 'Animation, Music', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'A dance of shapes. A title card tells us this is an experiment in conveying the mental images of music in a visual form. Liszt''s "Second Hungarian Rhapsody" is the music. The shapes, all two-dimensional, are circles primarily, with some squares and rectangles, and a few triangles. The shapes move rhythmically to the music: receding from view or moving across the screen. Red circles on a blue background; light blue squares; white rectangles. Then, a red background of many circles with a few in the foreground. Red gives way to blue then to white. Shapes reappear as Liszt''s themes re-occur. Then, with a few staccato notes and images, it''s over.', 'A dance of shapes. A title card tells us this is an experiment in conveying the mental images of music in a visual form. Liszt''s "Second Hungarian Rhapsody" is the music. The shapes, all two-dimensional, are circles primarily, with some squares and rectangles, and a few triangles. The shapes move rhythmically to the music: receding from view or moving across the screen. Red circles on a blue background; light blue squares; white rectangles. Then, a red background of many circles with a few in the foreground. Red gives way to blue then to white. Shapes reappear as Liszt''s themes re-occur. Then, with a few staccato notes and images, it''s over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yAfkkvRsmK8rbJD2m5W905jb56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193652'),
  ('255743301744835593', 'An Optimistic Tragedy', 1963, 'War, Drama, History', 'Samson Samsonov, Vladimir Monakhov, Grigori Korenblyum', 'Sofiya Vishnevetskaya, Samson Samsonov', 'Margarita Volodina, Boris Andreyev, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Vsevolod Sanayev, Orvo Björninen, Vsevolod Safonov, Ivan Zhevago, Daniil Netrebin', null, '1918 year. A woman commissar has been appointed from the Central Committee of the Bolshevik Party to the Russian warship Gromoboi, which is ruled by anarchist sailors. The leader of the ship is the anarchist Vozhak. The Commissioner was instructed to reorganize the naval detachment into the First Sailor Regiment. She faces a difficult task: to win the authority of the sailors and eradicate anarchy. Of the remaining officers on the ship — lieutenant Bering, who served in the tsarist fleet on the battleship "Emperor Paul I". He must become the commander and, together with the sent commissar, lead the regiment to the front in the Black Sea region.', '1918 year. A woman commissar has been appointed from the Central Committee of the Bolshevik Party to the Russian warship Gromoboi, which is ruled by anarchist sailors. The leader of the ship is the anarchist Vozhak. The Commissioner was instructed to reorganize the naval detachment into the First Sailor Regiment. She faces a difficult task: to win the authority of the sailors and eradicate anarchy. Of the remaining officers on the ship — lieutenant Bering, who served in the tsarist fleet on the battleship "Emperor Paul I". He must become the commander and, together with the sent commissar, lead the regiment to the front in the Black Sea region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJNMTxfgapA96w1K0FCzodeRvSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198845'),
  ('897215318461759273', 'An Ordinary Case', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'François Jaouën, Frédéric Gérard, Camille Sanchez', 'Daniel Auteuil, Steven Mitz', 'Daniel Auteuil, Grégory Gadebois, Alice Belaïdi, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Gaëtan Roussel, Isabelle Candelier, Florence Janas, Aurore Auteuil', null, 'Jean Monier is a disillusioned lawyer, appointed to defend Nicolas Milik, a man accused of murdering his wife. While everything points to his guilt, Monier takes up the case, convinced of his innocence.', 'Jean Monier is a disillusioned lawyer, appointed to defend Nicolas Milik, a man accused of murdering his wife. While everything points to his guilt, Monier takes up the case, convinced of his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMRuEL73DJrIDKvMyLU7v5ksBv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136394'),
  ('1065733794354532172', 'An Ordinary Execution', 2010, 'Drama', 'Marc Dugain, Yves Angelo', 'Marc Dugain', 'Marina Hands, Édouard Baer, Denis Podalydès, André Dussollier, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Anne Benoît, Régis Romele, Valentin Popescu', null, 'During the last days of Stalin''s reign, a doctor (Marina Hands) tries to go unnoticed in a society of mutual dread where a neighbour or colleague might "denounce" you to the authorities at any moment.But tales of her healing touch have spread and one night she is taken away, not to the infamous Lubyanka prison, but to the Kremlin to attend the ailing Comrade Stalin himself. Uncle Joe (André Dussollier), an old man racked with pain but still as watchful and deadly as a snake.', 'During the last days of Stalin''s reign, a doctor (Marina Hands) tries to go unnoticed in a society of mutual dread where a neighbour or colleague might "denounce" you to the authorities at any moment.But tales of her healing touch have spread and one night she is taken away, not to the infamous Lubyanka prison, but to the Kremlin to attend the ailing Comrade Stalin himself. Uncle Joe (André Dussollier), an old man racked with pain but still as watchful and deadly as a snake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8JO7bRdeGoclT2f3Db69K8ayWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69157'),
  ('664333728658334046', 'An Ordinary Man', 2017, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Brad Silberling, Magdalena Górka', 'Brad Silberling', 'Ben Kingsley, Hera Hilmar, Peter Serafinowicz, Edmund Kingsley, Robert Blythe, Milorad Kapor, Igor Kovačević, Marija Opsenica', 'R', 'A war criminal in hiding forms a relationship with his only connection to the outside world - his maid.', 'A war criminal in hiding forms a relationship with his only connection to the outside world - his maid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qc2mu3aYUDhdDCcrgvQWiQ4rMp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405965'),
  ('678781217529440361', 'An Ordinary Mother', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Guillaume Deffontaines, Pascal Metge, Victor Baussonie', 'Anna Fregonese, Jacques Akchoti, Sylvie Audcoeur', 'Karin Viard, Darren Muselet, Samir Guesmi, Yannick Rosset, Farida Ouchani, Oscar Copp, Pasquale D''Inca, Céline Jorrion', null, 'Aline never managed to get closure from the death of her 17-year-old son in a street fight. When she sees the assai- lant recently released from prison, she decides to cook up a plan to avenge her dead son. Things go unexpectedly as she gets to know the young man and her determination is tested.', 'Aline never managed to get closure from the death of her 17-year-old son in a street fight. When she sees the assai- lant recently released from prison, she decides to cook up a plan to avenge her dead son. Things go unexpectedly as she gets to know the young man and her determination is tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFGUNdWRc2P4bGiUaBPO8t1E3tU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893904'),
  ('480125053275236069', 'An Ostrich Told Me the World Is Fake and I Think I Believe It', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Lachlan Pendragon', 'Lachlan Pendragon', 'Lachlan Pendragon, John Cavanagh, Michael Richard, Jamie Trotter', null, 'When a young telemarketer is confronted by a mysterious talking ostrich, he learns that the universe is stop motion animation. He must put aside his dwindling toaster sales and focus on convincing his colleagues of his terrifying discovery. It''s scary business living in a stop motion world, where your faces come off and a giant hand controls your every move.', 'When a young telemarketer is confronted by a mysterious talking ostrich, he learns that the universe is stop motion animation. He must put aside his dwindling toaster sales and focus on convincing his colleagues of his terrifying discovery. It''s scary business living in a stop motion world, where your faces come off and a giant hand controls your every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0xrTLwvosW81fuFhdWYdu35GJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943776'),
  ('771664408505146355', 'An Owl Is an Owl Is an Owl', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker', null, null, 'PG-13', 'Part of Chris Marker’s Bestiaire (Petit Bestiaire) collection, An Owl Is an Owl Is an Owl is a short video meditation on the gaze and movement of owls—sometimes still, sometimes in flight—observed with the quiet, rhythmic attention typical of Marker’s later video work.', 'Part of Chris Marker’s Bestiaire (Petit Bestiaire) collection, An Owl Is an Owl Is an Owl is a short video meditation on the gaze and movement of owls—sometimes still, sometimes in flight—observed with the quiet, rhythmic attention typical of Marker’s later video work.', null, 'tmdb:movie:280062'),
  ('695786391124892534', 'An Unexpected Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Robinson, Adam Sliwinski', 'Paul Campbell', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Tyler Hynes, Alison Wandzura, Lynda Boyd, Paul McGillion, Elan Ross Gibson, Logan McInnes, Jessica Garcie', 'G', 'Jamie hasn’t told his family that he and his now ex-girlfriend Emily broke up. After an inopportune run-in with Emily at the train station in his hometown, Jamie convinces her to pretend they’re still a couple to avoid ruining Christmas for his family.', 'Jamie hasn’t told his family that he and his now ex-girlfriend Emily broke up. After an inopportune run-in with Emily at the train station in his hometown, Jamie convinces her to pretend they’re still a couple to avoid ruining Christmas for his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xX3396RcIQynrulZHFlE1DqAOfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874124'),
  ('1139789454197937010', 'An Unexpected Love', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rolo Pulpeiro, Juan Vera', 'Daniel Cúparo', 'Ricardo Darín, Mercedes Morán, Claudia Fontán, Andrea Pietra, Mariu Fernández, Jean Pierre Noher, Norman Briski, Juan Minujín', null, 'It tells the story of Marcos and Ana, who have been married for more than 25 years, but enter into an existential crisis that leads them to separate. The life of singles seems fascinating and exciting at first, but soon it also becomes monotonous for her and nightmarish for him.', 'It tells the story of Marcos and Ana, who have been married for more than 25 years, but enter into an existential crisis that leads them to separate. The life of singles seems fascinating and exciting at first, but soon it also becomes monotonous for her and nightmarish for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN0ODPC5w6mhEBqlLcWAMyMlmyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535683'),
  ('702060514380073295', 'An Unfinished Affair', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Rod Hardy, David Connell', 'Rama Laurie Stagner, Dan Witt', 'Jennie Garth, Tim Matheson, Leigh Taylor-Young, Peter Facinelli, Michael Fairman, Georgann Johnson, Michael Massee, John Furey', null, 'When a man ends a regretful love affair that occurred during his wife''s illness, his mistress plots revenge by targeting his family''s most treasured possessions, a priceless painting and his son.', 'When a man ends a regretful love affair that occurred during his wife''s illness, his mistress plots revenge by targeting his family''s most treasured possessions, a priceless painting and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwD7bRExfNvo9B8yUJR3jBzdY0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237807'),
  ('1140749192489034302', 'An Unfinished Film', 2024, 'Drama', 'Lou Ye, Zeng Jian', 'Lou Ye, Ma Yingli', 'Qin Hao, Mao Xiaorui, Qi Xi, Liang Ming, Huang Xuan, Zhang Songwen, Zeng Jian', null, 'A film crew gathers in a hotel near Wuhan to resume production of a film that was interrupted ten years earlier, but an unexpected event once again disrupts the preparations.', 'A film crew gathers in a hotel near Wuhan to resume production of a film that was interrupted ten years earlier, but an unexpected event once again disrupts the preparations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzsiqXFxWal6bkuV2QK6zCKjpOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878607'),
  ('74685588074253408', 'An Unfinished Life', 2005, 'Drama', 'Lasse Hallström, Oliver Stapleton', 'Mark Spragg, Virginia Korus Spragg', 'Robert Redford, Jennifer Lopez, Morgan Freeman, Becca Gardner, Josh Lucas, Damian Lewis, Camryn Manheim, Lynda Boyd', 'PG-13', 'Stoic and heartbroken, Einar Gilkyson quietly lives in the rugged Wyoming ranchlands alongside his only trusted friend, Mitch Bradley. One day, the woman he blames for the death of his only son arrives at his door broke, desperate, and with a granddaughter he''s never known. But even as buried anger and accusations resurface, the way is opened for unexpected connection, adventure, and forgiveness.', 'Stoic and heartbroken, Einar Gilkyson quietly lives in the rugged Wyoming ranchlands alongside his only trusted friend, Mitch Bradley. One day, the woman he blames for the death of his only son arrives at his door broke, desperate, and with a granddaughter he''s never known. But even as buried anger and accusations resurface, the way is opened for unexpected connection, adventure, and forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ugLG1yF1l8HWYhmdmHHSC3kJ8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1947'),
  ('846219966506324278', 'An Unfinished Piece for Player Piano', 1977, 'Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, Valentin Bobrovsky', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Alexander Adabashyan', 'Aleksandr Kalyagin, Yelena Solovey, Evgeniya Glushenko, Antonina Shuranova, Yuri Bogatyryov, Oleg Tabakov, Nikolai Pastukhov, Pavel Kadochnikov', null, 'On a summer day in late 19th century Russia, a group of bourgeois friends and acquaintances gather at a dilapidated country estate.', 'On a summer day in late 19th century Russia, a group of bourgeois friends and acquaintances gather at a dilapidated country estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xoTcxLF7DrVw3qPEOZ8GwRb3QR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38837'),
  ('204239165106194561', 'An Unforgettable Summer', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Lucian Pintilie, Călin Ghibu', 'Lucian Pintilie', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Claudiu Bleonţ, Olga Tudorache, George Constantin, Ion Pavlescu, Marcel Iureș, Răzvan Vasilescu, Cornel Scripcaru', null, 'In 1925 Romania, young Marie-Therese Von Debretsy refuses the flirtatious advances of her husband''s commanding officer. As a result, the cosmopolitan family is reassigned to a brutally bleak and dangerous outpost on the Bulgarian/Romanian frontier where both their relationship and humanity are severely tested.', 'In 1925 Romania, young Marie-Therese Von Debretsy refuses the flirtatious advances of her husband''s commanding officer. As a result, the cosmopolitan family is reassigned to a brutally bleak and dangerous outpost on the Bulgarian/Romanian frontier where both their relationship and humanity are severely tested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQeuQzrl1bU4lSz7qklkJEnZTAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81949'),
  ('27526592509250320', 'An Unforgettable Year - Autumn', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Lázaro Ramos, Anita Barbosa, Mariana Moreira', 'Keka Reis, Thamyra Thâmara, Marcelo Saback', 'Gabz, Lucas Leto, IZA, Larissa Luz, Raphael Ghanem, Vittor Fernando, Enrico Cardoso, Nicolas Lee', null, 'An ambitious law student who hates music needs to make a perfect plan to get hired at the office she interns at – until she meets a charming singer who shakes her life. While she''s living her first love, she needs to face her own past and decide what''s more important: do what she loves or learn to love what she does.', 'An ambitious law student who hates music needs to make a perfect plan to get hired at the office she interns at – until she meets a charming singer who shakes her life. While she''s living her first love, she needs to face her own past and decide what''s more important: do what she loves or learn to love what she does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2nhmSE3QnXcA8aijq1iMFmkLkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884535'),
  ('1098696417586569435', 'An Unforgettable Year - Spring', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Garotti, Jamile Marinho, Raquel Zandoná', 'Ana Pacheco, Luisa Parnes, Maíra Oliveira', 'Lívia Silva, Ronald Sotto, Luís Lobianco, Gabriel Contente, Rogério Brito, Giovanna Chaves, Bia Jordão, Juliana Alves', null, 'When she''s about to fail in math – the subject she hates the most, Jasmine has to take booster classes with a cute young tutor, but who breathes numbers in everything he does. Facing family pressure and embarking on a risky love, she''ll need to overcome her fears and limitations to pursue her true dream: be an artist.', 'When she''s about to fail in math – the subject she hates the most, Jasmine has to take booster classes with a cute young tutor, but who breathes numbers in everything he does. Facing family pressure and embarking on a risky love, she''ll need to overcome her fears and limitations to pursue her true dream: be an artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRXkAcGcFIVNpsVe7cdr5YfBPmG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899535'),
  ('1086118726302408469', 'An Unforgettable Year - Summer', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cris D''amato, Kika Cunha, Anita Barbosa', 'Sylvio Gonçalves, Bruno Garotti, Marcelo Saback', 'Lívia Inhudes, Micael Borges, Mariana Rios, Júlia Gomes, Diego Martins, Isaías Silva, André Mattos, Késia Estácio', 'PG-13', 'In order to study fashion in so-desired Paris, a young country girl who hates Carnival travels to Rio de Janeiro to try to get support from the most famous designer in Brazil. Set on sneaking into the sewing team of one of the biggest samba schools, she will discover that Carnival only lasts for a week, but a love story can change her entire life.', 'In order to study fashion in so-desired Paris, a young country girl who hates Carnival travels to Rio de Janeiro to try to get support from the most famous designer in Brazil. Set on sneaking into the sewing team of one of the biggest samba schools, she will discover that Carnival only lasts for a week, but a love story can change her entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNO8smUkyNbL2t6HU6EBnJCSf6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962682'),
  ('552005914162231890', 'An Unforgettable Year - Winter', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Caroline Fioratti, Hélcio Alemão Nagamine, Patricio Acuña', 'Ângela Hirata Fabri, Ricardo Inhan, Marcelo Saback', 'Maitê Padilha, Michel Joelsas, Leticia Spiller, Marcelo Laham, Rita von Hunty, João Manoel, Catarina de Carvalho, Larissa Murai', null, 'Instead of joining the graduation trip with her friends, Mabel is forced to travel with her parents to a ski station in Chile. Only she didn''t expect this freezing retreat could introduce her to a secret group of friends and a potential new love.', 'Instead of joining the graduation trip with her friends, Mabel is forced to travel with her parents to a ski station in Chile. Only she didn''t expect this freezing retreat could introduce her to a secret group of friends and a potential new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/632MOx4ou1ZuRT9YWSg7eKSPWP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884533'),
  ('360494122913560401', 'An Ungentlemanly Act', 1992, 'War, History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stuart Urban, David Mason, Debbi Slater', 'Stuart Urban', 'Ian Richardson, Rosemary Leach, Hugh Ross, Bob Peck, Ian McNeice, James Warrior, Marc Warren, Aidan Gillen', null, 'Based on actual accounts, this film portrays the days and hours before and during the invasion of the Falkland Islands by Argentina, which eventually lead to the Falklands War. As the Argentine forces land on the main island and make their way towards Government House, the handful of British defenders batten down the hatches and prepare to defend Governor Rex Hunt, his family, and their fellow islanders from the invaders.', 'Based on actual accounts, this film portrays the days and hours before and during the invasion of the Falkland Islands by Argentina, which eventually lead to the Falklands War. As the Argentine forces land on the main island and make their way towards Government House, the handful of British defenders batten down the hatches and prepare to defend Governor Rex Hunt, his family, and their fellow islanders from the invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR3cDshkYnyuafrzrV8cVJnBrhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45562'),
  ('106149377273312335', 'An Unmarried Woman', 1978, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Paul Mazursky, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Paul Mazursky', 'Jill Clayburgh, Alan Bates, Michael Murphy, Cliff Gorman, Kelly Bishop, Lisa Lucas, Linda Miller, Patricia Quinn', 'R', 'A wealthy woman from Manhattan''s Upper East Side struggles to deal with her new identity and her sexuality after her husband of 16 years leaves her for a younger woman.', 'A wealthy woman from Manhattan''s Upper East Side struggles to deal with her new identity and her sexuality after her husband of 16 years leaves her for a younger woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJ6BLvNcLhNxvVCGgTynO5BJtQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38731'),
  ('395971607038626590', 'An Unnamed Star', 1978, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Mikhail Kozakov, Georgi Rerberg, Vladimir Ivanov', 'Aleksandr Khmelik', 'Igor Kostolevskiy, Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Mikhail Kozakov, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Grigoriy Lyampe, Mikhail Svetin, Alla Budnitskaya, Aleksandr Pyatkov', null, '"Stars never leave their orbits". The poor astronomy teacher got one more demonstration of this law when he met HER. SHE was "from the another world". SHE was strange and inappropriate in his tiny calm town. Town with slough-like life and citizens who spent all their time gossiping. Once he almost started to believe that the miracle is possible... but "the stars never leave their orbits"', '"Stars never leave their orbits". The poor astronomy teacher got one more demonstration of this law when he met HER. SHE was "from the another world". SHE was strange and inappropriate in his tiny calm town. Town with slough-like life and citizens who spent all their time gossiping. Once he almost started to believe that the miracle is possible... but "the stars never leave their orbits"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvf5iMLA0GJqgeBHqDBYig1C8E3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89674'),
  ('720377947701366067', 'An Unremarkable Christmas', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Juan Camilo Pinzón, Sergio Iván Castaño', null, 'Antonio Sanint, Luis Eduardo Arango, María Cecilia Sánchez, Luisa Fernanda Giraldo, Biassini Segura, Aura Cristina Geithner, Julián Cerati, Lina Tejeiro', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ltEDUajn4rYLixIRgaGHPFlYka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774259'),
  ('239521692726956664', 'An Unstable Marriage', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Brittany Goodwin, Thomas Hennessy, Paul Ruddy', 'Kelly Peters', 'Skye Coyne, Adam Harper, Chad Ridgely, Donald Ome, Sheena Colette', null, 'After marrying the owner of a popular horse stable, Caitlin tries to adjust to life as part of an upper-class horse community but finds herself under suspicion when her new husband suddenly disappears. Inspired by actual events.', 'After marrying the owner of a popular horse stable, Caitlin tries to adjust to life as part of an upper-class horse community but finds herself under suspicion when her new husband suddenly disappears. Inspired by actual events.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd956eaa6af4a3edf3c029373f3393143.jpg', 'plex:movie:an-unstable-marriage'),
  ('212646909060296271', 'An Unsuitable Job for a Woman', 1982, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Waldo Roeg, Scott Wodehouse, Melvin Lind', 'Brian Scobie, Elizabeth McKay, Chris Petit', 'Pippa Guard, Billie Whitelaw, Paul Freeman, Dominic Guard, David Horovitch, Elizabeth Spriggs, Dawn Archibald, Bernadette Shortt', null, 'After finding her boss, a private detective, has committed suicide and has left her his agency, Cordelia Gray is asked to investigate the suicide of the man''s son. During the course of her investigation, Cordelia becomes obsessed with the young man''s memory and his increasingly suspicious death.', 'After finding her boss, a private detective, has committed suicide and has left her his agency, Cordelia Gray is asked to investigate the suicide of the man''s son. During the course of her investigation, Cordelia becomes obsessed with the young man''s memory and his increasingly suspicious death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buOFUQJxKN2iftlWcC0PKZX4MO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263565'),
  ('123570856889014055', 'An Untimely Intrusion', 1902, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A fighting couple gets interrupted by the landlady.', 'A fighting couple gets interrupted by the landlady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/je15lgJb5vnUrSN0rSyHN5adqQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119980'),
  ('777332577578710405', 'An Unusual Affair', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maris Pfeiffer', null, 'Hans-Werner Meyer, Tatjana Blacher, Matthias Walter, August Schmölzer, Bruno Cathomas', null, 'Jochen Wenzel, a young teacher, married with two kids, one day surprisingly falls in love with a young male colleague, Tom Leuthner and they begin an unusual affair (= "Eine aussergewöhnliche Affäre"). While Ina, Jochen''s wife, worries about Jochen''s distanced behavior without having a clue of her husband''s affair, Jochen and Tom seriously fall for each other. Torn between his family and his new love, Jochen has to make a decision. Written by Smoothhoney', 'Jochen Wenzel, a young teacher, married with two kids, one day surprisingly falls in love with a young male colleague, Tom Leuthner and they begin an unusual affair (= "Eine aussergewöhnliche Affäre"). While Ina, Jochen''s wife, worries about Jochen''s distanced behavior without having a clue of her husband''s affair, Jochen and Tom seriously fall for each other. Torn between his family and his new love, Jochen has to make a decision. Written by Smoothhoney', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sffrfXCRN86NQmDsec8cvbiv8Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226572'),
