  ('793742820954473975', 'Anaarkali of Aarah', 2017, 'Drama', 'Arvind Kannabiran, Avinash Das', 'Avinash Das', 'Swara Bhasker, Sanjay Mishra, Pankaj Tripathi, Mayur More, Ishtiyak Khan, Nitin Arora, Brijesh Karanwal, Vijay Kumar', null, 'Hailing from Aarah in Bihar, Anarkali is an item girl, famous for her vocals, suggestive dance moves and innuendo laden lyrics. She enjoys her stardom and revels in the lusty glances. The singer acknowledges that she is no saint and even makes peace with the hatred she evokes among civilised society but what she refuses to tolerate is being exploited in public by an influential politician.', 'Hailing from Aarah in Bihar, Anarkali is an item girl, famous for her vocals, suggestive dance moves and innuendo laden lyrics. She enjoys her stardom and revels in the lusty glances. The singer acknowledges that she is no saint and even makes peace with the hatred she evokes among civilised society but what she refuses to tolerate is being exploited in public by an influential politician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRK1wUXVtiSHNPDRuLPgsQJcteT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449361'),
  ('128914086325270991', 'Anabel', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Roland de Middel, Antonio Trashorras', 'Antonio Trashorras', 'Ana de Armas, Rocío León, Enrique Villén', null, 'Anabel and her two roommates are looking for someone to share the rent. They choose an older gentleman who gain their trust, but soon they discover a strange and disturbing presence.', 'Anabel and her two roommates are looking for someone to share the rent. They choose an older gentleman who gain their trust, but soon they discover a strange and disturbing presence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWjPWr8USnYM8M9twN9C11kI1cB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362579'),
