  ('833465129151071742', 'Anali', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Dinesh Dena, Ramalingam', 'Dinesh Dena', 'Cynthia Lourde, Kabir Duhan Singh, Sakthi Vasu', null, 'Entire Story takes place over a single night. It revolves around Jansi and her 8yr old child, who gets trapped between third world war tensions and dangereous men Lal Chetta, Khan Bhai and Ranga Reddy. These men far more dangerous than wild animals. The Note film thrillingly portraits by how Jansi uses her intelligence to escape and bring everything to an end.', 'Entire Story takes place over a single night. It revolves around Jansi and her 8yr old child, who gets trapped between third world war tensions and dangereous men Lal Chetta, Khan Bhai and Ranga Reddy. These men far more dangerous than wild animals. The Note film thrillingly portraits by how Jansi uses her intelligence to escape and bring everything to an end.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FswU1gHR88apVPthor7RVv8AOa1j.jpg', 'plex:movie:anali-2026'),
  ('525388923384424003', 'Analyze That', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Harold Ramis, Ellen Kuras, Doug Coleman', 'Harold Ramis, Peter Steinfeld, Peter Tolan', 'Robert De Niro, Billy Crystal, Lisa Kudrow, Joe Viterelli, Cathy Moriarty, Joey Diaz, Jerome Le Page, Joseph Bono', 'R', 'The mafia''s Paul Vitti is back in prison and will need some serious counseling when he gets out. Naturally, he returns to his analyst Dr. Ben Sobel for help and finds that Sobel needs some serious help himself as he has inherited the family practice, as well as an excess stock of stress.', 'The mafia''s Paul Vitti is back in prison and will need some serious counseling when he gets out. Naturally, he returns to his analyst Dr. Ben Sobel for help and finds that Sobel needs some serious help himself as he has inherited the family practice, as well as an excess stock of stress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3R6Hno3WFfIkHQg7CeVAEOcHQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9932'),
  ('980749311438806854', 'Analyze This', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Harold Ramis, Stuart Dryburgh, Helen Rella', 'Harold Ramis, Kenneth Lonergan, Peter Tolan', 'Robert De Niro, Billy Crystal, Lisa Kudrow, Chazz Palminteri, Kresh Novakovic, Bart Tangredi, Michael Straka, Joseph Rigano', 'R', 'Countless wiseguy films are spoofed in this film that centers on the neuroses and angst of a powerful Mafia racketeer who suffers from panic attacks. When Paul Vitti needs help dealing with his role in the "family," unlucky shrink Dr. Ben Sobel is given just days to resolve Vitti''s emotional crisis and turn him into a happy, well-adjusted gangster.', 'Countless wiseguy films are spoofed in this film that centers on the neuroses and angst of a powerful Mafia racketeer who suffers from panic attacks. When Paul Vitti needs help dealing with his role in the "family," unlucky shrink Dr. Ben Sobel is given just days to resolve Vitti''s emotional crisis and turn him into a happy, well-adjusted gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqa4TEgkx63WRhqyD8eTwmL7bUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9535'),
  ('1123688331385192084', 'Anamorph', 2007, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Henry Miller, W. Steven Graham, Fred Murphy', 'Tom Phelan, Henry Miller', 'Willem Dafoe, Scott Speedman, Peter Stormare, Clea DuVall, James Rebhorn, Amy Carlson, Yul Vazquez, Don Harvey', 'R', 'A detective must solve the case of a serial killer who enacts anamorphosis, a painting technique that manipulates the laws of perspective, only with human bodies.', 'A detective must solve the case of a serial killer who enacts anamorphosis, a painting technique that manipulates the laws of perspective, only with human bodies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6cR0n2n98NM3LAisX8eWA63SD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14000'),
  ('653917014922202867', 'Anamorphosis', 1993, 'Animation, Documentary, History', 'Timothy Quay, Stephen Quay, Ian Nicholas', null, 'Witold Schejbal', null, 'The Quays'' interest in esoteric illusions finds its perfect realization in this fascinating animated lecture on the art of anamorphosis. This artistic technique, often used in the 16th- and 17th centuries, utilizes a method of visual distortion with which paintings, when viewed from different angles, mischievously revealed hidden symbols.', 'The Quays'' interest in esoteric illusions finds its perfect realization in this fascinating animated lecture on the art of anamorphosis. This artistic technique, often used in the 16th- and 17th centuries, utilizes a method of visual distortion with which paintings, when viewed from different angles, mischievously revealed hidden symbols.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUHlL1Wo4gPJxaYriuwUx9re0v3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59361'),
  ('238529424356156355', 'Anand', 1971, 'Drama', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Jaywant Pathare, Saroj Banerjee', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Bimal Dutta, Gulzar', 'Rajesh Khanna, Amitabh Bachchan, Sumita Sanyal, Ramesh Deo, Seema Deo, Lalita Pawar, Johnny Walker, Dev Kishan', null, 'Dr. Bhaskar Bannerjee struggles with his patients'' suffering and the darkness and poverty he confronts daily. He treats cancer patient Anand who upon learning of his impending death determines to use the time he has left to the absolute fullest.', 'Dr. Bhaskar Bannerjee struggles with his patients'' suffering and the darkness and poverty he confronts daily. He treats cancer patient Anand who upon learning of his impending death determines to use the time he has left to the absolute fullest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgrege8e0yk3SSdHzHfMTvk2ffc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26237'),
  ('950756352403397741', 'Anandabhadram', 2005, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Santosh Sivan, Santosh Sivan', 'Sunil Parameswaran', 'Prithviraj Sukumaran, Manoj K Jayan, Kavya Madhavan, Kalabhavan Mani, Biju Menon, Riya Sen, Cochin Haneefa, Suresh Krishna', null, 'To honour his mother''s final wish, Ananthan returns to his ancestral village from America and attempts to light a lamp at the family temple. However, his quest is thwarted by an evil magician named Digambaran who seeks to harness the temple''s hidden powers.', 'To honour his mother''s final wish, Ananthan returns to his ancestral village from America and attempts to light a lamp at the family temple. However, his quest is thwarted by an evil magician named Digambaran who seeks to harness the temple''s hidden powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7f3ZFCobD9Em3dUMDP2Rk7NB40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194809'),
