  ('1080984502474945614', 'Anantha', 2026, 'Drama', 'Suresh Krissna, Deva', 'Suresh Krissna', 'Jagapati Babu, Suhasini Maniratnam, Y. G. Mahendran', null, 'Through divine grace and miracles, faith transforms lives as a mischievous man finds redemption and a village survives floods, revealing universal love and spiritual truth beyond religious boundaries.', 'Through divine grace and miracles, faith transforms lives as a mischievous man finds redemption and a village survives floods, revealing universal love and spiritual truth beyond religious boundaries.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fy1GAbomStmF8dnvrsYzUGiqBFy4.jpg', 'plex:movie:anantha-2026'),
  ('65358835757221404', 'Anarchist from Colony', 2017, 'History, Drama', 'Lee Joon-ik, Park Sung-ju, Kim Hyo-seong', 'Hwang Sung-goo', 'Lee Je-hoon, Moon Choi, Kim In-woo, Kwon Yul, Min Jin-woong, Kim Soo-jin, Kim Jun-han, Baek Soo-jang', null, 'Based on the life of the Korean anarchist Park Yeol, the film shows his struggle to counter the massacre of Koreans by the government during the 1923 great Kanto earthquake, focusing on his activities as the leader of the anti-Japanese organization Bulryeongsa and his relationship with Japanese comrade Fumiko Kaneko.', 'Based on the life of the Korean anarchist Park Yeol, the film shows his struggle to counter the massacre of Koreans by the government during the 1923 great Kanto earthquake, focusing on his activities as the leader of the anti-Japanese organization Bulryeongsa and his relationship with Japanese comrade Fumiko Kaneko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KXB46zmGd6WAf3T9oQK5j1I6Ce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453992'),
  ('466706924538415292', 'Anarchy Parlor', 2016, 'Horror', 'Kenny Gage, Devon Downs, Edd Lukas', 'Kenny Gage, Devon Downs', 'Robert LaSardo, Jordan James Smith, Sara Fabel, Tiffany DeMarco, Claire Garvey, Anthony Del Negro, Beth Humphreys, Joey Fisher', null, 'Six young college hopefuls vacationing and partying in Lithuania get more than they bargained for when they unwittingly get caught up in a maniacal tattoo artist''s fiendish side business.', 'Six young college hopefuls vacationing and partying in Lithuania get more than they bargained for when they unwittingly get caught up in a maniacal tattoo artist''s fiendish side business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aaehYQWQzCX5Pt7vznnNt2ckzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339342'),
  ('609861129505158975', 'Anarchy TV', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Blank, Ruurd M. Fenenga', 'Philip Craft, Jonathan Blank', 'Jonathan Penner, Jessica Hecht, Matt Winston, Moon Unit Zappa, Dweezil Zappa, Albert Hall, Alan Thicke, Tamayo Otsuki', 'R', 'A group of anarchists use their public-access TV show to satirize the government until a right-wing preacher attempts to shut them down.', 'A group of anarchists use their public-access TV show to satirize the government until a right-wing preacher attempts to shut them down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjnbQ9QGuXiulEG17IVIoA2xfUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95415'),
  ('732372609873186786', 'Anastasia', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anatole Litvak, Jack Hildyard, Gerry O''Hara', 'Arthur Laurents', 'Ingrid Bergman, Yul Brynner, Helen Hayes, Akim Tamiroff, Martita Hunt, Felix Aylmer, Sacha Pitoëff, Ivan Desny', 'NR', 'Russian exiles in Paris plot to collect ten million pounds from the Bank of England by grooming a destitute, suicidal girl to pose as heir to the Russian throne. While Bounin is coaching her, he comes to believe that she is really Anastasia. In the end, the Empress must decide her claim.', 'Russian exiles in Paris plot to collect ten million pounds from the Bank of England by grooming a destitute, suicidal girl to pose as heir to the Russian throne. While Bounin is coaching her, he comes to believe that she is really Anastasia. In the end, the Empress must decide her claim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26wHOXNt4XNn2lYT8i8pWx1JOP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38171'),
  ('656078684343147396', 'Anastasia', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Gary Goldman, Don Bluth, Mary Clarke-Miller', 'Susan Gauthier, Bob Tzudiker, Noni White', 'Meg Ryan, John Cusack, Kelsey Grammer, Christopher Lloyd, Hank Azaria, Bernadette Peters, Kirsten Dunst, Angela Lansbury', 'G', 'Ten years after she was separated from her family, an eighteen-year-old orphan with vague memories of the past sets out to Paris in hopes of reuniting with her grandmother. She is accompanied by two con men, who intend to pass her off as the Grand Duchess Anastasia to the Dowager Empress for a reward.', 'Ten years after she was separated from her family, an eighteen-year-old orphan with vague memories of the past sets out to Paris in hopes of reuniting with her grandmother. She is accompanied by two con men, who intend to pass her off as the Grand Duchess Anastasia to the Dowager Empress for a reward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bppGWGA8zq1sRvTdDJnUzVW9GcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9444'),
  ('322145519389524805', 'Anastasia: Once Upon a Time', 2020, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Blake Harris, Dean Cundey', 'Blake Harris', 'Brandon Routh, Emily Carey, Amiah Miller, Kendall Vertes, Shanna Collins, Jo Koy, Donna Murphy, Claire Crosby', 'PG', 'Anastasia Romanov escapes through a portal when her family is threatened by Vladimir Lenin, and she finds herself in the year 1988, befriended by a young American girl.', 'Anastasia Romanov escapes through a portal when her family is threatened by Vladimir Lenin, and she finds herself in the year 1988, befriended by a young American girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g9R5lpmJ77kRcx4agxc3oIzN1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476389'),
  ('49915633192290068', 'Anatahan', 1953, 'Drama, War', 'Josef von Sternberg, Josef von Sternberg, Kōzō Okazaki', 'Josef von Sternberg', 'Akemi Negishi, Tadashi Suganuma, Kisaburo Sawamura, Shoji Nakayama, Jun Fujikawa, Hiroshi Kondō, Shozo Miyashita, Kikuji Onoe', null, 'From June 1944, twelve Japanese seamen are stranded for seven years on an abandoned and forgotten island called Anatahan.', 'From June 1944, twelve Japanese seamen are stranded for seven years on an abandoned and forgotten island called Anatahan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfut8CVv8VlTH0DnIE2pI0Zlv7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104776'),
  ('646706420045165598', 'Anatar', 2023, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure, Action, Romance', 'Lorenzo Zanoni, Alan Smithee, Daniele Trani', 'Tommaso Arnaldi, Salvatore Scarico', 'Azzurra Rocchi, Raffaele De Vita, Ciro Villano, Walter Lippa, Davide Marotta, Anna D''Auria, Maurizio Siano, Paolo Perinelli', null, 'After causing the collapse of their own planet, the Anatar people of humanoid aliens who evolved from ducks, are searching for a new celestial body to call a nest. During their wanderings in space they land on Pandono, a place where living beings and nature have found their strange balance. Love, war, spaceships and space ducks are the ingredients of this grotesque modern fairy tale about accepting what is different from us.', 'After causing the collapse of their own planet, the Anatar people of humanoid aliens who evolved from ducks, are searching for a new celestial body to call a nest. During their wanderings in space they land on Pandono, a place where living beings and nature have found their strange balance. Love, war, spaceships and space ducks are the ingredients of this grotesque modern fairy tale about accepting what is different from us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYhSFvuBK637CFPsUNsBbF6VYkM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052025'),
  ('1104786771248380599', 'Anatema', 2024, 'Horror', 'Jimina Sabadú, Luis Ángel Pérez, Silvia Alba', 'Jimina Sabadú, Elio Quiroga', 'Leonor Watling, Pablo Derqui, Jaime Ordóñez, Keren Hapuc, Manuel de Blas, Xoán Fórneas, Mariano Llorente, Mauro Brussolo', null, 'Juana is a nun with a strong character marked by a paranormal experience. A mysterious order from the Archbishopric will take her to an old church in old Madrid, built on a network of passageways of unknown origin. There, Juana will discover that in the bowels of the building there is something prior to the legends that are explained about that place. And the Evil that lives there has begun to infect the exterior.', 'Juana is a nun with a strong character marked by a paranormal experience. A mysterious order from the Archbishopric will take her to an old church in old Madrid, built on a network of passageways of unknown origin. There, Juana will discover that in the bowels of the building there is something prior to the legends that are explained about that place. And the Evil that lives there has begun to infect the exterior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4akd1zxzCUdow2gXX1ovbRE3ZoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104390'),
  ('1013912673546137938', 'Anatolian Eagles', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Uğur İçbak, Ömer Vargı', 'Hakan Evrensel', 'Engin Altan Düzyatan, Çağatay Ulusoy, Özge Özpirinçci, Hande Subaşı, Alpay Atalan, Alper Saldıran, Ekin Türkmen, İsmail Filiz', null, 'Onur, Ayşe, Mustafa, Tunç ve Fatih. Onlar, gökyüzüne hakim birer pilot olma hayaliyle yaşayan genç havacılar. Hayalleri yükseklerde fakat hedefe giderken yaşadıkları bin türlü zorluk, aile, sevgili hasreti, dostlukları, havada olmak için yaptıkları fedakarlıklar ve birbirleriyle rekabetleri ne kadar çetin bir yola çıktıklarının da göstergesi olacak. Binbaşı Kemal Tanaçan''ın deneyimi ve desteği sayesinde eğitimden geçen beş genç için Uluslararası Anadolu Kartalı Tatbikatı, hayatlarını tamamen değiştirecek çok büyük bir deneyim olacaktır..', 'Onur, Ayşe, Mustafa, Tunç ve Fatih. Onlar, gökyüzüne hakim birer pilot olma hayaliyle yaşayan genç havacılar. Hayalleri yükseklerde fakat hedefe giderken yaşadıkları bin türlü zorluk, aile, sevgili hasreti, dostlukları, havada olmak için yaptıkları fedakarlıklar ve birbirleriyle rekabetleri ne kadar çetin bir yola çıktıklarının da göstergesi olacak. Binbaşı Kemal Tanaçan''ın deneyimi ve desteği sayesinde eğitimden geçen beş genç için Uluslararası Anadolu Kartalı Tatbikatı, hayatlarını tamamen değiştirecek çok büyük bir deneyim olacaktır..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keovFHBEEJNOoBppsTvP5YvG6mO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77862'),
  ('609828033302454592', 'Anatomia Extinction', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Kensuke Suzuki', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura', 'Kisei Ishizuka, Jun Sasaki, Chikako Tone, Tomoko Haseyama, Ikuko Uemura, Shinji Kida, Kensuke Suzuki, Satoru Ôtani', null, 'A salaryman sees a murder in the subways and is soon pursued by the killer, who wants him to join a group called The Engineers, who have taken it upon themselves to reduce Japan''s overpopulation. Despite not wanting any part of joining, the man begins to mutate, running throughout Japan and fighting his urge to kill.', 'A salaryman sees a murder in the subways and is soon pursued by the killer, who wants him to join a group called The Engineers, who have taken it upon themselves to reduce Japan''s overpopulation. Despite not wanting any part of joining, the man begins to mutate, running throughout Japan and fighting his urge to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPIUP6qzmuwasgKEVPmF4QxgRDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104952'),
  ('603544158245477061', 'Anatomy', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Peter von Haller, Anton Maria Aigner', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Franka Potente, Benno Fürmann, Anna Loos, Sebastian Blomberg, Holger Speckhahn, Traugott Buhre, Oliver Wnuk, Arndt Schwering-Sohnrey', 'R', 'Medical student Paula wins a place at an exclusive Heidelberg medical school. When the body of a young man she met on the train turns up on her dissection table, she begins to investigate the mysterious circumstances surrounding his death.', 'Medical student Paula wins a place at an exclusive Heidelberg medical school. When the body of a young man she met on the train turns up on her dissection table, she begins to investigate the mysterious circumstances surrounding his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZgnRhrOkmjjod5u3umbw4y08kX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1698'),
  ('1050754122762170255', 'Anatomy 2', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Andreas Berger', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Barnaby Metschurat, Herbert Knaup, Heike Makatsch, Roman Knižka, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Franka Potente, Frank Giering, Hanno Koffler', 'R', 'The doctor and soccer player in the leisure time Jo Hauser decides to move to Berlin and be an intern in a famous clinic, expecting to increase his knowledge and expertize, and help his handicap brother Willi Hauser. He joins a secret fraternity of doctors, under the leadership of Prof. Muller-LaRousse, who is researching the use of bionic muscles in human beings without any ethics or respect to the laws. The team is also volunteer to the experiences, and is under investigation of Paula Henning. When Jo gets close to a Filipino nurse, and becomes addicted in the drugs used in experience, he realizes the truth hidden in the methods used by the secret society in the development of science.', 'The doctor and soccer player in the leisure time Jo Hauser decides to move to Berlin and be an intern in a famous clinic, expecting to increase his knowledge and expertize, and help his handicap brother Willi Hauser. He joins a secret fraternity of doctors, under the leadership of Prof. Muller-LaRousse, who is researching the use of bionic muscles in human beings without any ethics or respect to the laws. The team is also volunteer to the experiences, and is under investigation of Paula Henning. When Jo gets close to a Filipino nurse, and becomes addicted in the drugs used in experience, he realizes the truth hidden in the methods used by the secret society in the development of science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT8ouLaEJtLb899m34BYtR5bR5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1699'),
