  ('274754293125077376', 'Ancient Chinese Whorehouse', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ivan Lai Kai-Ming', 'Ng Man-Fai', 'Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Yvonne Yung Hung, Suet-Ngan Ching, Dick Lau Tik-Chi, Shing Fui-On, Tsang Yuk-Kuen, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan', null, 'Madam Five and carpenter Kong work together managing a famous whorehouse. Kong''s apprentice Yat fails to get along with Ching due to a misunderstanding between them. Luckily, the appearance of a murderous rapist helps to resolve the misunderstanding between them. It also unites the group to defend against the sex maniac and to rebuild Madam Five''s business at a new location.', 'Madam Five and carpenter Kong work together managing a famous whorehouse. Kong''s apprentice Yat fails to get along with Ching due to a misunderstanding between them. Luckily, the appearance of a murderous rapist helps to resolve the misunderstanding between them. It also unites the group to defend against the sex maniac and to rebuild Madam Five''s business at a new location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53AdAWdL7pJnWzvfSfDq30MJaFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105812'),
  ('609527191509180282', 'And Agnes Chose to Die', 1976, 'Drama, War', 'Mario Maffei, Vera Pescarolo, Lorenzo Magnolia', 'Nicola Badalucco, Giuliano Montaldo', 'Ingrid Thulin, Stefano Satta Flores, Michele Placido, Aurore Clément, Ninetto Davoli, William Berger, Flavio Bucci, Rosalino Cellamare', null, 'After the Nazis take her husband away, an illiterate old washerwoman joins the Resistance as a bike courier in the Central Italian countryside.', 'After the Nazis take her husband away, an illiterate old washerwoman joins the Resistance as a bike courier in the Central Italian countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXlMVrtKl44kA2xZ5cbBTX3g8ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57341'),
  ('983019559744998692', 'And Along Come Tourists', 2007, 'Drama', 'Yoliswa Gärtig, Robert Thalheim', 'Robert Thalheim', 'Alexander Fehling, Ryszard Ronczewski, Barbara Wysocka, Piotr Rogucki, Lutz Blochberger, Lena Stolze, Rainer Sellien', null, 'Sven arrives in nowadays Auschwitz to do his civil service at the memorial. He encounters unfriendliness, especially by Stanislaw Krzeminski, the 85 year old KZ-survivor, and Krzysztof Lanuszewski, brother of his early love affair Ania. Even his boss Herold, the places manager, does little to help Sven familiarize. But when problems accumulate Sven realises that he already has become involved.', 'Sven arrives in nowadays Auschwitz to do his civil service at the memorial. He encounters unfriendliness, especially by Stanislaw Krzeminski, the 85 year old KZ-survivor, and Krzysztof Lanuszewski, brother of his early love affair Ania. Even his boss Herold, the places manager, does little to help Sven familiarize. But when problems accumulate Sven realises that he already has become involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqPBBkuWcbgC95bR7P5PYHNVlM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3397'),
  ('853415505741112299', 'And Breathe Normally', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ísold Uggadóttir, Ita Zbroniec-Zajt', 'Ísold Uggadóttir', 'Kristín Þóra Haraldsdóttir, Babetida Sadjo, Patrik Nökkvi Pétursson, Þorsteinn Bachmann, Gunnar Jónsson, Sveinn Geirsson, Helga Vala Helgadóttir, Bragi Arnason', null, 'At the edge of Iceland’s Reykjanes peninsula, two women’s lives will intersect – for a brief moment – while trapped in circumstances unforeseen. Between a struggling Icelandic mother and an asylum seeker from Guinea-Bissau, a delicate bond will form as both strategize to get their lives back on track.', 'At the edge of Iceland’s Reykjanes peninsula, two women’s lives will intersect – for a brief moment – while trapped in circumstances unforeseen. Between a struggling Icelandic mother and an asylum seeker from Guinea-Bissau, a delicate bond will form as both strategize to get their lives back on track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYoOX37zNCHWZMg6s0dRpVrkyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489982'),
  ('1003544319161027783', 'And Give My Love to the Swallows', 1972, 'Drama', 'Jaromil Jireš, Miroslav Voštiar, Claudi Niubò', 'Jaromil Jireš, Zora Beráková', 'Magda Vášáryová, Viera Strnisková, Július Vašek, Václav Helšus, Dagmar Bláhová, Hana Pastejříková, Hana Maciuchová, Jana Andresíková', null, 'This film, chronicling the last days of Czech resistance fighter Maruska Kuderikova (played by Magda Vasaryova), is based on her diaries. Though she was tortured and eventually executed by the Nazis, her diaries indicate that she was optimistic for the humanity of her captors and did not by any means hate them. Told with simple dignity, this film makes clear why Maruska became a national hero.', 'This film, chronicling the last days of Czech resistance fighter Maruska Kuderikova (played by Magda Vasaryova), is based on her diaries. Though she was tortured and eventually executed by the Nazis, her diaries indicate that she was optimistic for the humanity of her captors and did not by any means hate them. Told with simple dignity, this film makes clear why Maruska became a national hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDyO4cblACmAr4knleDwfwSxpym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208531'),
  ('613331944045171842', 'And God Created Woman', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Giuliano, Stephen M. Katz, Roger Vadim', 'R.J. Stewart', 'Rebecca De Mornay, Vincent Spano, Frank Langella, Donovan Leitch, Judith Chapman, Jamie McEnnan, Benjamin Mouton, Dave Shelley', 'R', 'In this variation on director Vadim''s own, more acclaimed Et Dieu Créa La Femme (1956, the same title in French), the vamp Robin Shea marries charming carpenter Billy Moran, only to get out of prison, but soon decides to seduce James Tiernan, who runs for state governor.', 'In this variation on director Vadim''s own, more acclaimed Et Dieu Créa La Femme (1956, the same title in French), the vamp Robin Shea marries charming carpenter Billy Moran, only to get out of prison, but soon decides to seduce James Tiernan, who runs for state governor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taznRSey1cI962s1h8RqOmBDOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61651'),
