  ('490924982396284848', 'And Now My Love', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Lelouch, Jean-Marc Pertus, Élie Chouraqui', 'Claude Lelouch, Pierre Uytterhoeven', 'Marthe Keller, André Dussollier, Charles Denner, Carla Gravina, Charles Gérard, Gilbert Bécaud, Daniel Boulanger, André Falcon', 'PG', 'The movie follows the lives of a woman and a man starting from several generations earlier. The story spans a whole century and several continents.', 'The movie follows the lives of a woman and a man starting from several generations earlier. The story spans a whole century and several continents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TbOqP4weWzXz09By3qQ6oWy4K7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139851'),
  ('199203468754543206', 'And now sex', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Clarita Di Giovanni, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Sergio Solli, Ciro Esposito, Lucianna De Falco, Elena Russo, Maurizio Santilli, Antonio Allocca, Gianfranco Agus, Adolfo Margiotta', null, 'Eight episodes vaguely inspired to real events. The "fil rouge" is the relationship between the Italians and sex in the first years of 2000s. From prostitution to virtual sex all the categories are represented in a funny way that anyway tries to investigate this kind of reality.', 'Eight episodes vaguely inspired to real events. The "fil rouge" is the relationship between the Italians and sex in the first years of 2000s. From prostitution to virtual sex all the categories are represented in a funny way that anyway tries to investigate this kind of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhhRPjpNh8XuVhsQxJa0qhMPzik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192507'),
  ('163212717308868502', 'And Now the Screaming Starts!', 1973, 'Horror', 'Roy Ward Baker, Derek Whitehurst, Lindsey C. Vickers', 'Roger Marshall', 'Stephanie Beacham, Peter Cushing, Patrick Magee, Herbert Lom, Ian Ogilvy, Geoffrey Whitehead, Guy Rolfe, Rosalie Crutchley', 'R', 'In the late 18th century, two newlyweds move into the stately mansion of the Fengriffen family. The young bride is victim of terrifying visions and apparitions, threatening her very sanity. A London psychiatrist comes to her help and uncovers the terrible secret that haunts the estate.', 'In the late 18th century, two newlyweds move into the stately mansion of the Fengriffen family. The young bride is victim of terrifying visions and apparitions, threatening her very sanity. A London psychiatrist comes to her help and uncovers the terrible secret that haunts the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7qtRYAL9K1g0FAv3QHEvZ12ork.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42455'),
