  ('265683260116730505', 'And Satan Calls the Turns', 1962, 'Drama', 'Grisha N. Dabat', 'Grisha N. Dabat', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jacques Perrin, Bernadette Lafont, Françoise Brion, Henri-Jacques Huet, Jacques Doniol-Valcroze, Jacques Monod, Jean Alazé', null, 'On a sun-kissed beach, six people linger lazily, each confident of fulfilling his or her desires before the day is out. A wealthy heiress, Emmanuelle, has designs on a handsome adolescent, Ivan, but his interests lie elsewhere. Having gratified Emmanuelle’s womanly needs, Ivan immediately sets out to make his next conquest, the mistress of a well-known writer...', 'On a sun-kissed beach, six people linger lazily, each confident of fulfilling his or her desires before the day is out. A wealthy heiress, Emmanuelle, has designs on a handsome adolescent, Ivan, but his interests lie elsewhere. Having gratified Emmanuelle’s womanly needs, Ivan immediately sets out to make his next conquest, the mistress of a well-known writer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpD2xRoCqeeri9PqAWFgSOSx173.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142932'),
  ('816552759952625883', 'And So It Goes', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Pitt, Murphy Occhino, Mary Knauf', 'Mark Andrus', 'Michael Douglas, Diane Keaton, Sterling Jerins, Paloma Guzmán, Frances Sternhagen, Frankie Valli, Andy Karl, Meryl Jones Williams', 'PG-13', 'Nobody likes self-centered realtor Oren Little, and he prefers it that way. He''s deliberately mean to anyone who crosses his path and wants nothing more than to sell one final house and retire. His life turns upside-down when his estranged son drops off a granddaughter he never knew existed. Suddenly left in charge of her and with no idea how to take care of a child, he pawns the girl off on his neighbor, Leah -- but he eventually learns how to open his heart.', 'Nobody likes self-centered realtor Oren Little, and he prefers it that way. He''s deliberately mean to anyone who crosses his path and wants nothing more than to sell one final house and retire. His life turns upside-down when his estranged son drops off a granddaughter he never knew existed. Suddenly left in charge of her and with no idea how to take care of a child, he pawns the girl off on his neighbor, Leah -- but he eventually learns how to open his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJoWtA8OAIqavlb5mbx3EzvxFUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253235'),
  ('533723577542272508', 'And So It Is', 1966, 'Drama', 'Jorge Sanjinés, Jesús Urzagasti, Hugo Roncal', 'Jorge Sanjinés', 'Néstor Peredo, Benedicta Huanca, Vicente Verneros Salinas, Elsa Antequera, Benedicta Mendoza, Néstor Cárdenas', null, 'While her husband is on his way to the market, a peasant woman is raped and murdered. Her widower carefully plans his revenge.', 'While her husband is on his way to the market, a peasant woman is raped and murdered. Her widower carefully plans his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjgfOnLUnxH3RdsUNFc71DHUNbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232866'),
  ('155614725232158716', 'And So We Put Goldfish in the Pool.', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ryo Nagata, Makoto Nagahisa, Hiroaki Takeda', 'Makoto Nagahisa', 'Hina Yukawa, Rina Matsuyama, Marin Nishimoto, Reina Kikuchi, Takashi Yamanaka, Daisuke Kuroda, Ryô Fujiwara, Michiyo Ishimoto', null, 'One summer day, 400 goldfish were found in the swimming pool of a secondary school. This is a story about the four 15-year-old girls who put them there.', 'One summer day, 400 goldfish were found in the swimming pool of a secondary school. This is a story about the four 15-year-old girls who put them there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTonbW1CTt5Q5OW6i9AsoRJsKBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454758'),
  ('165577121358168302', 'And Soon the Darkness', 1970, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Robert Fuest, Ian Wilson, Ken Baker', 'Terry Nation, Brian Clemens', 'Pamela Franklin, Michele Dotrice, Sandor Elès, John Nettleton, Clare Kelly, Hana Maria Pravda, John Franklyn, Claude Bertrand', 'PG', 'Two young English women go on a cycling tour of the French countryside. When one of them goes missing, the other begins to search for her. But who can she trust?', 'Two young English women go on a cycling tour of the French countryside. When one of them goes missing, the other begins to search for her. But who can she trust?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6p6JmnIACFI5FVy9jUNmEe5dOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51992'),
  ('1024089151669880184', 'And Soon the Darkness', 2010, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Marcos Efron, Gabriel Beristain', 'Jennifer Derwingson, Marcos Efron', 'Amber Heard, Odette Annable, Karl Urban, César Vianco, Michel Noher, Adriana Barraza, Gia Mantegna, Luis Sabatini', 'R', 'When two American girls on a bike trip in a remote part of Argentina split up and one of them goes missing, the other must find her before her worst fears are realized.', 'When two American girls on a bike trip in a remote part of Argentina split up and one of them goes missing, the other must find her before her worst fears are realized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8k7BV9YRKTNXdj7wKiRGncNfwAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33107'),
  ('98326750400154647', 'And Starring Pancho Villa as Himself', 2003, 'Drama, History, War, Western, TV Movie', 'Bruce Beresford, Peter James', 'Larry Gelbart', 'Antonio Banderas, Eion Bailey, Alan Arkin, Jim Broadbent, Matt Day, Michael McKean, Kyle Chandler, Alexa Davalos', null, 'In 1914, the Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa invites studios to shoot his actual battles against Porfírio Diaz army to raise funds for financing guns and ammunition. The Mutual Film Corporation, through producer D.W. Griffith, interests for the proposition and sends the filmmaker Frank Thayer to negotiate a contract with Pancho Villa himself.', 'In 1914, the Mexican revolutionary Pancho Villa invites studios to shoot his actual battles against Porfírio Diaz army to raise funds for financing guns and ammunition. The Mutual Film Corporation, through producer D.W. Griffith, interests for the proposition and sends the filmmaker Frank Thayer to negotiate a contract with Pancho Villa himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPXm56o3tEQdk0QTR6sZzmyw4f5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24241'),
  ('813527878372543662', 'And the Band Played On', 1993, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Paul Elliott, Albert M. Shapiro', null, 'Matthew Modine, Alan Alda, Patrick Bauchau, Nathalie Baye, Christian Clemenson, David Clennon, Phil Collins, Bud Cort', null, 'The story of the discovery of the AIDS epidemic and the political infighting of the scientific community hampering the early fight with it.', 'The story of the discovery of the AIDS epidemic and the political infighting of the scientific community hampering the early fight with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4fyZ6SZaZuerfZWaIp0niFW7Yar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2887'),
  ('468096979839832459', 'And the Birds Rained Down', 2019, 'Drama', 'Louise Archambault, Mathieu Laverdière, Karel Quinn', 'Louise Archambault', 'Andrée Lachapelle, Gilbert Sicotte, Rémy Girard, Ève Landry, Éric Robidoux, Louise Portal, Patricia Nolin, Marie-Ginette Guay', null, 'A photographer sets off toward a mysterious forest to find Boychuk, witness and victim of the Great Fire that swept through Northern Ontario at the turn of the 20th century. But before she arrives, she learns that Boychuck has just perished. Survivors of the long-ago fire, Tom and Charlie, two elderly men who have chosen to live out their last days in the woods, are introduced to Marie Desneige, whose 60 year institutionalization has only fueled her passion for life. Meanwhile, the photographer is discovering that Boychuck had been a painter, whose life’s work had been entirely inspired by the Great Fire. The story immerses us in a historical drama while captivating us with the strange lives of these men of the forest. Three men who, in choosing freedom above all else, made a deal with death.', 'A photographer sets off toward a mysterious forest to find Boychuk, witness and victim of the Great Fire that swept through Northern Ontario at the turn of the 20th century. But before she arrives, she learns that Boychuck has just perished. Survivors of the long-ago fire, Tom and Charlie, two elderly men who have chosen to live out their last days in the woods, are introduced to Marie Desneige, whose 60 year institutionalization has only fueled her passion for life. Meanwhile, the photographer is discovering that Boychuck had been a painter, whose life’s work had been entirely inspired by the Great Fire. The story immerses us in a historical drama while captivating us with the strange lives of these men of the forest. Three men who, in choosing freedom above all else, made a deal with death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nym6GBRGK8pfy4f6cPSnW9dR9LT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592783'),
  ('333442793875353784', 'And the Little Prince Said', 1992, 'Drama', 'Christine Pascal', 'Robert Boner, Christine Pascal', 'Richard Berry, Anémone, Lucie Phan, Marie Kleiber, Mista Préchac, Claude Muret', null, 'A divorced Swiss couple must come to terms with their daughter''s life-threatening illness. He, a scientist, snatches his daughter from the examining table at the clinic and takes her away as if to kidnap her from the disease. His ex-wife, an actress, takes to bed weeping uncontrollably when she learns of her daughter''s tumor. The girl''s step-mother, an Asian-American physician, is clinical in her response, outlining a treatment regimen of surgery, chemotherapy, and radiation. It is left to the girl herself, ten-year-old Violette, to be calm, reassuring, philosophical, and even metaphysical as she faces death.', 'A divorced Swiss couple must come to terms with their daughter''s life-threatening illness. He, a scientist, snatches his daughter from the examining table at the clinic and takes her away as if to kidnap her from the disease. His ex-wife, an actress, takes to bed weeping uncontrollably when she learns of her daughter''s tumor. The girl''s step-mother, an Asian-American physician, is clinical in her response, outlining a treatment regimen of surgery, chemotherapy, and radiation. It is left to the girl herself, ten-year-old Violette, to be calm, reassuring, philosophical, and even metaphysical as she faces death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXyFWTpsVHD8fgTFzSQDs5juUJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195274'),
  ('1025111070355621282', 'And the Oscar Goes To...', 2014, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Rob Epstein, Jeffrey Friedman, Nancy Schreiber', 'Jeffrey Friedman, Rob Epstein, Sharon Wood', 'Annette Bening, Ellen Burstyn, Jane Fonda, Jennifer Hudson, Liza Minnelli, Phil Alden Robinson, Michael Moore, Ben Burtt', 'NR', 'The story of the gold-plated statuette that became the film industry''s most coveted prize, AND THE OSCAR GOES TO... traces the history of the Academy itself, which began in 1927 when Louis B. Mayer, then head of MGM, led other prominent members of the industry in forming this professional honorary organization. Two years later the Academy began bestowing awards, which were nicknamed "Oscar," and quickly came to represent the pinnacle of cinematic achievement.', 'The story of the gold-plated statuette that became the film industry''s most coveted prize, AND THE OSCAR GOES TO... traces the history of the Academy itself, which began in 1927 when Louis B. Mayer, then head of MGM, led other prominent members of the industry in forming this professional honorary organization. Two years later the Academy began bestowing awards, which were nicknamed "Oscar," and quickly came to represent the pinnacle of cinematic achievement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRL4xf3Z6kgLUyb5vbGKErlzP4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253639'),
  ('296282219537509533', 'And the Party Goes On', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ferdinand Verhaeghe, Robert Guédiguian, Benjamin Evrard', 'Serge Valletti, Robert Guédiguian', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Lola Naymark, Robinson Stévenin, Gérard Meylan, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Alicia Da Luz Gomes, Pauline Caupenne', null, 'In Marseille, Rosa, 60, dedicated her life to family and politics with the same sense of duty. Everyone considers her unwavering, until the day she falls in love with Henri. For the first time, Rosa is afraid to commit. Between the pressure of his family, politics and a desire to indulge in her feelings, the conflict is difficult to sustain.', 'In Marseille, Rosa, 60, dedicated her life to family and politics with the same sense of duty. Everyone considers her unwavering, until the day she falls in love with Henri. For the first time, Rosa is afraid to commit. Between the pressure of his family, politics and a desire to indulge in her feelings, the conflict is difficult to sustain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iillo9GZNKb8YwvLoDo7o4NLe98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960042'),
  ('1028696850637890425', 'And the Ship Sails On', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Giuseppe Rotunno, Federico Fellini, Gianni Arduini', 'Federico Fellini, Tonino Guerra', 'Freddie Jones, Barbara Jefford, Victor Poletti, Peter Cellier, Elisa Mainardi, Norma West, Paolo Paoloni, Sarah-Jane Varley', 'PG', 'In 1914, a cruise ship sets sail from Naples to spread the ashes of beloved opera singer Edmea Tetua near Erimo, the isle of her birth. During the voyage, the eclectic array of passengers discovers a group of Serbian refugees aboard the vessel. Peace and camaraderie abound until the ship is descended upon by an Austrian flagship. The Serbians are forced to board it, but naturally they resist, igniting a skirmish that ends in destruction.', 'In 1914, a cruise ship sets sail from Naples to spread the ashes of beloved opera singer Edmea Tetua near Erimo, the isle of her birth. During the voyage, the eclectic array of passengers discovers a group of Serbian refugees aboard the vessel. Peace and camaraderie abound until the ship is descended upon by an Austrian flagship. The Serbians are forced to board it, but naturally they resist, igniting a skirmish that ends in destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAJEaXgZ5sO0tBaB9By260JZUQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5622'),
  ('773824935490375488', 'And the Spring Comes', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Gu Changwei', 'Qiang Li', 'Dong Xuan, Jiang Wenli, Jiao Gang, Li Guangjie, Wang Yajie, Zhang Yao, Zhang Jingchu', null, 'In a grimy provincial industrial city, a talented but unattractive schoolteacher dreams of an operatic career.', 'In a grimy provincial industrial city, a talented but unattractive schoolteacher dreams of an operatic career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntenGCXvlYZecvBEIOmzZrfEDuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72219'),
  ('509625277768191534', 'And the Woman Shall Fear Her Husband', 1965, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yorgos Tzavellas, Takis Vougiouklakis, Nestoras Pavelas', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Giorgos Konstantinou, Maro Kodou, Despo Diamantidou, Stavros Xenidis, Katerina Gogou, Dimitris Kalivokas, Kostas Doukas, Lili Papayanni', null, 'When a man decides to marry the woman he''s been living with, she stops being the silent patient person she was and claims to be the boss in the house. Her behaviour changes so much after the marriage that the husband gets so irritated as to ask for a divorce even a few hours later..', 'When a man decides to marry the woman he''s been living with, she stops being the silent patient person she was and claims to be the boss in the house. Her behaviour changes so much after the marriage that the husband gets so irritated as to ask for a divorce even a few hours later..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD5Q5ZbshCtw9rgFMUmEhw4LHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163791'),
  ('56798230500943749', 'And Their Children After Them', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sophie Deutsch, Noémie Pinel, Pascale Jeanniard', 'Zoran Boukherma, Ludovic Boukherma', 'Paul Kircher, Angelina Woreth, Sayyid El Alami, Gilles Lellouche, Ludivine Sagnier, Anouk Villemin, Louis Memmi, Louise Lehry', null, 'In eastern France, two teenage cousins have the summer of their lives when they paddle a purloined canoe to the far shore of a lake.', 'In eastern France, two teenage cousins have the summer of their lives when they paddle a purloined canoe to the far shore of a lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/memf03JOexe9scX0Nxj16uXcQZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103678'),
  ('662251990997368204', 'And Then', 1985, 'Drama', 'Yoshimitsu Morita, Yonezō Maeda, Kazuo Yabe', 'Tomomi Tsutsui', 'Yūsaku Matsuda, Miwako Fujitani, Kaoru Kobayashi, Morio Kazama, Chishū Ryū, Katsuo Nakamura, Mitsuko Kusabue, Katsuhiko Kobayashi', null, 'Daisuke is supposed to be out looking for a respectable job and equally respectable wife. He is 30 years old and devotes his attention to music and literature; his family is wealthy and can support his interests. When his friend Hiraoka returns with his wife Michiyo, problems arise.', 'Daisuke is supposed to be out looking for a respectable job and equally respectable wife. He is 30 years old and devotes his attention to music and literature; his family is wealthy and can support his interests. When his friend Hiraoka returns with his wife Michiyo, problems arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qih3JeneA3QooN0sDa26aGBuPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118785'),
  ('877378606476931680', 'And Then Came Lola', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Megan Siler, Ellen Seidler, Jennifer Derbin', 'Megan Siler, Ellen Seidler', 'Ashleigh Sumner, Jill Bennett, Cathy DeBuono, Jessica Graham, Angelyna Martinez-Boyd, Candy Tolentino, Linda Ignazi', 'PG', 'A talented, but distracted photographer, Lola, on the verge of success in both love and work, could lose it all if she doesn''t make it to a crucial meeting on time. But, as usual, Lola is late. With her job and girlfriend on the line, she has three chances to make it right. In a desperate race through the streets and back rooms of San Francisco, time grows short-will Lola make it? Will she come at all? With a pop sensibility that mixes live action, animation and still photography, And Then Came Lola explores love''s age old question in a fresh new way, "If you try, try again, will you finally get it right?" (Written by M. Siler and E. Seidler)', 'A talented, but distracted photographer, Lola, on the verge of success in both love and work, could lose it all if she doesn''t make it to a crucial meeting on time. But, as usual, Lola is late. With her job and girlfriend on the line, she has three chances to make it right. In a desperate race through the streets and back rooms of San Francisco, time grows short-will Lola make it? Will she come at all? With a pop sensibility that mixes live action, animation and still photography, And Then Came Lola explores love''s age old question in a fresh new way, "If you try, try again, will you finally get it right?" (Written by M. Siler and E. Seidler)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hug5nbikVlOC4feNhOq19Vl1vuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38645'),
  ('430510960428628721', 'And Then the Bear', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', 'Agnès Patron, Morgane Le Péchon, Cerise Lopez', 'Agnès Patron, Johanna Krawczyk', null, null, 'When a boy’s close bond with his mother is imperiled one night by the arrival of a mysterious stranger, matters of nature and nurture collide.', 'When a boy’s close bond with his mother is imperiled one night by the arrival of a mysterious stranger, matters of nature and nurture collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUz0IFq1P4L5d2djxXMSdHsZwzH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596289'),
  ('393446505908899150', 'And Then There Was Light', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Sigalon Sagna, Saly Badji, Binta Cissé, Marie-Christine Dieme, Fatou Seydi, Alpha Sane, Abdou Sane, Souleimane Sagna', null, 'Events in an idyllic African village are shown in detail in the period just before logging trucks come in and cut down the forest around the villagers, forcing them to move into the wretched shantytowns that surround major cities throughout the undeveloped world. Despite the familiar premise, this surprisingly unsentimental film by Georgian director Otar Ioselliani has several things going for it, beginning with the cinematography and including the natural and unaffected (non-professional) performances of the villagers.', 'Events in an idyllic African village are shown in detail in the period just before logging trucks come in and cut down the forest around the villagers, forcing them to move into the wretched shantytowns that surround major cities throughout the undeveloped world. Despite the familiar premise, this surprisingly unsentimental film by Georgian director Otar Ioselliani has several things going for it, beginning with the cinematography and including the natural and unaffected (non-professional) performances of the villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4r1fj4sRWxGitGyAwd5WYxFeddy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203986'),
  ('65237910180127335', 'And Then There Were None', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Lucien N. Andriot, René Clair, Sam Nelson', 'Dudley Nichols', 'Barry Fitzgerald, Walter Huston, Louis Hayward, Roland Young, June Duprez, Mischa Auer, C. Aubrey Smith, Judith Anderson', 'NR', 'Ten strangers are summoned to a remote island and while they are waiting for the mysterious host to appear, a recording levels serious accusations at each of the guests. Soon they start being murdered, one by one. As the survivors try to keep their wits, they reach a disturbing conclusion: one of them must be the killer.', 'Ten strangers are summoned to a remote island and while they are waiting for the mysterious host to appear, a recording levels serious accusations at each of the guests. Soon they start being murdered, one by one. As the survivors try to keep their wits, they reach a disturbing conclusion: one of them must be the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maV1jQZ58NZIjwRbdtmRcaW3fZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4886'),
  ('756004858889896840', 'And Then There Were None', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Peter Collinson, Fernando Arribas, José López Rodero', 'Erich Kröhnke, Enrique Llovet, Harry Alan Towers', 'Oliver Reed, Elke Sommer, Richard Attenborough, Stéphane Audran, Gert Fröbe, Herbert Lom, Maria Rohm, Adolfo Celi', 'PG', 'Ten people are invited to a hotel in the Iranian desert, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?', 'Ten people are invited to a hotel in the Iranian desert, only to find that an unseen person is killing them one by one. Could one of them be the killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JoBZj30v380XBiRrYwIhOoGJ1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4883'),
  ('133071955320266932', 'And Then We Danced', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giorgi Samsiani, Nutsa Zangurashvili, Levan Akin', 'Levan Akin', 'Levan Gelbakhiani, Bachi Valishvili, Ana Javakishvili, Giorgi Tsereteli, Tamar Bukhnikashvili, Kakha Gogidze, Nino Gabisonia, Aleko Begalishvili', null, 'Merab, a devoted dancer, has been training for years with his partner Mary for a spot in the National Georgian Ensemble. The arrival of another male dancer, Irakli, sparks both an intense rivalry and romantic desire that may cause Merab to risk his future in dance as well as his relationships.', 'Merab, a devoted dancer, has been training for years with his partner Mary for a spot in the National Georgian Ensemble. The arrival of another male dancer, Irakli, sparks both an intense rivalry and romantic desire that may cause Merab to risk his future in dance as well as his relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zP8Gg0wLJuqXGlrrD3mEu0M4kMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597088'),
  ('993986567941107633', 'And Then We''ll See', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Calvaruso, Donato Sileo, Gianluca Barone', 'Fabrizio Sansone, Federico Sansone, Fabrizio Testini', 'Fabrizio Sansone, Federico Sansone, Donatella Finocchiaro, Paola Minaccioni, Ester Pantano, Paride Benassai, Domenico Centamore, Maurizio Bologna', null, 'Three houses, three boys, the same goal: to win the competition for a position as an employee in the legal office of the city. Federico, a law graduate, but only to please his father counsellor, hopes for his recommendation; Fabrizio, lawyer on paper but not practicing in life, tries to overcome the umpteenth public test and Luca, who since he was born has always had the road open. Only for one of them will the dream of a lifetime come true, until things take an unexpected turn.', 'Three houses, three boys, the same goal: to win the competition for a position as an employee in the legal office of the city. Federico, a law graduate, but only to please his father counsellor, hopes for his recommendation; Fabrizio, lawyer on paper but not practicing in life, tries to overcome the umpteenth public test and Luca, who since he was born has always had the road open. Only for one of them will the dream of a lifetime come true, until things take an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqAP7bUd5M60dJxQ7hkxMRuvGlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1256208'),
  ('987181658985707327', 'And They Call It Summer', 2012, 'Drama', 'Cesare Accetta, Paolo Franchi, Vincenzo Carpineta', 'Heidrun Schleef, Rinaldo Rocco, Paolo Franchi', 'Jean-Marc Barr, Isabella Ferrari, Filippo Nigro, Eva Riccobono, Luca Argentero, Romina Carrisi, Anna Rita Del Piano, Christian Burruano', 'NR', 'Dino and Anna are a couple in their forties. Their relationship is hardly conventional: in fact, it is unconsummated. Dino gets out of it, gratifying himself with prostitutes and swingers. He reaches his nadir when he looks up Anna’s old boyfriends to ask about their sexual relations with her, and even begs them to take her back, as a way to end their relationship. Anna can’t find a way out herself; she can’t bring herself to end this one-of-a-kind, tormented love affair. In the end, Dino’s angst is what makes her feel loved, feel unique. No solution seems to be waiting in the wings.', 'Dino and Anna are a couple in their forties. Their relationship is hardly conventional: in fact, it is unconsummated. Dino gets out of it, gratifying himself with prostitutes and swingers. He reaches his nadir when he looks up Anna’s old boyfriends to ask about their sexual relations with her, and even begs them to take her back, as a way to end their relationship. Anna can’t find a way out herself; she can’t bring herself to end this one-of-a-kind, tormented love affair. In the end, Dino’s angst is what makes her feel loved, feel unique. No solution seems to be waiting in the wings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5kbhhdZScw08HpXjB44WdRo1M5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180859'),
  ('449253263143365253', 'And They Say I Am the Crazy One', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pablo Baião, Julia Rezende', 'Gustavo Lipsztein', 'Débora Falabella, Yara de Novaes, Gustavo Vaz, Cristina Pereira, Cássio Pandolph, Duda Batista, Beatriz Oblasser, Rômulo Arantes Neto', null, 'Young, intense and authentic, Dani just wants a normal life. However, since she was a child, she has been misaligned with her world.', 'Young, intense and authentic, Dani just wants a normal life. However, since she was a child, she has been misaligned with her world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iASQXlZqZfERdwTnBxIRpfgKrsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637881'),
  ('85909656114680349', 'And Tomorrow the Entire World', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Julia von Heinz, Daniela Knapp', 'John Quester, Julia von Heinz', 'Mala Emde, Noah Saavedra, Tonio Schneider, Luisa-Céline Gaffron, Andreas Lust, Nadine Sauter, Hussein Eliraqui, Victoria Trauttmansdorff', 'NR', 'Luisa, a 20-year-old law student, joins a cell of the Antifa group when she and her friends Alfa and Lenor get to know about an upcoming attack planned by a local neo-Nazi gang. As they try to find out more, the three youngsters delve deeper into the scene linked to right-wing movements and their political connections, to the point where they will understand how much they are willing to go further, in order to defend their own beliefs.', 'Luisa, a 20-year-old law student, joins a cell of the Antifa group when she and her friends Alfa and Lenor get to know about an upcoming attack planned by a local neo-Nazi gang. As they try to find out more, the three youngsters delve deeper into the scene linked to right-wing movements and their political connections, to the point where they will understand how much they are willing to go further, in order to defend their own beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZkRbEvrKDNHo0ttkss1MShdHjP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728113'),
  ('796171781858506402', 'And Tomorrow You Will Be Dead', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Steiner, Filip Zumbrunn, Nihar Palwe', 'Urs Bühler', 'Morgane Ferru, Sven Schelker, Ingo Ospelt, Karin Pfammatter, Suly Röthlisberger, Arda Görkem', null, 'In 2011 the young married Swiss couple Daniela Widmer and David Och got kidnapped while being on a long trip along the old Silk Road in Pakistan. They were hand over to the Taliban and were held as hostages for 8 months under the most precarious conditions.', 'In 2011 the young married Swiss couple Daniela Widmer and David Och got kidnapped while being on a long trip along the old Silk Road in Pakistan. They were hand over to the Taliban and were held as hostages for 8 months under the most precarious conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIgBQkGaWj8eANdbiy8zwdaqPgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846964'),
  ('730441889790326291', 'And What if It Works!', 1978, 'Animation', 'Ivan Ufimtsev', null, 'Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Vasiliy Livanov, Mikhail Kozakov, Vsevolod Larionov, Boris Vladimirov', null, 'Parrot sets forth for a nest. But he foots. Appears he is afraid to fly, because he never tried.', 'Parrot sets forth for a nest. But he foots. Appears he is afraid to fly, because he never tried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oLaCeRbtbNL9VEXpXMSOeZTdtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492487'),
  ('788388062919092915', 'And When Did You Last See Your Father?', 2007, 'Drama', 'James Chasey, Ben Howarth, Samantha Smith McGrady', 'David Nicholls', 'Jim Broadbent, Colin Firth, Juliet Stevenson, Gina McKee, Sarah Lancashire, Elaine Cassidy, Claire Skinner, Matthew Beard', null, 'The story of a son''s conflicting memories of his dying father.', 'The story of a son''s conflicting memories of his dying father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWzhqUMGva7sKENr4L6M1RC7BlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45791'),
  ('1111473499725518433', 'And While We Were Here', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kat Coiro, Doug Chamberlain', 'Kat Coiro', 'Kate Bosworth, Iddo Goldberg, Jamie Blackley, Claire Bloom', 'R', 'Trapped in a loveless marriage, a troubled writer experiences a sexual awakening when she meets a carefee American in Italy.', 'Trapped in a loveless marriage, a troubled writer experiences a sexual awakening when she meets a carefee American in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wQtx8AKTMIJZ6pf53PDMeNezgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139997'),
  ('670439122155143600', 'And Yet We Were All Blind', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Beatrice Pollet, Georges Lechaptois, Louis Barge', 'Beatrice Pollet', 'Maud Wyler, Géraldine Nakache, Grégoire Colin, Roman Kolinka, Fanny Cottençon, Pascale Vignal, Pascal Demolon, Ophélia Kolb', null, 'Who has never heard of pregnancy denial? This condition, often caused by miscellaneous circumstances, escapes our understanding and even science. How can the mind of a pregnant woman hide a child growing in her body?', 'Who has never heard of pregnancy denial? This condition, often caused by miscellaneous circumstances, escapes our understanding and even science. How can the mind of a pregnant woman hide a child growing in her body?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4s674lAMP4sKiODkaOWO5znm0nr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964890'),
  ('296461142747934566', 'And You Thought Your Parents Were Weird!', 1991, 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Tony Cookson', 'Tony Cookson', 'Marcia Strassman, Joshua John Miller, Edan Gross, John Quade, Sam Behrens, Alan Thicke, Susan Gibney, Gustav Vintas', 'PG', 'Two boys follow in their late fathers foot steps by inventing weird and wonderful gadgets. Trouble lies ahead when after a halloween party the spirit of their father ends up in the latest invention, a robot.', 'Two boys follow in their late fathers foot steps by inventing weird and wonderful gadgets. Trouble lies ahead when after a halloween party the spirit of their father ends up in the latest invention, a robot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJovp121PMc514gnrtLVj7JwOuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77664'),
  ('1067647701711629389', 'And Your Bird Can Sing', 2018, 'Drama', 'Takashi Matsuo, Sho Miyake, Hidetoshi Shinomiya', 'Sho Miyake', 'Tasuku Emoto, Shizuka Ishibashi, Shota Sometani, Tomomitsu Adachi, Ai Yamamoto, Takaya Shibata, Makiko Watanabe, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'With a contagious sense of abandon, three young adults'' lives become intimately entangled over the course of a long summer in Hakodate, Hokkaido.', 'With a contagious sense of abandon, three young adults'' lives become intimately entangled over the course of a long summer in Hakodate, Hokkaido.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfGfVLvXwe0a5W519dvTcISq82Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576404'),
  ('276190069391063651', 'Andaaz', 2003, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Raj Kanwar', 'Robin Bhatt, Shyam Goel', 'Akshay Kumar, Lara Dutta, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Rajeev Verma, Pankaj Dheer, Gajendra Chouhan, Vivek Shauq, Vishwajeet Pradhan', null, 'Young Raj Malhotra lives with his elder brother, Rohit; his sister-in-law Kiran, and a niece. After an accident fractures his leg, he is unable to walk for some time. Due to psychological reasons, he cannot walk even after the fracture heals. When the Malhotras move to Dehra Dun, Raj befriends young Kajal, as both share a common passion for airplanes. Kajal encourages Raj to walk, and succeeds. Years later the two continue to be fast friends, and everyone expects them to marry soon. Then Raj is recruited by the Indian Air Force and goes for training for a year and a half. After his training gets over, he rushes to Kajal to propose to her, only to find out that she has given her heart to a multimillionaire, Karan Singhania (Verma), who owns several airplanes and choppers. Raj congratulates Kajal and Karan, but does not reveal his true feelings.', 'Young Raj Malhotra lives with his elder brother, Rohit; his sister-in-law Kiran, and a niece. After an accident fractures his leg, he is unable to walk for some time. Due to psychological reasons, he cannot walk even after the fracture heals. When the Malhotras move to Dehra Dun, Raj befriends young Kajal, as both share a common passion for airplanes. Kajal encourages Raj to walk, and succeeds. Years later the two continue to be fast friends, and everyone expects them to marry soon. Then Raj is recruited by the Indian Air Force and goes for training for a year and a half. After his training gets over, he rushes to Kajal to propose to her, only to find out that she has given her heart to a multimillionaire, Karan Singhania (Verma), who owns several airplanes and choppers. Raj congratulates Kajal and Karan, but does not reveal his true feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLUQ9NLnn13rujYqbmdoNvv2dmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54072'),
  ('164571726640686593', 'Andaleeb El Dokki', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Wael Ehsan, Ehab Mohamed Ali', null, 'Mohamed Henedi, Amr Abdel Gelil, Lotfy Labib, Alaa Morsy, Dawood Hussein, Heba Nour, Thuraya Ibrahim, Mohamed El Sadaany', null, 'A poor guy want to be famous singer but he is a failure one when his mother dies he knows from her that he has a millionaire twins brother.', 'A poor guy want to be famous singer but he is a failure one when his mother dies he knows from her that he has a millionaire twins brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5tlX0LXqtD3PFLYXKDRV2dVCcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514133'),
  ('342602008838175634', 'Andaz Apna Apna', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Ishwar Bidri', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Aamir Khan, Salman Khan, Raveena Tandon, Karisma Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Shakti Kapoor, Javed Khan, Mehmood', null, 'Two slackers competing for the affections of an heiress inadvertently become her protectors from an evil criminal.', 'Two slackers competing for the affections of an heiress inadvertently become her protectors from an evil criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0GV2V3yif2DbsMCSBrivvSHUWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58128'),
  ('218797347576603354', 'Ander', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roberto Castón, Kike López', 'Roberto Castón', 'Josean Bengoetxea, Christian Esquivel, Leire Ucha, Pilar Rodríguez, Mamen Rivera, Pako Revueltas, Eriz Alberdi, Pedro Otaegi', null, 'A love story between a Basque farmer and a Peruvian immigrant.', 'A love story between a Basque farmer and a Peruvian immigrant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riPkoB2650oNY7g1IrFBdcN2vXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82795'),
  ('358371395705111431', 'Anderson Silva: Like Water', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Pablo Croce', 'Ed Soares, Lyoto Machida', 'Anderson Silva, José Aldo, Junior dos Santos', 'PG', 'Anderson Silva is the deadliest man on the planet - The longest-reigning UFC Champion, and the most feared fighter in mixed martial arts. Like Water offers a unique perspective of the living legend as he trains with fellow fighters Lyoto "The Dragon" Machida, Junior Dos Santos, and Antonio "Minotauro" Nogueira, in preparation for his career defining title defense against challenger, and arch villain Chael Sonnen. A man of few words, Anderson Silva walks the fine line between cockiness and confidence. A philosopher in spirit, and dedicated family man, Silva''s personality contradicts that of Sonnen''s, who uses trash talk and intimidation to get under his opponents'' skin. Balancing family and fighting; respect for the sport, and rage for his opponent; Silva''s mind and body will be put to the test, as first-time filmmaker Pablo Croce peels back the layers of an ultimate fighter to reveal the heart of a champion.', 'Anderson Silva is the deadliest man on the planet - The longest-reigning UFC Champion, and the most feared fighter in mixed martial arts. Like Water offers a unique perspective of the living legend as he trains with fellow fighters Lyoto "The Dragon" Machida, Junior Dos Santos, and Antonio "Minotauro" Nogueira, in preparation for his career defining title defense against challenger, and arch villain Chael Sonnen. A man of few words, Anderson Silva walks the fine line between cockiness and confidence. A philosopher in spirit, and dedicated family man, Silva''s personality contradicts that of Sonnen''s, who uses trash talk and intimidation to get under his opponents'' skin. Balancing family and fighting; respect for the sport, and rage for his opponent; Silva''s mind and body will be put to the test, as first-time filmmaker Pablo Croce peels back the layers of an ultimate fighter to reveal the heart of a champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wn5S1nVaoEeGHo3UNwtuV9nySz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92117'),
  ('1080175969060085126', 'Andersonville', 1996, 'War, Drama, TV Movie, History', 'John Frankenheimer, Ric Waite', 'David W. Rintels', 'Jarrod Emick, Frederic Forrest, Ted Marcoux, Carmen Argenziano, Frederick Coffin, Cliff DeYoung, William H. Macy, William Sanderson', 'NR', 'This lengthy docudrama records the harrowing conditions at the Confederacy''s most notorious prisoner-of-war camp. The drama unfolds through the eyes of a company of Union soldiers captured at the Battle of Cold Harbor, VA, in June 1864, and shipped to the camp in southern Georgia. A private, Josiah Day, and his sergeant try to hold their company together in the face of squalid living conditions, inhumane punishments, and a gang of predatory fellow prisoners called the Raiders.', 'This lengthy docudrama records the harrowing conditions at the Confederacy''s most notorious prisoner-of-war camp. The drama unfolds through the eyes of a company of Union soldiers captured at the Battle of Cold Harbor, VA, in June 1864, and shipped to the camp in southern Georgia. A private, Josiah Day, and his sergeant try to hold their company together in the face of squalid living conditions, inhumane punishments, and a gang of predatory fellow prisoners called the Raiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fk2oAP5M1yx31dJMfsL7DbouxBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21038'),
  ('70613849703913068', 'Anderst schön', 2015, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Rodja Kükenthal, Bartosz Werner', 'Wolfgang Stauch', 'Charly Hübner, Christina Große, Steffi Kühnert, Emilie Neumeister, Renate Krößner, Hermann Beyer, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Christoph Jungmann', null, 'Roger has his own clear world. He loves his apartment. Roger works as a janitor in a house about to be demolished. Leftover GDR supporters, failed geniuses, artistic neo-Nazis live there.', 'Roger has his own clear world. He loves his apartment. Roger works as a janitor in a house about to be demolished. Leftover GDR supporters, failed geniuses, artistic neo-Nazis live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHnBD6J9Rar1jlLKmpuKqeBgwzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355444'),
  ('241332856707720302', 'Andha Naal', 1954, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'S. Balachander, S. Maruti Rao', 'Javar Seetharaman, S. Balachander', 'Sivaji Ganesan, Pandari Bai, Javar Seetharaman, P. D. Sambandam, T. K. Balachandran, Sooryakala, S. Menaka', null, 'Rajan, a radio engineer, is found murdered in Madras during the tense World War II era, amid fears of a Japanese air raid on the city. CID officer Sivanandham investigates the case as each suspect—Rajan''s wife, lover, relatives, and neighbors—narrates a different version of events, revealing hidden motives and secrets that lead to the truth.', 'Rajan, a radio engineer, is found murdered in Madras during the tense World War II era, amid fears of a Japanese air raid on the city. CID officer Sivanandham investigates the case as each suspect—Rajan''s wife, lover, relatives, and neighbors—narrates a different version of events, revealing hidden motives and secrets that lead to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udRWICwrJZVyQqXDSbrC47fbZ88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261793'),
  ('831762261386828106', 'Andhaa Kaanoon', 1983, 'Action, Drama', 'Rama Rao Tatineni', null, 'Rajinikanth, Hema Malini, Reena Roy, Amitabh Bachchan, Pran Sikand, Danny Denzongpa, Prem Chopra, Madan Puri', null, 'When his parents are killed by three men, Amar, Akbar and Anthony, Vijay teams up with a forest officer who was framed in a murder case to avenge their deaths.', 'When his parents are killed by three men, Amar, Akbar and Anthony, Vijay teams up with a forest officer who was framed in a murder case to avenge their deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4toRI99N5nRlFla2l6BulYrnwQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196846'),
  ('950338556096477910', 'Andhadhun', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Comedy', 'Sriram Raghavan, K.U. Mohanan, Rajeev Ravi', 'Sriram Raghavan, Hemanth M. Rao', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Tabu, Radhika Apte, Manav Vij, Zakir Hussain, Anil Dhawan, Ashwini Kalsekar, Rashmi Agdekar', 'R', 'A series of mysterious events changes the life of a blind pianist who now must report a crime that was actually never witnessed by him.', 'A series of mysterious events changes the life of a blind pianist who now must report a crime that was actually never witnessed by him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy3K6hNvwE05siGgiLJcEiwgpdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534780'),
