  ('290050637032187881', 'Andre the Giant', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jason Hehir', 'Vince McMahon', 'André Roussimoff, Hulk Hogan, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Vince McMahon, Ric Flair, Gene Okerlund, Billy Crystal, Rob Reiner', 'PG', 'An ambitious and wide-ranging documentary exploring Andre’s upbringing in France, his celebrated career in WWE, and his forays in the entertainment world.', 'An ambitious and wide-ranging documentary exploring Andre’s upbringing in France, his celebrated career in WWE, and his forays in the entertainment world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4t2g7NbHGu0c51jlQ2qlOZEhvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446663'),
  ('1049101668640072485', 'Andrea', 2005, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Rogert Bencosme', null, 'Hensy Pichardo, Any Ferreiras, Elvira Grullón, Anthony Ferreiras', null, 'A young girl named Andrea unleashes a spirit after removing a cross on a sacred holy ground cemetery. The spirit starts terrorizing Andrea and her family. Andrea''s family, witch doctors, and spiritual healers battle the spirit in attempts to return to a normal life.', 'A young girl named Andrea unleashes a spirit after removing a cross on a sacred holy ground cemetery. The spirit starts terrorizing Andrea and her family. Andrea''s family, witch doctors, and spiritual healers battle the spirit in attempts to return to a normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BklQItpPQ6o6c1f7sMPFufnUDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316710'),
  ('515357751065475723', 'Andrea Gets a Divorce', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Josef Hader, Carsten Thiele, Hanuš Polak jr.', 'Josef Hader, Florian Kloibhofer', 'Birgit Minichmayr, Josef Hader, Thomas Schubert, Robert Stadlober, Branko Samarovski, Thomas Stipsits, Marlene Hauser, Maria Hofstätter', null, 'Rural policewoman Andrea wants to end her marriage and become a detective inspector in the city. After a birthday party, her drunken soon-to-be ex-husband runs out in front of her car. In a state of shock, Andrea commits a hit-and-run.', 'Rural policewoman Andrea wants to end her marriage and become a detective inspector in the city. After a birthday party, her drunken soon-to-be ex-husband runs out in front of her car. In a state of shock, Andrea commits a hit-and-run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUiRJH7CRGSnNK7uM0LtoAjz3GM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900235'),
  ('1148366333214704918', 'Andrea''s Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Manuel Martín Cuenca, Iria Moreno, Eva Díaz', 'Lola Mayo, Manuel Martín Cuenca', 'Lupe Mateo Barredo, Fidel Sierra, Cayetano Rodríguez Anglada, Agustín Domínguez, Irka Lugo, Jesús Ortiz, Inés Amueva, Jose M. Verdulla Otero', null, 'Andrea is a 15-year-old girl living in Cádiz with her mother and little brothers. Despite being a teenager, she leads a very busy life, attending high school, picking up her brothers Tomás and Fidel, as well as helping her working mother at home. Andrea has almost no time to meet her friends or do anything else. Her life is missing something, and she’s determined not to stop until she finds it.', 'Andrea is a 15-year-old girl living in Cádiz with her mother and little brothers. Despite being a teenager, she leads a very busy life, attending high school, picking up her brothers Tomás and Fidel, as well as helping her working mother at home. Andrea has almost no time to meet her friends or do anything else. Her life is missing something, and she’s determined not to stop until she finds it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Yt3hmD6bROe87FoSzBx4p1HjO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053995'),
  ('424564137906823745', 'Andrei Tarkovsky: A Poet in the Cinema', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Donatella Baglivo', 'Donatella Baglivo', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Donatella Baglivo', null, 'An extensive interview with legendary director Andrei Tarkovsky conducted by Donatello Baglivo.', 'An extensive interview with legendary director Andrei Tarkovsky conducted by Donatello Baglivo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uLWz0kkP5xR6iMFi4BNMWivwbc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128417'),
  ('1061089397282559425', 'Andrés Iniesta: The Unexpected Hero', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Oriol Bosch', 'Pep Bras', 'Andrés Iniesta, Sergio Ramos, Pep Guardiola, Anna Ortiz, Lionel Messi, Fernando Torres, Luis Enrique, Luis Suárez', null, 'This is the story of a normal person who does extraordinary things. Someone who pursues and achieves triumphs through taking care of the small details, because these are, after all, the ones that make him a different soccer player.', 'This is the story of a normal person who does extraordinary things. Someone who pursues and achieves triumphs through taking care of the small details, because these are, after all, the ones that make him a different soccer player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xPMEWPTp3VkBBYGnp8rlPZP110.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678314'),
  ('632010819899368469', 'Andrew Schulz: Infamous', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Mark Gagnon', 'Andrew Schulz', 'Andrew Schulz', 'R', 'Andrew Schulz delivers his latest comedy special INFAMOUS, a daring, raw performance filmed during his 10 month sold-out'' "Infamous Tour" at The Paramount in Austin, TX. For Schulz nothing is off limits. There''s only one rule at his shows - everyone gets these jokes.', 'Andrew Schulz delivers his latest comedy special INFAMOUS, a daring, raw performance filmed during his 10 month sold-out'' "Infamous Tour" at The Paramount in Austin, TX. For Schulz nothing is off limits. There''s only one rule at his shows - everyone gets these jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAaSnjYMrqKxyi4N0P0F1W2NW9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999283'),
  ('404125724592313229', 'Andrew Schulz: LIFE', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller', null, 'Andrew Schulz', null, 'In this razor-sharp yet heartfelt special, Andrew Schulz unpacks the wildest moment of his life — becoming a father.', 'In this razor-sharp yet heartfelt special, Andrew Schulz unpacks the wildest moment of his life — becoming a father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yA2LhLNIW5tUGyLtaMuLg9NvvBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1435760'),
  ('974197501479202498', 'Andriesh', 1954, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Yakov Bazelyan, Sergei Parajanov, Suren Shakhbazyan', 'Grigoriy Koltunov, S. Lyalin', 'Giuli Chokhonelidze, Konstantin Russu, Nodar Shashigoglu, K. Stirbu, Eugeniu Ureche, Domnika Dariyenko, Trifan Gruzin, Lyudmila Sokolova', null, 'The evil wizard Black Whirlwind steals the herd of a shepherd boy named Andriesh along with his faithful dog Lupar. Andriesh sets off to rescue them. On the way, he receives a magical flute as a gift, which helps him find his way to the wizard''s castle — and comes to the aid of Black Whirlwind''s numerous victims, who have long suffered from the tyrant''s misdeeds. Based on a Moldovan fairy tale by Emilian Bukov.', 'The evil wizard Black Whirlwind steals the herd of a shepherd boy named Andriesh along with his faithful dog Lupar. Andriesh sets off to rescue them. On the way, he receives a magical flute as a gift, which helps him find his way to the wizard''s castle — and comes to the aid of Black Whirlwind''s numerous victims, who have long suffered from the tyrant''s misdeeds. Based on a Moldovan fairy tale by Emilian Bukov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2CzTryLhaXUyh5VvymrHSkBgjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121276'),
  ('910347698516494689', 'Andrine and Kjell', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kåre Bergstrøm', 'Kåre Bergstrøm', 'Inger Marie Andersen, Toralv Maurstad, Liv Strømsted, Betzy Holter, Sigurd Magnussøn, Ola Isene, Ingeborg Steffens, Ottar Wicklund', null, 'Andrine and Kjell are both 17, and attends a private high school. Many things disturb their way to the spring exams, and fall in love. The come from different backgrounds, but gets common problems when she rents a room at Kjells parents.', 'Andrine and Kjell are both 17, and attends a private high school. Many things disturb their way to the spring exams, and fall in love. The come from different backgrounds, but gets common problems when she rents a room at Kjells parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fd9memmHnVgx4Bl7hzji4SZ2xn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147790'),
  ('636453651637640099', 'Androcles and the Lion', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Chester Erskine, Nicholas Ray, Gregg Peters', null, 'Victor Mature, Jean Simmons, Alan Young, Robert Newton, Maurice Evans, Elsa Lanchester, Reginald Gardiner, Gene Lockhart', 'NR', 'George Bernard Shaw’s breezy, delightful dramatization of this classic fable—about a Christian slave who pulls a thorn from a lion’s paw and is spared from death in the Colosseum as a result of his kind act—was written as a meditation on modern Christian values. Pascal’s final Shaw production is played broadly, with comic character actor Alan Young as the titular naïf. He’s ably supported by Jean Simmons, Victor Mature, Robert Newton, and Elsa Lanchester.', 'George Bernard Shaw’s breezy, delightful dramatization of this classic fable—about a Christian slave who pulls a thorn from a lion’s paw and is spared from death in the Colosseum as a result of his kind act—was written as a meditation on modern Christian values. Pascal’s final Shaw production is played broadly, with comic character actor Alan Young as the titular naïf. He’s ably supported by Jean Simmons, Victor Mature, Robert Newton, and Elsa Lanchester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16XZFR47rhHcyh8Jh4FYpmQ7dYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48646'),
  ('411831585920211398', 'Android', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Aaron Lipstadt, Tim Suhrstedt', 'James Reigle, Don Keith Opper', 'Klaus Kinski, Brie Howard, Norbert Weisser, Crofton Hardester, Kendra Kirchner, Don Keith Opper, Darrell Larson, Rachel Talalay', 'PG', 'Eccentric scientist Dr. Daniel and his shy assistant Max lead a quiet life on their space station, carrying out illegal research on androids, until they receive an unwelcome visit from three fugitives one of whom is female. Both Dr. Daniel and Max show an interest in her, but one of the other visitors has more sinister intentions.', 'Eccentric scientist Dr. Daniel and his shy assistant Max lead a quiet life on their space station, carrying out illegal research on androids, until they receive an unwelcome visit from three fugitives one of whom is female. Both Dr. Daniel and Max show an interest in her, but one of the other visitors has more sinister intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2exixpei6yaOBrnKgYun1fybsoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38849'),
  ('149498815112517161', 'Android Apocalypse', 2006, 'Science Fiction', 'Paul Ziller, Mark Dobrescu, Dwain Dupley', 'Karl Schiffman', 'Joey Lawrence, Scott Bairstow, Anne Bedian, Chris Irvine, Shannon Jardine, Amy Matysio, Terrance Leigh, Wendy Anderson', 'PG-13', 'Machines have taken over, but left humans thinking that they are still the ones in charge. The androids need humans because of the human brain fluid; without it the android brains can''t work. Until the mad scientist finds out how to make this brain fluid artificially that is.', 'Machines have taken over, but left humans thinking that they are still the ones in charge. The androids need humans because of the human brain fluid; without it the android brains can''t work. Until the mad scientist finds out how to make this brain fluid artificially that is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6DkAZAcDgoJQbKlkC4ZNgrdh9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17940'),
  ('765887187832355727', 'Android Cop', 2014, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Stuart Brereton', 'Mark Atkins', 'Michael Jai White, Charles S. Dutton, Kadeem Hardison, Randy Wayne, Larissa Vereza, Kaiwi Lyman, Jay Gillespie, Morgan Benoit', 'NR', 'In the year 2045, a Los Angeles Police Department detective and his new android partner enter the Zone, a forbidden section of the city plagued with an unknown disease. There, they discover the source of the illness and attempt to stop it using the android''s advanced technology and weaponry.', 'In the year 2045, a Los Angeles Police Department detective and his new android partner enter the Zone, a forbidden section of the city plagued with an unknown disease. There, they discover the source of the illness and attempt to stop it using the android''s advanced technology and weaponry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pStgVcVSMNDykydPzMTuAiXAb50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249021'),
  ('626543848549722729', 'Android Re-Enactment', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Darryl Shaw, Kevin Davidson', 'Darryl Shaw', 'Jeff Sinasac, Adam Buller, Sarah Silverthorne, Todd Thomas Dark, William Poulin, Melissa Cline, Delina Porter, Dean Tedesco', null, 'Ermus Daglek, retired Empathtek engineer, commandeers a defunct factory where he creates androids based on persons from his past and recreates a dinner party where he lost the love of his life - until they malfunction and escape.', 'Ermus Daglek, retired Empathtek engineer, commandeers a defunct factory where he creates androids based on persons from his past and recreates a dinner party where he lost the love of his life - until they malfunction and escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nIjfoaIeWGICbKiNk67Eq7oSxZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663414'),
  ('599432107476122120', 'Android Uprising', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Andrew Bellware', 'Steven J. Niles', 'Kate Britton, Julia Rae Maldonado, Jared van Heel', null, 'After a devastating battle against an army of drones leaves Sergeant Barbara Slade paralyzed, her only chance for survival is to be placed inside an artificial, android body. However, once inside a cybernetic unit, Slade’s identity is mistaken, leading her to a cell of antigovernment activists and to a mind-bending plan that threatens to destroy everything she has made sacrifices to protect.', 'After a devastating battle against an army of drones leaves Sergeant Barbara Slade paralyzed, her only chance for survival is to be placed inside an artificial, android body. However, once inside a cybernetic unit, Slade’s identity is mistaken, leading her to a cell of antigovernment activists and to a mind-bending plan that threatens to destroy everything she has made sacrifices to protect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muAHk3CxJBkx0LnLHJR4M4pJ4Ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749139'),
  ('401710075812085765', 'Androids Dream', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Ion de Sosa, Ion de Sosa', 'Chema García Ibarra, Ion de Sosa, Jorge Gil Munarriz', 'Manolo Marín, Moisés Richart, Marta Bassols, Coque Sánchez, Margot Sánchez, Óscar de la Huerga, César Velasco, Begoña Alarcón', null, 'In 2052, a man wanders through a semi-constructed high rise, assassinating people without warning.', 'In 2052, a man wanders through a semi-constructed high rise, assassinating people without warning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLFqPjjqXQkHawF1HJnBYrhx3FQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299269'),
  ('429921117469858538', 'Andromeda Nebula', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Romance', 'Nikolay Zhuravlyov, Evgeniy Sherstobitov, Natan Trakhtenberg', 'Vladimir Dmitrievskiy, Evgeniy Sherstobitov', 'Sergey Stolyarov, Vija Artmane, Nikolai Kryukov, Lyudmila Chursina, Marina Yurasova, Oleksandr Hai, Aleksandr Goloborodko, Gennadiy Yukhtin', null, 'Humans on spaceship named "Tantra" are exploring the unknown part of the Universe. The spaceship gets trapped by the mysterious Iron Star. The Iron Star''s powerful force of gravity is to hold the spaceship for 20 years. The humans are facing a very tough survival challenge... Based on famous novel by Ivan Efremov.', 'Humans on spaceship named "Tantra" are exploring the unknown part of the Universe. The spaceship gets trapped by the mysterious Iron Star. The Iron Star''s powerful force of gravity is to hold the spaceship for 20 years. The humans are facing a very tough survival challenge... Based on famous novel by Ivan Efremov.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HGhgqtfOcthal6y8yjCMHR0wv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42655'),
  ('507791999290042157', 'Andromeda Stories', 1982, 'Animation, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Masamitsu Sasaki', 'Masaki Tsuji', 'Mami Koyama, Toru Furuya, Toshiko Fujita, Chiyoko Kawashima, Hidekatsu Shibata, Kaneto Shiozawa, Kazuko Sugiyama, Keiichi Noda', null, 'In the Andromeda galaxy there''s a planet of a highly developed human civilisation. The gentle Prince Itaka and another kingdom''s beautiful Princess Lilia are about to enter a love-marriage and take over the throne, when they discover a strange object on the nightsky. Later it lands on the planet, and an alien, mechanic civilization invades King Itaka''s peaceful country making nearly everybody their slave. On a fateful night Queen Lilia gives birth to twins, and to avoid misfortune, the nanny Tarama takes one of the babies away, and entrusts it to the gladiator Balga. They still don''t know, that the children were born with strong powers, and hold the key to the fight against the enemy that''s searching to destroy every human civilisation on the planet... (from myanimelist)', 'In the Andromeda galaxy there''s a planet of a highly developed human civilisation. The gentle Prince Itaka and another kingdom''s beautiful Princess Lilia are about to enter a love-marriage and take over the throne, when they discover a strange object on the nightsky. Later it lands on the planet, and an alien, mechanic civilization invades King Itaka''s peaceful country making nearly everybody their slave. On a fateful night Queen Lilia gives birth to twins, and to avoid misfortune, the nanny Tarama takes one of the babies away, and entrusts it to the gladiator Balga. They still don''t know, that the children were born with strong powers, and hold the key to the fight against the enemy that''s searching to destroy every human civilisation on the planet... (from myanimelist)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhhTRfnqu17aFPYBHYLagUDVGGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178011'),
  ('208152221351452921', 'Andromedia', 1998, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Takashi Miike, Bunmei Katô, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Itaru Era, Masaru Nakamura', 'Hiroko Shimabukuro, Eriko Imai, Takako Uehara, Hitoe Arakaki, Kenji Harada, Ryo Karato, Christopher Doyle, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'After his daughter Mai is killed in an auto accident, a genius programmer recreates her in the form of a computer program called AI. His jealous brother-in-law, wanting to get his hands on the technology for profit, sends his client to steal it and Mai’s father is killed in the process. Learning of her capture, Mai’s old friends race to free AI from her captors so that she won’t fall into the corporate clutches that threaten to erase her soul.', 'After his daughter Mai is killed in an auto accident, a genius programmer recreates her in the form of a computer program called AI. His jealous brother-in-law, wanting to get his hands on the technology for profit, sends his client to steal it and Mai’s father is killed in the process. Learning of her capture, Mai’s old friends race to free AI from her captors so that she won’t fall into the corporate clutches that threaten to erase her soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SYambGzoDwR0fkPu6TKjAUTz8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76806'),
  ('402755880883664824', 'Andromina: The Pleasure Planet', 1999, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Lester Wisbrod, Darren Moloney', 'Louise Monclair', 'Shyra Deland, Christian Boeving, Mike Roman, Flower Edwards, Samantha Phillips, Darby Daniels, RayVeness, Eric Stratton', 'R', 'Three adventurous space pilots voyage to the all-female planet Andromina, looking forward to the most famous pleasure planet in the galaxy. When they arrive they find that all the women have disappeared, and it''s up to them to figure out where the fun has gone.', 'Three adventurous space pilots voyage to the all-female planet Andromina, looking forward to the most famous pleasure planet in the galaxy. When they arrive they find that all the women have disappeared, and it''s up to them to figure out where the fun has gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qujAorhWjAuO2nQvMO5uZ5RMm2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223461'),
  ('497363695753928273', 'Andron', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Francesco Cinquemani, Gherardo Gossi', 'Francesco Cinquemani', 'Alec Baldwin, Michelle Ryan, Danny Glover, Gale Harold, Leo Howard, Jon Kortajarena, Margareth Madè, Skin', 'R', 'A group of people are plunged into a dark, claustrophobic maze, where they must fight to survive, as the outside world watches.', 'A group of people are plunged into a dark, claustrophobic maze, where they must fight to survive, as the outside world watches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVyHjAwCVYcoCQQHyc1zQH9DSoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395883'),
