  ('298648887964430269', 'Andy Hardy Comes Home', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Ridgeway Callow, Harold E. Wellman, William W. Spencer', 'Edward Everett Hutshing, Robert Morris Donley', 'Mickey Rooney, Patricia Breslin, Fay Holden, Cecilia Parker, Sara Haden, Joey Forman, Jerry Colonna, Vaughn Taylor', 'NR', 'Andy Hardy, now a grown man with a wife and children, returns to his hometown on a business trip and finds himself getting mixed up in local politics.', 'Andy Hardy, now a grown man with a wife and children, returns to his hometown on a business trip and finds himself getting mixed up in local politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO9suErVQ7bglHdonbXprBzgIKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155752'),
  ('165800816264594219', 'Andy Hardy Gets Spring Fever', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'W.S. Van Dyke, Stan Rogers, Lester White', 'Kay Van Riper', 'Lewis Stone, Mickey Rooney, Cecilia Parker, Fay Holden, Ann Rutherford, Sara Haden, Helen Gilbert, Terry Kilburn', 'NR', 'Young Andy develops a crush on his drama teacher. When his play is chosen as the school''s annual production, Andy seizes the opportunity to spend as much time as possible with his pretty teacher. Meanwhile, Judge Hardy has his own problems when he gets conned into forming a phony aluminum corporation.', 'Young Andy develops a crush on his drama teacher. When his play is chosen as the school''s annual production, Andy seizes the opportunity to spend as much time as possible with his pretty teacher. Meanwhile, Judge Hardy has his own problems when he gets conned into forming a phony aluminum corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyakaVz7k8i35sNMIMOwtgDXfPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43826'),
  ('596067304940077398', 'Andy Hardy Meets Debutante', 1940, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'George B. Seitz, Douglas Shearer, Gabriel Scognamillo', 'Annalee Whitmore, Tom Seller', 'Lewis Stone, Mickey Rooney, Cecilia Parker, Fay Holden, Judy Garland, Ann Rutherford, Diana Lewis, George P. Breakston', 'NR', 'Judge Hardy takes his family to New York City, where Andy quickly falls in love with a socialite. He finds the high society life too expensive, and eventually decides that he liked it better back home.', 'Judge Hardy takes his family to New York City, where Andy quickly falls in love with a socialite. He finds the high society life too expensive, and eventually decides that he liked it better back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uI4URBcIYzJr3fsDparKP9Cb0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43808'),
  ('572011522976806757', 'Andy Hardy''s Double Life', 1942, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Douglas Shearer, George J. Folsey, John J. Mescall', 'Agnes Christine Johnston', 'Lewis Stone, Mickey Rooney, Cecilia Parker, Fay Holden, Ann Rutherford, Sara Haden, Esther Williams, William Lundigan', 'NR', 'Andy is about to head off to college but he''s got a few things to take care of before leaving. For starters, he must try and sell his junk car for $20 to pay for a bill and he must convince his father not to go with him to college. Worst of all is that Polly wants to make up but her best friend decides to give Andy a test.', 'Andy is about to head off to college but he''s got a few things to take care of before leaving. For starters, he must try and sell his junk car for $20 to pay for a bill and he must convince his father not to go with him to college. Worst of all is that Polly wants to make up but her best friend decides to give Andy a test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOH94qeVdXFRrH75Nf7PSBvjCUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43167'),
  ('329772924566442549', 'Ane Is Missing', 2020, 'Drama', 'David Pérez Sañudo', 'David Pérez Sañudo, Marina Parés', 'Patricia López Arnaiz, Mikel Losada, Jone Laspiur, Luis Callejo, Nagore Aranburu, Fernando Albizu, Gorka Aguinagalde, David Blanka', null, 'Lide works the night shift for the construction company in charge of a new high-speed train network, a project that has attracted protests and violent attacks. One morning she wakes up to discover that her teenage daughter, Ane, is nowhere to be found.', 'Lide works the night shift for the construction company in charge of a new high-speed train network, a project that has attracted protests and violent attacks. One morning she wakes up to discover that her teenage daughter, Ane, is nowhere to be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LYxSzkN3JJcCmlXH6O83NExm7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736203'),
  ('264878595223221917', 'Anek', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ewan Mulligan, Vikhyaat Sareen, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Yash Keswani, Sima Agarwal, Anubhav Sinha', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Andrea Kevichusa, Manoj Pahwa, Kumud Mishra, J. D. Chakravarthi, Loitongbam Dorendra, Mepham Otsal, Jatin Goswami', null, 'Amid the turmoil in northeast India, an undercover agent tasked with peace negotiations crosses paths with a tenacious boxer fighting for her dreams.', 'Amid the turmoil in northeast India, an undercover agent tasked with peace negotiations crosses paths with a tenacious boxer fighting for her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7DOaApwC0CO5EEV7Knqju3rLFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888268'),
  ('1097327073227609263', 'Anelka: Misunderstood', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Frank Nataf', null, 'Nicolas Anelka, Thierry Henry, Omar Sy, Arsène Wenger, Didier Drogba, Emmanuel Petit, Patrick Vieira, Patrice Evra', null, 'Bad boy or football genius? Famed French footballer Nicolas Anelka''s controversial legacy is examined in an unflinching documentary.', 'Bad boy or football genius? Famed French footballer Nicolas Anelka''s controversial legacy is examined in an unflinching documentary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5a9RuQfEVaBW2hSjIILDAokMMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726649'),
  ('828432606453049952', 'Anemic Cinema', 1926, 'Drama', 'Marcel Duchamp, Man Ray', null, null, null, 'A spiral design spins. It''s replaced by a spinning disk. These two continue in perfect alternation until the end: a spiral design, a disk. Each disk is labelled and can be read as it rotates. The messages, in French, feature puns and whimsical rhymes and alliteration. The final message comments on the spiral motif itself.', 'A spiral design spins. It''s replaced by a spinning disk. These two continue in perfect alternation until the end: a spiral design, a disk. Each disk is labelled and can be read as it rotates. The messages, in French, feature puns and whimsical rhymes and alliteration. The final message comments on the spiral motif itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnmJljxFSnradmwAwarIqsod2jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58094'),
  ('215124328780873343', 'Anemone', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ronan Day-Lewis, Ben Fordesman, Stephen Carney', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Ronan Day-Lewis', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Sean Bean, Samantha Morton, Samuel Bottomley, Safia Oakley-Green, Lewis Ian Bray, Paul Butterworth, Karl Cam', 'R', 'Middle-aged Jem sets out from his suburban home on a journey into the woods, where he reconnects with his estranged hermit brother Ray. Bonded by a mysterious, complicated past, the men share a fraught, if occasionally tender relationship—one that was forever altered by shattering events decades earlier.', 'Middle-aged Jem sets out from his suburban home on a journey into the woods, where he reconnects with his estranged hermit brother Ray. Bonded by a mysterious, complicated past, the men share a fraught, if occasionally tender relationship—one that was forever altered by shattering events decades earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dubKbJTRTJmji0VUEo5pVoZ92ra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1364608'),
