  ('1047410359483044747', 'Angel', 1982, 'Drama, Music', 'Neil Jordan, Chris Menges', 'Neil Jordan', 'Veronica Quilligan, Stephen Rea, Alan Devlin, Peter Caffrey, Honor Heffernan, Lise-Ann McLaughlin, Ian McElhinney, Derek Lord', 'R', 'Saxophonist Danny witnesses the murder of his band manager and a deaf-mute girl after a gig. Questioned by the police, he remembers only the orthopedic shoes of the killers’ leader. So begins his quest to avenge her.', 'Saxophonist Danny witnesses the murder of his band manager and a deaf-mute girl after a gig. Questioned by the police, he remembers only the orthopedic shoes of the killers’ leader. So begins his quest to avenge her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuaOneuqq5FNgI0bu5luB2Br85a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125769'),
  ('155774738886498011', 'Angel', 1984, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Davis, Robert Vincent O''Neil, Jeannine Lucchesi', 'Joseph Michael Cala, Robert Vincent O''Neil', 'Cliff Gorman, Susan Tyrrell, Dick Shawn, Rory Calhoun, Donna Wilkes, John Diehl, Elaine Giftos, Donna McDaniel', 'R', 'Molly Stewart, a teen at the top of her class who survives by working nights as a prostitute on Hollywood Blvd, finds her world beginning to fall apart when a depraved, necrophiliac serial killer begins targeting LA’s streetwalkers.', 'Molly Stewart, a teen at the top of her class who survives by working nights as a prostitute on Hollywood Blvd, finds her world beginning to fall apart when a depraved, necrophiliac serial killer begins targeting LA’s streetwalkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLrOR7QqV5fZ9g85bGJL0s5cHTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1803'),
  ('271342010090412671', 'Angel', 2005, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jiří Strach, Petr Polák', 'Lucie Konášová', 'Ivan Trojan, Jiří Dvořák, Zuzana Kajnarová, David Švehlík, Oldřich Navrátil, Jiří Bartoška, Josef Somr, Jana Štěpánková', null, 'An angel who ruins everything he touches is sent to Earth to learn about love, forgiveness and selflessness -- and he has just one day to do it.', 'An angel who ruins everything he touches is sent to Earth to learn about love, forgiveness and selflessness -- and he has just one day to do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e84zlGxsproTuu2GlkdZfdIury5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47396'),
  ('534205724733625033', 'Angel', 2006, 'Drama', 'Mayumi Miyasaka, Masami Inomoto', 'Satoko Okudera', 'Kyoko Fukada, Shigeru Izumiya, Akemi Kobayashi, Saori, Ei Morisako, Hiromi Nagasaku, Masatoshi Nagase, Naomi Nishida', null, 'One day, an angel materializes before Kato''s eyes. While the angel seems like an average girl with a passion for gin and lime, she sports a pair of big white wings. Only lonely-hearted people can see her. She may seem ordinary, but this angel touches hearts and transforms lives.', 'One day, an angel materializes before Kato''s eyes. While the angel seems like an average girl with a passion for gin and lime, she sports a pair of big white wings. Only lonely-hearted people can see her. She may seem ordinary, but this angel touches hearts and transforms lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arGON9HzYHQ1iembPOtsDbEPnIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53541'),
  ('283911827214704702', 'Angel', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Denis Lenoir, François Ozon', 'François Ozon', 'Romola Garai, Sam Neill, Michael Fassbender, Lucy Russell, Charlotte Rampling, Jacqueline Tong, Janine Duvitski, Christopher Benjamin', null, 'Edwardian England. A precocious girl from a poor background with aspirations to being a novelist finds herself swept to fame and fortune when her tasteless romances hit the best seller lists. Her life changes in unexpected ways when she encounters an aristocratic brother and sister, both of whom have cultural ambitions, and both of whom fall in love with her.', 'Edwardian England. A precocious girl from a poor background with aspirations to being a novelist finds herself swept to fame and fortune when her tasteless romances hit the best seller lists. Her life changes in unexpected ways when she encounters an aristocratic brother and sister, both of whom have cultural ambitions, and both of whom fall in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWJKPVsTvQK04TAZxErMymfEiyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11801'),
  ('628774327002178168', 'Angel', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Harry Cleven', 'Thomas Gunzig, Harry Cleven', 'Fleur Geffrier, Elina Löwensohn, François Vincentelli, Gauthier Battoue, Léo Lorléac''h, Hannah Boudru, Jules Myny, Maya Dory', null, 'Once upon a time there was Louise and her friend, the magician. But his last trick left a bitter taste in her mouth. He disappeared in a curtain of smoke… never to appear again. This is too much for the young woman. Devastated by endless grief, Louise is sent to a psychiatric asylum, resigned to the idea that she will swallow pills till the end of her days. Yet nine months later she gives birth to a child who is likely to have a big problem for his future class pictures, since he’s invisible. But Louise doesn’t care. He’s her angel and, wanting to protect him from this cruel world, she decides to keep his existence a secret. Years later, Louise’s angel has grown up. He even managed to find a girlfriend; Madeleine. The two become inseparable, for Madeleine never judges him. And for good reason: she’s blind.', 'Once upon a time there was Louise and her friend, the magician. But his last trick left a bitter taste in her mouth. He disappeared in a curtain of smoke… never to appear again. This is too much for the young woman. Devastated by endless grief, Louise is sent to a psychiatric asylum, resigned to the idea that she will swallow pills till the end of her days. Yet nine months later she gives birth to a child who is likely to have a big problem for his future class pictures, since he’s invisible. But Louise doesn’t care. He’s her angel and, wanting to protect him from this cruel world, she decides to keep his existence a secret. Years later, Louise’s angel has grown up. He even managed to find a girlfriend; Madeleine. The two become inseparable, for Madeleine never judges him. And for good reason: she’s blind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCy4X814fl8Qfnzot0gkCEcWvgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415137'),
  ('454996823479615954', 'Angel', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Koen Mortier, Nicolas Karakatsanis, Viktor Renson', 'Koen Mortier', 'Vincent Rottiers, Fatou N''Diaye, Paul Bartel, Aïcha Cissé, Katrien Goosens, Luc Assez, Eric Berlito, Ndiaga Mbow', null, 'Thierry, a world-famous cyclist, meets Fae, a sex worker, on his holiday in Senegal, and they sense in each other the love they seek. However, Thierry''s career disgrace and Fae''s refusal to register with the authorities threaten their dream.', 'Thierry, a world-famous cyclist, meets Fae, a sex worker, on his holiday in Senegal, and they sense in each other the love they seek. However, Thierry''s career disgrace and Fae''s refusal to register with the authorities threaten their dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSAXK47rgckhOx6JcZGb7mPSAD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484739'),
  ('872604929349069334', 'Angel 4: Undercover', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Schenkman, Donald Paul Pemrick, Gerry Lively', 'Dode B. Levenson, Frank Chance', 'Darlene Vogel, Shane Fraser, Samantha Phillips, Mark DeCarlo, Kerrie Clark, Peter Jurasik, Stoney Jackson, Stephen Kay', 'R', 'Former prostitute Molly Stewart works as a police photographer. When an old friend, a groupie in pursuit of the lead singer of a rock band, is found murdered with a guitar string, she goes undercover as Angel to find the killer.', 'Former prostitute Molly Stewart works as a police photographer. When an old friend, a groupie in pursuit of the lead singer of a rock band, is found murdered with a guitar string, she goes undercover as Angel to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkhHNfynrWbFGx5pdFgEtXqBhwq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161322'),
  ('381276839206543087', 'Angel and Sinner', 1945, 'Drama', 'Christian-Jaque', 'Henri Jeanson', 'Micheline Presle, Louis Salou, Berthe Bovy, Alfred Adam, Jean Brochard, Louise Conte, Mona Dol, Gabrielle Fontan', null, 'During the stagecoach trip of a frightened group of inhabitants of Rouen, Elisabeth Rousset, known as "Boule de Suif", renders these people a signal service, but comes up against their stupidity and their sufficiency. A little later, Boule de Suif assassinates the formidable Prussian lieutenant whom his friends had nicknamed Fifi and who shamelessly displayed his taste for pillage and his sadistic tendencies.', 'During the stagecoach trip of a frightened group of inhabitants of Rouen, Elisabeth Rousset, known as "Boule de Suif", renders these people a signal service, but comes up against their stupidity and their sufficiency. A little later, Boule de Suif assassinates the formidable Prussian lieutenant whom his friends had nicknamed Fifi and who shamelessly displayed his taste for pillage and his sadistic tendencies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ht3qJRSk0ZMaodz1XJ426BnRC9C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61712'),
  ('580941318808168030', 'Angel and the Badman', 1947, 'Western, Romance, Adventure, Action', 'James Edward Grant, Archie Stout, Cy Feuer', 'James Edward Grant', 'John Wayne, Gail Russell, Harry Carey, Bruce Cabot, Irene Rich, Lee Dixon, Stephen Grant, Tom Powers', 'NR', 'Notorious shootist and womanizer Quirt Evans'' horse collapses as he passes a Quaker family''s home. Quirt has been wounded, and the kindly family takes him in to nurse him back to health against the advice of others. The handsome Evans quickly attracts the affections of their beautiful daughter, Penelope. He develops an affection for the family and their faith, but his troubled past follows him.', 'Notorious shootist and womanizer Quirt Evans'' horse collapses as he passes a Quaker family''s home. Quirt has been wounded, and the kindly family takes him in to nurse him back to health against the advice of others. The handsome Evans quickly attracts the affections of their beautiful daughter, Penelope. He develops an affection for the family and their faith, but his troubled past follows him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbnte13MT1mke828R0rKmNZ41G6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22356'),
  ('875033668483337721', 'Angel at Sea', 2009, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Dumont, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Frédéric Dumont', 'Martin Nissen, Anne Consigny, Julien Frison, Louise Portal, Jacques Germain, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Olivier Gourmet, Bobker Hilal', null, 'Louis is a twelve year old boy who lives with his parents and older brother in southern Morocco. Louis is very happy until the day his father shares a secret with him.', 'Louis is a twelve year old boy who lives with his parents and older brother in southern Morocco. Louis is very happy until the day his father shares a secret with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGXSgLOeGE6gg0fPiqj4hKfgfDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52636'),
  ('1038867340629215176', 'Angel Baby', 1961, 'Drama', 'Paul Wendkos, Hubert Cornfield, Haskell Wexler', 'Samuel Roeca, Orin Borsten, Paul Mason', 'George Hamilton, Mercedes McCambridge, Joan Blondell, Henry Jones, Burt Reynolds, Salome Jens, Roger Clark, Dudley Remus', 'NR', 'A woman who believes she has been chosen by God to heal people is taken in by a greedy promoter and his shrewish wife to make the rounds of the rural South.', 'A woman who believes she has been chosen by God to heal people is taken in by a greedy promoter and his shrewish wife to make the rounds of the rural South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ey6U87Hv1YxNhTxTElJSHzaiN2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110299'),
  ('363150712696069171', 'Angel Baby', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Rymer, Damien M. Grant, Euan Keddie', 'Michael Rymer', 'John Lynch, Jacqueline McKenzie, Colin Friels, Deborra-Lee Furness, Geoff Brooks, Humphrey Bower, Alex Pinder, Robyn Nevin', 'R', 'Two schizophrenics meet during therapy and fall in love. Unfortunately they are on a road to nowhere...', 'Two schizophrenics meet during therapy and fall in love. Unfortunately they are on a road to nowhere...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiZJfBKWav33Kp1NTyrU3NjvOJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2892'),
  ('619038457810201374', 'Angel Cop', 1989, 'Thriller, Animation, Crime, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ichiro Itano, Etsuji Yamada', 'Ichiro Itano', 'Mika Doi, Akio Otsuka, Kenji Utsumi, Koichi Kitamura, Kumiko Hironaka, Masashi Ebara, Mikio Terashima, Nozomu Sasaki', null, 'In the late twentieth century, the Secret Security Force was formed to stop the actions of the communist terrorist group known as the Red May. Angel, a beautiful, yet cold woman, has recently joined the small anti-terrorist group. But her first mission will be a true test of skill, for members of the Red May are being found dead, murdered by gruesome methods. Who is causing these murders? And why? Written by Chuck "Dark-Side" Williamson', 'In the late twentieth century, the Secret Security Force was formed to stop the actions of the communist terrorist group known as the Red May. Angel, a beautiful, yet cold woman, has recently joined the small anti-terrorist group. But her first mission will be a true test of skill, for members of the Red May are being found dead, murdered by gruesome methods. Who is causing these murders? And why? Written by Chuck "Dark-Side" Williamson', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRelTNgj9NqGZbncOVJ0jwcKpTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37629'),
  ('436745066875421506', 'Ángel de fuego', 1991, 'Drama', 'Dana Rotberg, Toni Kuhn', 'Omar Alain Rodrigo, Dana Rotberg', 'Evangelina Sosa, Lilia Aragón, Roberto Sosa, Alejandro Parodi, Salvador Sánchez, Gina Morett, Mercedes Pascual, Marta Aura', null, 'The young trapeze artist Alma is part of the show of a miserable traveling circus. In an act of desperation, Alma commits incest with her father, a sick clown obsessed with the woman who abandoned them. Determined to have his child, Alma leaves the circus and joins a group of preachers led by Refugio, a woman who performs puppet shows with biblical passages in poor neighborhoods.', 'The young trapeze artist Alma is part of the show of a miserable traveling circus. In an act of desperation, Alma commits incest with her father, a sick clown obsessed with the woman who abandoned them. Determined to have his child, Alma leaves the circus and joins a group of preachers led by Refugio, a woman who performs puppet shows with biblical passages in poor neighborhoods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1seRYFFV3nCoZiJCnwI10uha7TJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240596'),
  ('577376197213940009', 'Angel Dust', 1994, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Gakuryu Ishii', 'Kaho Minami, Takeshi Wakamatsu, Etsushi Toyokawa, Ryoko Takizawa, Masayuki Shionoya, Yukio Yamato, Tomorowo Taguchi, Toshinori Kondo', null, 'Every Monday, a young woman is murdered in the subway, leading psychiatrist Setsuko Suma to investigate Dr. Rei Aku''s deprogramming of former sect members.', 'Every Monday, a young woman is murdered in the subway, leading psychiatrist Setsuko Suma to investigate Dr. Rei Aku''s deprogramming of former sect members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCCjvRIJJygkavmSg6DbtPOimWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34048'),
  ('815781531730072214', 'Angel Eyes', 1993, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Gary Graver, Gary Graver', 'Gary Graver', 'Erik Estrada, John Phillip Law, Monique Gabrielle, Raven, John Coleman, Hoke Howell, Richard Harrison, Suzanne Ager', null, 'Angel is a disturbed teen who becomes obsessed with her nice stepfather Steven. After her mother dies under unusual circumstances, Angel is sent to an institution. Years later, she is let out and tracks down her dear step-dad who now lives with his new girlfriend Michelle. He is technically her only kin so he takes her in, but his girlfriend doesn''t like Angel one bit. Angel''s obsession with her "dad" is as strong as ever and she fantasizes about seducing him. After spying on him and his girlfriend having passionate sex, she begins playing a deadly game and even tries to seduce his hostile girlfriend. However, Steven has a more immediate and obvious problem - a drug dealer called Johnny Ventura.', 'Angel is a disturbed teen who becomes obsessed with her nice stepfather Steven. After her mother dies under unusual circumstances, Angel is sent to an institution. Years later, she is let out and tracks down her dear step-dad who now lives with his new girlfriend Michelle. He is technically her only kin so he takes her in, but his girlfriend doesn''t like Angel one bit. Angel''s obsession with her "dad" is as strong as ever and she fantasizes about seducing him. After spying on him and his girlfriend having passionate sex, she begins playing a deadly game and even tries to seduce his hostile girlfriend. However, Steven has a more immediate and obvious problem - a drug dealer called Johnny Ventura.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LQ1ypGmloOMw63YRW9KCsvCA7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28864'),
  ('1112855644822860498', 'Angel Eyes', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Luis Mandoki, Piotr Sobociński, Spiro Razatos', 'Gerald Di Pego', 'Jennifer Lopez, Jim Caviezel, Jeremy Sisto, Terrence Howard, Sonia Braga, Victor Argo, Monet Mazur, Shirley Knight', 'R', 'A story about a seemingly unlikely couple who cross paths under life-threatening circumstances as though they are destined not only to meet but to save each other''s lives. Not once, but twice.', 'A story about a seemingly unlikely couple who cross paths under life-threatening circumstances as though they are destined not only to meet but to save each other''s lives. Not once, but twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZeMoynnz4pRweKKZ9c2G1absMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5852'),
