  ('325291836537421302', 'Angel Face', 2018, 'Drama', 'Vanessa Filho, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Vanessa Filho, François Pirot, Diastème', 'Marion Cotillard, Ayline Etaix, Alban Lenoir, Amélie Daure, Stéphane Rideau, Mario Magalhaes, Joël Boudjelta, Stefano Cassetti', null, '8-year-old Elli and her mother, Marlène, live in a small town by the French Riviera where they act out to relieve boredom and hide from social services. When Marlène caves in to yet another night of excess, she chooses to leave Elli behind for a man she just met. The young child must confront her mother''s demons in order to get her back.', '8-year-old Elli and her mother, Marlène, live in a small town by the French Riviera where they act out to relieve boredom and hide from social services. When Marlène caves in to yet another night of excess, she chooses to leave Elli behind for a man she just met. The young child must confront her mother''s demons in order to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9MUiB0prnEtCKTDNmf7Esz8UTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489170'),
  ('783835584772399529', 'Angel Falls Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jerry Ciccoritti, Jonathan Yapp', null, 'Chad Michael Murray, Jessica Lowndes, David Reale, Samora Smallwood, Jane Luk, Deborah Tennant, Carlie Mantilla-Jordan, Mia Schierau', 'G', 'A devoted doctor with little time for the Christmas spirit is in desperate need of an intervention from the unlikeliest of places.', 'A devoted doctor with little time for the Christmas spirit is in desperate need of an intervention from the unlikeliest of places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7A4sPNcTnwtHW2lPaPrKHFVSMON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878401'),
  ('102326606151898830', 'Angel Flight Down', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie, Action', 'Charles Wilkinson', 'Michael Petryni', 'Patricia Kalember, David Charvet, Garwin Sanford, Christopher Atkins, Stephen E. Miller, Paige Magnusson, Donna-Lynne Larson, Deanna Milligan', null, 'A medical emergency aircraft crashes in the snowy Rockies. The pilot, two paramedics, a two-year-old patient, and her father all manage to survive the crash. Unfortunately, the little girl''s already critical condition is rapidly worsening, her father is growing hysterical by the minute, the pilot is seriously injured, and the paramedics aren''t sure if they are emotionally equipped for the crisis.', 'A medical emergency aircraft crashes in the snowy Rockies. The pilot, two paramedics, a two-year-old patient, and her father all manage to survive the crash. Unfortunately, the little girl''s already critical condition is rapidly worsening, her father is growing hysterical by the minute, the pilot is seriously injured, and the paramedics aren''t sure if they are emotionally equipped for the crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozr2bpGEGaa3C5sPsTCYTUlkF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160054'),
  ('32841126977327123', 'Angel Guts: High School Co-Ed', 1978, 'Drama', 'Chūsei Sone, Nobumasa Mizunoo, Toshiharu Ikeda', 'Ryuusaku Shinsui, Toshiharu Ikeda', 'Machiko Ohtani, Tatsuma Higuchi, Tsutomu Hori, Shin Kagayama, Kenji Kasai, Megu Kawashima, Ken Kazama, Kazuyuki Komiya', null, 'A three-member motorcycle gang spends its time raping women until one member’s sister gets involved.', 'A three-member motorcycle gang spends its time raping women until one member’s sister gets involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw8es1GtePt85s2AytW77fbXIEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98226'),
