  ('567610292350487542', 'Angel Guts: Red Classroom', 1979, 'Drama', 'Chūsei Sone, Nobumasa Mizunoo, Masao Asada', 'Takashi Ishii, Chūsei Sone', 'Yūki Mizuhara, Keizo Kanie, Jun Aki, Rebun Hori, Kenji Kasai, Ryoichi Kusanagi, Minako Mizushima, Hidetoshi Kageyama', null, 'When Muraki, a porn magazine editor, watches a blue film depicting a gang rape in a school, he becomes obsessed with the lead actress. Quite by chance, whilst looking to reserve a location for a shoot, he happens to encounter her at a love hotel where she works as a receptionist. Her name is Nami and she reluctantly agrees to speak with him, and confesses that it was her in the film. Then, Muraki tells Nami that he wants her to model for him.', 'When Muraki, a porn magazine editor, watches a blue film depicting a gang rape in a school, he becomes obsessed with the lead actress. Quite by chance, whilst looking to reserve a location for a shoot, he happens to encounter her at a love hotel where she works as a receptionist. Her name is Nami and she reluctantly agrees to speak with him, and confesses that it was her in the film. Then, Muraki tells Nami that he wants her to model for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdyu91l3MGOXQaAbHBFVunU0gMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106754'),
