  ('937029808563979795', 'Angel Puss', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A little black boy is hired to kill a cat, but the feline escapes and proceeds to play tricks on the kid, pretending he''s a ghost come back to haunt his "killer". One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'A little black boy is hired to kill a cat, but the feline escapes and proceeds to play tricks on the kid, pretending he''s a ghost come back to haunt his "killer". One of the “Censored 11” banned from TV syndication by United Artists in 1968 for racist stereotyping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVMD8EBoBWsMPnXg78R3xRn0JaT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205876'),
  ('60211158957528709', 'Angel Sanctuary', 2001, 'Romance, Fantasy, Animation', 'Kiyoko Sayama, Hideyuki Tanaka', 'Mayori Sekijima', 'Kenji Nojima, Ai Orikasa, Takehito Koyasu, Shin-ichiro Miki, Mayumi Asano, Yuji Ueda, Ryusei Nakao, Yuko Miyamura', null, 'Setsuna, a High School student, not only has to deal with bullies and more then appropiate feelings for his own sister, but also must come to terms with the fact that he is the reincarnation of the Organic Angel Alexiel who rebelled against God. Being thrust into a world he never knew existed he must believe that angels and demons exist for the sake of Heaven, Earth and even Hell.', 'Setsuna, a High School student, not only has to deal with bullies and more then appropiate feelings for his own sister, but also must come to terms with the fact that he is the reincarnation of the Organic Angel Alexiel who rebelled against God. Being thrust into a world he never knew existed he must believe that angels and demons exist for the sake of Heaven, Earth and even Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erouXeD5hTzlr9SgsvLeiElMmO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44370'),
