  ('187372563592318345', 'Angel''s Fall', 2005, 'Drama', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu, Eyüp Boz', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu', 'Tülin Özen, Budak Akalin, Musa Karagöz, Engin Dogan, Yeşim Ceren Bozoğlu, Özlem Turhal, Can Kolukısa, Mine Demiriz', null, 'Zeynep, Tülin Özen works in a hotel as a housekeeper. But she suffers hell on earth because of her father''s behavior. She only talks to Mustafa, ''Engin Dogan'' who works in the same hotel and he is interested in Zeynep. She is not interested in Mustafa who is younger than Zeynep, but she is not indifferent to him. While Zeynep is trying to make a bonfire of bad situation, Selçuk, Budak Akalin who lives on the other side of city is a voice technician. He feels guilty after his wife''s death. The suitcase which has his wife''s dresses changes the Zeynep''s destiny.', 'Zeynep, Tülin Özen works in a hotel as a housekeeper. But she suffers hell on earth because of her father''s behavior. She only talks to Mustafa, ''Engin Dogan'' who works in the same hotel and he is interested in Zeynep. She is not interested in Mustafa who is younger than Zeynep, but she is not indifferent to him. While Zeynep is trying to make a bonfire of bad situation, Selçuk, Budak Akalin who lives on the other side of city is a voice technician. He feels guilty after his wife''s death. The suitcase which has his wife''s dresses changes the Zeynep''s destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEoa9BG0FSHgu9MMy2myE8wr7xC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179715'),
  ('47869556621141775', 'Angel''s Friends - Between Dream and Reality', 2011, 'Romance, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Orlando Corradi, Danilo Bernardi', 'Francesco Balletta', 'Patrizia Mottola, Simone D''Andrea, Francesca Bielli, Benedetta Ponticelli, Marcella Silvestri, Emanuela Pacotto, Maddalena Vadacca, Luca Bottale', null, 'A television movie based on the animated series and settled between the first and the second season aired, in Italy, on 23 April 2011. The movie focuses on the Angels attending the Summer School at the Sunny College in Alpinville, where Raf hopes she will not meet Sulfus. The Devils show up at the school and Raf tells Sulfus she has fallen in love with someone else. Meanwhile, the Earthly ones receive the task of refurbishing the Theatre of Princes (Italian: Teatro dei Principi) and organising a play, Romeo &amp; Juliet by William Shakespeare. However, they are attacked by a mysterious hooded man who wants them to leave the theatre. The Angels and the Devils decide to investigate and find out the truth about Tyco and Sai''s fate. At last, Raf and Sulfus conclude that they''ll decide what to do about their future together once returned to the Golden School for the new term.', 'A television movie based on the animated series and settled between the first and the second season aired, in Italy, on 23 April 2011. The movie focuses on the Angels attending the Summer School at the Sunny College in Alpinville, where Raf hopes she will not meet Sulfus. The Devils show up at the school and Raf tells Sulfus she has fallen in love with someone else. Meanwhile, the Earthly ones receive the task of refurbishing the Theatre of Princes (Italian: Teatro dei Principi) and organising a play, Romeo &amp; Juliet by William Shakespeare. However, they are attacked by a mysterious hooded man who wants them to leave the theatre. The Angels and the Devils decide to investigate and find out the truth about Tyco and Sai''s fate. At last, Raf and Sulfus conclude that they''ll decide what to do about their future together once returned to the Golden School for the new term.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCa1XSy5rglNwvzOol9n6jkGoXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278753'),
  ('903125304988247746', 'Angel''s Leap', 1971, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yves Boisset, Jean Boffety, Georges Grodzenczyk', 'Yves Boisset, Richard Winckler', 'Jean Yanne, Senta Berger, Sterling Hayden, Raymond Pellegrin, Gordon Mitchell, Claude Cerval, Daniel Ivernel, Giancarlo Sbragia', null, 'In this French crime thriller, you can leave the mob, but the mob won''t leave you. Louis (Jean Yanne) has retired to a Thailand plantation with an Asian wife and child. Back in Marseilles, however, because a no-holds-barred gang war has broken out, Louis'' large collateral family is wiped out, and he is family are slated for destruction.', 'In this French crime thriller, you can leave the mob, but the mob won''t leave you. Louis (Jean Yanne) has retired to a Thailand plantation with an Asian wife and child. Back in Marseilles, however, because a no-holds-barred gang war has broken out, Louis'' large collateral family is wiped out, and he is family are slated for destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hO3wD0XoxVIVpUk97uvCDJ3SzbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122229'),
  ('297572784437802841', 'Angela', 1996, 'Drama', 'Rebecca Miller, Ellen Kuras', 'Rebecca Miller', 'Miranda Rhyne, Charlotte Eve Blythe, Anna Thomson, John Ventimiglia, iO Tillett Wright, Vincent Gallo, Ruth Maleczech, Garrett Bemer', 'NR', 'A ten year old girl named Angela leads her six year old sister, Ellie, through various regimens of ''purification'' in an attempt to rid themselves of their evil, which she believes to be the cause of their mother''s mental illness. Precocious, to say the least, Angela has visions of Lucifer coming to take her and her sister away, and one of her remedies for this is for them to remain within a circle of their dolls and toys until they see a vision of the virgin Mary come to them. But such thinking can only lead to an ending befitting of her own mental state.', 'A ten year old girl named Angela leads her six year old sister, Ellie, through various regimens of ''purification'' in an attempt to rid themselves of their evil, which she believes to be the cause of their mother''s mental illness. Precocious, to say the least, Angela has visions of Lucifer coming to take her and her sister away, and one of her remedies for this is for them to remain within a circle of their dolls and toys until they see a vision of the virgin Mary come to them. But such thinking can only lead to an ending befitting of her own mental state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhxU3jFzC2tlBgqFhB7NqO4qAFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32622'),
  ('1033691219786233247', 'Angela', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Camila Andreoni, Bruno Alfano, Fátima Toledo', 'Duda de Almeida', 'Isis Valverde, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Alice Carvalho, Bianca Bin, Emílio Orciollo Netto, Gustavo Machado, Carolina Mânica, Chris Couto', null, 'In this biopic about the life and death of Ângela Diniz, Angela meets Raul and believes she has found someone who loves her free spirit as much as she does. The overwhelming attraction makes the couple drop everything and live the dream of rebuilding their lives on the beach. But the relationship declines into abuse and violence, giving rise to one of the most remembered murders in Brazil.', 'In this biopic about the life and death of Ângela Diniz, Angela meets Raul and believes she has found someone who loves her free spirit as much as she does. The overwhelming attraction makes the couple drop everything and live the dream of rebuilding their lives on the beach. But the relationship declines into abuse and violence, giving rise to one of the most remembered murders in Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkzlkNuH50dPoJ3AlmwvaJtWRaz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147964'),
  ('12731031473872293', 'Angela & Viril', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Steven Shainberg', null, 'Angelina Jolie', null, 'While Angela meditates, Viril is typing the numbers one through one thousand.', 'While Angela meditates, Viril is typing the numbers one through one thousand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBSLEUr5gov1ib3TTkH9MtksDMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359468'),
  ('386628307115479023', 'Angela and I', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Herbert Simone Paragnani, Giovanni Macedonio', 'Herbert Simone Paragnani, Gianni Corsi', 'Pietro Sermonti, Ilenia Pastorelli, Eugenio Franceschini, Saverio Raimondo, Alessandro Cremona, Daniele Blando, Corinne Cléry, Maurizio Lops', null, 'Arturo, a placid forty-year-old, unexpectedly receives the visit of an Angel of Death: a sexy woman with a weakness for tequila and younger boys. The supernatural being, Angela, invites him to a quick departure. However, Arturo wants to make a pact with his incorrect escort: he will accept his Destiny only if she helps him take revenge on all those who have made fun of him. The bet is tough: if Arturo disappears from the Register of the Morituri, Angela will lose her immortality. Who between the two will be able to defeat Igli Hasani a second time?', 'Arturo, a placid forty-year-old, unexpectedly receives the visit of an Angel of Death: a sexy woman with a weakness for tequila and younger boys. The supernatural being, Angela, invites him to a quick departure. However, Arturo wants to make a pact with his incorrect escort: he will accept his Destiny only if she helps him take revenge on all those who have made fun of him. The bet is tough: if Arturo disappears from the Register of the Morituri, Angela will lose her immortality. Who between the two will be able to defeat Igli Hasani a second time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFsZRzxbh7xwjPZvPm3B0OTCrHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820209'),
  ('203228261493930370', 'Angela''s Ashes', 1999, 'Drama', 'Alan Parker, Michael Seresin, Chris Connier', 'Laura Jones, Alan Parker', 'Emily Watson, Robert Carlyle, Joe Breen, Michael Legge, Ciarán Owens, Ronnie Masterson, Pauline McLynn, Liam Carney', 'R', 'An Irish Catholic family returns to 1930s Limerick after a child''s death in America. The unemployed I.R.A. veteran father struggles with poverty, prejudice, and alcoholism as the family endures harsh slum conditions.', 'An Irish Catholic family returns to 1930s Limerick after a child''s death in America. The unemployed I.R.A. veteran father struggles with poverty, prejudice, and alcoholism as the family endures harsh slum conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Zzcys11nAPP14sKW9l97fIHhkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10397'),
  ('856548136544217431', 'Angela''s Christmas', 2017, 'Animation, Family', 'Damien O''Connor, John T. Coomey', 'Will Collins, Damien O''Connor', 'Lucy O''Connell, Ruth Negga, Brian Gleeson, Pat Kinevane, Malachy McCourt, Janet Moran, Des Nealon, Don Wycherley', 'G', 'A trip to church with her family on Christmas Eve gives young Angela an extraordinary idea. A heartwarming tale based on a story by Frank McCourt.', 'A trip to church with her family on Christmas Eve gives young Angela an extraordinary idea. A heartwarming tale based on a story by Frank McCourt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sUXtCQsT49bGw1zPtSnYeBpKpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563710'),
  ('689396886576259471', 'Angela''s Christmas Wish', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Damien O''Connor', 'Damien O''Connor', 'Lucy O''Connell, Ruth Negga, Moe Dunford, Pat Kinevane, Jared Harris, Caitríona Balfe', 'G', 'A determined Angela makes a wish to reunite her family in time for Christmas, then launches a plan to find her way from Ireland to Australia.', 'A determined Angela makes a wish to reunite her family in time for Christmas, then launches a plan to find her way from Ireland to Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ftutOnMM5JHl69mvkNbs8f1AUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752455'),
  ('972554008855161741', 'Angele', 1934, 'Drama', 'Marcel Pagnol, Willy Faktorovitch', 'Marcel Pagnol', 'Fernandel, Orane Demazis, Henri Poupon, Édouard Delmont, Annie Toinon, Jean Servais, Andrex, Charles Blavette', null, 'Angèle is a 1934 French drama film directed, produced and written by Marcel Pagnol. It stars Orane Demazis as a naive young woman who is seduced and abandoned. It is based on the novel Un de Baumugnes by Jean Giono.', 'Angèle is a 1934 French drama film directed, produced and written by Marcel Pagnol. It stars Orane Demazis as a naive young woman who is seduced and abandoned. It is based on the novel Un de Baumugnes by Jean Giono.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y25PgfJmCFD9KlAMbyoZTxZn6LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43900'),
  ('221474447881845628', 'Angèle', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Brice VDH, Sébastien Rensonnet', null, 'Angèle', 'R', 'Belgian pop star Angèle reflects on her life and hopes as she finds balance amid the tears, joys and loneliness of fame. Told through her own words.', 'Belgian pop star Angèle reflects on her life and hopes as she finds balance amid the tears, joys and loneliness of fame. Told through her own words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9ldOOvwImdHfsDqZ4sIwRqcK2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892433'),
  ('895842044969559101', 'Angèle and Tony', 2011, 'Romance', 'Alix Delaporte, Claire Mathon', 'Alain Le Henry', 'Clotilde Hesme, Grégory Gadebois, Evelyne Didi, Jérôme Huguet, Lola Dueñas, Antoine Laurent, Corine Marienneau, Elsa Bouchain', null, 'Angèle, a beautiful young woman with a past, arrives in a small fishing harbor in Normandy. She meets Tony, a professional fisherman, who finds himself attracted to her although he dislikes her blunt ways. Tony hires her as a fishmonger, lodges her and teaches her the tricks of the trade. The relationships between Myriam, Tony''s mother, and Angèle are far from easy but the young woman gradually adapts to her new environment and little by little Tony and Angèle manage to tame each other.', 'Angèle, a beautiful young woman with a past, arrives in a small fishing harbor in Normandy. She meets Tony, a professional fisherman, who finds himself attracted to her although he dislikes her blunt ways. Tony hires her as a fishmonger, lodges her and teaches her the tricks of the trade. The relationships between Myriam, Tony''s mother, and Angèle are far from easy but the young woman gradually adapts to her new environment and little by little Tony and Angèle manage to tame each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqkz5wAiJd32wZjgYFPIkyP5Phl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56002'),
  ('429929303497647933', 'Angelfist', 1993, 'Thriller, Action', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Joe Batac', 'Anthony L. Greene', 'Catya Sassoon, Melissa Moore, Michael Shaner, Denise Buick, Jessica Roberts, Bob Larson, Tony Carreon, Roland Dantes', 'R', 'An assassination in the Philippines is caught on film by kickboxer Christy, which leads to her death at the hands of radicals intent on disrupting peace talks. Her sister Kat, a Los Angeles police officer, comes to Manila to try and bring justice to the people responsible. She enters the kickboxing tournament in order to get closer to the nefarious agents, and begins unravelling the twisted plan while narrowly evading the wrath of the Death Brigades.', 'An assassination in the Philippines is caught on film by kickboxer Christy, which leads to her death at the hands of radicals intent on disrupting peace talks. Her sister Kat, a Los Angeles police officer, comes to Manila to try and bring justice to the people responsible. She enters the kickboxing tournament in order to get closer to the nefarious agents, and begins unravelling the twisted plan while narrowly evading the wrath of the Death Brigades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrU8GRu6jccyDXdUdqw686tPEku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98377'),
  ('962000656113409714', 'Angelina', 1947, 'Drama', 'Luigi Zampa, Antonio Altoviti, Mario Craveri', 'Piero Tellini', 'Anna Magnani, Nando Bruno, Ernesto Almirante, Agnese Dubbini, Armando Migliari, Maria Donati, Franco Zeffirelli, Ave Ninchi', null, 'A rowdy woman is so forceful that she outdoes her husband in a loud cry against speculators who refuse poor people entrance to a block of new apartments, built after WW2. Without noticing it, she starts a people''s movement, and leads a march to the capital. She returns to her village a winner, an honourable MP. Yet, she is still the same simple, fiery woman, able to get in a hair-pulling brawl with the local barmaid for the affection of her man.', 'A rowdy woman is so forceful that she outdoes her husband in a loud cry against speculators who refuse poor people entrance to a block of new apartments, built after WW2. Without noticing it, she starts a people''s movement, and leads a march to the capital. She returns to her village a winner, an honourable MP. Yet, she is still the same simple, fiery woman, able to get in a hair-pulling brawl with the local barmaid for the affection of her man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sGwLZQORMFHUWlnKS9paRMa1mL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105509'),
  ('108283554395806462', 'Angelique', 1964, 'Adventure, Romance, History', 'Bernard Borderie', 'Bernard Borderie, Claude Brulé, Francis Cosne', 'Michèle Mercier, Robert Hossein, Jean Rochefort, Claude Giraud, Giuliano Gemma, Jacques Toja, Jacques Castelot, Charles Regnier', null, 'In 17th-century France, beautiful country maiden Angélique marries wealthy neighbor Jeoffray de Peyrac out of convenience, but eventually, she falls in love with him. So when Jeoffray is arrested and then vanishes, she bravely sets out to find him. This is the first of many dramas based on Anne and Serge Golon''s novels about strong-willed Angélique and her adventures during the reign of Louis XIV, the Sun King.', 'In 17th-century France, beautiful country maiden Angélique marries wealthy neighbor Jeoffray de Peyrac out of convenience, but eventually, she falls in love with him. So when Jeoffray is arrested and then vanishes, she bravely sets out to find him. This is the first of many dramas based on Anne and Serge Golon''s novels about strong-willed Angélique and her adventures during the reign of Louis XIV, the Sun King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBPpq9f5FNa1fgbcguVh9cOzfg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44450'),
  ('122749807514077660', 'Angélique', 2013, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Ariel Zeitoun, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Ariel Zeitoun, Philippe Blasband, Nadia Golon', 'Nora Arnezeder, Gérard Lanvin, Tomer Sisley, Simon Abkarian, Florence Coste, David Kross, Mathieu Kassovitz, Jiří Pomeje', null, 'The incredible destiny of Angélique: a beautiful girl who found in her love for Joffrey Peyrac the strength to fight injustice and submission in a century plagued by power struggles, inequality and the oppression.', 'The incredible destiny of Angélique: a beautiful girl who found in her love for Joffrey Peyrac the strength to fight injustice and submission in a century plagued by power struggles, inequality and the oppression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLnWjVLuf5IK4SZcn9VPgkWlmaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222230'),
  ('604594709462776179', 'Angelique and the King', 1966, 'Adventure, History, Romance', 'Bernard Borderie', null, 'Michèle Mercier, Robert Hossein, Jean Rochefort, Jacques Toja, Sami Frey, Estella Blain, Fred Williams, Pasquale Martino', null, 'Soon after her latest husband death, the King himself (Louis XIV) meets with our heroine and begs her to help convince the Persian Ambassador to agree to a treaty. However, what they didn''t realize was that the handsome Persian was in fact a sexual sadist. So, it is up to the King''s half- brother, some Hungarian prince, to save Angélique from the evil troll''s clutches.', 'Soon after her latest husband death, the King himself (Louis XIV) meets with our heroine and begs her to help convince the Persian Ambassador to agree to a treaty. However, what they didn''t realize was that the handsome Persian was in fact a sexual sadist. So, it is up to the King''s half- brother, some Hungarian prince, to save Angélique from the evil troll''s clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtrK32Qdu7oaPqBiN7tGo1BhkJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22183'),
  ('874588482793902098', 'Angelique and the Sultan', 1968, 'Adventure, Romance, History', 'Bernard Borderie', 'Bernard Borderie, Francis Cosne', 'Michèle Mercier, Robert Hossein, Jean-Claude Pascal, Jacques Santi, Helmuth Schneider, Roger Pigaut, Ettore Manni, Erno Crisa', null, 'Angélique is in a North African Muslim kingdom where she is now part of the Sultan''s harem. She refuses to be bedded as her captors try to beat sense into her. She finally decides to escape with the help of two Christian prisoners.', 'Angélique is in a North African Muslim kingdom where she is now part of the Sultan''s harem. She refuses to be bedded as her captors try to beat sense into her. She finally decides to escape with the help of two Christian prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqENboMTcwRg09lm6wO1eyPaWgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44446'),
  ('892276151728966038', 'Angelique: The Road To Versailles', 1965, 'Adventure, Mystery, Romance', 'Bernard Borderie', 'Claude Brulé, Bernard Borderie, Francis Cosne', 'Michèle Mercier, Claude Giraud, Jean Rochefort, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Giuliano Gemma, Jacques Toja, Robert Porte, François Maistre', null, 'Angelique is saved by the king of the cutthroats when she is endangered in the streets of Paris. After her hero is killed, she has many amorous affairs and becomes a successful businesswoman.', 'Angelique is saved by the king of the cutthroats when she is endangered in the streets of Paris. After her hero is killed, she has many amorous affairs and becomes a successful businesswoman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46sNgfbm3MXCYlIpCOvOMJIrEWN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44453'),
  ('777245520782993531', 'Angelitos Negros', 1948, 'Drama', 'Joselito Rodríguez, Jorge López Portillo, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Joselito Rodríguez', 'Pedro Infante, Emilia Guiú, Rita Montaner, Chela Castro, Antonio R. Frausto, María Douglas, Juan Pulido, Óscar Pulido', null, 'Starring Mexican star Pedro Infante, "Black Angels" is about a couple formed by a beautiful woman and a singer, both white, who are parents of a black girl. The woman blames him, but the girl will suffer the racist treatment from her own mother. Mexican version of the famous novel by Fannie Hurst "Imitation of Life"', 'Starring Mexican star Pedro Infante, "Black Angels" is about a couple formed by a beautiful woman and a singer, both white, who are parents of a black girl. The woman blames him, but the girl will suffer the racist treatment from her own mother. Mexican version of the famous novel by Fannie Hurst "Imitation of Life"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxLhc3jEcMiKmsD9y3vN7OdQOn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110915'),
  ('1077700869080044162', 'Angelo', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Markus Schleinzer, Gerald Kerkletz', 'Alexander Brom, Markus Schleinzer', 'Makita Samba, Alba Rohrwacher, Larisa Faber, Kenny Nzogang, Lukas Miko, Gerti Drassl, Michael Rotschopf, Jean-Baptiste Tiémélé', null, 'In early 18th century an African slave boy is chosen by a European Comtesse to be baptized and educated. Reaching adulthood, Angelo achieves prominence and soon becomes the Viennese court mascot until he decides to secretly marry a white woman.', 'In early 18th century an African slave boy is chosen by a European Comtesse to be baptized and educated. Reaching adulthood, Angelo achieves prominence and soon becomes the Viennese court mascot until he decides to secretly marry a white woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CC853SbB0PmfK70qj1P2Q5vfGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485359'),
  ('539121106867957997', 'Angels & Co.', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Vladimir Rodionov, Djanik Mayaux, Antoine Monod', 'Romain Lancry, Vladimir Rodionov', 'Élodie Fontan, Romain Lancry, Julien Pestel, Shirine Boutella, François Berléand, Zabou Breitman, Simon Astier, Joséphine Draï', null, 'Paul and Léa should never have met. But ever since, they''ve been irresistibly drawn to each other. Raphaëlle and Gabriel, two angels who are complete opposites, are forced to team up to put everything back in order and prevent these two humans from falling in love. If the angels fail, ambitious Raphaëlle can kiss her promotion to archangel goodbye. As for the swindler Gabriel, he''ll be deposed and must spend eternity on Earth.', 'Paul and Léa should never have met. But ever since, they''ve been irresistibly drawn to each other. Raphaëlle and Gabriel, two angels who are complete opposites, are forced to team up to put everything back in order and prevent these two humans from falling in love. If the angels fail, ambitious Raphaëlle can kiss her promotion to archangel goodbye. As for the swindler Gabriel, he''ll be deposed and must spend eternity on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3AO6twCId5iYwaU4FM4cSpZaVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261616'),
  ('446719484266120579', 'Angels & Demons', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Ron Howard, Salvatore Totino, Aaron Haye', 'Akiva Goldsman, David Koepp', 'Tom Hanks, Ewan McGregor, Ayelet Zurer, Stellan Skarsgård, Pierfrancesco Favino, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Thure Lindhardt', 'PG-13', 'Harvard symbologist Robert Langdon is recruited by the Vatican to investigate the apparent return of the Illuminati – a secret, underground organization – after four cardinals are kidnapped on the night of the papal conclave.', 'Harvard symbologist Robert Langdon is recruited by the Vatican to investigate the apparent return of the Illuminati – a secret, underground organization – after four cardinals are kidnapped on the night of the papal conclave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFZQAuulEOtFTp0gHbVdEXwGrYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13448'),
  ('12080849662279353', 'Angels and Demons', 1969, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Carlos Hugo Christensen, Francisco A. Marques', 'Orígenes Lessa, Carlos Hugo Christensen', 'Eva Christian, Geraldo del Rey, Luiz Fernando Ianelli, Fregolente, Rubens de Falco, Nildo Parente, Clementino Kelé, Suzy Arruda', null, 'A young woman and her lover draw an unsuspecting lawyer into their plan to kill her rich uncle and stay with his fortune.', 'A young woman and her lover draw an unsuspecting lawyer into their plan to kill her rich uncle and stay with his fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/668foXM7kuBXs4b0ii24onSfgDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362111'),
  ('1026110582093763325', 'Angels and Insects', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Haas, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Philip Haas, Belinda Haas', 'Mark Rylance, Kristin Scott Thomas, Patsy Kensit, Jeremy Kemp, Douglas Henshall, Annette Badland, Chris Larkin, Anna Massey', null, 'In Victorian England, wealthy patriarch Sir Harald Alabaster invites an impoverished biologist, William Adamson, into his home. There, William tries to continue his work, but is distracted by Alabaster''s seductive daughter, Eugenia. William and Eugenia begin a torrid romance, but as the couple become closer, the young scientist begins to realize that dark, disturbing things are happening behind the closed doors of the Alabaster manor.', 'In Victorian England, wealthy patriarch Sir Harald Alabaster invites an impoverished biologist, William Adamson, into his home. There, William tries to continue his work, but is distracted by Alabaster''s seductive daughter, Eugenia. William and Eugenia begin a torrid romance, but as the couple become closer, the young scientist begins to realize that dark, disturbing things are happening behind the closed doors of the Alabaster manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1i5JdddoLuzSmnKo5ORDoKdMm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8447'),
  ('513343411566443190', 'Angels Fallen', 2020, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Dane Lawing, Ali Zamani', 'Amanda Barton', 'Nicola Posener, Houston Rhines, Michael Teh, Li Jing, Michael Madsen, Said Legue, Caroline Amiguet, Eric Roberts', null, 'After the tragic loss of his wife battling the forces of darkness, Gabriel is persuaded to rejoin his former team of demon hunters traveling from relatively obscurity in America to the deep unknown regions of Europe. He is joined by his estranged best friend Michael who harbors a dark secret, the mystical Hannah whose visions predict the future, and a motley crew of demon slayers. After losing part of his team Gabriel must confront his tragic past and decide who really is friend or foe.', 'After the tragic loss of his wife battling the forces of darkness, Gabriel is persuaded to rejoin his former team of demon hunters traveling from relatively obscurity in America to the deep unknown regions of Europe. He is joined by his estranged best friend Michael who harbors a dark secret, the mystical Hannah whose visions predict the future, and a motley crew of demon slayers. After losing part of his team Gabriel must confront his tragic past and decide who really is friend or foe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mVHxdtlmTZUpgps2cvPqVeJEtb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662844'),
  ('963687256431004822', 'Angels Fallen: Warriors of Peace', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Ali Zamani, Artur Gubin', 'Chris Kato, Ali Zamani', 'Josh Burdett, Arifin Putra, Cuba Gooding Jr., Michael Teh, Denise Richards, Randy Couture, Korrina Rico, Lee Kholafai', 'NR', 'When an Iraq War veteran receives a calling from a higher power, he embarks on a mission to stop a fallen angel from raising an army of the dead to take over the world.', 'When an Iraq War veteran receives a calling from a higher power, he embarks on a mission to stop a fallen angel from raising an army of the dead to take over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKdKUSGQ9E0G73WPr9xIHrofpkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058537'),
  ('585596229035175766', 'Angels Hard as They Come', 1971, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Joe Viola, Lorenzo Barzaghi, Stephen M. Katz', 'Jonathan Demme, Joe Viola', 'Scott Glenn, Charles Dierkop, James Iglehart, Gilda Texter, Gary Littlejohn, Gary Busey, Janet Wood, Don Carerra', 'R', 'A group of crazy bikers meet up with a group of drug-addicted hippies in a small town, but the two roving factions are soon at odds with one another and chaos ensues.', 'A group of crazy bikers meet up with a group of drug-addicted hippies in a small town, but the two roving factions are soon at odds with one another and chaos ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBY9tOiXhNejjlThosOtojnI1gn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29068'),
  ('1015248222090106282', 'Angels in Fast Motion', 2005, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ole Christian Madsen, Jørgen Johansson, Kathrine Windfeld', 'Ole Christian Madsen, Bo Hr. Hansen', 'Signe Egholm Olsen, Thure Lindhardt, Claus Riis Østergaard, Thomas L. Corneliussen, Signe Vaupel, Pernille Vallentin, Farshad Kholghi, Rudi Køhnke', null, 'The unflinching tale of Maria, Allan and Steso, who are struggling for survival. Maria is a pusher frau, wandering restlessly among addicts, abusers and bikers in a relentless search for love. Allan has just returned from an ill-fated trip across the Pacific and must reclaim his life and stay clean, but ghosts from his past return to haunt him. Steso, the intellectual, god-forsaken and prophetic cynic, does his utmost to unite the two polar opposites that give meaning to his life: his girl and drugs. All three try desperately to make some sense of the madness, but how do you find meaning in the chaos that is life? And how do you find love if you can''t recognize it?', 'The unflinching tale of Maria, Allan and Steso, who are struggling for survival. Maria is a pusher frau, wandering restlessly among addicts, abusers and bikers in a relentless search for love. Allan has just returned from an ill-fated trip across the Pacific and must reclaim his life and stay clean, but ghosts from his past return to haunt him. Steso, the intellectual, god-forsaken and prophetic cynic, does his utmost to unite the two polar opposites that give meaning to his life: his girl and drugs. All three try desperately to make some sense of the madness, but how do you find meaning in the chaos that is life? And how do you find love if you can''t recognize it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mARHol09nUcvhH9zAh3N4Scr5JO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14897'),
  ('1033633513508758498', 'Angels in the Endzone', 1997, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Ron Orieux, Gary Nadeau, Peter Dashkewytch', 'Alan Eisenstock, Larry Mintz', 'Paul Dooley, Matthew Lawrence, David Gallagher, Jack Coleman, Lynda Boyd, Allan Zinyk, Christopher Lloyd, Ken Kirzinger', 'G', 'The football team Jesse is on is terrible, and after the death of his father Jesse quits the team. Then angels come to help the team get better and nobody can see them but Jesse''s little brother.', 'The football team Jesse is on is terrible, and after the death of his father Jesse quits the team. Then angels come to help the team get better and nobody can see them but Jesse''s little brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CGoV5Lmw7Ex2jfizZTPPEZpHHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36986'),
  ('1073203329625178657', 'Angels in the Outfield', 1951, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Clarence Brown, Paul Vogel', 'Dorothy Kingsley, George Wells', 'Paul Douglas, Janet Leigh, Keenan Wynn, Donna Corcoran, Lewis Stone, Spring Byington, Bruce Bennett, Marvin Kaplan', null, 'The short-tempered manager of the Pittsburgh Pirates mends his ways in return for a little divine assistance.', 'The short-tempered manager of the Pittsburgh Pirates mends his ways in return for a little divine assistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72vL5Z7v0Mq0AfFiU1iL6tMHTID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45588'),
  ('602200153982448173', 'Angels in the Outfield', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, William Dear, L. Dean Jones Jr.', 'Dorothy Kingsley, Holly Goldberg Sloan, George Wells', 'Danny Glover, Tony Danza, Brenda Fricker, Ben Johnson, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Jay O. Sanders, Taylor Negron, Milton Davis Jr.', 'PG', 'Roger is a foster child whose irresponsible father promises to get his act together when Roger''s favourite baseball team, the California Angels, wins the pennant. The problem is that the Angels are in last place, so Roger prays for help to turn the team around. Sure enough, his prayers are answered in the form of angel Al.', 'Roger is a foster child whose irresponsible father promises to get his act together when Roger''s favourite baseball team, the California Angels, wins the pennant. The problem is that the Angels are in last place, so Roger prays for help to turn the team around. Sure enough, his prayers are answered in the form of angel Al.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WRt6l7tiXVPG9zLco1rwy5Ffw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24795'),
  ('1101355733515685302', 'Angels in the Snow', 2015, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Cliff Hokanson, George Erschbamer', 'Julie Brazier', 'Kristy Swanson, Chris Potter, Carolyn Adair, Lizzie Boys, Colin Lawrence, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Jaeda Lily Miller, Nick Purcha', null, 'In Angels in the Snow, the affluent, yet troubled Montgomery family hits the road for a special Christmas in the mountains.', 'In Angels in the Snow, the affluent, yet troubled Montgomery family hits the road for a special Christmas in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmMahviTDwv6uRehlGxWNbTuoOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365762'),
