  ('239164306119552294', 'Angels of Sex', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sergi Gallardo, Xavier Villaverde', 'Ana Maroto', 'Àstrid Bergès-Frisbey, Llorenç González, Álvaro Cervantes, Ricard Farré, Lluïsa Castell, Sonia Méndez, Marc García Coté, David Verdaguer', null, 'Carla and Bruno believe they have answers for everything until Rai appears in their lives, an attractive and mysterious young who lives outsidethe rules. In this story about love and friendship, boundaries dissolve by the rhythm of funkyand break to offer a provocative, exciting and deeply touching vision about romantic relationships.', 'Carla and Bruno believe they have answers for everything until Rai appears in their lives, an attractive and mysterious young who lives outsidethe rules. In this story about love and friendship, boundaries dissolve by the rhythm of funkyand break to offer a provocative, exciting and deeply touching vision about romantic relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syUzYJh4GaqoY6lRKBtlnFUqoYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104634'),
  ('785575103499763163', 'Angels of Sin', 1943, 'Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Philippe Agostini', 'Jean Giraudoux, Robert Bresson, Raymond Leopold Bruckberger', 'Renée Faure, Jany Holt, Sylvie, Mila Parély, Marie-Hélène Dasté, Yolande Laffon, Paula Dehelly, Silvia Monfort', null, 'A well-off young woman decides to become a nun, joining a convent that rehabilitates female prisoners. Through their program, she meets a woman named Thérèse who refuses any help because she says she was innocent of the crime she was convicted for. After being released from prison, Thérèse murders the actual perpetrator of the crime and comes to seek sanctuary in the convent.', 'A well-off young woman decides to become a nun, joining a convent that rehabilitates female prisoners. Through their program, she meets a woman named Thérèse who refuses any help because she says she was innocent of the crime she was convicted for. After being released from prison, Thérèse murders the actual perpetrator of the crime and comes to seek sanctuary in the convent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGSzltZQCBuOVVPlPHOUAi6WxNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55835'),
  ('976587989196296051', 'Angels of Terror', 1971, 'Thriller', 'Harald Philipp, Karl Löb', 'Horst Wendlandt, Harald Philipp', 'Uschi Glas, Hansjörg Felmy, Werner Peters, Harry Riebauer, Siegfried Schürenberg, Günther Stoll, Petra Schürmann, Friedrich Schoenfelder', null, 'An Australian woman arrives in London to search for her sister who she finds is involved with a heroin smuggling gang. The gang itself is under attack from an unknown rival, who is methodically assassinating them with a shot to the head.', 'An Australian woman arrives in London to search for her sister who she finds is involved with a heroin smuggling gang. The gang itself is under attack from an unknown rival, who is methodically assassinating them with a shot to the head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlnZxW3PMu0oxUWffQLQMY8LrkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70541'),
  ('304115168530233283', 'Angels of the Night', 1987, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Wilson Barros, José Roberto Eliezer, Alvaro Pedreira', 'Wilson Barros', 'Zezé Motta, Antônio Fagundes, Marco Nanini, Chiquinho Brandão, Aida Leiner, Cláudio Mamberti, Aldo Bueno, Ana Ramalho', null, 'Many exotic characters meet in São Paulo night, looking for love and adventure: Malu, a model; Mauro, a drag queen; Teddy, a hustler; Guto, a gay reporter; and Marta, an actress.', 'Many exotic characters meet in São Paulo night, looking for love and adventure: Malu, a model; Mauro, a drag queen; Teddy, a hustler; Guto, a gay reporter; and Marta, an actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lxbnWUUmQHPyVaxIhdCPS96RFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258206'),
  ('152308705322913603', 'Angels of the Sun', 2006, 'Drama', 'Rudi Lagemann, Tuca Moraes', 'Rudi Lagemann', 'Antonio Calloni, Otávio Augusto, Darlene Glória, Vera Holtz, Maurício Gonçalves, Chico Diaz, Bianca Comparato, Mary Sheila', null, 'In Northeastern Brazil, twelve-year-old Maria is sold to have a better life as a housemaid. However, Maria is resold and sent to a brothel in the Amazon gold fields and put to work by the despicable Saraiva.', 'In Northeastern Brazil, twelve-year-old Maria is sold to have a better life as a housemaid. However, Maria is resold and sent to a brothel in the Amazon gold fields and put to work by the despicable Saraiva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BEucdM9eJ27omJACKfwfhTGSa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37993'),
  ('583932969865134357', 'Angels of the Universe', 2000, 'Drama', 'Fridrik Thor Fridriksson, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', null, 'Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Baltasar Kormákur, Björn Jörundur Friðbjörnsson, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Thor Tulinius, Pétur Einarsson, Margrét Helga Jóhannsdóttir, Theodór Júlíusson', null, 'The story of an Icelandic man and his slow descent into madness. Along his journey he meets Dagný, the initial cause of his breakdown. Other people he meets in the asylum have been committed for various reasons, such as signing cheques for Adolf Hitler and, believing themselves to be writing songs for the Beatles and telepathically transmitting to the band.', 'The story of an Icelandic man and his slow descent into madness. Along his journey he meets Dagný, the initial cause of his breakdown. Other people he meets in the asylum have been committed for various reasons, such as signing cheques for Adolf Hitler and, believing themselves to be writing songs for the Beatles and telepathically transmitting to the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RViMuKJVmRamRLaO1wl3a5a3EL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20152'),
  ('485539843411632337', 'Angels One Five', 1952, 'Drama, War', 'Harold V. King, Gordon Scott, John Wooldridge', 'Derek N. Twist', 'Jack Hawkins, Michael Denison, John Gregson, Cyril Raymond, Veronica Hurst, Harold Goodwin, Geoffrey Keen, Philip Stainton', 'NR', 'The year is 1940 and Pilot Officer T.B. Baird arrives straight out of flight school to join a front line RAF squadron at the height of the Battle of Britain. After an unfortunate start and a drumming down from his commanding officer, Baird must balance the struggle to impress his Group Captain, regain his pride, fit in with his fellow pilots, and survive one of the most intense air battles in history.', 'The year is 1940 and Pilot Officer T.B. Baird arrives straight out of flight school to join a front line RAF squadron at the height of the Battle of Britain. After an unfortunate start and a drumming down from his commanding officer, Baird must balance the struggle to impress his Group Captain, regain his pride, fit in with his fellow pilots, and survive one of the most intense air battles in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1bBcmopZPDieHtBhuQcUkZ0TpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41312'),
  ('518186091798794330', 'Angels Over Broadway', 1940, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lee Garmes, Ben Hecht, Lee Garmes', 'Ben Hecht', 'Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Rita Hayworth, Thomas Mitchell, John Qualen, George Watts, Ralph Theodore, Eddie Foster, Jack Roper', 'NR', 'Small-time businessman Charles Engle is threatened with exposure for embezzling $3,000 for his free-spending wife. Deciding on suicide, he scribbles a note, stuffs it in his pocket and goes for one last night on the town. He is pulled into a poker game by conman Bill O''Brien and singer Nina Barone, but when they discover the dropped note, they resolve to turn the tables, get Engle his $3,000 and save his life.', 'Small-time businessman Charles Engle is threatened with exposure for embezzling $3,000 for his free-spending wife. Deciding on suicide, he scribbles a note, stuffs it in his pocket and goes for one last night on the town. He is pulled into a poker game by conman Bill O''Brien and singer Nina Barone, but when they discover the dropped note, they resolve to turn the tables, get Engle his $3,000 and save his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nee1LVYfgKE6fWrXNzi94fl2PAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42756'),
  ('384254087066022877', 'Angels Sing', 2013, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Tim McCanlies, Kamal Derkaoui', 'Lou Berney', 'Harry Connick Jr., Connie Britton, Chandler Canterbury, Fionnula Flanagan, Lyle Lovett, Willie Nelson, Kris Kristofferson, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson', 'PG', 'As a child, Michael Walker wished every day could be Christmas. That is, until a tragic accident crushed his holiday spirit. Thirty years later, Michael still can''t muster any joy for the holidays, despite encouragement from his playful wife and well-intentioned parents. But when his young son faces a tragedy, Michael needs to make amends with his past. A mysterious man named Nick gives Michael a gift and instills in him the courage to find the joy that he lost.', 'As a child, Michael Walker wished every day could be Christmas. That is, until a tragic accident crushed his holiday spirit. Thirty years later, Michael still can''t muster any joy for the holidays, despite encouragement from his playful wife and well-intentioned parents. But when his young son faces a tragedy, Michael needs to make amends with his past. A mysterious man named Nick gives Michael a gift and instills in him the courage to find the joy that he lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQMtS4bUyufS8hivsYKLM2Ctcqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57210'),
  ('287136953829870629', 'Angels Wear White', 2017, 'Drama', 'Vivian Qu, Benoît Dervaux', 'Vivian Qu', 'Wen Qi, Zhou Meijun, Shi Ke, Geng Le, Liu Weiwei, Peng Jing, Wang Yuexin, Li Mengnan', 'NR', 'In a small seaside town, two schoolgirls are assaulted by a middle-aged man in a motel. Mia, a teenager who was working on reception that night, is the only witness. For fear of losing her job, she says nothing. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Wen, one of the victims, finds that her troubles have only just begun. Trapped in a world that offers them no safety, Mia and Wen will have to find their own way out.', 'In a small seaside town, two schoolgirls are assaulted by a middle-aged man in a motel. Mia, a teenager who was working on reception that night, is the only witness. For fear of losing her job, she says nothing. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Wen, one of the victims, finds that her troubles have only just begun. Trapped in a world that offers them no safety, Mia and Wen will have to find their own way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpATMFID3lzxoLUyqZa65634vet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468208'),
  ('75035367749672130', 'Angels with Dirty Faces', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Sol Polito, Sherry Shourds', 'Charles MacArthur, Ben Hecht', 'James Cagney, Pat O''Brien, Humphrey Bogart, Ann Sheridan, George Bancroft, Billy Halop, Bobby Jordan, Leo Gorcey', 'NR', 'Childhood chums Rocky Sullivan and Jerry Connelly grow up on opposite sides of the fence: Rocky matures into a prominent gangster, while Jerry becomes a priest, tending to the needs of his old tenement neighborhood.', 'Childhood chums Rocky Sullivan and Jerry Connelly grow up on opposite sides of the fence: Rocky matures into a prominent gangster, while Jerry becomes a priest, tending to the needs of his old tenement neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k23E4UAcow8eczLRmVCMdukL4Mx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13696'),
  ('310301634053181613', 'Angels with Dirty Wings', 2009, 'Drama', 'Roland Reber, Mira Gittner, Roland Reber', 'Roland Reber', 'Antje Mönning, Marina Anna Eich, Mira Gittner, Martin Kagerer, Patricia Koch, Maren Scholz', null, 'Three women - no moral. Morality is the excuse for those who don''t dare to live their truth.Michaela, Gabriela and Lucy are angels of vice. On their motorbikes they ride through the countryside to live their pleasure. They could see a lot, but only see themselves. They call themselves angels but they are angels with dirty wings. To be a full member in the exile paradise of angels, Lucy has to prove herself and stand the tests. The new film of Roland Reber and Mira Gittner is an anthem of immorality. A holy song of egoism and a painful study about our time and a generation who rent their feelings.', 'Three women - no moral. Morality is the excuse for those who don''t dare to live their truth.Michaela, Gabriela and Lucy are angels of vice. On their motorbikes they ride through the countryside to live their pleasure. They could see a lot, but only see themselves. They call themselves angels but they are angels with dirty wings. To be a full member in the exile paradise of angels, Lucy has to prove herself and stand the tests. The new film of Roland Reber and Mira Gittner is an anthem of immorality. A holy song of egoism and a painful study about our time and a generation who rent their feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycAYQbWbPTYw9XZx1Xs64yzbfOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76660'),
  ('550366068901865185', 'Angels'' Brigade', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Greydon Clark, Dean Cundey', 'Alvin L. Fast, Greydon Clark', 'Sylvia Anderson, Lieu Chinh, Jacqulin Cole, Liza Greer, Robin Greer, Susan Kiger, Noela Velasco, Jack Palance', 'PG', 'Six sexy women, and a teenage girl, devastate a right-wing militia before doing battle with ruthless drug pushers.', 'Six sexy women, and a teenage girl, devastate a right-wing militia before doing battle with ruthless drug pushers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4TzXV6PiMndm1Hdm3Uvs9cVHZ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31251'),
  ('695821616857037622', 'Angels'' Wild Women', 1972, 'Horror, Action', 'Al Adamson', 'Al Adamson', 'Ross Hagen, Kent Taylor, Preston Pierce, Regina Carrol, William Bonner, Arne Warde, Jill Woelfel, Vicki Volante', 'R', 'These angels don''t wear halos. After stomping the lights out on a couple of racist rapists, some tough biker babes take refuge in a rural commune run by a peace-loving guru who''s actually a drug kingpin with a vicious gang -- and who specializes in human sacrifices.', 'These angels don''t wear halos. After stomping the lights out on a couple of racist rapists, some tough biker babes take refuge in a rural commune run by a peace-loving guru who''s actually a drug kingpin with a vicious gang -- and who specializes in human sacrifices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTE2bM866Z5Pjv9VkIXL4wJgzFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89146'),
  ('927181174665361651', 'Anger', 2008, 'Drama', 'Albertina Carri', 'Albertina Carri', 'Analía Couceyro, Víctor Hugo Carrizo, Nazarena Duarte, Dalma Maradona, Gonzalo Pérez, Javier Lorenzo', null, 'A married woman with a mute daughter has a forbidden relationship with the single father of a teenage boy.', 'A married woman with a mute daughter has a forbidden relationship with the single father of a teenage boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjQZdYXj7fqAyhGnXJT6dZWlY3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83748'),
  ('167723779099413508', 'Anger Management', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Peter Segal, Donald McAlpine, Joseph J. Kontra', 'David Dorfman', 'Adam Sandler, Jack Nicholson, Marisa Tomei, Luis Guzmán, Allen Covert, Lynne Thigpen, Kurt Fuller, Jonathan Loughran', 'PG-13', 'After a small misunderstanding aboard an airplane escalates out of control, timid businessman Dave Buznik is ordered by the court to undergo anger management therapy at the hands of specialist Dr. Buddy Rydell. But when Buddy steps up his aggressive treatment by moving in, Dave goes from mild to wild as the unorthodox treatment wreaks havoc with his life.', 'After a small misunderstanding aboard an airplane escalates out of control, timid businessman Dave Buznik is ordered by the court to undergo anger management therapy at the hands of specialist Dr. Buddy Rydell. But when Buddy steps up his aggressive treatment by moving in, Dave goes from mild to wild as the unorthodox treatment wreaks havoc with his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wX3S5HjL3bgb2yi4CfR2qIqbdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9506'),
  ('248995709080426913', 'Angie', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge, Johnny E. Jensen, Julie A. Bloom', 'Todd Graff', 'Geena Davis, Stephen Rea, James Gandolfini, Aida Turturro, Philip Bosco, Jenny O''Hara, Michael Rispoli, Betty Miller', null, 'Angie lives in Bensonhurst, Brooklyn, and dreams of a better life. When she finds out she''s pregnant by her boyfriend, Vinnie, she decides she''ll have the baby; but not Vinnie as a husband. This turns the entire close-knit neighborhood upside-down and starts Angie on a journey of self-discovery.', 'Angie lives in Bensonhurst, Brooklyn, and dreams of a better life. When she finds out she''s pregnant by her boyfriend, Vinnie, she decides she''ll have the baby; but not Vinnie as a husband. This turns the entire close-knit neighborhood upside-down and starts Angie on a journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7B8snyynp1iOBYiGx76V3TOdKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83714'),
  ('1014004523539419550', 'Angie: Lost Girls', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Julia Verdin, Peter A. Holland', 'Julia Verdin, Janet Odogwu', 'Olivia D''Abo, Randall Batinkoff, Jane Widdop, Dylan Sprayberry, Anthony Montgomery, Betzaida Landín, Cherie Jimenez, MC Lyte', null, 'After escaping from a sex trafficking ring, one teenage girl struggles to reconnect with herself and her family. To rescue her helpless friends, she must confront her own fears and help lead the police to her traffickers - at all costs.', 'After escaping from a sex trafficking ring, one teenage girl struggles to reconnect with herself and her family. To rescue her helpless friends, she must confront her own fears and help lead the police to her traffickers - at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejRsqy2FVz2G6rEyLfn9SzMCRj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776047'),
  ('219347274055003123', 'Angkinin Mo Ako', 2026, 'Drama', 'Topel Lee', null, 'Cess Garcia, Sheena Cole, Juan Calma, Dara Lima, Sarah Pulido', null, 'Cess Garcia and VMX’s next big thing Dara Lima star in a steamy drama about two sisters and the man who sparks their sensual awakening. A female lawyer hires a young man as tutor for her younger sister but unknown to her, their review sessions are becoming wild', 'Cess Garcia and VMX’s next big thing Dara Lima star in a steamy drama about two sisters and the man who sparks their sensual awakening. A female lawyer hires a young man as tutor for her younger sister but unknown to her, their review sessions are becoming wild', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YZ24F49pRkNb45YWI6yckrTYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1597538'),
  ('860368680463937789', 'Angoor', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Gulzar, Arjun Chakraborty', 'Gulzar', 'Sanjeev Kumar, Deven Verma, Moushumi Chatterjee, Aruna Irani, Deepti Naval, Utpal Dutt, Shammi, C.S. Dubey', null, 'Two pairs of identical twins are separated following an unfortunate incident. However, years later, their lives intertwine, leading to confusion and misunderstandings. Based on William Shakespeare''s ''A Comedy Of Errors''.', 'Two pairs of identical twins are separated following an unfortunate incident. However, years later, their lives intertwine, leading to confusion and misunderstandings. Based on William Shakespeare''s ''A Comedy Of Errors''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wijF2sW1MDq9c1u5m9ezealO9KC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21984'),
  ('69306044264737356', 'Angora Love', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Lewis R. Foster', 'Leo McCarey', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Harry Bernard, Charlie Hall, Edgar Kennedy, Charley Young', 'NR', 'Stanley and Oliver are adopted by a runaway goat, whose noise and aroma in turn get the goat of their suspicious landlord.', 'Stanley and Oliver are adopted by a runaway goat, whose noise and aroma in turn get the goat of their suspicious landlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vw0TKUtkCRLL1CYQ8AfMftW0SVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50855'),
  ('1146569029334289952', 'Angrezi Medium', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arunima Sharma, Homi Adajania, Paran Bawa', null, 'Irrfan Khan, Radhikka Madan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Dimple Kapadia, Pankaj Tripathi, Deepak Dobriyal, Manu Rishi Chadha, Ranvir Shorey', null, 'When his daughter decides to further her studies in London, a hardworking Haryanvi businessman does everything in power to make her dreams come true.', 'When his daughter decides to further her studies in London, a hardworking Haryanvi businessman does everything in power to make her dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT41Fi3NAqkPpNkWt7imaOtxGDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606717'),
  ('356714885377053802', 'Angry Annie', 2022, 'Drama', 'Blandine Lenoir, Emilie Adroguer, Thibault Frey', 'Blandine Lenoir, Axelle Ropert', 'Laure Calamy, Zita Hanrot, India Hair, Rosemary Standley, Damien Chapelle, Yannick Choirat, Florence Muller, Cédric Appietto', null, 'Annie becomes pregnant. Since she doesn''t want to keep the child, she meets a movement that performs illegal abortions. But, in the seventies, Annie will encounter allies and opponents along the way.', 'Annie becomes pregnant. Since she doesn''t want to keep the child, she meets a movement that performs illegal abortions. But, in the seventies, Annie will encounter allies and opponents along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfd6TH4B8QgJbxt7FTDNPA68bHF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950849'),
  ('678705765995629794', 'Angry Harvest', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnieszka Holland, Jozef Ort-Šnep', 'Agnieszka Holland, Paul Hengge', 'Armin Mueller-Stahl, Elisabeth Trissenaar, Wojciech Pszoniak, Gerd Baltus, Käte Jaenicke, Margit Carstensen, Kurt Raab, Tilly Lauenstein', null, 'In the winter of 1942-43, a Jewish family leaps from a train going through Silesia. They are separated in the woods, and Leon, a local peasant who''s now a farmer of some wealth, discovers the woman, Rosa, and hides her in his cellar. Leon''s a middle-aged Catholic bachelor, tormented by his sexual drive. He doesn''t tell Rosa he''s seen signs her husband is alive, and he begs her to love him. Rosa offers herself to Leon if he''ll help a local Jew in hiding who needs money. Leon pays, and love between Rosa and him does develop, but then Leon''s peasant subservience and his limited empathy lead to tragedy. At the war''s end, a ray of sunshine comes from an unexpected place.', 'In the winter of 1942-43, a Jewish family leaps from a train going through Silesia. They are separated in the woods, and Leon, a local peasant who''s now a farmer of some wealth, discovers the woman, Rosa, and hides her in his cellar. Leon''s a middle-aged Catholic bachelor, tormented by his sexual drive. He doesn''t tell Rosa he''s seen signs her husband is alive, and he begs her to love him. Rosa offers herself to Leon if he''ll help a local Jew in hiding who needs money. Leon pays, and love between Rosa and him does develop, but then Leon''s peasant subservience and his limited empathy lead to tragedy. At the war''s end, a ray of sunshine comes from an unexpected place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iNArCw1DuOC2V5FK5C0FbLw1Et.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42032'),
  ('372910470108253648', 'Angry Indian Goddesses', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neeraj Kumar Singh, Pan Nalin, Swapnil S. Sonawane', 'Pan Nalin, Subhadra Mahajan, Dilip Shankar', 'Sarah-Jane Dias, Rajshri Deshpande, Sandhya Mridul, Amy Maghera, Pavleen Gujral, Tannishtha Chatterjee, Anushka Manchanda, Jeffrey Goldberg', null, 'A photographer invites her closest friends to vacation at her family''s home in Goa in celebration of her upcoming marriage.', 'A photographer invites her closest friends to vacation at her family''s home in Goa in celebration of her upcoming marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn7kTThiHtZHp7CAdpGSS9ik4ly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358893'),
  ('346721663385974453', 'Angry Video Game Nerd: The Movie', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Kevin Finn, Jason Brewer, James D. Rolfe', 'Kevin Finn, James D. Rolfe', 'James D. Rolfe, Jeremy Suarez, Sarah Glendening, Stephen Mendel, Helena Barrett, Time Winters, Nathan Barnatt, Bear McCreary', 'R', 'Based on the hit web series of the same name, a disgruntled gamer must overcome his fear of the worst video game of all time in order to save his fans. Hilarity ensues as a simple road trip becomes an extravagant pursuit of the unexpected.', 'Based on the hit web series of the same name, a disgruntled gamer must overcome his fear of the worst video game of all time in order to save his fans. Hilarity ensues as a simple road trip becomes an extravagant pursuit of the unexpected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXEKVaCbCUd53CYKkI0B7u1LBB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94590'),
  ('169821662802349400', 'Angst', 1983, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Gerald Kargl, Zbigniew Rybczyński, Dusty Sprengnagel', 'Gerald Kargl, Zbigniew Rybczyński', 'Erwin Leder, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Silvia Rabenreither, Karin Springer, Edith Rosset, Josefine Lakatha, Rudolf Götz, Renate Kastelik', null, 'A killer is released from prison and breaks into a remote home to kill a woman, her handicapped son and her pretty daughter.', 'A killer is released from prison and breaks into a remote home to kill a woman, her handicapped son and her pretty daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSYdWrPPwvcs5t5hG67XqDbwncG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18912'),
  ('346199100433290403', 'Angst', 2003, 'Drama', 'Oskar Roehler, Hagen Bogdanski', 'Oskar Roehler', 'André Hennicke, Marie Bäumer, Vadim Glowna, Ralf Bauer, Jutta Hoffmann, Hermann Beyer, Christoph Waltz, Herbert Knaup', null, 'Oskar Roehler''s drama Der Alte Affe Angst (Angst) is about the dissolution of a couple. Robert (Andre Hennicke) and Marie (Marie Baumer) have little in common other than their sex life. Since Robert is going through a bout with impotency, they are having a very rocky time. Robert learns that his father, whom he is estranged from, has died. This disturbs Robert so much that he visits a prostitute, and is able to engage in sex with her. Marie discovers the infidelity, and the prostitute has a surprise of her own. Angst was screened at the 2003 Berlin Film Festival.', 'Oskar Roehler''s drama Der Alte Affe Angst (Angst) is about the dissolution of a couple. Robert (Andre Hennicke) and Marie (Marie Baumer) have little in common other than their sex life. Since Robert is going through a bout with impotency, they are having a very rocky time. Robert learns that his father, whom he is estranged from, has died. This disturbs Robert so much that he visits a prostitute, and is able to engage in sex with her. Marie discovers the infidelity, and the prostitute has a surprise of her own. Angst was screened at the 2003 Berlin Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzuBDIhiuwXGWymL4hntHbU4ftk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10717'),
  ('549059211868532026', 'Anguish', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bigas Luna, Josep M. Civit', 'Bigas Luna', 'Zelda Rubinstein, Michael Lerner, Talia Paul, Àngel Jové, Clara Pastor, Isabel García Lorca, Vicente Gil, Víctor Guillén', 'R', 'An ophthalmologist''s assistant with an unhealthy interest in human eyeballs goes on a killing spree to collect eyeballs for his overbearing mother''s collection. Reality soon takes a bizarre turn, both for the characters and the audience.', 'An ophthalmologist''s assistant with an unhealthy interest in human eyeballs goes on a killing spree to collect eyeballs for his overbearing mother''s collection. Reality soon takes a bizarre turn, both for the characters and the audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcgTyhl00GDmlKyZvEOJ3qDxEgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42002'),
  ('494859261217287539', 'Anguish', 2015, 'Horror', 'Sonny Mallhi, Amanda Treyz, Laura Klein', 'Sonny Mallhi', 'Ryan Simpkins, Annika Marks, Karina Logue, Amberley Gridley, Cliff Chamberlain, Ryan O''Nan, Paulina Olszynski, Christian Litke', null, 'A new girl in a quiet town, Tess tries to manage her psychosis while adjusting to her new life with her mom. After stumbling upon the shrine of Lucy, a hit and run victim, Tess finds herself overwhelmed by hallucinations of the dead girl and starts to question her sanity again. When the spirit possesses Tess’s mind and soul, mother and daughter are at a loss for where to turn next for salvation: religion or medicine? Both institutions have failed them to date but faith leads them to the house of Sarah, Lucy’s mother, who has been despondent since the accident. All together with time working against them, Sarah is desperate to believe that Lucy is still alive in Tess but neither parent wants to give up on their daughter. Now that she understands what is happening to her, ultimately Tess must decide whether she wants to keep fighting or succumb to her affliction.', 'A new girl in a quiet town, Tess tries to manage her psychosis while adjusting to her new life with her mom. After stumbling upon the shrine of Lucy, a hit and run victim, Tess finds herself overwhelmed by hallucinations of the dead girl and starts to question her sanity again. When the spirit possesses Tess’s mind and soul, mother and daughter are at a loss for where to turn next for salvation: religion or medicine? Both institutions have failed them to date but faith leads them to the house of Sarah, Lucy’s mother, who has been despondent since the accident. All together with time working against them, Sarah is desperate to believe that Lucy is still alive in Tess but neither parent wants to give up on their daughter. Now that she understands what is happening to her, ultimately Tess must decide whether she wants to keep fighting or succumb to her affliction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8B3CIbIuxWhPf0G19lse4mJrLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347944'),
  ('491835837326329185', 'Angus', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Patrick Read Johnson, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Jill Gordon', 'Charlie Talbert, Kathy Bates, Chris Owen, James Van Der Beek, Robert Curtis Brown, George C. Scott, Kevin Connolly, Tony Denman', 'PG-13', 'Angus is a large, pathetic 14-year-old whose thoughts are most often filled with the image of only one girl, Melissa Lefevre. Angus is shy and thinks that he has no chance of ever ''getting'' her. Being especially uncool, he is incredibly surprised (along with the rest of the school) that he is chosen to dance with her at the Winter Ball. The only one not surprised is the cool kid who set him up to fail, but Angus'' best friend is going to help him win the heart of Melissa by developing a new look for him', 'Angus is a large, pathetic 14-year-old whose thoughts are most often filled with the image of only one girl, Melissa Lefevre. Angus is shy and thinks that he has no chance of ever ''getting'' her. Being especially uncool, he is incredibly surprised (along with the rest of the school) that he is chosen to dance with her at the Winter Ball. The only one not surprised is the cool kid who set him up to fail, but Angus'' best friend is going to help him win the heart of Melissa by developing a new look for him', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1Py4TB8Y0Wx9IZ62derpSDqwjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25969'),
  ('1129369524769250076', 'Angus, Thongs and Perfect Snogging', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Gurinder Chadha, Dick Pope', 'Gurinder Chadha, Paul Mayeda Berges, Will McRobb', 'Georgia Groome, Eleanor Tomlinson, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Tommy Bastow, Alan Davies, Karen Taylor, Liam Hess, Georgia Henshaw', 'PG-13', 'Georgia Nicolson is fourteen, lives with nosey parents who don''t understand her, an annoying three year old sister and has to wear a beret to school. She would, however, rather be blonde, have a smaller nose and a boyfriend. Revolving around her hilarious journal entries, prepare to be engulfed in the world of the soaring joys and bottomless angst of being a teenager.', 'Georgia Nicolson is fourteen, lives with nosey parents who don''t understand her, an annoying three year old sister and has to wear a beret to school. She would, however, rather be blonde, have a smaller nose and a boyfriend. Revolving around her hilarious journal entries, prepare to be engulfed in the world of the soaring joys and bottomless angst of being a teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WLMr49X84qGiFn1pkCyhS5SEBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12689'),
  ('89976622967495789', 'Ani*Kuri15', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Shinji Kimura, Shojiro Nishimi, Akemi Hayashi', 'Shoji Kawamori, Michael Arias, Satoshi Kon', 'Aika Kanda, Toshio Watanabe', null, '15 one-minute shorts created by various people from Japan''s animation industry. The title of the collection, Ani*Kuri15, is abbreviated from the words "anime" and "creators".', '15 one-minute shorts created by various people from Japan''s animation industry. The title of the collection, Ani*Kuri15, is abbreviated from the words "anime" and "creators".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YrTQAKVJaDUgDOVevZ0LJbhJGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262833'),
  ('1084506363005130479', 'Aniara', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Sophie Winqvist, Pella Kågerman, Hugo Lilja', 'Pella Kågerman, Hugo Lilja', 'Emelie Jonsson, Arvin Kananian, Bianca Cruzeiro, Anneli Martini, Jennie Silfverhjelm, Peter Carlberg, Emma Broomé, Jamil Drissi', 'R', 'A ship carrying settlers to a new home on Mars after Earth is rendered uninhabitable is knocked off-course, causing the passengers to consider their place in the universe.', 'A ship carrying settlers to a new home on Mars after Earth is rendered uninhabitable is knocked off-course, causing the passengers to consider their place in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEpEJe8NTmwWL0hwYkZguTzEqzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496743'),
  ('1139407655899362113', 'Aniki-Bóbó', 1942, 'Drama, Family', 'Manoel de Oliveira, António Mendes, Manuel Guimarães', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Horácio Silva, Fernanda Matos, António Santos, Nascimento Fernandes, Vital dos Santos, António Palma, Armando Pedro, António Soares', null, 'Two schoolboys, Carlitos and Eduardo, fight for the affection of a girl, Teresinha.', 'Two schoolboys, Carlitos and Eduardo, fight for the affection of a girl, Teresinha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3ALny6no1YHFZ7DaKNKEhlpMuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81210'),
  ('996156694457020088', 'Aníkúlápó', 2022, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Kunle Afolayan, Jonathan Kovel', 'Shola Dada', 'Kunle Remi, Bimbo Ademoye, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Sola Sobowale, Taiwo Hassan, Adebayo Salami, Moji Afolayan, Adebowale Adedayo', 'R', 'After an affair with a queen leads to his demise, an eager traveler encounters a mystical bird with the power to give him another life.', 'After an affair with a queen leads to his demise, an eager traveler encounters a mystical bird with the power to give him another life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xb30hkUpBm23stnVgDJGYGsC0R0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023994'),
  ('1026913370562655895', 'Anima', 2019, 'Music', 'Aliosha Cheyko, Petr Heinrich, Matěj Blahovec', null, 'Thom Yorke, Dajana Roncione, Frida Dam Seidel, Joseba Yerro Izaguirre, Jean Michael Sinisterra Munoz, Takuya Fujisawa, Valerija Kuzmica, Dorotea Saykaly', null, 'In a short musical film directed by Paul Thomas Anderson, Thom Yorke of Radiohead stars in a mind-bending visual piece. Best played loud.', 'In a short musical film directed by Paul Thomas Anderson, Thom Yorke of Radiohead stars in a mind-bending visual piece. Best played loud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCBOjFAzsz8d2kABIPfwIAOeJ5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610120'),
  ('1093928127228484996', 'Anima bella', 2022, 'Drama', 'Dario Albertini, Giuseppe Maio', 'Simone Ranucci, Dario Albertini', 'Madalina Di Fabio, Luciano Miele, Enzo Casertano, Elisabetta Rocchetti, Piera Degli Esposti, Paola Lavini, Antonio Noto, Alessandra Scirdi', null, 'Gioia has just turned 18. She lives with her father Bruno in a small country village where she works as a shepherdess. They live very simply yet harmoniously with the villagers. Their lives are disrupted when Bruno gives in once again and once too many to his gambling addiction, in spite of his efforts to quit. Gioia will have to follow him to a faraway town, where he will be treated in a specialized center. This will radically change her existence, forcing her to abandon the safety of the village, her friends and her habits. She will be all by herself to support her father, in his journey for a better life.', 'Gioia has just turned 18. She lives with her father Bruno in a small country village where she works as a shepherdess. They live very simply yet harmoniously with the villagers. Their lives are disrupted when Bruno gives in once again and once too many to his gambling addiction, in spite of his efforts to quit. Gioia will have to follow him to a faraway town, where he will be treated in a specialized center. This will radically change her existence, forcing her to abandon the safety of the village, her friends and her habits. She will be all by herself to support her father, in his journey for a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p04NWuYEuwMcbdXyKSgH9ucbQB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873095'),
  ('497137840486478709', 'Anima Mundi', 1991, 'Documentary, Music', 'Godfrey Reggio, Graham Berry', 'Godfrey Reggio', null, null, 'Image and music are intertwined in this third collaboration between director Godfrey Reggio and composer Philip Glass. The film was produced to celebrate the World Wildlife Fund''s Biological Diversity Campaign. The film combines images of nature with pulsing rhythms in a Microcosmos (1996) meets Koyaanisqatsi (1983) spectacle.', 'Image and music are intertwined in this third collaboration between director Godfrey Reggio and composer Philip Glass. The film was produced to celebrate the World Wildlife Fund''s Biological Diversity Campaign. The film combines images of nature with pulsing rhythms in a Microcosmos (1996) meets Koyaanisqatsi (1983) spectacle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3y1G5CDFGtw7XMp3XyRzoHBvGE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54220'),
  ('645083563520875468', 'Animal', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Claude Renoir, Claude Zidi', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Raquel Welch, Dany Saval, Charles Gérard, Raymond Gérôme, Julien Guiomar, Aldo Maccione, Mario David', null, 'Mike (Jean-Paul Belmondo) is a stuntman who works with his girlfriend Jane (Raquel Welch). On their wedding day Mike and Jane are forced by producers to do a stunt for a film they are working on. Mike, annoyed doesn''t look on the road and crashes the car causing them to end up in a hospital. After they come out Jane doesn''t want to talk to Mike so he decides to get her a job in a film in which he is a stunt double for his double who is a star in action pictures but is in fact a wimp.', 'Mike (Jean-Paul Belmondo) is a stuntman who works with his girlfriend Jane (Raquel Welch). On their wedding day Mike and Jane are forced by producers to do a stunt for a film they are working on. Mike, annoyed doesn''t look on the road and crashes the car causing them to end up in a hospital. After they come out Jane doesn''t want to talk to Mike so he decides to get her a job in a film in which he is a stunt double for his double who is a star in action pictures but is in fact a wimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeDhwzAfaMkKqa91mtbUWLzS2Cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8767'),
  ('131085464604417010', 'Animal', 2005, 'Action, Drama', 'David J. Burke, PJ López', null, 'Ving Rhames, Terrence Howard, Jim Brown, Chazz Palminteri, Beverly Todd, Taraji P. Henson, Junior Álvarez, Rafa Alvarez', 'R', 'His name: infamous. His reputation: ruthless. But when James "Animal"Allen is locked up in a maximum security prison, he meets a revolutionary who changes his life. Now a reformed man, James is released only to find that his own son has assumed a life of crime and violence. Can a father haunted by his past redeem his family from the very streets he created, or will he be forced to make the ultimate sacrifice?', 'His name: infamous. His reputation: ruthless. But when James "Animal"Allen is locked up in a maximum security prison, he meets a revolutionary who changes his life. Now a reformed man, James is released only to find that his own son has assumed a life of crime and violence. Can a father haunted by his past redeem his family from the very streets he created, or will he be forced to make the ultimate sacrifice?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0r2kdF3TitkTxAwb0kKdsTfIvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10252'),
  ('187213474203796238', 'Animal', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Brett Simmons, Scott Winig', 'Catherine Trillo, Thommy Hutson', 'Joey Lauren Adams, Elizabeth Gillies, Paul Iacono, Thorsten Kaye, Amaury Nolasco, Keke Palmer, Jeremy Sumpter, Parker Young', 'NR', 'When plans for a weekend vacation hit a dead end, a group of close-knit friends find themselves stranded in unfamiliar territory, pursued by a menacing predator. Holed up in an isolated cabin, tensions mount as long-buried secrets are revealed. As the body count rises, the group must put their differences aside and fight for survival.', 'When plans for a weekend vacation hit a dead end, a group of close-knit friends find themselves stranded in unfamiliar territory, pursued by a menacing predator. Holed up in an isolated cabin, tensions mount as long-buried secrets are revealed. As the body count rises, the group must put their differences aside and fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAWZHSV5C6EOPuG2zVG9fISO5tQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274626'),
  ('136416914260315570', 'Animal', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Chino Fernández, Armando Bo, Julián Calviño', 'Armando Bo, Nicolás Giacobone', 'Guillermo Francella, Carla Peterson, Federico Salles, Mercedes De Santis, Gloria Carrá, Marcelo Subiotto, Majo Chicar, Joaquín Flamini', null, 'Antonio Decoud is a conservative family man who is forced by destiny to face an unexpected situation that shakes him to the core, scrambling up his life and his priorities, pushing him to forget his beliefs and his way of understanding life and follow the most basic instinct: the animal instinct.', 'Antonio Decoud is a conservative family man who is forced by destiny to face an unexpected situation that shakes him to the core, scrambling up his life and his priorities, pushing him to forget his beliefs and his way of understanding life and follow the most basic instinct: the animal instinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL44SbXxd4arcHeM7KiukuVmeIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499925'),
  ('1057473250114390445', 'Animal', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Cyril Dion, Alexandre Léglise', 'Walter Bouvais', 'Jane Goodall, Bella Lack, Vipulan Puvaneswaran', null, '16-year-old Bella and Vipulan are part of a generation convinced its very future is in danger. Between climate change and the 6th mass extinction of wildlife, their world could well be inhabitable 50 years from now. They have sounded the alarm over and over, but nothing has really changed. So they’ve decided to tackle the root of the problem: our relationship with the living world. Over the course of an extraordinary journey, they come to realize just how deeply humans are tied to all other living species. And that by saving them… we’re also saving ourselves. Humans thought they could distance themselves from nature, but humans are part and parcel of nature. For man is, after all, an Animal.', '16-year-old Bella and Vipulan are part of a generation convinced its very future is in danger. Between climate change and the 6th mass extinction of wildlife, their world could well be inhabitable 50 years from now. They have sounded the alarm over and over, but nothing has really changed. So they’ve decided to tackle the root of the problem: our relationship with the living world. Over the course of an extraordinary journey, they come to realize just how deeply humans are tied to all other living species. And that by saving them… we’re also saving ourselves. Humans thought they could distance themselves from nature, but humans are part and parcel of nature. For man is, after all, an Animal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJhxPbRXfuSg3X63hJBWKdsW7K7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842354'),
  ('542504285835760000', 'Animal', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Amit Roy, Mariya Doma, Anmol Raina', 'Sandeep Reddy Vanga, Suresh Bandaru, Pranay Reddy Vanga', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Rashmika Mandanna, Anil Kapoor, Bobby Deol, Triptii Dimri, Prem Chopra, Suresh Oberoi, Shakti Kapoor', 'R', 'The hardened son of a powerful industrialist returns home after years abroad and vows to take bloody revenge on those threatening his father''s life.', 'The hardened son of a powerful industrialist returns home after years abroad and vows to take bloody revenge on those threatening his father''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hr9rjR3J0xBBKmlJ4n3gHId9ccx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781732'),
  ('854719824974876211', 'Animal 2', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Ryan Combs', null, 'Ving Rhames, K.C. Collins, Vicellous Shannon, Clé Bennett, Kevin Duhaney, Yannick Bisson, Deborah Valente, Conrad Dunn', 'R', 'Now serving a life sentence for murder, James "Animal" Allen returns to fighting for cash in order to help his troubled son on the outside. However, with his newfound fame as a fighter, Animal uncovers a jailhouse conspiracy that threatens to cause racial tensions to explode.', 'Now serving a life sentence for murder, James "Animal" Allen returns to fighting for cash in order to help his troubled son on the outside. However, with his newfound fame as a fighter, Animal uncovers a jailhouse conspiracy that threatens to cause racial tensions to explode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18qUe5ONoyIVtO3eShRRqVouvoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13202'),
  ('500640407661997612', 'Animal Attraction: Carnal Desires', 1999, 'Romance', 'Eric Haase, Eric Gibson, Jeff Spielman', 'D. Ray Morton', 'Tamara Landry, Steven Ginsburg, Susan Featherly, Peggy Trentini, Mia Zottoli, Louis Moorpark, Michael Patrick', 'R', 'A massage parlor gets way more business than it can handle when Mick, an excellent and handsome masseur, begins working there. He quickly gets a reputation for being one of the best in the business and suddenly finds himself unable to satisfy his customers'' growing demands. He also wants to open his own business. But he is forced to choose between his loyalties and his desires.', 'A massage parlor gets way more business than it can handle when Mick, an excellent and handsome masseur, begins working there. He quickly gets a reputation for being one of the best in the business and suddenly finds himself unable to satisfy his customers'' growing demands. He also wants to open his own business. But he is forced to choose between his loyalties and his desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQGOxfkEWc62VGJXq9WU0Twm3ai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39351'),
  ('546369641984866001', 'Animal Behaviour', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Alison Snowden, David Fine', 'Alison Snowden, David Fine', 'Ryan Beil, Taz Van Rassel, Leah Juel, Andrea Libman, James Kirk, Alison Snowden, Toby Berner', null, 'Five animals meet regularly to discuss their inner angst in a group therapy session led by Dr. Clement, a canine psychotherapist. The group includes Lorraine, a leech who suffers from separation anxiety; Cheryl, a praying mantis who can’t seem to keep a man; Todd, a pig with an eating disorder; Jeffrey, a bird with guilt issues; and Linda, an obsessive-compulsive cat.', 'Five animals meet regularly to discuss their inner angst in a group therapy session led by Dr. Clement, a canine psychotherapist. The group includes Lorraine, a leech who suffers from separation anxiety; Cheryl, a praying mantis who can’t seem to keep a man; Todd, a pig with an eating disorder; Jeffrey, a bird with guilt issues; and Linda, an obsessive-compulsive cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2FIQHsKk7yOe43TamXI7zfNxBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511138'),
  ('1063678177495846753', 'Animal Crackers', 1930, 'Comedy, Music', 'Victor Heerman, George J. Folsey', 'George S. Kaufman', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Zeppo Marx, Lillian Roth, Margaret Dumont, Louis Sorin, Hal Thompson', 'G', 'The well-known explorer and hunter Captain Spaulding has just returned from Africa, and is being welcomed home with a lavish party at the estate of influential society matron Mrs. Rittenhouse when a valuable painting goes missing. The intrepid Captain Spaulding attempts to solve the crime with the help of his silly secretary Horatio Jamison, while sparring with the anarchic Signor Emanuel Ravelli and his nutty sidekick The Professor.', 'The well-known explorer and hunter Captain Spaulding has just returned from Africa, and is being welcomed home with a lavish party at the estate of influential society matron Mrs. Rittenhouse when a valuable painting goes missing. The intrepid Captain Spaulding attempts to solve the crime with the help of his silly secretary Horatio Jamison, while sparring with the anarchic Signor Emanuel Ravelli and his nutty sidekick The Professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qj7owFXzCtIbZC51O8NwLe4Kde4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13913'),
  ('611841248810206566', 'Animal Crackers', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Piero Pupilli, Teresa Ricci Bartolini', 'Achille Campanile, Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Ivo Perilli', 'Totò, Luisa Ferida, Calisto Bertramo, Lilia Dale, Dina Perbellini, Bianca Stagno Bellincioni, Claudio Ermelli, Raffaele Giachini', null, 'After several unsuccessful suicide attempts, Totò finds himself in an animal asylum.', 'After several unsuccessful suicide attempts, Totò finds himself in an animal asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmmP1Pc925rgHWQLekfrHlMHQoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74675'),
  ('563527371555957348', 'Animal Crackers', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Tony Bancroft, Scott Christian Sava, Jaime Maestro', 'Scott Christian Sava, Dean Lorey', 'Emily Blunt, John Krasinski, Lydia Rose Taylor, Ian McKellen, Sylvester Stallone, Danny DeVito, Patrick Warburton, Wallace Shawn', 'PG', 'A family must use a magical box of Animal Crackers to save a rundown circus from being taken over by their evil uncle Horatio P. Huntington.', 'A family must use a magical box of Animal Crackers to save a rundown circus from being taken over by their evil uncle Horatio P. Huntington.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxFqZiO5MqqVoFZuWOjTdjmDh6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315064'),
  ('572658012731241902', 'Animal Crossing: The Movie', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Joji Shimura, Yasuji Yamagoe, Akihiro Tamagawa', 'Aya Matsui', 'Yui Horie, Misato Fukuen, Fumiko Orikasa, Yu Kobayashi, Takatoshi Kaneko, Masaki Terasoma, Yurika Hino, Yasuhiro Takato', null, 'Ai, a self-reliant girl who moves to Animal Village and works at Nook''s Cranny, gradually becomes part of the community with guidance from its residents and embarks on a quest to plant pine trees for a Winter Festival miracle after finding a message in a bottle.', 'Ai, a self-reliant girl who moves to Animal Village and works at Nook''s Cranny, gradually becomes part of the community with guidance from its residents and embarks on a quest to plant pine trees for a Winter Festival miracle after finding a message in a bottle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaGG41JN1mfQXUXFPxDINFDIJQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20523'),
  ('787464817693638004', 'Animal Factory', 2000, 'Crime, Drama', 'Phil Parmet, Steve Buscemi, John Rusk', 'Edward Bunker, John Steppling', 'Willem Dafoe, Edward Furlong, Danny Trejo, Mark Boone Junior, Seymour Cassel, Mickey Rourke, Tom Arnold, John Heard', 'R', 'Suburbanite Ron is spoiled, young and not overly worried about the marijuana charges leveled against him. But, after being made out to be a drug dealer, he faces a five-year jail sentence in San Quentin State Prison. Physically frail and unaccustomed to his rough surroundings, Ron is primed to fall victim to sexual predators and bullying guards – that is, until he''s befriended by Earl, a veteran inmate who finds meaning in protecting the vulnerable new kid.', 'Suburbanite Ron is spoiled, young and not overly worried about the marijuana charges leveled against him. But, after being made out to be a drug dealer, he faces a five-year jail sentence in San Quentin State Prison. Physically frail and unaccustomed to his rough surroundings, Ron is primed to fall victim to sexual predators and bullying guards – that is, until he''s befriended by Earl, a veteran inmate who finds meaning in protecting the vulnerable new kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OUOg9Pf5dZZr5RufM5liA4IUVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9791'),
  ('48613060199453857', 'Animal Farm', 1954, 'Animation, Drama', 'Sid Griffiths, John Gurr, Roy Turk', 'Laurence Heath', 'Gordon Heath, Maurice Denham', 'G', 'Animals on a farm lead a revolution against the farmers to put their destiny in their own hands. However this revolution eats their own children and they cannot avoid corruption.', 'Animals on a farm lead a revolution against the farmers to put their destiny in their own hands. However this revolution eats their own children and they cannot avoid corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhLp9a0jBIPLMAdUFNlYjCuS72Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11848'),
