  ('785183043535743604', 'Animal Heart', 2009, 'Drama', 'Séverine Cornamusaz, Carlo Varini', 'Séverine Cornamusaz, Marcel Beaulieu, Florence Grivel', 'Olivier Rabourdin, Camille Japy, Antonio Buíl, Alexandra Karamisaris, Pierre-Isaie Duc, Franziska Kahl, Magdalena Meier, Pierre-Louis Normand', null, 'Suddenly he thinks her alone, his wife. This person whom he doesn''t know how to love and who is now falling prey to a gnawing disease. This woman whom he knows so little about and whom he would like to be with him. Right now, Just like before.', 'Suddenly he thinks her alone, his wife. This person whom he doesn''t know how to love and who is now falling prey to a gnawing disease. This woman whom he knows so little about and whom he would like to be with him. Right now, Just like before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oknOhLvScQDG4FFKjzOzXbJrYGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101053'),
  ('454851592569706372', 'Animal House', 1978, 'Comedy', 'John Landis, William B. Kaplan, Gary McLarty', 'Harold Ramis, Chris Miller, Douglas Kenney', 'John Belushi, Karen Allen, Tom Hulce, Stephen Furst, Mark Metcalf, Mary Louise Weller, Martha Smith, John Vernon', 'R', 'At a 1962 College, Dean Vernon Wormer is determined to expel the entire Delta Tau Chi Fraternity, but those troublemakers have other plans for him.', 'At a 1962 College, Dean Vernon Wormer is determined to expel the entire Delta Tau Chi Fraternity, but those troublemakers have other plans for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWooBbipMRIKeSRhEzmeaDV0T8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8469'),
  ('552722793964502606', 'Animal Instinct', 2026, 'Comedy, Crime, Fantasy, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Slimane-Baptiste Berhoun, Guillaume Girardot, Slimane Baptiste Berhoun', 'Samantha Mazéras', 'Fred Testot, Ophélia Kolb, Benicia Makengele, David Salles, Lilea Le Borgne', null, 'Follows a seasoned cop named Jeff who awakens from a coma with the ability to communicate with animals and recruits them to help crack cases while seeking redemption as both an elite cop and father.', 'Follows a seasoned cop named Jeff who awakens from a coma with the ability to communicate with animals and recruits them to help crack cases while seeking redemption as both an elite cop and father.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8Kk8ygdvgNCFukJDphrBpQYhAy8.jpg', 'plex:movie:animal-instinct-2026'),
  ('685699566663597127', 'Animal Instincts', 1992, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Eric Small, Richard Murken', 'Jon Robert Samsel, Georges des Esseintes', 'Shannon Whirry, Maxwell Caulfield, Jan-Michael Vincent, Delia Sheppard, Mitch Gaylord, John Saxon, David Carradine, Josh Cruze', 'R', 'A cop and his sexually frustrated wife are struggling to keep their failing marriage intact, when by chance she finds that he is at heart a voyeuristic peeping tom. To satisfy him and herself, his wife has numerous affairs, which her husband watches on closed-circuit televison. However, the pair soon learn that when you play with fire, you''ll always get burned.', 'A cop and his sexually frustrated wife are struggling to keep their failing marriage intact, when by chance she finds that he is at heart a voyeuristic peeping tom. To satisfy him and herself, his wife has numerous affairs, which her husband watches on closed-circuit televison. However, the pair soon learn that when you play with fire, you''ll always get burned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YuYMZSUXI8ZgysXIdW6mHZ7qlj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49292'),
  ('545366957514205793', 'Animal Instincts 2', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Rod Smith, Daniel Carrey', 'Daryl Haney', 'Shannon Whirry, Woody Brown, Al Sapienza, Elizabeth Sandifer, Jennifer Campbell, Debra Beatty, David Gautreaux, Eric Fleeks', 'R', 'An unhappy divorcée has the bad fortune to move next door to a security systems installer, a voyeur whose hobby is planting hidden video cameras in the bedrooms of all his clients. He then monitors the sex lives of his customers through an elaborate TV monitor system in his garage. Joanna Cole becomes his latest victim, but when she discovers the camera by accident, she reverts back to her exhibitionist ways and begins putting on sex shows for his pleasure. Things gets ugly when Jim professes his love for her but is rebuffed.', 'An unhappy divorcée has the bad fortune to move next door to a security systems installer, a voyeur whose hobby is planting hidden video cameras in the bedrooms of all his clients. He then monitors the sex lives of his customers through an elaborate TV monitor system in his garage. Joanna Cole becomes his latest victim, but when she discovers the camera by accident, she reverts back to her exhibitionist ways and begins putting on sex shows for his pleasure. Things gets ugly when Jim professes his love for her but is rebuffed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfkD52sL0piWrxUT8EHKztLsLy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60896'),
  ('51800750145503369', 'Animal Instincts 3', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Ernest Paul Roebuck, Dale Larsen', 'Selwyn Harris', 'Alexander Keith, James Matthew, Marcus Grahm, Anthony Lesa, John Bates, Jenteal, G. Larry Butler, Sam Cupae', null, 'An exhibitionist female author is drawn to a "blind" voyeur record producer. Her exhibitionist tendencies draw the interest of his musical clients and leads to visual fireworks. Her sexual romps take place in view of her blind lover but does he see more than he lets on?', 'An exhibitionist female author is drawn to a "blind" voyeur record producer. Her exhibitionist tendencies draw the interest of his musical clients and leads to visual fireworks. Her sexual romps take place in view of her blind lover but does he see more than he lets on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhP3mDyW3lw0JLdM9Zd3dQoH9C0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101314'),
  ('188177005108820976', 'Animal Kingdom', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'David Michôd, Adam Arkapaw', 'David Michôd', 'Ben Mendelsohn, Joel Edgerton, Guy Pearce, Luke Ford, Jacki Weaver, Sullivan Stapleton, James Frecheville, Dan Wyllie', 'R', 'Joshua “J” is taken in by his extended family after his mother dies of an overdose. The clan, ruled by J’s scheming grandmother, is heavily involved in criminal activities, and J is soon indoctrinated into their way of life. But J is given a chance to take another path when a cop seeks to help him.', 'Joshua “J” is taken in by his extended family after his mother dies of an overdose. The clan, ruled by J’s scheming grandmother, is heavily involved in criminal activities, and J is soon indoctrinated into their way of life. But J is given a chance to take another path when a cop seeks to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhj8YPQKuRev5N3KoHacsPnF4mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44629'),
  ('961254377585183384', 'Animal Kingdom: Let''s Go Ape', 2015, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Jamel Debbouze', 'Frédéric Fougea, Jamel Debbouze', 'Jamel Debbouze, Arié Elmaleh, Mélissa Theuriau, Patrice Thibaud, Christian Hecq, Diouc Koma, Adrien Antoine, Georgette Kala-Lobé', null, 'Based on the novel ''Evolution Man'' by Roy Lewis, this tells the story about the first man - young Edward - to descend from apes. Edward is ejected by his tribe, but is very resourceful. He learns to walk, discovers fire, manages to hunt - and we follow him as he evolves. He has a generous nature, and search for true humanity - a world where we don''t eat our fathers.', 'Based on the novel ''Evolution Man'' by Roy Lewis, this tells the story about the first man - young Edward - to descend from apes. Edward is ejected by his tribe, but is very resourceful. He learns to walk, discovers fire, manages to hunt - and we follow him as he evolves. He has a generous nature, and search for true humanity - a world where we don''t eat our fathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qccdwXUMazLqkMKm4ZJ7lAnzUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280391'),
  ('627723074512283789', 'Animal Love', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Ulrich Seidl, Michael Glawogger, Hans Selikovsky', 'Ulrich Seidl', 'Franz Dolesch, Renée Felden, Franz Holzschuh, Peter Kristek, Fritzi Schmied, Herbert Scholz, Ernst Schönmann, Gabi Tairi', null, 'In conurbations where hundreds of thousands live alongside one another, in the era of a highly technological society, in which communication has never played such a significant role, man has become lonely. Disappointed by his fellow human beings, he turns to animals. Dogs and other domestic animals serve him as companions, life partners, cuddly objects and bedfellows.', 'In conurbations where hundreds of thousands live alongside one another, in the era of a highly technological society, in which communication has never played such a significant role, man has become lonely. Disappointed by his fellow human beings, he turns to animals. Dogs and other domestic animals serve him as companions, life partners, cuddly objects and bedfellows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bckvNeXAPXcyOZ1bQocFYPO4eBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56345'),
  ('1140050717773038147', 'Animal Room', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Craig Singer, Amy Vincent', 'Craig Singer', 'Neil Patrick Harris, Matthew Lillard, Gabriel Olds, Catherine Hicks, Stephen Pearlman, Ryan Payne Bell, Lori Heuring, Eddie Malavarca', null, 'Cynical and intelligent Arnold Mosk, a known drug user, is put into a disciplinary program at his high school meant for the seriously disturbed where he becomes the main target of the psychopathic Doug Van Housen and his gang.', 'Cynical and intelligent Arnold Mosk, a known drug user, is put into a disciplinary program at his high school meant for the seriously disturbed where he becomes the main target of the psychopathic Doug Van Housen and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EnqCP4BcD6l1yrE3rjWxYkqyOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30492'),
  ('497401732808099952', 'Animal Treasure Island', 1971, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Hiroshi Ikeda, Yasuji Mori', 'Hiroshi Ikeda', 'Minori Matsushima, Fusako Amachi, Asao Koike, Hitoshi Takagi, Eiko Masuyama, Naozumi Yamamoto, Joji Yanami, Hidekatsu Shibata', null, 'A Japanese adaption of Robert Louis Stevenson''s Treasure Island, featuring animals as the majority of the cast. By chance Jim comes upon a map of Treasure Island. He leaves the port accompanied by Glan, the rat and Bub, the baby on a strange looking boat of his own make to look for the island. Pirates soon find him and adventure ensues.', 'A Japanese adaption of Robert Louis Stevenson''s Treasure Island, featuring animals as the majority of the cast. By chance Jim comes upon a map of Treasure Island. He leaves the port accompanied by Glan, the rat and Bub, the baby on a strange looking boat of his own make to look for the island. Pirates soon find him and adventure ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3N75fNdQg2QwJqXJGzHeZU2S6nC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34834'),
  ('176971703793865478', 'Animal World', 2018, 'Drama, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Han Yan, Max Da-Yung Wang, Ivy Yu-li Chiang', 'Han Yan', 'Li Yifeng, Michael Douglas, Zhou Dongyu, Cao Bingkun, Wang Ge, Su Ke, Wu Yanshu, Yao Anlian', 'R', 'Backed into a corner by mounting debts, a youth agrees to submit himself to a high stakes game of chance in international waters aboard a disused warship.', 'Backed into a corner by mounting debts, a youth agrees to submit himself to a high stakes game of chance in international waters aboard a disused warship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxc25B05Gq4CbCoWbyTFf9iF0wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518764'),
  ('195689339716899055', 'Animale', 2024, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Emma Benestan, Anaïs Lazreg, Claude Guillouard', 'Emma Benestan, Julie Debiton, Vincent Le Port', 'Oulaya Amamra, Damien Rebattel, Vivien Rodriguez, Claude Chaballier, Elies-Morgan Admi-Bensellam, Pierre Roux, Marinette Rafai, Renaud Vinuesa', null, 'Camargue, France - Nejma trains hard to win the local bullfighting competition. When she is mauled after a celebration, she starts to notice disturbing changes. News of a rogue bull on the loose terrifies the community, killing young men.', 'Camargue, France - Nejma trains hard to win the local bullfighting competition. When she is mauled after a celebration, she starts to notice disturbing changes. News of a rogue bull on the loose terrifies the community, killing young men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SvehuwHBzORRREnYZfdAwWukgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1020822'),
  ('109437905588882887', 'Animalia', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kevin Soirat, Hamza Boumalki, Théo Richard', 'Sofia Alaoui', 'Oumaïma Barid, Mehdi Dehbi, Fouad Oughaou, Souad Khouyi, Mohamed Lahbib', null, 'Itto, a young woman from a modest rural background, is slowly adapting to the Moroccan privileged codes of her husband’s family. But when supernatural events put the country in a state of emergency, Itto finds herself separated from her husband and new family. Alone, pregnant and looking for her way back, she finds emancipation.', 'Itto, a young woman from a modest rural background, is slowly adapting to the Moroccan privileged codes of her husband’s family. But when supernatural events put the country in a state of emergency, Itto finds herself separated from her husband and new family. Alone, pregnant and looking for her way back, she finds emancipation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNp7Kd6EsrGDMIWKvj5CYKTUlna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937738'),
  ('36056639238175492', 'Animals', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Douglas Aarniokoski, Heather Toone, Maximillian D. Day', 'Craig Spector', 'Marc Blucas, Naveen Andrews, Nicki Aycox, Eva Amurri, Andy Comeau, Bart Johnson, Gillian Shure, Mark Elias', null, 'Syd Jarrett is an unsuspecting, down-and-out man in a washed-up hick town who gets pulled into a sub-culture of blood-hungry creatures. He encounters Vic, a renegade whose animal instincts are stronger than his human ones. As things begin to get even worse, Jarrett realizes that his best chance for happiness, and survival, lies in his true love for Jane.', 'Syd Jarrett is an unsuspecting, down-and-out man in a washed-up hick town who gets pulled into a sub-culture of blood-hungry creatures. He encounters Vic, a renegade whose animal instincts are stronger than his human ones. As things begin to get even worse, Jarrett realizes that his best chance for happiness, and survival, lies in his true love for Jane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HUP1vWpWYZLCJ94qcykZ07v3lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25713'),
  ('665004175159200298', 'Animals', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Greg Zglinski, Susanne Nowotny, Piotr Jaxa', 'Greg Zglinski, Jörg Kalt', 'Birgit Minichmayr, Philipp Hochmair, Mona Petri, Mehdi Nebbou, Michael Ostrowski, Philip Lenkowsky', null, 'Nick and Anna are off to Switzerland for six months. Nick, a chef, wants to collect recipes of local cuisine and Anna hopes to write a new book. The journey can also be good for their relationship, because Anna suspects that Nick had an affair with other woman. Meanwhile, Mischa will take care of their Viennese apartment.', 'Nick and Anna are off to Switzerland for six months. Nick, a chef, wants to collect recipes of local cuisine and Anna hopes to write a new book. The journey can also be good for their relationship, because Anna suspects that Nick had an affair with other woman. Meanwhile, Mischa will take care of their Viennese apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGeHAeaPI06UqLbiJA3I05WiGJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440136'),
  ('274152298120620295', 'Animals', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anna Harrison, Stephen Fuller, Julien Benoiton', 'Emma Jane Unsworth', 'Holliday Grainger, Alia Shawkat, Fra Fee, Dermot Murphy, Amy Molloy, Pat Shortt, Olwen Fouéré, Kwaku Fortune', null, 'Longtime friends and party lovers Laura and Tyler navigate life and love in Dublin, Ireland but find themselves drifting apart when Laura becomes engaged.', 'Longtime friends and party lovers Laura and Tyler navigate life and love in Dublin, Ireland but find themselves drifting apart when Laura becomes engaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQyvlLavdNz8xg1vn3Dt7ZC5SnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513340'),
  ('1036783248672498810', 'Animals', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rodrigue De Hults, Sofie Tusschans, Julien Denis', 'Nabil Ben Yadir, Antoine Cuypers', 'Soufiane Chilah, Gianni Guettaf, Vincent Overath, Serkan Sancak, Lionel Maisin, Madeleine Baudot, Anne-Marie Loop, Amid Chakir', null, 'Brahim is a young man, and secretly gay. At his mother’s birthday party, tensions around his unaccepted sexuality become unbearable. Brahim flees the oppressive family home into the night, where a terrible encounter awaits...', 'Brahim is a young man, and secretly gay. At his mother’s birthday party, tensions around his unaccepted sexuality become unbearable. Brahim flees the oppressive family home into the night, where a terrible encounter awaits...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/taNO8ww04C8M4IMVbZDOjutNoD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802714'),
  ('776819943442977820', 'Animals on the Loose: A You vs. Wild Movie', 2021, 'Adventure', 'Ben Simms', null, 'Bear Grylls', null, 'When there’s a power outage at a safari reserve, Bear Grylls is called and he needs your help. The situation is dire: an escaped lion is headed for a nearby village; a baboon has broken free and is going towards the sea cliffs, and the power must be restored before more animals escape.', 'When there’s a power outage at a safari reserve, Bear Grylls is called and he needs your help. The situation is dire: an escaped lion is headed for a nearby village; a baboon has broken free and is going towards the sea cliffs, and the power must be restored before more animals escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZkhIiJRYLzghOkHrA9X6dbcK3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786357'),
  ('431889571594407287', 'Animals United', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Holger Tappe, Reinhard Klooss', 'Reinhard Klooss, Oliver Huzly, Sven Severin', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Ralf Schmitz, Thomas Fritsch, Bastian Pastewka, Oliver Kalkofe, Nana Spier, Constantin von Jascheroff, Jessica Owen', 'G', 'A group of animals waiting for the annual flood they rely on for food and water discover that the humans, who have been destroying their habitats have built a dam for a leisure resort. The animals endeavour to save the delta and send a message to the humans not to interfere with nature.', 'A group of animals waiting for the annual flood they rely on for food and water discover that the humans, who have been destroying their habitats have built a dam for a leisure resort. The animals endeavour to save the delta and send a message to the humans not to interfere with nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUCLetZNa3rZknSmLc2gGUdxWH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50135'),
  ('1068862527532761123', 'Animalympics', 1980, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Steven Lisberger, Bill Kroyer, Michael Fremer', 'Steven Lisberger, Michael Fremer', 'Gilda Radner, Billy Crystal, Harry Shearer, Michael Fremer', 'NR', 'Animalympics is all about the Animal Olympics Contest where all the animals around the world gather to take part in everything from skiing in North America to the very long marathon race in humid conditions.', 'Animalympics is all about the Animal Olympics Contest where all the animals around the world gather to take part in everything from skiing in North America to the very long marathon race in humid conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmvKcJq7BKObGe0df8lpPHXQil6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19247'),
  ('20042301281624757', 'Animaniacs: Wakko''s Wish', 1999, 'Animation, Music, Comedy, Adventure, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Liz Holzman, Rusty Mills, Tom Ruegger', 'Tom Ruegger, Nick DuBois, Earl Kress', 'Rob Paulsen, Jess Harnell, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche, Nancy Cartwright, Frank Welker, Chick Vennera, John Mariano', 'NR', 'The Warner Brothers (and the Warner Sister) go on a quest to find a fallen wishing star to help Dot with her illness. Unfortunately the rest of the town, including an evil king, also hear about the star and want to get to it first to have their own wishes come true. It''s a race against time and it''s up to the three zany siblings to get there first.', 'The Warner Brothers (and the Warner Sister) go on a quest to find a fallen wishing star to help Dot with her illness. Unfortunately the rest of the town, including an evil king, also hear about the star and want to get to it first to have their own wishes come true. It''s a race against time and it''s up to the three zany siblings to get there first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNVhFOzd939TlI9r1uKVZKrmKFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73901'),
  ('931581571419742502', 'Animas', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Laura Alvea, José F. Ortuño, Fran Fernández-Pardo', 'José F. Ortuño, Laura Alvea', 'Clare Durant, Iván Pellicer, Luis Bermejo, Liz Lobato, Chacha Huang, Ángela Molina, Manuela Pedraza, Rocío Borrallo', null, 'Abraham and his female friend Álex have a close relationship; they share both secrets and fears. When Abraham starts going out with Anchi, he begins to distance himself from Álex, who gradually dives into a living hell where she encounters strange apparitions, nightmarish visions and extreme situations.', 'Abraham and his female friend Álex have a close relationship; they share both secrets and fears. When Abraham starts going out with Anchi, he begins to distance himself from Álex, who gradually dives into a living hell where she encounters strange apparitions, nightmarish visions and extreme situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pOIMOAsi2zPAWzf0sy2Zk9BSTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484436'),
  ('1084856556772466424', 'Animated Newspaper', 2016, 'Animation', 'Donato Sansone', 'Donato Sansone', null, null, 'An artistic improvisation in real time led day in and day out, inspired by international events as taken from the pages of the French daily newspaper Libération.', 'An artistic improvisation in real time led day in and day out, inspired by international events as taken from the pages of the French daily newspaper Libération.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5ZAQzEkja56mVMQUQkhn0dYHri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425693'),
  ('612906522334037903', 'Animated Self-Portraits', 1989, 'Animation', 'Pavel Koutský, David Ehrlich, Osamu Tezuka', 'Hardi Volmer, Jiří Barta, Maureen Selwood', null, null, 'An animated film compiled by David Ehrlich consisting of 27 animators from different countries all explaining themselves through their animation.', 'An animated film compiled by David Ehrlich consisting of 27 animators from different countries all explaining themselves through their animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AONS1rNQr1oIfJPTltc8Y8majp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213080'),
  ('818101640727109298', 'Anime', 2017, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Brisebois, Jessica Lee Gagné', 'Arnaud Brisebois', 'Eve Lemieux, Alexi Charron', null, 'Two hardy orphans survive upon the remains of a humanity that has left them behind.', 'Two hardy orphans survive upon the remains of a humanity that has left them behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qig1q8F6ejuPdSjMR8TBa0rDOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620004'),
  ('406468538976525492', 'Anime Supremacy!', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kohei Yoshino, Motonobu Kiyoku, Hiroyuki Yoshida', 'Yosuke Masaike', 'Riho Yoshioka, Tomoya Nakamura, Tasuku Emoto, Machiko Ono, Asuka Kudo, Kanji Furutachi, Karin Ono, Yuu Tokui', null, 'Hitomi Saito has been climbing the ranks for years and is set to direct an anime series for the first time, while brilliant director Chiharu Oji is about to make his big comeback after nearly a decade.', 'Hitomi Saito has been climbing the ranks for years and is set to direct an anime series for the first time, while brilliant director Chiharu Oji is about to make his big comeback after nearly a decade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Lin1w6GuvpkRxrah7k3IOJz7HE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947166'),
  ('760105576090803203', 'Animus', 2026, 'Short, Drama, Thriller', 'Jamie Murray, Calum Stewart, Joseph Dutaillis', 'Jamie Murray', 'Fenn Leon, Chris Hardy, Carmina Soriano, Matthew Murray, Steve Sampson', null, 'In a dystopian near-future where animal species are on the brink of extinction, a violent sociopath is interviewed by an institutional psychologist after confessing to a brutal attack. In search of a motive, the psychologist realizes he must sink his teeth into the one thing that his subject finds meaningful: an obsessive fascination with animal nature and evolution.', 'In a dystopian near-future where animal species are on the brink of extinction, a violent sociopath is interviewed by an institutional psychologist after confessing to a brutal attack. In search of a motive, the psychologist realizes he must sink his teeth into the one thing that his subject finds meaningful: an obsessive fascination with animal nature and evolution.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FexeOkfDaot1UAyUXOvwg18Nn0h.jpg', 'plex:movie:animus-2026-1'),
  ('776217501447197188', 'Anina', 2013, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Alfredo Soderguit, Juan Carve, Alejo Schettini', 'Alfredo Soderguit, Alejo Schettini, Germán Tejeira', 'Federica Lacaño, María Mendive, César Troncoso, Cristina Morán, Petru Valensky, Roberto Suárez, Gimena Fajardo, Florencia Zabaleta', null, 'Anina Yatay Salas is a ten-year-old whose name spells trouble: those three palindromes in a row are an ongoing source of teasing at school. When a playground fight results in mysterious punishment, Anina will learn to put her problems in perspective and empathize with others in this sweet little daydream of a tale.', 'Anina Yatay Salas is a ten-year-old whose name spells trouble: those three palindromes in a row are an ongoing source of teasing at school. When a playground fight results in mysterious punishment, Anina will learn to put her problems in perspective and empathize with others in this sweet little daydream of a tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bI0zmlwOr8QSr4NcugJsZhwWJNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180644'),
  ('1021716378142408383', 'Aningaaq', 2013, 'Drama', 'Jonás Cuarón, Alexis Zabé', 'Jonás Cuarón', 'Orto Ignatiussen, Sandra Bullock, Lajla Lange, Maligiaq Fredeik, Lange Siegstad', null, 'Aningaaq, an Inuit fisherman camping on the ice over a frozen fjord, talks through a two way radio with a dying astronaut who is stranded in space, 500 kilometers above Earth. Even though he doesn''t speak English and she doesn''t speak Greenlandic, they manage to have a conversation about dogs, babies, life and death.', 'Aningaaq, an Inuit fisherman camping on the ice over a frozen fjord, talks through a two way radio with a dying astronaut who is stranded in space, 500 kilometers above Earth. Even though he doesn''t speak English and she doesn''t speak Greenlandic, they manage to have a conversation about dogs, babies, life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksSTh2rIcrDUitF8wssK071rcJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238407'),
  ('995689401185220643', 'Anita', 2009, 'Drama', 'Marcos Carnevale, Guillermo Zappino', 'Marcela Guerty, Marcos Carnevale, Lily Ann Martin', 'Alejandra Manzo, Peto Menahem, Luis Luque, Leonor Manso, Norma Aleandro, Mercedes Scápola, Huang Hui Shion, Mei Lan Chen', null, 'Anita is the story of a young woman with Down syndrome who lives a happy, routine life in Buenos Aires, being meticulously cared for by her mother Dora. One tragic morning in 1994, everything changes when Anita is left alone, confused and helpless after the nearby Argentine Israelite Mutual Association is bombed (the deadliest bombing in Argentina''s history). As Anita wanders through the city, she learns not only to care for herself, but touches the lives of those around her, from an alcoholic to a family of Asian immigrants.', 'Anita is the story of a young woman with Down syndrome who lives a happy, routine life in Buenos Aires, being meticulously cared for by her mother Dora. One tragic morning in 1994, everything changes when Anita is left alone, confused and helpless after the nearby Argentine Israelite Mutual Association is bombed (the deadliest bombing in Argentina''s history). As Anita wanders through the city, she learns not only to care for herself, but touches the lives of those around her, from an alcoholic to a family of Asian immigrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qm1h99fK4TbFxFFTd7gx1g93njf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29275'),
  ('756059779375847583', 'Anita', 2021, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Leung Lok-Man, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Tiffany Ng Ka-Ching', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Leung Lok-Man', 'Louise Wong Tan-Nei, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Terrance Lau Chun-Him, Tony Yang, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Louis Koo, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Waise Lee Chi-Hung', null, 'This long-awaited biopic provides a vivid account of the remarkable life of Anita Mui in and behind the limelight, chronicling her journey from a child performer to becoming one of world''s most recognized music icons.', 'This long-awaited biopic provides a vivid account of the remarkable life of Anita Mui in and behind the limelight, chronicling her journey from a child performer to becoming one of world''s most recognized music icons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u049Y7PDVTysi6KLryhOE7ocdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848788'),
  ('307159650380298922', 'Anita and Me', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Metin Hüseyin, Cinders Forshaw, Max Keene', 'Meera Syal', 'Chandeep Uppal, Max Beesley, Anna Brewster, Sanjeev Bhaskar, Kathy Burke, Kabir Bedi, Ayesha Dharker, Lynn Redgrave', null, 'Meena, a 12-year-old living in a mining village in the English Midlands in 1972, is the daughter of Indian parents who''ve come to England to give her a better life. This idyllic existence is upset by the arrival in the village of Anita Rutter and her dysfunctional family.', 'Meena, a 12-year-old living in a mining village in the English Midlands in 1972, is the daughter of Indian parents who''ve come to England to give her a better life. This idyllic existence is upset by the arrival in the village of Anita Rutter and her dysfunctional family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ih3tJ76cG207h5amSBy1aEUgNTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14596'),
  ('861320093370068427', 'Anita B.', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paolo Giacomo Marino, Roberto Faenza, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Edith Bruck, Iole Masucci, Nelo Risi', 'Eline Powell, Robert Sheehan, Andrea Osvárt, Antonio Cupo, Nico Mirallegro, Clive Riche, Guenda Goria, Moni Ovadia', 'NR', 'After World War II, Anita, a young survivor of Auschwitz, becomes involved in an intense and passionate affair that almost shatters her until she gains the strength to start a new life.', 'After World War II, Anita, a young survivor of Auschwitz, becomes involved in an intense and passionate affair that almost shatters her until she gains the strength to start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJPB80TJbPJD0j4uW5kgyLozGhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228107'),
