  ('86163292839697189', 'Ankahi Kahaniya', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Abhishek Chaubey, Ashwiny Iyer Tiwari, Saket Chaudhary', 'Shreyas Jain, Piyush Gupta, Nitesh Tiwari', 'Kunal Kapoor, Zoya Hussain, Abhishek Banerjee, Rinku Rajguru, Delzad Hiwale, Palomi Ghosh, Nikhil Dwivedi, TJ Bhanu', null, 'As big city life buzzes around them, lonely souls discover surprising sources of connection and companionship in three tales of love, loss and longing.', 'As big city life buzzes around them, lonely souls discover surprising sources of connection and companionship in three tales of love, loss and longing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNDu6aBv0yynUr8TcvSLUe8QLPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862701'),
  ('811335564603010414', 'Ankhon Dekhi', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rajat Kapoor, Rafey Mehmood', 'Rajat Kapoor', 'Sanjay Mishra, Seema Pahwa, Rajat Kapoor, Taranjit Kaur, Maya Sarao, Chandrachoor Rai, Namit Das, Brijendra Kala', null, 'Bauji resists his daughter''s request to let her marry the man she loves as the neighbours incessantly shame him. However, his opinion changes after he meets him and he decides to change his viewpoint.', 'Bauji resists his daughter''s request to let her marry the man she loves as the neighbours incessantly shame him. However, his opinion changes after he meets him and he decides to change his viewpoint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yA0pvH3YnlvONPbAdRl0neYpMCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241882'),
