  ('832994523929717280', 'Anna Karenina', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Joe Wright, Seamus McGarvey, Niall Moroney', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Keira Knightley, Jude Law, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Matthew Macfadyen, Eric MacLennan, Kelly Macdonald, Alicia Vikander, Domhnall Gleeson', 'R', 'In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she''s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.', 'In Imperial Russia, Anna, wife of the officer Karenin, goes to Moscow to visit her brother. On the way, she meets charming cavalry officer Vronsky, to whom she''s immediately attracted. But in St. Petersburg’s high society, a relationship like this could destroy a woman’s reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DvjkCbmlg8sbBHZKUZvYPgsT5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96724'),
  ('511807739653717940', 'Anna Lucasta', 1958, 'Drama', 'Arnold Laven, Lucien Ballard, Eugene Anderson Jr', 'Philip Yordan', 'Eartha Kitt, Frederick O''Neal, Henry Scott, Rex Ingram, James Edwards, Isabel Cooley, Rosetta LeNoire, Georgia Burke', null, 'The estranged family of a reformed prostitute calls her back home to get her married to an affluent acquaintance out of greed.', 'The estranged family of a reformed prostitute calls her back home to get her married to an affluent acquaintance out of greed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNAJfYHiLgfBXYUYkS8GOqnEuQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170477'),
  ('1048535962937463445', 'Anna M.', 2007, 'Drama', 'Michel Spinosa, Alain Duplantier', 'Michel Spinosa', 'Isabelle Carré, Gilbert Melki, Anne Consigny, Geneviève Mnich, Gaëlle Bona, Pascal Bongard, Julie Brochen, Catherine Epars', null, 'Anna, a somewhat introverted woman, becomes obsessed with the orthopedic surgeon who helped with her recuperation following a car accident. Incorrectly believing the love to be reciprocated, she embarks on several attempts to try and stay in touch with him but, after several rejections, finds herself descending into despair and, ultimately, hatred.', 'Anna, a somewhat introverted woman, becomes obsessed with the orthopedic surgeon who helped with her recuperation following a car accident. Incorrectly believing the love to be reciprocated, she embarks on several attempts to try and stay in touch with him but, after several rejections, finds herself descending into despair and, ultimately, hatred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJSWHgljX39JWc0KPIirCqeqXMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17376'),
  ('2032446333726459', 'Anna Magdalena', 1998, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Kenneth Yee, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Ivy Ho', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Kelly Chen, Aaron Kwok, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Leslie Cheung, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Josie Ho, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', null, 'Two young men fall for the woman staying upstairs when she practises J.S. Bach''s "Notebook for Anna Magdalena".', 'Two young men fall for the woman staying upstairs when she practises J.S. Bach''s "Notebook for Anna Magdalena".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncyMIJiOyRhc6nrknvUay5locDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118381'),
  ('1102331752416506141', 'Anna Nicole Smith: You Don''t Know Me', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Ursula Macfarlane', null, 'Anna Nicole Smith, Marilyn Grabowski, Patrik Simpson, Pol Atteu, J.D. Ligier, Henley Mohrman, Daniel Smith, Howard K. Stern', 'R', 'From the heights of her modeling fame to her tragic death, this documentary reveals Anna Nicole Smith through the eyes of the people closest to her.', 'From the heights of her modeling fame to her tragic death, this documentary reveals Anna Nicole Smith through the eyes of the people closest to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mybL2Hd3PvsY7Qyjf7W6BKsoECu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114590'),
  ('882618106096750651', 'Anna to the Infinite Power', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Wiemer, Glenn Kershaw', 'Robert Wiemer', 'Martha Byrne, Dina Merrill, Mark Patton, Donna Mitchell, Jack Ryland, Loretta Devine, Jack Gilford, Julie Araskog', null, 'Anna Hart was always an odd child, a genius, a shoplifter, desperately afraid of flickering lights, with strange prophetic dreams. Simultaneously, several strange things begin to happen. A strange, mysterious neighbor, by the name of MacKayla moves in next door to the Harts. And, most frightening of all, Anna sees her exact double on the television one night. As her investigation of the other Anna, Anna Smithson, progresses, she begins to learn the truth. The truth about a woman named Anna Zimmerman that has been dead for twenty years, and most importantly, the truth about herself', 'Anna Hart was always an odd child, a genius, a shoplifter, desperately afraid of flickering lights, with strange prophetic dreams. Simultaneously, several strange things begin to happen. A strange, mysterious neighbor, by the name of MacKayla moves in next door to the Harts. And, most frightening of all, Anna sees her exact double on the television one night. As her investigation of the other Anna, Anna Smithson, progresses, she begins to learn the truth. The truth about a woman named Anna Zimmerman that has been dead for twenty years, and most importantly, the truth about herself', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLFL3ajh9zTKcEdQPBfgdkr28UR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110739'),
  ('1067959736977419010', 'Anna: the Pleasure, the Torment', 1973, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Carnimeo, Marcello Masciocchi, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Francesco Milizia, Sauro Scavolini', 'Edwige Fenech, Corrado Pani, Richard Conte, John Richardson, Ettore Manni, Laura Bonaparte, Paolo Lena, Ennio Balbo', null, 'A beautiful but poor young girl finds all the money and material goods she never had when she becomes the girlfriend of a crime boss, but soon learns that there is a price to be paid for that kind of life.', 'A beautiful but poor young girl finds all the money and material goods she never had when she becomes the girlfriend of a crime boss, but soon learns that there is a price to be paid for that kind of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXhVwMA8AV9miWs3jpMappwc4aN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104954'),
  ('190655350638510895', 'Anna''s Engagement', 1972, 'Drama', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Lefteris Haronitis, Christos Paliyannopoulos', 'Pantelis Voulgaris, Menis Koumantareas', 'Anna Vagena, Smaro Veaki, Kostas Rigopoulos, Stavros Kalaroglou, Aliki Zografou, Maria Martika, Alekos Oudinotis, Irene Emirza', null, 'A lower-class maid navigates the social world of the upper-crust family she works for.', 'A lower-class maid navigates the social world of the upper-crust family she works for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVrdRhJAF4KVLdfdgrdMiowjvlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262448'),
  ('809524259329447942', 'Anna''s Time', 2016, 'Drama', 'Greg Zglinski', null, 'Isabelle Caillat, Gaëlle Bona, Mathieu Simonet, Jean-Charles Clichet, Jean-Pierre Gos, Baptiste Coustenoble, Antonin Schopfer, Loris Godel', null, 'Canton of Neuchâtel, 1917 to 1933. A young watchmaker falls head over heels with a mysterious young woman. Jean and Anna get married, love each other madly and go through all life experiences together, supported by their happiness and friends at their side. Jean wants to invent a new waterproof watch, and the future looks promising. But Anna suddenly seems to suffer from a strange sickness which gets worse each day. Will Jean''s love for her be enough to save her?', 'Canton of Neuchâtel, 1917 to 1933. A young watchmaker falls head over heels with a mysterious young woman. Jean and Anna get married, love each other madly and go through all life experiences together, supported by their happiness and friends at their side. Jean wants to invent a new waterproof watch, and the future looks promising. But Anna suddenly seems to suffer from a strange sickness which gets worse each day. Will Jean''s love for her be enough to save her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wMBNc4aqPxaKM06PIWgNM4mQZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415182'),
  ('138122097517493406', 'Annaatthe', 2021, 'Action, Family, Drama', 'R. Rajasekar, Siva, Vettri', 'Adhi Narayana', 'Rajinikanth, Keerthy Suresh, Jagapati Babu, Soori, Nayanthara, Meena, Khushboo, Bala', null, 'Kaaliyan is a village president in the Madurai district, who is fondly called Annaatthe. His nieces compete with each other to marry him. But, he falls in love with another woman who visits their village. Kaaliyan has a sister who gets married and shifts to Kolkata where she faces some unknown threats. Soon, her brother comes to her aid.', 'Kaaliyan is a village president in the Madurai district, who is fondly called Annaatthe. His nieces compete with each other to marry him. But, he falls in love with another woman who visits their village. Kaaliyan has a sister who gets married and shifts to Kolkata where she faces some unknown threats. Soon, her brother comes to her aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1T5BAF0RsrQfQik5WtXA30gJlk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752961'),
  ('147158764468531131', 'Annabelle', 2014, 'Horror', 'John R. Leonetti, James Kniest, Milos Milicevic', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Annabelle Wallis, Ward Horton, Tony Amendola, Alfre Woodard, Eric Ladin, Kerry O''Malley, Brian Howe, Ivar Brogger', 'R', 'A couple begins to experience terrifying supernatural occurrences involving a vintage doll shortly after their home is invaded by satanic cultists.', 'A couple begins to experience terrifying supernatural occurrences involving a vintage doll shortly after their home is invaded by satanic cultists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLsuU2P2SpDYFwtZQ7dtfVAf6TE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250546'),
  ('344965630571360490', 'Annabelle Butterfly Dance', 1894, 'Documentary', 'William Heise, William K.L. Dickson, William Heise', null, 'Annabelle Moore', null, 'Annabelle (Whitford) Moore performs one of her popular dances. For this performance, her costume has a pair of wings attached to her back, to suggest a butterfly. As she dances, she uses her long, flowing skirts to create visual patterns.', 'Annabelle (Whitford) Moore performs one of her popular dances. For this performance, her costume has a pair of wings attached to her back, to suggest a butterfly. As she dances, she uses her long, flowing skirts to create visual patterns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYEaEoXrDDbXgzeMJpRHoxcpwVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105160'),
  ('477438454248022114', 'Annabelle Comes Home', 2019, 'Horror', 'David Marnell, Gary Dauberman, Rich Delia', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Mckenna Grace, Madison Iseman, Katie Sarife, Michael Cimino, Samara Lee, Vera Farmiga, Patrick Wilson, Luca Luhan', 'R', 'Determined to keep Annabelle from wreaking more havoc, demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren bring the possessed doll to the locked artifacts room in their home, placing her “safely” behind sacred glass and enlisting a priest’s holy blessing. But an unholy night of horror awaits as Annabelle awakens the evil spirits in the room, who all set their sights on a new target—the Warrens'' ten-year-old daughter, Judy, and her friends.', 'Determined to keep Annabelle from wreaking more havoc, demonologists Ed and Lorraine Warren bring the possessed doll to the locked artifacts room in their home, placing her “safely” behind sacred glass and enlisting a priest’s holy blessing. But an unholy night of horror awaits as Annabelle awakens the evil spirits in the room, who all set their sights on a new target—the Warrens'' ten-year-old daughter, Judy, and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWsHMrbg9DsBY3bCMk9jyYCRVRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521029'),
  ('759700111026237668', 'Annabelle Hooper and the Ghosts of Nantucket', 2016, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Family', 'Paul Serafini, Ryan Patrick Dean', 'Kieran McGowan, Paul Serafini, Stefne Miller', 'Bailee Madison, Robert Capron, Mavrick Moreno, Juliana Harkavy, Gary Weeks, Whitney Goin, Rachel Resheff, Kevin B. McGlynn', 'G', 'Vacationing on historic Nantucket Island, a teenage mystery writer and her friends must outwit two scheming thieves to solve the secret behind a legendary ghost story.', 'Vacationing on historic Nantucket Island, a teenage mystery writer and her friends must outwit two scheming thieves to solve the secret behind a legendary ghost story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3eTA6XKKS8Fi1RInvgAjsYEsuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410284'),
  ('207389094730180135', 'Annabelle: Creation', 2017, 'Horror', 'Cory Johnson, Cyndi Martin, Michael Feldman', 'Gary Dauberman', 'Stephanie Sigman, Talitha Eliana Bateman, Lulu Wilson, Anthony LaPaglia, Miranda Otto, Grace Caroline Currey, Philippa Coulthard, Samara Lee', 'R', 'Several years after the tragic death of their little girl, a doll maker and his wife welcome a nun and several girls from a shuttered orphanage into their home, soon becoming the target of the doll maker''s possessed creation—Annabelle.', 'Several years after the tragic death of their little girl, a doll maker and his wife welcome a nun and several girls from a shuttered orphanage into their home, soon becoming the target of the doll maker''s possessed creation—Annabelle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tb86j8jVCVsdZnzf8I6cIi65IeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396422'),
  ('306640509149879884', 'Annabelle''s Wish', 1997, 'Family, Animation, Music, Adventure', 'Roy Wilson', 'John Bettis, Jane Baer, Kathy Grover', 'Randy Travis, Kath Soucie, Aria Noelle Curzon, Jerry Van Dyke, Jennifer Darling, Jerry Houser, Steve Mackall, Mary Kay Bergman', 'G', 'Annabelle - a calf who has a special wish for Christmas - wants to be a reindeer and help Santa Claus drive his sleigh as he delivers his presents! Annabelle''s friends tell her not to get her hopes up, but to everyone''s surprise, Santa does indeed meet up with Annabelle, and the calf gets to help Santa make the holiday special for one young boy.', 'Annabelle - a calf who has a special wish for Christmas - wants to be a reindeer and help Santa Claus drive his sleigh as he delivers his presents! Annabelle''s friends tell her not to get her hopes up, but to everyone''s surprise, Santa does indeed meet up with Annabelle, and the calf gets to help Santa make the holiday special for one young boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuwl1H6qCdgOJVxuonYlBQviC5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13664'),
  ('423760751527252477', 'Annaluise & Anton', 1999, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Caroline Link, Torsten Breuer', 'Caroline Link', 'Elea Geissler, Max Felder, Juliane Köhler, August Zirner, Meret Becker, Sylvie Testud, Gudrun Okras, Benno Fürmann', null, 'Luise, called Pünktchen, and Anton are closest of friends. Being the daughter of a wealthy surgeon, young Pünktchen lives in a great house. Her mother, who always travels through the world more for public relation reasons than for the social tasks she pretends to fulfill, is never available to her as a mother. Anton, son of a single and sick mother in financial trouble, does his best to help her out of it by working late. Pünktchen decides to help her only friend (as nobody else would anyway) and starts singing in public places. Trouble arises when Anton can''t resist stealing a golden lighter and Pünktchen''s secret life is discovered by her parents. Two troubled families finally can see the need for actions to be taken.', 'Luise, called Pünktchen, and Anton are closest of friends. Being the daughter of a wealthy surgeon, young Pünktchen lives in a great house. Her mother, who always travels through the world more for public relation reasons than for the social tasks she pretends to fulfill, is never available to her as a mother. Anton, son of a single and sick mother in financial trouble, does his best to help her out of it by working late. Pünktchen decides to help her only friend (as nobody else would anyway) and starts singing in public places. Trouble arises when Anton can''t resist stealing a golden lighter and Pünktchen''s secret life is discovered by her parents. Two troubled families finally can see the need for actions to be taken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7sc2f57F3jSFew7Nz5dJBPUCFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799'),
  ('259612490501112594', 'Annamalai', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Suresh Krissna, P. S. Prakash', 'Suresh Krissna', 'Rajinikanth, Sarath Babu, Khushboo, Rekha, Radha Ravi, Janagaraj, Nizhalgal Ravi, Manorama', null, 'A class-divided friendship goes through highs and lows through several decades.', 'A class-divided friendship goes through highs and lows through several decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e96hSrmolvJ2SiaxlDNs3Ye2WEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48757'),
  ('579939477085991930', 'Annamayya', 1997, 'Drama, History, Music', 'K Raghavendra Rao, M.M. Keeravaani, A. Vincent', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Ramya Krishnan, Kasturi Shankar, Suman Talwar, Bhanupriya, Srikanya, Mohan Babu, Roja Selvamani', null, 'A cinematic version of the life of famous Indian saint-poet, Annamayya (born May 1408), follows the spiritual awakening of the mystic composer Annamayya, who''s first motivated to write a song of praise after visiting a temple. His devotion is put to the test when he vows to fast until he comes face to face with God, an act of faith for which he''s rewarded with a blessed meal of prasad. As his fame as a singer spreads, Annamayya eventually becomes a real personification of the holy Nandaka Sword.', 'A cinematic version of the life of famous Indian saint-poet, Annamayya (born May 1408), follows the spiritual awakening of the mystic composer Annamayya, who''s first motivated to write a song of praise after visiting a temple. His devotion is put to the test when he vows to fast until he comes face to face with God, an act of faith for which he''s rewarded with a blessed meal of prasad. As his fame as a singer spreads, Annamayya eventually becomes a real personification of the holy Nandaka Sword.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmgzq8MWSMthVYE08H9bAKVTpu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80798'),
  ('448309123836695487', 'Annapolis', 2006, 'Drama, Action', 'Justin Lin, Phil Abraham, Greg Hale', 'David Collard', 'James Franco, Tyrese Gibson, Jordana Brewster, Donnie Wahlberg, Vicellous Shannon, Roger Fan, McCaleb Burnett, Wilmer Calderon', 'PG-13', 'Jake Huard, from a shipbuilders family, promised his dying mother he''ld make it to Anapolis Naval Academy. Thanks to tenaciously bugging a Congressman, he''s selected despite dubious grades. Once inside, Jake soon proves sub-standard academically. Constantly challenged to his limits, repeatedly made the ''over-cocky'' reason for the entire class to suffer, Jake nearly quits, but after facing his utterly un-supportive father''s gloating returns just in time. Stubborn Jake finds support withs mates as well as Senor Ali, his lover-to-be, and a discipline he may excel in: the ''brigade'' boxing tournament, open to all ranks.', 'Jake Huard, from a shipbuilders family, promised his dying mother he''ld make it to Anapolis Naval Academy. Thanks to tenaciously bugging a Congressman, he''s selected despite dubious grades. Once inside, Jake soon proves sub-standard academically. Constantly challenged to his limits, repeatedly made the ''over-cocky'' reason for the entire class to suffer, Jake nearly quits, but after facing his utterly un-supportive father''s gloating returns just in time. Stubborn Jake finds support withs mates as well as Senor Ali, his lover-to-be, and a discipline he may excel in: the ''brigade'' boxing tournament, open to all ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH6YeqFcihbZsz7iWl6MzQVzL8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13275'),
  ('745896268531739626', 'Annayya', 2000, 'Family, Comedy', 'Muthyala Subbaiah', 'Satyanand Pydipalli', 'Chiranjeevi, Soundarya, Ravi Teja, Venkat, Chandni, Sishwa, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Sarath Babu', null, 'Rajaram (Chiranjeevi), owner of a fleet of lorries, meets Devi (Soundarya), a garment factory owner. After that acquaintance, she once seeks his help in dealing with two street ruffians, who were teasing her sisters, Lata (Chandini) and Geetha (Sishwa), and is shocked when the culprits turn out to be his brothers, Ravi (Ravi Teja) and Gopi (Venkat). Rajaram takes the incident lightly as the pranks of youngsters and is very lenient to them. With more such incidents, the two fall in love, with the brothers and sisters not far behind. On his brothers'' request, Rajaram approaches Devi for her sisters'' hands in marriage to his brothers. But she curtly refuses her consent on grounds that the two are wayward drunkards. Rajaram reacts sharply to it and vows to get his brothers married to her sisters. Since then on he is more exacting with his brothers and brings about a transformation in them. Devi agrees to their marriage.', 'Rajaram (Chiranjeevi), owner of a fleet of lorries, meets Devi (Soundarya), a garment factory owner. After that acquaintance, she once seeks his help in dealing with two street ruffians, who were teasing her sisters, Lata (Chandini) and Geetha (Sishwa), and is shocked when the culprits turn out to be his brothers, Ravi (Ravi Teja) and Gopi (Venkat). Rajaram takes the incident lightly as the pranks of youngsters and is very lenient to them. With more such incidents, the two fall in love, with the brothers and sisters not far behind. On his brothers'' request, Rajaram approaches Devi for her sisters'' hands in marriage to his brothers. But she curtly refuses her consent on grounds that the two are wayward drunkards. Rajaram reacts sharply to it and vows to get his brothers married to her sisters. Since then on he is more exacting with his brothers and brings about a transformation in them. Devi agrees to their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnlFk5IlqALE3zoLCRTeOVjquWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240143'),
  ('679586408282619484', 'Anne Frank Remembered', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Jon Blair', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Glenn Close, Anne Frank, Otto Frank', 'PG', 'Using previously unreleased archival material in addition to contemporary interviews, this Academy Award-winning documentary tells the story of the Frank family and presents the first fully-rounded portrait of their brash and free-spirited daughter Anne, perhaps the world''s most famous victim of the Holocaust.', 'Using previously unreleased archival material in addition to contemporary interviews, this Academy Award-winning documentary tells the story of the Frank family and presents the first fully-rounded portrait of their brash and free-spirited daughter Anne, perhaps the world''s most famous victim of the Holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nyhzrSGimCbdxiY8DEO7kI7xx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51352'),
  ('966520534171408147', 'Anne Frank''s Diary', 1995, 'Animation, History, Drama, War', 'Akinori Nagaoka, Yoshinori Kanemori', 'Hachirô Konno, Roger Pulvers', '高橋玲奈, Gō Katō, Seiko Tano, Jiro Sakagami, Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Tetsuko Kuroyanagi, Yūsuke Takita, Yoshie Taira', null, 'During World War II, a teenage Jewish girl named Anne Frank and her family are forced into hiding in the Nazi-occupied Netherlands.', 'During World War II, a teenage Jewish girl named Anne Frank and her family are forced into hiding in the Nazi-occupied Netherlands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFVgglkfaEoBZodxeP1VG9QrNd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128396'),
  ('826503747984777659', 'Anne of Green Gables', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'George Nichols Jr., Lucien N. Andriot, C.C. Thompson', 'Sam Mintz', 'Anne Shirley, O. P. Heggie, Helen Westley, Tom Brown, Sara Haden, Murray Kinnell, Gertrude Messinger, Charley Grapewin', 'NR', 'Anne Shirley, an orphan, is fostered by farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla, who were expecting a boy to be sent them to help with their farm work. They accept Anne, who quickly endears herself to them and to the local villagers.', 'Anne Shirley, an orphan, is fostered by farmer Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla, who were expecting a boy to be sent them to help with their farm work. They accept Anne, who quickly endears herself to them and to the local villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkXXyY8rqToMwCkGndUk9I3GAl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43901'),
  ('221869504362781935', 'Anne of Green Gables', 1985, 'Family, Drama', 'Kevin Sullivan, Rene Ohashi', null, 'Megan Follows, Colleen Dewhurst, Richard Farnsworth, Patricia Hamilton, Marilyn Lightstone, Schuyler Grant, Jonathan Crombie, Charmion King', 'PG', 'At the turn of the century on Prince Edward Island, Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla decide to take on an orphan boy as help for their farm. But they get an unexpected jolt when they''re mistakenly sent a girl instead: Anne Shirley.', 'At the turn of the century on Prince Edward Island, Matthew Cuthbert and his sister Marilla decide to take on an orphan boy as help for their farm. But they get an unexpected jolt when they''re mistakenly sent a girl instead: Anne Shirley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1owlDzKO3DQpFKNFBnuQlPF891.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17663'),
  ('195119045676218550', 'Anne of Green Gables', 2016, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Ousama Rawi, John Kent Harrison', 'Susan Coyne', 'Ella Ballentine, Martin Sheen, Sara Botsford, Julia Lalonde, Kate Hennig, Stefani Kimber, Linda Kash, Drew Haytaoglu', 'G', 'A retelling of L.M. Montgomery''s story of Anne Shirley, an orphan who is accidentally sent to a couple looking to adopt a boy instead.', 'A retelling of L.M. Montgomery''s story of Anne Shirley, an orphan who is accidentally sent to a couple looking to adopt a boy instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naohj9jmNggrodVingNs1veCwXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397520'),
  ('1128631929283335369', 'Anne of Green Gables: The Sequel', 1987, 'Family, Drama, Romance', 'Kevin Sullivan, Marc Champion', 'Kevin Sullivan', 'Megan Follows, Jonathan Crombie, Colleen Dewhurst, Patricia Hamilton, Schuyler Grant, Rosemary Dunsmore, Frank Converse, Genevieve Appleton', 'G', 'Anne Shirley, now a schoolteacher, has begun writing stories and collecting rejection slips. She acts as Diana''s maid of honor, develops a relationship with Gilbert Blythe, and finds herself at Kingsport Ladies'' College. But while Anne enjoys the battles and the friends she makes, she finds herself returning to Avonlea.', 'Anne Shirley, now a schoolteacher, has begun writing stories and collecting rejection slips. She acts as Diana''s maid of honor, develops a relationship with Gilbert Blythe, and finds herself at Kingsport Ladies'' College. But while Anne enjoys the battles and the friends she makes, she finds herself returning to Avonlea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2n8qhm9SQph1s7njjO1kq3c6Imk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40724'),
  ('482321945733176745', 'Anne of the Indies', 1951, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jacques Tourneur, Harry Jackson', 'Philip Dunne, Arthur Caesar', 'Jean Peters, Louis Jourdan, Debra Paget, Herbert Marshall, Thomas Gomez, James Robertson Justice, Francis Pierlot, Sean McClory', 'NR', 'After buccaneer captain Anne Providence spares Pierre LaRochelle and recruits him into her pirate crew, their growing attraction is tested when Captain Blackbeard reveals LaRochelle''s true identity as a former French navy officer.', 'After buccaneer captain Anne Providence spares Pierre LaRochelle and recruits him into her pirate crew, their growing attraction is tested when Captain Blackbeard reveals LaRochelle''s true identity as a former French navy officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqqsaRNgEKfbmyPpCSwIYgcialS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69784'),
  ('974612316166105898', 'Anne of the Thousand Days', 1969, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Charles Jarrott, Simon Relph, Nicolas Hippisley-Coxe', 'John Hale, Bridget Boland', 'Richard Burton, Geneviève Bujold, Irene Papas, Anthony Quayle, John Colicos, Michael Hordern, Katharine Blake, Peter Jeffrey', 'PG', 'Henry VIII of England discards his wife, Katharine of Aragon, who has failed to produce a male heir, in favor of the young and beautiful Anne Boleyn.', 'Henry VIII of England discards his wife, Katharine of Aragon, who has failed to produce a male heir, in favor of the young and beautiful Anne Boleyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2p5SspAs1GqeuHXNXywryU3k37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22522'),
  ('7810159870315188', 'Anne Trister', 1986, 'Drama', 'Léa Pool, Pierre Mignot', 'Marcel Beaulieu, Léa Pool', 'Albane Guilhe, Louise Marleau, Lucie Laurier, Guy Thauvette, Hugues Quester, Nüvit Özdoğru, Kim Yaroshevskaya, Carl Boileau', null, 'After the death of her father, Anne — a brilliant but emotionally unstable painter/sculptor — returns from Switzerland to her home town in Quebec. Setting up a studio, she becomes obsessed with her work, to the extent that she grows farther and farther from her Swiss lover.', 'After the death of her father, Anne — a brilliant but emotionally unstable painter/sculptor — returns from Switzerland to her home town in Quebec. Setting up a studio, she becomes obsessed with her work, to the extent that she grows farther and farther from her Swiss lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekWnSkeVyFkD2eAS9yJBiRVTtdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197538'),
  ('89667495809974059', 'Anne+: The Film', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valerie Bisscheroux, Cor Booy', 'Maud Wiemeijer', 'Hanna van Vliet, Jouman Fattal, Thorn Roos de Vries, Eline van Gils, Jesse Mensah, Jade Olieberg, Huib Cluistra, Amy van der Weerden', null, 'Just before Anne is moving from Amsterdam to live with her great love Sara in Montreal, her publisher criticizes the manuscript for her first novel. What exactly is the story she''s trying to tell? Does she even have something to say at all? Anne is forced to search for what she wants in life, because it is not only the main character in her novel who seems to be a little lost.', 'Just before Anne is moving from Amsterdam to live with her great love Sara in Montreal, her publisher criticizes the manuscript for her first novel. What exactly is the story she''s trying to tell? Does she even have something to say at all? Anne is forced to search for what she wants in life, because it is not only the main character in her novel who seems to be a little lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Pcz7SOPerJ0OjJnTVFb4YozpEi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808579'),
  ('1039322100324272485', 'Annette', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clément Ducol, Fiora Cutler, Leos Carax', null, 'Adam Driver, Marion Cotillard, Simon Helberg, Devyn McDowell, Natalia Lafourcade, Sinay Bavurhe, Franziska Grohmann, Rachel Mulowayi', 'R', 'In present-day Los Angeles, controversial stand-up comedian Henry McHenry and internationally renowned opera singer Ann Defrasnoux form the façade of a happy couple in the spotlight. Ann gives birth to a baby girl named Annette, who possesses an exceptional gift that will change all of their lives forever.', 'In present-day Los Angeles, controversial stand-up comedian Henry McHenry and internationally renowned opera singer Ann Defrasnoux form the façade of a happy couple in the spotlight. Ann gives birth to a baby girl named Annette, who possesses an exceptional gift that will change all of their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FTnypxpGltJdIARrfFsP31pGTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424277'),
  ('917997125110042552', 'Annie', 1976, 'Drama', 'Massimo Dallamano, Amanzio Todini, Franco Delli Colli', 'Harry Alan Towers, Massimo Dallamano, Marcello Coscia', 'Annie Belle, Felicity Devonshire, Ciro Ippolito, Maria Rohm, Charles Fawcett, Al Cliver, Linda Ho, Charlie Chan Yiu-Lam', null, 'Annie, the mistress of a middle-aged financier, accompanies him on a trip to Hong Kong. When his business interests collapse Annie ends up destitute. She is befriended by a group of socialites and begins her rite of passage in their world.', 'Annie, the mistress of a middle-aged financier, accompanies him on a trip to Hong Kong. When his business interests collapse Annie ends up destitute. She is befriended by a group of socialites and begins her rite of passage in their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdoMKkMQvpvXbNrDoxWqCanN2vM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28680'),
  ('646700949482860661', 'Annie', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'John Huston, Richard Moore, Dianne Wager', 'Carol Sobieski, Thomas Meehan', 'Aileen Quinn, Albert Finney, Carol Burnett, Ann Reinking, Tim Curry, Bernadette Peters, Geoffrey Holder, Roger Minami', 'PG', 'An orphan in a facility run by the mean Miss Hannigan, Annie believes that her parents left her there by mistake. When a rich man named Oliver "Daddy" Warbucks decides to let an orphan live at his home to promote his image, Annie is selected. While Annie gets accustomed to living in Warbucks'' mansion, she still longs to meet her parents. So Warbucks announces a search for them and a reward, which brings out many frauds.', 'An orphan in a facility run by the mean Miss Hannigan, Annie believes that her parents left her there by mistake. When a rich man named Oliver "Daddy" Warbucks decides to let an orphan live at his home to promote his image, Annie is selected. While Annie gets accustomed to living in Warbucks'' mansion, she still longs to meet her parents. So Warbucks announces a search for them and a reward, which brings out many frauds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xopqD99S1GqQOG8UAeSElsX9MeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15739'),
  ('581793396363137143', 'Annie', 1999, 'Music, Family, Comedy', 'Rob Marshall, Ralf D. Bode', null, 'Alicia Morton, Kathy Bates, Victor Garber, Alan Cumming, Audra McDonald, Kristin Chenoweth, Erin Adams, Sarah Hyland', 'PG', 'Things seem pretty bad for a young girl living a "hard-knock life" in an orphanage. Fed up with the dastardly Miss Hannigan, Annie escapes the run-down orphanage determined to find her mom and dad. It''s an adventure that takes her from the cold, mean streets of New York to the warm, comforting arms of bighearted billionaire Oliver Warbucks - with plenty of mischief and music in between.', 'Things seem pretty bad for a young girl living a "hard-knock life" in an orphanage. Fed up with the dastardly Miss Hannigan, Annie escapes the run-down orphanage determined to find her mom and dad. It''s an adventure that takes her from the cold, mean streets of New York to the warm, comforting arms of bighearted billionaire Oliver Warbucks - with plenty of mischief and music in between.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0XWZC1A7PbWf1gwmvbvhY9uWM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26177'),
  ('281460344294264209', 'Annie', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Will Gluck, Michael Grady, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Aline Brosh McKenna, Will Gluck', 'Quvenzhané Wallis, Jamie Foxx, Rose Byrne, Cameron Diaz, Bobby Cannavale, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, David Zayas, Amanda Troya', 'PG', 'Annie is a young, happy foster kid who''s also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they''d be back for her someday, it''s been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything''s about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he''s her guardian angel, but Annie''s self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it''s the other way around.', 'Annie is a young, happy foster kid who''s also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they''d be back for her someday, it''s been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything''s about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he''s her guardian angel, but Annie''s self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it''s the other way around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKAM9V0izx4VhsdyAdBvAB26UCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196867'),
  ('216309386696109496', 'Annie Get Your Gun', 1950, 'Music, Comedy, Romance, Western', 'George Sidney, Adolph Deutsch, Charles Rosher', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Betty Hutton, Howard Keel, Louis Calhern, J. Carrol Naish, Edward Arnold, Keenan Wynn, Benay Venuta, Clinton Sundberg', 'NR', 'Gunslinger Annie Oakley romances fellow sharpshooter Frank Butler as they travel with Buffalo Bill''s Wild West Show.', 'Gunslinger Annie Oakley romances fellow sharpshooter Frank Butler as they travel with Buffalo Bill''s Wild West Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2ZLeqZVI2FYctcrFwm5C86zkLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25209'),
  ('1024104358539533541', 'Annie Leibovitz: Life Through a Lens', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Barbara Leibovitz, Nicholas Blair, Jaime Hellman', 'Barbara Leibovitz', 'Annie Leibovitz, George Clooney, Kirsten Dunst, Jason Schwartzman, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Mark Holborn, Anna Wintour, Robert Wilson', null, 'An account of the professional and personal life of renowned American photographer Annie Leibovitz, from her early artistic endeavors to her international success as a photojournalist, war reporter, and pop culture chronicler.', 'An account of the professional and personal life of renowned American photographer Annie Leibovitz, from her early artistic endeavors to her international success as a photojournalist, war reporter, and pop culture chronicler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hT7sATh60MsEHAWhiuR6seKQQFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49255'),
  ('832986177878093059', 'Annie Oakley', 1894, 'Documentary, Western', 'William K.L. Dickson, William Heise', null, 'Annie Oakley', null, 'A short Edison Black Maria studio film featuring famed sharpshooter Annie Oakley, known as “Little Sure Shot.” Born Phoebe Ann Oakley Mozee in Ohio in 1860, she rose to global fame performing with Buffalo Bill’s Wild West show. Accompanied (likely) by her husband and fellow marksman Frank Butler, Oakley’s diminutive stature belied her legendary marksmanship.', 'A short Edison Black Maria studio film featuring famed sharpshooter Annie Oakley, known as “Little Sure Shot.” Born Phoebe Ann Oakley Mozee in Ohio in 1860, she rose to global fame performing with Buffalo Bill’s Wild West show. Accompanied (likely) by her husband and fellow marksman Frank Butler, Oakley’s diminutive stature belied her legendary marksmanship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXFwgPgMpOOUID3NCUGdLuakrEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144393'),
  ('500024390392697272', 'Annie Oakley', 1935, 'Drama, Western', 'George Stevens, J. Roy Hunt, Alberto Colombo', 'Joel Sayre, John Twist', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Preston Foster, Melvyn Douglas, Moroni Olsen, Pert Kelton, Andy Clyde, Chief Thunderbird, Margaret Armstrong', 'NR', 'Awkward Annie loves her sharpshooting rival in Buffalo Bill''s Wild West Show.', 'Awkward Annie loves her sharpshooting rival in Buffalo Bill''s Wild West Show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktF8RMMBs8zzjTPqn7HpYF6ddAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43887'),
  ('338171338186000609', 'Annie: A Royal Adventure', 1995, 'Music, Family', 'Ian Toynton, Paul Morris', 'Trish Soodik', 'Ashley Johnson, Joan Collins, George Hearn, Ian McDiarmid, Emily Ann Lloyd, Camilla Belle, Crispin Bonham-Carter, Perry Benson', 'G', 'Annie is back! Along with her friends Molly, Hannah, her dog Sandy, and her wealthy father Oliver Warbucks. They take a trip to England where Warbucks is going to be Knighted by the King. Annie and the gang stumbles onto a wicked scheme led by an evil noblewoman who plans to blow up Buckingham Palace so she can become Queen and claim the throne for herself! And now it is up to Annie and her friends to stop her!', 'Annie is back! Along with her friends Molly, Hannah, her dog Sandy, and her wealthy father Oliver Warbucks. They take a trip to England where Warbucks is going to be Knighted by the King. Annie and the gang stumbles onto a wicked scheme led by an evil noblewoman who plans to blow up Buckingham Palace so she can become Queen and claim the throne for herself! And now it is up to Annie and her friends to stop her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXSZSwjHf8NZ0d6pnfS7dVhifVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21780'),
  ('1013622630494953483', 'Annie''s Coming Out', 1984, 'Drama', 'Gil Brealey', null, 'Angela Punch McGregor, Drew Forsythe, Liddy Clark, Monica Maughan, Philippa Baker, Tina Arhondis, John Frawley', null, 'It tells the story of a young female social worker who begins work at a hospital for retarded children, and discovers that some of the psychological problems attributed to these children are incorrectly diagnosed. Proving this to be the case is difficult, however, as it is generally accepted that as those who are ''profoundly retarded'' cannot communicate, therefore they cannot think. In the case of Annie O''Farrell (Tina Arhondis), finding a way for her to ''talk'', other than speaking or writing, finally shows that she is not only able to think, but is highly intelligent. The battle against the hospital to acknowledge this in a legal sense goes to court, as the psychiatrists try to hide their misdiagnosis.', 'It tells the story of a young female social worker who begins work at a hospital for retarded children, and discovers that some of the psychological problems attributed to these children are incorrectly diagnosed. Proving this to be the case is difficult, however, as it is generally accepted that as those who are ''profoundly retarded'' cannot communicate, therefore they cannot think. In the case of Annie O''Farrell (Tina Arhondis), finding a way for her to ''talk'', other than speaking or writing, finally shows that she is not only able to think, but is highly intelligent. The battle against the hospital to acknowledge this in a legal sense goes to court, as the psychiatrists try to hide their misdiagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZCsC1j2M6TwqXFDmh0uR1sRv8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118491'),
  ('374879180330508303', 'Annihilation', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Alex Garland, Matthew Penry-Davey, Denis Schnegg', 'Alex Garland', 'Natalie Portman, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Gina Rodriguez, Tessa Thompson, Tuva Novotny, Oscar Isaac, Benedict Wong, Sonoya Mizuno', 'R', 'A biologist signs up for a dangerous, secret expedition into a mysterious zone where the laws of nature don''t apply.', 'A biologist signs up for a dangerous, secret expedition into a mysterious zone where the laws of nature don''t apply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YRplSk6BhH6PRuE9gfyw9byUJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300668'),
  ('686357541096222709', 'Annihilator', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie', 'Michael Chapman, Paul Goldsmith, Stan Zabka', 'Roderick Taylor, Bruce A. Taylor', 'Mark Lindsay Chapman, Susan Blakely, Lisa Blount, Brion James, Earl Boen, Geoffrey Lewis, Catherine Mary Stewart, Nicole Eggert', null, 'Humanoid killer robots stalk a newspaperman, who has knowledge of their existence. One of the robots is made to look like his girl friend.', 'Humanoid killer robots stalk a newspaperman, who has knowledge of their existence. One of the robots is made to look like his girl friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwWoknF64tJ4PGcY4US1yGPqNpv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170885'),
  ('402710187526767488', 'Annihilator Unleashed', 2026, 'Action, Drama', 'Waqar Peter Gill', 'Waqar Peter Gill', 'Pratik Sehajpal, Julius John, Dan Arora', 'R', 'A reclusive ex-cartel enforcer is drawn back into bloodshed when he saves a singer from murder, leading to a confrontation with a vengeful crime lord seeking revenge against him.', 'A reclusive ex-cartel enforcer is drawn back into bloodshed when he saves a singer from murder, leading to a confrontation with a vengeful crime lord seeking revenge against him.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fve58p2OiWvTd8fO8AEIMmSI38jE.jpg', 'plex:movie:annihilator-unleashed'),
  ('1111975362308860766', 'Annika Bengtzon: Crime Reporter - Studio Sex', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Agneta Fagerström-Olsson, John Olsson, Sheila Kilic', 'Antonia Pyk', 'Malin Crépin, Björn Kjellman, Leif Andrée, Kajsa Ernst, Erik Johansson, Felix Engström, Richard Ulfsäter, Leonard Terfelt', null, 'A stripper at the club Studio Six is murdered. A political scandal takes off when the Minister of Commerce appears to have been at the club. He resigns - but only to hide an even bigger secret.', 'A stripper at the club Studio Six is murdered. A political scandal takes off when the Minister of Commerce appears to have been at the club. He resigns - but only to hide an even bigger secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emFDEA0ECwitNUP5mtEAbRkLnBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118279'),
  ('123068892203366033', 'Anniversary', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jan Komasa, Piotr Sobociński Jr.', 'Lori Rosene-Gambino', 'Diane Lane, Kyle Chandler, Madeline Brewer, Zoey Deutch, Mckenna Grace, Phoebe Dynevor, Dylan O''Brien, Daryl McCormack', 'R', 'When Ellen and Paul’s son Josh introduces his new girlfriend at their 25th anniversary party, no one suspects that it is the beginning of the end for this happy family. The new girlfriend is Liz, Ellen’s former student, who left the university, some years before, after Ellen called her out in class for her radical ideology.', 'When Ellen and Paul’s son Josh introduces his new girlfriend at their 25th anniversary party, no one suspects that it is the beginning of the end for this happy family. The new girlfriend is Liz, Ellen’s former student, who left the university, some years before, after Ellen called her out in class for her radical ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSdpXGBNt3mQzjZZVK6eV5NcPdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126336'),
  ('633246172218711100', 'Anniyan', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Shankar, V. Manikandan, Ravi Varman', 'Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Vikram, Sadha, Prakash Raj, Vivek, Nedumudi Venu, Nassar, Cochin Haneefa, Kalabhavan Mani', null, 'Unable to bear the growing corruption in society and rejection from his love interest, a meek lawyer becomes diagnosed with multiple personality disorder due to which the personalities of a vigilante killer and a metrosexual start existing within him.', 'Unable to bear the growing corruption in society and rejection from his love interest, a meek lawyer becomes diagnosed with multiple personality disorder due to which the personalities of a vigilante killer and a metrosexual start existing within him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yvvHfswmlMcuivXe6gRu6uTzhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19978'),
