  ('278060213100288196', 'Anomalous', 2016, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'Hugo Stuven Casasnovas', 'David Zurdo, Hugo Stuven Casasnovas, Fernando Acevedo', 'Lluís Homar, Christy Escobar, Edgar Fox, Adria Arjona', null, 'A young schizophrenic who felt threatened by a presence he was unable to define turns up gruesomely dead in his bathtub', 'A young schizophrenic who felt threatened by a presence he was unable to define turns up gruesomely dead in his bathtub', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF1s437myprp8pd2n7pzfyqUBOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419315'),
  ('39643374933469959', 'Anomie', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Riyas Marath, Sujith Sarang', 'Riyas Marath', 'Rahman, Vishnu Agasthya, Shebin Benson, Arjun Lal, Binu Pappu', null, 'Zaara, a relentless sister seeking answers in her brother''s unresolved case, confronts a police officer after days of failed investigation. As faith in the system erodes, pursue the truth on parallel paths leading to a haunting revelation.', 'Zaara, a relentless sister seeking answers in her brother''s unresolved case, confronts a police officer after days of failed investigation. As faith in the system erodes, pursue the truth on parallel paths leading to a haunting revelation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fp9czhWmPhyMFp8eHNYO34Z9hOGA.jpg', 'plex:movie:anomie-2026'),
  ('961422153594260302', 'Anon', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Andrew Shea, Sarah Campbell, Elis Y. Lam', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Clive Owen, Amanda Seyfried, Colm Feore, Mark O''Brien, Sonya Walger, Joe Pingue, Iddo Goldberg, Afiya Bennett', 'R', 'Set in a near-future world where there is no privacy, ignorance or anonymity, our private memories are recorded and crime almost ceases to exist. In trying to solve a series of unsolved murders, Sal Frieland stumbles onto a young woman who appears to have subverted the system and disappeared. She has no identity, no history and no record. Sal realizes it may not be the end of crime but the beginning. Known only as ''The Girl'', Sal must find her before he becomes the next victim.', 'Set in a near-future world where there is no privacy, ignorance or anonymity, our private memories are recorded and crime almost ceases to exist. In trying to solve a series of unsolved murders, Sal Frieland stumbles onto a young woman who appears to have subverted the system and disappeared. She has no identity, no history and no record. Sal realizes it may not be the end of crime but the beginning. Known only as ''The Girl'', Sal must find her before he becomes the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhBTO9n3fxy3HJt7WlR9h9vvVmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396806'),
  ('686554094804175635', 'Anonymous', 2011, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Roland Emmerich, Anna Foerster, Stephan O. Gessler', 'John Orloff', 'Jamie Campbell Bower, Rhys Ifans, David Thewlis, Joely Richardson, Vanessa Redgrave, Sebastian Armesto, Rafe Spall, Edward Hogg', 'PG-13', 'Set against the backdrop of the succession of Queen Elizabeth I, and the Essex Rebellion against her, the story advances the theory that it was in fact Edward De Vere, Earl of Oxford who penned Shakespeare''s plays.', 'Set against the backdrop of the succession of Queen Elizabeth I, and the Essex Rebellion against her, the story advances the theory that it was in fact Edward De Vere, Earl of Oxford who penned Shakespeare''s plays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRjdFP0kqCPaDKeXgQtsb7how6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61891'),
  ('18905759881740967', 'Anonymous Animals', 2021, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Baptiste Rouveure, Emmanuel Dauchy, Kevin Brunet', 'Baptiste Rouveure', 'Thierry Marcos, Aurélien Chilarski, Pauline Guilpain, Emilien Lavaut', null, 'The balance of power between man and animal is reversed. In a remote countryside, any encounter with the dominant can become hostile. At the crossroads of fantastic and suspense kind, Anonymous Animals questions the place of animals in our societies.', 'The balance of power between man and animal is reversed. In a remote countryside, any encounter with the dominant can become hostile. At the crossroads of fantastic and suspense kind, Anonymous Animals questions the place of animals in our societies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTk93f5Uc8Bys4gvwFH7dHIoAMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734322'),
  ('745494030451607393', 'Anonymous Noise', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Koichiro Miki, Yoko Itakura', 'Koichiro Miki, Rie Yokota', 'Ayami Nakajo, Jun Shison, Yuta Koseki, Erina Mano, Hayato Isomura, Yosuke Sugino', null, 'Every day, a young girl wearing a mask stands by the beach and sings a nostalgic melody. After experiencing two sudden heart-wrenching partings when she was only a child, Nino Arisugawa has been singing her songs to the ocean, bound by a promise made with her two childhood friends—her first love, Momo Sakaki, and a boy who composed music, Kanade "Yuzu" Yuzuriha. Having never met each other, the boys both individually promised that if Nino was ever separated from them, her voice would be the beacon to reunite them once again.', 'Every day, a young girl wearing a mask stands by the beach and sings a nostalgic melody. After experiencing two sudden heart-wrenching partings when she was only a child, Nino Arisugawa has been singing her songs to the ocean, bound by a promise made with her two childhood friends—her first love, Momo Sakaki, and a boy who composed music, Kanade "Yuzu" Yuzuriha. Having never met each other, the boys both individually promised that if Nino was ever separated from them, her voice would be the beacon to reunite them once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/233beMjWtmk4tGcbbWCLlAdV9FO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494086'),
