  ('44534026922266892', 'Another Cinderella Story', 2008, 'Music, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Damon Santostefano, Jon Joffin', 'Erik Patterson, Jessica Scott', 'Selena Gomez, Drew Seeley, Jane Lynch, Katharine Isabelle, Emily Perkins, Jessica Parker Kennedy, Marcus T. Paulk, Nicole LaPlaca', 'PG', 'A guy who danced with what could be the girl of his dreams at a costume ball only has one hint at her identity: the Zune she left behind as she rushed home in order to make her curfew. And with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity in front of him, he sets out to find his masked beauty.', 'A guy who danced with what could be the girl of his dreams at a costume ball only has one hint at her identity: the Zune she left behind as she rushed home in order to make her curfew. And with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity in front of him, he sets out to find his masked beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bW957WNXiiUvIGFaUVL7wMeD776.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15157'),
