  ('71086113662731250', 'Another Gantz', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Shinsuke Sato, Yuji Shimomura', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Kanata Hongo, Haruhiko Kato, Kenichi Matsuyama, Natsuna Watanabe, Kazunari Ninomiya, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'Before finding out the Perfect Answer, discover Another Gantz. Aired on Nippon Television network before the theatrical release of Gantz: The Perfect Answer, this film is an alternate perspective version of the first Gantz film from the same writing-directing team of the two-part theatrical film. In addition to condensed scenes from the Gantz film, Another Gantz features a new subplot that follows an investigative journalist not included in the theatrical film. Delving deep into the mystery, Another Gantz offers another piece towards solving the complex puzzle that is the world of Gantz.', 'Before finding out the Perfect Answer, discover Another Gantz. Aired on Nippon Television network before the theatrical release of Gantz: The Perfect Answer, this film is an alternate perspective version of the first Gantz film from the same writing-directing team of the two-part theatrical film. In addition to condensed scenes from the Gantz film, Another Gantz features a new subplot that follows an investigative journalist not included in the theatrical film. Delving deep into the mystery, Another Gantz offers another piece towards solving the complex puzzle that is the world of Gantz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7mNGE3oYjSzBhXWLkcRK68ewzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244478'),
  ('719968506957775673', 'Another Gay Movie', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Todd Stephens, Carl Bartels', 'Todd Stephens', 'Michael Carbonaro, Jonah Blechman, Jonathan Chase, Mitch Morris, Ashlie Atkinson, Scott Thompson, Graham Norton, Angela Oh', 'NR', 'Andy is your typical All-American eighteen-year-old gay virgin. Like everyone else, he''s dying to have sex. Totally out of the closet and mad-crazy horny, this naïve high school senior is caught in that awkward vortex between child and adult. Much to the dismay of his mom (who wonders why all her carrots and cucumbers keep disappearing), Andy spends much of his private time practicing for the big moment when he''ll finally take the plunge.', 'Andy is your typical All-American eighteen-year-old gay virgin. Like everyone else, he''s dying to have sex. Totally out of the closet and mad-crazy horny, this naïve high school senior is caught in that awkward vortex between child and adult. Much to the dismay of his mom (who wonders why all her carrots and cucumbers keep disappearing), Andy spends much of his private time practicing for the big moment when he''ll finally take the plunge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKdilPwtuoZRhw9A63qzduRkSbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12795'),
  ('342460342835300891', 'Another Gay Sequel: Gays Gone Wild!', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Todd Stephens, Carl Bartels', 'Todd Stephens', 'Jonah Blechman, Jake Mosser, Aaron Michael Davies, Jimmy Clabots, Euriamis Losada, Perez Hilton, RuPaul, Scott Thompson', 'NR', 'Four university students head to Florida for spring break and enroll in a contest to see who can get the most sexual partners.', 'Four university students head to Florida for spring break and enroll in a contest to see who can get the most sexual partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7hDHBpZlUX5JCGfpukLXkKrH4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15706'),
  ('45334286331296947', 'Another Happy Day', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sam Levinson, Ivan Strasburg', 'Sam Levinson', 'Ellen Barkin, Ezra Miller, Ellen Burstyn, Demi Moore, Thomas Haden Church, Kate Bosworth, George Kennedy, Jeffrey DeMunn', 'R', 'A wedding at her parents'' Annapolis estate hurls high-strung Lynn into the center of touchy family dynamics.', 'A wedding at her parents'' Annapolis estate hurls high-strung Lynn into the center of touchy family dynamics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOS14Pr563QEUd3bath9LwhhId3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60422'),
  ('502851316828428443', 'Another Heaven', 2000, 'Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'George Iida, Hiroshi Takase', 'George Iida', 'Yosuke Eguchi, Miwako Ichikawa, Takashi Kashiwabara, Haruhiko Kato, Naomasa Musaka, Kunihiko Ida, Yosinori Kô, Toshi Shioya', 'R', 'A pair of hard-boiled Tokyo cops are investigating a gruesome murder: after killing the victim, the murderer cut his skull open and cooked his brain in a stew. As they try to track down the killer, they discover that, quite literally, everybody is a suspect. Will they bring the terror to an end, or will they become part of it themselves?', 'A pair of hard-boiled Tokyo cops are investigating a gruesome murder: after killing the victim, the murderer cut his skull open and cooked his brain in a stew. As they try to track down the killer, they discover that, quite literally, everybody is a suspect. Will they bring the terror to an end, or will they become part of it themselves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwanI9kFGyAR8ENcNImN6NcMu9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62004'),
  ('482652850187966551', 'Another Kind of I Do', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Raúl García', 'Frankie Bracero', 'Braulio Castillo Jr., Sara Pastor, Jazmin Caratini, Michael Stuart, Marcos Carlos Cintrón, Richard Rondon, Francis Rosas', 'NR', 'Eduardito, the son of Dr. Zalduondo and his partner Maurice, marries. If Mariana''s wedding was memorable, Eduardito has proposed that hers be even more so. It will be the first gay wedding in the traditional town of Castañer in Lares, Puerto Rico. The greatest one ever held in family and in the countryside. And you are invited. Not to be missed.', 'Eduardito, the son of Dr. Zalduondo and his partner Maurice, marries. If Mariana''s wedding was memorable, Eduardito has proposed that hers be even more so. It will be the first gay wedding in the traditional town of Castañer in Lares, Puerto Rico. The greatest one ever held in family and in the countryside. And you are invited. Not to be missed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbgZKSB76uYKLhP7KzxD8YL4BJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723629'),
  ('316220542574046666', 'Another Life', 2014, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Mouret', null, 'JoeyStarr, Virginie Ledoyen, Jasmine Trinca, Stéphane Freiss, Bernard Verley, Ariane Ascaride, Thibault Vinçon, Vittoria Scognamiglio', null, 'The South of France. Internationally famous pianist Aurore collapses one night during a performance, over-exhausted from too many concerts. Tired of music, she believes she no longer has anything to offer her public. Then she meets Jean, an electrician who installs residential security systems. Despite their differences, they immediately fall in love and plan a new life together. Jean intends to leave his long-time partner, Dolorès, but she will stop at nothing to keep him.', 'The South of France. Internationally famous pianist Aurore collapses one night during a performance, over-exhausted from too many concerts. Tired of music, she believes she no longer has anything to offer her public. Then she meets Jean, an electrician who installs residential security systems. Despite their differences, they immediately fall in love and plan a new life together. Jean intends to leave his long-time partner, Dolorès, but she will stop at nothing to keep him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AG0CKgQZHcrdagALEZDvfb1O0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247319'),
  ('1076755328107868098', 'Another Man', 2009, 'Drama', 'Lionel Baier', 'Lionel Baier', 'Robin Harsch, Natacha Koutchoumov, Elodie Weber, Georges-Henri Dépraz, Brigitte Jordan, Olivia Csiky Trnka, Bulle Ogier, Agnieszka Kowalski', null, 'Psychological drama about a young, inexperienced film reviewer who falls for the charms of a well-established female colleague. A challenging look at the essence of film critique as well as an erotic encounter between two unequals.', 'Psychological drama about a young, inexperienced film reviewer who falls for the charms of a well-established female colleague. A challenging look at the essence of film critique as well as an erotic encounter between two unequals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dOyABMxPHwQA3yyfXtWyDLWG7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131420'),
  ('238057392303650420', 'Another Man, Another Chance', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Claude Lelouch, Jacques Lefrançois, Stanley Cortez', 'Claude Lelouch', 'James Caan, Geneviève Bujold, Francis Huster, Susan Tyrrell, Jennifer Warren, Rossie Harris, Linda Lee Lyons, Jacques Villeret', null, 'Young Jeanne falls in love with photographer Francis, who soon takes her with him when he emigrates to America. In a small town in the still wild west, they build up a small photo shop. Meanwhile, animal doctor David lives on his lonesome farm together with his unlucky wife. It takes years and two tragic accidents until Jeanne and David meet. She has already decided to return to France as soon as possible, but love, and fate, have other plans.', 'Young Jeanne falls in love with photographer Francis, who soon takes her with him when he emigrates to America. In a small town in the still wild west, they build up a small photo shop. Meanwhile, animal doctor David lives on his lonesome farm together with his unlucky wife. It takes years and two tragic accidents until Jeanne and David meet. She has already decided to return to France as soon as possible, but love, and fate, have other plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aW1k75z1NqVhH4TN938AO3UlGem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146117'),
  ('148146072969350303', 'Another Man''s Poison', 1951, 'Crime, Drama', 'Irving Rapper, Robert Krasker, George Fowler', 'Val Guest', 'Bette Davis, Gary Merrill, Emlyn Williams, Anthony Steel, Barbara Murray, Reginald Beckwith, Edna Morris', 'NR', 'Mystery novelist Janet Frobisher, lives in an isolated house, having been separated for years from her criminal husband. She has fallen in love with her secretary''s fiancé and when her estranged husband unexpectedly returns, Janet poisons him, but just as she''s about to dispose of the body, one of her husband''s criminal cohorts also shows up.', 'Mystery novelist Janet Frobisher, lives in an isolated house, having been separated for years from her criminal husband. She has fallen in love with her secretary''s fiancé and when her estranged husband unexpectedly returns, Janet poisons him, but just as she''s about to dispose of the body, one of her husband''s criminal cohorts also shows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1l9H43tauTdy4PZaekywdLYY5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53714'),
  ('180051286200329705', 'Another Me', 2013, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Isabel Coixet, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Sophie Turner, Claire Forlani, Rhys Ifans, Eugenio Pérez, Gregg Sulkin, Priyanka Patel, Ivana Baquero, Jonathan Rhys Meyers', 'PG-13', 'A teenager finds her perfect life upended when she''s stalked by a mysterious doppelganger who has her eyes set on assuming her identity.', 'A teenager finds her perfect life upended when she''s stalked by a mysterious doppelganger who has her eyes set on assuming her identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryGdE6W9oMSKSRE0CSaHActo4oh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252529'),
  ('567688780499830529', 'Another Me', 2022, 'Comedy, History', 'Yikang Liu, Xiaoming Yang, Gao Ke', 'Gao Ke', 'Ma Li, Chang Yuan, Allen, Wei Xiang, Wang Chengsi, Song Xiaobao, Clara Lee', null, 'After finding himself looking exactly the same as the crown prince, a constable decides to change his identity.', 'After finding himself looking exactly the same as the crown prince, a constable decides to change his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grzCmY1ZFePuT5I4xZKK4ZGQAt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:903125'),
  ('915384731913933455', 'Another Part of the Forest', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Gordon, Hal Mohr, Ben Chapman', 'Vladimir Pozner', 'Fredric March, Dan Duryea, Edmond O''Brien, Ann Blyth, Florence Eldridge, John Dall, Betsy Blair, Dona Drake', 'NR', 'This ''prequel'' to The Little Foxes tells how the ruthless members of the old-South Hubbard family got that way.', 'This ''prequel'' to The Little Foxes tells how the ruthless members of the old-South Hubbard family got that way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBsOsTBPJO0E2myqHGlXuuDrAXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161716'),
  ('546525161595471959', 'Another Public Enemy', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'Kang Woo-suk, Kim Sung-bok', 'Kim Hee-jae', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Jung Jun-ho, Kang Shin-il, Park Keun-hyong, Byun Hee-bong, Park Sang-wook, Uhm Tae-woong, Jeong Gyu-su', null, 'A criminal psychopath from a wealthy family is confronted with Chul-jung Kang, a former classmate who no longer likes his activities.', 'A criminal psychopath from a wealthy family is confronted with Chul-jung Kang, a former classmate who no longer likes his activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr3JPTQgNyUwa5rbm4ZLAktJo8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32213'),
  ('818999724711271237', 'Another Round', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Tobias Lindholm', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Thomas Bo Larsen, Magnus Millang, Lars Ranthe, Maria Bonnevie, Helene Reingaard Neumann, Susse Wold, Magnus Sjørup', 'NR', 'Four stagnant high school teachers decide to test out a theory that maintaining a constant level of intoxication will improve their overall lives.', 'Four stagnant high school teachers decide to test out a theory that maintaining a constant level of intoxication will improve their overall lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDcIt4NHURLKnAEu7gow51Yd00Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580175'),
  ('894030219176050233', 'Another Silence', 2011, 'Drama', 'Santiago Amigorena, Lucio Bonelli', 'Santiago Amigorena, Nicolás Buenaventura', 'Marie-Josée Croze, Benz Antoine, Ignacio Rogers, Ailín Salas, Amber Goldfarb, Tony Nardi, Alison Louder, Luis Oliva', null, 'Marie is a Toronto police officer. One evening, her husband Joshua and their son Nicky are brutally murdered in their car. Marie quickly links Pablo Molina, an Argentinian drug trafficker who she''d arrested a few months earlier, with the crime. In despair, Marie heads to Argentina on the tracks of the killer. A journey of revenge and a journey to come to terms with her loss.', 'Marie is a Toronto police officer. One evening, her husband Joshua and their son Nicky are brutally murdered in their car. Marie quickly links Pablo Molina, an Argentinian drug trafficker who she''d arrested a few months earlier, with the crime. In despair, Marie heads to Argentina on the tracks of the killer. A journey of revenge and a journey to come to terms with her loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvNTerBmd6S4OjikQejuu0dqe3d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93195'),
  ('252004280707792060', 'Another Simple Favor', 2025, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Paul Feig, John Schwartzman, Gianpaolo Rifino', 'Laeta Kalogridis, Jessica Sharzer', 'Anna Kendrick, Blake Lively, Michele Morrone, Henry Golding, Allison Janney, Elizabeth Perkins, Elena Sofia Ricci, Alex Newell', 'R', 'Stephanie and Emily reunite on the beautiful island of Capri, Italy for Emily''s extravagant wedding to a rich Italian businessman. Along with the glamorous guests, expect murder and betrayal to RSVP for a wedding with more twists and turns than the road from the Marina Grande to the Capri town square.', 'Stephanie and Emily reunite on the beautiful island of Capri, Italy for Emily''s extravagant wedding to a rich Italian businessman. Along with the glamorous guests, expect murder and betrayal to RSVP for a wedding with more twists and turns than the road from the Marina Grande to the Capri town square.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zboCGZ4aIqPMd7VFI4HWnmc7KYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974573'),
  ('1008788944132315960', 'Another Stakeout', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'John Badham, Roy H. Wagner, D.J. Caruso', 'Jim Kouf, Lynn Bigelow-Kouf', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Emilio Estevez, Rosie O''Donnell, Dennis Farina, Miguel Ferrer, Cathy Moriarty, Marcia Strassman, Dan Lauria', 'PG-13', 'A pair of immature detectives are joined by a pesky assistant district attorney in staking out a lakeside home where an important Mafia trial witness is believed to be heading.', 'A pair of immature detectives are joined by a pesky assistant district attorney in staking out a lakeside home where an important Mafia trial witness is believed to be heading.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBItFUmCrRS1mel0TM69ymBD79k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9409'),
  ('846931058449898914', 'Another State of Mind', 1984, 'Documentary, Music', 'Peter Stuart, Adam Small', null, 'Mike Ness, Sean Stern, Adam Stern, Ian MacKaye, Dennis Danell, Brent Liles, John Macias, Keith Morris', 'NR', 'Another State of Mind is a documentary film made in the summer of 1982 chronicling the adventure (and misadventure) of two punk bands – Social Distortion and Youth Brigade – as they embark on their first international tour. Along the way they meet up with another progressive punk band, Minor Threat, whom they hang out with at the Dischord house for about a week near the end of their ill-fated tour.', 'Another State of Mind is a documentary film made in the summer of 1982 chronicling the adventure (and misadventure) of two punk bands – Social Distortion and Youth Brigade – as they embark on their first international tour. Along the way they meet up with another progressive punk band, Minor Threat, whom they hang out with at the Dischord house for about a week near the end of their ill-fated tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5XlkFS9D8tIg7yaihxgFBoFo5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42082'),
  ('1034281652133539897', 'Another Story of Love', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edwin Oyarce', null, 'Benjamín Prati, Aquiles Poblete, Eyal Meyer, Beba Koening-Robert', null, 'Diego is a twenty-year-old Chilean boy who spends every day taking pictures of anything he sees. After many years he meets Sebastian, his childhood friend, and they spend a whole summer together drinking alcohol, smoking marijuana and walking around in the blazing sun of Santiago. They both come from dysfunctional families (Diego''s mother is an alcoholic and Sebastian feels abandoned by his father and his stepmother), but the need to discover the world around them and explore their inner feelings brings them closer to each other, making their friendship very, very intense. The desire that ties them to each other is palpable, and soon barriers and fears fall, leading them to wonder what they really want.', 'Diego is a twenty-year-old Chilean boy who spends every day taking pictures of anything he sees. After many years he meets Sebastian, his childhood friend, and they spend a whole summer together drinking alcohol, smoking marijuana and walking around in the blazing sun of Santiago. They both come from dysfunctional families (Diego''s mother is an alcoholic and Sebastian feels abandoned by his father and his stepmother), but the need to discover the world around them and explore their inner feelings brings them closer to each other, making their friendship very, very intense. The desire that ties them to each other is palpable, and soon barriers and fears fall, leading them to wonder what they really want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzSTTN4GE0lFLj3rPJl0K42W9oE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222584'),
  ('302914044274725395', 'Another Summer Holiday', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Elisabetta Boni, Paolo Virzì', 'Francesco Bruni, Paolo Virzì, Carlo Virzì', 'Silvio Orlando, Sabrina Ferilli, Christian De Sica, Laura Morante, Andrea Carpenzano, Vinicio Marchioni, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Emanuela Fanelli', null, 'Altiero Molino is a twenty-six-year-old digital entrepreneur who’s returning to Ventotene with his model husband in order to gather his old friends together around his ailing father so as to treat him to one last holiday in this place which is so special to him. He didn’t expect to find the island all abuzz with Sabry Mazzalupi’s marriage to her partner Cesare. This young woman, who’s the awkward daughter of Roman shopkeeper Ruggero, has become an online celebrity and her wedding is a global event attracting the media as well as mysterious emissaries from the new political regime. These two tribes of vacationers, two seemingly irreconcilable sides of Italy, are destined to come together during the Ferragosto holiday for an ultimate showdown.', 'Altiero Molino is a twenty-six-year-old digital entrepreneur who’s returning to Ventotene with his model husband in order to gather his old friends together around his ailing father so as to treat him to one last holiday in this place which is so special to him. He didn’t expect to find the island all abuzz with Sabry Mazzalupi’s marriage to her partner Cesare. This young woman, who’s the awkward daughter of Roman shopkeeper Ruggero, has become an online celebrity and her wedding is a global event attracting the media as well as mysterious emissaries from the new political regime. These two tribes of vacationers, two seemingly irreconcilable sides of Italy, are destined to come together during the Ferragosto holiday for an ultimate showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0yItZfvxSRiUWasfTzdnCpL5X3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096252'),
  ('60110855886067085', 'Another Thin Man', 1939, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'W.S. Van Dyke, John S. Detlie, William H. Daniels', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett, Anita Loos', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Virginia Grey, Otto Kruger, C. Aubrey Smith, Ruth Hussey, Nat Pendleton, Patric Knowles', 'NR', 'Not even the joys of parenthood can stop married sleuths Nick and Nora Charles from investigating a murder on a Long Island estate.', 'Not even the joys of parenthood can stop married sleuths Nick and Nora Charles from investigating a murder on a Long Island estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmOjn9qg9Cun7P9YAKr5ajNZBcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14589'),
  ('683187334485734729', 'Another Time, Another Place', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Allen, Jack Hildyard, René Dupont', 'Stanley Mann', 'Lana Turner, Barry Sullivan, Glynis Johns, Sean Connery, Terence Longdon, Sidney James, Martin Stephens, Doris Hare', null, 'In England during WWII, an American news correspondent’s affair with a married British correspondent ends tragically when he is killed in action. Fearing a nervous breakdown as a result of his death, she travels to Cornwall to mourn with his family without any intention of revealing her relationship with him.', 'In England during WWII, an American news correspondent’s affair with a married British correspondent ends tragically when he is killed in action. Fearing a nervous breakdown as a result of his death, she travels to Cornwall to mourn with his family without any intention of revealing her relationship with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNP1r8qbCscqVnekG4jWyeV9cHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43273'),
  ('727827152292918109', 'Another Time, Another Place', 1983, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Roger Deakins, Michael Radford', 'John Francis Lane, Michael Radford', 'Phyllis Logan, Giovanni Mauriello, Denise Coffey, Tom Watson, Gianluca Favilla, Gregor Fisher, Paul Young, Claudio Rosini', null, 'Set in 1943 in Scotland during World War II. Janie is a young housewife married to a man named Dougal, 15 years her senior. As part of a war rehabilitation program, Janie and Dougal welcome three Italian POWs to work on their farm. Soon, Janie falls in love with one of them...', 'Set in 1943 in Scotland during World War II. Janie is a young housewife married to a man named Dougal, 15 years her senior. As part of a war rehabilitation program, Janie and Dougal welcome three Italian POWs to work on their farm. Soon, Janie falls in love with one of them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anoPMnxdrL4B7EMZZA5tQCmod65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73069'),
  ('969031793655502707', 'Another Way', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'Károly Makk, Tamás Andor, Mara Bóna', 'Károly Makk, Erzsébet Galgóczi', 'Jadwiga Jankowska-Cieślak, Grażyna Szapołowska, Jozef Kroner, Péter Andorai, Ádám Szirtes, Judit Pogány, Gábor Reviczky, Dénes Ujlaki', null, 'Political and sexual repression in Hungary, just after the revolution of 1956. Passionate and determined, Eva gets a job as a journalist. There, she meets Livia and is attracted to her. Livia feels much the same, but as a married woman, has doubts and hesitations. In their work, they (and Eva in particular) bang up against the limits of telling political truths; in private, they confront the limits of living out sexual and emotional truth.', 'Political and sexual repression in Hungary, just after the revolution of 1956. Passionate and determined, Eva gets a job as a journalist. There, she meets Livia and is attracted to her. Livia feels much the same, but as a married woman, has doubts and hesitations. In their work, they (and Eva in particular) bang up against the limits of telling political truths; in private, they confront the limits of living out sexual and emotional truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ly5f3QlR9XSEMnpR6ltItE2lGfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100215'),
  ('954463404361914612', 'Another WolfCop', 2017, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lowell Dean, Adam Swica', 'Lowell Dean', 'Leo Fafard, Yannick Bisson, Amy Matysio, Jonathan Cherry, Serena Miller, Devery Jacobs, Kris "The Raven" Blackwell, Alden Adair', null, 'An alcoholic cop experiences blackouts and starts turning into a werewolf when the full moon appears in the sky.', 'An alcoholic cop experiences blackouts and starts turning into a werewolf when the full moon appears in the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amvOMZgMGCg7sxScBJZOFdirlqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346652'),
  ('1116331280299248204', 'Another Woman', 1988, 'Drama', 'Woody Allen, Sven Nykvist, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Gena Rowlands, Mia Farrow, Ian Holm, Blythe Danner, Gene Hackman, Betty Buckley, Martha Plimpton, John Houseman', 'PG', 'Marion is a woman who has learned to shield herself from her emotions. She rents an apartment to work undisturbed on her new book, but by some acoustic anomaly she can hear all that is said in the next apartment in which a psychiatrist holds his office. When she hears a young woman tell that she finds it harder and harder to bear her life, Marion starts to reflect on her own life. After a series of events she comes to understand how her unemotional attitude towards the people around her affected them and herself.', 'Marion is a woman who has learned to shield herself from her emotions. She rents an apartment to work undisturbed on her new book, but by some acoustic anomaly she can hear all that is said in the next apartment in which a psychiatrist holds his office. When she hears a young woman tell that she finds it harder and harder to bear her life, Marion starts to reflect on her own life. After a series of events she comes to understand how her unemotional attitude towards the people around her affected them and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds4CcnlACh0r1r3VGa7y85dz72R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22478'),
  ('752793333603919533', 'Another Woman', 1994, 'Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Alan Smythe, Michael Storey, John Pace', 'Jim Henshaw, Lee Langley, Lyle Slack', 'Justine Bateman, Peter Outerbridge, James Purcell, Kenneth Welsh, Amy Stewart, Jackie Richardson, Elizabeth Lennie, Michael Copeman', null, 'After Lisa Temple is brutally attacked and suffers from amnesia, it seems her bitter character has changed for the better, which causes her estranged husband Paul to have second thoughts about leaving her. As she rebuilds her life, Lisa and Paul fall in love again. However; there is danger lurking and one last angry memory waiting to surface. Will their love survive?', 'After Lisa Temple is brutally attacked and suffers from amnesia, it seems her bitter character has changed for the better, which causes her estranged husband Paul to have second thoughts about leaving her. As she rebuilds her life, Lisa and Paul fall in love again. However; there is danger lurking and one last angry memory waiting to surface. Will their love survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIC5yYtecVtVETTZS2WWgHKGEg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129842'),
  ('603223993267015744', 'Another Woman''s Life', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Thierry Arbogast, Sylvie Testud', 'Sylvie Testud, Claire Lemaréchal', 'Juliette Binoche, Mathieu Kassovitz, Aure Atika, Danièle Lebrun, François Berléand, Vernon Dobtcheff, Yvi Dachary-Le Beon, Nilton Martins', null, 'When the fun loving Marie sets her eyes on brooding comic book artist Paul, it sets off the kind of romantic sparks that quickly culminate in the bedroom. But the next morning brings its share of surprises as Marie crawls out of bed to discover her life flash-forwarded fifteen years down the road: Not only has she been married to Paul all this time, but she’s now the mother of a little boy the head of a powerful multinational investment firm and the proprietor of a fabulous apartment overlooking the Eiffel Tower. Quickly Marie discovers that all her achievements have not brought happiness.', 'When the fun loving Marie sets her eyes on brooding comic book artist Paul, it sets off the kind of romantic sparks that quickly culminate in the bedroom. But the next morning brings its share of surprises as Marie crawls out of bed to discover her life flash-forwarded fifteen years down the road: Not only has she been married to Paul all this time, but she’s now the mother of a little boy the head of a powerful multinational investment firm and the proprietor of a fabulous apartment overlooking the Eiffel Tower. Quickly Marie discovers that all her achievements have not brought happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71pWxKKnBErzNHF1hS4j3ZXJXW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116231'),
  ('640420689594692547', 'Another World', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Eitan Reuven, Benji Cohen, Aviram Sahar', 'Michael Birinbaum, Eitan Reuven, Shlomi Aviner', 'Zach Cohen, Susanne Gschwendtner, Davina Kevelson, David Lavenski, Carl McCrystal', null, 'The movie is a post-apocalyptic horror/science fiction film. the setting is in a near post apocalyptic future where a biological warfare program goes wrong, and turns most of humanity to mindless, murderous creatures.', 'The movie is a post-apocalyptic horror/science fiction film. the setting is in a near post apocalyptic future where a biological warfare program goes wrong, and turns most of humanity to mindless, murderous creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxeawqEzahKB5qLgM7ZkpwSjI8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120172'),
  ('194592727550096178', 'Another World', 2022, 'Drama', 'Éric Dumont, Emile Louis, Stéphane Brizé', 'Olivier Gorce, Stéphane Brizé', 'Vincent Lindon, Sandrine Kiberlain, Anthony Bajon, Marie Drucker, Olivier Lemaire, Guillaume Draux, Christophe Rossignon, Sarah Laurent', null, 'An executive manager, his wife and his family, at the point when his professional choices are about to overturn all their lives. Philippe Lemesle and his wife are separating, their love irretrievably damaged by pressures of work. A successful executive in industrial conglomerate, Philippe no longer knows how to respond to the contradictory demands of his bosses. Yesterday they wanted a manager, today an enforcer. Now he must decide what his life really means.', 'An executive manager, his wife and his family, at the point when his professional choices are about to overturn all their lives. Philippe Lemesle and his wife are separating, their love irretrievably damaged by pressures of work. A successful executive in industrial conglomerate, Philippe no longer knows how to respond to the contradictory demands of his bosses. Yesterday they wanted a manager, today an enforcer. Now he must decide what his life really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhzf8sgqmDnluRsZv6ZHOPzms3q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664506'),
  ('208745519561988428', 'Another Year', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mike Leigh, Dick Pope, Josh Robertson', 'Mike Leigh', 'Jim Broadbent, Lesley Manville, Ruth Sheen, Peter Wight, Oliver Maltman, David Bradley, Karina Fernandez, Martin Savage', 'PG-13', 'During a year, a very content couple approaching retirement are visited by friends and family less happy with their lives.', 'During a year, a very content couple approaching retirement are visited by friends and family less happy with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrkQcAatfBox5x9KZjaYGnKoqu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44009'),
  ('831652267266237135', 'Another You', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Victor J. Kemper, Maurice Phillips', 'Ziggy Steinberg', 'Richard Pryor, Gene Wilder, Mercedes Ruehl, Stephen Lang, Vanessa Williams, Peter Michael Goetz, Jerry Houser, Kevin Pollak', 'R', 'George has been in a mental hospital for 3 years and is finally ready to go out into the real world again. Eddie Dash, a dedicated con-man, is supposed to keep him out of trouble, but when people begin to recognise George as a missing millionaire, Eddie wants to take advantage of the situation.', 'George has been in a mental hospital for 3 years and is finally ready to go out into the real world again. Eddie Dash, a dedicated con-man, is supposed to keep him out of trouble, but when people begin to recognise George as a missing millionaire, Eddie wants to take advantage of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKF0hCjv4JZhTt9XoxVsKLtteaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23303'),
  ('513095378358739202', 'Another You', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak, Oktay Başpınar', 'Giray Altınok, Kerem Özdoğan', 'Giray Altınok, Ezgi Mola, Kerem Özdoğan, Nevra Serezli, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Deniz Cengiz, Cihat Tamer, Osman Alkaş', null, 'Mümtaz and Derya are condemned to live out their last moments each day in someone else''s skin.', 'Mümtaz and Derya are condemned to live out their last moments each day in someone else''s skin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfEbhAzhKavunGOFiOknVtY0NiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1425617'),
  ('457532841581618473', 'Anplagghed al Cinema', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Arturo Brachetti, Rinaldo Gaspari, Aldo Solbiati', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti', 'Aldo Baglio, Giovanni Storti, Giacomo Poretti, Silvana Fallisi', null, 'A queue at the ATM machine, a displaced family after a seismic shock that has half-washed their home, a tour within an art gallery, moments of everyday life that become the cues for the emergence of comic, farce, paradoxical situations – trademarks of one of the most successful Italian comic groups.', 'A queue at the ATM machine, a displaced family after a seismic shock that has half-washed their home, a tour within an art gallery, moments of everyday life that become the cues for the emergence of comic, farce, paradoxical situations – trademarks of one of the most successful Italian comic groups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJEAiAfCgItEMedF1I4HQpStaxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50472'),
  ('255207924340191210', 'Anselm', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Franz Lustig, Luca Lucchesi', 'Wim Wenders', 'Anselm Kiefer, Anton Wenders, Daniel Kiefer', null, 'This unique cinematic experience dives deep into an artist’s work and reveals his life path, inspiration, and creative process. It explores his fascination with myth and history. Past and present are interwoven to diffuse the line between film and painting, allowing the audience to be completely immersed in the remarkable world of one of the greatest contemporary artists, Anselm Kiefer. Wim Wenders shot this unique portrait over the course of two years in stunning 3D.', 'This unique cinematic experience dives deep into an artist’s work and reveals his life path, inspiration, and creative process. It explores his fascination with myth and history. Past and present are interwoven to diffuse the line between film and painting, allowing the audience to be completely immersed in the remarkable world of one of the greatest contemporary artists, Anselm Kiefer. Wim Wenders shot this unique portrait over the course of two years in stunning 3D.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erEJByCPNjwpOk34XAZXQvKEJnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112547'),
  ('382652084510123254', 'Ant Pasted', 1953, 'Animation, Family', 'Friz Freleng', 'Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Elmer Fudd, on a fourth of July picnic, throws some of his firecrackers into an ant colony, and the ants declare all-out war on him.', 'Elmer Fudd, on a fourth of July picnic, throws some of his firecrackers into an ant colony, and the ants declare all-out war on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYpsH7FVmW9brWjDcUykbWMpx9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226801'),
  ('970733320145115887', 'Ant-Man', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Peyton Reed, Russell Carpenter, Lauren Rosenbloom', 'Adam McKay, Joe Cornish, Paul Rudd', 'Paul Rudd, Michael Douglas, Evangeline Lilly, Corey Stoll, Bobby Cannavale, Anthony Mackie, Judy Greer, Abby Ryder Fortson', 'PG-13', 'Armed with the astonishing ability to shrink in scale but increase in strength, master thief Scott Lang must embrace his inner-hero and help his mentor, Doctor Hank Pym, protect the secret behind his spectacular Ant-Man suit from a new generation of towering threats. Against seemingly insurmountable obstacles, Pym and Lang must plan and pull off a heist that will save the world.', 'Armed with the astonishing ability to shrink in scale but increase in strength, master thief Scott Lang must embrace his inner-hero and help his mentor, Doctor Hank Pym, protect the secret behind his spectacular Ant-Man suit from a new generation of towering threats. Against seemingly insurmountable obstacles, Pym and Lang must plan and pull off a heist that will save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQRnQfUl3kfp78nCWq8Ks04vnq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102899'),
  ('1062581545490582589', 'Ant-Man and the Wasp', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Peyton Reed, Dante Spinotti, Jay Pelissier', 'Chris McKenna, Erik Sommers, Andrew Barrer', 'Paul Rudd, Evangeline Lilly, Michael Douglas, Hannah John-Kamen, Randall Park, Michelle Pfeiffer, Laurence Fishburne, Michael Peña', 'PG-13', 'Just when his time under house arrest is about to end, Scott Lang once again puts his freedom at risk to help Hope van Dyne and Dr. Hank Pym dive into the quantum realm and try to accomplish, against time and any chance of success, a very dangerous rescue mission.', 'Just when his time under house arrest is about to end, Scott Lang once again puts his freedom at risk to help Hope van Dyne and Dr. Hank Pym dive into the quantum realm and try to accomplish, against time and any chance of success, a very dangerous rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFQEO687n1K6umXbInzocxcnAQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363088'),
  ('203050782491180835', 'Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Bill Pope, Jamie Christopher, Nick Gottschalk', 'Jeff Loveness', 'Paul Rudd, Evangeline Lilly, Michael Douglas, Michelle Pfeiffer, Jonathan Majors, Kathryn Newton, Corey Stoll, Bill Murray', 'PG-13', 'Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope''s parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott''s daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.', 'Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope''s parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott''s daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnqGbB22YJ7dSs4o6M7exTpNxPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640146'),
  ('877207086277802029', 'Antar Holding His Sword', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Fawzy Ali, Ahmed El-Sabawy', 'Saad Shanab, Raoof Helmy', 'Adel Emam, Noura, Mustafa Metwalli, Ahmad Bedir, Ibrahim Abdulraziq, Hatem Zulfiqar, Eva, Moamen Hassan', null, 'Antar is a poor farmer who flies to Italy after he sings a job contract with one of his relatives. After he arrives in Italy, he discovers that the contract is fake, and he gets manipulated by a director to act in porn films. He returns to Egypt and starts war against Medht, who is trying to take his wife''s piece of land.', 'Antar is a poor farmer who flies to Italy after he sings a job contract with one of his relatives. After he arrives in Italy, he discovers that the contract is fake, and he gets manipulated by a director to act in porn films. He returns to Egypt and starts war against Medht, who is trying to take his wife''s piece of land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dZrublhFaHNCyQAVmCj0T8fizA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548568'),
  ('213970276605640155', 'Antarctic Journal', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Yim Pil-sung, Chung Chung-hoon, Lee Hwan-hee', 'Bong Joon Ho, Yim Pil-sung', 'Song Kang-ho, Yoo Ji-tae, Park Hee-soon, Yoon Je-moon, Choi Deok-moon, Kang Hye-jung, Kim Kyung-ik, Park Jung-soo', null, 'Arctic cold and paranoia take their toll as Korean explorers are beset by the same strange occurrences that preceded the disappearance of a British team in 1922.', 'Arctic cold and paranoia take their toll as Korean explorers are beset by the same strange occurrences that preceded the disappearance of a British team in 1922.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnfYwQUnvdNLNV1nm2n20b6y6mH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49190'),
  ('63354434104953863', 'Antarctica', 1983, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Akira Shiizuka', 'Tatsuo Nogami, Susumu Saji, Toshirō Ishidō', 'Ken Takakura, Eiji Okada, Masako Natsume, Keiko Oginome, Takeshi Kusaka, Shigeru Kōyama, So Yamamura, Jun Etoh', 'PG', 'Two Japanese scientists, Ushioda and Ochi, develop a bond with their sled dogs while on an expedition in Antarctica.', 'Two Japanese scientists, Ushioda and Ochi, develop a bond with their sled dogs while on an expedition in Antarctica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSVGUA8DATylRYoxXerl5gORxqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17895'),
  ('420476749450416686', 'Antarctica', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yair Hochner', 'Yair Hochner', 'Tomer Ilan, Ofer Regirer, Lucy Dubinchik, Guy Zo-Aretz, Yiftach Mizrahi, Oshri Sahar, Yuval Raz, Liat Ekta', null, 'Set in Tel Aviv, focuses on an interconnected group of friends and their various relationships. At the center is the adorably bookish Omer, about to turn 30, who still hasn''t found himself, and his free-spirited best friend Miki, who both end up inadvertently dating the same handsome journalist, Ronen.', 'Set in Tel Aviv, focuses on an interconnected group of friends and their various relationships. At the center is the adorably bookish Omer, about to turn 30, who still hasn''t found himself, and his free-spirited best friend Miki, who both end up inadvertently dating the same handsome journalist, Ronen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DWNnfXcPdokQokvNB6ixcXXoLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20116'),
  ('1086063003202309679', 'Antarctica: A Year on Ice', 2013, 'Drama, Adventure, Documentary', 'Anthony Powell, Anthony Powell', 'Anthony Powell, Simon Price', 'Genevieve Bachman, William Brotman, Michael Christiansen, Tom Hamann, George Lampman, Peter Lund, Keri Nelson, Casey O''Brien', 'PG', 'Filling the giant screen with stunning time-lapse vistas of Antarctica, and detailing year-round life at McMurdo and Scott Base, Anthony Powell’s documentary is a potent hymn to the icy continent and the heavens above.', 'Filling the giant screen with stunning time-lapse vistas of Antarctica, and detailing year-round life at McMurdo and Scott Base, Anthony Powell’s documentary is a potent hymn to the icy continent and the heavens above.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agXQuqqqvF0Th77y2nEZg7INOXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201132'),
  ('649366994554712880', 'Antarctica: Ice & Sky', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Luc Jacquet', null, 'Claude Lorius, Michel Papineschi', null, 'Documentary about the work of Claude Lorius, who began studying Antarctic ice in 1957, and, in 1965, was the first scientist to be concerned about global warming.', 'Documentary about the work of Claude Lorius, who began studying Antarctic ice in 1957, and, in 1965, was the first scientist to be concerned about global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3Rt1nzTnNWKaPDxdeYCuJiECRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338273'),
