  ('555829470275964442', 'Antboy', 2013, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Ask Hasselbalch, Niels Reedtz Johansen', 'Anders Ølholm', 'Oscar Dietz, Amalie Kruse Jensen, Samuel Ting Graf, Nicolas Bro, Cecilie Alstrup Tarp, Marcuz Jess Petersen, Johannes Jeffries Sørensen, Lærke Winther', 'PG', '12-year-old Pelle accidentally gets bitten by an ant and develops unimaginable superpowers. With help from his friend, comic book nerd Wilhelm, Pelle creates a secret identity as the superhero Antboy. Slowly things start to happen in the surburban community, and when a scary and crazy supervillain, Flea, enters the scene, Antboy must step up to the challenge. The first Danish superhero-movie. Based on the books by Kenneth Bøgh Andersen.', '12-year-old Pelle accidentally gets bitten by an ant and develops unimaginable superpowers. With help from his friend, comic book nerd Wilhelm, Pelle creates a secret identity as the superhero Antboy. Slowly things start to happen in the surburban community, and when a scary and crazy supervillain, Flea, enters the scene, Antboy must step up to the challenge. The first Danish superhero-movie. Based on the books by Kenneth Bøgh Andersen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbYXm4j8S8AfLSnvA88uf7WpcWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198436'),
  ('527406116687028938', 'Antboy 3', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Ask Hasselbalch, Niels Reedtz Johansen', null, 'Oscar Dietz, Samuel Ting Graf, Amalie Kruse Jensen, Nicolas Bro, Paprika Steen, Astrid Juncher-Benzon, Cecilie Alstrup Tarp, Lærke Winther', 'PG', 'Antboy is challenged by the release of archenemy Loppen from prison, the new super villain, Alicia Dufort, and competition from an all new vigilante; the Hero Without a Name.', 'Antboy is challenged by the release of archenemy Loppen from prison, the new super villain, Alicia Dufort, and competition from an all new vigilante; the Hero Without a Name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0pxLqYkEifszG3aelMnyNd5BWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378932'),
  ('818383375066362025', 'Antboy: Revenge of the Red Fury', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Ask Hasselbalch, Niels Reedtz Johansen', 'Anders Ølholm', 'Oscar Dietz, Samuel Ting Graf, Amalie Kruse Jensen, Astrid Juncher-Benzon, Marcuz Jess Petersen, Johannes Jeffries Sørensen, Hector Brøgger Andersen, Cecilie Alstrup Tarp', null, 'The film '' Antboy: Revenge of the Red Fury '' is a sequel to the Danish superhero film Antboy, based on the books by Kenneth Bøgh Andersen. The story is again on the ordinary Danish boy Pelle, who secretly fights crime as a superhero Antboy. In the first film, he made ​​short work of the super villain flea , now tucked away on the local insane clinic.', 'The film '' Antboy: Revenge of the Red Fury '' is a sequel to the Danish superhero film Antboy, based on the books by Kenneth Bøgh Andersen. The story is again on the ordinary Danish boy Pelle, who secretly fights crime as a superhero Antboy. In the first film, he made ​​short work of the super villain flea , now tucked away on the local insane clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ye4KIGuRZmq2qRk85fZg7ubeV37.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314285'),
