  ('299007277273514772', 'Anthony', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Sukirthan Christhuraja, Jenosan Rajeswar, Rishi Selvam', 'Sukirthan Cristhuraja, Jenosan Rajeswar', 'Vincent Nakul, TJ Bhanu, Sudharshan Raveendran, Saumi Munasin, Ashana Julius Kanistan', null, 'A fisherman with a past navigates his romantic relationships in Sri Lankan waters.', 'A fisherman with a past navigates his romantic relationships in Sri Lankan waters.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiSTE5UGlQ5YlPiMdsuCOAnChY9X.jpg', 'plex:movie:anthony-2026-1'),
  ('574487798297887632', 'Anthony Adverse', 1936, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Tony Gaudio, William H. Cannon', 'Sheridan Gibney', 'Fredric March, Olivia de Havilland, Donald Woods, Anita Louise, Edmund Gwenn, Claude Rains, Louis Hayward, Gale Sondergaard', 'NR', 'Based on the novel by Hervey Allen, this expansive drama follows the many adventures of the eponymous hero, Anthony Adverse. Abandoned at a convent by his heartless nobleman father, Don Luis, Anthony is later mentored by his kind grandfather, John Bonnyfeather, and falls for the beautiful Angela Giuseppe. When circumstances separate Anthony and Angela and he embarks on a long journey, he must find his way back to her, no matter what the cost.', 'Based on the novel by Hervey Allen, this expansive drama follows the many adventures of the eponymous hero, Anthony Adverse. Abandoned at a convent by his heartless nobleman father, Don Luis, Anthony is later mentored by his kind grandfather, John Bonnyfeather, and falls for the beautiful Angela Giuseppe. When circumstances separate Anthony and Angela and he embarks on a long journey, he must find his way back to her, no matter what the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SPjkq5z86t80Q7XBw8AG2si2vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37658'),
  ('470294001611206092', 'Anthony Jeselnik: Bones and All', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Bill Benz, Dylan Sanford, Pablo Gambetta', 'Anthony Jeselnik', 'Anthony Jeselnik', 'R', 'Anthony Jeselnik celebrates 20 years of delivering boundary-pushing comedy to the masses in this razor-sharp stand-up special.', 'Anthony Jeselnik celebrates 20 years of delivering boundary-pushing comedy to the masses in this razor-sharp stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lU96zGB4H8X1Jkrmh40J3I1enjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380447'),
  ('1120501604753627222', 'Anthony Jeselnik: Fire in the Maternity Ward', 2019, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Marcus Raboy, Jay Lafayette', 'Anthony Jeselnik', 'Anthony Jeselnik', null, 'Forging his own comedic boundaries, Anthony Jeselnik revels in getting away with saying things others can''t in this stand-up special shot in New York.', 'Forging his own comedic boundaries, Anthony Jeselnik revels in getting away with saying things others can''t in this stand-up special shot in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10EkzjVA0AWUArKnE53Nzf2pigj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593489'),
  ('1086806362796671317', 'Anthony Jeselnik: Thoughts and Prayers', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Adam Dubin', 'Anthony Jeselnik', 'Anthony Jeselnik', null, 'There''s no subject too dark as the comedian skewers taboos and riffs on national tragedies before pulling back the curtain on his provocative style.', 'There''s no subject too dark as the comedian skewers taboos and riffs on national tragedies before pulling back the curtain on his provocative style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s257nbi40jQXFy4AyjVMT4Nhfun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364089'),
  ('504243662016093877', 'Anthony Zimmer', 2005, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Jérôme Salle, Denis Rouden, Eric Zaouali', 'Jérôme Salle', 'Sophie Marceau, Yvan Attal, Sami Frey, Gilles Lellouche, Daniel Olbrychski, Samir Guesmi, Dimitri Rataud, Nicky Marbot', null, 'François, an ordinary Joe, falls hard for the sublimely beautiful woman who has just picked him up on the train and invited him to spend the weekend with her on the Riviera. But when the lady disappears the next morning and the police drag him in for questioning, François discovers he''s been set up to pass for her notorious outlaw husband on the run, Anthony Zimmer. Even though he''s been lied to and manipulated, François'' life is changed forever and he''s ready to give anything - maybe even his life - to hold this mysterious beauty in his arms again.', 'François, an ordinary Joe, falls hard for the sublimely beautiful woman who has just picked him up on the train and invited him to spend the weekend with her on the Riviera. But when the lady disappears the next morning and the police drag him in for questioning, François discovers he''s been set up to pass for her notorious outlaw husband on the run, Anthony Zimmer. Even though he''s been lied to and manipulated, François'' life is changed forever and he''s ready to give anything - maybe even his life - to hold this mysterious beauty in his arms again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMBJnGPOr5lr7Dnyr3O4sMgpKPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11604'),
  ('359882634963251569', 'Anthropocene: The Human Epoch', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jennifer Baichwal, Nicholas de Pencier, Edward Burtynsky', 'Jennifer Baichwal', 'Alicia Vikander', null, 'Documentary on psychedelic potash mines, expansive concrete seawalls, mammoth industrial machines, and other examples of humanity’s massive, destructive reengineering of the planet.', 'Documentary on psychedelic potash mines, expansive concrete seawalls, mammoth industrial machines, and other examples of humanity’s massive, destructive reengineering of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jkKn1lMLjAIYwYh9QKWgnmje2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539757'),
  ('426524607321894381', 'Anthropoid', 2016, 'History, Thriller, War', 'Sean Ellis, Sean Ellis, Radek Hanák', 'Sean Ellis, Anthony Frewin', 'Jamie Dornan, Cillian Murphy, Charlotte Le Bon, Anna Geislerová, Harry Lloyd, Toby Jones, Alena Mihulová, Marcin Dorociński', 'R', 'In December 1941, Czech soldiers Jozef Gabčík and Jan Kubiš parachute into their occupied homeland to assassinate Nazi officer Reinhard Heydrich.', 'In December 1941, Czech soldiers Jozef Gabčík and Jan Kubiš parachute into their occupied homeland to assassinate Nazi officer Reinhard Heydrich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hUghRVVkBYufftfNQkGevY5AmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351339'),
  ('357315515347333019', 'Anthropophagous', 1980, 'Horror', 'Enrico Biribicchi, Donatella Donati, Joe D''Amato', 'George Eastman', 'Tisa Farrow, Saverio Vallone, Serena Grandi, Margaret Mazzantini, Mark Bodin, Bob Larson, Rubina Rey, Simone Baker', 'R', 'Tourists take a boat to a remote island, where they find that most of the people have disappeared, and something is stalking them. They find a hidden room in the big mansion on a hill, and an ancient diary, which gives them clues to the source of the terror.', 'Tourists take a boat to a remote island, where they find that most of the people have disappeared, and something is stalking them. They find a hidden room in the big mansion on a hill, and an ancient diary, which gives them clues to the source of the terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3y6P2tlbx8Cjr2Bmyqs7AFh4tW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5424'),
  ('303742366086976517', 'Anthropophagous 2000', 1999, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Andreas Schnaas', 'Karl-Heinz Geisendorf', 'Achim Kohlhase, Andre Sobottka, Dirk Thies, Joe Neumann, Andreas Schnaas', null, 'The millionaire Nikos Karamanlis (Andreas Schnaas) and his family are on a boat trip, when they get into a storm, in which the daughter dies and the yacht sinks. After days without food on a life raft, Nikos needs to eat the corpse of his wife and daughter or die. Later, a group of vacationers arrive at a remote island where Niko had made his home. Now insane and craving flesh, Niko Begins to pick them off, and a few of the survivors try to fight back.', 'The millionaire Nikos Karamanlis (Andreas Schnaas) and his family are on a boat trip, when they get into a storm, in which the daughter dies and the yacht sinks. After days without food on a life raft, Nikos needs to eat the corpse of his wife and daughter or die. Later, a group of vacationers arrive at a remote island where Niko had made his home. Now insane and craving flesh, Niko Begins to pick them off, and a few of the survivors try to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/169Pjyb1VZLWPn1gugr3mewi35M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67382'),
  ('202716241251957051', 'Anti Matter', 2016, 'Science Fiction', 'Keir Burrows, Gerry Vasbenter', 'Keir Burrows', 'Yaiza Figueroa, Philippa Carson, Tom Barber-Duffy, Noah Maxwell Clarke, James Farrar, Yolanda Vazquez, Casey Lawler, Harrie Hayes', null, 'Oxford PhD student Ana finds herself unable to build new memories, following an experiment to generate and travel through a wormhole. The story follows her increasingly desperate efforts to understand what happened, and to find out who—or what—is behind the rising horror in her life.', 'Oxford PhD student Ana finds herself unable to build new memories, following an experiment to generate and travel through a wormhole. The story follows her increasingly desperate efforts to understand what happened, and to find out who—or what—is behind the rising horror in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DUCdQ4rGn7uoJZcBqNehV5DeXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429101'),
  ('910947663669364311', 'Anti-Clock', 1979, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jane Arden, Jack Bond', 'Jane Arden', 'Sebastian Saville, Suzan Cameron, Liz Saville, Louise Temple, Gia-Fu Feng, Richard Feynman, Tom Gerrard', null, 'A complex and fascinating experimental exploration of time and identity, Anti-Clock is a film of authentic, startling originality. Brilliantly mixing film and video techniques, Arden and Bond''s paranoid, psychological surveillance study of a career gambler turned clairvoyant unstuck in time captures onscreen the anxieties that have infiltrated the consciousness of so many in Western society.', 'A complex and fascinating experimental exploration of time and identity, Anti-Clock is a film of authentic, startling originality. Brilliantly mixing film and video techniques, Arden and Bond''s paranoid, psychological surveillance study of a career gambler turned clairvoyant unstuck in time captures onscreen the anxieties that have infiltrated the consciousness of so many in Western society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6WaeUKLCqD3nCdMZGiOFWrNKa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31267'),
  ('667914517643979005', 'Anti-Squat', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pierre Maïllis-Laval, Nicolas Silhol, Barbara Canale', 'Nicolas Silhol, Fanny Burdino', 'Louise Bourgoin, Samy Belkessa, Sâm Mirhosseini, Kahina Lahoucine, Arthur Choisnet, Agnès Sourdillon, Ike Ortiz, Adèle Wismes', null, 'Paris, today. 38 y.o. Inès, mother of teenage Adam whom she is raising alone, is threatened with eviction. She absolutely must get a stable job to find them a place to live. She is taken on 2 months trial at “Anti-Squat,” a start-up company offering temporary housing in empty suburban office buildings. But the rules are very strict and the tenants have no rights. As a manager, Inès must live and sleep in the building to monitor the residents. But children are forbidden... She has two months to go, two months to complete her trial period, two months to start a new life at the risk of losing her most cherished values.', 'Paris, today. 38 y.o. Inès, mother of teenage Adam whom she is raising alone, is threatened with eviction. She absolutely must get a stable job to find them a place to live. She is taken on 2 months trial at “Anti-Squat,” a start-up company offering temporary housing in empty suburban office buildings. But the rules are very strict and the tenants have no rights. As a manager, Inès must live and sleep in the building to monitor the residents. But children are forbidden... She has two months to go, two months to complete her trial period, two months to start a new life at the risk of losing her most cherished values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1U9VEhLuxp4SiqfkK3aHYXE5zSY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936360'),
  ('531420203090727639', 'Antibirth', 2016, 'Horror', 'Danny Perez, Rudolf Blahacek', 'Danny Perez', 'Natasha Lyonne, Chloë Sevigny, Meg Tilly, Mark Webber, Maxwell McCabe-Lokos, Emmanuel Kabongo, Neville Edwards, Morgan Bedard', null, 'In a desolate community full of drug-addled Marines and rumors of kidnapping, a wild-eyed stoner named Lou wakes up after a crazy night of partying with symptoms of a strange illness and recurring visions. As she struggles to get a grip on reality, the stories of conspiracy spread.', 'In a desolate community full of drug-addled Marines and rumors of kidnapping, a wild-eyed stoner named Lou wakes up after a crazy night of partying with symptoms of a strange illness and recurring visions. As she struggles to get a grip on reality, the stories of conspiracy spread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4KSOLDlg1mY4SUbFL3Rd72CoMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332285'),
  ('646384573895170243', 'Antibody', 2002, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Christian McIntire, Adolfo Bartoli, Joel Morales', 'Micheal Baldwin', 'Lance Henriksen, Robin Givens, William Zabka, Gastón Pauls, Teodora Duhovnikova, Stella Ivanova, Kathleen Randazzo, Velizar Binev', null, 'After a terrorist with an implanted nuclear detonator gets shot, a team of scientists must defuse the bomb by miniaturizing themselves and going into his bloodstream. His organism''s antibodies start to mass against them.', 'After a terrorist with an implanted nuclear detonator gets shot, a team of scientists must defuse the bomb by miniaturizing themselves and going into his bloodstream. His organism''s antibodies start to mass against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVXlHKzBnzEhSdIJMXA3srrqvX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28572'),
  ('647344271292332864', 'Antichrist', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Styles, Lars von Trier, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Lars von Trier', 'Willem Dafoe, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Storm Acheche Sahlstrøm', 'NR', 'A grieving couple retreats to their cabin ''Eden'' in the woods, hoping to repair their broken hearts and troubled marriage. But nature takes its course and things go from bad to worse.', 'A grieving couple retreats to their cabin ''Eden'' in the woods, hoping to repair their broken hearts and troubled marriage. But nature takes its course and things go from bad to worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ge7zbYvpfsDP3luKi0iSpzOgncM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17609'),
  ('518736021743711003', 'Anticipation of the Night', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'First person view of a man, seen only in shadow, attempting to connect with the world around him. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'First person view of a man, seen only in shadow, attempting to connect with the world around him. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHNU0ZWCaQsnfJ0xUsoVHYYvAlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149708'),
  ('323684880331238705', 'Antidote', 2014, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Alper Çağlar, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Alper Çağlar', 'Emin Boztepe, Cüneyt Arkın, Tolga Akdoğan, Christina Gottschalk, Emir Benderlioğlu, Edoardo Costa, Florence Eugene, Duygu Çiftçioğlu', null, 'Istanbul cirminal underworld; a place of merciless families and swaggering hitmen afraid of no one. Kadir Korkut, nicknamed the "Demon" is the most fearsome of their kind. When he wants to retire for the love of a blind German pianist, it starts a chain of events which will paint the night red. His boss and foster father, Kara Cemal betrays and coerces Kadir by poisoning him to perform two final hits on the two largest rival families in order to receive the antidote. Outgunned, outmanned and facing impossible odds he has to team up with an outed undercover police mole Cem, and somehow survive his final night of revenge and redemption.', 'Istanbul cirminal underworld; a place of merciless families and swaggering hitmen afraid of no one. Kadir Korkut, nicknamed the "Demon" is the most fearsome of their kind. When he wants to retire for the love of a blind German pianist, it starts a chain of events which will paint the night red. His boss and foster father, Kara Cemal betrays and coerces Kadir by poisoning him to perform two final hits on the two largest rival families in order to receive the antidote. Outgunned, outmanned and facing impossible odds he has to team up with an outed undercover police mole Cem, and somehow survive his final night of revenge and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gViEsHeUnLGhP4rQXJpC25LdgT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268413'),
  ('358437696570938735', 'Antidote', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Daskaloff', 'Matthew Toronto, Peter Daskaloff', 'Louis Mandylor, Ashlynn Yennie, Scott Alin, Olive Bernadette Hoffman, Augie Duke, Yorgos Karamihos, Evan Faunce, Ken Del Norte', null, 'A young woman is held captive in an underground medical facility where selected individuals are perpetually mutilated and then healed using an experimental miracle drug: a panacea.', 'A young woman is held captive in an underground medical facility where selected individuals are perpetually mutilated and then healed using an experimental miracle drug: a panacea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aes8w7v22L1uZCeo28qkfSshqOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720109'),
  ('335694225433478608', 'Antifa: Skinhead Hunters', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Marc-Aurèle Vecchione', null, null, null, 'A French documentary on how groups of youth in Paris generated a backlash against the NeoNazi skinhead subculture, and by doing so earned themselves the nickname Chasseurs de Skins or ''Skinhead Hunters''.', 'A French documentary on how groups of youth in Paris generated a backlash against the NeoNazi skinhead subculture, and by doing so earned themselves the nickname Chasseurs de Skins or ''Skinhead Hunters''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pIFz1LGSQjGQ1eulBjNc7Puv81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74820'),
  ('760807759975822348', 'Antigang', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Benjamin Rocher, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Tristan Schulmann', 'Jean Reno, Alban Lenoir, Caterina Murino, Oumar Diaw, Stéfi Celma, Sébastien Lalanne, Thierry Neuvic, Jean-Toussaint Bernard', null, 'As a rowdy team of detectives clashes with their disciplined new boss, they must catch a vicious band of robbers who are wreaking havoc on their city.', 'As a rowdy team of detectives clashes with their disciplined new boss, they must catch a vicious band of robbers who are wreaking havoc on their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDya9lk0CLNohepEbbhOt9xMaVE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348060'),
  ('842425110530132150', 'Antigone', 1961, 'History, Drama', 'Yorgos Tzavellas, Lakis Antonakos', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Irene Papas, Manos Katrakis, Maro Kodou, Nikos Kazis, Ilia Livykou, Giannis Argyris, Byron Pallis, Tzavalas Karousos', null, 'In Thebes in ancient Greece, King Oedipus kills his father and marries his mother Jocasta, having two sons - Eteocles and Polyneices - and two daughters - Ismene and Antigone. King Oedipus dies a beggar in the exile after gouging out his own eye, and Eteocle agrees to reign in Thebes in alternating years with Polynices. However, he refuses to resign after the first year and Polynieces raises an army and attacks Thebes, and they kill each other. The ruler of Thebes Creon decrees that Eleocles should have an honorable burial while the body of the traitor Polyneices should be left on the battlefield to be eaten by the jackals and vultures. However, Antigone, who was betrothed to Creon''s surviving son Haemon, defies Creon''s orders and buries her brother. When Creon is reported of the attitude of Antigone, he sentences her to be placed in a tomb alive. Antigone hangs herself in the tomb and Haemon tries to kill his father first and then he kills himself with his sword...', 'In Thebes in ancient Greece, King Oedipus kills his father and marries his mother Jocasta, having two sons - Eteocles and Polyneices - and two daughters - Ismene and Antigone. King Oedipus dies a beggar in the exile after gouging out his own eye, and Eteocle agrees to reign in Thebes in alternating years with Polynices. However, he refuses to resign after the first year and Polynieces raises an army and attacks Thebes, and they kill each other. The ruler of Thebes Creon decrees that Eleocles should have an honorable burial while the body of the traitor Polyneices should be left on the battlefield to be eaten by the jackals and vultures. However, Antigone, who was betrothed to Creon''s surviving son Haemon, defies Creon''s orders and buries her brother. When Creon is reported of the attitude of Antigone, he sentences her to be placed in a tomb alive. Antigone hangs herself in the tomb and Haemon tries to kill his father first and then he kills himself with his sword...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEwJqLKoKlr4fKjc2AL6kgBqxkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98189'),
  ('564858011473841431', 'Antigone', 1992, 'Drama', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, William Lubtchansky', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub', 'Astrid Ofner, Ursula Ofner, Werner Rehm, Hans Diehl, Kurt Radeke, Michael Maassen, Rainer Philippi, Lars Studer', null, 'A fearless Antigone, refusing to allow the dishonored body of her murdered brother Polynices to be devoured by vultures and dogs, defies the Thebian tyrant Creon by burying him.', 'A fearless Antigone, refusing to allow the dishonored body of her murdered brother Polynices to be devoured by vultures and dogs, defies the Thebian tyrant Creon by burying him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idvNggHcI7MLkaycH6GV6ENePEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208200'),
  ('133610423265972258', 'Antigone', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sophie Deraspe, Sophie Deraspe', 'Sophie Deraspe', 'Nahéma Ricci, Nour Belkhiria, Rawad El-Zein, Rachida Oussaada, Hakim Brahimi, Paul Doucet, Antoine Desrochers, Jean-Sébastien Courchesne', null, 'Sophie Deraspe’s adaptation of the classic Greek tragedy of the same name reimagines the story of a woman’s quest for justice as a commentary on the immigrant experience in contemporary Montreal.', 'Sophie Deraspe’s adaptation of the classic Greek tragedy of the same name reimagines the story of a woman’s quest for justice as a commentary on the immigrant experience in contemporary Montreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whn30vLHgM5IyMorCVGAsXzB3Zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582309'),
  ('679702720341669652', 'Antikiller', 2002, 'Action, Crime', 'Egor Konchalovsky, Olga Serdyukova, Anton Antonov', 'Fuad Ibragimbekov', 'Sergey Shakurov, Aleksandr Baluev, Gosha Kutsenko, Mikhail Ulyanov, Evgeniy Sidikhin, Viktor Sukhorukov, Mikhail Efremov, Sergey Veksler', null, 'Former criminal investigator, Major Korenev, nicknamed Fox is released from prison. He has been detained there as a result of planted incriminating evidence of unlawful investigation techniques. Setting accounts with Shaman - a big criminal boss, who ordered the evidence planted and also with his former colleagues was not a part of Korenev''s agenda. As he returns to Moscow he finds a new world ruled by underworld bosses, criminal clans fighting each other and utter chaos on the desperately keeping appearances streets of Russian capital. Facing death of his friends, Major Korenev decides to re-install law and order using some unorthodox methods that are only relevant in 21st century Russia.', 'Former criminal investigator, Major Korenev, nicknamed Fox is released from prison. He has been detained there as a result of planted incriminating evidence of unlawful investigation techniques. Setting accounts with Shaman - a big criminal boss, who ordered the evidence planted and also with his former colleagues was not a part of Korenev''s agenda. As he returns to Moscow he finds a new world ruled by underworld bosses, criminal clans fighting each other and utter chaos on the desperately keeping appearances streets of Russian capital. Facing death of his friends, Major Korenev decides to re-install law and order using some unorthodox methods that are only relevant in 21st century Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etGu5noSpWfeEcyEPgRQODkg2QI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41955'),
  ('591684110993723603', 'Antikiller 2: Antiterror', 2003, 'Action, Crime', 'Egor Konchalovsky, Nikolay Korobeynik, Anton Antonov', 'Victor Shamirov, Fuad Ibragimbekov, Egor Konchalovsky', 'Gosha Kutsenko, Lyubov Tolkalina, Aleksey Serebryakov, Sergey Veksler, Sergey Shakurov, Ivan Bortnik, Vyacheslav Razbegaev, Mikhail Efremov', null, 'Colonel Fox is in charge of a counter terrorism group that will now have the complicated mission to help the police to prevent a dangerous Chechen terrorist organization that wants to free its leader at any cost, even if it has to destroy the whole place.', 'Colonel Fox is in charge of a counter terrorism group that will now have the complicated mission to help the police to prevent a dangerous Chechen terrorist organization that wants to free its leader at any cost, even if it has to destroy the whole place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msqYWZQ5bYdMhk0X9TIMw4I2f8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41957'),
  ('102550288468889043', 'Antilles sur Seine', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Pascal Légitimus', null, 'Chantal Lauby, Pascal Légitimus, Med Hondo, Pierre-Olivier Mornas, Serge Riaboukine, Édouard Montoute, Bernard Campan, Didier Bourdon', null, 'Corruption threatens to move into a heretofore idyllic village in this comedy-drama. Hector St. Rose is the mayor of a seaside community in the Antilles Islands, a French-controlled territory in the West Indies. Hector has long been determined not to sacrifice the well-being of his constituents in order to make the village more attractive to tourists, which has made him popular with his citizens, but not so much so with outside developers.', 'Corruption threatens to move into a heretofore idyllic village in this comedy-drama. Hector St. Rose is the mayor of a seaside community in the Antilles Islands, a French-controlled territory in the West Indies. Hector has long been determined not to sacrifice the well-being of his constituents in order to make the village more attractive to tourists, which has made him popular with his citizens, but not so much so with outside developers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVfifY3LsNh2rdQkCy6Dy0tvCUH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69124'),
  ('992457145175423356', 'Antique', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Min Kyu-dong, Ko Hyun-woong, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Min Kyu-dong', 'Ju Ji-hoon, Kim Jae-uck, Yoo Ah-in, Choi Ji-ho, Andy Gillet, Kim Chang-wan, Lee Hwi-hyang, Oh Mi-hee', null, 'Jin-hyeok opens a cake shop in an old antique shop, hiring Seon-woo, Korea''s best pastry chef, who fell in love with him in high school. Also there, are Su-young, crushing on Seon-woo, ex-boxer Ki-beom, and Seon-woo''s French ex-boyfriend.', 'Jin-hyeok opens a cake shop in an old antique shop, hiring Seon-woo, Korea''s best pastry chef, who fell in love with him in high school. Also there, are Su-young, crushing on Seon-woo, ex-boxer Ki-beom, and Seon-woo''s French ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtjJAFaHL5GEzOzHZaCKI9TjyN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30843'),
  ('11614269334096933', 'Antisocial', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Maher, Cody Calahan', 'Chad Archibald, Cody Calahan', 'Michelle Mylett, Cody Ray Thompson, Adam Christie, Ana Alic, Romaine Waite, Ry Barrett, Eitan Shalmon, Laurel Brandes', 'R', 'Five university friends gather at a house party to ring in the New Year. Unbeknownst to them, an epidemic has erupted outside, causing outbreaks around the world. With nowhere else to turn, they barricade themselves indoors with only their phones, laptops, and other tech devices. They use their devices to research the possible cause of this outbreak. Information and video footage over flow their computers as they descend further into the cause and the ensuing chaos. As the virus spreads, the mood in the house changes from fear to paranoia. Who is safe? Who can they trust? Reality becomes blurred as they slowly discover the source of the virus causing the sickness...and there is no going back.', 'Five university friends gather at a house party to ring in the New Year. Unbeknownst to them, an epidemic has erupted outside, causing outbreaks around the world. With nowhere else to turn, they barricade themselves indoors with only their phones, laptops, and other tech devices. They use their devices to research the possible cause of this outbreak. Information and video footage over flow their computers as they descend further into the cause and the ensuing chaos. As the virus spreads, the mood in the house changes from fear to paranoia. Who is safe? Who can they trust? Reality becomes blurred as they slowly discover the source of the virus causing the sickness...and there is no going back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPu9etEMSsB48e1UmsVUNIOUA8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207780'),
  ('872403165473420976', 'Antitrust', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'John Bailey, John MacCarthy, Peter Howitt', 'Howard Franklin', 'Ryan Phillippe, Rachael Leigh Cook, Tim Robbins, Claire Forlani, Richard Roundtree, Tygh Runyan, Ned Bellamy, Tyler Labine', 'PG-13', 'A computer programmer''s dream job at a hot Portland-based firm turns nightmarish when he discovers his boss has a secret and ruthless means of dispatching anti-trust problems.', 'A computer programmer''s dream job at a hot Portland-based firm turns nightmarish when he discovers his boss has a secret and ruthless means of dispatching anti-trust problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PXyfcJe53A9qFkcj5dkTJwIWoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9989'),
  ('710318448148608366', 'Antiviral', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Brandon Cronenberg, Karim Hussain, Rob Cotterill', 'Brandon Cronenberg', 'Caleb Landry Jones, Sarah Gadon, Malcolm McDowell, Joe Pingue, Sheila McCarthy, Douglas Smith, Wendy Crewson, Nicholas Campbell', 'NR', 'Syd March is an employee at a clinic that sells injections of live viruses harvested from sick celebrities to obsessed fans. When he becomes infected with the disease that kills super sensation Hannah Geist, Syd becomes a target for collectors and rabid fans. He must unravel the mystery surrounding her death before he suffers the same fate.', 'Syd March is an employee at a clinic that sells injections of live viruses harvested from sick celebrities to obsessed fans. When he becomes infected with the disease that kills super sensation Hannah Geist, Syd becomes a target for collectors and rabid fans. He must unravel the mystery surrounding her death before he suffers the same fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIn0ruFDU8psnCGkPgA9fbKJJUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125490'),
  ('716939659477008253', 'Antlers', 2021, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Kristina Lyne, Matthew Johnson, Scott Cooper', 'Nick Antosca, Henry Chaisson, Scott Cooper', 'Keri Russell, Jesse Plemons, Jeremy T. Thomas, Graham Greene, Scott Haze, Sawyer Jones, Rory Cochrane, Amy Madigan', 'R', 'A small-town Oregon teacher and her brother, the local sheriff, discover a young student is harbouring a dangerous secret that could have frightening consequences.', 'A small-town Oregon teacher and her brother, the local sheriff, discover a young student is harbouring a dangerous secret that could have frightening consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMch3tiexw3FdOEeZxMWVel61Xg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516329'),
  ('786875162522320173', 'Antoine & Antoinette', 1947, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jacques Becker, Pierre Montazel, Marcel Camus', 'Jacques Becker, Françoise Giroud, Maurice Griffe', 'Roger Pigaut, Claire Mafféi, Noël Roquevert, Gaston Modot, Louis de Funès, Brigitte Auber, Made Siamé, Charles Camus', null, '1947, in France, Antoine and Antoinette, a young couple living in Paris, lead a monotonous existence: he works in a print shop while she is a shop assistant. But one evening, they regain hope: Antoine finds a winning lottery ticket in his girlfriend''s handbag. He decides to cash it in, but loses his wallet. What follows is a series of twists and turns that redefine the couple''s priorities while forcing them to remain optimistic.', '1947, in France, Antoine and Antoinette, a young couple living in Paris, lead a monotonous existence: he works in a print shop while she is a shop assistant. But one evening, they regain hope: Antoine finds a winning lottery ticket in his girlfriend''s handbag. He decides to cash it in, but loses his wallet. What follows is a series of twists and turns that redefine the couple''s priorities while forcing them to remain optimistic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQrx290OaYTgnuvcFaU0hFHBRlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44532'),
  ('126345552526865769', 'Antoine and Colette', 1962, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Raoul Coutard, François Truffaut', 'François Truffaut', 'Jean-Pierre Léaud, Marie-France Pisier, Rosy Varte, François Darbon, Patrick Auffay, Jean-François Adam, Pierre Schaeffer', null, 'Now aged 17, Antoine Doinel works in a factory which makes records. At a music concert, he meets a girl his own age, Colette, and falls in love with her. Later, Antoine goes to extraordinary lengths to please his new girlfriend and her parents, but Colette still only regards him as a casual friend. First segment of “Love at Twenty” (1962).', 'Now aged 17, Antoine Doinel works in a factory which makes records. At a music concert, he meets a girl his own age, Colette, and falls in love with her. Later, Antoine goes to extraordinary lengths to please his new girlfriend and her parents, but Colette still only regards him as a casual friend. First segment of “Love at Twenty” (1962).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfP8J7pv75KOAliIM3RG7h6Zos5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256'),
  ('935738664391470637', 'Antoine Griezmann: The Making of a Legend', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alex Dell', null, 'Antoine Griezmann, Paul Pogba, Didier Deschamps, Lucas Hernandez, Diego Godín', null, 'With heart and determination, Antoine Griezmann overcame his small stature to become one of the world''s top soccer players and a World Cup champion.', 'With heart and determination, Antoine Griezmann overcame his small stature to become one of the world''s top soccer players and a World Cup champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYiqPgDM6KYpRVkjOZi6kgnalR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589116'),
  ('630015285242473265', 'Anton Tchekhov 1890', 2015, 'Drama', 'René Féret', 'René Féret', 'Nicolas Giraud, Lolita Chammah, Jacques Bonnaffé, Bruno Davézé, Frédéric Pierrot, Robinson Stévenin, Jenna Thiam, Brontis Jodorowsky', null, 'Summer 1890. In order to make some money to feed his family, Anton Chekhov, modest physician, wrote short stories for newspapers to sign Antosha Tchékhonté. Important characters, writer and editor, just make him aware of his talent. His situation is improving and Anton Chekhov gets the Pushkin prices and admiration of Tolstoy. But when one of his brothers died of tuberculosis, Anton saw it as a personal failure and wants to escape his fame and his love.', 'Summer 1890. In order to make some money to feed his family, Anton Chekhov, modest physician, wrote short stories for newspapers to sign Antosha Tchékhonté. Important characters, writer and editor, just make him aware of his talent. His situation is improving and Anton Chekhov gets the Pushkin prices and admiration of Tolstoy. But when one of his brothers died of tuberculosis, Anton saw it as a personal failure and wants to escape his fame and his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m2rmzWQNR1Sn4gN6DOiV55JqvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270591'),
  ('1049019772436903522', 'Antonia', 2015, 'Drama', 'Sayombhu Mukdeeprom, Ferdinando Cito Filomarino', 'Carlo Salsa, Ferdinando Cito Filomarino', 'Linda Caridi, Filippo Dini, Alessio Praticò, Perla Ambrosini, Federica Fracassi, Luca Lo Monaco, Maurizio Fanin', null, 'Distinguished Italian poet Antonia Pozzi (1912–1938) was among those women who were at odds with the times in which they lived. Her poems record her inability to adapt to social norms and her desire to live fully, and in poetry she sought an escape from reality and from her own complex soul and emotional life.', 'Distinguished Italian poet Antonia Pozzi (1912–1938) was among those women who were at odds with the times in which they lived. Her poems record her inability to adapt to social norms and her desire to live fully, and in poetry she sought an escape from reality and from her own complex soul and emotional life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GU1Q80Fio0Vu6DFnWzTCEw8vne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320709'),
  ('762099601805980962', 'Antônia', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Tata Amaral, Júlia Pacheco Jordão, Daniela Carvalho', 'Tata Amaral, Roberto Moreira', 'Negra Li, Cindy Mendes, Leilah Moreno, Quelynah, Kamau, Negro Rico, Hadji, Thaíde', null, 'Determined to escape their poverty-stricken lives, four talented young women living on the outskirts of Sao Paulo, Brazil, form an all-female rap group but find their road to success is riddled with sexism, racism, and violence. One by one, they succumb to their grim realities...until they discover that out of struggle comes strength, and out of strength, the courage to continue on.', 'Determined to escape their poverty-stricken lives, four talented young women living on the outskirts of Sao Paulo, Brazil, form an all-female rap group but find their road to success is riddled with sexism, racism, and violence. One by one, they succumb to their grim realities...until they discover that out of struggle comes strength, and out of strength, the courage to continue on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1o8AFAwdGKaXBpf3VSttnUoeymb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54952'),
  ('311930864493000772', 'Antonia''s Line', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marleen Gorris, Willy Stassen', 'Marleen Gorris', 'Willeke van Ammelrooy, Els Dottermans, Dora van der Groen, Veerle van Overloop, Carolien Spoor, Esther Vriesendorp, Thyrza Ravesteijn, Mil Seghers', 'R', 'After World War II, Antonia and her daughter, Danielle, go back to their Dutch hometown, where Antonia''s late mother has bestowed a small farm upon her. There, Antonia settles down and joins a tightly-knit but unusual community. Those around her include quirky friend Crooked Finger, would-be suitor Bas and, eventually for Antonia, a granddaughter and great-granddaughter who help create a strong family of empowered women.', 'After World War II, Antonia and her daughter, Danielle, go back to their Dutch hometown, where Antonia''s late mother has bestowed a small farm upon her. There, Antonia settles down and joins a tightly-knit but unusual community. Those around her include quirky friend Crooked Finger, would-be suitor Bas and, eventually for Antonia, a granddaughter and great-granddaughter who help create a strong family of empowered women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUCVi6bBIL7LGC61nYaCqikAhIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:880'),
  ('115299744614406077', 'Antonieta', 1982, 'War, Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Teo Escamilla', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Andrés Henestrosa, Antonieta Rivas', 'Hanna Schygulla, Isabelle Adjani, Ignacio López Tarso, Carlos Bracho, Gonzalo Vega, Bruno Rey, Víctor Junco, Víctor Alcocer', null, 'Anna is a psychologist undertaking research about famous suicidal women. She takes a specific interest in the case of Antonieta Rivas Mercado, who killed herself in 1931 in the Cathedral of Notre-Dame de Paris.', 'Anna is a psychologist undertaking research about famous suicidal women. She takes a specific interest in the case of Antonieta Rivas Mercado, who killed herself in 1931 in the Cathedral of Notre-Dame de Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqGralIZDVnbzio9V2xO1XBHAw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37187'),
  ('683913182543225601', 'Antonio das Mortes', 1969, 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Affonso Beato, Glauber Rocha, Ronaldo Duarte', 'Glauber Rocha', 'Maurício do Valle, Odete Lara, Othon Bastos, Jofre Soares, Lorival Pariz, Hugo Carvana, Rosa Maria Penna, Emmanuel Cavalcanti', null, 'A new incarnation of Cangaceiro bandits, led by Coirana, has risen in the badlands. A blind landowner hires Antônio to wipe out his old nemesis. Yet after besting Coirana and accompanying the dying man to his mountain hideout, Antônio is moved by the plight of the Cangaceiro’s followers. The troubled hitman turns revolutionary, his gun and machete aimed towards his former masters.', 'A new incarnation of Cangaceiro bandits, led by Coirana, has risen in the badlands. A blind landowner hires Antônio to wipe out his old nemesis. Yet after besting Coirana and accompanying the dying man to his mountain hideout, Antônio is moved by the plight of the Cangaceiro’s followers. The troubled hitman turns revolutionary, his gun and machete aimed towards his former masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOoqqn5A2XoPLblvAPpujRonzZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74349'),
  ('1020384473873310266', 'Antonio Gaudí', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara, Yoshikazu Yanagida, Ryu Segawa', null, 'Isidro Puig Boada, Seiji Miyaguchi, Antoni Gaudi', null, 'Catalan architect Antonio Gaudí (1852-1926) designed some of the world''s most astonishing buildings, interiors, and parks; Japanese director Hiroshi Teshigahara constructed some of the most aesthetically audacious films ever made. With camera work as bold and sensual as the curves of his subject''s organic structures, Teshigahara immortalizes Gaudí on film.', 'Catalan architect Antonio Gaudí (1852-1926) designed some of the world''s most astonishing buildings, interiors, and parks; Japanese director Hiroshi Teshigahara constructed some of the most aesthetically audacious films ever made. With camera work as bold and sensual as the curves of his subject''s organic structures, Teshigahara immortalizes Gaudí on film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5avrBzIW7mXrUmUAz8gNz8KxXhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37239'),
  ('1057017219224573713', 'Antonio One Two Three', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Leonardo Mouramateus, Aline Belfort, Diogo Ferreira', 'Leonardo Mouramateus', 'Mauro Soares, Daniel Pizamiglio, João Fiadeiro, Sandra Hung, Mariana Dias, Carolina Thadeu, Hugo Pereira, Sofia Dinger', null, 'Antonio runs away from home and tries to spend the night at his ex-girlfriend''s apartment. There he finds a brazilian girl, an unexpected guest. Johnny is struggling to stage his first theater play in Lisbon. His friendship with the young light technician will make him face his real problems. Débora is passing by, finally returning home. When she goes to the theater, she falls asleep, and is awaken by the protagonist. Three dimensions of the same story.', 'Antonio runs away from home and tries to spend the night at his ex-girlfriend''s apartment. There he finds a brazilian girl, an unexpected guest. Johnny is struggling to stage his first theater play in Lisbon. His friendship with the young light technician will make him face his real problems. Débora is passing by, finally returning home. When she goes to the theater, she falls asleep, and is awaken by the protagonist. Three dimensions of the same story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQarOwERT3BBYs4fsTSjaHjdIeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434468'),
  ('805328382478770377', 'Antonio, ihm schmeckt''s nicht!', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Daniel Speck', 'Christian Ulmen, Mina Tander, Alessandro Bressanello, Maren Kroymann, Peter Prager, Jeff Burrell, James Feuer, Robin Gooch', null, 'Pregnant Sara and her husband Jan are full of anticipation for their family-free honeymoon in New York. However, father-in-law Antonio has completely different plans and unceremoniously joins the young couple, which puts both Antonio and Jan''s relationship, but especially the newly married couple''s relationship, to a tough test in this turbulent cinema comedy...', 'Pregnant Sara and her husband Jan are full of anticipation for their family-free honeymoon in New York. However, father-in-law Antonio has completely different plans and unceremoniously joins the young couple, which puts both Antonio and Jan''s relationship, but especially the newly married couple''s relationship, to a tough test in this turbulent cinema comedy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUf5pKUxt82JVExloZVfDnnqjxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389358'),
  ('641539707657928838', 'Antony and Cleopatra', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Charlton Heston, Rafael Pacheco', 'Charlton Heston', 'Charlton Heston, Hildegard Neil, Eric Porter, John Castle, Fernando Rey, Juan Luis Galiardo, Carmen Sevilla, Freddie Jones', 'NR', 'Adaptation of Shakespeare''s Antony and Cleopatra, a historical drama that attempts to bring an epic visual style to the Bard''s original stage play. The story concerns Marc Antony''s attempts to rule Rome while maintaining a relationship with the queen of Egypt (Hildegarde Neil), which began while Antony was still married. Now he is being forced to marry the sister of his Roman co-leader, and soon the conflict leads to war.', 'Adaptation of Shakespeare''s Antony and Cleopatra, a historical drama that attempts to bring an epic visual style to the Bard''s original stage play. The story concerns Marc Antony''s attempts to rule Rome while maintaining a relationship with the queen of Egypt (Hildegarde Neil), which began while Antony was still married. Now he is being forced to marry the sister of his Roman co-leader, and soon the conflict leads to war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrXWX1kMzoD9cCVae0iy4nl5Erq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98632'),
  ('6121880336500348', 'Antoshka', 1969, 'Animation', 'Leonid Nosyrev', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Margarita Korabelnikova', null, 'The musical tale about the red-haired freckled boy who didn''t want to dig potatoes.', 'The musical tale about the red-haired freckled boy who didn''t want to dig potatoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4bAWSNzz4lTcqGL6PPalrT4vi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337389'),
  ('610035434747208051', 'Antrum', 2018, 'Horror', 'David Amito, Michael Laicini, Maksymilian Milczarczyk', 'David Amito', 'Nicole Tompkins, Rowan Smyth, Dan Istrate, Circus-Szalewski, Shu Sakimoto, Kristel Elling, Lucy Rayner, Carrie Hammontree', 'NR', 'Rumored to have been lost, Antrum appears as a cursed film from the 1970s. Viewers are warned to proceed with caution. It’s said to be a story about a young boy and girl who enter the forest in an attempt to save the soul of their recently deceased pet. They journey to “The Antrum,” the very spot the devil landed after being cast out of heaven. There, the children begin to dig a hole to hell.', 'Rumored to have been lost, Antrum appears as a cursed film from the 1970s. Viewers are warned to proceed with caution. It’s said to be a story about a young boy and girl who enter the forest in an attempt to save the soul of their recently deceased pet. They journey to “The Antrum,” the very spot the devil landed after being cast out of heaven. There, the children begin to dig a hole to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20de4Rcmy4B0L5zyOc3Nc5F7c0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412546'),
  ('946004405887619315', 'Ants in the Pantry', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Al Giebler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Clara Kimball Young, Douglas Gerrard, Harrison Greene, Isabel La Mal, Anne O''Neal', 'NR', 'The Stooges are pest exterminators who drum up business by planting vermin in a ritzy mansion where a party is going on. They are hired, but must pose as guests to work unobserved. They ruin a piano and generally make a mess of the party, but the hostess passes them off as vaudeville comedians and they are invited to join the guests on a fox hunt.', 'The Stooges are pest exterminators who drum up business by planting vermin in a ritzy mansion where a party is going on. They are hired, but must pose as guests to work unobserved. They ruin a piano and generally make a mess of the party, but the hostess passes them off as vaudeville comedians and they are invited to join the guests on a fox hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m02ef0nu0EFlzU0hoegS7arhPZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115804'),
  ('196027627296652608', 'Ants in the Pants', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marc Rothemund, Hans-Günther Bücking', null, 'Tobias Schenke, Axel Stein, Luise Helm, Mina Tander, Sissi Perlinger, Andrea Sawatzki, Tina Ruland, Björn Kirschniok', null, 'Flo is not quite a normal teenager: While all his friends only think about sex he can''t even pronounce the word "S - E - X". But everything changes completely when one morning Flo wakes up from a strange call. His penis, excited for the first time, begins to talk to him. He claims that Flo severely neglected him for 15 years and it''s time to release him.', 'Flo is not quite a normal teenager: While all his friends only think about sex he can''t even pronounce the word "S - E - X". But everything changes completely when one morning Flo wakes up from a strange call. His penis, excited for the first time, begins to talk to him. He claims that Flo severely neglected him for 15 years and it''s time to release him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tp2ldyLlAxEp1dsGbNe0AON9bOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9478'),
  ('856917809978622699', 'Ants in the Pants 2', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Granz Henman, Gernot Roll', 'Granz Henman', 'Tobias Schenke, Axel Stein, Diana Amft, Rebecca von Mitzlaff, Nicky Kantor, Axel Milberg, Michael Herbig, Carmen-Maja Antoni', null, 'In the sequel of "Ants in the Pants" we again meet Flo and his friends.', 'In the sequel of "Ants in the Pants" we again meet Flo and his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykWaTvNFLK2xE8LHYrU9nz3DBvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9572'),
  ('739198074868997655', 'Antwone Fisher', 2002, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Denzel Washington, Hope R. Goodwin, Randy Fletcher', 'Antwone Fisher', 'Denzel Washington, Derek Luke, Malcolm David Kelley, Cory Hodges, Viola Davis, Joy Bryant, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Leonard Earl Howze', 'PG-13', 'A sailor prone to violent outbursts is sent to a naval psychiatrist for help. Refusing at first to open up, the young man eventually breaks down and reveals a horrific childhood. Through the guidance of his doctor, he confronts his painful past and begins a quest to find the family he never knew.', 'A sailor prone to violent outbursts is sent to a naval psychiatrist for help. Refusing at first to open up, the young man eventually breaks down and reveals a horrific childhood. Through the guidance of his doctor, he confronts his painful past and begins a quest to find the family he never knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9lCK1aFXqMO3hzhGiqCNU8coIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13435'),
  ('873916731629982218', 'Antz', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Eric Darnell, Tim Johnson, George Bruder', 'Chris Weitz, Paul Weitz, Todd Alcott', 'Woody Allen, Sharon Stone, Dan Aykroyd, Anne Bancroft, Danny Glover, Gene Hackman, Jane Curtin, Sylvester Stallone', 'PG', 'A neurotic worker ant in love with a rebellious princess rises to unlikely stardom when he switches places with a soldier. Signing up to march in a parade, he ends up under the command of a bloodthirsty general. But he''s actually been enlisted to fight against a termite army.', 'A neurotic worker ant in love with a rebellious princess rises to unlikely stardom when he switches places with a soldier. Signing up to march in a parade, he ends up under the command of a bloodthirsty general. But he''s actually been enlisted to fight against a termite army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWPjxbUMpAHFkJpZHHNWhQaRsax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8916'),
  ('1113032013441797273', 'Anuja', 2024, 'Drama', 'Adam J. Graves, Akash Raje, Ksheetij Saini', 'Adam J. Graves', 'Sajda Pathan, Ananya Shanbhag, Nagesh Bhonsle, Gulshan Walia, Sushil Parwana, Sunita Bhadauria, Rudolpho Rajeev Hubert, Jugal Kishore', 'PG-13', 'When a brilliant nine-year-old working in a sweatshop gets a chance to attend school, she must make a difficult choice for her and her sister''s future.', 'When a brilliant nine-year-old working in a sweatshop gets a chance to attend school, she must make a difficult choice for her and her sister''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJVGVQgetKas8wpgHBYqfbJRoEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1337997'),
  ('43523225768772763', 'Anunnaki Origins: Sumeria to South America', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Steve Mera, Josh Mills', null, 'The Sumerians worshiped Enki, a god of creation, wisdom and something far more mysterious. But the past refuses to stay buried. What if the myths were true?', 'The Sumerians worshiped Enki, a god of creation, wisdom and something far more mysterious. But the past refuses to stay buried. What if the myths were true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9OQlE0cIon7GO4dq95OQ3g5I01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1537103'),
  ('453560565110495279', 'Anunnaki: los caídos del cielo', 2018, 'Action, Family, Horror', 'Rubén Vílchez, Joan Frank Charansonnet', null, 'Joan Frank Charansonnet, Daniel Bernabé, Julia Jeane, Mónica Corral, Miquel Sitjar, Joan Bentallé, Susanna Plana, Kornel Doman', null, 'A vampire joins a secret society to destroy an alien conspiracy for world domination. He battles extraterrestrials and uncovers a shadow government.', 'A vampire joins a secret society to destroy an alien conspiracy for world domination. He battles extraterrestrials and uncovers a shadow government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0TsXV8qtmuVx0wAHcCt0OBmBCz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798016'),
  ('659161013433110846', 'Anuvahood', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Toland, Adam Deacon, Felix Wiedemann', 'Adam Deacon, Michael Vu', 'Adam Deacon, Ollie Barbieri , Jazzie Zonzolo, Michael Vu, Richie Campbell, Jaime Winstone, Paul Kaye, Ashley Walters', null, 'Kenneth (who likes to call himself Kay) begins to realise he''s just another wannabe bad boy... even less than a loser in fact. After quitting his job at Laimsbury''s, Kay vows to become a respected gangster... or cry trying. A pulls-no-punches, coming-of-age story, centering on one directionless hopeless "shotter", who finds his true worth in the face of urban adversity.', 'Kenneth (who likes to call himself Kay) begins to realise he''s just another wannabe bad boy... even less than a loser in fact. After quitting his job at Laimsbury''s, Kay vows to become a respected gangster... or cry trying. A pulls-no-punches, coming-of-age story, centering on one directionless hopeless "shotter", who finds his true worth in the face of urban adversity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1u4r4pwJuba6Vasp4pMjFDBr4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68419'),
  ('673345767430654416', 'Anvil! The Story of Anvil', 2008, 'Documentary, Music', 'Christopher Soos, Sacha Gervasi', 'Sacha Gervasi', 'Steve ''Lips'' Kudlow, Robb Reiner, Kevin Goocher, Glenn Gyorffy, William Howell, Tiziana Arrigoni, Slash, Lemmy Kilmister', 'NR', 'At 14, best friends Robb Reiner and Lips made a pact to rock together forever. Their band, Anvil, hailed as the "demi-gods of Canadian metal" influenced a musical generation that includes Metallica, Slayer, and Anthrax. Following a calamitous European tour, Lips and Robb, now in their fifties, set off to record their 13th album in one last attempt to fulfill their boyhood dreams.', 'At 14, best friends Robb Reiner and Lips made a pact to rock together forever. Their band, Anvil, hailed as the "demi-gods of Canadian metal" influenced a musical generation that includes Metallica, Slayer, and Anthrax. Following a calamitous European tour, Lips and Robb, now in their fifties, set off to record their 13th album in one last attempt to fulfill their boyhood dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDrMuFaWBKwjwEnw4C06Sm97huY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18094'),
  ('362291631841829924', 'Anweshippin Kandethum', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Darwin Kuriakose, Gautham Shankar', 'Jinu Abraham', 'Tovino Thomas, Vineeth Thattil David, Siddique, Pramod Veliyanad, Indrans, Baburaj, Shammi Thilakan, Ramya Suvi', null, 'A team of four expert policemen go through extreme trials and tribulations to find the killer of a young woman.', 'A team of four expert policemen go through extreme trials and tribulations to find the killer of a young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjNKLsXCEEZCzT1ZiJScvqVxevA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834664'),
  ('542219499768570815', 'Anxiety', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Miguel Zacarías, Gabriel Figueroa', null, 'Pedro Infante, Libertad Lamarque, Irma Dorantes, Arturo Soto Rangel, Guillermo Samperio, Salvador Quiroz, José Muñoz, Miguel Funes Jr.', null, 'Twins (both played by Infante) are separated while very young, one raised as a singer by their widowed mother and another as the heir to one of Mexico''s richest families. Their paths cross in the future, but they are unable to recognize each other due to their very different social backgrounds.', 'Twins (both played by Infante) are separated while very young, one raised as a singer by their widowed mother and another as the heir to one of Mexico''s richest families. Their paths cross in the future, but they are unable to recognize each other due to their very different social backgrounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mq7DVdQdIuoSw1b1nn0szoP76Vo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189426'),
  ('53630648520173326', 'Any Bonds Today?', 1942, 'History, Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Bugs Bunny and friends sing and dance to promote the sale of government bonds in support of the war effort.', 'Bugs Bunny and friends sing and dance to promote the sale of government bonds in support of the war effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2c6ro1wdhiYVgV12LwGO0xtZaiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236582'),
  ('595615546139641647', 'Any Crybabies Around?', 2020, 'Drama', 'Takuma Sato, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Takuma Sato', 'Taiga Nakano, Riho Yoshioka, Kanichiro Sato, Takashi Yamanaka, Kimiko Yo, Toshiro Yanagiba, Kotone Furukawa, Shunya Itabashi', null, 'A man has a baby, runs away, then comes back, but he can''t just show up, apologize, and hope that makes himself a grown man.', 'A man has a baby, runs away, then comes back, but he can''t just show up, apologize, and hope that makes himself a grown man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFP7XlZ3O1kH7bO5KK1lA43tIyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722209'),
  ('464449314118108499', 'Any Day Now', 2012, 'Drama', 'Chris Debenedetto, Rachel Morrison, Travis Fine', 'George Arthur Bloom, Travis Fine', 'Alan Cumming, Garret Dillahunt, Isaac Leyva, Frances Fisher, Gregg Henry, Jamie Anne Allman, Chris Mulkey, Don Franklin', 'R', 'In the late 1970s, when a mentally handicapped teenager is abandoned, a gay couple takes him in and becomes the family he''s never had. But once the unconventional living arrangement is discovered by authorities, the men must fight the legal system to adopt the child.', 'In the late 1970s, when a mentally handicapped teenager is abandoned, a gay couple takes him in and becomes the family he''s never had. But once the unconventional living arrangement is discovered by authorities, the men must fight the legal system to adopt the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5C1J8mKX4aHy6GOczK6iTwqodP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105526'),
  ('171360652942222118', 'Any Given Sunday', 1999, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Totino, Oliver Stone, Allan Graf', 'John Logan, Oliver Stone', 'Al Pacino, Cameron Diaz, Dennis Quaid, James Woods, Jamie Foxx, LL Cool J, Matthew Modine, Jim Brown', 'R', 'A star quarterback gets knocked out of the game and an unknown third stringer is called in to replace him. The unknown gives a stunning performance and forces the aging coach to reevaluate his game plans and life. A new co-owner/president adds to the pressure of winning. The new owner must prove herself in a male dominated world.', 'A star quarterback gets knocked out of the game and an unknown third stringer is called in to replace him. The unknown gives a stunning performance and forces the aging coach to reevaluate his game plans and life. A new co-owner/president adds to the pressure of winning. The new owner must prove herself in a male dominated world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bysZeUvSPZPJnku4qkHF34CdgMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9563'),
  ('410174149205709472', 'Any Gun Can Play', 1967, 'Adventure, Action, Western', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Maurizio Mancini, Giovanni Bergamini', 'Tito Carpi, Enzo G. Castellari, Giovanni Simonelli', 'George Hilton, Edd Byrnes, Gilbert Roland, Stefania Careddu, José Torres, Ivano Staccioli, Gérard Herter, Riccardo Pizzuti', 'NR', 'A gang robs a gold shipment from a train. A so called bounty hunter is sent to track down the robbers and decides to let them lead him to the gold.', 'A gang robs a gold shipment from a train. A so called bounty hunter is sent to track down the robbers and decides to let them lead him to the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPhlwzFLjHZDcT3sZ25fcENfu96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22359'),
  ('788845273878954877', 'Any Number Can Play', 1949, 'Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Harold Rosson, Sid Sidman', 'Richard Brooks', 'Clark Gable, Alexis Smith, Wendell Corey, Audrey Totter, Frank Morgan, Mary Astor, Lewis Stone, Barry Sullivan', null, 'When illegal casino owner Charley Kyng develops heart disease, he is advised by a doctor to spend more time with his family. However, he finds it difficult to keep his work separate from his life at home. His son, Paul, feels ashamed of Charley''s career and gets into a fight at his prom because of it. Meanwhile, Charley''s brother-in-law, Robbin, who works at the casino, begins fixing games due to his extreme gambling debts.', 'When illegal casino owner Charley Kyng develops heart disease, he is advised by a doctor to spend more time with his family. However, he finds it difficult to keep his work separate from his life at home. His son, Paul, feels ashamed of Charley''s career and gets into a fight at his prom because of it. Meanwhile, Charley''s brother-in-law, Robbin, who works at the casino, begins fixing games due to his extreme gambling debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIqcrtNP6wkPO6vQYYRkwasvWNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121074'),
  ('680788654213129055', 'Any Number Can Win', 1963, 'Crime', 'Henri Verneuil, Claude Pinoteau, Louis Page', null, 'Jean Gabin, Alain Delon, Claude Cerval, Maurice Biraud, Viviane Romance, Henri Virlogeux, Jean Carmet, José Luis de Vilallonga', 'NR', 'Charles, fresh out of jail, rejects his wife''s plan for a quiet life of bourgeois respectability. He enlists a former cell mate, Francis, to assist him in pulling off one final score, a carefully planned assault on the vault of a Cannes casino.', 'Charles, fresh out of jail, rejects his wife''s plan for a quiet life of bourgeois respectability. He enlists a former cell mate, Francis, to assist him in pulling off one final score, a carefully planned assault on the vault of a Cannes casino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjA8gAy6oqLZHXXdCKygqZA6cf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22650'),
  ('513284942484120012', 'Any Old Port!', 1932, 'Comedy', 'James W. Horne, Art Lloyd', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Julie Bishop, Walter Long, Eddie Baker, Harry Bernard, Ed Brandenburg, Bobby Burns', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie check into a seedy hotel and help a young girl escape the clutches of the landlord. They are forced to flee the hotel with no money and Ollie arranges for Stan to fight at a local boxing hall for $50. Stan''s opponent turns out to be Musgy who uses a loaded glove. During the fight the glove is swapped and Stan triumphs only to find that Ollie has bet their fee that he would lose.', 'Stan and Ollie check into a seedy hotel and help a young girl escape the clutches of the landlord. They are forced to flee the hotel with no money and Ollie arranges for Stan to fight at a local boxing hall for $50. Stan''s opponent turns out to be Musgy who uses a loaded glove. During the fight the glove is swapped and Stan triumphs only to find that Ollie has bet their fee that he would lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIJJFMuo0refaAeuy4KxG0QsjOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44891'),
  ('1090029265576211159', 'Any Stray Cat', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniela De Carlo, André Modugno, Tomás Portella', 'Tati Bernardi, Júlia Spadaccini, Ricardo Tiezzi', 'Cleo, Malvino Salvador, Dudu Azevedo, Rita Guedes, Álamo Facó, Letícia Novaes, Gillray Coutinho, Jean Pierre Noher', null, 'Tati is in love with Marcelo, a guy who enjoys dating lots of girls. Honest to a fault, Tati wears her heart on her sleeve, but her intense affection only drives Marcelo further away. After attending a lecture by a young biology professor named Conrado, she decides to put his controversial theories into practice in her own love life. Conrado has developed a scientific guide to seduction, inspired by Charles Darwin''s theories, comparing the dating behaviour of young people to that of animals in nature. Tati becomes his eager test subject. At first, the experiment seems to be working: Marcelo is showing interest again. But things take an unexpected turn when real feelings begin to spark between the professor and the student.', 'Tati is in love with Marcelo, a guy who enjoys dating lots of girls. Honest to a fault, Tati wears her heart on her sleeve, but her intense affection only drives Marcelo further away. After attending a lecture by a young biology professor named Conrado, she decides to put his controversial theories into practice in her own love life. Conrado has developed a scientific guide to seduction, inspired by Charles Darwin''s theories, comparing the dating behaviour of young people to that of animals in nature. Tati becomes his eager test subject. At first, the experiment seems to be working: Marcelo is showing interest again. But things take an unexpected turn when real feelings begin to spark between the professor and the student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pza45sya47vgwKWbaQy6cpGBCQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74053'),
  ('818228027878777694', 'Any Stray Cat 2', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Roberto Santucci, Marcelo Antunez, Marcelo Brasil', 'Bíbi da Pieve, Paulo Cursino', 'Cleo, Malvino Salvador, Dudu Azevedo, Rita Guedes, Álamo Facó, Stella Miranda, Letícia Novaes, Mel Maia', null, 'Tati and Conrado travel to Cancún, where he''s attending a conference to launch his new book. But for Tati, the trip has an extra purpose: she plans to propose to him. During this special moment, with family and friends watching live online, Conrado responds by saying he''d "like to think about it". Tati''s disappointment opens the door for renewed hope in her ex, Marcelo, who shows up to find her. To complicate matters further, Conrado''s ex, Ângela, is also in Cancún, attending the same event.', 'Tati and Conrado travel to Cancún, where he''s attending a conference to launch his new book. But for Tati, the trip has an extra purpose: she plans to propose to him. During this special moment, with family and friends watching live online, Conrado responds by saying he''d "like to think about it". Tati''s disappointment opens the door for renewed hope in her ex, Marcelo, who shows up to find her. To complicate matters further, Conrado''s ex, Ângela, is also in Cancún, attending the same event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aW1jUFBcOarOSJieHkGqbB1dqHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322977'),
  ('418747006475693113', 'Any Virgin Left Alive?', 2015, 'Fantasy, Mystery', 'Bertrand Mandico, Pascale Granel', 'Elina Löwensohn, Bertrand Mandico', 'Elina Löwensohn, Eva Maloisel, Thomas Arnold', null, 'According to an English legend, Joan of Arc never died at the stake. Her eyes were seared with hot pokers and she was deflowered by an English stud. She was then sentenced to wander on the battlefields, like a vulture, on the look-out for life and searching for any virgins left alive.', 'According to an English legend, Joan of Arc never died at the stake. Her eyes were seared with hot pokers and she was deflowered by an English stud. She was then sentenced to wander on the battlefields, like a vulture, on the look-out for life and searching for any virgins left alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QO0q1Mu7qpm8B9f69IhE5Gd2I8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359293'),
  ('452832200028203907', 'Any Way the Wind Blows', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tom Barman, Renaat Lambeets', 'Tom Barman', 'Frank Vercruyssen, Diane De Belder, Eric Kloeck, Natali Broods, Matthias Schoenaerts, Dirk Roofthooft, Jonas Boel, Titus De Voogdt', null, 'Antwerp, early June. On a sweltering Friday, eight people dream of a different life. There is wind and music, police and paranoia, gossip and arguing. There''s an ancient virus, a lost Frisbee, a dead horse, and, wandering the city, an enigmatic phenomenon called Windman who feels everyone''s pain but can''t seem to help himself. In the evening a party awaits them...', 'Antwerp, early June. On a sweltering Friday, eight people dream of a different life. There is wind and music, police and paranoia, gossip and arguing. There''s an ancient virus, a lost Frisbee, a dead horse, and, wandering the city, an enigmatic phenomenon called Windman who feels everyone''s pain but can''t seem to help himself. In the evening a party awaits them...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a83O7SAIcHyUuXESl1cfhcwnhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17001'),
  ('114927785629408610', 'Any Wednesday', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Ellis Miller, Harold Lipstein, Victor Vallejo', 'Julius J. Epstein', 'Jane Fonda, Jason Robards, Dean Jones, Rosemary Murphy, Ann Prentiss, Jack Fletcher, King Moody, Kelly Jean Peters', null, 'Ellen Gordon, a New York executive''s mistress falls for the executive''s young business associate when the young man is accidentally sent to use the apartment where the executive and his mistress get together every Wednesday. More complications arise when the executive''s wife shows up with plans to redecorate the apartment.', 'Ellen Gordon, a New York executive''s mistress falls for the executive''s young business associate when the young man is accidentally sent to use the apartment where the executive and his mistress get together every Wednesday. More complications arise when the executive''s wife shows up with plans to redecorate the apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhnpJY9ldontHXHbxBAiRJw0eIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42714'),
  ('1051287397406090848', 'Any Which Way You Can', 1980, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Buddy Van Horn, David Worth', 'Stanford Sherman', 'Clint Eastwood, Sondra Locke, Geoffrey Lewis, William Smith, Harry Guardino, Ruth Gordon, Michael Cavanaugh, Barry Corbin', 'PG', 'Philo takes part in a bare knuckle fight – as he does – to make more money than he can earn from his car repair business. He decides to retire, but when the Mafia come along and arrange another fight, he''s pushed into it. A motorcycle gang and an orangutan called Clyde all add to the ''fun''.', 'Philo takes part in a bare knuckle fight – as he does – to make more money than he can earn from his car repair business. He decides to retire, but when the Mafia come along and arrange another fight, he''s pushed into it. A motorcycle gang and an orangutan called Clyde all add to the ''fun''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjqS8TXTy0GvqPBfdB4CAbFCYW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17169'),
  ('807785908863825471', 'Anya''s Bell', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gordon Lonsdale, Tom McLoughlin', 'David Alexander', 'Della Reese, Mason Gamble, Tom Cavanagh, Nancy McLoughlin, Kelly Rowan, Mary Parker Williams, Clayton Taylor, Hamilton Lucas', null, 'Inspirational tale set in the late 1940s involving an elderly blind woman with a unique collection of bells in her home and a dyslexic 12-year-old boy who form an offbeat friendship to help each other overcome a disability.', 'Inspirational tale set in the late 1940s involving an elderly blind woman with a unique collection of bells in her home and a dyslexic 12-year-old boy who form an offbeat friendship to help each other overcome a disability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXEwR18cZIR71NuGQiidijO3YzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28164'),
  ('889660817558278627', 'Anyone But Her', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Luis Kuri, Tonatiuh Martínez', 'Ricardo Avilés', 'Cassandra Sánchez Navarro, Ricardo Abarca, Carolina Miranda, Ana Gonzalez Bello, Jesús Zavala, Oswaldo Zárate, Guillermo Quintanilla, Mar Carrera', null, 'A tight-knit group of friends can''t live without each other, that is until one of them announces their marriage. In the midst of dealing with this change, they stumble upon the perfect chance to throw a wrench into the wedding preparations.', 'A tight-knit group of friends can''t live without each other, that is until one of them announces their marriage. In the midst of dealing with this change, they stumble upon the perfect chance to throw a wrench into the wedding preparations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MYLLfWEVlAwWvNY5Tdy1Z9ruqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178069'),
  ('985015759709773513', 'Anyone But You', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sandra Nieuwenhuijsen, David Burr, Peter Beeh', 'Ilana Wolpert, Will Gluck', 'Sydney Sweeney, Glen Powell, Mia Artemis, Nat Buchanan, GaTa, Alexandra Shipp, Hadley Robinson, Dermot Mulroney', 'R', 'After an amazing first date, Bea and Ben’s fiery attraction turns ice cold — until they find themselves unexpectedly reunited at a destination wedding in Australia. So they do what any two mature adults would do: pretend to be a couple.', 'After an amazing first date, Bea and Ben’s fiery attraction turns ice cold — until they find themselves unexpectedly reunited at a destination wedding in Australia. So they do what any two mature adults would do: pretend to be a couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qHoazZiaLe7oFBok7XlUhg96f2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072790'),
  ('877631318253409757', 'anyone lived in a pretty [how] town', 1967, 'Music', 'George Lucas', 'Paul Golding, George Lucas', 'John Strawbridge, Nancy Yates, Lance Larson', null, 'A visual interpretation of the poem by E.E. Cummings about the life cycle of a townspeople and of one ignored couple.', 'A visual interpretation of the poem by E.E. Cummings about the life cycle of a townspeople and of one ignored couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6BTukf1PIgUZEFJoKTO2bJii0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324606'),
  ('722224733087248830', 'Anything Can Happen', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Marcel Łoziński, Artur Reinhart', 'Marcel Łoziński', 'Tomek Łoziński', null, 'A story of life and death, featuring Lozinski''s six-year-old son Tomaszek and elderly people spending time on the benches of a Warsaw park. Riding his scooter, Tomaszek asks the elderly very adult, though basic, questions, which they are happy to answer. The boy''s ideas of future and life are confronted with those of men at the end of their lives.', 'A story of life and death, featuring Lozinski''s six-year-old son Tomaszek and elderly people spending time on the benches of a Warsaw park. Riding his scooter, Tomaszek asks the elderly very adult, though basic, questions, which they are happy to answer. The boy''s ideas of future and life are confronted with those of men at the end of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUSEYv0GG265v2UsdPhf7Y27ryy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258945'),
  ('405152743033538702', 'Anything Else', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Woody Allen, Darius Khondji, Jonathan Arkin', 'Woody Allen', 'Jason Biggs, Christina Ricci, Woody Allen, Stockard Channing, Danny DeVito, Jimmy Fallon, Anthony Arkin, David Conrad', 'R', 'Jerry Falk, an aspiring writer in New York, falls in love at first sight with a free-spirited young woman named Amanda. He has heard the phrase that life is like "anything else," but soon he finds that life with the unpredictable Amanda isn''t like anything else at all.', 'Jerry Falk, an aspiring writer in New York, falls in love at first sight with a free-spirited young woman named Amanda. He has heard the phrase that life is like "anything else," but soon he finds that life with the unpredictable Amanda isn''t like anything else at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvyoWDh60R31ZE5L8TjZ8Qpv5xM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10739'),
  ('878650731004812814', 'Anything for Alice', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Cuche, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Nicolas Cuche', 'Max Boublil, Aïssa Maïga, Patrick Timsit, Chantal Lauby, Redouanne Harjane, Steve Tran, Naidra Ayadi, Philippe Lefebvre', null, 'Slacker Max fell so hard for single mother Alice in college that he developed a website aimed at winning her heart. Years later, after his venture has earned him millions of dollars, Max risks his entire fortune performing an ever more complicated series of social contortions to get close to Alice, now a politically motivated factory worker.', 'Slacker Max fell so hard for single mother Alice in college that he developed a website aimed at winning her heart. Years later, after his venture has earned him millions of dollars, Max risks his entire fortune performing an ever more complicated series of social contortions to get close to Alice, now a politically motivated factory worker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1Be5dlR0lj6ZRvugufEljBp2D5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204765'),
  ('131501938652485053', 'Anything for Her', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fred Cavayé', 'Guillaume Lemans, Fred Cavayé', 'Vincent Lindon, Diane Kruger, Lancelot Roch, Olivier Marchal, Hammou Graïa, Liliane Rovère, Olivier Perrier, Moussa Maaskri', null, 'Lisa and Julien are married and lead a happy uneventful life with their son Oscar. But their life radically changes one morning, when the police comes to arrest Lisa on murder charges. She''s sentenced to 20 years of prison. Convinced of his wife''s innocence, Julien decides to act. How far will he be willing to go for her?', 'Lisa and Julien are married and lead a happy uneventful life with their son Oscar. But their life radically changes one morning, when the police comes to arrest Lisa on murder charges. She''s sentenced to 20 years of prison. Convinced of his wife''s innocence, Julien decides to act. How far will he be willing to go for her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8iom9xZi9bE2nN2TTYp3efyqvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14556'),
  ('97833558718903031', 'Anything for Jackson', 2020, 'Horror', 'Justin G. Dyck, Sasha Moric', 'Keith Cooper', 'Sheila McCarthy, Julian Richings, Konstantina Mantelos, Josh Cruddas, Yannick Bisson, Lanette Ware, Claire Cavalheiro, Scott Cavalheiro', 'NR', 'A bereaved Satanist couple kidnap a pregnant woman so they can use an ancient spellbook to put their dead grandson''s spirit into her unborn child, but they end up summoning more than they bargained for.', 'A bereaved Satanist couple kidnap a pregnant woman so they can use an ancient spellbook to put their dead grandson''s spirit into her unborn child, but they end up summoning more than they bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8C0eUGpqiJZqoU84UjXAMS474B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734353'),
  ('546742355241374030', 'Anything for Love', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Neil Cervin, Nick Fletcher, Brian Giddens', 'Barbara Curry', 'Erika Christensen, Paul Greene, Ali Liebert, Antonio Cupo, Nicole Major, Tom Butler, Patrick Gilmore, Jordana Largy', null, 'Katherine, a high-powered executive who believes men are intimidated by her career, is persuaded by her friend to create an internet dating profile claiming she is an executive assistant.', 'Katherine, a high-powered executive who believes men are intimidated by her career, is persuaded by her friend to create an internet dating profile claiming she is an executive assistant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvKECIiRF6qSp6LOXKfkuw1XpIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379990'),
  ('779320696967909145', 'Anything Goes', 1956, 'Comedy, Music', 'Robert Lewis, John F. Warren', 'Sidney Sheldon, Howard Lindsay', 'Bing Crosby, Donald O''Connor, Zizi Jeanmaire, Mitzi Gaynor, Phil Harris, Kurt Kasznar, Walter Sande, Marcel Dalio', 'G', 'Bill Benson and Ted Adams are to appear in a Broadway show together and, while in Paris, each ''discovers'' the perfect leading lady for the plum female role. Each promises the prize role to the girl they selected without informing the other until they head back across the Atlantic by liner - with each man having brought his choice along! It becomes a stormy crossing as each man has to tell his ''find'' that she might not get the role after all.', 'Bill Benson and Ted Adams are to appear in a Broadway show together and, while in Paris, each ''discovers'' the perfect leading lady for the plum female role. Each promises the prize role to the girl they selected without informing the other until they head back across the Atlantic by liner - with each man having brought his choice along! It becomes a stormy crossing as each man has to tell his ''find'' that she might not get the role after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGf7Jsj6akh5343JDNI4WEUjcUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46007'),
  ('701258062017144929', 'Anything You Want', 2010, 'Drama', 'Achero Mañas', 'Achero Mañas', 'Juan Diego Botto, Lucía Fernández, José Luis Gómez, Najwa Nimri', null, 'Leo is immediately set adrift by his new found responsibilities as a single parent, a feeling that is made doubly distressing when Dafne, herself understandably confused and heartbroken by her mother''s absence, asks for an "artificial" mother to help her fall asleep at night. It is here that Mañas takes the road less traveled, but to write any more about the plot line he introduces would be unfair to both the viewer and filmmaker alike. Suffice it to say that Leo''s actions are both surprising and potentially dangerous, as they require Leo to subsume his own identity to the point where he nearly loses it.', 'Leo is immediately set adrift by his new found responsibilities as a single parent, a feeling that is made doubly distressing when Dafne, herself understandably confused and heartbroken by her mother''s absence, asks for an "artificial" mother to help her fall asleep at night. It is here that Mañas takes the road less traveled, but to write any more about the plot line he introduces would be unfair to both the viewer and filmmaker alike. Suffice it to say that Leo''s actions are both surprising and potentially dangerous, as they require Leo to subsume his own identity to the point where he nearly loses it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ3sgTG2DepVfdzQTBl5QZULyWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106446'),
  ('146434399498837110', 'Anything''s Possible', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Billy Porter, Andrei Schwartz', 'Ximena García Lecuona', 'Eva Reign, Abubakr Ali, Courtnee Carter, Kelly Lamor Wilson, Grant Reynolds, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Alec Ludacka, Noah Pacht', 'PG-13', 'Anything’s Possible is a delightfully modern Gen Z coming-of-age story that follows Kelsa, a confident high school girl who is trans, as she navigates through senior year. When her classmate Khal gets a crush on her, he musters up the courage to ask her out, despite the drama he knows it could cause. What transpires is a romance that showcases the joy, tenderness, and pain of young love.', 'Anything’s Possible is a delightfully modern Gen Z coming-of-age story that follows Kelsa, a confident high school girl who is trans, as she navigates through senior year. When her classmate Khal gets a crush on her, he musters up the courage to ask her out, despite the drama he knows it could cause. What transpires is a romance that showcases the joy, tenderness, and pain of young love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLeswI1zxf2xN5iIdcJpqx9XEnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787787'),
  ('1049439358335187930', 'Anywhere', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Adam Seidel, Adam J. Minnick, Jackson Ezinga', 'Adam Seidel', 'Joshua Burge, Hayley McFarland, Sean Gunn, Ryan Francis, Annie Funke', null, 'A roughneck commits a hasty and brutal crime after discovering his scumbag brother is planning to run off with his cheating wife, completely upending the only life he''s ever known.', 'A roughneck commits a hasty and brutal crime after discovering his scumbag brother is planning to run off with his cheating wife, completely upending the only life he''s ever known.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F71af7b97d84e7e8170170255881eb989.jpg', 'plex:movie:anywhere-2026'),
  ('534052750766704409', 'Anywhere but Here', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Wayne Wang, Roger Deakins, Betsy Magruder', 'Mona Simpson, Alvin Sargent', 'Susan Sarandon, Natalie Portman, Hart Bochner, Eileen Ryan, Ray Baker, John Diehl, Shawn Hatosy, Bonnie Bedelia', 'PG-13', 'Single mother Adele August is bad with money, and even worse when it comes to making decisions. Her straight-laced daughter, Ann, is a successful high school student with Ivy League aspirations. When Adele decides to pack up and move the two of them from the Midwest to Beverly Hills, Calif., to pursue her dreams of Hollywood success, Ann grows frustrated with her mother''s irresponsible and impulsive ways.', 'Single mother Adele August is bad with money, and even worse when it comes to making decisions. Her straight-laced daughter, Ann, is a successful high school student with Ivy League aspirations. When Adele decides to pack up and move the two of them from the Midwest to Beverly Hills, Calif., to pursue her dreams of Hollywood success, Ann grows frustrated with her mother''s irresponsible and impulsive ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DNtxmXkotuaJexU57geTLIPnQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21349'),
  ('40610122290607743', 'Anywhere Else', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ester Amrami, Johannes Praus', 'Momme Peters, Ester Amrami', 'Neta Riskin, Golo Euler, Hana Laslo, Hana River, Dov Reiser, Romi Aboulafia, Kosta Kaplan', null, 'You left your home to move far away. You were struck by a wind of change and were unfaithful to yourself. You reinvented yourself and you are now feeling free. But suddenly pressure arises in you.', 'You left your home to move far away. You were struck by a wind of change and were unfaithful to yourself. You reinvented yourself and you are now feeling free. But suddenly pressure arises in you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evntH1ojm6Vjt32Je6VpuY37i4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280894'),
  ('451761197136002761', 'Anzio', 1968, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Duilio Coletti, Dante Ferretti', 'H.A.L. Craig', 'Robert Mitchum, Peter Falk, Robert Ryan, Arthur Kennedy, Giancarlo Giannini, Earl Holliman, Mark Damon, Reni Santoni', 'PG', 'American troops land unopposed on Italian beaches during World War II, but instead of pushing on to Rome, they dig in and the Germans fight back ferociously.', 'American troops land unopposed on Italian beaches during World War II, but instead of pushing on to Rome, they dig in and the Germans fight back ferociously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBRiZCpjqpLZhApdcmm6LEJlCUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35284'),
  ('273562996900645835', 'Ao Oni The Animation', 2017, 'Horror, Animation', 'Toshirou Hamamura', null, 'Shuta Morishima, Ryota Osaka, Ayane Sakura, Takahiro Mizushima, Eri Kitamura, Hiroki Touchi, Yoko Hikasa, Kenji Nojima', null, 'Based on the horror game Ao Oni by noprops. Five members of the cultural anthropology club at an old western-style school are trying to come up with ideas for their presentation at the school''s culture festival, when they find a collection of folk tales gathered by a student in their club 40 years ago. They realize that the mysterious Bellflower Oni that appears in the folk tales may be the basis for the popular free game Ao Oni, and decide to make that their theme. They manage to make contact with the author of the Ao Oni game, but he dies mysteriously soon afterward. The club members become suspicious at the author''s death and began to investigate on their own, but encounter a secret they never should have touched: a secret underground prison in the school. For some reason all the fire doors at the school are locked, and they are trapped in the school. The sound of the strange footsteps they hear soon turn to their screams...A new tragedy of the Ao Oni is about to begin.', 'Based on the horror game Ao Oni by noprops. Five members of the cultural anthropology club at an old western-style school are trying to come up with ideas for their presentation at the school''s culture festival, when they find a collection of folk tales gathered by a student in their club 40 years ago. They realize that the mysterious Bellflower Oni that appears in the folk tales may be the basis for the popular free game Ao Oni, and decide to make that their theme. They manage to make contact with the author of the Ao Oni game, but he dies mysteriously soon afterward. The club members become suspicious at the author''s death and began to investigate on their own, but encounter a secret they never should have touched: a secret underground prison in the school. For some reason all the fire doors at the school are locked, and they are trapped in the school. The sound of the strange footsteps they hear soon turn to their screams...A new tragedy of the Ao Oni is about to begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsxRVzb6u72LWSrlv4aoyQmbAg4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432130'),
  ('847578621438692674', 'Ao: The Last Hunter', 2010, 'Adventure, History', 'Jacques Malaterre, Sabine Lancelin', null, 'Helmi Dridi, Vesela Kazakova, Aruna Shields, Simon Paul Sutton, Yavor Veselinov, Sara Malaterre, Ilian Ivanov, Craig Morris', null, 'When his clan, including his wife and baby girl Néa, are massacred, Ao, a desperate Neandertal man, decides to leave the North country where he has been living for the South where he was born. His aim is to join his twin brother, from whom he was separated when he was nine. On his long and adventurous way home, he meets Aki, a Homo Sapiens woman...', 'When his clan, including his wife and baby girl Néa, are massacred, Ao, a desperate Neandertal man, decides to leave the North country where he has been living for the South where he was born. His aim is to join his twin brother, from whom he was separated when he was nine. On his long and adventurous way home, he meets Aki, a Homo Sapiens woman...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4nKlmubLYBzdJAMPkEfFk8WdCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56623'),
  ('536602344187594661', 'Aontas', 2026, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Damian McCann, Damien Elliott', 'Damian McCann, Sarah Gordon', 'Carrie Crowley, Brid Brennan, Eva-Jane Gaffney, Seán T. Ó Meallaigh, Marcus Lamb', null, 'Three unlikely thieves, led by a woman on the verge of a breakdown, rob a rural Irish Credit Union. Opening in the tragic aftermath of the heist-gone-wrong, the story uses reverse chronology to unravel the events that led to this point. What starts as a poorly executed robbery becomes a portrait of a wilful woman trapped in her own past.', 'Three unlikely thieves, led by a woman on the verge of a breakdown, rob a rural Irish Credit Union. Opening in the tragic aftermath of the heist-gone-wrong, the story uses reverse chronology to unravel the events that led to this point. What starts as a poorly executed robbery becomes a portrait of a wilful woman trapped in her own past.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqmP75nlRXg5tyUG0Uf1FXQT4FRM.jpg', 'plex:movie:aontas'),
  ('449610926456245749', 'Aos', 1964, 'Animation', 'Yôji Kuri', null, null, null, 'An abstract animation about people and organs of the body in and out of drawers.', 'An abstract animation about people and organs of the body in and out of drawers.', null, 'tmdb:movie:106201'),
  ('913765124710668592', 'Apache', 1954, 'Action, Western', 'Stanley Cortez, Robert Aldrich, Ernest Laszlo', 'James R. Webb', 'Burt Lancaster, Jean Peters, John McIntire, Charles Bronson, John Dehner, Paul Guilfoyle, Ian MacDonald, Walter Sande', 'NR', 'Following the surrender of Geronimo, Massai, the last Apache warrior is captured and scheduled for transportation to a Florida reservation. On the way he manages to escape and heads for his homeland to win back his girl and settle down to grow crops. His pursuers have other ideas though.', 'Following the surrender of Geronimo, Massai, the last Apache warrior is captured and scheduled for transportation to a Florida reservation. On the way he manages to escape and heads for his homeland to win back his girl and settle down to grow crops. His pursuers have other ideas though.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Q05vmMNL2syEciyUqOmlEq3JC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43329'),
  ('430531737065136245', 'Apache', 1973, 'Western, Adventure', 'Gottfried Kolditz, Helmut Bergmann', 'Gojko Mitić, Gottfried Kolditz', 'Gojko Mitić, Milan Beli, Colea Răutu, Gerry Wolff, Rolf Hoppe, Leon Niemczyk, Fred Delmare, Elsa Grube-Deister', null, 'The story of Ulzana, an Apache chief who has reached a rapprochement with the local Mexican population and generously extends it to whites who travel through the territory. His people have become inured to the treacherous ways of the white man, however, and are now reliant on them for booze, ''relief flour'' and beef steak.', 'The story of Ulzana, an Apache chief who has reached a rapprochement with the local Mexican population and generously extends it to whites who travel through the territory. His people have become inured to the treacherous ways of the white man, however, and are now reliant on them for booze, ''relief flour'' and beef steak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQfjpckS9iLY3gRaZOuF7f3zvvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130964'),
  ('2593414490882987', 'Apache Ambush', 1955, 'Western', 'Fred F. Sears, Fred Jackman Jr., Charles S. Gould', 'David Lang', 'Bill Williams, Richard Jaeckel, Alex Montoya, Movita, Adelle August, James Griffith, Tex Ritter, Ray Corrigan', 'NR', 'Two former enemies find themselves together on a cattle drive and fighting marauding Apaches and Mexican bandits.', 'Two former enemies find themselves together on a cattle drive and fighting marauding Apaches and Mexican bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffXfsKOwflL35ySxtfAEYlmaASa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228285'),
  ('212052648793830041', 'Apache Drums', 1951, 'Western', 'Hugo Fregonese, Charles P. Boyle, Marshall Green', 'David Chandler', 'Stephen McNally, Coleen Gray, Willard Parker, Arthur Shields, James Griffith, Armando Silvestre, Georgia Backus, Clarence Muse', null, 'A gambler is thrown out of a western town, but returns when the town is suddenly threatened by a band of marauding Apaches.', 'A gambler is thrown out of a western town, but returns when the town is suddenly threatened by a band of marauding Apaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPsYgzWIUrcx1vnp9b5YcpJCsXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73896'),
  ('243127065373993960', 'Apache Gold', 1963, 'Western, Adventure', 'Harald Reinl, Ernst W. Kalinke, Slavko Andreš', 'Harald G. Petersson', 'Lex Barker, Pierre Brice, Mario Adorf, Marie Versini, Chris Howland, Walter Barnes, Ralf Wolter, Milivoje ''Mavid'' Popović', 'NR', 'The construction of the Great Western Railroad creates heavy conflict between the railway company and neighboring Indian tribes. Worse, criminal gang leader Santer sets his eyes on a gold mine located on holy Indian land and influences the construction supervisor to re-rout the planned railroad straight through Apache land. Old Shatterhand, who works as a measurement technician, discovers the evil plan and searches contact with the Apaches in an effort to avert war.', 'The construction of the Great Western Railroad creates heavy conflict between the railway company and neighboring Indian tribes. Worse, criminal gang leader Santer sets his eyes on a gold mine located on holy Indian land and influences the construction supervisor to re-rout the planned railroad straight through Apache land. Old Shatterhand, who works as a measurement technician, discovers the evil plan and searches contact with the Apaches in an effort to avert war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHS5Bf4zliMzYj9WqTdr1exZHUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3685'),
  ('384549682804665262', 'Apache Junction', 2021, 'Western, Action, Crime', 'Logan Fulton, Justin Lee', 'Justin Lee', 'Stuart Townsend, Scout Taylor-Compton, Trace Adkins, Thomas Jane, Ed Morrone, Victoria Pratt, Edward Finlay, Danielle Gross', 'R', 'Apache Junction is an outpost of lawlessness, a haven for thieves and cold-blooded killers. After big-city reporter Annabelle Angel arrives to write an article on the town, she becomes a target when notorious gunslinger Jericho Ford comes to her aid. Now Annabelle must entrust her future to a man with a deadly past, as Jericho heads toward a tense showdown.', 'Apache Junction is an outpost of lawlessness, a haven for thieves and cold-blooded killers. After big-city reporter Annabelle Angel arrives to write an article on the town, she becomes a target when notorious gunslinger Jericho Ford comes to her aid. Now Annabelle must entrust her future to a man with a deadly past, as Jericho heads toward a tense showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYkElIUzn9NkVFufpc2oSQlfVsS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866038'),
  ('410227190547405194', 'Apache Rifles', 1964, 'Western', 'William Witney, Herbert S. Greene, Archie R. Dalzell', 'Charles B. Smith', 'Audie Murphy, Michael Dante, Linda Lawson, L.Q. Jones, Ken Lynch, Joseph Vitale, Robert Brubaker, Eugene Iglesias', 'NR', 'A young cavalry officer is assigned the job of bringing in a band of Apaches who have been terrorizing the countryside.', 'A young cavalry officer is assigned the job of bringing in a band of Apaches who have been terrorizing the countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rm0KEElXEWxFZpsyjgzTTaLEag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155685'),
  ('868144635836875773', 'Apache Stays Apache', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Nepomuk V. Fischer', 'Nepomuk V. Fischer, Elena Gruschka, Andrej Jelic', 'Apache 207', null, '10 number one hits. More than 2 billion streams. Yet rap superstar Apache 207 is a mystery. Now he breaks his silence and grants access to camera crews. This compelling documentary shows his life, from plattenbau to luxury mansions, from loneliness to sold-out stadiums - accompanied by his family, best friends and rap icons Loredana, BAUSA and XATAR.', '10 number one hits. More than 2 billion streams. Yet rap superstar Apache 207 is a mystery. Now he breaks his silence and grants access to camera crews. This compelling documentary shows his life, from plattenbau to luxury mansions, from loneliness to sold-out stadiums - accompanied by his family, best friends and rap icons Loredana, BAUSA and XATAR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bozqwpI9nO3t8Z5yeiF023Q18n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027511'),
  ('158178332330564651', 'Apache Territory', 1958, 'Action, Western', 'Ray Nazarro, Irving Lippman, Eddie Saeta', 'George W. George, Charles R. Marion', 'Rory Calhoun, Barbara Bates, John Dehner, Carolyn Craig, Tom Pittman, Leo Gordon, Myron Healey, Francis De Sales', 'NR', 'Logan Cates sets out to rescue a white woman captured by Apache Indians and prevent a war. On the way he is joined by a few civilians and a small band of soldiers at a water hole. They are ambushed and laid siege to by Apache. As their food and water supplies dwindle a storm arrives which enables Cates to put an escape plan into action.', 'Logan Cates sets out to rescue a white woman captured by Apache Indians and prevent a war. On the way he is joined by a few civilians and a small band of soldiers at a water hole. They are ambushed and laid siege to by Apache. As their food and water supplies dwindle a storm arrives which enables Cates to put an escape plan into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SEnnaMjhGZJWI4Kr8sWD4VWFWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110674'),
  ('461718506292081446', 'Apache Uprising', 1965, 'Western', 'R.G. Springsteen, W. Wallace Kelley, Robert Templeton', 'Max Lamb, Harry Sanford', 'Rory Calhoun, Corinne Calvet, John Russell, Lon Chaney Jr., Gene Evans, Richard Arlen, Robert H. Harris, Arthur Hunnicutt', 'NR', 'Various stage coach passengers and outlaws travelling through Indian country are forced to join forces against the Apaches.', 'Various stage coach passengers and outlaws travelling through Indian country are forced to join forces against the Apaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVwcTdgeS96RqWuDaq1WKxteHGP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206518'),
  ('416387993380275872', 'Apache Woman', 1955, 'Western', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'Lou Rusoff', 'Lloyd Bridges, Joan Taylor, Lance Fuller, Morgan Jones, Paul Birch, Lou Place, Paul Dubov, Jonathan Haze', null, 'A government agent ventures west to look into reports that Apaches are behind a recent wave of frontier attacks. Begins to suspect a set-up.', 'A government agent ventures west to look into reports that Apaches are behind a recent wave of frontier attacks. Begins to suspect a set-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM1PVRNIOlozVSx69P7NgrLO9sC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187146'),
  ('931793415091660592', 'Apaches: Gang of Paris', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Romain Quirot, Jean-Paul Agostini, Emeline Durey', 'Fannie Pailloux, Antoine Jaunin', 'Alice Isaaz, Niels Schneider, Rod Paradot, Artus, Émilie Gavois-Kahn, Bruno Lochet, Dominique Pinon, Jean-Luc Couchard', null, 'Paris, 1884. The lives of three orphaned children wandering the streets dominated by ruthless criminals change tragically when they carry out a daring robbery.', 'Paris, 1884. The lives of three orphaned children wandering the streets dominated by ruthless criminals change tragically when they carry out a daring robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUez9nfKgolfL2seCMFz2VofgI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949903'),
  ('552012791889760726', 'Apaharan', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Prakash Jha', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Nana Patekar, Bipasha Basu, Ayub Khan, Mohan Agashe, Mukesh Tiwari, Yashpal Sharma, Pankaj Tripathi', null, 'Story of a tumultuous and complex relationship between a father (Mohan Agashe) and son (Ajay Devgan), set against the backdrop of a thriving kidnapping industry in the Hindi heartland of Bihar.', 'Story of a tumultuous and complex relationship between a father (Mohan Agashe) and son (Ajay Devgan), set against the backdrop of a thriving kidnapping industry in the Hindi heartland of Bihar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZbY2w5NKuJZ8XBmIPZnG2P7X5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28805'),
  ('160198841274610562', 'Apaixonada', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Natalia Warth, Luz Guerra', 'Ana Abreu, Sabrina Garcia', 'Giovanna Antonelli, Danton Mello, Polly Marinho, Pedroca Monteiro, Rodrigo Simas, Nicolás Pauls, Rayssa Bratillieri, Natalia Dal Molin', null, 'Based on the book by Cris Souza Fontes, Apaixonada tells the story of a woman who realizes how monotonous her life is. She finds herself desperate and facing an identity crisis. From then on, she is forced to begin an exciting journey of self-discovery that takes her close to all the passions that life has to offer.', 'Based on the book by Cris Souza Fontes, Apaixonada tells the story of a woman who realizes how monotonous her life is. She finds herself desperate and facing an identity crisis. From then on, she is forced to begin an exciting journey of self-discovery that takes her close to all the passions that life has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luWMuHlX0cIFopEQ4DIu7n6xqGn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181237'),
  ('319405092714526351', 'Aparajito', 1956, 'Drama', 'Subrata Mitra, Satyajit Ray, Suren Chakraborty', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Karuna Banerjee, Santi Gupta, Ranibala, Sudipta Roy, Keya Sengupta, Kamala Adhikari, Saraswati Pandey, Kanu Bannerjee', null, 'Apu and his family have moved away from the country to live in the bustling holy city of Benares. As he progresses from wide-eyed child to intellectually curious teenager, eventually studying in Kolkata, we witness his academic and moral education, as well as the growing complexity of his relationship with his mother.', 'Apu and his family have moved away from the country to live in the bustling holy city of Benares. As he progresses from wide-eyed child to intellectually curious teenager, eventually studying in Kolkata, we witness his academic and moral education, as well as the growing complexity of his relationship with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvR2Qs42WHwCEcuwhQnterU3gVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897'),
  ('974954062171360144', 'Aparan', 1988, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'P. Padmarajan, Venu', 'P. Padmarajan', 'Jayaram, Shobana, Madhu, Mukesh, Sukumari, Jalaja, M G Soman, Innocent', null, 'Viswanathan comes to the city for a job interview, only to find himself entangled in a crisis due to his resemblance with a gangster. Frustrated, he decides to find and face his doppelgänger with the help of a police inspector friend, but finding the imposter proves difficult, and the further they dig, the more mysterious and shocking their findings.', 'Viswanathan comes to the city for a job interview, only to find himself entangled in a crisis due to his resemblance with a gangster. Frustrated, he decides to find and face his doppelgänger with the help of a police inspector friend, but finding the imposter proves difficult, and the further they dig, the more mysterious and shocking their findings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaPA201KKNMgkXMCOJq0dLBadaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135706'),
  ('1117799824317019866', 'Aparecida - O Milagre', 2010, 'Drama', 'Tizuka Yamasaki, Luís Abramo', 'Marco Schiavon, Pedro Antônio, Carlos Gregório', 'Murilo Rosa, Jonatas Faro, Maria Fernanda Cândido, Leona Cavalli, Bete Mendes, Rodrigo Veronese, Vinícius Franco, Janaína Prado', null, 'Marcos Resende is a cold and crisis man command MetalNobre company. Mark lost his faith in God when her father, Antonio, died in the construction of the Basilica of Our Lady of Aparecida. He had asked the day before to Our Lady Aparecida cleats for him to play in a team and his father would buy them. Mark is separated from wife and Sonia have feuds with son Lucas, in addition to keeping a bad emotional relationship with Beatriz, an official of the company and his mother, Julia. After a misunderstanding, Lucas suffers a serious motorcycle accident. Then Mark revive its history and living with his father. And when he turns to Julia, she reveals the mysterious grace of his family.', 'Marcos Resende is a cold and crisis man command MetalNobre company. Mark lost his faith in God when her father, Antonio, died in the construction of the Basilica of Our Lady of Aparecida. He had asked the day before to Our Lady Aparecida cleats for him to play in a team and his father would buy them. Mark is separated from wife and Sonia have feuds with son Lucas, in addition to keeping a bad emotional relationship with Beatriz, an official of the company and his mother, Julia. After a misunderstanding, Lucas suffers a serious motorcycle accident. Then Mark revive its history and living with his father. And when he turns to Julia, she reveals the mysterious grace of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obmt1Kk5c1Wsgzh46G6bo0PBXEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63696'),
  ('708554212465958697', 'Apariencias', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alberto Lecchi', 'Mario Segade, Gustavo Belatti', 'Andrea Del Boca, Adrián Suar, Rita Cortese, Fernando Siro, Jorge Rivera López, Lucrecia Capello, Diego Pérez, Favio Posca', null, 'Carmelo, who is 30-years old and extremely shy, finds it difficult to reveal his innermost feelings to Verónica, his co-worker. Carmelo''s world collapses when he finds out that she intends to get married soon. Accidentally, she spots him demonstrating in a gay rally where he becomes a leader of that cause. Of course, Verónica assumes that Carmelo is gay, and he takes adv antage of this misunderstanding.', 'Carmelo, who is 30-years old and extremely shy, finds it difficult to reveal his innermost feelings to Verónica, his co-worker. Carmelo''s world collapses when he finds out that she intends to get married soon. Accidentally, she spots him demonstrating in a gay rally where he becomes a leader of that cause. Of course, Verónica assumes that Carmelo is gay, and he takes adv antage of this misunderstanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8JZfPLhWPC3eGNXI08Bke1Ca9m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27820'),
  ('892151917886894463', 'Apart from You', 1933, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse', 'Mikio Naruse', 'Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Akio Isono, Sumiko Mizukubo, Reikichi Kawamura, Ryuko Fuji, Yoko Fujita, Tomio Aoki, Kotarô Sekiguchi', null, 'An aging geisha, whose angry teenage son is ashamed of her profession, works alongside a young geisha, resentful of her family for forcing her into a life of ignominy.', 'An aging geisha, whose angry teenage son is ashamed of her profession, works alongside a young geisha, resentful of her family for forcing her into a life of ignominy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEd67dhJCmrqlIN8bA0n9OH0ehJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91150'),
  ('974975561913364801', 'Apart Together', 2010, 'Drama', 'Wang Quan''an, Lutz Reitemeier', 'Na Jin', 'Lisa Lu, Xu Cai-gen, Ling Feng, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Ma Xiaoqing, Na Jin, Yubai Yang, Xue Guoping', null, 'Liu returns to his native city Shanghai after 50 years spent in Taiwan. He has come to find the first love of his life, Qiao, who he left behind pregnant. In the meantime, Qiao has married and formed a family. But Liu is determined to get the family''s approval to take her away with him.', 'Liu returns to his native city Shanghai after 50 years spent in Taiwan. He has come to find the first love of his life, Qiao, who he left behind pregnant. In the meantime, Qiao has married and formed a family. But Liu is determined to get the family''s approval to take her away with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4iMMgnG9NJsGQxNyjacjbsfVfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129955'),
  ('471195910817361678', 'Apartment 1303', 2007, 'Horror', 'Ataru Oikawa, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Takamasa Sato, Ataru Oikawa, Kei Ôishi', 'Noriko Nakagoshi, Arata Furuta, Eriko Hatsune, Yuka Itaya, Naoko Ohtani, Akira Fukada, Toshinobu Matsuo, Shion Machida', 'R', 'While celebrating with her friends in her new cheaply rented apartment on the thirteenth floor of a building, the young Sayaka unexpectedly jumps off the balcony committing suicide. Her mother goes insane and her older sister, Mariko, decides to investigate the mysterious death of her sister.', 'While celebrating with her friends in her new cheaply rented apartment on the thirteenth floor of a building, the young Sayaka unexpectedly jumps off the balcony committing suicide. Her mother goes insane and her older sister, Mariko, decides to investigate the mysterious death of her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UsoGkO7UAWv5o3UxVMMcdMdYUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24417'),
