  ('957325852120071230', 'Apartment Wife: Night of the Rape', 1973, null, 'Saburo Endo, Shōhei Andō, Yuzo Yamaguchi', 'Yukio Yoshihara', 'Junko Miyashita, Kazuhiko Kasai, Kazuko Shirakawa, Hirokazu Inoue, Shinko Jo, Toshihiko Oda, Kôji Kai, Yumi Nakano', null, 'The story depicts the process of a happy family being destroyed by someone taking advantage of a traffic accident caused by buying a car to show off to the neighbors.', 'The story depicts the process of a happy family being destroyed by someone taking advantage of a traffic accident caused by buying a car to show off to the neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJ6nsKWglf7yqlv4XYPEKon3fUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960346'),
