  ('261797729724953524', 'Apartment Zero', 1989, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Carlos Gil, Martin Donovan, Miguel Rodriguez', 'Martin Donovan, David Koepp', 'Colin Firth, Hart Bochner, Dora Bryan, Liz Smith, Mirella D''Angelo, James Telfer, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Juan Vitali', 'R', 'In a rundown area of Buenos Aires, at the dawn of the 1980s, Adrian LeDuc owns both a struggling movie theater and a shabby apartment building filled with eccentric, squabbling tenants. To make ends meet, Adrian takes in a roommate, Jack Carney, but soon begins to suspect that the quiet American is responsible for a series of political assassinations that are rocking the city.', 'In a rundown area of Buenos Aires, at the dawn of the 1980s, Adrian LeDuc owns both a struggling movie theater and a shabby apartment building filled with eccentric, squabbling tenants. To make ends meet, Adrian takes in a roommate, Jack Carney, but soon begins to suspect that the quiet American is responsible for a series of political assassinations that are rocking the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVXGyReSl955Wr2c8ythuxRmJRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5333'),
  ('343986614893382855', 'Ape vs Mecha Ape', 2023, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Marc Gottlieb, Michael Su', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Tom Arnold, Anna Telfer, Lisa Ellee, Jack Pearson, Corbin Timbrook, Xander Bailey, Iris Svis, Lindsey Marie Wilson', null, 'Recognizing the destructive power of its captive giant Ape, the military makes its own battle-ready A.I., Mecha Ape. But its first practical test goes horribly wrong, leaving the military no choice but to release the imprisoned giant ape to stop the colossal robot before it destroys downtown Chicago.', 'Recognizing the destructive power of its captive giant Ape, the military makes its own battle-ready A.I., Mecha Ape. But its first practical test goes horribly wrong, leaving the military no choice but to release the imprisoned giant ape to stop the colossal robot before it destroys downtown Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJaIw8OgACelojyV6YuVsOhtTLO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094844'),
