  ('899925039180282398', 'Apio Verde', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Francesc Morales, Alex Leyton', 'Francesc Morales', 'Catherine Mazoyer, Cristián Gajardo, Catalina Aguayo, Sonia Mena, Teresita Reyes, Andrés Gómez, Carolina Paulsen, Jenny Cavallo', null, 'Adriana finds out the son she''s expecting suffers a brain malformation that won''t allow him to live outside her womb. As therapeutic abortion is illegal in Chile, she must wait until her baby is naturally born.', 'Adriana finds out the son she''s expecting suffers a brain malformation that won''t allow him to live outside her womb. As therapeutic abortion is illegal in Chile, she must wait until her baby is naturally born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7b6UOwFo75DT2e5wKdgPcVyab3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497644'),
  ('682762286446054113', 'Apna Sapna Money Money', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Sangeeth Sivan', null, 'Riteish Deshmukh, Shreyas Talpade, Suniel Shetty, Jackie Shroff, Celina Jaitly, Koena Mitra, Riya Sen, Chunky Panday', null, 'Kishan is a young man from Goa whose brain is full of every conceivable trick to make a quick buck. He cons people by slipping into different outfits and by assuming many guises. Julie, is a sexy club dancer with quite a local reputation, but behind her raunchy exterior is a compassionate, kind-hearted woman who goes out of her way to help the needy...', 'Kishan is a young man from Goa whose brain is full of every conceivable trick to make a quick buck. He cons people by slipping into different outfits and by assuming many guises. Julie, is a sexy club dancer with quite a local reputation, but behind her raunchy exterior is a compassionate, kind-hearted woman who goes out of her way to help the needy...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTxNRZQhRqGqYyuNjAFAzk0iqrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46371'),
  ('326837689124401997', 'Apnas', 2026, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Ashley Chin, Darren R L Gordon', 'Adrian Scott', 'James Greaney, Asim Ashraf, Nitin Ganatra, Rehan Sheikh, Ash Tandon', null, 'A British Asian Mancunian is drawn in to the criminal underworld by his notorious Uncle. Everything is at stake as his competition with his cousin reaches a deadly level.', 'A British Asian Mancunian is drawn in to the criminal underworld by his notorious Uncle. Everything is at stake as his competition with his cousin reaches a deadly level.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9GzallO6gl14TFafP1Y5KDV2uzG.jpg', 'plex:movie:apnas'),
  ('907855855335680023', 'Apne', 2007, 'Drama', 'Anil Sharma', null, 'Dharmendra, Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Katrina Kaif, Divya Dutta, Kirron Kher, Victor Banerjee', null, 'An ex-boxer Baldev Choudhary (Dharmendra) has had a stain in his boxing career. He wanted to wash it with his son Angad''s (Sunny Deol) success, but times were hard and a financial crunch kept him from achieving this dream. Though Angad pulled through fine, Baldev never forgot who ruined his chance to wash the stain. An opportunity strikes Baldev in the form of a T.V. Show. He trains a local boy to get into this media hyped boxing show, but is ditched for a better coach at the last minute. Baldev''s younger son Karan (Bobby Deol) has just launched his first music album. Realizing his father is in crises of his life, he gives up his dream of a musical career to get into the game of boxing.', 'An ex-boxer Baldev Choudhary (Dharmendra) has had a stain in his boxing career. He wanted to wash it with his son Angad''s (Sunny Deol) success, but times were hard and a financial crunch kept him from achieving this dream. Though Angad pulled through fine, Baldev never forgot who ruined his chance to wash the stain. An opportunity strikes Baldev in the form of a T.V. Show. He trains a local boy to get into this media hyped boxing show, but is ditched for a better coach at the last minute. Baldev''s younger son Karan (Bobby Deol) has just launched his first music album. Realizing his father is in crises of his life, he gives up his dream of a musical career to get into the game of boxing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMGSWgtmtMyn9hkyGZeOB5Kz7zC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60124'),
  ('769725733905292202', 'Apnée', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse, Javier Ruiz Gómez', 'Jean-Christophe Meurisse', 'Céline Fuhrer, Thomas Scimeca, Maxence Tual, Thomas De Pourquery, Jean-Luc Vincent, Claire Bournet, Solal Bouloudnine, Pascal Sangla', null, 'Céline, Thomas and Maxence always go by three. Just like the republican motto. They want to get married, to get a house, work, good children and eat oysters every day. Rebellious and ill adapted to the furious economical and administrative reality, they ride their burning quad bikes and travel across an afflicted France, looking for new landmarks, deserts strewn with bipeds and moments of ephemeral bliss.', 'Céline, Thomas and Maxence always go by three. Just like the republican motto. They want to get married, to get a house, work, good children and eat oysters every day. Rebellious and ill adapted to the furious economical and administrative reality, they ride their burning quad bikes and travel across an afflicted France, looking for new landmarks, deserts strewn with bipeds and moments of ephemeral bliss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gahjahWxzJTS93o1J3RZF3XdzlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393517'),
  ('814577473316023556', 'Apocalypse', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Andrea Cecconati, Cristian Mindrila', 'Andrea Cecconati', 'Francesca Cellini, Matteo Zoppi', null, 'The world will end in 12 minutes. A young couple in love decides to spend the remaining time sitting on a park bench, talking about regrets, stolen futures and mistakes of the human race.', 'The world will end in 12 minutes. A young couple in love decides to spend the remaining time sitting on a park bench, talking about regrets, stolen futures and mistakes of the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNYmFwNpcHs1AVffRahJeqTCcNj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:708282'),
  ('705395212906873534', 'Apocalypse ''45', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Erik Nelson', null, 'Issei Nakagawa', null, 'Recounts the harrowing end of World War II through the eyes of 24 men who lived through the events and using never-before-seen footage.', 'Recounts the harrowing end of World War II through the eyes of 24 men who lived through the events and using never-before-seen footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA6YDyz2sEj0jmx0oyOo8ADc57M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729769'),
  ('978220231900445841', 'Apocalypse After', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Anna Le Mouël, David Scherer, Bertrand Mandico', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Pauline Jacquard, Elina Löwensohn, Anne-Lise Maulin, Lola Créton, Vimala Pons, Pauline Lorillard, Nathalie Richard, Jean Le Scouarnec', null, 'An abandoned seaside resort. The shooting for a fantasy film about the end of an era wraps up. Two women, both members of the film crew, one an actrice, the other a director, Apocalypse and Joy, are on the verge of concluding their love affair.', 'An abandoned seaside resort. The shooting for a fantasy film about the end of an era wraps up. Two women, both members of the film crew, one an actrice, the other a director, Apocalypse and Joy, are on the verge of concluding their love affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIONQOopvJ60wJ7OHUhhloiAIz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518500'),
  ('820619129337302519', 'Apocalypse in the Tropics', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Petra Costa, João Atala, Pedro Urano', 'Petra Costa, Alessandra Orofino, Tina Baz', 'Silas Malafaia, Elizete Malafaia, Jair Bolsonaro, Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva, Petra Costa, Alexandre de Moraes, Cabo Daciolo, Damares Alves', 'PG-13', 'Through deep examination, this documentary from Oscar nominee Petra Costa explores the profound impact of evangelism on Brazil''s political landscape.', 'Through deep examination, this documentary from Oscar nominee Petra Costa explores the profound impact of evangelism on Brazil''s political landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Bz69UixoR7jPpYuO6NSKOTGDDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320400'),
