  ('644352731613190049', 'Apocalypse of Ice', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Ben Gelera, Nadine Flores, Maximilian Elfeldt', 'Ryan Ebert', 'Tom Sizemore, Emily Killian, Ramiro Leal, Tania Fox, Torrey Richardson, Jake Holley, Xander Bailey, Christina Licciardi', null, 'Earthquakes cause a massive polar vortex that covers most of the planet, a family must make their way to a safe zone at the equator.', 'Earthquakes cause a massive polar vortex that covers most of the planet, a family must make their way to a safe zone at the equator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfZwx3iarQoawBe3cRmFZxSbx08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747550'),
  ('760006635188896930', 'Apocalypse Pompeii', 2014, 'Adventure, Action', 'Ben Demaree, Ben Demaree, Kiril Neitchev', 'Jacob Cooney, Bill Hanstock', 'Adrian Paul, John Rhys-Davies, Georgina Beedle, Ralitsa Paskaleva, Dan Cade, Jhey Castles, Dylan Vox, Konstantin Trendafilov', 'NR', 'When a former Special Ops commando visits Pompeii, his wife and daughter are trapped as Mt. Vesuvius erupts with massive force. While his family fights to survive the deadly onslaught of heat and lava, he enlists his former teammates in a daring operation beneath the ruins of the city of Pompeii.', 'When a former Special Ops commando visits Pompeii, his wife and daughter are trapped as Mt. Vesuvius erupts with massive force. While his family fights to survive the deadly onslaught of heat and lava, he enlists his former teammates in a daring operation beneath the ruins of the city of Pompeii.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hlmot2yGQEiRruT8hOAkoo7fUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256284'),
  ('185229517128447243', 'Apocalypse Z: The Beginning of the End', 2024, 'Drama, Action, Horror', 'Carles Torrens, Elías M. Félix, Edu Canet', 'Ángel Agudo', 'Francisco Ortiz, José María Yázpik, Berta Vázquez, Iria del Río, Marta Poveda, Amalia Gómez, María Salgueiro, Yuri Mykhaylychenko', null, 'When a kind of rabies that transforms people into aggressive creatures spreads across the planet, Manel isolates himself at home with his cat, relying on his wits to survive; but soon they must go out in search of food, by land and by sea, dodging many dangers.', 'When a kind of rabies that transforms people into aggressive creatures spreads across the planet, Manel isolates himself at home with his cat, relying on his wits to survive; but soon they must go out in search of food, by land and by sea, dodging many dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIGJnIFQlESkC2rLpfA8EDHqk4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118031'),
  ('1039280459813557056', 'Apocalypto', 2006, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Dean Semler, Mel Gibson, Adrian Grünberg', 'Mel Gibson, Farhad Safinia', 'Rudy Youngblood, Raoul Max Trujillo, Gerardo Taracena, Iazua Larios, Antonio Monroy, María Isabel Díaz Lago, Dalia Hernández, Jonathan Brewer', 'R', 'Set in the Mayan civilization, when a man''s idyllic presence is brutally disrupted by a violent invading force, he is taken on a perilous journey to a world ruled by fear and oppression where a harrowing end awaits him. Through a twist of fate and spurred by the power of his love for his woman and his family he will make a desperate break to return home and to ultimately save his way of life.', 'Set in the Mayan civilization, when a man''s idyllic presence is brutally disrupted by a violent invading force, he is taken on a perilous journey to a world ruled by fear and oppression where a harrowing end awaits him. Through a twist of fate and spurred by the power of his love for his woman and his family he will make a desperate break to return home and to ultimately save his way of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRY25Q32kDNPFDkFkxAs6bgCq3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1579'),
  ('173914335321321659', 'Apollo 10½: A Space Age Childhood', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Linklater, Shane F. Kelly', 'Richard Linklater', 'Milo Coy, Jack Black, Lee Eddy, Bill Wise, Natalie L''Amoreaux, Josh Wiggins, Jessica Brynn Cohen, Sam Chipman', 'PG-13', 'A man narrates stories of his life as a 10-year-old boy in 1969 Houston, weaving tales of nostalgia with a fantastical account of a journey to the moon.', 'A man narrates stories of his life as a 10-year-old boy in 1969 Houston, weaving tales of nostalgia with a fantastical account of a journey to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms3qa9LH9kosaGCSe22NJ7fDPv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664996'),
  ('908566552848048562', 'Apollo 11', 2019, 'Documentary, History, Drama', 'Todd Douglas Miller', null, 'Neil Armstrong, Buzz Aldrin, Michael Collins, Walter Cronkite, Bruce McCandless II, Charlie Duke, Andy Aldrin, Patricia Mary Finnegan', 'G', 'A look at the Apollo 11 mission to land on the moon led by commander Neil Armstrong and pilot Buzz Aldrin.', 'A look at the Apollo 11 mission to land on the moon led by commander Neil Armstrong and pilot Buzz Aldrin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woLMRroHyoTGoXyxdEeBJEYBFtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549559'),
  ('1152526524094292478', 'Apollo 13', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Dean Cundey, Ron Howard, Todd Hallowell', 'Al Reinert, William Broyles Jr.', 'Tom Hanks, Bill Paxton, Kevin Bacon, Gary Sinise, Ed Harris, Kathleen Quinlan, David Andrews, Xander Berkeley', 'PG', 'The true story of technical troubles that scuttle the Apollo 13 lunar mission in 1970, risking the lives of astronaut Jim Lovell and his crew, with the failed journey turning into a thrilling saga of heroism. Drifting more than 200,000 miles from Earth, the astronauts work furiously with the ground crew to avert tragedy.', 'The true story of technical troubles that scuttle the Apollo 13 lunar mission in 1970, risking the lives of astronaut Jim Lovell and his crew, with the failed journey turning into a thrilling saga of heroism. Drifting more than 200,000 miles from Earth, the astronauts work furiously with the ground crew to avert tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVeKscCm2fY1xDXZk8PgnZ87h9S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568'),
  ('167789394777934467', 'Apollo 13: Survival', 2024, 'Documentary, History', 'Pete Middleton, Anna MacDonald', null, 'Jim Lovell, Fred Haise, Jack Swigert, Walter Cronkite, Lyndon B. Johnson, Richard Nixon, Jules Bergman', 'PG-13', 'Using original footage and interviews, this documentary tells the nail-biting story of Apollo 13 and the struggle to bring its astronauts safely home.', 'Using original footage and interviews, this documentary tells the nail-biting story of Apollo 13 and the struggle to bring its astronauts safely home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tuK9kKSB2L6rMVlNOjwiWQaWxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249216'),
  ('1068953777310876118', 'Apollo 18', 2011, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Gonzalo López-Gallego, José David Montero, Andy Amoroso', 'Brian Miller', 'Ryan Robbins, Warren Christie, Lloyd Owen, Andrew Airlie, Michael Kopsa, Ali Liebert, Kurt Max Runte, Kim Wylie', 'PG-13', 'Officially, Apollo 17 was the last manned mission to the moon. But a year later in 1973, three American astronauts were sent on a secret mission to the moon funded by the US Department of Defense. What you are about to see is the actual footage which the astronauts captured on that mission. While NASA denies its authenticity, others say it''s the real reason we''ve never gone back to the moon.', 'Officially, Apollo 17 was the last manned mission to the moon. But a year later in 1973, three American astronauts were sent on a secret mission to the moon funded by the US Department of Defense. What you are about to see is the actual footage which the astronauts captured on that mission. While NASA denies its authenticity, others say it''s the real reason we''ve never gone back to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bLqU6YncqvKETzvPZPPoVrLUYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50357'),
  ('388478152183720945', 'Apology for Murder', 1945, 'Crime', 'Jack Greenhalgh, Sam Newfield, Kenneth Kessler', 'Fred Myton', 'Hugh Beaumont, Ann Savage, Charles D. Brown, Russell Hicks, Pierre Watkin, Budd Buster, Norman Willis, Elizabeth Valentine', null, 'Head over heels in love with a stern and cold older businessman''s young wife, a reporter is seduced into conspiring to murder him so she can inherit his estate, while pinning the murder on another businessman.', 'Head over heels in love with a stern and cold older businessman''s young wife, a reporter is seduced into conspiring to murder him so she can inherit his estate, while pinning the murder on another businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32hhYf2i379w8yTwziWTeAqtaSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32892'),
  ('725700674028683984', 'Apolonia, Apolonia', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Anna Żarnecka, Lea Glob, Lea Glob', 'Lea Glob', 'Apolonia Sokol, Oksana Shachko, Alexandra Tlolka, Hervé Breuil, Stefan Simchowitz, Mike White, Lea Glob', null, 'When Danish filmmaker Lea Glob first portrayed Apolonia Sokol in 2009, she appeared to be leading a storybook life. The talented Apolonia was born in an underground theater in Paris and grew up in an artists’ community—the ultimate bohemian existence. In her 20s, she studied at the Beaux-Arts de Paris, one of the most prestigious art academies in Europe. Over the years, Lea Glob kept returning to film the charismatic Apolonia and a special bond developed between the two young women.', 'When Danish filmmaker Lea Glob first portrayed Apolonia Sokol in 2009, she appeared to be leading a storybook life. The talented Apolonia was born in an underground theater in Paris and grew up in an artists’ community—the ultimate bohemian existence. In her 20s, she studied at the Beaux-Arts de Paris, one of the most prestigious art academies in Europe. Over the years, Lea Glob kept returning to film the charismatic Apolonia and a special bond developed between the two young women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mflhHTFqeYgVSNvQoTmlBY0XJDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047128'),
  ('999187104652865064', 'Apoorva Sagodharargal', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'P. C. Sreeram, Singeetam Srinivasa Rao', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Jaishankar, Nagesh, Srividya, Gautami Tadimalla, Manorama, Janagaraj, Mouli', null, 'An honest police officer pays a heavy price after he gets involved with a group of criminals. Years later, his son goes on a vengeance spree but his twin is mistaken as the culprit.', 'An honest police officer pays a heavy price after he gets involved with a group of criminals. Years later, his son goes on a vengeance spree but his twin is mistaken as the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqhffaAgfjNf5TlHUwqdTHVx3Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66365'),
  ('360726054003180562', 'Aporia', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jared Moshé, Nicholas Bupp', 'Jared Moshé', 'Judy Greer, Edi Gathegi, Payman Maadi, Faithe Herman, Whitney Morgan Cox, Rachel Paulson, Lisa Linke, Adam O''Byrne', 'R', 'Since losing her husband, Sophie has struggled to manage grief, a full-time job, and parenting her devastated daughter, but when a former physicist reveals a secret time-bending machine, Sophie will be faced with an impossible choice.', 'Since losing her husband, Sophie has struggled to manage grief, a full-time job, and parenting her devastated daughter, but when a former physicist reveals a secret time-bending machine, Sophie will be faced with an impossible choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYt35YGKoc85LXULzMKDfJ8qX1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528502'),
  ('27727232095738622', 'Apostasy', 2017, 'Drama', 'Daniel Kokotajlo, Lucy Gough-Jones, Ursula Haworth', 'Daniel Kokotajlo', 'Siobhan Finneran, Sacha Parkinson, Molly Wright, Robert Emms, James Quinn, James Foster, Jessica Baglow, Christian Foster', null, 'A faithful Jehovah''s Witness is forced to shun her own sister because of a religious transgression. As the separation draws out, she starts to question the meaning of God''s love.', 'A faithful Jehovah''s Witness is forced to shun her own sister because of a religious transgression. As the separation draws out, she starts to question the meaning of God''s love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjhVHDCCl2nwR1yCPZX4xw819Se.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473309'),
  ('522606581869499032', 'Apostle', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Barry Phillips, Lloyd Elis, Ceinwen Wilkinson', 'Gareth Evans', 'Dan Stevens, Michael Sheen, Lucy Boynton, Mark Lewis Jones, Bill Milner, Kristine Froseth, Paul Higgins, Richard Elfyn', 'R', 'In 1905, a man travels to a remote island in search of his missing sister who has been kidnapped by a mysterious religious cult.', 'In 1905, a man travels to a remote island in search of his missing sister who has been kidnapped by a mysterious religious cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd269f2Yftxxam3EOJPYVwrvjIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424121'),
  ('979725874995568201', 'Apotheose', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Eugen Skladanowsky, Max Skladanowsky', null, 'The two inventors of the Bioskop, a sort of magic lantern that projected images so fast as to give the illusion of movement, bow to the camera at both sides of an empty screen. The scene was shown in continuity, at the end of the session, as if the producers and directors of the session were beading the public a farewell.', 'The two inventors of the Bioskop, a sort of magic lantern that projected images so fast as to give the illusion of movement, bow to the camera at both sides of an empty screen. The scene was shown in continuity, at the end of the session, as if the producers and directors of the session were beading the public a farewell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di6oBKnxZheJdwNDH0XzSQ2c0yh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194087'),
  ('834388342231380931', 'App', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Bobby Boermans', 'Robert A. Jansen', 'Hannah Hoekstra, Isis Cabolet, Robert de Hoog, Jeroen Spitzenberger, Matthijs van de Sande Bakhuyzen, Alex Hendrickx, Mark van Eeuwen, Patrick Martens', null, 'A young psychology student is drawn into the dark and fearful world of a diabolic and mysterious App that starts to terrorize her, distributing compromising photographs, videos and text messages about herself and delves deeper and deeper into her personal life, flawlessly exposing all of her deepest secrets.', 'A young psychology student is drawn into the dark and fearful world of a diabolic and mysterious App that starts to terrorize her, distributing compromising photographs, videos and text messages about herself and delves deeper and deeper into her personal life, flawlessly exposing all of her deepest secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHJ4Zyl0iQ8f7dY99tw49fhcG6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179053'),
  ('404226193623530923', 'App War', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yanyong Kuruaungkoul, Phaklao Jiraungkoonkun, Suteenit Kangvan', 'Phuwanit Pholdee, Sutthipong Phanthanalai, Rangsima Akarawiwat', 'Nat Kitcharit, Prariyapit Yu, Patchanan Jiajirachote, Sirat Intarachote, Thanapop Yoovijit, Ticha Wongtipkanon, Apiwich Reardon, Thanwa Jumpapha', null, 'Two like-minded app entrepreneurs discover that the apps they''re developing are similar, and the pair fight tooth and nail to come out on top. Meanwhile, sparks begin to fly between the two rivals.', 'Two like-minded app entrepreneurs discover that the apps they''re developing are similar, and the pair fight tooth and nail to come out on top. Meanwhile, sparks begin to fly between the two rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmo8ebW89tSg9jdwB1C0Ebmnfgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540765'),
