  ('868230104149778524', 'Appetite for Love', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Eric J. Goldstein, Jason Furukawa, Shane Erron West', 'Damon Hill', 'Taylor Cole, Andrew W. Walker, Alley Mills, Marcus Rosner, Robert Moloney, Jenn Griffin, Antonio Cayonne, Morgan Taylor Campbell', null, 'Mina has everything going for her, but her world is turned upside down when work sends her to her hometown in Tennessee where she must convince an old, stubborn restaurant owner to sell his property. There is just one problem- the restaurant is now owned by her ex-boyfriend Clay, who claims he will never sell. He resists her negotiations every step of the way, and all the while sparks fly.', 'Mina has everything going for her, but her world is turned upside down when work sends her to her hometown in Tennessee where she must convince an old, stubborn restaurant owner to sell his property. There is just one problem- the restaurant is now owned by her ex-boyfriend Clay, who claims he will never sell. He resists her negotiations every step of the way, and all the while sparks fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iijOHt8helVKEaghhoRguu0OtQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377431'),
  ('812006902793513747', 'Applause', 1929, 'Music, Drama', 'Rouben Mamoulian, Otto Brower, George J. Folsey', null, 'Helen Morgan, Joan Peers, Fuller Mellish Jr., Jack Cameron, Henry Wadsworth, Mack Gray, Dorothy Cumming', null, 'This early example of the "backstage" musical genre tells the story of Kitty Darling, a fading burlesque star who tries to save her convent-educated daughter April from following in mom''s footsteps.', 'This early example of the "backstage" musical genre tells the story of Kitty Darling, a fading burlesque star who tries to save her convent-educated daughter April from following in mom''s footsteps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhcVy77WKN0Mr9kCzRgwbbtkEd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120833'),
  ('786770572403621849', 'Apples', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Bartosz Świniarski, Christos Nikou, Stavros Raptis', 'Christos Nikou, Stavros Raptis', 'Aris Servetalis, Sofia Georgovassili, Anna Kalaitzidou, Argyris Bakirtzis, Kostas Laskos, Costas Xikominos, Alexandra Aidini, Babis Makridis', null, 'As an unpredictable, sweeping pandemic causes people to develop sudden amnesia, a man finds himself enrolled in a recovery program designed to help him build a new life. His treatment: performing daily tasks prescribed by his doctors on cassette tape, and capturing those with a Polaroid camera.', 'As an unpredictable, sweeping pandemic causes people to develop sudden amnesia, a man finds himself enrolled in a recovery program designed to help him build a new life. His treatment: performing daily tasks prescribed by his doctors on cassette tape, and capturing those with a Polaroid camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNRERFDH4HpDVIwh2uBDvSb1W1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652156'),
  ('185230739060710067', 'Appleseed', 1988, 'Crime, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuyoshi Katayama, Yumiko Horasawa', 'Kazuyoshi Katayama', 'Masako Katsuki, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Toshio Furukawa, Norio Wakamoto, Toshiko Sawada, Mayumi Shou, Mika Doi, Kumiko Takizawa', null, 'In the futuristic city of Olympus, built on the ashes of the third world war, a police officer and her cyborg partner fight terrorism.', 'In the futuristic city of Olympus, built on the ashes of the third world war, a police officer and her cyborg partner fight terrorism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EoJdu7hyxu73lXKQQrnCxuLoXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45295'),
  ('109933558598269574', 'Appleseed', 2004, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Yasuhiro Ohtsuka, Yasushi Kawamura', 'Haruka Handa, Tsutomu Kamishiro', 'Ai Kobayashi, Asumi Miwa, Jurota Kosugi, Yuki Matsuoka, Yuzuru Fujimoto, Takehito Koyasu, Mami Koyama, Miho Yamada', 'R', 'In a utopian society created at the end of World War III, a female warrior who has been plucked from the badlands begins to see cracks in this new facade. And what does this community have planned for the rest of humankind?', 'In a utopian society created at the end of World War III, a female warrior who has been plucked from the badlands begins to see cracks in this new facade. And what does this community have planned for the rest of humankind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtSmeCDTexb0uWhVedouJ4SeD6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11633'),
  ('879256791412491492', 'Appleseed Alpha', 2014, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Shinji Aramaki, Masaru Matsumoto', 'Marianne Krawczyk', 'Yuka Komatsu, Junichi Suwabe, Aoi Yuuki, Hiroki Takahashi, Hiroki Touchi, Kaori Nazuka, Tessyo Genda, Katsunosuke Hori', 'R', 'The Third World War (2099–2126) devastated part of the Earth. Former nations are reforming while new powers emerge, and groups of humans struggle to survive in ruined cities. The story follows Deunan Knute and her partner Briareos as they search for the legendary city of Olympus.', 'The Third World War (2099–2126) devastated part of the Earth. Former nations are reforming while new powers emerge, and groups of humans struggle to survive in ruined cities. The story follows Deunan Knute and her partner Briareos as they search for the legendary city of Olympus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yISvzOlV0x1D667oRcUBxxDR0LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269650'),
  ('975885918468011908', 'Appleseed: Ex Machina', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Yasushi Kawamura', 'Kiyoto Takeuchi', 'Ai Kobayashi, Koichi Yamadera, Yuji Kishi, Kong Kuwata, Shinpachi Tsuji, Gara Takashima, Rei Igarashi, Rica Fukami', 'PG-13', 'As members of ESWAT, the elite forces serving Olympus, Deunan and Briaereos are deployed anywhere trouble strikes. Olympus finds itself under a stealth attack - cyborg terrorism, deadly nanotech zealots, and rioting citizens are just some of the threats that Deunan must contend with as she fights to save Olympus!', 'As members of ESWAT, the elite forces serving Olympus, Deunan and Briaereos are deployed anywhere trouble strikes. Olympus finds itself under a stealth attack - cyborg terrorism, deadly nanotech zealots, and rioting citizens are just some of the threats that Deunan must contend with as she fights to save Olympus!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxhr2e2Xky4cQ96NpI24xc2GUPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13981'),
  ('889288713742886501', 'Appointment in Bray', 1971, 'Drama, Music, War', 'Ghislain Cloquet, André Delvaux', 'André Delvaux', 'Anna Karina, Mathieu Carrière, Roger Van Hool, Bulle Ogier, Pierre Vernier, Luce Garcia-Ville, Boby Lapointe, Martine Sarcey', null, 'In 1917, the First World War is raging. Julien is from Luxemburg, so instead of having to go to war he studies piano in Paris. One day his friend Jacques, also a musician and now a fighter pilot on the front, invites him to spend a few days in his family''s empty house in Bray. The housekeeper, a beautiful stoic woman lets Julien in, but his friend is late and he is obliged to wait. In the meantime, he starts reminiscing of the pre-war days spent with his friend and Jacques'' girlfriend Odile.', 'In 1917, the First World War is raging. Julien is from Luxemburg, so instead of having to go to war he studies piano in Paris. One day his friend Jacques, also a musician and now a fighter pilot on the front, invites him to spend a few days in his family''s empty house in Bray. The housekeeper, a beautiful stoic woman lets Julien in, but his friend is late and he is obliged to wait. In the meantime, he starts reminiscing of the pre-war days spent with his friend and Jacques'' girlfriend Odile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfDZW6PZqXdXA6mu0bKGgyUWTdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4746'),
  ('828957330939226782', 'Appointment in London', 1953, 'War, Drama', 'Philip Leacock, Stephen Dade', 'John Wooldridge, Robert Westerby', 'Dirk Bogarde, Ian Hunter, Dinah Sheridan, Bryan Forbes, Walter Fitzgerald, Bill Kerr, William Sylvester, Anne Leon', null, 'Wing-commander Tim Mason leads a squadron of Lancaster bombers on almost nightly raids from England. Having flown eighty-seven missions he will shortly be retiring from flying, but the strain is showing. He tries to make sure his men concentrate only on their job and so keeps women away from the base, but then he himself meets naval officer Eve Canyon.', 'Wing-commander Tim Mason leads a squadron of Lancaster bombers on almost nightly raids from England. Having flown eighty-seven missions he will shortly be retiring from flying, but the strain is showing. He tries to make sure his men concentrate only on their job and so keeps women away from the base, but then he himself meets naval officer Eve Canyon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0r4MFnK3rDVqnt3g9L2afkAVuj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54792'),
  ('1141218416386427110', 'Appointment with a Shadow', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'William E. Snyder, Richard Carlson, Gordon McLean', 'Alec Coppel, Norman Jolley', 'George Nader, Joanna Moore, Brian Keith, Virginia Field, Frank De Kova, Stephen Chase, Bill Hickman, Rusty Lane', 'NR', 'George Nader plays a reporter whose career is ruined by liquor. A comeback opportunity presents itself when Nader is a bystander at the arrest of a well-known criminal.', 'George Nader plays a reporter whose career is ruined by liquor. A comeback opportunity presents itself when Nader is a bystander at the arrest of a well-known criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yQCLra8AcqGVxrJFbqQbgYseSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38045'),
  ('1138880324313684409', 'Appointment with Crime', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Harlow, Denis Johnson, Gerald Moss', 'John Harlow', 'William Hartnell, Raymond Lovell, Robert Beatty, Herbert Lom, Joyce Howard, Alan Wheatley, Cyril Smith, Elsie Wagstaff', 'NR', 'Small-time jewel thief Leo Martin is deserted by his partners-in-crime, club owner Gus Loman and driver Hatchett, when the robbery they are committing goes wrong. After serving his prison sentence, Leo emerges with an intricate plan for revenge. Leo implicates Loman, as well as his amoral boss, Gregory Lang, for murder -- but Inspector Rogers suspects Leo.', 'Small-time jewel thief Leo Martin is deserted by his partners-in-crime, club owner Gus Loman and driver Hatchett, when the robbery they are committing goes wrong. After serving his prison sentence, Leo emerges with an intricate plan for revenge. Leo implicates Loman, as well as his amoral boss, Gregory Lang, for murder -- but Inspector Rogers suspects Leo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ngIy28Iyayfkz3z0SLD0p8iqHKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92459'),
  ('530341590938450769', 'Appointment with Danger', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lewis Allen, John F. Seitz, Francisco Day', 'Richard L. Breen, Warren Duff', 'Alan Ladd, Phyllis Calvert, Paul Stewart, Jan Sterling, Jack Webb, Stacy Harris, Harry Morgan, David Bauer', 'NR', 'Al Goddard, a detective who works for the United States Postal Inspection Service, is assigned to arrest two criminals who''ve allegedly murdered a U.S. postal detective.', 'Al Goddard, a detective who works for the United States Postal Inspection Service, is assigned to arrest two criminals who''ve allegedly murdered a U.S. postal detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZOvwsG2KbwUROmiidyVbijdLJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25564'),
  ('1114402584672122268', 'Appointment with Death', 1988, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Michael Winner, David Gurfinkel, Chris Carreras', 'Anthony Shaffer, Peter Buckman, Michael Winner', 'Peter Ustinov, Lauren Bacall, Carrie Fisher, John Gielgud, Piper Laurie, Hayley Mills, Jenny Seagrove, David Soul', 'PG', 'Emily Boynton, the stepmother to three children, blackmails the family lawyer into destroying a second will of her late husband that would have freed the children from her dominating influence. She takes herself, the children, and her daughter-in-law on holiday to Europe and the Holy Land. At a dig, Emily is found dead and Hercule Poirot investigates.', 'Emily Boynton, the stepmother to three children, blackmails the family lawyer into destroying a second will of her late husband that would have freed the children from her dominating influence. She takes herself, the children, and her daughter-in-law on holiday to Europe and the Holy Land. At a dig, Emily is found dead and Hercule Poirot investigates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnHtgkOgYznDOh9lmK5MLiJpxVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4281'),
  ('638251180416045420', 'Apprentice to Murder', 1988, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ralph L. Thomas, Kelvin Pike, Torill Ek', 'Wesley Moore, Allan Scott', 'Donald Sutherland, Chad Lowe, Mia Sara, Knut Husebø, Rutanya Alda, Eddie Jones, Mark Burton, Adrian Sparks', 'PG-13', 'Pennsylvania, 1928. Billy Kelly, a sixteen-year old boy, meets a mysterious traveler claiming he''s the messenger of God. Falling under under the spell of this "doctor" Reese, he will soon discover Reese has murderous plans for his future. Based on a true story.', 'Pennsylvania, 1928. Billy Kelly, a sixteen-year old boy, meets a mysterious traveler claiming he''s the messenger of God. Falling under under the spell of this "doctor" Reese, he will soon discover Reese has murderous plans for his future. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewG6XQJKbT6JUoZxQdldyGO3M9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140394'),
  ('962963914059594774', 'Approaching the Unknown', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Adam Newport-Berra, Mark Elijah Rosenberg', 'Mark Elijah Rosenberg', 'Mark Strong, Luke Wilson, Sanaa Lathan, Anders Danielsen Lie, Charles Baker, Bettina Skye, Nancy Rubel, Joe James', 'R', 'Captain William Stanaforth is on a one-way solo mission to take the first steps in colonising Mars. Like all pioneers throughout history, Stanaforth will face insurmountable odds and life and death decisions as he rockets bravely through space.', 'Captain William Stanaforth is on a one-way solo mission to take the first steps in colonising Mars. Like all pioneers throughout history, Stanaforth will face insurmountable odds and life and death decisions as he rockets bravely through space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zubKPqGvXog7LWMyVVZChCo4E8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328429'),
  ('144431090650560659', 'Appropriate Behavior', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Desiree Akhavan, Chris Teague, Laura Klein', 'Desiree Akhavan', 'Desiree Akhavan, Rebecca Henderson, Halley Feiffer, Ryan Fitzsimmons, Anh Duong, Hooman Majd, Arian Moayed, Justine Cotsonas', null, 'Shirin is struggling to become an ideal Persian daughter, politically correct bisexual and hip young Brooklynite but fails miserably in her attempt at all identities.', 'Shirin is struggling to become an ideal Persian daughter, politically correct bisexual and hip young Brooklynite but fails miserably in her attempt at all identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywa3IaNZz6m7jMur18zn4de59CV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249916'),
  ('877937155144786691', 'Approved for Adoption', 2012, 'Animation, Family, Documentary', 'Jung-sik Jun, Laurent Boileau', 'Laurent Boileau', 'William Coryn, Christelle Cornil, Jean-Luc Couchard, Arthur Dubois, David Macaluso, Jung-sik Jun', null, 'This remarkable animated documentary traces the unconventional upbringing of the filmmaker Jung Henin, one of thousands of Korean children adopted by Western families after the end of the Korean War. It is the story of a boy stranded between two cultures. Animated vignettes – some humorous and some poetic – track Jung from the day he first meet his new blond siblings, through elementary school, and into his teenage years, when his emerging sense of identity begins to create fissures at home and ignite the latent biases of his adoptive parents. The filmmaker tells his story using his own animation intercut with snippets of super-8 family footage and archival film. The result is an animated memoir like no other: clear-eyed and unflinching, humorous, and above all, inspiring in the capacity of the human heart.', 'This remarkable animated documentary traces the unconventional upbringing of the filmmaker Jung Henin, one of thousands of Korean children adopted by Western families after the end of the Korean War. It is the story of a boy stranded between two cultures. Animated vignettes – some humorous and some poetic – track Jung from the day he first meet his new blond siblings, through elementary school, and into his teenage years, when his emerging sense of identity begins to create fissures at home and ignite the latent biases of his adoptive parents. The filmmaker tells his story using his own animation intercut with snippets of super-8 family footage and archival film. The result is an animated memoir like no other: clear-eyed and unflinching, humorous, and above all, inspiring in the capacity of the human heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLr90DiyM8mRgBgsRDzgiDwtzxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137695'),
  ('362682454744084111', 'Après moi le bonheur', 2016, 'Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Cuche, Pierre-Yves Bastard', 'Claire Lemaréchal, Cristina Arellano', 'Alexandra Lamy, Michaël Abiteboul, Julia Piaton, Zabou Breitman, Thierry Frémont, Jean-Michel Tinivelli, Nicolas Jouhet, Juliette Gombert', null, 'A dying woman is fighting to choose a new family to keep her four children together, after she''s gone.', 'A dying woman is fighting to choose a new family to keep her four children together, after she''s gone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5ewYwRPWbfoXQ3VbaIsoqwxXZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383866'),
  ('900514751528416132', 'April', 1963, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Otar Iosseliani, L. Mzhavia, Yuri Fednev', 'Otar Iosseliani, Erlom Akhvlediani', 'Tatyana Chanturia, Gia Chiraqadze, Akakiy Chikvaidze, V. Maisuradze, A. Jorbenadze', null, 'A critique of materialism, the film is about a young couple who live in a rundown empty apartment. Their love is so strong that it makes the water flow and the electricity work, but when they start purchasing furniture and knickknacks, they fight and grow apart.', 'A critique of materialism, the film is about a young couple who live in a rundown empty apartment. Their love is so strong that it makes the water flow and the electricity work, but when they start purchasing furniture and knickknacks, they fight and grow apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZTKgfb3jr1ojAM2LnLRPN3jS1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83234'),
  ('446800947240790142', 'April', 2025, 'Drama', 'Dea Kulumbegashvili, Arseni Khachaturan, Alexander Glurjidze', 'Dea Kulumbegashvili', 'Ia Sukhitashvili, Kakha Kintsurashvili, Merab Ninidze, Roza Kacheishvili, Ana Nikolava, David Beradze, Sandro Kalandadze, Tosia Doloiani', 'NR', 'Nina, an OB-GYN, faces accusations after a newborn''s death. Her life undergoes scrutiny during investigation. She persists in her medical duties, determined to provide care others hesitate to offer, despite the risks.', 'Nina, an OB-GYN, faces accusations after a newborn''s death. Her life undergoes scrutiny during investigation. She persists in her medical duties, determined to provide care others hesitate to offer, despite the risks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DJadZoQfmSzxe3E5uB7dISfc3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064021'),
  ('999100899386491801', 'April 1, 2000', 1952, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Wolfgang Liebeneiner, Karl Löb, Sepp Ketterer', 'Rudolf Brunngraber, Ernst Wolfram Marboe', 'Josef Meinrad, Hilde Krahl, Waltraut Haas, Curd Jürgens, Paul Hörbiger, Hans Moser, Judith Holzmeister, Elisabeth Stemberger', null, 'It is the year 2000 and the World Global Union is in charge, although other countries are allowed to elect their own government leaders, as long as they support the Union. When Austria''s newly-elected president, played by Josef Meinrad, makes his inauguration speech he declares Austria independence and issues an edict ending Austria''s financial support for the Global Union.', 'It is the year 2000 and the World Global Union is in charge, although other countries are allowed to elect their own government leaders, as long as they support the Union. When Austria''s newly-elected president, played by Josef Meinrad, makes his inauguration speech he declares Austria independence and issues an edict ending Austria''s financial support for the Global Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQroCQrO7NWV9FfKLFzwRchfkFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30024'),
  ('795411451331117325', 'April 9th', 2015, 'Drama, War, History', 'Roni Ezra, Philippe Kress, Eszter Takács', 'Tobias Lindholm', 'Pilou Asbæk, Lars Mikkelsen, Gustav Dyekjær Giese, Martin Greis-Rosenthal, Joachim Fjelstrup, Jannik Lorenzen, Elliott Crosset Hove, Mikkel Bentzen', null, 'In the early morning of April 9, 1940, the Danish army is alerted: the Germans have crossed the border.', 'In the early morning of April 9, 1940, the Danish army is alerted: the Germans have crossed the border.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH1uhfE5eN4FzQIuj8WkdCAL7n0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332179'),
  ('522701968042501122', 'April and the Extraordinary World', 2015, 'Thriller, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Franck Ekinci, Christian Desmares, Patrick Imbert', 'Benjamin Legrand, Franck Ekinci', 'Marion Cotillard, Philippe Katerine, Jean Rochefort, Olivier Gourmet, Marc-André Grondin, Bouli Lanners, Anne Coesens, Macha Grenon', null, 'It''s 1941, but France is trapped in the 19th Century, governed by steam and Napoleon V. Avril, a teenage girl, goes in search of her missing scientist parents.', 'It''s 1941, but France is trapped in the 19th Century, governed by steam and Napoleon V. Avril, a teenage girl, goes in search of her missing scientist parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cenqAhHFJRGf08L8rgvHTlFrLuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340357'),
  ('996173712916540650', 'April Apocalypse', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Jarret Tarnol, Kyle Hartman', 'Brent Tarnol', 'Reece Thompson, Rebekah Brandes, Brent Tarnol, Stephanie Hunt, Todd Stashwick, Roger Bart, George López, Mark Rolston', 'NR', 'Artie is pure bred trailer trash. He has zero ambition, is everyone''s favorite punching back at school and bears the burden of his virginity in silence. And then April moves out of the state. She''s his best friend and support since kindergarten and the love of his life. Three years later Artie finally has the courage to take to the road and go see April to tell her how he feels about her. One car-crash later Artie wakes up in the middle of the zombie apocalypse. But this time he''s not going to hide. Artie''s love for April doesn''t give him wings, but does give him the courage to hack, slash, punch and kick himself a part towards the girl he loves. Time is of the essence, because that bite on his hand will make the difference between a French kiss and a bite out of April''s brains.', 'Artie is pure bred trailer trash. He has zero ambition, is everyone''s favorite punching back at school and bears the burden of his virginity in silence. And then April moves out of the state. She''s his best friend and support since kindergarten and the love of his life. Three years later Artie finally has the courage to take to the road and go see April to tell her how he feels about her. One car-crash later Artie wakes up in the middle of the zombie apocalypse. But this time he''s not going to hide. Artie''s love for April doesn''t give him wings, but does give him the courage to hack, slash, punch and kick himself a part towards the girl he loves. Time is of the essence, because that bite on his hand will make the difference between a French kiss and a bite out of April''s brains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9FB6gCQLpTKQFtI4SCSQbSeA0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270064'),
  ('263776680562628600', 'April Captains', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Maria de Medeiros, Michel Abramowicz', 'Ève Deboise, Maria de Medeiros', 'Stefano Accorsi, Maria de Medeiros, Joaquim de Almeida, Frédéric Pierrot, Fele Martínez, Manuel João Vieira, Marcantonio Del Carlo, Emmanuel Salinger', null, 'Story of the 1974 coup that overthrew the right-wing Portuguese dictatorship--which continued the fascist policies of long-time dictator Antonio Salazar--and of two young army captains who were involved in it.', 'Story of the 1974 coup that overthrew the right-wing Portuguese dictatorship--which continued the fascist policies of long-time dictator Antonio Salazar--and of two young army captains who were involved in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUX2F3tyw2pa7l3snGCsnEIZHcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54380'),
  ('245478440600760177', 'April Fool''s Day', 1986, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Fred Walton, Charles Minsky', 'Danilo Bach', 'Amy Steel, Ken Olandt, Deborah Foreman, Deborah Goodrich, Clayton Rohner, Thomas F. Wilson, Jay Baker, Leah Pinsent', 'R', 'As soon as Muffy St. John and her college friends arrive on her parents'' secluded island, someone starts trimming the guest list... one murder at a time.', 'As soon as Muffy St. John and her college friends arrive on her parents'' secluded island, someone starts trimming the guest list... one murder at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNx2tNRzRyPsBSHX1VF2c7U0UyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24913'),
  ('1115557193174947979', 'April Fool''s Day', 2008, 'Horror', 'Phil Flores, Mitchell Altieri, Alexa Sheehan', 'Phil Flores, Mitchell Altieri, Danilo Bach', 'Taylor Cole, Josh Henderson, Scout Taylor-Compton, Joe Egender, Jennifer Siebel Newsom, Samuel Child, Joseph McKelheer, Frank J. Aard', 'R', 'When an April Fool''s Day prank turns deadly, Desiree Cartier, her brother Blaine, and five of their friends all become the targets of a twisted kill who begins hunting them down one by one.', 'When an April Fool''s Day prank turns deadly, Desiree Cartier, her brother Blaine, and five of their friends all become the targets of a twisted kill who begins hunting them down one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdssdn6dNC2hGzc2j7IgQT2VDjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26233'),
  ('62130685874752216', 'April Fools', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Junichi Ishikawa', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Erika Toda, Tori Matsuzaka, Nanao, Yusuke Santamaria, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Kōtarō Satomi, Sumiko Fuji, Susumu Terajima', null, 'Ayumi Nitta is a member of a hospital cleaning staff and suffers from extreme social anxiety. After having a one-night stand with genius surgeon and sex addict Wataru Makino, Ayumi discovers she’s pregnant. However, when she tells Wataru, he dismisses her claim as a bad April Fools joke. Refusing to believe he could possibly be the father of Ayumi’s baby after just one night together, Wataru takes a woman named Reiko on a date to an Italian restaurant. However, Ayumi also shows up, leading to a major incident.', 'Ayumi Nitta is a member of a hospital cleaning staff and suffers from extreme social anxiety. After having a one-night stand with genius surgeon and sex addict Wataru Makino, Ayumi discovers she’s pregnant. However, when she tells Wataru, he dismisses her claim as a bad April Fools joke. Refusing to believe he could possibly be the father of Ayumi’s baby after just one night together, Wataru takes a woman named Reiko on a date to an Italian restaurant. However, Ayumi also shows up, leading to a major incident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWaxZkkWsUYezLqw8mW8lhhIVOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314829'),
  ('1048280906003867722', 'April Fools'' Day', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Marc Fossard, Gilles Grangier, Maxime Roger', 'Michel Audiard', 'Bourvil, Louis de Funès, Annie Cordy, Jacqueline Noëlle, Maurice Biraud, Louis Bugette, Paul Faivre, Suzanne Grey', null, 'Emile is a good mechanic whose clientele is very loyal. A bit naive, he is bamboozled by a seller who manages to sell him the full trappings of the perfect fisherman. No sooner did he regret that he bought, frightened by his wife''s reaction to such expenditure. But he plans to try it ...', 'Emile is a good mechanic whose clientele is very loyal. A bit naive, he is bamboozled by a seller who manages to sell him the full trappings of the perfect fisherman. No sooner did he regret that he bought, frightened by his wife''s reaction to such expenditure. But he plans to try it ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4tzSCmqmMMU7RwcV9jzJenQfji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51840'),
  ('786205290276869697', 'April in Love', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gérald Hustache-Mathieu', 'Gérald Hustache-Mathieu', 'Sophie Quinton, Miou-Miou, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Clément Sibony, Richaud Valls, Geneviève Casile, Monique Mélinand, Anna Mihalcea', null, 'Avril is a novice in a convent of "Baptistine" sisters, a monastic order which was officially dissolved by the end of the nineteenth century but that is kept alive by Mère Marie Joseph, the sadistic superior. While Avril is on retreat, locked in for a fortnight in a chapel prior to taking her vows, Soeur Bernadette, a sympathetic sister, discloses a secret to her: she has a twin brother...', 'Avril is a novice in a convent of "Baptistine" sisters, a monastic order which was officially dissolved by the end of the nineteenth century but that is kept alive by Mère Marie Joseph, the sadistic superior. While Avril is on retreat, locked in for a fortnight in a chapel prior to taking her vows, Soeur Bernadette, a sympathetic sister, discloses a secret to her: she has a twin brother...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oW0GR3rtFmNQ4OWVh2o1Hvi9E2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22161'),
  ('720293664757081851', 'April Love', 1957, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Henry Levin, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Winston Miller', 'Pat Boone, Shirley Jones, Arthur O''Connell, Dolores Michaels, Matt Crowley, Jeanette Nolan, Bradford Jackson', 'NR', 'A teenager, recently in trouble with the police, is sent to live with his aunt and uncle on their Kentucky farm in order to rediscover life''s values.', 'A teenager, recently in trouble with the police, is sent to live with his aunt and uncle on their Kentucky farm in order to rediscover life''s values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64Zay1PxaN2uFNlvlOey2Li84i2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106833'),
