  ('214986951221659636', 'Arab Blues', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Manele Labidi, Laurent Brunet', 'Manele Labidi', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Hichem Yacoubi, Majd Mastoura, Aïsha Ben Miled, Ramla Ayari, Feryel Chammari, Najoua Zouhair, Jamel Sassi', null, 'Selma, a psychoanalyst, deals with a cast of colorful new patients after returning home to Tunisia to open a practice.', 'Selma, a psychoanalyst, deals with a cast of colorful new patients after returning home to Tunisia to open a practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8UoHYXLRClZcesFIdBGx22lH0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582897'),
  ('452223638717909994', 'Arab Cortege, Geneva', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'A stationary camera looks across a busy corner toward a store front marked "The Divan." The words "des fees" are beneath. A cortege of Arabs, about 20 persons in the party, walk past; the dignitaries are in front, attended by men with horns and drums. Coming in the other direction are local Swiss, who pay little attention, and a group of native-garbed Africans. The dozen or so well-dressed denizens of Geneva who are sitting on the steps of the Divan take it all in.', 'A stationary camera looks across a busy corner toward a store front marked "The Divan." The words "des fees" are beneath. A cortege of Arabs, about 20 persons in the party, walk past; the dignitaries are in front, attended by men with horns and drums. Coming in the other direction are local Swiss, who pay little attention, and a group of native-garbed Africans. The dozen or so well-dressed denizens of Geneva who are sitting on the steps of the Divan take it all in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQQlJRfjwbEBEDqaKA3ko492BOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178755'),
  ('284661124166586269', 'Arabella, the Pirate''s Daughter', 1982, 'Adventure, Family', 'Peeter Simm, Arvo Iho, Toomas Vohu', 'Peeter Simm', 'Inga-Kai Puskar-Polonski, Lembit Peterson, Urmas Kibuspuu, Raivo Trass, Leelo Talvik, Lembit Ulfsak, Aarne Üksküla, Sulev Luik', null, 'Arabella is a daughter of the world''s most terrifying pirate captain. She loves her father but also dreams about a life of a usual girl. One day a weird stranger is saved from the sea who will be the only friend of Arabella. At the same time a rival pirate called Raudpats plans to kidnap the girl. Will she be safe and can she ever live a normal life?', 'Arabella is a daughter of the world''s most terrifying pirate captain. She loves her father but also dreams about a life of a usual girl. One day a weird stranger is saved from the sea who will be the only friend of Arabella. At the same time a rival pirate called Raudpats plans to kidnap the girl. Will she be safe and can she ever live a normal life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkNO97wVHR1OwsfeX16jZzG3CeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70122'),
  ('1139705438813264813', 'Arabella: Black Angel', 1989, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Stelvio Massi, Stelvio Massi', 'R. Filippucci', 'Tinì Cansino, Valentina Visconti, Francesco Casale, Carlo Mucari, Renato D''Amore, Giose Davi, David D''Ingeo, Rena Niehaus', null, 'An insatiable nymphomaniac with a wheelchair-bound writer husband finds that her lurid exploits rejuvenate his creativity and libido, but soon enough, all of her lovers end up being murdered by an unknown assailant.', 'An insatiable nymphomaniac with a wheelchair-bound writer husband finds that her lurid exploits rejuvenate his creativity and libido, but soon enough, all of her lovers end up being murdered by an unknown assailant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTSAYWRi9T3C7hQ1Jh0emq1hyLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108101'),
  ('130068520662311789', 'Arabesque', 1929, 'Fantasy', 'Germaine Dulac, Paul Guichard', null, 'Marie-Anne Malleville', null, 'The film’s visual structure is principally composed of variations on the arabesque: arcs of light, water spouts, spider webs, burgeoning trees, flowers and foliage, a woman’s smile, arms stretching, an arm giving rhythm to a rocking chair. It uses natural elements (light, mirrors, water, and wind) and photographic techniques (multiple exposures and lenses) to distort the various elements, or to intensify their design.', 'The film’s visual structure is principally composed of variations on the arabesque: arcs of light, water spouts, spider webs, burgeoning trees, flowers and foliage, a woman’s smile, arms stretching, an arm giving rhythm to a rocking chair. It uses natural elements (light, mirrors, water, and wind) and photographic techniques (multiple exposures and lenses) to distort the various elements, or to intensify their design.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lct1EqvZzzIWd8b7cmtBxvF6mxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283491'),
  ('1130500067835677078', 'Arabesque', 1966, 'Thriller, Comedy, Mystery, Action', 'Christopher Challis, Stanley Donen, Arthur Carroll', 'Peter Stone, Stanley Price, Julian Mitchell', 'Gregory Peck, Sophia Loren, Alan Badel, Kieron Moore, Carl Duering, John Merivale, Duncan Lamont, George Coulouris', null, 'When a plot against a prominent Middle Eastern politician is uncovered, David Pollock, a professor of ancient hieroglyphics at Oxford University, is recruited to help expose the scheme. Pollock must find information believed to be in hieroglyphic code and must also contend with a mysterious man called Beshraavi. Meanwhile, Beshraavi''s lover, Yasmin Azir, seems willing to aid Pollock -- but is she really on his side?', 'When a plot against a prominent Middle Eastern politician is uncovered, David Pollock, a professor of ancient hieroglyphics at Oxford University, is recruited to help expose the scheme. Pollock must find information believed to be in hieroglyphic code and must also contend with a mysterious man called Beshraavi. Meanwhile, Beshraavi''s lover, Yasmin Azir, seems willing to aid Pollock -- but is she really on his side?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufQBXrETmVizoVaoYKAmjArRTyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23030'),
  ('389359425632946184', 'Arabesque', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music, Drama', 'Ertem Eğilmez, Ferdi Eğilmez', 'Gani Müjde', 'Müjde Ar, Şener Şen, Uğur Yücel, Üstün Asutay, Necati Bilgiç, Orhan Çağman, Doğu Erkan, Tarık Papuççuoğlu', null, 'Sener and Müjde, who can never come together because of endless obstacles and misunderstandings, slowly drift into the plaintive world of arabesque music.', 'Sener and Müjde, who can never come together because of endless obstacles and misunderstandings, slowly drift into the plaintive world of arabesque music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnwrlDHwAELRWXitPPBKUbkpzvl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32279'),
  ('969474541906879604', 'Arabesque for Kenneth Anger', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Marie Menken', null, 'Kenneth Anger, Willard Maas', null, 'Filmed at the Alhambra in Spain in just one day, according to Marie Menken. Arabesque for Kenneth Anger concentrates on visual details found in Moorish architecture and in ancient Spanish tile. The date 1961 refers to the addition of Teiji Ito''s soundtrack and its subsequent completion, but the film was likely shot in 1960 or earlier. - David Lewis', 'Filmed at the Alhambra in Spain in just one day, according to Marie Menken. Arabesque for Kenneth Anger concentrates on visual details found in Moorish architecture and in ancient Spanish tile. The date 1961 refers to the addition of Teiji Ito''s soundtrack and its subsequent completion, but the film was likely shot in 1960 or earlier. - David Lewis', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJ14TRgcjSbGpQWsGoaO43fx8iU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209714'),
  ('817961411411872522', 'Arabesques on the Pirosmani Theme', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Sergei Parajanov, Nodar Paliashvili', 'Kora Tsereteli', null, null, 'Short film from Sergei Parajanov, a personal view of the director on the spectacular heritage of Niko Pirosmani (1862–1918), a Georgian primitivist painter.', 'Short film from Sergei Parajanov, a personal view of the director on the spectacular heritage of Niko Pirosmani (1862–1918), a Georgian primitivist painter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9xZhLcMwC7BjEj9bq7Xk0vCYnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335204'),
  ('997358944085699159', 'Arabian Adventure', 1979, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Kevin Connor, Alan Hume', 'Brian Hayles', 'Christopher Lee, Milo O''Shea, Oliver Tobias, Emma Samms, Puneet Sira, John Wyman, John Ratzenberger, Shane Rimmer', null, 'An evil caliph offers his daughter’s hand in marriage to a prince if he can complete a perilous quest for a magical rose. Helped by a young boy and a magic carpet, Prince Hasan has to overcome genies, fire-breathing monsters, and treacherous swamps to reach his prize and claim the hand of the Princess Zuleira.', 'An evil caliph offers his daughter’s hand in marriage to a prince if he can complete a perilous quest for a magical rose. Helped by a young boy and a magic carpet, Prince Hasan has to overcome genies, fire-breathing monsters, and treacherous swamps to reach his prize and claim the hand of the Princess Zuleira.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dH9JDUQUygOSqCizzI1R10bnpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82430'),
  ('811366306004085575', 'Arabian Nights', 1942, 'Action, Adventure', 'John Rawlins, William V. Skall, W. Howard Greene', 'Michael Hogan', 'Jon Hall, Maria Montez, Sabu, Leif Erickson, Billy Gilbert, Edgar Barrier, Richard Lane, Turhan Bey', 'NR', 'Two half brothers battle each other for the power of the throne and the love of sensual, gorgeous dancing girl Scheherazade.', 'Two half brothers battle each other for the power of the throne and the love of sensual, gorgeous dancing girl Scheherazade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5ZurZi5LEyY9sGsl5iKzaCyEeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60488'),
  ('924373736739722024', 'Arabian Nights: The Adventures of Sinbad', 1962, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Taiji Yabushita, Masao Kuroda', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Hideo Kinoshita, Junpei Takiguchi, Kiyoshi Kawakubo, Mahito Tsujimura, Tetsuko Kuroyanagi, Kyôko Satomi, Noriko Shindô', null, 'Two young aspiring adventurers, Sindbad and Ali, find an old sailor who has washed up on the shore. With his final breath, the sailor tells them a tale of a hidden treasure and hands over the map he had held on to through his trials. And so, the two would-be heroes are off for adventure. But the road to riches is paved with hardships: their travels lead from stowing away on a ship to the sultan''s dungeons -- only to escape with the sultan''s daughter in tow!', 'Two young aspiring adventurers, Sindbad and Ali, find an old sailor who has washed up on the shore. With his final breath, the sailor tells them a tale of a hidden treasure and hands over the map he had held on to through his trials. And so, the two would-be heroes are off for adventure. But the road to riches is paved with hardships: their travels lead from stowing away on a ship to the sultan''s dungeons -- only to escape with the sultan''s daughter in tow!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRgvM4KTkgiJVkerVMZc6bCwGA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85399'),
  ('628136550852493071', 'Arabian Nights: Volume 1, The Restless One', 2015, 'Drama', 'Miguel Gomes, Mário Castanheira, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Miguel Gomes, Telmo Churro, Mariana Ricardo', 'Crista Alfaiate, Miguel Gomes, Carloto Cotta, Adriano Luz, Rogério Samora, Maria Rueff, Diogo Dória, Bruno Bravo', null, 'Every night, in danger of being beheaded, Scheherazade tells King Shahryar unfinished tales to continue them the following night, hence defying his promise of murdering his new wives after their wedding night. Scheherazade tells King Shahryar her stories but these are not those in the book. As in the book, these stories are tragic and comical, with rich and poor, powerless and powerful people, filled with surprising and extraordinary events.', 'Every night, in danger of being beheaded, Scheherazade tells King Shahryar unfinished tales to continue them the following night, hence defying his promise of murdering his new wives after their wedding night. Scheherazade tells King Shahryar her stories but these are not those in the book. As in the book, these stories are tragic and comical, with rich and poor, powerless and powerful people, filled with surprising and extraordinary events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB2Gbsv0tkdxDAK9XEdNcnoLOyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254736'),
  ('23408172183070718', 'Arabian Nights: Volume 2, The Desolate One', 2015, 'Drama', 'Miguel Gomes, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Miguel Gomes, Telmo Churro, Mariana Ricardo', 'Crista Alfaiate, Chico Chapas, Luísa Cruz, Pedro Caldas, Gonçalo Waddington, Margarida Carpinteiro, Carla Maciel, Gracinda Nave', null, 'Scheherazade narrates three more tales, supposedly selected from the 470th, 484th and 497th nights of her ordeal: “It hath reached me, O auspicious King, that a Judge will cry instead of giving out her sentence. A runaway murderer will wander through the land for over forty days and will teletransport himself to escape the Guard while dreaming of prostitutes and partridges. A wounded cow will reminisce about a thousand-year-old olive tree while saying what she must say, which will sound none less than sad!', 'Scheherazade narrates three more tales, supposedly selected from the 470th, 484th and 497th nights of her ordeal: “It hath reached me, O auspicious King, that a Judge will cry instead of giving out her sentence. A runaway murderer will wander through the land for over forty days and will teletransport himself to escape the Guard while dreaming of prostitutes and partridges. A wounded cow will reminisce about a thousand-year-old olive tree while saying what she must say, which will sound none less than sad!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/W04y81NoA9RkbEMDgIkXjNtG6d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342179'),
  ('725311257102397304', 'Arabian Nights: Volume 3, The Enchanted One', 2015, 'Drama', 'Miguel Gomes, Sayombhu Mukdeeprom', 'Miguel Gomes, Telmo Churro, Mariana Ricardo', 'Crista Alfaiate, Bernardo Alves, Carloto Cotta, Américo Silva, Louison Tresallet, Gonçalo Waddington, Chico Chapas', null, 'In which Scheherazade doubts that she will still be able to tell stories to please the King, given that what she has to tell weighs three thousand tonnes. She therefore escapes from the palace and travels the Kingdom in search of pleasure and enchantment. Her father, the Grand-Vizier, arranges to meet her at the Ferris wheel, and Scheherazade resumes her narration: “Auspicious King, in old shanty towns of Lisbon there was a community of bewitched men who, in all rigour and passion, dedicated themselves to teaching birds to sing…”. And seeing the morning break, Scheherazade fell silent.', 'In which Scheherazade doubts that she will still be able to tell stories to please the King, given that what she has to tell weighs three thousand tonnes. She therefore escapes from the palace and travels the Kingdom in search of pleasure and enchantment. Her father, the Grand-Vizier, arranges to meet her at the Ferris wheel, and Scheherazade resumes her narration: “Auspicious King, in old shanty towns of Lisbon there was a community of bewitched men who, in all rigour and passion, dedicated themselves to teaching birds to sing…”. And seeing the morning break, Scheherazade fell silent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF4o6hlk7i6WGUfnFbgLxFQeykj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342183'),
  ('134084947674542711', 'Arabic Numeral Series 12', 1981, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This is the twelfth film in the twenty-part Arabics series. Brakhage creates blurry visual fields that are profoundly without ground, worlds of unidentifiable, ever-shifting shapes, and oceans of light and darkness.', 'This is the twelfth film in the twenty-part Arabics series. Brakhage creates blurry visual fields that are profoundly without ground, worlds of unidentifiable, ever-shifting shapes, and oceans of light and darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A127TZk3lycVXnGdNLg2YUO3acT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322775'),
  ('771185807964905675', 'Araby', 2018, 'Drama', 'Affonso Uchôa, João Dumans, Leonardo Feliciano', 'João Dumans, Affonso Uchôa', 'Aristides de Sousa, Murilo Caliari, Gláucia Vandeveld, Renata Cabral, Adriano Araújo, Wederson Neguinho, Renato Novaes, Renan Rovida', null, 'André, a teenager, lives in an industrial town in Brazil near an old aluminum factory. One day, a factory worker, Cristiano, suffers an accident. Asked to go to Cristiano’s house to pick up clothes and documents, André stumbles on a notebook, and it’s here that Araby begins — or, rather, transforms. As André reads from the journal entries, we are plunged into Cristiano’s life, into stories of his wanderings, adventures, and loves.', 'André, a teenager, lives in an industrial town in Brazil near an old aluminum factory. One day, a factory worker, Cristiano, suffers an accident. Asked to go to Cristiano’s house to pick up clothes and documents, André stumbles on a notebook, and it’s here that Araby begins — or, rather, transforms. As André reads from the journal entries, we are plunged into Cristiano’s life, into stories of his wanderings, adventures, and loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR06tuy0hGZCOQpZ7cZO3AwHVYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434370'),
  ('10931855990943924', 'Arachnado', 2026, 'Horror', 'Dustin Ferguson', 'Dustin Ferguson', 'Brinke Stevens, Shawn C. Phillips, Julie Anne Prescott, Mike Ferguson, Mel Novak', null, 'A freak cyclone slams into Los Angeles and dumps millions of deadly spiders onto the city. Soon the streets are crawling with fangs and webs as panicked survivors fight for their lives. Cars crash, bodies pile up, and the City of Angels becomes a giant feeding ground in this outrageous creature-feature shocker.', 'A freak cyclone slams into Los Angeles and dumps millions of deadly spiders onto the city. Soon the streets are crawling with fangs and webs as panicked survivors fight for their lives. Cars crash, bodies pile up, and the City of Angels becomes a giant feeding ground in this outrageous creature-feature shocker.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fe%2Fgracenote%2Fe8c09ff64e6160b6e4df0cb38599b53b.jpg', 'plex:movie:arachnado'),
  ('921417119145028225', 'Arachnia', 2003, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brett Piper, Cheryl Friberg, Chuck Harding', 'Brett Piper', 'Rob Monkiewicz, Irene Joseph, David Bunce, Bevin McGraw, Alexxus Young, James Aspden, Dan Merriman, Fred La Torella', null, 'When a small research plane carrying a group of science students and their professor crash-lands in the middle of nowhere, the survivors go to a nearby farmhouse to look for help but soon find themselves besieged by giant mutant spiders.', 'When a small research plane carrying a group of science students and their professor crash-lands in the middle of nowhere, the survivors go to a nearby farmhouse to look for help but soon find themselves besieged by giant mutant spiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFpb14mgFyVWYYafSASonnELou5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128866'),
  ('133507330795714024', 'Arachnid', 2001, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jack Sholder, Carlos González, Manuel L. Cañizares', 'Mark Sevi', 'Chris Potter, Alex Reid, José Sancho, Neus Asensi, Ravil Isyanov, Luis Lorenzo Crespo, Rocqueford Allen, Jesús Cabrero', null, 'Mercer''s brother, an amateur pilot, crashes on an island and is killed by a giant spider. A year later, when Mercer goes in search of him, she discovers a breed of poisonous arachnids ready to attack.', 'Mercer''s brother, an amateur pilot, crashes on an island and is killed by a giant spider. A year later, when Mercer goes in search of him, she discovers a breed of poisonous arachnids ready to attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvBZADXO4mJIAn5mlurR3cYGmH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12587'),
  ('686669709316432715', 'Arachnophobia', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Frank Marshall, Mikael Salomon, Bruce Cohen', 'Don Jakoby, Wesley Strick', 'Jeff Daniels, Harley Jane Kozak, John Goodman, Julian Sands, Brian McNamara, Stuart Pankin, Henry Jones, Peter Jason', 'PG-13', 'A large spider from the jungles of South America is accidentally transported in a crate with a dead body to America where it mates with a local spider. Soon after, the residents of a small California town disappear as the result of spider bites from the deadly spider offspring. It''s up to a couple of doctors with the help of an insect exterminator to annihilate these eight legged freaks.', 'A large spider from the jungles of South America is accidentally transported in a crate with a dead body to America where it mates with a local spider. Soon after, the residents of a small California town disappear as the result of spider bites from the deadly spider offspring. It''s up to a couple of doctors with the help of an insect exterminator to annihilate these eight legged freaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHjpwv1Yv2RcGcTQb4Lc1cKw1y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6488'),
  ('822058629443373416', 'Arachnoquake', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Griff Furst, Lorenzo Senatore, John Michael Sudol', 'Paul A. Birkett', 'Edward Furlong, Bug Hall, Olivia Hardt, Gralen Bryant Banks, Tracey Gold, Tiara Ashleigh, Megan Adelle, Ethan Phillips', 'PG', 'Giant albino spiders break free from the depths of Earth in New Orleans, making everyone’s worst nightmare a reality.', 'Giant albino spiders break free from the depths of Earth in New Orleans, making everyone’s worst nightmare a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPytCHvtnFNho8qMrcwo5RqUh0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116463'),
  ('386178099428647914', 'Arada', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Mu Tunç', 'Mu Tunç, Sam Pink', 'Burak Deniz, Büşra Develi, Eriş Akman, Deniz Celiloğlu, Selim Bayraktar, Ceren Moray, Seda Akman, Cem Baseskioglu', null, 'A young punk rocker in Istanbul tracks down a cruise ticket to California on the night of his birthday gig. Based on the director''s personal family story. Film sets during the 90''s unrest Turkey.', 'A young punk rocker in Istanbul tracks down a cruise ticket to California on the night of his birthday gig. Based on the director''s personal family story. Film sets during the 90''s unrest Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3j2fgJX0Dh093YvwrRlaHu8rvcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503976'),
  ('1123506486751680426', 'Aradhana', 1969, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shakti Samanta, Aloke Dasgupta', 'Sachin Bhowmick', 'Sharmila Tagore, Rajesh Khanna, Sujit Kumar, Pahadi Sanyal, Anita Dutt, Madan Puri, Asit Sen, Farida Jalal', null, 'Vandana''s husband, Arun, gets killed in an air crash after they secretly get married but no one accepts their marriage. Thereafter, she is forced to put her child up for adoption and later work as his nanny to stay by his side.', 'Vandana''s husband, Arun, gets killed in an air crash after they secretly get married but no one accepts their marriage. Thereafter, she is forced to put her child up for adoption and later work as his nanny to stay by his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpAYC3kWt9VpDDY2a3jWt4sF3wc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96732'),
  ('877352621293720544', 'Araf 2', 2019, 'Horror', 'Biray Dalkıran', 'Biray Dalkıran', 'Emre Kızılırmak, Cevahir Turan, Recep Aktuğ, Sahin Sekman, Reyhan İlhan, Burak Sarımola', 'R', 'Sequel to the 2006 film Araf tells the story of Kübra and Ahmet, who love each other deeply and have a happy marriage. Their lives turn into a nightmare due to events they cannot comprehend. While the doctor diagnoses Kübra with epilepsy, the imam of the neighborhood claims that Kübra is possessed by a jinn after learning about her experiences. Ahmet tries to find a logical explanation for what is happening, but he is at a loss for words in the face of a series of terrible events. First, Kübra''s grandmother dies, then they find an amulet that cannot be destroyed in a locked cabinet. Kübra''s condition, meanwhile, grows worse by the day. The jinn tormenting her is the ruler of the Cühenna Tribe, the most ruthless of all jinn tribes.', 'Sequel to the 2006 film Araf tells the story of Kübra and Ahmet, who love each other deeply and have a happy marriage. Their lives turn into a nightmare due to events they cannot comprehend. While the doctor diagnoses Kübra with epilepsy, the imam of the neighborhood claims that Kübra is possessed by a jinn after learning about her experiences. Ahmet tries to find a logical explanation for what is happening, but he is at a loss for words in the face of a series of terrible events. First, Kübra''s grandmother dies, then they find an amulet that cannot be destroyed in a locked cabinet. Kübra''s condition, meanwhile, grows worse by the day. The jinn tormenting her is the ruler of the Cühenna Tribe, the most ruthless of all jinn tribes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zecgRjwCdzGplZHxgTcTdztZOiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531618'),
  ('431173510893553800', 'Araf/Somewhere in Between', 2012, 'Drama', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu', 'Neslihan Atagül, Özcan Deniz, Barış Hacıhan, Nihal Yalçın, Ilgaz Kocatürk, Can Basak, Yasemin Baştan, Erol Babaoğlu', null, 'Araf is the story of Zehra and Olgun whose lives are caught in a vacuum. The world in which they live and work is a place of throwaway culture and constant change. They too are waiting for a chance to change and escape from their empty, monotonous lives.', 'Araf is the story of Zehra and Olgun whose lives are caught in a vacuum. The world in which they live and work is a place of throwaway culture and constant change. They too are waiting for a chance to change and escape from their empty, monotonous lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVH1mQ1hl2quBO13dGXJRsUWsyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129119'),
  ('622701959683483440', 'Aragami', 2003, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Takumi Furuya', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Ryuichi Takatsu, Shoichiro Masumoto', 'Takao Osawa, Masaya Katō, Kanae Uotani, Tak Sakaguchi, Hideo Sakaki', null, 'Two seriously wounded samurai find refuge from a storm at an isolated temple, the home of a swordsman and a mysterious young woman. One samurai awakes to find that not only has his comrade died, but that his wounds have miraculously healed. He discovers that he has been given the power of immortality by the swordsman, a man once known as the legendary Miyamoto Musashi, who now lives an endless existence as Aragami, a "god of battle".', 'Two seriously wounded samurai find refuge from a storm at an isolated temple, the home of a swordsman and a mysterious young woman. One samurai awakes to find that not only has his comrade died, but that his wounds have miraculously healed. He discovers that he has been given the power of immortality by the swordsman, a man once known as the legendary Miyamoto Musashi, who now lives an endless existence as Aragami, a "god of battle".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSCNj4TSAnCp0XcCRJRN1x5dNdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5845'),
  ('997461500479398019', 'Aragne: Sign of Vermillion', 2018, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Saku Sakamoto', 'Saku Sakamoto', 'Kana Hanazawa, Ayana Shiramoto, Fukujuro Katayama, Shogo Batori, Yosuke Ito, Yukari Fukui', null, 'A young woman in a decaying apartment complex finds herself seeing worms and moths everywhere, bursting out of beetles, animals, and people, and sets out to find how this is related to a rash of murders across the city.', 'A young woman in a decaying apartment complex finds herself seeing worms and moths everywhere, bursting out of beetles, animals, and people, and sets out to find how this is related to a rash of murders across the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAWl5QVqb1DRXgUib3idhpT4tzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536108'),
  ('865414014130562051', 'Arahan', 2004, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Lee Jun-gyu, Park Yong-jib', 'Yoo Sun-dong, Ryoo Seung-wan, Eun Ji-hie', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Yoon So-Yi, Ahn Sung-ki, Jung Doo-hong, Yun Ju-sang, An Kil-kang, Baek Chan-Ki, Lee Won', null, 'Sang-hwan became a cop in order to help the downtrodden, but he doesn''t get much respect. All that changes when he meets the Seven Masters.', 'Sang-hwan became a cop in order to help the downtrodden, but he doesn''t get much respect. All that changes when he meets the Seven Masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98c0nyZOLW9xdGJwvkzWQMiAgBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13970'),
  ('54857870123729931', 'Arance & martello', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Diego Bianchi, Dora Dalla Chiesa, Roberto Forza', 'Diego Bianchi', 'Diego Bianchi, Francesco Acquaroli, Antonella Attili, Luciano Miele, Emanuel Bevilacqua, Francesca Antonelli, Margherita Vicario, Lorenzo Gioielli', null, 'A ''period'' piece set in the hot summer of 2011, in the midst of the Berlusconi era. The life of a quiet corner market is shaken when the mayor decides to close it down. The only political organization people can turn to is the local section of the Democratic Party, which is separated from the market by a concrete wall, built to allow the construction of the subway.', 'A ''period'' piece set in the hot summer of 2011, in the midst of the Berlusconi era. The life of a quiet corner market is shaken when the mayor decides to close it down. The only political organization people can turn to is the local section of the Democratic Party, which is separated from the market by a concrete wall, built to allow the construction of the subway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ElMg0tlQVDvW72H84vLw0f9Wi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290843'),
  ('170045992109931072', 'Arang', 2006, 'Horror', 'Ahn Sang-hoon', 'Lee Jeong-sub, Sun-Joo Jung, Ahn Sang-hoon', 'Song Yun-ah, Lee Dong-wook, Lee Jong-soo, Kim Hae-in, Choo So-yeong, Jung Won-joong, Kim Ok-bin, Ju Sang-uk', null, 'A salt storehouse near the sea may be haunted. A penniless ex-con dies a gristly death in a house he can ill afford. The detectives assigned the case are Min, newly reinstated after a suspension, and Lee, a new transfer from forensics. Min has nightmares: a sexual assault that haunts her. She and Lee work well together, but soon two more deaths occur - each mysteriously poisoned, both friends of the ex-con. A fourth friend, a newly married doctor, is a suspect. But what has all this to do with the salt storehouse, a death ten years ago, and a missing girl? Can Min and Lee get to the bottom of it, or is the supernatural beyond a cop''s reach?', 'A salt storehouse near the sea may be haunted. A penniless ex-con dies a gristly death in a house he can ill afford. The detectives assigned the case are Min, newly reinstated after a suspension, and Lee, a new transfer from forensics. Min has nightmares: a sexual assault that haunts her. She and Lee work well together, but soon two more deaths occur - each mysteriously poisoned, both friends of the ex-con. A fourth friend, a newly married doctor, is a suspect. But what has all this to do with the salt storehouse, a death ten years ago, and a missing girl? Can Min and Lee get to the bottom of it, or is the supernatural beyond a cop''s reach?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osSqqnw0LOWxhdCLkFt1klKG4rG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33794'),
  ('70405235416980663', 'Ararat', 2002, 'Drama, War, History', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Simon Abkarian, Charles Aznavour, Christopher Plummer, Arsinée Khanjian, David Alpay, Marie-Josée Croze, Elias Koteas, Brent Carver', null, 'Interrogated by a customs officer, a young man recounts how his life was changed during the making of a film about the Armenian genocide.', 'Interrogated by a customs officer, a young man recounts how his life was changed during the making of a film about the Armenian genocide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQkn715VQYLIs2nddAUf19Bz5Wj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16351'),
  ('724619775969560026', 'Araya', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Margot Benacerraf , Giuseppe Nisoli', 'Pierre Seghers, Margot Benacerraf', 'José Ignacio Cabrujas, Laurent Terzieff', null, '"Araya" is an old natural salt mine located in a peninsula in northeastern Venezuela which was still, by 1959, being exploited manually five hundred years after its discovery by the Spanish. In images, the life of the "salineros" and their archaic methods of work before their definite disappearance with the arrival of the industrial exploitation.', '"Araya" is an old natural salt mine located in a peninsula in northeastern Venezuela which was still, by 1959, being exploited manually five hundred years after its discovery by the Spanish. In images, the life of the "salineros" and their archaic methods of work before their definite disappearance with the arrival of the industrial exploitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npsnMBOI43PKlulTjRoTQ77DxYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89688'),
  ('320806615333018576', 'Arbitrage', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicholas Jarecki, Yorick Le Saux, Dan-ah Kim', 'Nicholas Jarecki', 'Richard Gere, Susan Sarandon, Tim Roth, Brit Marling, Laetitia Casta, Nate Parker, Stuart Margolin, Chris Eigeman', 'R', 'A troubled hedge fund magnate, desperate to complete the sale of his trading empire, makes an error that forces him to turn to an unlikely person for help.', 'A troubled hedge fund magnate, desperate to complete the sale of his trading empire, makes an error that forces him to turn to an unlikely person for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoDLTfEmwDcnl5GX0VZb3trekYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60599'),
  ('323029982595507220', 'Arbor Demon', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Rea', 'Michelle Davidson, Patrick Rea', 'Fiona Dourif, Jake Busey, Rob Bouton, Michelle Mills, Bruce Williamson, Kevin Ryan', null, 'An adventurous woman with a secret from her husband insists they go for a romantic camping trip in a remote wood to reconnect and share some quality time. But their idyll is shockingly cut short after a group of nearby hunters are brutally killed by a mysterious creature. Trapped inside their tent, the couple is forced to help one of the injured hunters and together they plan their escape. Is there really something supernatural hidden in the forest? Or is it just their imaginations running riot. Soon they must determine if the real threat is inside or outside their enclosure', 'An adventurous woman with a secret from her husband insists they go for a romantic camping trip in a remote wood to reconnect and share some quality time. But their idyll is shockingly cut short after a group of nearby hunters are brutally killed by a mysterious creature. Trapped inside their tent, the couple is forced to help one of the injured hunters and together they plan their escape. Is there really something supernatural hidden in the forest? Or is it just their imaginations running riot. Soon they must determine if the real threat is inside or outside their enclosure', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mJea8gSFBwTSdrKxDkzEsgCD0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405551'),
  ('969918260085937613', 'Arcade', 1993, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Thompson O''Sullivan', 'David S. Goyer', 'Megan Ward, Peter Billingsley, John de Lancie, Seth Green, Sharon Farrell, A. J. Langer, Bryan Dattilo, Brandon Rane', null, 'Alex Manning and her friends decide to visit the local video arcade known as "Dante''s Inferno" where a new virtual reality arcade game called "Arcade" is being test marketed by a computer company CEO. However, it soon becomes clear that the teenagers who lose are being imprisoned inside the virtual reality world by the central villain "Arcade" and takes over their minds.', 'Alex Manning and her friends decide to visit the local video arcade known as "Dante''s Inferno" where a new virtual reality arcade game called "Arcade" is being test marketed by a computer company CEO. However, it soon becomes clear that the teenagers who lose are being imprisoned inside the virtual reality world by the central villain "Arcade" and takes over their minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZC9OZMyrZ4uAIfEOlGIh9e8xkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28790'),
  ('1121234904424294569', 'Arcadian', 2024, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Frank Mobilio, Benjamin Brewer, Enda Doherty', 'Michael Nilon', 'Nicolas Cage, Jaeden Martell, Maxwell Jenkins, Sadie Soverall, Samantha Coughlan, Joel Gillman, Joe Dixon, Daire McMahon', 'R', 'In the near future, on a decimated Earth, Paul and his twin sons face terror at night when ferocious creatures awaken. When Paul is nearly killed, the boys come up with a plan for survival, using everything their father taught them to keep him alive.', 'In the near future, on a decimated Earth, Paul and his twin sons face terror at night when ferocious creatures awaken. When Paul is nearly killed, the boys come up with a plan for survival, using everything their father taught them to keep him alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4T8Xeydkw53h9uIbulYsss25UF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051896'),
  ('513613866638759197', 'Arcana', 1972, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Giulio Questi, Dario Di Palma', 'Franco Arcalli, Giulio Questi', 'Lucia Bosè, Maurizio Degli Esposti, Tina Aumont, Renato Paracchi, Gianfranco Pozzi, Giovanni Ricci, Dario Viganò, Annarella De Faveri', null, 'A Sicilian widow earns her living as a clairvoyant, in Milan, but she hasn''t got any power at all. Her son instead holds supernatural powers and with the help of his mother he becomes a strong sorcerer. But he fails perhaps to understand the real strength he possesses inside and unbinds uncontrolled forces that lead people that surround him to go mad.', 'A Sicilian widow earns her living as a clairvoyant, in Milan, but she hasn''t got any power at all. Her son instead holds supernatural powers and with the help of his mother he becomes a strong sorcerer. But he fails perhaps to understand the real strength he possesses inside and unbinds uncontrolled forces that lead people that surround him to go mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkd1iV0PddE8MG6bjYovx4uN8sR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143451'),
  ('627760344367839509', 'Arcane Sorcerer', 1996, 'Horror', 'Cesare Bastelli, Pupi Avati', 'Pupi Avati', 'Carlo Cecchi, Stefano Dionisi, Arnaldo Ninchi, Andrea Scorzoni, Consuelo Ferrara, Vittorio Duse, Mario Erpichini, Patrizia Sacchi', null, 'Shunned by his church, a seminary student takes refuge with an excommunicated priest who teaches him wizardry and black magic.', 'Shunned by his church, a seminary student takes refuge with an excommunicated priest who teaches him wizardry and black magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwGWcOOll4Zt64iPFtIdcjXwws9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59857'),
  ('79349462002099929', 'Arch of Triumph', 1948, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Milestone, Russell Metty', 'Lewis Milestone, Harry Brown', 'Ingrid Bergman, Charles Boyer, Charles Laughton, Louis Calhern, Ruth Warrick, Roman Bohnen, J. Edward Bromberg, Ruth Nelson', 'NR', 'In the winter of 1938, Paris is crowded with refugees from the Nazis, who live in the black shadows of night, trying to evade deportation. One such is Dr. Ravic, who practices medicine illegally and stalks his old Nazi enemy Haake with murder in mind. One rainy night, Ravic meets Joan Madou, a kept woman cast adrift by her lover''s sudden death. Against Ravic''s better judgment, they become involved in a doomed affair.', 'In the winter of 1938, Paris is crowded with refugees from the Nazis, who live in the black shadows of night, trying to evade deportation. One such is Dr. Ravic, who practices medicine illegally and stalks his old Nazi enemy Haake with murder in mind. One rainy night, Ravic meets Joan Madou, a kept woman cast adrift by her lover''s sudden death. Against Ravic''s better judgment, they become involved in a doomed affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKzNR6ZHexdUgwfaxgkqlYnAwwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40985'),
  ('15063830266923175', 'Arch of Triumph', 1984, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Waris Hussein, Bob Edwards', null, 'Anthony Hopkins, Lesley-Anne Down, Donald Pleasence, Frank Finlay, Richard Pasco, Joyce Blair, Alexander Davion, Martin Benson', null, 'A 1985 British made-for-television film based on the novel by Erich Maria Remarque, which was previously adapted in 1948 for a film of the same name with Ingrid Bergman and Charles Boyer. Dr. Ravic (Anthony Hopkins) is an Austrian doctor who helps Jews escape from the Nazis. In 1939, he meets Joan Madou (Lesley-Anne Down), a woman he saves from suicide, and their relationship flourishes until he is arrested as a refugee without documentation and realizes he has some unfinished business with the Nazis. After a prolonged separation, without explanation, the two are finally reunited and struggle to put their relationship back on the right course as mayhem breaks out all around them.', 'A 1985 British made-for-television film based on the novel by Erich Maria Remarque, which was previously adapted in 1948 for a film of the same name with Ingrid Bergman and Charles Boyer. Dr. Ravic (Anthony Hopkins) is an Austrian doctor who helps Jews escape from the Nazis. In 1939, he meets Joan Madou (Lesley-Anne Down), a woman he saves from suicide, and their relationship flourishes until he is arrested as a refugee without documentation and realizes he has some unfinished business with the Nazis. After a prolonged separation, without explanation, the two are finally reunited and struggle to put their relationship back on the right course as mayhem breaks out all around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snnAtB6AFxQuUwfF7Uem77mxJyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125745'),
  ('665439221104701988', 'Archangel', 1990, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Guy Maddin, Deanne Rohde', 'Guy Maddin, George Toles', 'Michael Gottli, David Falkenburg, Michael O''Sullivan, Margaret Anne MacLeod, Ari Cohen, Sarah Neville, Kathy Marykuca, Kyle McCulloch', 'PG-13', 'At the height of the October Revolution during the 1919 allied intervention in Arkhangelsk, the exploits of one-legged Canadian soldier Lt. John Boles are told, after he is taken in from the cold by a dysfunctional Russian family and mistakes a local woman for his presumed dead lover.', 'At the height of the October Revolution during the 1919 allied intervention in Arkhangelsk, the exploits of one-legged Canadian soldier Lt. John Boles are told, after he is taken in from the cold by a dysfunctional Russian family and mistakes a local woman for his presumed dead lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKUfdvPjIYL3QyqVtd54p5qwdoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85559'),
  ('272894465179145940', 'Archenemy', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Halyna Hutchins, Adam Egypt Mortimer, Borjan Jovanovich', 'Adam Egypt Mortimer', 'Joe Manganiello, Skylan Brooks, Zolee Griggs, Paul Scheer, Amy Seimetz, Glenn Howerton, Mac Brandt, Kieran Gallagher', 'R', 'Max Fist claims he’s a hero from another dimension who has somehow landed on Earth and been stripped of his powers. Instead of treating him like a powerful champion, no one believes Max’s claims — except for a teenager named Hamster and his sister Indigo. The siblings convince Max to help them take out a local drug gang, where Max’s abilities are put to a violent and harrowing test.', 'Max Fist claims he’s a hero from another dimension who has somehow landed on Earth and been stripped of his powers. Instead of treating him like a powerful champion, no one believes Max’s claims — except for a teenager named Hamster and his sister Indigo. The siblings convince Max to help them take out a local drug gang, where Max’s abilities are put to a violent and harrowing test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4H54bQrCM6NBm9sqw911scGd4hb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727097'),
  ('918559101595439942', 'Archie: To Riverdale and Back Again', 1990, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Dick Lowry, Frank Byers', 'Evan Katz', 'Christopher Rich, Lauren Holly, Karen Kopins, Sam Whipple, Gary Kroeger, Matt McCoy, Mike Nussbaum, Billy Corben', null, 'The classic comic characters return, partaking in their Riverdale High 15th anniversary reunion! But when Pop''s Chock''lit Shoppe is under the danger of being closed down for good, Archie, along with his pals n'' gals, find a way to help out their friend and keep the youth of Riverdale intact with a good burger and milkshake!', 'The classic comic characters return, partaking in their Riverdale High 15th anniversary reunion! But when Pop''s Chock''lit Shoppe is under the danger of being closed down for good, Archie, along with his pals n'' gals, find a way to help out their friend and keep the youth of Riverdale intact with a good burger and milkshake!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wURFPiFdRiGrNrc29iaAlauPffZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52304'),
