  ('361024688612118168', 'Architecture 101', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Yong-ju, Park Se-moon, Cho Sang-yun', 'Lee Yong-ju', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Han Ga-in, Lee Je-hoon, Suzy, Cho Jung-seok, Yoo Yeon-seok, Kim Eui-sung, Cho Hyun-chul', null, 'When Seung-min was on his first year at the Academy of Architecture, he met Seo-yeon. She was a musician student, and Seung-min totally fell in love with her. Years have passed, and now he meets Seo-yeon again - she asks him to rebuild her father''s old house.', 'When Seung-min was on his first year at the Academy of Architecture, he met Seo-yeon. She was a musician student, and Seung-min totally fell in love with her. Years have passed, and now he meets Seo-yeon again - she asks him to rebuild her father''s old house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/349EO3Wrvc2d9F58nyTR1Y1hl6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107235'),
