  ('195992406012974468', 'Arco', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Ugo Bienvenu, Anaëlle Saba, Adam Sillard', 'Ugo Bienvenu, Félix de Givry', 'Margot Ringard Oldra, Oscar Tresanini, Nathanaël Perrot, Alma Jodorowsky, Swann Arlaud, Vincent Macaigne, Louis Garrel, William Lebghil', 'PG', '10-year-old Arco lives in a far future. During his first flight in his rainbow suit, he loses control and falls into the past. Iris, a girl his age from 2075, comes to his rescue and tries by all means to help send him back to his era.', '10-year-old Arco lives in a far future. During his first flight in his rainbow suit, he loses control and falls into the past. Iris, a girl his age from 2075, comes to his rescue and tries by all means to help send him back to his era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWlvHFxTDhq9O5WSOHywa32QIez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804370'),
  ('333358768316200530', 'Arctic', 2018, 'Drama, Adventure', 'William Thomas Möller, Joe Penna, Phoenix Woung-Bi Lee', 'Ryan Morrison, Joe Penna', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Maria Thelma Smáradóttir, Tintrinai Thikhasuk', 'PG-13', 'A man stranded in the Arctic is finally about to receive his long awaited rescue. However, after a tragic accident, his opportunity is lost and he must then decide whether to remain in the relative safety of his camp or embark on a deadly trek through the unknown for potential salvation.', 'A man stranded in the Arctic is finally about to receive his long awaited rescue. However, after a tragic accident, his opportunity is lost and he must then decide whether to remain in the relative safety of his camp or embark on a deadly trek through the unknown for potential salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxRc0Y4IjSRLC2fYaguXQtJCI4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453755'),
  ('886680039105706027', 'Arctic Antics', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'A collection of arctic animals (seals, walruses, polar bears, penguins) float by on ice floes and on shore, performing various musical numbers.', 'A collection of arctic animals (seals, walruses, polar bears, penguins) float by on ice floes and on shore, performing various musical numbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgeaK3QLVFiUy6yccp9KtwbCHri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51781'),
