  ('490583846941895166', 'Arctic Blast', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith', 'Jason Bourque', 'Michael Shanks, Alexandra Davies, Saskia Hampele, Bruce Davison, Indiana Evans, Robert Mammone, Judith Baribeau, Nick Falk', null, 'When a solar eclipse sends a colossal blast of super chilled air towards the earth, it then sets off a catastrophic chain of events that threatens to engulf the world in ice and begin a new Ice Age.', 'When a solar eclipse sends a colossal blast of super chilled air towards the earth, it then sets off a catastrophic chain of events that threatens to engulf the world in ice and begin a new Ice Age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54JrDQq3ISxwTAHz0yfbFNhBC7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45556'),
