  ('920997532261068688', 'Are We in Love?', 2020, 'Romance, Fantasy', 'Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Kim So-eun, Sung Hoon, Kim Sun-ung, Kim So-hye, Pan Do, Alex Chu, Jeon Mi-seon, Hong Sung Sook', null, 'A young woman with a miserable life receives a magical book that gives her the power to make every man she encounters fall for her.', 'A young woman with a miserable life receives a magical book that gives her the power to make every man she encounters fall for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVYhcpZaWJgTuClx5f3wCTH1t5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672955'),
