  ('230649197611226492', 'Are We Men or Corporals?', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Riccardo Pallottini, Aldo Tonti', 'Vittorio Metz, Totò, Camillo Mastrocinque', 'Totò, Paolo Stoppa, Fiorella Mari, Agnese Dubbini, Franca Faldini, Rosita Pisano, Mara Werlen, Vincent Barbi', null, 'These are the years of the Second World War, and Toto is imprisoned in a concentration camp, suffering the harassment of Colonel Hammler, a Nazi cruel and despotic.', 'These are the years of the Second World War, and Toto is imprisoned in a concentration camp, suffering the harassment of Colonel Hammler, a Nazi cruel and despotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbIuZa9dlO6P1oA4KHQCKYyqm8n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74005'),
  ('181241867301197578', 'Are We Ok?', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Deniz Celiloğlu, Aras Bulut Iynemli, Sumru Yavrucuk, Zuhal Gencer, Aslı Enver, Gürkan Uygun, Uğur Güneş', null, 'Temmuz is an openly gay sculptor living at a flat with his dog in Istanbul. He lives a bohemian lifestyle and has a happy go lucky, carefree, eccentric (such as believing in good luck charms) character, frequently distracting him from his work as a children''s book illustrator, and eventually leading him to be abandoned by his boyfriend via e-mail. He is given solace and affection by her wealthy mother, who is fully supportive of him, and best friend and co-worker, Beste. In the meantime, he keeps seeing a young man in his dreams, who repeatedly calls him for help and rescue. One day he runs into this guy while getting on the bus, who is accompanied by his mother, and helps them get into their home as the young man was born without limbs. From then on, two lives would collide into each other, starting a brotherhood full of discoveries and mutual help.', 'Temmuz is an openly gay sculptor living at a flat with his dog in Istanbul. He lives a bohemian lifestyle and has a happy go lucky, carefree, eccentric (such as believing in good luck charms) character, frequently distracting him from his work as a children''s book illustrator, and eventually leading him to be abandoned by his boyfriend via e-mail. He is given solace and affection by her wealthy mother, who is fully supportive of him, and best friend and co-worker, Beste. In the meantime, he keeps seeing a young man in his dreams, who repeatedly calls him for help and rescue. One day he runs into this guy while getting on the bus, who is accompanied by his mother, and helps them get into their home as the young man was born without limbs. From then on, two lives would collide into each other, starting a brotherhood full of discoveries and mutual help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEMltGaowYEbgVisstGsMwtcxlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255635'),
  ('715205779405425597', 'Are We There Yet?', 2005, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Brian Levant, Thomas E. Ackerman, Donald Sparks', 'Claudia Grazioso, David N. Weiss, J. David Stem', 'Ice Cube, Nia Long, Aleisha Allen, Philip Bolden, Jay Mohr, M.C. Gainey, Henry Simmons, Ray Galletti', 'PG', 'The fledgling romance between Nick, a playboy bachelor, and Suzanne, a divorced mother of two, is threatened by a particularly harrowing New Years Eve. When Suzanne''s work keeps her in Vancouver for the holiday, Nick offers to bring her kids to the city from Portland, Oregon. The kids, who have never liked any of the men their mom dates, are determined to turn the trip into a nightmare for Nick.', 'The fledgling romance between Nick, a playboy bachelor, and Suzanne, a divorced mother of two, is threatened by a particularly harrowing New Years Eve. When Suzanne''s work keeps her in Vancouver for the holiday, Nick offers to bring her kids to the city from Portland, Oregon. The kids, who have never liked any of the men their mom dates, are determined to turn the trip into a nightmare for Nick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guDkMD4wrZ1BGUO7DFFBVzaiGij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11637'),
  ('400091812585704916', 'Are You Being Served? The Movie', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Bob Kellett, Jack Atcheler, Weston Drury Jr.', 'Jeremy Lloyd, David Croft', 'John Inman, Mollie Sugden, Frank Thornton, Trevor Bannister, Wendy Richard, Arthur Brough, Nicholas Smith, Harold Bennett', null, 'In this feature film version of the popular BBC sitcom, the staff of Grace Brothers go on holiday to Costa Plonka, where they find themselves in the middle of a revolution.', 'In this feature film version of the popular BBC sitcom, the staff of Grace Brothers go on holiday to Costa Plonka, where they find themselves in the middle of a revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldtzjXaEkVXiY6w3hmmC2y3ZSjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20155'),
  ('761463840612445004', 'Are You Here', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Matthew Weiner, Christopher Manley, Donald Murphy', 'Matthew Weiner', 'Owen Wilson, Zach Galifianakis, Amy Poehler, Laura Ramsey, Lauren Lapkus, Jenna Fischer, Jason Davis, Joel Gretsch', 'R', 'When Steve Dallas, a womanizing local weatherman, hears that his off-the-grid best friend Ben Baker has lost his estranged father, the two return to Ben''s childhood home. Once there, they discover Ben has inherited the family fortune, and the ill-equipped duo must battle Ben''s formidable sister and deal with his father''s gorgeous 25-year old widow.', 'When Steve Dallas, a womanizing local weatherman, hears that his off-the-grid best friend Ben Baker has lost his estranged father, the two return to Ben''s childhood home. Once there, they discover Ben has inherited the family fortune, and the ill-equipped duo must battle Ben''s formidable sister and deal with his father''s gorgeous 25-year old widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v83MAkGH8jF8uNhJhKgADqw3Xup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209244'),
  ('1095630205605156579', 'Are You in the House Alone?', 1978, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Walter Grauman, Jack Swain', 'Judith Parker', 'Kathleen Beller, Blythe Danner, Tony Bill, Robin Mattson, Tricia O''Neil, Dennis Quaid, Alan Fudge, Scott Colomby', 'NR', 'An average high school girl''s life is turned upside down after she is attacked and savagely assaulted. When a mysterious person begins leaving her threatening messages and making unsettling phone calls, Gail realizes that the nightmare is only just beginning...', 'An average high school girl''s life is turned upside down after she is attacked and savagely assaulted. When a mysterious person begins leaving her threatening messages and making unsettling phone calls, Gail realizes that the nightmare is only just beginning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aozTeKh7GLi8ytEHiTSOEz3htIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55300'),
  ('598646528835335327', 'Are You Lonesome Tonight?', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Romance', 'Shipei Wen, Cedric Cheung-Lau, Andreas Thalhammer', 'Zhao Binghao, Wang Yinuo, Noé Dodson', 'Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Sylvia Chang, Wang Yanhui, Zhang Yu, Jiang Peiyao, Lu Xin, Chen Yongzhong, Deng Fei', null, 'On a dark night, Xueming hits a pedestrian with his car and flees the scene. Desperate to escape his feelings of guilt, he decides to approach the dead man''s wife, Mrs. Liang. He develops an ambiguous relationship with the widow, while a policeman tries to resolve the investigation that will change his life forever.', 'On a dark night, Xueming hits a pedestrian with his car and flees the scene. Desperate to escape his feelings of guilt, he decides to approach the dead man''s wife, Mrs. Liang. He develops an ambiguous relationship with the widow, while a policeman tries to resolve the investigation that will change his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZMP6MaoC50aX0NIe6a33fC4DNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824738'),
