  ('454308674253291110', 'Area Q.', 2012, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Gerson Sanginitto, Carina Sanginitto', 'Gerson Sanginitto, Julia Camara', 'Murilo Rosa, Isaiah Washington, Tania Khalill, Ronnie Gene Blevins, John Deignan, Steve Filice, Haroldo Serra, Hiramissa Serra', null, 'A year after the disappearance of his son, Thomas Mathews, an investigative journalist, still has no information and begins his own obsessive search. However, the obsession has him losing his house and job so his boss sends him on special assignment in Brazil. In Brazil, Mathews investigates close encounter sightings that have taken place in the small cities of Quixada and Quixeramobim-also known as Area Q. While there, he realizes he will face the biggest discovery of his life.', 'A year after the disappearance of his son, Thomas Mathews, an investigative journalist, still has no information and begins his own obsessive search. However, the obsession has him losing his house and job so his boss sends him on special assignment in Brazil. In Brazil, Mathews investigates close encounter sightings that have taken place in the small cities of Quixada and Quixeramobim-also known as Area Q. While there, he realizes he will face the biggest discovery of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sypXg8QbHNEild9vIYGqDvqePKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123945'),
  ('557801742767554065', 'Aren''t We Wonderful', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Richard Angst, Kurt Hoffmann', 'Heinz Pauck, Hugo Hartung, Günter Neumann', 'Hansjörg Felmy, Robert Graf, Johanna von Koczian, Wera Frydtberg, Ingrid Pan, Ingrid van Bergen, Jürgen Goslar, Tatjana Sais', null, 'Kurt Hoffmann′s satire concerning Germany′s development during the first half of the 20th century tells the story of two schoolmates - Hans and Bruno. They could not be more different. While Hans is ambitious and must always work hard for his career, it seems that the happy go lucky Bruno is carefree.', 'Kurt Hoffmann′s satire concerning Germany′s development during the first half of the 20th century tells the story of two schoolmates - Hans and Bruno. They could not be more different. While Hans is ambitious and must always work hard for his career, it seems that the happy go lucky Bruno is carefree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZZbEBsdWdDEbkvMckFSzTBphoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6905'),
  ('67035263869747315', 'Aren''t You Happy?', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ágnes Pákózdi, Susanne Heinrich', 'Susanne Heinrich', 'Marie Rathscheck, Nicolo Pasetti, Nicolai Borger, Yann Grouhel, Pero Radicic, Felix Mayr, Malte Bündgen, Dax Constantine', null, 'A girl roams through the city looking for a place to sleep. Along the way she meets young mothers who celebrate motherhood religiously, goes home with an abstinent existentialist for whom sex is “just another market”, and waits for the end of capitalism in a drag bar. Her attempt to write a book doesn’t make it beyond the first sentence of the second chapter, and she finds no space between art galleries, yoga studios and the beds of strangers. Instead of trying to fit in, she starts regarding her depression as a political issue.', 'A girl roams through the city looking for a place to sleep. Along the way she meets young mothers who celebrate motherhood religiously, goes home with an abstinent existentialist for whom sex is “just another market”, and waits for the end of capitalism in a drag bar. Her attempt to write a book doesn’t make it beyond the first sentence of the second chapter, and she finds no space between art galleries, yoga studios and the beds of strangers. Instead of trying to fit in, she starts regarding her depression as a political issue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm3NuEMA2ZkyDDtbpThI8sN7BoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523882'),
  ('907285249675560693', 'Arena', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Mac Ahlberg, Peter Manoogian', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Paul Satterfield, Hamilton Camp, Claudia Christian, Marc Alaimo, Shari Shattuck, Armin Shimerman, Brett Porter, Charles Tabansi', 'PG-13', 'On a distant space station far in the future, the best fighters from every planet vie for the championship in an intergalactic fighting competition. After over fifty years of no human contenders, Steve Armstrong emerges having trained all his life for a shot at the title, only to come up against a ruthless extra-terrestrial crime lord who wants him dead.', 'On a distant space station far in the future, the best fighters from every planet vie for the championship in an intergalactic fighting competition. After over fifty years of no human contenders, Steve Armstrong emerges having trained all his life for a shot at the title, only to come up against a ruthless extra-terrestrial crime lord who wants him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1T4k7EsxqLm1UgjUUiOZjqXWdIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44796'),
  ('361609829913656730', 'Arena', 2009, 'Drama', 'João Salaviza, Vasco Viana', 'João Salaviza', 'Carloto Cotta, Rodrigo Madeira, Rafael Sardo, Cláudio Rosa, André Feldman', null, 'A young man under house arrest spends his time in the best way he can by making some tattoos. His relative peace is strangely disturbed when he''s attacked and robbed by three kids from the neighborhood. From then on, he''ll try to find the kids who took his money and maybe give them a lesson. But with those actions, comes the reflection of how things were and are in this place filled with violence and hostility. Is change possible?', 'A young man under house arrest spends his time in the best way he can by making some tattoos. His relative peace is strangely disturbed when he''s attacked and robbed by three kids from the neighborhood. From then on, he''ll try to find the kids who took his money and maybe give them a lesson. But with those actions, comes the reflection of how things were and are in this place filled with violence and hostility. Is change possible?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkLKe16LkuzjJb3jcJd8oNrZ2ep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127059'),
  ('952102642004931532', 'Arena', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jonah Loop, Nelson Cragg, Chip Signore', 'Tony Giglio, Michael Hultquist, Robert Martinez', 'Kellan Lutz, Katia Winter, Johnny Messner, Samuel L. Jackson, James Remar, Daniel Dae Kim, Nina Dobrev, Marcelle Baer', 'R', 'David Lord finds himself forced into the savage world of a modern gladiatorial arena, where men fight to the death for the entertainment of the online masses.', 'David Lord finds himself forced into the savage world of a modern gladiatorial arena, where men fight to the death for the entertainment of the online masses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjudEycIJS3IOnYkI09u2tACms9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71254'),
  ('995558221905046551', 'Arena Wars', 2024, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Brandon Slagle, Michael Su', 'Brandon Slagle', 'Michael Madsen, Eric Roberts, Robert LaSardo, John Wells, Kevin Hager, BJ Mezek, Mercedes Peterson, Sheri Davis', null, 'In 2045 convicted criminals are given the opportunity to compete on the world''s #1 televised sporting event, Arena Wars. They must survive 7 rooms and 7 of the most vicious killers in the country. If they win, they regain their freedom.', 'In 2045 convicted criminals are given the opportunity to compete on the world''s #1 televised sporting event, Arena Wars. They must survive 7 rooms and 7 of the most vicious killers in the country. If they win, they regain their freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dRtXjk1rcsZlaMJpBn6Nh9cTfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:995803'),
  ('786338400569576073', 'Ares', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Jean-Patrick Benes, Jérôme Alméras, Vincent Lefeuvre', 'Jérémie Guez, Benjamin Dupas, Jean-Patrick Benes', 'Ola Rapace, Micha Lescot, Ruth Vega Fernandez, Thierry Hancisse, Hélène Fillières, Éva Lallier, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Élina Solomon', null, 'In a near future, the world order has changed. With its 10 millions of unemployed citizens, France has now become a poor country. Its people wavers between rebellion and resignation and find an outlet in the shape of TV broadcast ultra brutal fights in which the players are legally doped and unscrupulous.', 'In a near future, the world order has changed. With its 10 millions of unemployed citizens, France has now become a poor country. Its people wavers between rebellion and resignation and find an outlet in the shape of TV broadcast ultra brutal fights in which the players are legally doped and unscrupulous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVKz7eKtSkVGjKaSWo065XTkWk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415132'),
