  ('524509927821025859', 'Argentine Soldier Only Known by God', 2017, 'Drama, War, History', 'Nadir Medina, Rodrigo Fernández Engler, Rodrigo Alabart', 'Ivana Galdeano, Rodrigo Fernández Engler', 'Florencia Torrente, Sergio Surracco, Fabio Di Tomaso, Hugo Arana, Ezequiel Tronconi, Mariano Bertolini, Santiago San Paulo, Martín Suárez', null, 'The story is centered on the human drama of three young people from a small town in Traslasierra, Córdoba, who from very different ideological places, are forever transformed by the war in Malvinas Argentinas (Falkland Islands).', 'The story is centered on the human drama of three young people from a small town in Traslasierra, Córdoba, who from very different ideological places, are forever transformed by the war in Malvinas Argentinas (Falkland Islands).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiu3R1atrykH9sPQS9d8nEOMtkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451892'),
