  ('774494301150161349', 'Argoman the Fantastic Superman', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Sergio Grieco, Tino Santoni, Giulio Pannaccio', 'Vincenzo Mannino, Dino Verde', 'Roger Browne, Dominique Boschero, Eduardo Fajardo, Nadia Marlowa, Nino Dal Fabbro, Edoardo Toniolo, Andrea Bosic, Tom Felleghy', null, 'Argoman is practically invincible with powers beyond the scope of mortal man. Who is Sir Reginald Hoover, he seems to know what mission Argoman is involved with? Will Jenabell become the Queen of the World and achieve her wishes to outsmart Argoman?', 'Argoman is practically invincible with powers beyond the scope of mortal man. Who is Sir Reginald Hoover, he seems to know what mission Argoman is involved with? Will Jenabell become the Queen of the World and achieve her wishes to outsmart Argoman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qooyWKgdY5yGD6eP8byJuFYFLnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106922'),
  ('153844089741494460', 'Argylle', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Matthew Vaughn, George Richmond, Robert Haynes', 'Jason Fuchs', 'Henry Cavill, Bryce Dallas Howard, Sam Rockwell, Bryan Cranston, Catherine O''Hara, Sofia Boutella, Dua Lipa, Ariana DeBose', 'PG-13', 'When the plots of reclusive author Elly Conway''s fictional espionage novels begin to mirror the covert actions of a real-life spy organization, quiet evenings at home become a thing of the past. Accompanied by her cat Alfie and Aidan, a cat-allergic spy, Elly races across the world to stay one step ahead of the killers as the line between Conway''s fictional world and her real one begins to blur.', 'When the plots of reclusive author Elly Conway''s fictional espionage novels begin to mirror the covert actions of a real-life spy organization, quiet evenings at home become a thing of the past. Accompanied by her cat Alfie and Aidan, a cat-allergic spy, Elly races across the world to stay one step ahead of the killers as the line between Conway''s fictional world and her real one begins to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siduVKgOnABO4WH4lOwPQwaGwJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848538'),
  ('934985240608264348', 'Ari Eldjárn: Pardon My Icelandic', 2020, 'Comedy', 'August Jakobsson, August Jakobsson', null, 'Ari Eldjárn', null, 'Comedian Ari Eldjárn pokes fun at Nordic rivalries, Hollywood’s take on Thor, the whims of toddlers and more.', 'Comedian Ari Eldjárn pokes fun at Nordic rivalries, Hollywood’s take on Thor, the whims of toddlers and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRdqDmpfMqVSvW3OimT0HPVzAdo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760969'),
  ('682720814948500490', 'Ari-Cassamortari', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Amendola', 'Claudio Amendola, Kissy Dugan, Roberto Iannone', 'Massimo Ghini, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Lucia Ocone, Sonia Bergamasco, Alessandro Sperduti, Silvia D''Amico, Caterina Guzzanti, Michele Di Virgilio', null, 'After the Arcangelo affair, the Pasti brothers, together with an eccentric half-sister they didn''t know they had, have made a name for themselves as "gravediggers of VIPs" and are vying for a coveted category award never won before, the Vespillone D''oro. But the evaluation commission finds a gigantic hole in the company''s books, which threatens to exclude them from the race for the award. But how is this possible? The answer is in Matteo Pasti''s confession: he "borrowed" large sums from company accounts to maintain a virtual relationship with the cam girl named Bella Salma. A stage name that, soon, is on the opening news of all the news: the sex worker is found dead in her villa due to an unlikely domestic accident. The Pasti phone is not long in ringing...', 'After the Arcangelo affair, the Pasti brothers, together with an eccentric half-sister they didn''t know they had, have made a name for themselves as "gravediggers of VIPs" and are vying for a coveted category award never won before, the Vespillone D''oro. But the evaluation commission finds a gigantic hole in the company''s books, which threatens to exclude them from the race for the award. But how is this possible? The answer is in Matteo Pasti''s confession: he "borrowed" large sums from company accounts to maintain a virtual relationship with the cam girl named Bella Salma. A stage name that, soon, is on the opening news of all the news: the sex worker is found dead in her villa due to an unlikely domestic accident. The Pasti phone is not long in ringing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2mTbZoyGwxaWFCAZVhtlzugood.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121711'),
  ('1133519684656473195', 'Aria', 1987, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Charles Sturridge, Nicolas Roeg, Gale Tattersall', 'Charles Sturridge, Nicolas Roeg, Bruce Beresford', 'John Hurt, Theresa Russell, Sophie Ward, Buck Henry, Beverly D''Angelo, Anita Morris, Gary Kasper, Elizabeth Hurley', 'R', 'Ten short pieces directed by ten different directors, including Ken Russell, Jean-Luc Godard, Robert Altman, Bruce Beresford, and Nicolas Roeg. Each short uses an aria as soundtrack/sound, and is an interpretation of the particular aria.', 'Ten short pieces directed by ten different directors, including Ken Russell, Jean-Luc Godard, Robert Altman, Bruce Beresford, and Nicolas Roeg. Each short uses an aria as soundtrack/sound, and is an interpretation of the particular aria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bt7zLQo5ca8UmQAmkdw29TwVPNi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25832'),
  ('856423513976852248', 'Aria the Avvenire', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Junichi Sato, Chisato Kawaguchi, Motohiro Taniguchi', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Kaori Mizuhashi, Ai Kayano, Mai Nakahara, Junko Minagawa, Tomoko Kawakami, Chiwa Saito, Erino Hazuki, Chinami Nishimura', null, 'Now that Akari Mizunashi is a Prima Undine and head of the Aria Company with her own apprentice, Ai Aino, she can''t help but reminisce about her time as a Single. She has new responsibilities and much less time on her hands, but these changes bring with them new forms of miracles that Neo Venezia can give. Growing up into new roles is hard, but Akari can always count on the friends she''s made on Aqua in times of need.', 'Now that Akari Mizunashi is a Prima Undine and head of the Aria Company with her own apprentice, Ai Aino, she can''t help but reminisce about her time as a Single. She has new responsibilities and much less time on her hands, but these changes bring with them new forms of miracles that Neo Venezia can give. Growing up into new roles is hard, but Akari can always count on the friends she''s made on Aqua in times of need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sX2Dd7T4qdyF1NxTRhWHKFa9Iz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375177'),
  ('710389680992804012', 'Aria the Benedizione', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Junichi Sato, Takahiro Natori, Takahiro Natori', 'Junichi Sato', 'Chiwa Saito, Junko Minagawa, Sumi Shimamoto, Mai Nakahara, Kaori Mizuhashi, Ai Kayano, Erino Hazuki, Ryo Hirohashi', null, 'Neo-Venezia has reached a long winter. Ai, Azusa and Anya, who were practicing jointly in the cold weather, visit the Undine Museum, led by Akira who seems not her usual self. At the museum, the trio meet its director, Asuka who is Akira''s senior known as Himeya''s legendary undine. The two of them are the successors to a gondola that has been carefully passed down since the founding of Himeya Company. However, Akira reveals that Aika, who is expected to inherit the gondola, has no intention of doing so. Azusa, who is not convinced, tries to find out why.', 'Neo-Venezia has reached a long winter. Ai, Azusa and Anya, who were practicing jointly in the cold weather, visit the Undine Museum, led by Akira who seems not her usual self. At the museum, the trio meet its director, Asuka who is Akira''s senior known as Himeya''s legendary undine. The two of them are the successors to a gondola that has been carefully passed down since the founding of Himeya Company. However, Akira reveals that Aika, who is expected to inherit the gondola, has no intention of doing so. Azusa, who is not convinced, tries to find out why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5AlOjywdZvokwqq0wJ9AsyF2RI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808604'),
  ('20518499529333297', 'Aria the Crepuscolo', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Yoshifumi Terai, Kanako Abe, Kanae Hatakeyama', 'Junichi Sato', 'Ryo Hirohashi, Rina Sato, Ai Kayano, Kaori Mizuhashi, Mai Nakahara, Kiyono Yasuno, Akeno Watanabe, Erino Hazuki', null, 'The season is fall and the city of Neo-Venezia is covered in fallen leaves. Something is bothering Anya, who works at Orange Planet. Her senior colleagues Alice and Athena haven''t seen each other due to their busy schedules, which is making Athena feel sad. But for some reason, Alice seems to be avoiding her altogether. With her friends Ai and Azusa''s help, Anya tries to find a definitive way for Alice and Athena to get together. But during this time, Anya learns of a situation that only she can see because of where she stands.', 'The season is fall and the city of Neo-Venezia is covered in fallen leaves. Something is bothering Anya, who works at Orange Planet. Her senior colleagues Alice and Athena haven''t seen each other due to their busy schedules, which is making Athena feel sad. But for some reason, Alice seems to be avoiding her altogether. With her friends Ai and Azusa''s help, Anya tries to find a definitive way for Alice and Athena to get together. But during this time, Anya learns of a situation that only she can see because of where she stands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKGiRp3FaZaXHm0U81BIcbRoXZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726550'),
  ('600907444080346426', 'ariana grande: excuse me, i love you', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale, Ariana Grande, Brian Nicholson', null, 'Ariana Grande, Scott Nicholson, Brian Nicholson, Joesar Alva, Cory Graves, Bong Buño, Igor Faria, Darrion Gallegos', null, 'Ariana Grande takes the stage in London for her Sweetener World Tour and shares a behind-the-scenes look at her life in rehearsal and on the road.', 'Ariana Grande takes the stage in London for her Sweetener World Tour and shares a behind-the-scenes look at her life in rehearsal and on the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nm10ajNVkKwwyf8VFPkZnr93GbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774372'),
  ('107819637867918677', 'Ariane''s Thread', 2014, 'Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian', 'Serge Valletti, Robert Guédiguian', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Jacques Boudet, Anaïs Demoustier, Youssouf Djaoro, Adrien Jolivet, Gérard Meylan, Lola Naymark', null, 'Ariane is having her birthday party but no one comes. She decides to leave at the seaside and take part with her life that disappointed her.', 'Ariane is having her birthday party but no one comes. She decides to leave at the seaside and take part with her life that disappointed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw9rGLe1OXD3YsJhyafsJtg9fYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279579'),
  ('1070084871650734019', 'Arianna', 2015, 'Drama', 'Carlo Lavagna, Hélène Louvart', 'Carlo Salsa, Carlo Lavagna, Chiara Barzini', 'Ondina Quadri, Massimo Popolizio, Valentina Carnelutti, Corrado Sassi, Blu Yoshimi, Eduardo Valdarnini, Lidia Vitale', null, 'Arianna is nineteen, but she''s still waiting to get her first period. As the summer begins, her parents decide to renew their acquaintance with their country house on Lake Bolsena, where Arianna lived until she was three, and has never been back. As the family settle in for the summer, long-repressed memories start to re-emerge, and Arianna decides to stay on after her parents return to the city.', 'Arianna is nineteen, but she''s still waiting to get her first period. As the summer begins, her parents decide to renew their acquaintance with their country house on Lake Bolsena, where Arianna lived until she was three, and has never been back. As the family settle in for the summer, long-repressed memories start to re-emerge, and Arianna decides to stay on after her parents return to the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pOBf728jZa1z6WwcLIazN4rhNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356757'),
  ('120475421001263581', 'Ariel', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Timo Salminen, Aki Kaurismäki, Pauli Pentti', 'Aki Kaurismäki', 'Turo Pajala, Susanna Haavisto, Matti Pellonpää, Eetu Hilkamo, Erkki Pajala, Matti Jaaranen, Hannu Viholainen, Jorma Markkula', 'NR', 'A Finnish man goes to the city to find a job after the mine where he worked is closed and his father commits suicide.', 'A Finnish man goes to the city to find a job after the mine where he worked is closed and his father commits suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojDg0PGvs6R9xYFodRct2kdI6wC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2'),
  ('156070471330659938', 'Ariella', 1980, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Herbert, Antonio Meliande', 'Cassandra Rios', 'Nicole Puzzi, John Herbert, Herson Capri, Christiane Torloni, Sérgio Hingst, Laura Cardoso, Liana Duval, Íris Bruzzi', null, 'Ariella, a lonely young woman, feels like a stranger in her own house. Ariella is discovering her sexuality and her arrogant mother Helena, her father Rodrigo and her brothers Clécio and Alfonso do not give any love or affection to her. One day Ariella discovers the secret of her despair and plots to take her revenge.', 'Ariella, a lonely young woman, feels like a stranger in her own house. Ariella is discovering her sexuality and her arrogant mother Helena, her father Rodrigo and her brothers Clécio and Alfonso do not give any love or affection to her. One day Ariella discovers the secret of her despair and plots to take her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKFtDAjHHAF2Pi8alWvbdP7NWFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263982'),
  ('336142392676188557', 'Arif V 216', 2018, 'Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kıvanç Baruönü, Eyüp Ömer Yücel, Tugba Yigitcan', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ozan Güven, Seda Bakan, Özkan Uğur, Zafer Algöz, Özge Özberk, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Çağlar Çorumlu', null, 'After 8 years, Arif''s old friend 216 from planet GORA pays a visit to Earth.Together they go on a quest where they''ll be visiting 60''s.', 'After 8 years, Arif''s old friend 216 from planet GORA pays a visit to Earth.Together they go on a quest where they''ll be visiting 60''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3meMMp53LR3kWiRQm7mhS2pt4f4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450720'),
