  ('183266926673935806', 'Arise! SubGenius Recruitment Film #16', 1992, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Cordt Holland, Douglass Smith', 'Paul Mavrides, Harry S. Robins, Douglass Smith', 'Mark Mothersbaugh, Robert Anton Wilson, Douglass Smith, Janor Hypercleats', null, 'A brain-crushing collage of music and video presented in the form of a religious recruitment video. The topics covered (in deadpan narration) are basic psychology, the origin of the human race, spiritualism, religious dogma, UFO''s, the end of the world, and the group''s figurehead, J.R. "Bob" Dobbs.', 'A brain-crushing collage of music and video presented in the form of a religious recruitment video. The topics covered (in deadpan narration) are basic psychology, the origin of the human race, spiritualism, religious dogma, UFO''s, the end of the world, and the group''s figurehead, J.R. "Bob" Dobbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbXUgDGTKw9NhYaQ5PpvvdZT6eF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54992'),
  ('234426141016781583', 'Aristocrats', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yukiko Sode, Yasuyuki Sasaki, Kaori Harimoto', 'Yukiko Sode', 'Mugi Kadowaki, Kiko Mizuhara, Kengo Kora, Shizuka Ishibashi, Rio Yamashita, Yukiko Shinohara, Kei Ishibashi, Kenta Satoi', null, 'Hanako Haibara was born and raised in the city of Tokyo. After she gets dumped by her boyfriend, while in her late 20''s, she goes on blind dates to find a man to marry. Miki Tokioka was born in a province. She studied very hard and entered a prestigious university in Tokyo. She experienced difficult financial times, but she now works at an IT company. Due to a man, Hanako Haibara and Miki Tokioka meet each other.', 'Hanako Haibara was born and raised in the city of Tokyo. After she gets dumped by her boyfriend, while in her late 20''s, she goes on blind dates to find a man to marry. Miki Tokioka was born in a province. She studied very hard and entered a prestigious university in Tokyo. She experienced difficult financial times, but she now works at an IT company. Due to a man, Hanako Haibara and Miki Tokioka meet each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ5XppGKvHcVPm7iZe1n1e5ftkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718498'),
