  ('604753771994370536', 'Arizona', 1940, 'Western', 'Wesley Ruggles, Harry Hallenberger, Joseph Walker', 'Claude Binyon', 'Jean Arthur, William Holden, Warren William, Porter Hall, Edgar Buchanan, Paul Harvey, George Chandler, Byron Foulger', 'NR', 'Phoebe Titus is a tough, swaggering pioneer woman, but her ways become decidedly more feminine when she falls for California bound Peter Muncie. But Peter won''t be distracted from his journey and Phoebe is left alone and plenty busy with villains Jefferson Carteret and Lazarus Ward plotting at every turn to destroy her freighting company. She has not seen the last of Peter, however.', 'Phoebe Titus is a tough, swaggering pioneer woman, but her ways become decidedly more feminine when she falls for California bound Peter Muncie. But Peter won''t be distracted from his journey and Phoebe is left alone and plenty busy with villains Jefferson Carteret and Lazarus Ward plotting at every turn to destroy her freighting company. She has not seen the last of Peter, however.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDOcNRXtYJzvqAGmkeubVd17xsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35561'),
  ('409583310204938194', 'Arizona', 2018, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Jonathan Watson, Drew Daniels', 'Luke Del Tredici', 'Danny McBride, Rosemarie DeWitt, Lolli Sorenson, Luke Wilson, Elizabeth Gillies, Kaitlin Olson, David Alan Grier, Travis Hammer', 'R', 'Set in the midst of the 2009 housing crisis, the life of Cassie Fowler, a single mother and struggling realtor, goes off the rails when she witnesses a murder.', 'Set in the midst of the 2009 housing crisis, the life of Cassie Fowler, a single mother and struggling realtor, goes off the rails when she witnesses a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcqXQms8AzkrTL22FbT9VKcjt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490004'),
  ('503309401447851601', 'Arizona Colt', 1966, 'Western', 'Guglielmo Mancori, Michele Lupo', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Giuliano Gemma, Fernando Sancho, Roberto Camardiel, Corinne Marchand, Nello Pazzafini, Andrea Bosic, Mirko Ellis, Rosalba Neri', null, 'Arizona Colt heads for Blackstone City where Gordon is planning a robbery. When one of Gordon''s henchmen murders a saloon girl, Arizona offers to hunt down the killer.', 'Arizona Colt heads for Blackstone City where Gordon is planning a robbery. When one of Gordon''s henchmen murders a saloon girl, Arizona offers to hunt down the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i184Iiiyid7dqquZjk7XPj7v6QZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14169'),
  ('737157263124615947', 'Arizona Colt Returns', 1970, 'Western', 'Sergio Martino, Mariano Canales, Renato Pecoriello', 'Joaquín Romero Hernández', 'Anthony Steffen, Marcella Michelangeli, Aldo Sambrell, Rosalba Neri, Roberto Camardiel, Gildo Di Marco, Raf Baldassarre, José Manuel Martín', null, 'Famed gunman Arizona Colt is sent by Moreno to rescue his daughter from the grips of Arizona''s old enemy, Keane. But certain complications make the mission far more dangerous than expected.', 'Famed gunman Arizona Colt is sent by Moreno to rescue his daughter from the grips of Arizona''s old enemy, Keane. But certain complications make the mission far more dangerous than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBHn4BvasOtLS2OwPLxS2AcaGTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129579'),
  ('1080112030127039508', 'Arizona Dream', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Emir Kusturica, Vilko Filač, Sergio Mimica-Gezzan', 'David Atkins', 'Johnny Depp, Jerry Lewis, Faye Dunaway, Lili Taylor, Vincent Gallo, Paulina Porizkova, Michael J. Pollard, Polly Noonan', 'R', 'Rebellious young Axel Blackmar gets caught up into the family car business when his cousin, Paul, coaxes him to come to Arizona to attend the wedding of their Uncle Leo. As Axel makes the decision to try selling Cadillacs with his family, he meets an eccentric woman named Elaine and her equally quirky stepdaughter, Grace. Their lives become inextricably intertwined through romance, dreams – and death.', 'Rebellious young Axel Blackmar gets caught up into the family car business when his cousin, Paul, coaxes him to come to Arizona to attend the wedding of their Uncle Leo. As Axel makes the decision to try selling Cadillacs with his family, he meets an eccentric woman named Elaine and her equally quirky stepdaughter, Grace. Their lives become inextricably intertwined through romance, dreams – and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNhRjc1Q9l6tFo5aHdl8UZJPdKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11044'),
  ('1027360969066463191', 'Arizona Raiders', 1965, 'Western', 'William Witney, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Alex Gottlieb, Mary Willingham, Willard W. Willingham', 'Audie Murphy, Michael Dante, Ben Cooper, Buster Crabbe, Gloria Talbott, Ray Stricklyn, George Keymas, Fred Krone', null, 'Murphy plays an ex-Quantrill''s Raider who''s released from jail with buddy Cooper to be deputized as Arizona Rangers in order to hunt down the remnant of the gang, rumored to he hiding out in a town "neer dee border" in the words of the loose-lipped saloon dancer. The goons are found hiding in an Indian mission. Murphy and Cooper pretend to want to rejoin the gang, but the bad guys catch on and brutally beat Cooper, who protects Murphy''s true sentiments to the death.', 'Murphy plays an ex-Quantrill''s Raider who''s released from jail with buddy Cooper to be deputized as Arizona Rangers in order to hunt down the remnant of the gang, rumored to he hiding out in a town "neer dee border" in the words of the loose-lipped saloon dancer. The goons are found hiding in an Indian mission. Murphy and Cooper pretend to want to rejoin the gang, but the bad guys catch on and brutally beat Cooper, who protects Murphy''s true sentiments to the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2UxpL2AB8xDOhPvy82XV8NHwe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132939'),
  ('788316766435048158', 'Arjun Reddy', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gireeshaaya, Sandeep Reddy Vanga, Raju Thota', 'Sandeep Reddy Vanga', 'Vijay Deverakonda, Shalini Pandey, Rahul Ramakrishna, Kamal Kamaraju, Kanchana, Sanjay Swaroop, Gopinath Bhat, Priyadarshi Pullikonda', 'R', 'A brilliant but impulsive young surgeon spirals into self-destruction after a painful breakup, struggling to cope with love, loss, and the consequences of his own temper.', 'A brilliant but impulsive young surgeon spirals into self-destruction after a painful breakup, struggling to cope with love, loss, and the consequences of his own temper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHubDgL59I5hCn7ccBYvU7bKY1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473234'),
  ('1037146789887877447', 'Arjun: The Warrior Prince', 2012, 'Action, Animation', 'Arnab Chaudhuri', 'Rajesh Devraj', 'Yuddvir Bakolia, Ila Arun, Aanjjan Srivastav, Sachin Khedekar, Vishnu Sharma, Ashok Banthia, Ravi Khanvilkar', null, 'Legend knows him as an archer of unwavering focus, the soldier who fought a battle in his own heart before taking up arms against his enemy. This is the untold story of Arjun, hero of the Mahabharata. A precocious talent plunged from boyhood and innocence into a murky world of deceit and betrayal, coming of age to become the most powerful warrior of his time. From the dusty plains of Hastinapur to the icy peaks of the Himalayas, Arjun: The Warrior Prince is the story of a man discovering what it takes to be a hero.', 'Legend knows him as an archer of unwavering focus, the soldier who fought a battle in his own heart before taking up arms against his enemy. This is the untold story of Arjun, hero of the Mahabharata. A precocious talent plunged from boyhood and innocence into a murky world of deceit and betrayal, coming of age to become the most powerful warrior of his time. From the dusty plains of Hastinapur to the icy peaks of the Himalayas, Arjun: The Warrior Prince is the story of a man discovering what it takes to be a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbyNAeBppsHUE0ki5BgikCdb6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117369'),
  ('923033213716026580', 'ARK', 2007, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Grzegorz Jonkajtys', null, null, null, 'An unknown virus has destroyed almost the entire human population. Oblivious to the true nature of the disease, the only remaining survivors escape to the sea. In great ships, they set off in search of uninhabited land. So begins the exodus, led by one man ...', 'An unknown virus has destroyed almost the entire human population. Oblivious to the true nature of the disease, the only remaining survivors escape to the sea. In great ships, they set off in search of uninhabited land. So begins the exodus, led by one man ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdEf8OMUaF86ykGbLIFh1oHjWtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72805'),
  ('901362458225535282', 'Arkansas', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Michael Melamed, Maggie Wilkinson, Nikki Rudloff', 'Clark Duke, Andrew Boonkrong', 'Liam Hemsworth, Clark Duke, Vince Vaughn, John Malkovich, Eden Brolin, Vivica A. Fox, Michael Kenneth Williams, Patrick Muldoon', 'R', 'Kyle and Swin live by the orders of an Arkansas-based drug kingpin named Frog, whom they''ve never met. But when a deal goes horribly wrong, the consequences are deadly.', 'Kyle and Swin live by the orders of an Arkansas-based drug kingpin named Frog, whom they''ve never met. But when a deal goes horribly wrong, the consequences are deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieNGttYsxunAANK9LRZa4LdkEqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560204'),
  ('842120850921571841', 'Arlette', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', null, 'Josiane Balasko, Christopher Lambert, Ennio Fantastichini, Stéphane Audran, Jean-Marie Bigard, Armelle, Martin Lamotte, Jean-Pierre Castaldi', null, 'An actor owes big bucks to the Vegas mob. He''s all set to pay them off; he''s conned a rich widow into marrying him. But the mobsters blow his cover because they need him for a different scam. The lost heiress to a Vegas casino fortune has been found; she''s a truckstop waitress in France. The mobsters'' proposition: romance the broad, and get hitched. Or else. Then the crooks can bump her off and keep the casino for themselves...', 'An actor owes big bucks to the Vegas mob. He''s all set to pay them off; he''s conned a rich widow into marrying him. But the mobsters blow his cover because they need him for a different scam. The lost heiress to a Vegas casino fortune has been found; she''s a truckstop waitress in France. The mobsters'' proposition: romance the broad, and get hitched. Or else. Then the crooks can bump her off and keep the casino for themselves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZLuCbrcjh4zoW6J6CfZunuhGPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44617'),
  ('614851702109644579', 'Arlette', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Mariloup Wolfe, Yves Bélanger', 'Marie Vien', 'Maripier Morin, Paul Ahmarani, Gilbert Sicotte, Benoît Brière, David La Haye, Kathleen Fortin, Bruno Marcil, Antoine Bertrand', null, 'Approached by the Prime Minister of Quebec to rejuvenate the image of his government, Arlette Saint-Amour becomes, overnight, Minister of Culture. She succeeds by her look and her daring in creating a real buzz around Culture.', 'Approached by the Prime Minister of Quebec to rejuvenate the image of his government, Arlette Saint-Amour becomes, overnight, Minister of Culture. She succeeds by her look and her daring in creating a real buzz around Culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGaCBImPs0wBKfYXpo4wyC53mMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853137'),
  ('165476808631140031', 'Arletty: A Guilty Passion', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Arnaud Sélignac, Éric Guichard', null, 'Laetitia Casta, Ken Duken, Marie-Josée Croze, Joséphine Draï, Marc Citti, Natalia Dontcheva, Michel Fau, Franck Victor', null, 'Covers the love affair between French actress Arletty and a high-ranking German officer during WWII in occupied France.', 'Covers the love affair between French actress Arletty and a high-ranking German officer during WWII in occupied France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8jySQw8mCPbtB5yhurrU6UIpmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309233'),
  ('817194703787682782', 'Arlington Road', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Bobby Bukowski, Mark Pellington, William Paul Clark', 'Ehren Kruger', 'Jeff Bridges, Tim Robbins, Joan Cusack, Hope Davis, Robert Gossett, Mason Gamble, Spencer Treat Clark, Stanley Anderson', 'R', 'Bedraggled college professor Michael Faraday has been vexed — and increasingly paranoid — since his wife''s accidental death in a botched FBI operation. When a seemingly all-American couple set up house next door, Michael begins to suspect there’s more to them than meets the eye.', 'Bedraggled college professor Michael Faraday has been vexed — and increasingly paranoid — since his wife''s accidental death in a botched FBI operation. When a seemingly all-American couple set up house next door, Michael begins to suspect there’s more to them than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yYHyZuyTTQaEZuHKS7561jXjtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073'),
  ('420867197122842142', 'Arlo the Alligator Boy', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ryan Crego, Mike Roush, Andy Wilson', 'Ryan Crego, Clay Senechal', 'Michael J. Woodard, Mary Lambert, Annie Potts, Vincent Rodriguez III, Tony Hale, Jonathan Van Ness, Haley Tju, Brett Gelman', 'NR', 'Upon learning that he is from New York City, a wide-eyed boy, who is half human and half alligator, decides to leave his sheltered life in the swamp and search for his long lost father. A musical adventure.', 'Upon learning that he is from New York City, a wide-eyed boy, who is half human and half alligator, decides to leave his sheltered life in the swamp and search for his long lost father. A musical adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOQMJM7G2W8v2AEK722k8welIJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763568'),
  ('956424638789093295', 'Armadillo', 2010, 'Documentary, War', 'Janus Metz, Lars Skree', 'Kasper Torsting', 'Rasmus, Mads ''Mini'', Daniel ''Olby'', Kim ''Birkerod''', 'NR', 'Danish soldiers are sent to Afghanistan in 2009 for 6 months, to help stabilize the country against the Taliban. They''re stationed on Armadillo military base in Helman province. Unlike other war movies, this is the real deal – no actors.', 'Danish soldiers are sent to Afghanistan in 2009 for 6 months, to help stabilize the country against the Taliban. They''re stationed on Armadillo military base in Helman province. Unlike other war movies, this is the real deal – no actors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aezjTpjt0sdQV9X8XiSH2oHWEt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37828'),
  ('1048626236861079248', 'Armageddon', 1977, 'Thriller', 'Alain Jessua, Jacques Robin', 'Alain Jessua', 'Alain Delon, Jean Yanne, Renato Salvatori, Marie Déa, Michel Creton, Robert Dalban, Gabriel Cattand, Guy Saint-Jean', null, 'After years of poverty, Carrier, a repairman, inherits a large sum of money upon his brother''s death in an accident. Now rich, he decides it is time to make his mark and be known at any cost. Becoming more and more mentally unstable, he begins to threaten police and the government signing his tracts, "Armaguedon". A detective from Interpol heads the investigation and prepares a trap at an international conference of world leaders in Paris.', 'After years of poverty, Carrier, a repairman, inherits a large sum of money upon his brother''s death in an accident. Now rich, he decides it is time to make his mark and be known at any cost. Becoming more and more mentally unstable, he begins to threaten police and the government signing his tracts, "Armaguedon". A detective from Interpol heads the investigation and prepares a trap at an international conference of world leaders in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/looKQfHHynIvJZboRN2hxwUk1Ky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67657'),
  ('963904614103370079', 'Armageddon', 1997, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Gordon Chan, Dante Lam Chiu-Yin, Horace Wong Wing-Hang', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Gordon Chan', 'Andy Lau, Michele Reis, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Claudia Lau, Jessica Chau Ching, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Kim Yip Kwong-Kim, Michael Lieu', null, 'The world''s ten most influential scientists are being mysteriously killed, one by one, spontaneously combusted, microwaved to death, or otherwise. Another scientist, software prodigy Dr. Ken, searches for clues to these bizarre happenings only to see his fiancee apparently return from the dead. As indications point to the end of the world, It appears that Dr. Ken may be the only one who can save humanity.', 'The world''s ten most influential scientists are being mysteriously killed, one by one, spontaneously combusted, microwaved to death, or otherwise. Another scientist, software prodigy Dr. Ken, searches for clues to these bizarre happenings only to see his fiancee apparently return from the dead. As indications point to the end of the world, It appears that Dr. Ken may be the only one who can save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOew4yLykaR3R8kpCABQSEP5oBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220724'),
  ('437145112837859633', 'Armageddon', 1998, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'John Schwartzman, Michael Bay, Doug J. Meerdink', 'Jonathan Hensleigh, J.J. Abrams', 'Bruce Willis, Billy Bob Thornton, Ben Affleck, Liv Tyler, Will Patton, Steve Buscemi, William Fichtner, Owen Wilson', 'PG-13', 'When an asteroid threatens to collide with Earth, NASA honcho Dan Truman determines the only way to stop it is to drill into its surface and detonate a nuclear bomb. This leads him to renowned driller Harry Stamper, who agrees to helm the dangerous space mission provided he can bring along his own hotshot crew. Among them is the cocksure A.J. who Harry thinks isn''t good enough for his daughter, until the mission proves otherwise.', 'When an asteroid threatens to collide with Earth, NASA honcho Dan Truman determines the only way to stop it is to drill into its surface and detonate a nuclear bomb. This leads him to renowned driller Harry Stamper, who agrees to helm the dangerous space mission provided he can bring along his own hotshot crew. Among them is the cocksure A.J. who Harry thinks isn''t good enough for his daughter, until the mission proves otherwise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTM3qtGhDU8cvjpoa6KEt5E2auU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95'),
  ('796491134044677470', 'Armageddon Time', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mark Pate, Doug Torres, Cary Lee', 'James Gray', 'Banks Repeta, Anne Hathaway, Jeremy Strong, Jaylin Webb, Anthony Hopkins, Ryan Sell, Andrew Polk, Tovah Feldshuh', 'R', 'In 1980, Queens, New York, a young Jewish boy befriends a rebellious African-American classmate to the disapproval of his privileged family and begins to reckon with growing up in a world of inequality and prejudice.', 'In 1980, Queens, New York, a young Jewish boy befriends a rebellious African-American classmate to the disapproval of his privileged family and begins to reckon with growing up in a world of inequality and prejudice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMK717aDWhboXOiVbZ9sLBqLmKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615952'),
  ('136736603517872855', 'Armand', 2024, 'Drama', 'Lars Thomas Skare, Emilie Stang, Jenny Larsen', 'Halfdan Ullmann Tøndel', 'Renate Reinsve, Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Endre Hellestveit, Thea Lambrechts, Øystein Røger, Vera Veljović-Jovanović, Loke Nikolaisen, Assad Siddique', null, 'Armand, a 6-year-old boy, is accused of crossing boundaries against his best friend at elementary school. While no one knows what actually happened between the two boys, the incident triggers a series of events, forcing parents and school staff into a captivating battle of redemption where madness, desire and obsession arise.', 'Armand, a 6-year-old boy, is accused of crossing boundaries against his best friend at elementary school. While no one knows what actually happened between the two boys, the incident triggers a series of events, forcing parents and school staff into a captivating battle of redemption where madness, desire and obsession arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toW7qhFaO3VvuoRXFNpjs55PXMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144681'),
  ('765672858195358836', 'Armed and Dangerous', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Fred Schuler, Mark L. Lester', 'Brian Grazer, Harold Ramis, PJ Torokvei', 'John Candy, Eugene Levy, Robert Loggia, Kenneth McMillan, Meg Ryan, Brion James, Jonathan Banks, Don Stroud', 'PG-13', 'After policeman Frank Dooley is framed for theft and loses his job on the force, he joins a security guard agency and teams up with inept former defense lawyer Norman Kane. When the two botch a job guarding a local warehouse, they begin to uncover corruption within the company and their union.', 'After policeman Frank Dooley is framed for theft and loses his job on the force, he joins a security guard agency and teams up with inept former defense lawyer Norman Kane. When the two botch a job guarding a local warehouse, they begin to uncover corruption within the company and their union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28SqYDrMyF5EqXfSmRgoqdYzNz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2620'),
  ('159674662330124688', 'Armed Hands', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Pierre Jolivet, Thomas Letellier', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Roschdy Zem, Leïla Bekhti, Marc Lavoine, Nicolas Bridet, Nina Meurisse, Eric Bougnon, Adrien Jolivet, Cyril Gueï', null, 'Lucas and his team are after a gang of Serbian criminals using NATO-issued weapons. As the investigation leads him to Paris, Lucas attempts to reconnect with his estranged daughter, a young narc officer.', 'Lucas and his team are after a gang of Serbian criminals using NATO-issued weapons. As the investigation leads him to Paris, Lucas attempts to reconnect with his estranged daughter, a young narc officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ooIOIt5XkAx5pZ3iuE9KeYL4nB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142096'),
  ('528586489678887230', 'Armed Only with a Camera: The Life and Death of Brent Renaud', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Brent Renaud, Craig Renaud, Brent Renaud', null, 'Brent Renaud, Craig Renaud, Jon Alpert, Juan Arredondo, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, Anderson Cooper', null, 'On March 13, 2022, filmmaker Brent Renaud was killed by Russian soldiers, the first American journalist to die while reporting on the war in Ukraine. His younger brother and collaborator, Craig Renaud, recovered Brent’s body and his final recordings from Ukraine and brought them back to their childhood home in Arkansas. As Brent’s journey to his final resting place unfolds, the film chronicles the years he and his brother spent covering some of the world’s most dangerous conflicts.', 'On March 13, 2022, filmmaker Brent Renaud was killed by Russian soldiers, the first American journalist to die while reporting on the war in Ukraine. His younger brother and collaborator, Craig Renaud, recovered Brent’s body and his final recordings from Ukraine and brought them back to their childhood home in Arkansas. As Brent’s journey to his final resting place unfolds, the film chronicles the years he and his brother spent covering some of the world’s most dangerous conflicts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vG68YrQGAEnCQooXrEvJ2eparK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422051'),
  ('524576680899644079', 'Armed Response', 1986, 'Action, Thriller', 'Fred Olen Ray, George W. Scott, Scott Andrew Ressler', 'T.L. Lankford', 'David Carradine, Lee Van Cleef, Mako, Lois Hamilton, Ross Hagen, Brent Huff, Laurene Landon, Dick Miller', 'R', 'One of Tanaka''s underlings has stolen a rare statuette that he had planned to use as a peace offering between the local Yakusa and Chinese Tong. He hires two private investigators to exchange ransom money to recover the statuette, but the trade goes down bad and Clay Roth is killed. This angers Roth''s brothers and father, all combat veterans, and they go after the people responsible', 'One of Tanaka''s underlings has stolen a rare statuette that he had planned to use as a peace offering between the local Yakusa and Chinese Tong. He hires two private investigators to exchange ransom money to recover the statuette, but the trade goes down bad and Clay Roth is killed. This angers Roth''s brothers and father, all combat veterans, and they go after the people responsible', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmDQZbTtVxBF3eS4nPNJiltkM9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67305'),
  ('124034801900712875', 'Armed Response', 2017, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'John Stockwell, Matthew Irving, James Roque Jr.', 'Matt Savelloni', 'Wesley Snipes, Anne Heche, Dave Annable, Colby Lopez, Kyle Clements, Eyas Younis, Mo Gallini, Chelle Ramos', 'R', 'The story follows a team of highly trained operatives who find themselves trapped inside an isolated military compound.', 'The story follows a team of highly trained operatives who find themselves trapped inside an isolated military compound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ii3cMm7UWHRG60sbvdntlU3z9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450932'),
  ('986429893509678039', 'Armed to the Teeth', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Jaiziel Hernández Máynez, Alberto Arnaut Estrada', 'Pedro G. García', null, null, 'The parents of two young men assassinated in the drug trafficking war, looking to clean the names of their sons accused of being hired assassins armed to the teeth.', 'The parents of two young men assassinated in the drug trafficking war, looking to clean the names of their sons accused of being hired assassins armed to the teeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3akk93FMnTiB1xFp8UnO10OjBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515409'),
  ('317612534596783005', 'Armenia', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert Guédiguian', 'Marie Desplechin, Robert Guédiguian, Ariane Ascaride', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Simon Abkarian, Serge Avédikian, Gérard Meylan, Chorik Grigorian, Romen Avinian', null, 'This is a story about returning to ones ancestral homeland. Anna is a cardiologist who discovers her father has fled to his native Armenia after being diagnosed with a heart problem. Despite their contentious relationship, she sets out to bring her father back for this operation. Anna is a tough-minded, headstrong woman with little feeling for her fathers homeland or patience with its politics and socially intrusive culture, yet she finds this journey not only a reunion of sorts, but one of reconciliation as well.', 'This is a story about returning to ones ancestral homeland. Anna is a cardiologist who discovers her father has fled to his native Armenia after being diagnosed with a heart problem. Despite their contentious relationship, she sets out to bring her father back for this operation. Anna is a tough-minded, headstrong woman with little feeling for her fathers homeland or patience with its politics and socially intrusive culture, yet she finds this journey not only a reunion of sorts, but one of reconciliation as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMY8YNiwIthueytydqjCPt8g3Wx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82552'),
  ('770652860743521681', 'Armero', 2017, 'Drama', 'Christian Mantilla-Vargas', null, 'Toto Vega', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yhaCCHSZ0fs5cbLDLO1XYEinRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479304'),
  ('489580819509244419', 'Armitage III: Poly Matrix', 1996, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Takuya Sato, Yukio Okamoto, Hiroyuki Ochi', 'Chiaki J. Konaka', 'Elizabeth Berkley, Kiefer Sutherland, Dan Woren, Wanda Nowicki, Mike Reynolds, Bryan Cranston, Stephen Apostolina, Barry Stigler', null, 'Ross Sylibus is assigned to a police unit on a Martian colony, to find that women are being murdered by a psychotic named D''anclaude. He is assigned a very unorthodox partner named Naomi Armitage, who seems to have links to the victims. To stir things up more, every victim is found to be an illegally made third-generation android.', 'Ross Sylibus is assigned to a police unit on a Martian colony, to find that women are being murdered by a psychotic named D''anclaude. He is assigned a very unorthodox partner named Naomi Armitage, who seems to have links to the victims. To stir things up more, every victim is found to be an illegally made third-generation android.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sUCRdjGe7VggDCGIHywfguYdAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33322'),
  ('917341962713931124', 'Armitage: Dual Matrix', 2002, 'Thriller, Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Katsuhito Akiyama, Atsushi Okuda, Hiroyuki Ochi', 'Hideki Kakinuma, Nahoko Hasegawa', 'Ryoka Yuzuki, Hikaru Hanada, Yuka Imai, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Daiki Nakamura, Jouji Nakata, Mitsuki Saiga, Takumi Yamazaki', null, 'Naomi Armitage and Ross Sylibus have changed their names and live with their daughter Yoko as a happy and normal family on Mars — until an android riot breaks out at an anti-matter plant on Earth.', 'Naomi Armitage and Ross Sylibus have changed their names and live with their daughter Yoko as a happy and normal family on Mars — until an android riot breaks out at an anti-matter plant on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5nd9VPKxpow5MFAQfZy2DEatPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21769'),
  ('86877769374784182', 'Armoire', 1970, 'Animation', 'Andrey Khrzhanovsky, Nina Klimova, Anatoliy Abarenov', 'Roza Husnitdinova', null, null, 'A man puts all the things from his apartment into one enormous closet and starts living there.', 'A man puts all the things from his apartment into one enormous closet and starts living there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rO57iIEuDSlYh1TWvXn015dBzN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358381'),
  ('647089640056640935', 'Armor', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Justin Routt, Ryan Glorioso, Cale Finot', 'Adrian Speckert, Cory Todd Hughes', 'Jason Patric, Sylvester Stallone, Josh Wiggins, Dash Mihok, Blake Shields, Josh Whites, Jeff Chase, Martin Bats Bradford', 'R', 'Armored truck security guard James Brody is working with his son Casey transporting millions of dollars between banks when a team of thieves led by Rook orchestrate a takeover of their truck to seize the riches. Following a violent car chase, Rook soon has the armored truck surrounded and James and Casey find themselves cornered onto a decrepit bridge.', 'Armored truck security guard James Brody is working with his son Casey transporting millions of dollars between banks when a team of thieves led by Rook orchestrate a takeover of their truck to seize the riches. Following a violent car chase, Rook soon has the armored truck surrounded and James and Casey find themselves cornered onto a decrepit bridge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnXLFioDeftqjlCVlRmXvIdMsdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182387'),
  ('1050666827320424833', 'Armor Hero Emperor', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Zheng Guo-Wei', 'Cao Wei-Wei', 'Danson Tang, Guo Shuai, Chen Zhenxi, Dong Wenjun, Yang Ya, Jerry Wu, Yuan ChengJie', null, 'After the Armor Heroes united to seal up the Dark Forces Monsters, the city regained its peace and happiness. Since Monster Ten was not successfully sealed up, Mei Zhen found Zi Yang, hoping that when danger and difficulty arises, Zi Yang would be able to seal up this last monster and would completely eradicate the forces of darkness on earth. Meanwhile the Five sealed in the Monster Sealing Box, in order to fulfill their quest for world domination, used the forces of darkness to entice an angry youth, and created new mutants to create havoc in the city.', 'After the Armor Heroes united to seal up the Dark Forces Monsters, the city regained its peace and happiness. Since Monster Ten was not successfully sealed up, Mei Zhen found Zi Yang, hoping that when danger and difficulty arises, Zi Yang would be able to seal up this last monster and would completely eradicate the forces of darkness on earth. Meanwhile the Five sealed in the Monster Sealing Box, in order to fulfill their quest for world domination, used the forces of darkness to entice an angry youth, and created new mutants to create havoc in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efqGRk05JxUrAD7S7Qmsm30xmhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270691'),
  ('439540633550557894', 'Armored', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Nimród Antal, Andrzej Sekula', 'James V. Simpson', 'Matt Dillon, Jean Reno, Laurence Fishburne, Amaury Nolasco, Fred Ward, Milo Ventimiglia, Skeet Ulrich, Columbus Short', 'PG-13', 'A crew of officers at an armored transport security firm risk their lives when they embark on the ultimate heist against their own company. Armed with a seemingly fool-proof plan, the men plan on making off with a fortune with harm to none. But when an unexpected witness interferes, the plan quickly unravels and all bets are off.', 'A crew of officers at an armored transport security firm risk their lives when they embark on the ultimate heist against their own company. Armed with a seemingly fool-proof plan, the men plan on making off with a fortune with harm to none. But when an unexpected witness interferes, the plan quickly unravels and all bets are off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQrAXGkBy84FyGpWrY71ptqs7zD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4597'),
  ('417847322043353067', 'Armored Car Robbery', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Richard Fleischer, Guy Roe, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Gerald Drayson Adams, Earl Felton', 'Charles McGraw, Adele Jergens, William Talman, Douglas Fowley, Steve Brodie, Don McGuire, Don Haggerty, James Flavin', 'NR', 'While executing an armored car heist in Los Angeles, icy crook Dave Purvis shoots policeman Lt. Phillips before he and his cronies make off with the loot. Thinking he got away scot-free, Purvis collects his money-crazy mistress, Yvonne, then disposes of his partners and heads out of town. What Purvis doesn''t know is that Phillips'' partner, tough-as-nails Lt. Cordell, is wise to the criminal''s plans and is closing in on his prey.', 'While executing an armored car heist in Los Angeles, icy crook Dave Purvis shoots policeman Lt. Phillips before he and his cronies make off with the loot. Thinking he got away scot-free, Purvis collects his money-crazy mistress, Yvonne, then disposes of his partners and heads out of town. What Purvis doesn''t know is that Phillips'' partner, tough-as-nails Lt. Cordell, is wise to the criminal''s plans and is closing in on his prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cYOPFbHEEXcXq8VYlJI5h2QpIe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22924'),
  ('822212466245509180', 'Armour of God', 1986, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Bob Thompson, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Jackie Chan', 'Abe Kwong Man-Wai', 'Jackie Chan, Alan Tam, Lola Forner, Rosamund Kwan Chi-Lam, Ken Boyle, John Ladalski, Robert O''Brien, Boris Gregorić', 'R', 'Jackie Chan stars as Asian Hawk, an Indiana Jones-style adventurer looking to make a fortune in exotic antiquities. After Hawk discovers a mysterious sword in Africa, a band of Satan-worshipping monks kidnap his ex-girlfriend Lorelei, demanding the sword as ransom as well as other pieces of the legendary Armour of God - a magical outfit dating back to the Crusades.', 'Jackie Chan stars as Asian Hawk, an Indiana Jones-style adventurer looking to make a fortune in exotic antiquities. After Hawk discovers a mysterious sword in Africa, a band of Satan-worshipping monks kidnap his ex-girlfriend Lorelei, demanding the sword as ransom as well as other pieces of the legendary Armour of God - a magical outfit dating back to the Crusades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phCpGqCSBWJqutKxj73COACrlPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10974'),
  ('48793472964676531', 'Arms and the Man', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Franz Peter Wirth, Klaus von Rautenfeld', 'Johanna Sibelius, George Bernard Shaw, Eberhard Keindorff', 'O.W. Fischer, Liselotte Pulver, Ellen Schwiers, Jan Hendriks, Ljuba Welitsch, Kurt Kasznar, Manfred Inger, Horst Tappert', null, '1865: Swiss captain Bluntschli fights as mercenary in the war between Bulgaria and Serbia. When his group''s attacked by a few Bulgarian troopers, he learns that he''s got the wrong ammunition for his cannon and has to flee. His flight leads him right into the bedroom of his enemy''s fiancée.', '1865: Swiss captain Bluntschli fights as mercenary in the war between Bulgaria and Serbia. When his group''s attacked by a few Bulgarian troopers, he learns that he''s got the wrong ammunition for his cannon and has to flee. His flight leads him right into the bedroom of his enemy''s fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keGmNhMvBRSrwwyTkPdQqLzd9qP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192727'),
  ('898526218798486848', 'Army', 1944, 'Drama, War', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Yoshio Taketomi', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Chishū Ryū, Kinuyo Tanaka, Eijirō Tōno, Ken Uehara, Ken Mitsuda, Haruko Sugimura, Kazumasa Hoshino, Fujio Nagahama', null, 'Though plagued by ill health all his life, a young Japanese man is obligated to fulfill his family''s longstanding military tradition.', 'Though plagued by ill health all his life, a young Japanese man is obligated to fulfill his family''s longstanding military tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjwi1pQXVvqx2fwsd0QGve3Z2K3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168994'),
  ('271064184071546953', 'Army', 1996, 'Action, Drama', 'Raam Shetty, Sabir Shaikh, Raju Akki', 'Sanjeev Duggal', 'Sridevi, Shah Rukh Khan, Mohnish Behl, Tinnu Anand, Danny Denzongpa, Ronit Roy, Aasif Sheikh, Ashok Saraf', null, 'Arjun, an army man, who is newly-wed, is brutally killed by a gangster, Nagraj. His wife, who is determined to avenge her husband, raises an army of dedicated young men to kill the gangster.', 'Arjun, an army man, who is newly-wed, is brutally killed by a gangster, Nagraj. His wife, who is determined to avenge her husband, raises an army of dedicated young men to kill the gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wujllj1QzLAxV7tbcTGWZT72blL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160261'),
  ('348825275414597001', 'Army of Crime', 2009, 'War, Drama, History', 'Pierre Milon, Robert Guédiguian, Yann Dury', 'Serge Le Péron, Gilles Taurand, Robert Guédiguian', 'Simon Abkarian, Virginie Ledoyen, Robinson Stévenin, Lola Naymark, Adrien Jolivet, Pierre Niney, Olga Legrand, Alexandru Potocean', null, 'This gripping historical drama recounts the story of Armenian-born Missak Manouchian, a woodworker and political activist who led an immigrant laborer division of the Parisian Resistance on 30 operations against the Nazis in 1943. The Nazis branded the group an Army of Crime, an anti-immigrant propaganda stunt that backfired as the team''s members became martyrs for the Resistance.', 'This gripping historical drama recounts the story of Armenian-born Missak Manouchian, a woodworker and political activist who led an immigrant laborer division of the Parisian Resistance on 30 operations against the Nazis in 1943. The Nazis branded the group an Army of Crime, an anti-immigrant propaganda stunt that backfired as the team''s members became martyrs for the Resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWlDUuOi1GiCjauunAR2OuDDkst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30432'),
  ('577912428227238268', 'Army of Darkness', 1992, 'Fantasy, Horror, Comedy', 'Sam Raimi, Bill Pope, William Mesa', 'Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi', 'Bruce Campbell, Embeth Davidtz, Marcus Gilbert, Ian Abercrombie, Richard Grove, Michael Earl Reid, Timothy Patrick Quill, Bridget Fonda', 'R', 'Ash, a handsome, shotgun-toting, chainsaw-armed department store clerk, is time warped backwards into England''s Dark Ages, where he romances a beauty and faces legions of the undead.', 'Ash, a handsome, shotgun-toting, chainsaw-armed department store clerk, is time warped backwards into England''s Dark Ages, where he romances a beauty and faces legions of the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsgTuAtR2zSH8Umg3jWZcZjlDpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766'),
  ('808029889017437474', 'Army of One', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Larry Charles, Anthony Hardwick', 'Scott Rothman, Rajiv Joseph', 'Nicolas Cage, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Russell Brand, Rainn Wilson, Denis O''Hare, Paul Scheer, Fiona Vroom, Hilary Jardine', 'R', 'Gary Faulkner is an ex-con, unemployed handyman, and modern day Don Quixote who receives a vision from God telling him to capture Osama Bin Laden. Armed with only a single sword purchased from a home-shopping network, Gary travels to Pakistan to complete his mission. While on his quest, Gary encounters old friends back home in Colorado, the new friends he makes in Pakistan, the enemies he makes at the CIA - and even God and Osama themselves.', 'Gary Faulkner is an ex-con, unemployed handyman, and modern day Don Quixote who receives a vision from God telling him to capture Osama Bin Laden. Armed with only a single sword purchased from a home-shopping network, Gary travels to Pakistan to complete his mission. While on his quest, Gary encounters old friends back home in Colorado, the new friends he makes in Pakistan, the enemies he makes at the CIA - and even God and Osama themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUmo47WFeFRIQktGXYxWnSZXO6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336445'),
  ('498526779879647510', 'Army of One', 2020, 'Action', 'Jon Schweigart, Ellen Hollman, Stephen Dunlevy', 'Stephen Durham, Ellen Hollman, David Dittlinger', 'Ellen Hollman, Matt Passmore, Geraldine Singer, Stephen Dunlevy, Gary Kasper, Cameron Bowen, Kendra Carelli, Jacob Hobbs', 'R', 'Out hiking, Special Forces Brenner Baker stumbles onto a Cartel''s compound. Her husband''s killed and she''s left for dead. The Cartel made two mistakes, killed her husband and left her alive. They won''t live to make another.', 'Out hiking, Special Forces Brenner Baker stumbles onto a Cartel''s compound. Her husband''s killed and she''s left for dead. The Cartel made two mistakes, killed her husband and left her alive. They won''t live to make another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oswZEJav9ymqIc9B1cjA9Pz2tj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768939'),
  ('126274019345676871', 'Army of the Dead', 2021, 'Crime, Action, Horror', 'Zack Snyder, Damon Caro, Zack Snyder', 'Zack Snyder, Shay Hatten, Joby Harold', 'Dave Bautista, Ella Purnell, Omari Hardwick, Ana de la Reguera, Theo Rossi, Matthias Schweighöfer, Nora Arnezeder, Hiroyuki Sanada', 'R', 'Following a zombie outbreak in Las Vegas, a group of mercenaries take the ultimate gamble: venturing into the quarantine zone to pull off the greatest heist ever attempted.', 'Following a zombie outbreak in Las Vegas, a group of mercenaries take the ultimate gamble: venturing into the quarantine zone to pull off the greatest heist ever attempted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCIsRxzcxvmuLYeAvWgoOuSxszF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503736'),
  ('621563344832462125', 'Army of Thieves', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Ralph Kaechele, Shakir Hafoudh, Jakub Dvorak', 'Shay Hatten', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Nathalie Emmanuel, Ruby O. Fee, Stuart Martin, Guz Khan, Jonathan Cohen, Noemie Nakai, Christian Steyer', 'R', 'A mysterious woman recruits bank teller Ludwig Dieter to lead a group of aspiring thieves on a top-secret heist during the early stages of the zombie apocalypse.', 'A mysterious woman recruits bank teller Ludwig Dieter to lead a group of aspiring thieves on a top-secret heist during the early stages of the zombie apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j04Oepj3LGTWSb1ltXm0pcy50Xq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796499'),
  ('983559313551276995', 'Arn: The Kingdom at Road''s End', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Peter Flinth, Eric Kress', 'Hans Gunnarsson', 'Joakim Nätterqvist, Sofia Helin, Stellan Skarsgård, Bibi Andersson, Gustaf Skarsgård, Fanny Risberg, Joel Kinnaman, Jakob Cedergren', null, 'Arn has served his term in the Holy land and returns home to be reunited with his beloved Cecilia. When he returns home, he discovers that political forces tries to separate him and Cecilia - but thanks to queen Blanka they can finally get married. Arn knows that war is looming and with his martial knowledge he starts to build an army at his new home at Forsvik.', 'Arn has served his term in the Holy land and returns home to be reunited with his beloved Cecilia. When he returns home, he discovers that political forces tries to separate him and Cecilia - but thanks to queen Blanka they can finally get married. Arn knows that war is looming and with his martial knowledge he starts to build an army at his new home at Forsvik.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yu0RmSffk4sVeEGIRO1LSvtYvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13522'),
  ('937993053402568807', 'Arn: The Knight Templar', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Flinth, Henrik Tamm, Eric Kress', 'Hans Gunnarsson', 'Joakim Nätterqvist, Sofia Helin, Stellan Skarsgård, Michael Nyqvist, Mirja Turestedt, Morgan Alling, Sven-Bertil Taube, Bibi Andersson', 'PG-13', 'Arn, the son of a high-ranking Swedish nobleman is educated in a monastery and sent to the Holy Land as a knight templar to do penance for a forbidden love.', 'Arn, the son of a high-ranking Swedish nobleman is educated in a monastery and sent to the Holy Land as a knight templar to do penance for a forbidden love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN8C9K9bSQ01lItuEqYzROYErAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13491'),
  ('646946709799959334', 'Arnold', 1973, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy, Mystery', 'Georg Fenady, William B. Jurgensen, Daniel McCauley', 'Jameson Brewer, John Fenton Murray', 'Stella Stevens, Roddy McDowall, Elsa Lanchester, Shani Wallis, Farley Granger, Victor Buono, John McGiver, Bernard Fox', 'PG', 'Karen marries Arnold at his funeral and continues to get his money as long as she stays by his coffin. Meanwhile, various oddball relatives after Arnold''s wealth are being killed in a creative variety of ways.', 'Karen marries Arnold at his funeral and continues to get his money as long as she stays by his coffin. Meanwhile, various oddball relatives after Arnold''s wealth are being killed in a creative variety of ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqlGD4RRiElW9OIvqupEfUBfRXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119884'),
  ('625616344396980456', 'Arnold Rides His Chair', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Craig Bartlett', null, null, null, 'Beginning of the story of the all-known football-headed boy. (Hey Arnold)', 'Beginning of the story of the all-known football-headed boy. (Hey Arnold)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHweQtVp6EM2DTvTxqc5r3JarUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397076'),
  ('489003552422941733', 'Arnulf Rainer', 1960, null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, null, null, 'An experimental film, the last in Peter Kubelka''s trilogy of “metric films”. Each frame of Arnulf Rainer is composed of darkness or light and silence or sound.', 'An experimental film, the last in Peter Kubelka''s trilogy of “metric films”. Each frame of Arnulf Rainer is composed of darkness or light and silence or sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rz6PywL9KuRkVE2H7znUpgdGGzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141419'),
  ('1010288081293365333', 'Aro Tolbukhin in the Mind of a Killer', 2002, 'Drama', 'Isaac-Pierre Racine, Agustí Villaronga, Lydia Zimmermann', 'Isaac-Pierre Racine, Agustí Villaronga, Lydia Zimmermann', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Carmen Beato, Zóltán Józan, Marina Castillo, Aram González, Eva Fortea, Jesús Ramos, La Terremoto de Alcorcón', null, 'After a strict upbringing and the death of his beloved sister, Aro Tolbukhin leaves Hungary for Guatemala. Taken in as a political refugee at a mission, Aro grows close to Sister Carmen and becomes part of the community, but a series of misfortunes drive him to arson and murder. Now on death row, Aro is interviewed about his life and motivations by a film crew trying to understand what made him snap.', 'After a strict upbringing and the death of his beloved sister, Aro Tolbukhin leaves Hungary for Guatemala. Taken in as a political refugee at a mission, Aro grows close to Sister Carmen and becomes part of the community, but a series of misfortunes drive him to arson and murder. Now on death row, Aro is interviewed about his life and motivations by a film crew trying to understand what made him snap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyja13VQHDUHpclZdkZsxuAbxpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222560'),
  ('329834393898828951', 'Around a Cabin', 1894, 'Animation', 'Émile Reynaud', 'Émile Reynaud', null, null, 'The film consists of a series of animations on a beach containing two beach huts and a diving board. Two characters play at diving into the water from the diving board and then appear on the beach. The woman begins to play with a small dog and is then joined by a gentleman. The two play around on the beach before getting changed into bathing costumes and going into the water. They bob up and down in the water before swimming out of the scene. Once the couple have gone a man sails out in a boat.', 'The film consists of a series of animations on a beach containing two beach huts and a diving board. Two characters play at diving into the water from the diving board and then appear on the beach. The woman begins to play with a small dog and is then joined by a gentleman. The two play around on the beach before getting changed into bathing costumes and going into the water. They bob up and down in the water before swimming out of the scene. Once the couple have gone a man sails out in a boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3IgAtdlQ4AfWz8IoejRrnOTS3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159896'),
  ('30874214173210685', 'Around a Small Mountain', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Rivette, Irina Lubtchansky', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Jacques Rivette, Sergio Castellitto', 'Jane Birkin, Sergio Castellitto, André Marcon, Jacques Bonnaffé, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Vimala Pons, Hélène de Vallombreuse, Tintin Orsoni', null, 'Vittorio stops to help Kate when her car breaks down on a mountain road. When they meet again, Vittorio discovers that Kate has rejoined a circus after a long time away. He begins to learn about the troupe''s buried past and Kate''s connection to it, while experiencing the magic of the circus.', 'Vittorio stops to help Kate when her car breaks down on a mountain road. When they meet again, Vittorio discovers that Kate has rejoined a circus after a long time away. He begins to learn about the troupe''s buried past and Kate''s connection to it, while experiencing the magic of the circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fn5XKgJfeHoY4tiF6X7BFRCaNhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59947'),
  ('42623616510519747', 'Around the Bend', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jordan Roberts, Michael Grady', null, 'Christopher Walken, David Eigenberg, Michael Caine, Jonah Bobo, Josh Lucas, Eva Blaylock, Glenne Headly, Carlos A. Cabarcas', 'R', 'A tale of four generations of men, all of whom have had their offspring at a young age: a great-grandfather, a grandfather, a father in his twenties and a son who is about 7 years old. When the oldest member passes away, the trio heads out on the road together in the Southwest to search out an old family secret that connects to their past.', 'A tale of four generations of men, all of whom have had their offspring at a young age: a great-grandfather, a grandfather, a father in his twenties and a son who is about 7 years old. When the oldest member passes away, the trio heads out on the road together in the Southwest to search out an old family secret that connects to their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JcHU68BwPh6FhSwGp9CvHyN7h1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15503'),
  ('689983523400722152', 'Around the Fire', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Jacobsen', 'Tommy Rosen, John W. Comerford', 'Devon Sawa, Bill Smitrovich, Tara Reid, Eric Mabius, Colman Domingo, Charlayne Woodard, Stephen Tobolowsky, Henri Lubatti', 'R', 'Simon is an intelligent and privileged young man whose family expects him to become a Princeton graduate. Crying out for attention from his reserved and cool hearted family, Simon commits numerous petty crimes and is soon sent away to boarding school where he befriends a "Deadhead," adopts the "hippie" lifestyle and dabbles in many drugs in his search for acceptance.', 'Simon is an intelligent and privileged young man whose family expects him to become a Princeton graduate. Crying out for attention from his reserved and cool hearted family, Simon commits numerous petty crimes and is soon sent away to boarding school where he befriends a "Deadhead," adopts the "hippie" lifestyle and dabbles in many drugs in his search for acceptance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gn7LxcbCk5bvdtpHeXupLWGuIbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18592'),
  ('797501180807442432', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 1956, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Michael Anderson, Ivan Volkman, John Farrow', 'Jules Verne, John Farrow, James Poe', 'David Niven, Cantinflas, Shirley MacLaine, Robert Newton, Finlay Currie, Robert Morley, Charles Boyer, Gilbert Roland', 'G', 'Based on the famous book by Jules Verne the movie follows Phileas Fogg on his journey around the world. Which has to be completed within 80 days, a very short period for those days.', 'Based on the famous book by Jules Verne the movie follows Phileas Fogg on his journey around the world. Which has to be completed within 80 days, a very short period for those days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk6Rrwh0toMz9tjuUHdS4O3v2Rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2897'),
  ('326052706748360816', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 1988, 'Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Geoff Collins', 'Alex Nicholas', 'Wallas Eaton, Ross Higgins, Colin Borgonon, Scott Higgins, Juliet Jordan, Keith Scott', null, 'English Lord Phileas Fogg has just become the main suspect in a daring bank robbery. Meanwhile, he has made a wager with several other lords that he will be able to travel around this world in a mere 80 days. Joined by his butler Passepartout, Fogg begins his journey. However, hot on his heels is Scotland Yard detective Mr. Fix.', 'English Lord Phileas Fogg has just become the main suspect in a daring bank robbery. Meanwhile, he has made a wager with several other lords that he will be able to travel around this world in a mere 80 days. Joined by his butler Passepartout, Fogg begins his journey. However, hot on his heels is Scotland Yard detective Mr. Fix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BFTNsXmjtQw06GNvIIwNAxJb9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119894'),
  ('567411321965147131', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Frank Coraci, Phil Meheux, Gary Freeman', 'David N. Titcher, David Benullo, David Andrew Goldstein', 'Jackie Chan, Steve Coogan, Cécile de France, Jim Broadbent, Ewen Bremner, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Ian McNeice, Roger Hammond', 'PG', 'A bet pits a British inventor, a Chinese thief and a French artist on a worldwide adventure that they can circle the globe in 80 days.', 'A bet pits a British inventor, a Chinese thief and a French artist on a worldwide adventure that they can circle the globe in 80 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBiMw6Jtg8tSTcEq8jFV7qk9TRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10204'),
  ('114326550880609635', 'Around the World in 80 Days', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Samuel Tourneux', 'David Michel, Gerry Swallow', 'Damien Frette, Julien Crampon, Kaycie Chase, Céline Ronté, Véronique Augereau, Emmanuel Garijo, Gabriel Le Doze, Serge Biavan', 'PG', 'Passepartout is a young and scholarly marmoset who always dreams of becoming an explorer. One day, he crosses paths with Phileas, a reckless and greedy frog, eager to take on a bet to circumnavigate the globe in 80 days and earn 10 million clams in the process. Seizing the opportunity of a lifetime to explore the world, Passepartout embarks with his new friend on a crazy and exhilarating adventure full of twists and surprises.', 'Passepartout is a young and scholarly marmoset who always dreams of becoming an explorer. One day, he crosses paths with Phileas, a reckless and greedy frog, eager to take on a bet to circumnavigate the globe in 80 days and earn 10 million clams in the process. Seizing the opportunity of a lifetime to explore the world, Passepartout embarks with his new friend on a crazy and exhilarating adventure full of twists and surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWPTnHtvlmggjGonie1VZNKViLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753601'),
  ('78835229515639795', 'Around the World Under the Sea', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Andrew Marton, Clifford H. Poland Jr.', 'Arthur Weiss, Art Arthur', 'Lloyd Bridges, Brian Kelly, Shirley Eaton, David McCallum, Keenan Wynn, Marshall Thompson, Gary Merrill, Ron Hayes', 'G', 'A five man submarine plants sensors around the worlds oceans to monitor for a impending earthquake.', 'A five man submarine plants sensors around the worlds oceans to monitor for a impending earthquake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/su55onkFohpFbMml7KahrC1Plow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26158'),
  ('87476141297716628', 'Around the World with Bolek and Lolek', 1977, 'Family, Animation, Adventure', 'Mieczysław Poznański, Stanisław Dülz, Władysław Nehrebecki', 'Leszek Mech, Władysław Nehrebecki', 'Ewa Złotowska, Danuta Mancewicz, Jan Kociniak, Wiesław Michnikowski, Andrzej Zaorski, Zdzisław Leśniak, Lech Ordon, Tomasz Zaliwski', null, 'Animated film about two young boys, Bolek and Lolek, who seek to fulfill the last will of Phileas Fogg who decided that his inheritor would be the one who made an identical round the world journey as he had done, using the means of transport generally in use in the nineteenth century. As they journey round the world, a bad character named Jeremiah tries to foil their attempts.', 'Animated film about two young boys, Bolek and Lolek, who seek to fulfill the last will of Phileas Fogg who decided that his inheritor would be the one who made an identical round the world journey as he had done, using the means of transport generally in use in the nineteenth century. As they journey round the world, a bad character named Jeremiah tries to foil their attempts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHTGcRFZCtILLfaSODIzwMmbn6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207412'),
  ('122421830612375424', 'Around the World with Fanny Hill', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Mac Ahlberg, Mikael Salomon', 'Albert G. Miller, Mac Ahlberg', 'Shirley Corrigan, Peter Bonke, Gaby Fuchs, Bo Brundin, Christina Lindberg, Walter Buschhoff, Peter Kuiper, Marie Ekorre', 'R', 'In Stockholm, Fanny Hill is tired of being a housewife, and she suspects that her husband Roger, a TV-commercial director who''s surrounded by starlets, is cheating on her. So, she sets a trap for him with her friend Monica, files for divorce, and heads to Hollywood, with Monica, to meet film stars. She falls into a film career, with lots of nude scenes, and as it takes her from L.A. to Hong Kong and Venice, Roger follows her, jealous, hoping to win her back. In every city, she acts and she seduces, making comedy out of both; but does her heart still belong to Roger? It''s on to Munich to find out.', 'In Stockholm, Fanny Hill is tired of being a housewife, and she suspects that her husband Roger, a TV-commercial director who''s surrounded by starlets, is cheating on her. So, she sets a trap for him with her friend Monica, files for divorce, and heads to Hollywood, with Monica, to meet film stars. She falls into a film career, with lots of nude scenes, and as it takes her from L.A. to Hong Kong and Venice, Roger follows her, jealous, hoping to win her back. In every city, she acts and she seduces, making comedy out of both; but does her heart still belong to Roger? It''s on to Munich to find out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zLz8tKPeRQm2Up4zdSB6UarAiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60088'),
  ('919007849310759709', 'Around the World With Timon & Pumbaa', 1996, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Tony Craig, Jeff DeGrandis, Bobs Gannaway', 'Bobs Gannaway, Kevin D. Campbell, Darrel Campbell', 'Quinton Flynn, Ernie Sabella, Corey Burton, Jeff Bennett, Nancy Cartwright, Jim Cummings, Phillip Ingram, Richard Karron', null, 'Join Timon and Pumbaa, your favorite friends from The Lion King, for outrageous laughs and high-spirited, globe-trotting adventures! First stop Boara Boara. Pumbaa gets the royal treatment when island natives think hes their long-lost king! Its a lesson in true friendship when Pumbaa strikes it rich and the evil criminal Quint steals his gold in Yukon Con. Then, Timon & Pumbaa play matchmaker for a couple of lovesick flying squirrels in Saskatchewan Catch. In Brazil Nuts, theres a rumble in the Amazon jungle when Timon & Pumbaa have to outsmart a couple of snakes that want to serve them up for dinner.', 'Join Timon and Pumbaa, your favorite friends from The Lion King, for outrageous laughs and high-spirited, globe-trotting adventures! First stop Boara Boara. Pumbaa gets the royal treatment when island natives think hes their long-lost king! Its a lesson in true friendship when Pumbaa strikes it rich and the evil criminal Quint steals his gold in Yukon Con. Then, Timon & Pumbaa play matchmaker for a couple of lovesick flying squirrels in Saskatchewan Catch. In Brazil Nuts, theres a rumble in the Amazon jungle when Timon & Pumbaa have to outsmart a couple of snakes that want to serve them up for dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3dhyGokJCNNsTXZnrTCayBU58x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40647'),
  ('555344680064639786', 'Arouse', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr., Marcee R. Lacap', 'Rodante Pajemna Jr., Steve Sanchez', 'Aiko Garcia, Jenn Rosa, Azi Acosta, Ayanna Misola, AJ Raval, John Rhey Flores, Shiena Yu, Benz Sangalang', null, 'Get ready to AROUSE your senses! Hosted by Aiko Garcia and Jenn Rosa, this steamy special brings you the hottest, most unforgettable scenes from VMX’s A-list sirens—AJ Raval, Ayanna Misola, Azi Acosta & more. Desire, passion, and pure heat—are you ready?', 'Get ready to AROUSE your senses! Hosted by Aiko Garcia and Jenn Rosa, this steamy special brings you the hottest, most unforgettable scenes from VMX’s A-list sirens—AJ Raval, Ayanna Misola, Azi Acosta & more. Desire, passion, and pure heat—are you ready?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTcNSqa2XgouS8cZ2eoyc93QVgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1450432'),
  ('774708071850534685', 'Aroused', 1966, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Anton Holden, Gideon Zumbach', 'Anton Holden, Ray Jenkins', 'Janine Lenon, Steve Hollister, Joanna Mills, Fleurette Carter, Ted Gelanza, Tony Palladino', null, 'In Manhattan, prostitutes are being murdered by a psycho. A detective is assigned to track him down and bring him in.', 'In Manhattan, prostitutes are being murdered by a psycho. A detective is assigned to track him down and bring him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwF3lMpYZmcEG5n7lWP3qJeDLuD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126008'),
  ('102443351710849672', 'Aroused by Gymnopedies', 2016, 'Drama', 'Isao Yukisada, Yu Koreyasu', 'Isao Yukisada, Anne Horiizumi', 'Itsuji Itao, Sumire Ashina, Izumi Okamura, Masaki Miura, Noriko Kohara, Ito Yozaburo, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Kisetsu Fujiwara', null, 'Shinji is a middle-aged, sleaze film director who used to be famous. He hardly goes back home and moves from one woman to another. In spite of his idleness, women are very fond of him and look after him compassionately for whatever reason.', 'Shinji is a middle-aged, sleaze film director who used to be famous. He hardly goes back home and moves from one woman to another. In spite of his idleness, women are very fond of him and look after him compassionately for whatever reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9asPWkkifQquMieGKaljuXmM17n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420686'),
  ('242605614164807783', 'Arpa Colla', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Nikos Perakis, Giorgos Panousopoulos', 'Nikos Perakis', 'Mimis Chrysomallis, Nikos Kalogeropoulos, Despina Pajanou, Rocky Taylor, Ilias Logothetis, Dimitris Piatas, Nikos Rizos, Ismini Kalessi', null, '"Arpa-colla" in Greek literally means "Grab and stick", a phrase used to show something that has been done quickly and therefore isn''t good enough. This is what the 2 main heroes of the film are doing. The one is a director(Giorgos) and the other an author(Kostas) with communistic ideas, who has won a prize at a festival. They both want to make a movie for the cinema. But every idea they have never comes true, because every time they meet someone to whom they tell their idea, they change their mind, and they want to make a totally different movie, ideas varying from political cinema to Greek historical dramas and modern films with motorcycle gangs. Not a bad attempt for the Greek cinema of the early 80''s, which starts to wake up from the hibernation of the 70''s.', '"Arpa-colla" in Greek literally means "Grab and stick", a phrase used to show something that has been done quickly and therefore isn''t good enough. This is what the 2 main heroes of the film are doing. The one is a director(Giorgos) and the other an author(Kostas) with communistic ideas, who has won a prize at a festival. They both want to make a movie for the cinema. But every idea they have never comes true, because every time they meet someone to whom they tell their idea, they change their mind, and they want to make a totally different movie, ideas varying from political cinema to Greek historical dramas and modern films with motorcycle gangs. Not a bad attempt for the Greek cinema of the early 80''s, which starts to wake up from the hibernation of the 70''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdfU3B9vYYuFlGnTyZTU23G1pvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141313'),
  ('252599144545691074', 'Arpeggio of Blue Steel -Ars Nova Cadenza-', 2015, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Satoki Iida, Daisuke Okumura, Seiji Kishi', 'Koujirou Nakamura, Chabo Higurashi, Makoto Uezu', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Mai Fuchigami, Manami Numakura, Suzuko Mimori, Jouji Nakata, Hiromi Igarashi, Hibiku Yamamura, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'The group of privateers known as the Blue Steel continues their mission to deliver blueprints of the Vibration Warhead Torpedo, a weapon that may turn the tides of war in their favor, to the United States. However, a new threat arises from their enemy, the overwhelming Fleet of Fog in the form of "The Student Council", a group of warships composed of the remaining Mental Models, the ships'' humanoid avatars, who have yet to face the unpredictable captain of the Blue Steel, Gunzou Chihaya. As the Blue Steel gets closer to understanding the origins of the authority controlling the enemy, Iona''s past reveals the beginning of the war and her reason for siding with humanity.', 'The group of privateers known as the Blue Steel continues their mission to deliver blueprints of the Vibration Warhead Torpedo, a weapon that may turn the tides of war in their favor, to the United States. However, a new threat arises from their enemy, the overwhelming Fleet of Fog in the form of "The Student Council", a group of warships composed of the remaining Mental Models, the ships'' humanoid avatars, who have yet to face the unpredictable captain of the Blue Steel, Gunzou Chihaya. As the Blue Steel gets closer to understanding the origins of the authority controlling the enemy, Iona''s past reveals the beginning of the war and her reason for siding with humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJlUCQyyWLTA6Q1ViHWkRxnckUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357397'),
  ('1053634497701298735', 'Arpeggio of Blue Steel -Ars Nova DC-', 2015, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Seiji Kishi, Daisuke Okumura, Daisuke Suzuki', 'Shigeru Morita, Makoto Uezu, Chabo Higurashi', 'Kazuyuki Okitsu, Mai Fuchigami, Manami Numakura, Suzuko Mimori, Jouji Nakata, Hiromi Igarashi, Hibiku Yamamura, Mao Ichimichi', null, 'Recap of the Aoki Hagane no Arpeggio: Ars Nova TV series, with approximately 40 minutes of new material. By 2039, global warming had caused sea levels to rise and large amount of territory to be lost. As though in response, a mysterious group of warships clad in mist, "the Fleet of Mist," appeared in every corner of the ocean, and began attacking human ships. In spite of humanity mustering all their strength, they were utterly defeated by the Mist''s overwhelming force. All of humanity''s trade routes were blockaded by the Fleet of Mist, their political economy was destroyed, and the human race was steadily beaten down. Seven years later, the Fleet of Mist''s submarine I-401 appears before cadet Gunzo Chihaya. The humanoid life form that pilots the sub, who should be their enemy, is instead offering her services to mankind.', 'Recap of the Aoki Hagane no Arpeggio: Ars Nova TV series, with approximately 40 minutes of new material. By 2039, global warming had caused sea levels to rise and large amount of territory to be lost. As though in response, a mysterious group of warships clad in mist, "the Fleet of Mist," appeared in every corner of the ocean, and began attacking human ships. In spite of humanity mustering all their strength, they were utterly defeated by the Mist''s overwhelming force. All of humanity''s trade routes were blockaded by the Fleet of Mist, their political economy was destroyed, and the human race was steadily beaten down. Seven years later, the Fleet of Mist''s submarine I-401 appears before cadet Gunzo Chihaya. The humanoid life form that pilots the sub, who should be their enemy, is instead offering her services to mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNUTbnGzqe6LtOfLy7drJ0LwHiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296918'),
  ('1120492574597980851', 'ARQ', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Tony Elliott, Daniel Grant', 'Tony Elliott', 'Robbie Amell, Rachael Taylor, Gray Powell, Jacob Neayem, Shaun Benson, Adam Butcher, Tantoo Cardinal, Nicolas Van Burek', 'R', 'Two old friends living in a dystopic future become trapped in a mysterious time loop — one that may have something to do with an ongoing battle between an omnipotent corporation and a ragtag band of rebels.', 'Two old friends living in a dystopic future become trapped in a mysterious time loop — one that may have something to do with an ongoing battle between an omnipotent corporation and a ragtag band of rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mU4VeXVK18JtCZsy7i0zczlA9p7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410199'),
  ('129120645448050080', 'Arranged', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Stefan C. Schaefer, Diane Crespo, Dan Hersey', 'Stefan C. Schaefer', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Francis Benhamou, Mimi Lieber, John Rothman, Sarah Lord, Trevor Braun, Doris Belack, Laith Nakli', null, 'ARRANGED centers on the friendship between an Orthodox Jewish woman and a Muslim woman who meet as first-year teachers at a public school in Brooklyn. Over the course of the year they learn they share much in common - not least of which is that they are both going through the process of arranged marriages.', 'ARRANGED centers on the friendship between an Orthodox Jewish woman and a Muslim woman who meet as first-year teachers at a public school in Brooklyn. Over the course of the year they learn they share much in common - not least of which is that they are both going through the process of arranged marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzgj2voZLFoeZOv3eCowTgbluu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18290'),
  ('772256155684131347', 'Arrapaho', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Ciro Ippolito, Franco Pasquetto', 'Silvano Ambrogi, Daniele Pace', 'Daniele Pace, Tinì Cansino, Alfredo Cerruti, Armando Marra, Totò Savio, Giancarlo Bigazzi, Urs Althaus, Gigio Morra', null, 'Scella Pezzata, daughter of the Indian chief Heavy Ball of the Cefaloni tribe, is betrothed to Cavallo Pazzo, but is in love with Arrapaho, son of the Indian chief Mazza Nera of the Arrapaho tribe, who is in turn the object of Luna Caprese''s wishes of the Froceyenne tribe.', 'Scella Pezzata, daughter of the Indian chief Heavy Ball of the Cefaloni tribe, is betrothed to Cavallo Pazzo, but is in love with Arrapaho, son of the Indian chief Mazza Nera of the Arrapaho tribe, who is in turn the object of Luna Caprese''s wishes of the Froceyenne tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CcEdZgBeQtBwV0Q7bjZEG8FM71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42416'),
  ('527820031748563950', 'Arrest Bulldog Drummond', 1938, 'Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'James P. Hogan, Ted Tetzlaff, Harry Scott', 'Stuart Palmer', 'John Howard, Heather Angel, H.B. Warner, Reginald Denny, E. E. Clive, Jean Fenwick, Zeffie Tilbury, George Zucco', 'NR', 'The invention of a machine that can cause remote explosions brings the attention of Scotland Yard and Bulldog Drummond.', 'The invention of a machine that can cause remote explosions brings the attention of Scotland Yard and Bulldog Drummond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXeCUeRNz1N3kj0GInNYpD50PHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37461'),
  ('212523004860191994', 'Arrest Me', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Jean-Paul Lilienfeld, Pascal Rabaud', 'Jean-Paul Lilienfeld', 'Sophie Marceau, Miou-Miou, Marc Barbé, Yann Ebongé, Valérie Bodson, Arthur Buyssens, Vadim Goudsmit, Claudine Pelletier', null, 'One evening, a woman enters a police station and confesses to having killed her violent husband several years ago. As she listens to her fantastic story, the policewoman is increasingly less inclined to arrest her. Just why is the woman so eager to confess her crime, and why is the policewoman so reluctant to take her into custody?', 'One evening, a woman enters a police station and confesses to having killed her violent husband several years ago. As she listens to her fantastic story, the policewoman is increasingly less inclined to arrest her. Just why is the woman so eager to confess her crime, and why is the policewoman so reluctant to take her into custody?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4jcDErndjTKeVzUziSiZwVZR0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165420'),
  ('512669902870846751', 'Arrête ton cinéma !', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Diane Kurys', 'Diane Kurys, Sylvie Testud', 'Sylvie Testud, Josiane Balasko, Zabou Breitman, Fred Testot, François-Xavier Demaison, Claire Keim, Hélène de Fougerolles, Virginie Hocq', null, 'Sybille, an accomplished actress, is given the chance to direct a film based on her own screenplay. Everything seems to go well at first. Her producers, two sisters, are two wacky but lovable characters, and Sybille dives into the adventure with them, putting aside her family life. But, from the unlikely choice of actresses, the successive rewrites of the script and the financial issues, the wonderful dream turns into a nightmare. Ever the optimist, Sybille will realise too late that her whimsical and totally crazy producers are going to drag her in their madness ... One thing is certain, nothing will happen as planned.', 'Sybille, an accomplished actress, is given the chance to direct a film based on her own screenplay. Everything seems to go well at first. Her producers, two sisters, are two wacky but lovable characters, and Sybille dives into the adventure with them, putting aside her family life. But, from the unlikely choice of actresses, the successive rewrites of the script and the financial issues, the wonderful dream turns into a nightmare. Ever the optimist, Sybille will realise too late that her whimsical and totally crazy producers are going to drag her in their madness ... One thing is certain, nothing will happen as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/upsupJT2huiyuCuAW9MAukM4U9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375811'),
  ('587856316629207244', 'Arrêtez d''filmer la Gova', null, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Younes Arbouja', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxSXQavlpSBjWgCvLena67ez1cU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684548'),
  ('382056420095105398', 'Arrhythmia', 2017, 'Drama', 'Boris Khlebnikov, Anna Pestryakova, Alisher Khamidkhodzhaev', 'Natalya Meshchaninova, Boris Khlebnikov', 'Aleksandr Yatsenko, Irina Gorbacheva, Nikolay Shrayber, Sergey Nasedkin, Yevgeni Syty, Polina Volkova, Nadezhda Markina, Polina Ilyukhina', null, 'Oleg is a young gifted paramedic. His wife Katya works as a nurse at the hospital emergency department. She loves Oleg, but is fed up with him caring more about patients than her. She tells him she wants a divorce. The new head of Oleg’s EMA department is a cold-hearted manager who’s got new strict rules to implement. Oleg couldn’t care less about the rules – he’s got lives to save; his attitude gets him in trouble with the new boss. The crisis at work coincides with the personal life crisis. Caught up between their patients, alcohol-fueled off-shifts, and an evolving health care system, Oleg and Katya have to find the binding force that will keep them together.', 'Oleg is a young gifted paramedic. His wife Katya works as a nurse at the hospital emergency department. She loves Oleg, but is fed up with him caring more about patients than her. She tells him she wants a divorce. The new head of Oleg’s EMA department is a cold-hearted manager who’s got new strict rules to implement. Oleg couldn’t care less about the rules – he’s got lives to save; his attitude gets him in trouble with the new boss. The crisis at work coincides with the personal life crisis. Caught up between their patients, alcohol-fueled off-shifts, and an evolving health care system, Oleg and Katya have to find the binding force that will keep them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bKQZ0E641HsAeghO5tcmkCJaPJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457842'),
  ('1104105454093079959', 'Arrival', 2016, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Denis Villeneuve, Isabelle Guay, Aaron Morrison', 'Eric Heisserer', 'Amy Adams, Jeremy Renner, Forest Whitaker, Michael Stuhlbarg, Mark O''Brien, Tzi Ma, Abigail Pniowsky, Julia Scarlett Dan', 'PG-13', 'Taking place after alien crafts land around the world, an expert linguist is recruited by the military to determine whether they come in peace or are a threat.', 'Taking place after alien crafts land around the world, an expert linguist is recruited by the military to determine whether they come in peace or are a threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEzNVQfdzYDzVK0XqxERIw2x2se.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329865'),
  ('664390255544911878', 'Arrival of a Train at Perrache', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière, Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'A trains arrives at Perrache station and people disembark.', 'A trains arrives at Perrache station and people disembark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRCJgKcM6xivxY887OnpPJ5bAoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190573'),
  ('294899949520008805', 'Arrival of a Train at Vincennes Station', 1896, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'This lost film presumably features a train arriving at Vincennes station, eastern Paris. (Until 2020, was confused with Arrival at Joinville flipbook.)', 'This lost film presumably features a train arriving at Vincennes station, eastern Paris. (Until 2020, was confused with Arrival at Joinville flipbook.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXMmMUFQh1om66LrOYWakwJL4Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374790'),
  ('904456213879446499', 'Arrivano i gatti', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Emilio Loffredo, Lodovico Gasparini, Carlo Vanzina', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Umberto Smaila, Nini Salerno, Franco Oppini, Jerry Calà, Aldo Puglisi, Bruno Lauzi, Orchidea De Santis, Ugo Bologna', null, 'Four young comedians from Verona (''I Gatti di Vicolo Miracoli'') go to Rome trying to achieve big success on cinema or TV.', 'Four young comedians from Verona (''I Gatti di Vicolo Miracoli'') go to Rome trying to achieve big success on cinema or TV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ll8EtJsQRCJsxkm31DSuAqJ3dJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158275'),
  ('426306039293732909', 'Arrivederci, Baby!', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ken Hughes, Denys N. Coop', 'Ken Hughes', 'Tony Curtis, Rosanna Schiaffino, Lionel Jeffries, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Fenella Fielding, Anna Quayle, Nancy Kwan, Warren Mitchell', 'NR', 'Nick Johnson has wed several times, but all his rich wives were ''accidentally'' killed after some time. Now he''s married a young Italian widow, but she''s not so easy to get rid of, especially when she learns of his plans and tries to turn the tables.', 'Nick Johnson has wed several times, but all his rich wives were ''accidentally'' killed after some time. Now he''s married a young Italian widow, but she''s not so easy to get rid of, especially when she learns of his plans and tries to turn the tables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12NJcYvaRGNkWL1zKOvPN92xrVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267791'),
  ('1048291531801255358', 'Arroseur et arrosé, III', 1897, 'Comedy', null, null, null, null, 'A gardener is watering his flowers, when a mischievous boy sneaks up behind his back, and puts a foot on the water hose. The gardener is surprised and looks into the nozzle to find out why the water has stopped coming. The boy then lifts his foot from the hose, whereby the water squirts up in the gardener''s face. The gardener chases the boy, grips his ear and slaps him in his buttocks. The boy then runs away and the gardener continues his watering. Three separate versions of this film exist, this is the third version.', 'A gardener is watering his flowers, when a mischievous boy sneaks up behind his back, and puts a foot on the water hose. The gardener is surprised and looks into the nozzle to find out why the water has stopped coming. The boy then lifts his foot from the hose, whereby the water squirts up in the gardener''s face. The gardener chases the boy, grips his ear and slaps him in his buttocks. The boy then runs away and the gardener continues his watering. Three separate versions of this film exist, this is the third version.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vpkz5kjUPKCYNNhRlmYJlKn6mA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322616'),
  ('780419096285664616', 'Arrowhead', 1953, 'Action, Western', 'Charles Marquis Warren', 'Charles Marquis Warren', 'Charlton Heston, Jack Palance, Katy Jurado, Brian Keith, Mary Sinclair, Milburn Stone, Richard Shannon, Lewis Martin', 'NR', 'Chief of Scouts Ed Bannon works for the US Army at Fort Clark, Texas and he dreams of aiding in bringing peace to the region, despite opposition from both the Army and the Apaches.', 'Chief of Scouts Ed Bannon works for the US Army at Fort Clark, Texas and he dreams of aiding in bringing peace to the region, despite opposition from both the Army and the Apaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydVyCnK6uqRijEkNGHAZR4EvP68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61049'),
  ('343776655535496778', 'Arrowhead', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Samuel Baulch, Jesse O''Brien, Gabriel Berghuis', 'Jesse O''Brien', 'Dan Mor, Aleisha Rose, Shaun Micallef, Mark Redpath, Christopher Kirby, Jamie Foster, Jak Wyld, Akira Bradley', null, 'Kye is a prisoner of war caught between two armies that he doesn''t believe in. When offered an opportunity for freedom, Kye sets out on one last rescue mission only to become stranded when his ship crash lands. Kye soon realises that the deadliest creature on the desert moon is himself.', 'Kye is a prisoner of war caught between two armies that he doesn''t believe in. When offered an opportunity for freedom, Kye sets out on one last rescue mission only to become stranded when his ship crash lands. Kye soon realises that the deadliest creature on the desert moon is himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qh0ne4EfyGskda3Z7VPZaObjIoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360799'),
  ('886470711784376152', 'Arrowsmith', 1931, 'Drama', 'John Ford, Herbert Sutch, Alfred Newman', 'Sidney Howard', 'Ronald Colman, Helen Hayes, Richard Bennett, A.E. Anson, Clarence Brooks, Alec B. Francis, Claude King, Bert Roach', 'NR', 'A medical researcher is sent to a plague outbreak, where he has to decide priorities for the use of a vaccine.', 'A medical researcher is sent to a plague outbreak, where he has to decide priorities for the use of a vaccine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urUy4jYuRs53WSmE0t0BivUSQjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84298'),
  ('492744136691124424', 'Ars', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Jacques Demy, Lucien Joulin, Bernard Toublanc-Michel', 'Jacques Demy, Jean-Marie Vianney', 'Jacques Demy, Bernard Toublanc-Michel', null, 'With ghostly eyes looking through the winter landscapes of the plains and villages of Ain, where the sanctified priest the Curé of Ars once lived, Jacques Demy tried to understand this fighter for communal spirituality and his daily torments of mysticism.', 'With ghostly eyes looking through the winter landscapes of the plains and villages of Ain, where the sanctified priest the Curé of Ars once lived, Jacques Demy tried to understand this fighter for communal spirituality and his daily torments of mysticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/667gX47PHXw1yzKm6eHald25js8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202104'),
  ('959323801453350067', 'Arschkalt', 2011, 'Comedy', 'André Erkau', 'André Erkau', 'Herbert Knaup, Johannes Allmayer, Elke Winkens, Peter Franke, Thorsten Merten, Mira Partecke, Philipp Hochmair, Johannes Rotter', null, 'Rainer Berg is a frozen food delivery man who has been let down by life. He has withdrawn from the world in order to avoid emotional trauma. His outlook on life is shaken when he is assigned a new colleague, ex-hairdresser Moerer, who turns out to be a pain in the neck. "This van is too small for two!" But it''s no use, Berg can only get rid of his annoying co-driver once he has turned him into a good salesman, according to the new boss. Team spirit is suddenly required from the cold-ass misanthrope Berg.', 'Rainer Berg is a frozen food delivery man who has been let down by life. He has withdrawn from the world in order to avoid emotional trauma. His outlook on life is shaken when he is assigned a new colleague, ex-hairdresser Moerer, who turns out to be a pain in the neck. "This van is too small for two!" But it''s no use, Berg can only get rid of his annoying co-driver once he has turned him into a good salesman, according to the new boss. Team spirit is suddenly required from the cold-ass misanthrope Berg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frgRVwapiXUpwH1yfBJ2HSt2Sag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70742'),
  ('217312775845219435', 'Arsenal', 1929, 'Drama, War', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Danylo Demutsky, Aleksei Kapler', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Semen Svashenko, Amvrosii Buchma, Dmytro Erdman, Serhii Petrov, Mykola Kuchynskyi, Mykola Nademskyi, Borys Zahorskyi, Osyp Merlatti', null, 'A soldier returns to Kyiv after surviving a train crash and encounters clashes between nationalists and collectivists. The story of the suppression of the Bolshevik uprising at the Arsenal factory in Kyiv by the Central Council troops.', 'A soldier returns to Kyiv after surviving a train crash and encounters clashes between nationalists and collectivists. The story of the suppression of the Bolshevik uprising at the Arsenal factory in Kyiv by the Central Council troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKFpCZSNwOPyz28uOcAuHisolVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85715'),
  ('375512084456791602', 'Arsenal', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox', 'Jason Mosberg', 'Nicolas Cage, John Cusack, Adrian Grenier, Johnathon Schaech, Lydia Hull, William Mark McCullough, Abbie Gayle, Kelton DuMont', 'R', 'After the deadbeat brother of a businessman is assumed to be in on his own kidnapping, his sibling must take action to rescue him.', 'After the deadbeat brother of a businessman is assumed to be in on his own kidnapping, his sibling must take action to rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDriMSMor8ofESkYnFBmm6oXHjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388202'),
  ('230139983720420440', 'Arsenault and Fils', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Rafaël Ouellet, François Dutil, Nathalie Boutrie', 'Rafaël Ouellet', 'Guillaume Cyr, Pierre-Paul Alain, Karine Vanasse, Luc Picard, Robin-Joël Cool, Patrick Goyette, Denis Marchand, Karine Lagueux', null, 'The Arsenaults, a close-knit family who profit from illegal hunting, have ruled the roost for several generations in Témiscouata, Quebec. The return to the fold of Anthony, the impetuous youngest of the family, then the arrival of Émilie, a radio host who exercises an ascendancy over Anthony and his older brother Adam, will come to test the harmony of the clan.', 'The Arsenaults, a close-knit family who profit from illegal hunting, have ruled the roost for several generations in Témiscouata, Quebec. The return to the fold of Anthony, the impetuous youngest of the family, then the arrival of Émilie, a radio host who exercises an ascendancy over Anthony and his older brother Adam, will come to test the harmony of the clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijN7zkNGzxjlApyrKSsK9sKnXE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848526'),
  ('100149382536320722', 'Arsène Lupin', 1932, 'Mystery, Romance', 'Jack Conway, Douglas Shearer, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Carey Wilson', 'John Barrymore, Lionel Barrymore, Karen Morley, John Miljan, Tully Marshall, Henry Armetta, George Davis, John Davidson', 'NR', 'A charming and very daring thief known as Arsene Lupin is terrorizing the wealthy of Paris. He even goes so far as to threaten the Mona Lisa. But the police, led by the great Guerchard, think they know Arsene Lupin''s identity, and they have a secret weapon to catch him.', 'A charming and very daring thief known as Arsene Lupin is terrorizing the wealthy of Paris. He even goes so far as to threaten the Mona Lisa. But the police, led by the great Guerchard, think they know Arsene Lupin''s identity, and they have a secret weapon to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmN5X4wM9DcMoiIMMfDxX8eoqbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161297'),
  ('697920817700691715', 'Arsène Lupin', 2004, 'Romance, Action, Adventure, Crime, Mystery', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Pascal Ridao', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Nicolas Saada, Laurent Vachaud', 'Romain Duris, Kristin Scott Thomas, Eva Green, Pascal Greggory, Robin Renucci, Patrick Toomey, Mathieu Carrière, Philippe Lemaire', null, 'As the daring thief Arsène Lupin ransacks the homes of wealthy Parisians, the police, with a secret weapon in their arsenal, attempt to ferret him out.', 'As the daring thief Arsène Lupin ransacks the homes of wealthy Parisians, the police, with a secret weapon in their arsenal, attempt to ferret him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAXpjyyZ48bDrXaCGZOYvoBDc08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11540'),
  ('1063071833316421871', 'Arsène Lupin versus Sherlock Holmes', 1910, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Viggo Larsen', null, 'Paul Otto, Viggo Larsen', null, 'German adaptation of Maurice Leblanc''s "Arsène Lupin versus Herlock Sholmes" stories. German copyright laws allowed the producers to return "Sholmes" to the proper "Sherlock Holmes" who was portrayed by Viggo Larsen.', 'German adaptation of Maurice Leblanc''s "Arsène Lupin versus Herlock Sholmes" stories. German copyright laws allowed the producers to return "Sholmes" to the proper "Sherlock Holmes" who was portrayed by Viggo Larsen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sL7P3R52TnHEXVhL9g7QgiYS3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820560'),
  ('409611650892517555', 'Arsène Lupin vs. Arsène Lupin', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Petit, Édouard Molinaro, Pierre Cosson', null, 'Jean-Pierre Cassel, Jean-Claude Brialy, Françoise Dorléac, Geneviève Grad, Jean Le Poulain, Michel Vitold, Anne Vernon, Daniel Cauchy', null, 'André Laroche, an industrialist, has just passed away. Face to his grave, as he is being buried, Anne de Vierne, the wife of a magistrate, confesses to her son François that Laroche was in fact Lupin and that he is his natural child. But he is not the gentleman thief''s only offspring! Lupin had indeed another son by a housemaid, Gérard Dagmar, a dancer, magician and - occasionally - burglar. Which complicates the task of François who, to respect the last wishes of the testator, has gone in search of the treasure of Poldavia. For he keeps finding Gérard on his way and his efforts are constantly thwarted by his half-brother. Will Gérard prevent François from becoming the worthy successor to their father or will the two young men decide to join forces? That is the question.', 'André Laroche, an industrialist, has just passed away. Face to his grave, as he is being buried, Anne de Vierne, the wife of a magistrate, confesses to her son François that Laroche was in fact Lupin and that he is his natural child. But he is not the gentleman thief''s only offspring! Lupin had indeed another son by a housemaid, Gérard Dagmar, a dancer, magician and - occasionally - burglar. Which complicates the task of François who, to respect the last wishes of the testator, has gone in search of the treasure of Poldavia. For he keeps finding Gérard on his way and his efforts are constantly thwarted by his half-brother. Will Gérard prevent François from becoming the worthy successor to their father or will the two young men decide to join forces? That is the question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFAAf3imyD9fmM60T7aRXeihigA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4719'),
  ('874217197042164662', 'Art & Copy', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Doug Pray, Peter Nelson', null, 'Lee Clow, Jim Durfee, Cliff Freeman, Jeff Goodby, George Lois, David Kennedy', null, 'The personal odysseys of some of the most influential advertising visionaries of all time and the stories behind their campaigns.', 'The personal odysseys of some of the most influential advertising visionaries of all time and the stories behind their campaigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWWrGxHkJv8zzpLAdS33oXh4Ubk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36432'),
  ('775239293874583900', 'Art Cinema for Tots: Journeys', 2026, null, 'Inge de Leeuw', null, null, null, 'Born out of a commitment to the idea that it’s never too early to introduce kids to the pleasures of movies made outside of the commercial mainstream—and the suspicion that young audiences are often more open-minded and curious than their elders when it comes to such matters—Metrograph presents the latest iteration of Art Cinema for Tots, a celebration of handcrafted, kid-friendly films that reconcile the smart and the silly. In this edition, join us for Journeys, a suite of enchanting, adventurous shorts, including Charlie Chaplin’s early silent family outing gone awry, A Day’s Pleasure, and Hermína Týrlová’s lively stop-motion animation The Little Train, about a cheeky little coal train who gets tired of working and attempts to set off to see the world!', 'Born out of a commitment to the idea that it’s never too early to introduce kids to the pleasures of movies made outside of the commercial mainstream—and the suspicion that young audiences are often more open-minded and curious than their elders when it comes to such matters—Metrograph presents the latest iteration of Art Cinema for Tots, a celebration of handcrafted, kid-friendly films that reconcile the smart and the silly. In this edition, join us for Journeys, a suite of enchanting, adventurous shorts, including Charlie Chaplin’s early silent family outing gone awry, A Day’s Pleasure, and Hermína Týrlová’s lively stop-motion animation The Little Train, about a cheeky little coal train who gets tired of working and attempts to set off to see the world!', null, 'tmdb:movie:1667524'),
  ('481448209713802211', 'Art Museum by the Zoo', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Lee Jeong-hyang, Lee Taek-yong, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Kim Jin, Lee Taek-yong, Lee Jeong-hyang', 'Shim Eun-ha, Lee Sung-jae, Song Sun-mi, Ahn Sung-ki, Kim Seon-hwa, Kim Jin, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Hyun-soon', null, 'Through a misunderstanding, Chul-su arrives on the doorstep of Chun-hi. Having nowhere else to go, he forces her to allow him to stay until they can contact their mutual friend to solve the problem. Their initial contempt for each other gradually softens.', 'Through a misunderstanding, Chul-su arrives on the doorstep of Chun-hi. Having nowhere else to go, he forces her to allow him to stay until they can contact their mutual friend to solve the problem. Their initial contempt for each other gradually softens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/souz37T5xg6dg0ay6ZPEhn0WnCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125183'),
  ('158562366574234109', 'Art of Eight Limbs', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Robert Grasmere, Picha Srisansanee', 'Louis Spiegler, H. Daniel Gross', 'Ludi Lin, Grace Vorananth, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Nicholas Hammond, Vithaya Pansringarm, Ron Smoorenburg, Tofan Pirani, Andrey Kasushkin', 'R', 'Four canisters of deadly VX nerve gas have fallen into the hands of an international arms dealer in Myanmar. A CIA recruit delivers a high-tech detection device to an agent already on the ground.', 'Four canisters of deadly VX nerve gas have fallen into the hands of an international arms dealer in Myanmar. A CIA recruit delivers a high-tech detection device to an agent already on the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZRypLd2SU3Eeqg5tD5cwkk5CdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208561'),
  ('829495402573589969', 'Art of Fighting', 1993, 'Action, Animation', 'Hiroshi Fukutomi', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Tetsuya Bessho, Masanori Ikeda, Ayumi Hamasaki, Masako Katsuki, Iemasa Kayumi, Takeshi Aono', null, 'After events involving a home invasion, a house cat, an ancient artifact, and an unpaid electrical bill, martial artist Ryo Sakazaki and his best friend Robert Garcia must fight their way into the Southtown underworld to save Ryo''s sister Yuri from the crimelord known as Mr. Big.', 'After events involving a home invasion, a house cat, an ancient artifact, and an unpaid electrical bill, martial artist Ryo Sakazaki and his best friend Robert Garcia must fight their way into the Southtown underworld to save Ryo''s sister Yuri from the crimelord known as Mr. Big.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0O48t270JnC2aSLH63EGWFJP0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96926'),
  ('980019412753172096', 'Art of Love', 1983, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Marina Pierro, Massimo Girotti, Philippe Lemaire, Laura Betti, Milena Vukotić, Philippe Taccini, Michele Placido, Mireille Pame', 'NR', 'Young student Claudine has a dream in which the Roman student Cornelius, fascinated by the beautiful wife of the commander, attends lectures on the art of love of great Ovid. Ancient tragedy repeats itself in a few centuries ...', 'Young student Claudine has a dream in which the Roman student Cornelius, fascinated by the beautiful wife of the commander, attends lectures on the art of love of great Ovid. Ancient tragedy repeats itself in a few centuries ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7z9YhHmF5lLTL4Aczc5LpWEUnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80292'),
  ('291647572520086486', 'Art of Love', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sonnel Velázquez, Betty Kaplan', 'Eduardo Lalo, Betty Kaplan', 'Esai Morales, Kunjue Li, Caterina Murino, Braulio Castillo Jr., Aris Mejias, Zorie Fonalledas, Joanna Cassidy', 'R', 'A mysterious, erotic and haunting love story between a writer/professor at Puerto Rico''s leading University and an aspiring artist from the immigrant Chinese community.', 'A mysterious, erotic and haunting love story between a writer/professor at Puerto Rico''s leading University and an aspiring artist from the immigrant Chinese community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcoSySNTUfIPkMwxfQsDIIoQ7zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892120'),
  ('899012614621033070', 'Art of Love', 2024, 'Romance, Action, Drama', 'Olcay Oğuz, Ahmet Burçin Kılıç, Recai Karagöz', 'Pelin Karamehmetoğlu', 'Birkan Sokullu, Esra Bilgiç, Fırat Tanış, Ushan Çakır, Hakan Ummak, Osman Alkaş, Nil Keser, Macit Tastan', 'PG-13', 'After learning that the art thief she has been chasing is her ex-lover, an officer working for Interpol concocts a plan to catch him red-handed.', 'After learning that the art thief she has been chasing is her ex-lover, an officer working for Interpol concocts a plan to catch him red-handed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niVtvS9Kf8G1VDPSqurqHkaSSwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248795'),
  ('801500671317992843', 'Art of Mirrors', 1973, null, 'Derek Jarman', null, 'Gerald Incandela, Luciana Martínez, Kevin Whitney', null, 'The film, shot in super 8 features figures moving in the foreground and background of an empty space holding mirrors which occasionally flash in the lens of the camera. The images portrayed in the film are reminiscent of Jarman''s Abstract Landscape paintings of the same period. In his diary Jarman wrote of this film, ''this is only something that could only be done on a Super 8 camera, with it''s built in meters and effects.'' The film''s title was reworked in the script for ''Dr Dee The Art Of Mirrors and The Summoning Of Angels'' in 1975.', 'The film, shot in super 8 features figures moving in the foreground and background of an empty space holding mirrors which occasionally flash in the lens of the camera. The images portrayed in the film are reminiscent of Jarman''s Abstract Landscape paintings of the same period. In his diary Jarman wrote of this film, ''this is only something that could only be done on a Super 8 camera, with it''s built in meters and effects.'' The film''s title was reworked in the script for ''Dr Dee The Art Of Mirrors and The Summoning Of Angels'' in 1975.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5uI3WfOXa1fKGrXSdtNvTdZDyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121360'),
  ('141496109659664992', 'Art of the Devil', 2004, 'Horror', 'Tanit Jitnukul, Taya Nimcharoenpong, Tanai Nimcharoenpong', 'Ghost Gypsy', 'Alisa Wills, Supakson Ruengsomboon, Krongthong Rachatawan, Trin Settachoke, Ittikorn Satutam, Isara Ochakul, Nirut Sutchart, Krittayod Thimnate', null, 'When Boom suffers abandonment and abuse by Prathan, she decides to use black magic to take revenge on him and his family.', 'When Boom suffers abandonment and abuse by Prathan, she decides to use black magic to take revenge on him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxLlAzwihpsUQQXAbNVmKg2peBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40127'),
  ('581442565525937605', 'Art of the Devil 2', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Yossapong Phonsup, Tanon Wattanapaibool, Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Kongkiat Khomsiri, Art Thamthrakul, Yossapong Phonsup', 'Napakpapha Nakprasitte, Namo Tongkumnerd, Akarin Siwapornpitak, Hataiwan Ngamsukonpusit, Korakot Woramusik, Pavarit Wongpanitch, Chanida Suriyakompon, Chalad Na Songkhla', null, 'A beautiful teacher is wronged by six of her students. Calling on demons and forces of black magic, she extracts an ultra-gruesome retribution against each of them.', 'A beautiful teacher is wronged by six of her students. Calling on demons and forces of black magic, she extracts an ultra-gruesome retribution against each of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdS7qZFeayKtqEBKRnIFd3SudkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44935'),
  ('233942742272893464', 'Art of the Devil 3', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Chitti Urnorakankij, Pasith Buranajan, Art Thamthrakul', 'Yossapong Phonsup, Kongkiat Khomsiri', 'Napakpapha Nakprasitte, Suppakorn Kitsuwan, Namo Tongkumnerd, Supaluck Neemayothin, Atthakorn Suwannaraj, Paweena Charivsakul, Sommart Praihirun, Theerayut Pratyabamrung', null, 'After Ta''s mother is poisoned by his father, he finds himself in a dark and dangerous situation among demons when his family uses black magic to bring her back.', 'After Ta''s mother is poisoned by his father, he finds himself in a dark and dangerous situation among demons when his family uses black magic to bring her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8adFAprCXfdAdlNYav0wa518iKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49236'),
  ('374693808925790761', 'Art School Confidential', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Zwigoff, Jamie Anderson', 'Daniel Clowes', 'Max Minghella, Sophia Myles, John Malkovich, Jim Broadbent, Matt Keeslar, Ethan Suplee, Joel David Moore, Nick Swardson', 'R', 'Starting from childhood attempts at illustration, the protagonist pursues his true obsession to art school. But as he learns how the art world really works, he finds that he must adapt his vision to the reality that confronts him.', 'Starting from childhood attempts at illustration, the protagonist pursues his true obsession to art school. But as he learns how the art world really works, he finds that he must adapt his vision to the reality that confronts him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eV6UL22Zlpsq5XybUupWh0rBOp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9786'),
  ('543215187549536837', 'Artemide’s Knee', 2008, 'Drama, Music', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Jean-Charles Fitoussi, Renato Berta', 'Jean-Marie Straub', 'Andrea Bacci, Dario Marconcini', null, 'Mourning the death of his partner and collaborator Danièle Huillet, Straub finds tender mercy in music and nature. Out of the abyss, Kathleen Ferrier sings “The Farewell” from Gustav Mahler’s “The Song of the Earth”, (which the composer wrote in 1909 after the death of his daughter) and Heinrich Schütz’s Lament on the Death of His Wife. The landscape also provides solace: the mountain grove where Endymion pines for his beloved Artemis, “a wild thing, untouchable, mortal,” appears to embody the Japanese concept of ‘mono no aware’ — a wistful acceptance of the fleeting beauty of things.', 'Mourning the death of his partner and collaborator Danièle Huillet, Straub finds tender mercy in music and nature. Out of the abyss, Kathleen Ferrier sings “The Farewell” from Gustav Mahler’s “The Song of the Earth”, (which the composer wrote in 1909 after the death of his daughter) and Heinrich Schütz’s Lament on the Death of His Wife. The landscape also provides solace: the mountain grove where Endymion pines for his beloved Artemis, “a wild thing, untouchable, mortal,” appears to embody the Japanese concept of ‘mono no aware’ — a wistful acceptance of the fleeting beauty of things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loooAFsksEyWstUzA61oRa18vHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255706'),
  ('224329941868440185', 'Artemis Fowl', 2020, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Kenneth Branagh, Haris Zambarloukos, Michael Stevenson', 'Conor McPherson, Hamish McColl', 'Ferdia Shaw, Colin Farrell, Lara McDonnell, Josh Gad, Tamara Smart, Nonso Anozie, Joshua McGuire, Judi Dench', 'PG', 'Artemis Fowl is a 12-year-old genius and descendant of a long line of criminal masterminds. He soon finds himself in an epic battle against a race of powerful underground fairies who may be behind his father''s disappearance.', 'Artemis Fowl is a 12-year-old genius and descendant of a long line of criminal masterminds. He soon finds himself in an epic battle against a race of powerful underground fairies who may be behind his father''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tI8ocADh22GtQFV28vGHaBZVb0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475430'),
  ('776717738391455023', 'Artemisia', 1997, 'Drama, History', 'Agnès Merlet, Benoît Delhomme', 'Patrick Amos', 'Valentina Cervi, Michel Serrault, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Luca Zingaretti, Emmanuelle Devos, Frédéric Pierrot, Maurice Garrel, Brigitte Catillon', 'R', 'The story of Artemisia Gentileschi (1593-1653), one of the first well-known female painters, including her youth, when she was guided and protected by her father, the painter Orazio Gentileschi.', 'The story of Artemisia Gentileschi (1593-1653), one of the first well-known female painters, including her youth, when she was guided and protected by her father, the painter Orazio Gentileschi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mMzt0Cw99wNk0xTT7YOdRxaqZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39177'),
  ('224466666096677804', 'Arth', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Pravin Bhatt', 'Mahesh Bhatt, Sujit Sen', 'Shabana Azmi, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Smita Patil, Rohini Hattangadi, Raj Kiran, Mazhar Khan, Gulshan Grover, Gita Siddharth', null, 'The semi-autobiographical film was written by Mahesh Bhatt about his extramarital relationship with actress Parveen Babi.', 'The semi-autobiographical film was written by Mahesh Bhatt about his extramarital relationship with actress Parveen Babi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtSdmEr5RVVWdg2zhsgv7yjqu0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96156'),
  ('383100939234943757', 'Arthur', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Steve Gordon, Robert Greenhut, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Steve Gordon', 'Dudley Moore, Liza Minnelli, John Gielgud, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Jill Eikenberry, Stephen Elliott, Ted Ross, Barney Martin', 'PG', 'Arthur is a 30-year-old child who will inherit $750 million if he complies with his family''s demands and marries the woman of their choosing.', 'Arthur is a 30-year-old child who will inherit $750 million if he complies with his family''s demands and marries the woman of their choosing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8yOFRDVZPxtsr4D2hVdzls6q6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13665'),
  ('356199176762046987', 'Arthur', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Winer, Michael Pitt, Adam Weisinger', 'Peter Baynham', 'Russell Brand, Helen Mirren, Greta Gerwig, Jennifer Garner, Geraldine James, Luis Guzmán, Nick Nolte, Peter Van Wagner', 'PG-13', 'A drunken playboy stands to lose a wealthy inheritance when he falls for a woman that his family doesn''t like.', 'A drunken playboy stands to lose a wealthy inheritance when he falls for a woman that his family doesn''t like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foUTAJurvnbUoIUbnuUk5dyHx7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49012'),
  ('457675403310424495', 'Arthur & Claire', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel Alexandre, Katharina Dießner, Jannis Skalieris', 'Miguel Alexandre, Josef Hader', 'Josef Hader, Hannah Hoekstra, Rainer Bock, Errol Trotman-Harewood, Guy Clemens, Ruben Brinkman, Florence Kasumba, Matthias Emberger', null, 'The chance meeting of two people at the darkest moments of their lives leads to a bright new beginning : Arthur (around 50) and Claire (around 30) pull each other from the abyss – by trying to save the other they see the worth of their own life.', 'The chance meeting of two people at the darkest moments of their lives leads to a bright new beginning : Arthur (around 50) and Claire (around 30) pull each other from the abyss – by trying to save the other they see the worth of their own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44x3kGB7GNlps4ofMSJWGhLnx3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478417'),
  ('403609754462647397', 'Arthur & Merlin', 2015, 'Fantasy', 'Xavier Ballester, Joe Burrows, Matt Gilooly', 'Kat Wood, Marco van Belle', 'Kirk Barker, Adrian Bouchet, David Sterne, Nigel Cooke, Charlotte Brimble, Nicholas Asbury, Garth Maunders, Andrew Grose', 'PG-13', 'In dark ages Britain, a time of magic and legend, a powerful druid is bent on destroying the Celtic people. Arthur, a banished warrior, and Merlin, a hermit wizard, embark on a heroic quest to stop the druid and save their people, before the Celts are lost forever and become a myth themselves.', 'In dark ages Britain, a time of magic and legend, a powerful druid is bent on destroying the Celtic people. Arthur, a banished warrior, and Merlin, a hermit wizard, embark on a heroic quest to stop the druid and save their people, before the Celts are lost forever and become a myth themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lItiYAN3Md0KFWSPvzw2TtB7pAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336149'),
  ('6834285200681896', 'Arthur & Merlin: Knights of Camelot', 2020, 'Adventure, History, Action', 'Giles Alderson', 'Simon Cotton, Jonny Grant', 'Richard Short, Joe Egan, Ronan Summers, Olivia Bernstone, Georgia Curtis, Charlie Hiett, Jennifer Matter, Stella Stocker', 'R', 'King Arthur returns home after fighting the Roman Empire. His illegitimate son has corrupted the throne of Camelot and King Arthur must reunite with the wizard Merlin and the Knights of the Round Table to fight to get back his crown.', 'King Arthur returns home after fighting the Roman Empire. His illegitimate son has corrupted the throne of Camelot and King Arthur must reunite with the wizard Merlin and the Knights of the Round Table to fight to get back his crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJJt55m14FIOM305lgMukhGCbDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635237'),
  ('1047522076083337721', 'Arthur 2: On the Rocks', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bud Yorkin, Stephen H. Burum', 'Andy Breckman', 'Dudley Moore, Liza Minnelli, John Gielgud, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Stephen Elliott, Paul Benedict, Cynthia Sikes, Kathy Bates', 'PG', 'Arthur loses his fortune for staying with Linda, right as the two were preparing to adopt a child. As their marriage suffers, Arthur plans for a way to get his money back, but first he must sober up and get a real job.', 'Arthur loses his fortune for staying with Linda, right as the two were preparing to adopt a child. As their marriage suffers, Arthur plans for a way to get his money back, but first he must sober up and get a real job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxoRLoKxPz5UdBNnQvQojEAZFVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26044'),
  ('322678059001157722', 'Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds', 2010, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast', 'Céline Garcia, Luc Besson', 'Freddie Highmore, Mia Farrow, Robert Stanton, Penny Balfour, David Gasman, Antony Hickling, Dashiell Eaves, Joseph Rezwin', 'G', 'With Maltazard now seven feet tall and Arthur still two inches small, our hero must find a way to grow back to his normal size and stop the Evil M once and for all, with the help of Selenia and Betameche.', 'With Maltazard now seven feet tall and Arthur still two inches small, our hero must find a way to grow back to his normal size and stop the Evil M once and for all, with the help of Selenia and Betameche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBT40NqmBz65WYmIGhDnWcgzPcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42949'),
  ('841763314295324925', 'Arthur and the Invisibles', 2006, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast', 'Luc Besson, Céline Garcia', 'Freddie Highmore, Madonna, Mia Farrow, Adam LeFevre, Doug Rand, Penny Balfour, Ron Crawford, David Bowie', 'PG', 'Ten-year-old Arthur, in a bid to save his grandfather''s house from being demolished, goes looking for some much-fabled hidden treasure in the land of the Minimoys, tiny people living in harmony with nature.', 'Ten-year-old Arthur, in a bid to save his grandfather''s house from being demolished, goes looking for some much-fabled hidden treasure in the land of the Minimoys, tiny people living in harmony with nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH27K0S7BiZCsNMxzOQTacG9IZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9992'),
  ('529329256961144168', 'Arthur and the Revenge of Maltazard', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Luc Besson, Thierry Arbogast', 'Luc Besson, Céline Garcia', 'Freddie Highmore, Mia Farrow, Logan Miller, Robert Stanton, Penny Balfour, Ron Crawford, Jean Bejote Njamba, Lou Reed', 'PG', 'Arthur answers a distress call from Princess Selenia, who is menaced by the nefarious Maltazard.', 'Arthur answers a distress call from Princess Selenia, who is menaced by the nefarious Maltazard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHCL0HwlQvU01TLRRHZFlvsVEqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26505'),
  ('798214737608682233', 'Arthur Christmas', 2011, 'Drama, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Sarah Smith, Brian Blasiak, Dan Haring', 'Sarah Smith, Peter Baynham', 'James McAvoy, Hugh Laurie, Bill Nighy, Jim Broadbent, Imelda Staunton, Ashley Jensen, Marc Wootton, Laura Linney', 'PG', 'For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title "Santa" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.', 'For hundreds of years, the Claus family has delegated the title "Santa" to a chosen few of its members, which can be passed down upon retirement. Each Christmas, Santa and his vast army of highly trained elves produce gifts and distribute them around the world in a one-night high-tech operation. However, when one of 600 million children to receive a gift from Santa on Christmas Eve is missed, it is deemed ‘acceptable’ to all but one—Arthur Claus, the current Santa’s misfit son deemed ineligible for the title, who executes an unauthorised rookie mission to get the last present halfway around the globe before dawn on Christmas morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yF7SNheAGWavNnjbAronedwjC1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51052'),
  ('819837064681939437', 'Arthur Newman', 2012, 'Drama', 'Scott Hardwick, Dante Ariola, Eduard Grau', 'Becky Johnston', 'Colin Firth, Emily Blunt, Lucas Hedges, Anne Heche, M. Emmet Walsh, Kristin Lehman, Phillip Troy Linger, Sterling Beaumon', 'R', 'A story of a man who fakes his own death and assumes a new identity in order to escape his life, who then moves in with a woman who is also trying to leave her past behind.', 'A story of a man who fakes his own death and assumes a new identity in order to escape his life, who then moves in with a woman who is also trying to leave her past behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns4gt4qD5JA3QioVlKzWSEM56Dj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127374'),
  ('161316033695348967', 'Arthur Rambo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Diego Urgoiti-Moinot, Delphine Daull, Pierre Milon', 'Samuel Doux, Laurent Cantet, Fanny Burdino', 'Rabah Nait Oufella, Antoine Reinartz, Sofian Khammes, Bilel Chegrani, Sarah Henochsberg, Hélène Alexandridis, Chouaib Arif, Malika Zerrouki', null, 'Who is this Karim D. ? The new young writer whom the media can''t get enough of? Or his alias, Arthur Rambo, the author of old hate-fuellled messages which are dredged up, one day, from social media websites?', 'Who is this Karim D. ? The new young writer whom the media can''t get enough of? Or his alias, Arthur Rambo, the author of old hate-fuellled messages which are dredged up, one day, from social media websites?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqQKKFNToX8nrmKOxMccpUjbAoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660334'),
  ('1108936792480265069', 'Arthur the King', 1985, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Clive Donner, Dennis C. Lewiston, Rose Tobias Shaw', 'David Wyles', 'Malcolm McDowell, Candice Bergen, Edward Woodward, Dyan Cannon, Joseph Blatchley, Rupert Everett, Rosalyn Landor, Liam Neeson', null, 'Classic tale of King Arthur and how his wife is kidnapped by his evil sister. Lancelot is sent out to try and retrieve the lost queen and unfortunately falls in love with her. Forbidden love, revenge, family rivalry, and magic are all prominent themes.', 'Classic tale of King Arthur and how his wife is kidnapped by his evil sister. Lancelot is sent out to try and retrieve the lost queen and unfortunately falls in love with her. Forbidden love, revenge, family rivalry, and magic are all prominent themes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KTrdrr7HQcsVlLhqHROSkGvp0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134542'),
  ('101995756196704344', 'Arthur the King', 2024, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jacques Jouffret, Simon Cellan Jones, John McKeown', 'Michael Brandt', 'Mark Wahlberg, Simu Liu, Juliet Rylance, Nathalie Emmanuel, Ali Suliman, Bear Grylls, Paul Guilfoyle, Rob Collins', 'PG-13', 'Over the course of ten days and 435 miles, an unbreakable bond is forged between pro adventure racer Michael Light and a scrappy street dog companion dubbed Arthur. As the team is pushed to their outer limits of endurance in the race, Arthur redefines what victory, loyalty and friendship truly mean.', 'Over the course of ten days and 435 miles, an unbreakable bond is forged between pro adventure racer Michael Light and a scrappy street dog companion dubbed Arthur. As the team is pushed to their outer limits of endurance in the race, Arthur redefines what victory, loyalty and friendship truly mean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkKB3kOun5DKAkm61pHvLbrjxfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618588'),
  ('652623487656756878', 'Arthur: Malediction', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Barthélémy Grossmann, Colin Wandersman, Thomas Delesti', 'Luc Besson', 'Mathieu Berger, Thalia Besson, Yann Mendy, Jade Pedri, Marceau Ebersolt, Vadim Agid, Lola Andreoni, Mikaël Halimi', null, 'Longtime Minimoys fan Alex is taken by his friends to the filming location for his 18th birthday, unaware that they''re all in for a horrific time.', 'Longtime Minimoys fan Alex is taken by his friends to the filming location for his 18th birthday, unaware that they''re all in for a horrific time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MVrHAbbMFXhFmLsVK1BbWAcHzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955569'),
  ('649687228025455966', 'Arthur''s Perfect Christmas', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Greg Bailey', 'Peter K. Hirsch', 'Michael Yarmush, Oliver Grainger, Bruce Dinsmore, Daniel Brochu, Jodie Resther, Melissa Altro, Luke Reid, Arthur Holden', null, 'Arthur, D.W., and their family and friends prepare to make the best Christmas ever in Elwood City - but obstacles get in their way.', 'Arthur, D.W., and their family and friends prepare to make the best Christmas ever in Elwood City - but obstacles get in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk2SDlixFUpiCtiKxSlHU4HrNmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366978'),
  ('616610381033873843', 'Article 15', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Anubhav Sinha, Anuj Gupta, Ewan Mulligan', 'Anubhav Sinha, Gaurav Solanki', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Isha Talwar, Sayani Gupta, Kumud Mishra, Manoj Pahwa, Nassar, Ronjini Chakraborty, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub', null, 'A young IPS officer’s new posting in rural India has him confronting caste disparities and uncomfortable truths in the face of a gruesome crime. When three girls go missing in the fictional village of Lalgaon, two of them are found dead and there is no trace of the third one. Where is she and who is responsible for this heinous act?', 'A young IPS officer’s new posting in rural India has him confronting caste disparities and uncomfortable truths in the face of a gruesome crime. When three girls go missing in the fictional village of Lalgaon, two of them are found dead and there is no trace of the third one. Where is she and who is responsible for this heinous act?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egknEWNt2B0slG2OC0gSpLZdVHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597089'),
