  ('858616482586042121', 'Article 99', 1992, 'Drama', 'Howard Deutch, Richard Bowen, K.C. Colwell', 'Ron Cutler', 'Ray Liotta, Kiefer Sutherland, Forest Whitaker, Lea Thompson, John C. McGinley, John Mahoney, Keith David, Kathy Baker', 'R', 'Dr. Richard Sturgess leads a team of compassionate doctors at a veteran''s hospital. Along with Drs. Morgan, Handleman and Van Dorn, he fights to deliver adequate care to needy veterans in the face of funding cuts and a corrupt administration. To succeed, the staff may have to bend the rules and circumvent the villainous "Article 99," a bureaucratic loophole that prevents veterans from receiving the benefits they deserve.', 'Dr. Richard Sturgess leads a team of compassionate doctors at a veteran''s hospital. Along with Drs. Morgan, Handleman and Van Dorn, he fights to deliver adequate care to needy veterans in the face of funding cuts and a corrupt administration. To succeed, the staff may have to bend the rules and circumvent the villainous "Article 99," a bureaucratic loophole that prevents veterans from receiving the benefits they deserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqgKO2qredWaXjwHg3GBDOzLErx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25269'),
  ('290841247690759102', 'Artifact', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jared Leto', null, 'Jared Leto, Shannon Leto, Tomo Miličević, Chester Bennington, Serj Tankian, Bam Margera, Flavor Flav, Irving Azoff', null, 'Follow 30 Seconds to Mars as they record their latest album, This Is War, and their battle against record label EMI.', 'Follow 30 Seconds to Mars as they record their latest album, This Is War, and their battle against record label EMI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BzAO0DwaYPpbyMtyqpWVNLn8th.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127853'),
  ('908340591253635739', 'Artificial Justice', 2024, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Simón Casal, Diego Cabezas, Carlos Amoedo', 'Víctor Sierra, Simón Casal', 'Verónica Echegui, Alberto Ammann, Tamar Novas, Alba Galocha, Lúcia Moniz, Paula Morado, Santi Prego, Afonso Pimentel', null, 'In the near future, the Government aims to replace judges with Artificial Intelligence software, pledging to effectively automate and depoliticize the justice system. Carmen Costa, a distinguished judge, has been invited to assess this new procedure. However, when the software’s creator is found dead, she realizes her life is in danger and that she will have to fight the powerful interests that are at play in the highest echelons of the State.', 'In the near future, the Government aims to replace judges with Artificial Intelligence software, pledging to effectively automate and depoliticize the justice system. Carmen Costa, a distinguished judge, has been invited to assess this new procedure. However, when the software’s creator is found dead, she realizes her life is in danger and that she will have to fight the powerful interests that are at play in the highest echelons of the State.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7twpnxfyDDCzzQnX9T3Zl9db1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209423'),
  ('1064177663382938961', 'Artificial Paradises', 2012, 'Drama', 'Marcos Prado, Lula Carvalho', 'Pablo Padilla, Cristiano Gualda, Marcos Prado', 'Nathalia Dill, Luca Bianchi, Bernardo Barreto, Lívia de Bueno, César Cardadeiro, Roney Villela, Divana Brandão, Cadu Fávero', null, 'Nando and Erika, two young people in their twenties, meet several times without noticing. The story of the subculture of electronic music and rave parties and drugs like MDMA.', 'Nando and Erika, two young people in their twenties, meet several times without noticing. The story of the subculture of electronic music and rave parties and drugs like MDMA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oIt62UWUhbjOb2xHa2RF08ngsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113329'),
  ('761937050059870058', 'Artists and Models', 1955, 'Comedy', 'James Engle, Richard Caffey, Frank Tashlin', 'Hal Kanter, Herbert Baker, Frank Tashlin', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Shirley MacLaine, Dorothy Malone, Eddie Mayehoff, Eva Gabor, Anita Ekberg, George Winslow', null, 'A struggling painter begins taking inspiration from the dreams of his friend and roommate, a comic book fan who narrates an adventure story while he sleeps, but unbeknownst to the latter, the artist of his favorite comic book lives in the same building as they do with the model for her drawings.', 'A struggling painter begins taking inspiration from the dreams of his friend and roommate, a comic book fan who narrates an adventure story while he sleeps, but unbeknownst to the latter, the artist of his favorite comic book lives in the same building as they do with the model for her drawings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKP3lBDj320ruxQ9JepgyEglNad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43317'),
  ('1139448282352560878', 'Artists Under the Big Top: Perplexed', 1968, 'Drama', 'Alexander Kluge, Günther Hörmann, Thomas Mauch', 'Alexander Kluge', 'Hannelore Hoger, Sigi Graue, Alfred Edel, Klaus Schwarzkopf, Bernd Höltz, Kurt Jürgens, Gilbert Houcke, Eva Oertel', null, 'A young circus director ends up going into television after her father, a trapeze performer, dies in a circus accident.', 'A young circus director ends up going into television after her father, a trapeze performer, dies in a circus accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAJQKddefFmKyEPGwSixY3yyljR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154582'),
  ('310886067498797108', 'Arturo''s Island', 1962, 'Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Roberto Gerardi, Mauro Severino', 'Damiano Damiani, Ugo Liberatore, Enrico Ribulsi', 'Vanni De Maigret, Key Meersman, Reginald Kernan, Gabriella Giorgelli, Luigi Giuliani, Elvira Tonelli, Luigi Zerbinati, Ireneo Petrucci', null, 'A lonely teenage boy, living isolated on an island, idolizes his distant father. Complications arise when his father brings home a young new wife, whom the boy falls for, and a recently released criminal, entangled in a web of complex relationships.', 'A lonely teenage boy, living isolated on an island, idolizes his distant father. Complications arise when his father brings home a young new wife, whom the boy falls for, and a recently released criminal, entangled in a web of complex relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKwZomqKFduMENv7FZQ9cGtgOrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143244'),
