  ('573745547930904724', 'Aruanda', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Vladimir Carvalho, Linduarte Noronha, João Ramiro Mello', 'Linduarte Noronha', 'Paulino Carneiro', null, 'The real story of Quilombo Olho d''Água from Serra do Talhado, in the state of Paraíba, Brazil, which became institutionally isolated from the rest of the country. Quilombos were runaway slave communities in colonial Brazil.', 'The real story of Quilombo Olho d''Água from Serra do Talhado, in the state of Paraíba, Brazil, which became institutionally isolated from the rest of the country. Quilombos were runaway slave communities in colonial Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rpYnUNVJOVSlHbfl4GQRfGNIK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329786'),
