  ('709763834676202171', 'As', 2023, null, 'Corné Wessels', null, null, null, 'Three years after the death of her beloved child, Elouise, Mara still feels her presence when she sits on the butterfly bedding in front of the jar with her ashes in it. Mara arranges a twelfth birthday party for Elouise, further alienating her from her husband, Richter, and remaining daughter, Hannah. Although Mara eventually vacates Elouise''s room at the insistence of her husband, she does find a way to stay close to Elouise. Before long, however, Hannah discovers her mother''s secret.', 'Three years after the death of her beloved child, Elouise, Mara still feels her presence when she sits on the butterfly bedding in front of the jar with her ashes in it. Mara arranges a twelfth birthday party for Elouise, further alienating her from her husband, Richter, and remaining daughter, Hannah. Although Mara eventually vacates Elouise''s room at the insistence of her husband, she does find a way to stay close to Elouise. Before long, however, Hannah discovers her mother''s secret.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1140817'),
  ('13608282102720090', 'As Above, So Below', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Erick Dowdle, Augustin Collet, Frédéric Cambon', 'John Erick Dowdle, Drew Dowdle', 'Perdita Weeks, Ben Feldman, Edwin Hodge, François Civil, Marion Lambert, Ali Marhyar, Cosme Castro, Hamid Djavadan', 'R', 'When a team of explorers venture into the catacombs that lie beneath the streets of Paris, they uncover the dark secret that lies within this city of the dead.', 'When a team of explorers venture into the catacombs that lie beneath the streets of Paris, they uncover the dark secret that lies within this city of the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJZSajKLJkoTOzSZQN2ZwRnPwHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256274'),
  ('779016397358265835', 'As Aventuras da Turma da Mônica', 1982, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Paulo José da Silva, Amélia Harue Hirota, Pio Zamuner', 'Mauricio de Sousa, Reinaldo Waisman', 'Maria Amélia Costa Manso, Ivete Jayme, Isaura Gomes, Silvia Cordeiro Marinho, Orlando Vigiani Filho, Denise Simonetto, Araken Saldanha, Ronaldo Batista', null, 'Embarking on a whimsical adventure, Monica and her friends take center stage in four captivating tales. The first, "O Plano Infalível," showcases Jimmy Five''s latest scheme to defeat Monica and her indomitable bunny companion. In "Um Amor de Ratinho," Monica attends a costume party dressed as a mouse, unaware that a small mishap would awaken a genuine mouse''s affectionate feelings towards her. The third story, "A Ermitã," sees Monica bid farewell to her friends, venturing alone into the heart of the forest to live an independent life. Lastly, in "O Império Empacota," Jimmy Five''s courage and true affection for Monica are unveiled when he fearlessly engages in an interplanetary battle against aliens, all in an effort to save his beloved big-toothed friend.', 'Embarking on a whimsical adventure, Monica and her friends take center stage in four captivating tales. The first, "O Plano Infalível," showcases Jimmy Five''s latest scheme to defeat Monica and her indomitable bunny companion. In "Um Amor de Ratinho," Monica attends a costume party dressed as a mouse, unaware that a small mishap would awaken a genuine mouse''s affectionate feelings towards her. The third story, "A Ermitã," sees Monica bid farewell to her friends, venturing alone into the heart of the forest to live an independent life. Lastly, in "O Império Empacota," Jimmy Five''s courage and true affection for Monica are unveiled when he fearlessly engages in an interplanetary battle against aliens, all in an effort to save his beloved big-toothed friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBEePgvAtegjgkFGeDzYAgprsfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244461'),
  ('1139516441217483910', 'As Aventuras de Pedro Malasartes', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Amacio Mazzaropi, Rudolf Icsey', 'Marcos Cesar, Galileu Garcia, Amacio Mazzaropi', 'Amacio Mazzaropi, Geny Prado, Nena Viana, Dorinha Duval, Noêmia Marcondes, Genésio Arruda, Augusto Machado de Campos, Benedito Liendo', null, 'It is the story of Pedro, who after being passed over by his brothers, wanders the world in search of a better life, but on the way, finds children who eventually conquer it, and in order to help them, he passes scamming other people he met along the way, telling lies, however, always with the goal of helping him new friends. And kills a cow.', 'It is the story of Pedro, who after being passed over by his brothers, wanders the world in search of a better life, but on the way, finds children who eventually conquer it, and in order to help them, he passes scamming other people he met along the way, telling lies, however, always with the goal of helping him new friends. And kills a cow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38vUpNIbGdjYEzjBw0X4GbIIv5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75212'),
  ('437148418060839368', 'As Cool as I Am', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Max Mayer, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Virginia Korus Spragg', 'Sarah Bolger, Thomas Mann, James Marsden, Claire Danes, Seth Adkins, Jeremy Sisto, Jon Tenney, Anika Noni Rose', 'R', 'A smart teenage girl comes of age in a small town with her self-centered parents who had her when they were teenagers.', 'A smart teenage girl comes of age in a small town with her self-centered parents who had her when they were teenagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izoKkDJCbYhIkrPzpCcwrqg2K90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83869'),
  ('200275467471371312', 'As Far As My Feet Will Carry Me', 2001, 'Drama, War', 'Hardy Martins, Pavel Lebeshev', 'Bastian Clevé', 'Bernhard Bettermann, Michael Mendl, Anatoliy Kotenyov, André Hennicke, Hans Peter Hallwachs, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Antonio Wannek, Irina Narbekova', null, 'The German soldier Clemens Forel - determined to be reunited with his beloved family - makes a dramatic escape through bitter cold winters, desolate landscapes, and life threatening ventures from a Siberian labor camp after World War II. 8000 miles and three endless years of uncertainty later, he is finally about to reach his destination... An edge of your seat drama that celebrates the power of the human spirit and the force of will, while inspired and impowered by love.', 'The German soldier Clemens Forel - determined to be reunited with his beloved family - makes a dramatic escape through bitter cold winters, desolate landscapes, and life threatening ventures from a Siberian labor camp after World War II. 8000 miles and three endless years of uncertainty later, he is finally about to reach his destination... An edge of your seat drama that celebrates the power of the human spirit and the force of will, while inspired and impowered by love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSZTNaN7OqeRw1CT4hhcaw8imcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11476'),
  ('1105891231150497197', 'As God Commands', 2008, 'Drama', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Niccolò Ammaniti, Gabriele Salvatores, Antonio Manzini', 'Filippo Timi, Elio Germano, Alvaro Caleca, Angelica Leo, Fabio De Luigi, Alessandro Mizzi, Corinna Agustoni, Alessandro Bressanello', null, 'An 11-year-old boy and his neo-Nazi dad struggle with being outcasts in their suburban town.', 'An 11-year-old boy and his neo-Nazi dad struggle with being outcasts in their suburban town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpMk5TxrdzP1UMbKC0e29OsYlvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24168'),
  ('1082517315981426809', 'As Good as Dead', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'R. Ellis Frazier, Jorge Román', 'Michael Jai White', 'Tom Berenger, Michael Jai White, Louis Mandylor, Gillian White, Michael Copon, Gabriella Quezada, Luca Oriel, Roberto ''Sanz'' Sanchez', null, 'An ex-cop in self-imposed witness protection in Mexico becomes a target when a fight video of his apprentice goes viral.', 'An ex-cop in self-imposed witness protection in Mexico becomes a target when a fight video of his apprentice goes viral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqQPxxRQqfLrq0ubfDQCwhJHZ91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028248'),
  ('387028027327181387', 'As Good As Dead', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Jonathan Mossek, Frank Barrera', 'Christopher J. Smith', 'Andie MacDowell, Cary Elwes, Frank Whaley, Matt Dallas, Nicole Ansari-Cox, Brian Cox, Clark Middleton, Emma Kantor', 'R', 'Seeking revenge for the murder of their religious leader, fundamental loyalists kidnap and torture the man they believe responsible, but the ensuing clash of right vs. left ideologies quickly reveals that they may have the wrong man, which puts them on a path toward a shocking twist', 'Seeking revenge for the murder of their religious leader, fundamental loyalists kidnap and torture the man they believe responsible, but the ensuing clash of right vs. left ideologies quickly reveals that they may have the wrong man, which puts them on a path toward a shocking twist', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1EkPYI578e2MYcmqhttuRzu7y7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35656'),
  ('734329394791947596', 'As Good as It Gets', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'James L. Brooks, Aldric La''Auli Porter, William M. Connor', 'Mark Andrus, James L. Brooks', 'Jack Nicholson, Helen Hunt, Greg Kinnear, Cuba Gooding Jr., Shirley Knight, Jesse James, Yeardley Smith, Lupe Ontiveros', 'PG-13', 'A misanthropic author, a single mother and waitress, and a gay artist form an unlikely friendship after the artist is assaulted in a robbery.', 'A misanthropic author, a single mother and waitress, and a gay artist form an unlikely friendship after the artist is assaulted in a robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXxuJPNUDZ0vjsAXca0O5p3leVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2898'),
  ('132072952904883662', 'As Green As It Gets', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daniela Knapp, Florian Gallenberger', 'Gernot Gricksch, Florian Gallenberger', 'Elmar Wepper, Emma Bading, Monika Baumgartner, Dagmar Manzel, Ulrich Tukur, Sunnyi Melles, Karolina Horster, Gudrun Ritter', null, 'Georg "Schorsch" Kempter is a gardener in a small Bavarian town, working day-in, day-out in his nursery, which is facing bankruptcy. He doesn''t like to talk much. He never has. His marriage has long lost all its magic and on top of that, he has trouble to connect with his daughter. Only when he is flying in his own rickety biplane, Schorsch feels truly free. When the owner of the local golf course tries to cheat Schorsch for his money, claiming the shade of green of the grass Schorsch has planted on the golf course is not right, insolvency seems unavoidable. So just when his airplane is about to be impounded, Schorsch grabs the control stick and flies away in an attempt to save his plane and himself. He embarks onto a journey into the unknown, to places he has never seen before, full of odd and special encounters - and with every take-off and every landing, this tough man''s heart slowly warms up to what you might call an idea of happiness.', 'Georg "Schorsch" Kempter is a gardener in a small Bavarian town, working day-in, day-out in his nursery, which is facing bankruptcy. He doesn''t like to talk much. He never has. His marriage has long lost all its magic and on top of that, he has trouble to connect with his daughter. Only when he is flying in his own rickety biplane, Schorsch feels truly free. When the owner of the local golf course tries to cheat Schorsch for his money, claiming the shade of green of the grass Schorsch has planted on the golf course is not right, insolvency seems unavoidable. So just when his airplane is about to be impounded, Schorsch grabs the control stick and flies away in an attempt to save his plane and himself. He embarks onto a journey into the unknown, to places he has never seen before, full of odd and special encounters - and with every take-off and every landing, this tough man''s heart slowly warms up to what you might call an idea of happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bMmBhaT6Hcc5iAXaIYXmd4hiIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483366'),
  ('58274384569704464', 'As Happy As Possible', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alain Raoust, Lucie Baudinaud', 'Alain Raoust, Cécile Vargaftig', 'Salomé Richard, Yoann Zimmer, Estelle Meyer, Jacques Bonnaffé, Christine Citti, Aude Briant, Carl Malapa, Iliana Zebeth', null, 'Salome gets a summer job in a junkyard somewhere in the country side. Under a western sun, in this place out of the world, her teenage rebellion springs up. From unexpected encounters to shared sorrows, arise promises of a new life.', 'Salome gets a summer job in a junkyard somewhere in the country side. Under a western sun, in this place out of the world, her teenage rebellion springs up. From unexpected encounters to shared sorrows, arise promises of a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHSdy4DTDLH70f6tpDEZaq5jS3k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597691'),
  ('42274820918743238', 'As I Lay Dying', 2013, 'Drama', 'James Franco, Christina Alexandra Voros, Caroline Aragon', 'James Franco, Matt Rager', 'James Franco, Danny McBride, Logan Marshall-Green, Ahna O''Reilly, Jim Parrack, Tim Blake Nelson, Beth Grant, Jennifer Kristen Howell', 'R', 'Strife and disaster befall a poor Mississippi family during a two-day trip by horse and wagon to bury their deceased matriarch.', 'Strife and disaster befall a poor Mississippi family during a two-day trip by horse and wagon to bury their deceased matriarch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9blwnvKBmFDwNTmFeSt7Z26XgMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152745'),
  ('765219547879879823', 'As I Open My Eyes', 2015, 'Drama', 'Sébastien Goepfert, Leyla Bouzid', 'Marie-Sophie Chambon, Leyla Bouzid', 'Baya Medhaffer, Ghalia Ben Ali, Montassar Ayari, Aymen Omrani, Lassaad Jamoussi, Deena Abdelwahed, Youssef Soltana, Marwen Soltana', null, 'Tunis, summer 2010, a few months before the Revolution: Farah, 18 years old, has just graduated and her family already sees her as a future doctor. But she doesn''t have the same idea. She sings in a political rock band, has a passion for life, gets drunk, discovers love and her city by night against the wishes of her mother Hayet, who knows Tunisia and its dangers all too well.', 'Tunis, summer 2010, a few months before the Revolution: Farah, 18 years old, has just graduated and her family already sees her as a future doctor. But she doesn''t have the same idea. She sings in a political rock band, has a passion for life, gets drunk, discovers love and her city by night against the wishes of her mother Hayet, who knows Tunisia and its dangers all too well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSdUEsu3vAgUepn2iJzYLS5LEvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356381'),
  ('811380954285420829', 'As I Was Moving Ahead, Occasionally I Saw Brief Glimpses of Beauty', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas', 'Jonas Mekas, Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening, Robert Breer, Hollis Frampton, Allen Ginsberg, Ken Jacobs, Peter Kubelka', null, 'A compilation of over 30 years of private home movie footage shot by Lithuanian-American avant-garde director Jonas Mekas, assembled by Mekas "purely by chance", without concern for chronological order.', 'A compilation of over 30 years of private home movie footage shot by Lithuanian-American avant-garde director Jonas Mekas, assembled by Mekas "purely by chance", without concern for chronological order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDaxB5juEGwXD7oZwh8IXsnisar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130824'),
  ('501260190765005131', 'As If It Were the First Time', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Mauricio T. Valle', 'Mauricio T. Valle', 'Ximena Romo, Vadhir Derbez, Alejandro Camacho, Iliana Fox, Loraida Bobadilla, Paco Rueda', null, 'A man falls in love with a girl who has short-term memory loss.', 'A man falls in love with a girl who has short-term memory loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ir6qRvE54mrCkToyIqoxyOPKAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555790'),
  ('785384726147611438', 'As in Heaven', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tea Lindeburg, Marcel Zyskind', 'Tea Lindeburg', 'Flora Ofelia Hofmann Lindahl, Ida Cæcilie Rasmussen, Palma Lindeburg Leth, Anna-Olivia Øster Coakley, Flora Augusta, Kirsten Olesen, Lisbet Dahl, Stine Fischer Christensen', null, 'One day at the end of the 1800s, 14-year-old Lise’s life is changed forever. She is the eldest of her siblings, the first in her family to go to school and full of hope and confidence in life. But when her mother goes into labour, it quickly appears that something is wrong. As night falls and the labour progresses, Lise begins to understand that a day that began in childhood might end with her becoming the woman of the house.', 'One day at the end of the 1800s, 14-year-old Lise’s life is changed forever. She is the eldest of her siblings, the first in her family to go to school and full of hope and confidence in life. But when her mother goes into labour, it quickly appears that something is wrong. As night falls and the labour progresses, Lise begins to understand that a day that began in childhood might end with her becoming the woman of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbypiQf40ReopnfbW9eFKJmboA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853361'),
  ('695693321353664402', 'As It Is in Heaven', 2004, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Kay Pollak, Harald Gunnar Paalgard', 'Kay Pollak, Carin Pollak, Anders Nyberg', 'Michael Nyqvist, Frida Hallgren, Helen Sjöholm, Lennart Jähkel, Ingela Olsson, Verena Buratti, Ulla-Britt Norrman-Olsson, Per Morberg', null, 'A musical romantic tragedy about a famous composer who moves back to his small hometown after having had heart troubles. His search for a simple everyday life leads him into teaching the local church choir, which is not easily accepted by the town yet the choir builds a great love for their teacher.', 'A musical romantic tragedy about a famous composer who moves back to his small hometown after having had heart troubles. His search for a simple everyday life leads him into teaching the local church choir, which is not easily accepted by the town yet the choir builds a great love for their teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygJ6RQQSmXRQLPpUKP9SCdKXSKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464'),
  ('510089522922814387', 'As Long as Shotguns Remain', 2014, 'Family, Drama', 'Caroline Poggi, Jonathan Vinel, Adrien Machado', 'Caroline Poggi, Jonathan Vinel', 'Lucas Doméjean, Nicolas Mias, Naël Malassagne, Benoit Roux, Jimmy Chaigne, Niko Fion-Fion, Dominique Mustel, Allan Picolo', null, 'Two young men in a nearly abandoned suburban landscape deal with the suicide of one of their friends by shotgunning beers and joining a gang.', 'Two young men in a nearly abandoned suburban landscape deal with the suicide of one of their friends by shotgunning beers and joining a gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxjRJFChzYAoor0yyyWCWpB3pKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323730'),
  ('980367265960147812', 'As Long as You''ve Got Your Health', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Étaix, Jean Boffety', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Pierre Étaix', 'Pierre Étaix, Denise Péronne, Simone Fonder, Sabine Sun, Véra Valmont, Françoise Occipinti, Claude Massot, Dario Meschi', null, 'An anthology film consisting of four stories. (1) A man reads a Dracula novel while in bed, but cannot seem to tell the novel from reality, causing sleep troubles. (2) A man cannot escape the absurd ads he saw at the movie theater that day. (3) A polluted and construction-ridden town keeps everybody on edge, sending one man to the doctor. (4) A hunter, a farmer and a couple on a picnic unknowingly cause continuous trouble for one another.', 'An anthology film consisting of four stories. (1) A man reads a Dracula novel while in bed, but cannot seem to tell the novel from reality, causing sleep troubles. (2) A man cannot escape the absurd ads he saw at the movie theater that day. (3) A polluted and construction-ridden town keeps everybody on edge, sending one man to the doctor. (4) A hunter, a farmer and a couple on a picnic unknowingly cause continuous trouble for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5mYSrUTCMe9XVg8hhHxu3km3g7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143796'),
  ('330551746266409966', 'As Luck Would Have It', 2002, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Lorenzo Gabriele, Pierre Abela, Thylane Zimmermann', 'Philippe Le Dem', 'Jean-Claude Brialy, Sabine Haudepin, Julien Bravo, Antonio Interlandi, Elena Noverraz, Lorriane Cherpillod, Jacques Michel, Anne Kreis', null, 'Jean-Pierre is a literature professor in Switzerland. Due to the vagarities of Swiss law, he is selected, basically at random, to be the guardian of a parentless teenage boy named Antoine. Conflict comes into the story as Jean-Pierre, who has just accepted a major promotion, must now deal with caring for a teenage boy he doesn''t want to care for, as well as handling his own jealous boyfriend. Then his wife steps into the picture. Things get complicated from there as Jean-Pierre tries to get out of his guardianship.', 'Jean-Pierre is a literature professor in Switzerland. Due to the vagarities of Swiss law, he is selected, basically at random, to be the guardian of a parentless teenage boy named Antoine. Conflict comes into the story as Jean-Pierre, who has just accepted a major promotion, must now deal with caring for a teenage boy he doesn''t want to care for, as well as handling his own jealous boyfriend. Then his wife steps into the picture. Things get complicated from there as Jean-Pierre tries to get out of his guardianship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14roK063JyBEQMMTCcNKBZlfjG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40941'),
  ('47161189678451056', 'As Luck Would Have It', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kiko de la Rica, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Randy Feldman', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Santiago Segura, Carolina Bang, Blanca Portillo, José Mota, Nacho Vigalondo, Javier Botet, Concha García Campoy', null, 'Roberto is an unemployed publicist who achieved success when he thought of a famous slogan: "Coca-Cola, the spark of life." Now he is a desperate man, trying to remember the happy days, back to the hotel where he spent the honeymoon with his wife. However, instead of the hotel, he finds a museum built around the Roman theater in the city. While walking through the ruins, he has an accident, an iron rod sticks into his head and leaves him completely paralyzed. If he tries to move he would die. Roberto becomes the focus of the media, which will change his life ...', 'Roberto is an unemployed publicist who achieved success when he thought of a famous slogan: "Coca-Cola, the spark of life." Now he is a desperate man, trying to remember the happy days, back to the hotel where he spent the honeymoon with his wife. However, instead of the hotel, he finds a museum built around the Roman theater in the city. While walking through the ruins, he has an accident, an iron rod sticks into his head and leaves him completely paralyzed. If he tries to move he would die. Roberto becomes the focus of the media, which will change his life ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUrp6iLFKxij6bLH1yIeFC6KGMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84797'),
  ('333615911048390667', 'As Luck Would Have It', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Robertson, Clare Niederpruem', null, 'JoAnna Garcia Swisher, Allen Leech, Niall Buggy, Nick Dunning, Rosemary Henderson, Fiana Toibin, Stephanie Dufresne, Joan Sheehy', 'G', 'When Lindsey travels to Ireland to acquire land that is perfect for a resort, she decides to enter the town''s matchmaking festival to prove her investment—and win over a handsome local.', 'When Lindsey travels to Ireland to acquire land that is perfect for a resort, she decides to enter the town''s matchmaking festival to prove her investment—and win over a handsome local.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50dVUPdEI1qWhiTnIWN3NIZqftn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795980'),
  ('977790318022174362', 'As Mães de Chico Xavier', 2011, 'Drama', 'Glauber Filho, Halder Gomes, Carina Sanginitto', 'Glauber Filho, Emmanuel Nogueira', 'Nelson Xavier, Vanessa Gerbelli, Via Negromonte, Tainá Müller, Caio Blat, Herson Capri, Gustavo Falcão, Paulo Goulart Filho', null, 'Three mothers see their reality become completely, they are: Ruth, whose teenage son, Raul, faces problems with drugs; Elisa, trying to make up for the absence of her husband giving full attention to the child, the little Theo, and Lara, teacher who faces the dilemma of an unplanned pregnancy. These three women, living in different times of their lives, seeking comfort next to Chico Xavier. And Karl reporter remains insisting on interviewing the medium, even without being prepared for it.', 'Three mothers see their reality become completely, they are: Ruth, whose teenage son, Raul, faces problems with drugs; Elisa, trying to make up for the absence of her husband giving full attention to the child, the little Theo, and Lara, teacher who faces the dilemma of an unplanned pregnancy. These three women, living in different times of their lives, seeking comfort next to Chico Xavier. And Karl reporter remains insisting on interviewing the medium, even without being prepared for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clnDNQsAH75mw8gfaBnRQGOHxGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69885'),
  ('106677714241141027', 'As Needed', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Stefano Falivene, Leopoldo Pescatore, Francesco Falaschi', 'Federico Sperindei, Ugo Chiti, Filippo Bologna', 'Vinicio Marchioni, Valeria Solarino, Luigi Fedele, Nicola Siri, Mirko Frezza, Stephanie de Jongh, Benedetta Porcaroli, Gianfranco Gallo', null, 'A 40-year-old world-famous chef with anger management issues is assigned to run a cooking class at a centre for young people with autism.', 'A 40-year-old world-famous chef with anger management issues is assigned to run a cooking class at a centre for young people with autism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f14DMVGHVZSTr6DHHcDsP2ML6jP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508206'),
  ('810478632221925731', 'As Not to Fly the Smoke', 1984, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Ahmed Yehia, Kamal El Hummusany, Essam Farid', 'Mostafa Moharram', 'Adel Emam, Sohier Ramzy, Ahmad Rateb, Sanaa Shafea, Fekry Abaza, Nadia Arslan, Youssef Fawzy, Nagwa Al Mogy', null, 'Fahmi Abdul Hadi .. A distinguished student of law school .. His dreams are simple and his actions are ideal and pure .. Fahmi collides with the bitter reality of life when losing his mother because he cannot afford the price of her treatment. At a time, He watches his colleagues around him spend money like water and making fun of his poverty and even refuse to help him to treat his mother. Fahmi decides to abandon the idealism and take revenge of all who failed him.', 'Fahmi Abdul Hadi .. A distinguished student of law school .. His dreams are simple and his actions are ideal and pure .. Fahmi collides with the bitter reality of life when losing his mother because he cannot afford the price of her treatment. At a time, He watches his colleagues around him spend money like water and making fun of his poverty and even refuse to help him to treat his mother. Fahmi decides to abandon the idealism and take revenge of all who failed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQw5GCWH4QzP7I4XsoEwgrHVlSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336791'),
  ('997583450113040959', 'As One', 2012, 'Drama', 'Moon Hyun-sung, Lee Doo-man, Kang Seong-hoon', 'Kwon Sung-hui, Yu Young-ah', 'Ha Ji-won, Bae Doona, Han Ye-ri, Park Cheol-min, Kim Eung-soo, Lee Jong-suk, Oh Jung-se, Park Young-seo', null, 'A unified team representing the two Koreas competed at the 1991 Chiba International Table Tennis Championships. It was the first such sport team since the division of the Korean peninsula. The unified team won the group competition event, beating the front runner, China.', 'A unified team representing the two Koreas competed at the 1991 Chiba International Table Tennis Championships. It was the first such sport team since the division of the Korean peninsula. The unified team won the group competition event, beating the front runner, China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIfoS8cTLFXU2ocrH8hwZatCMkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113388'),
  ('422597236690981705', 'As Silence Passes by', 2024, 'Drama', 'Sandra Romero Acevedo, Angello Faccini', 'Sandra Romero Acevedo', 'Antonio Araque, Javier Araque, Mona Martínez, Tamara Casellas, Nico Montoya, Emmanuel Medina, María Araque', null, 'Antonio (30) returns to his home after a long absence. He then discovers that his family is on the brink of falling apart because of his fraternal twin, who suffers from severe back malformation. Now, he is going to have to face him.', 'Antonio (30) returns to his home after a long absence. He then discovers that his family is on the brink of falling apart because of his fraternal twin, who suffers from severe back malformation. Now, he is going to have to face him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aKtm3aePdpThS2cWx6z4ohr95l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172267'),
