  ('547103350167715719', 'As the Gods Will', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Ryûsuke Kurahashi', 'Hiroyuki Yatsu', 'Sota Fukushi, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Hirona Yamazaki, Mio Yuki, Jingi Irie, Shota Sometani, Nao Omori, Nijiro Murakami', 'R', 'High school student Shun Takahata is bored. Bored with the day-to-day monotony of school and life, he prays for change, for something exciting. Suddenly, he and his classmates are forced to play deadly children''s games and facing terrifying creatures from a talking Daruma doll to a sharp-clawed lucky cat.', 'High school student Shun Takahata is bored. Bored with the day-to-day monotony of school and life, he prays for change, for something exciting. Suddenly, he and his classmates are forced to play deadly children''s games and facing terrifying creatures from a talking Daruma doll to a sharp-clawed lucky cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Obn9IR47fjhbtYtNrO7CBSrZ2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241863'),
  ('249965977504450650', 'As the Light Goes Out', 2014, 'Drama, Action', 'Clement Cheng Si-Kit, Joe Fong Si-Hang, Lemon Liu Yi-Man', 'Derek Kwok Chi-Kin', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Simon Yam, Hu Jun, Michelle Bai, William Chan, Andy On Chi-Kit, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man', null, 'Firefighters in Hong Kong''s Pillar Point uncover dangerous truths as they battle an out-of-control inferno on Christmas Eve.', 'Firefighters in Hong Kong''s Pillar Point uncover dangerous truths as they battle an out-of-control inferno on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HKm1a5k8oAY12mHpn5spXypXxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247954'),
  ('574695779856766967', 'As the Moon', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joël Séria, Marcel Combes', 'Joël Séria', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Sophie Daumier, Dominique Lavanant, Marco Perrin, Anna Gaylor, Jacques Rispal, René Berthier, Jeanne Hardeyn', null, 'Normandy, France, 1976. After 2 years of wild love with Nadia, Pouplard, an unemployed heating engineer working in his girlfriend''s butcher shop, decides to marry her and leave his wife and daughter. He''ll have to struggle against his own jealousy and Nadia''s incredible sex appeal to get through this ''moment de vie''.', 'Normandy, France, 1976. After 2 years of wild love with Nadia, Pouplard, an unemployed heating engineer working in his girlfriend''s butcher shop, decides to marry her and leave his wife and daughter. He''ll have to struggle against his own jealousy and Nadia''s incredible sex appeal to get through this ''moment de vie''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rSAK9rw8DGrIsjjlAQpBGK19jC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78280'),
  ('684972917965712763', 'As They Made Us', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'David Feeney-Mosier, Mayim Bialik', 'Mayim Bialik', 'Dianna Agron, Simon Helberg, Candice Bergen, Dustin Hoffman, Justin Chu Cary, Charlie Weber, Julian Gant, Gina Jun', 'R', 'Abigail, a divorced mother of two, is struggling to balance the dynamics within her dysfunctional family as she attempts to cultivate new love.', 'Abigail, a divorced mother of two, is struggling to balance the dynamics within her dysfunctional family as she attempts to cultivate new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qypGmqMTIT6PmDzmM3i2Aexaxug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644100'),
