  ('612025894532854447', 'As You Are', 2016, 'Drama', 'Miles Joris-Peyrafitte, Caleb Heymann', 'Miles Joris-Peyrafitte, Madison Harrison', 'Owen Campbell, Charlie Heaton, Amandla Stenberg, John Scurti, Scott Cohen, Mary Stuart Masterson, Annemarie Lawless, Andrew Polk', 'NR', 'Set in the early 1990s, "As You Are" is the telling and retelling of a relationship between three teenagers as it traces the course of their friendship through a construction of disparate memories prompted by a police investigation.', 'Set in the early 1990s, "As You Are" is the telling and retelling of a relationship between three teenagers as it traces the course of their friendship through a construction of disparate memories prompted by a police investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44IZLl6wD8aI8HXbJLqiMqEFtph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371445'),
  ('725932719657969832', 'As You Desire Me', 1932, 'Drama', 'George Fitzmaurice, Douglas Shearer, William H. Daniels', 'Gene Markey', 'Greta Garbo, Melvyn Douglas, Erich von Stroheim, Owen Moore, Hedda Hopper, Rafaela Ottiano, Warburton Gamble, Albert Conti', null, 'Bar entertainer Zara is a discontented alcoholic who is pursued by many men but lives with novelist Carl Salter. One day, Tony shows up on Salter''s estate claiming that Zara is actually Maria, the wife of his close friend Bruno, claiming that her memory was destroyed during World War I. Zara doesn''t remember but leaves with Tony to Salter''s dismay. Bruno, now an officer in the Italian Army, tries to coax Maria''s memory back on his large estate. No one is really sure if Zara is Maria, and when Salter shows up with a mental case from Trieste that he claims is the real Maria, everyone on Bruno''s estate is desperately searching for the truth.', 'Bar entertainer Zara is a discontented alcoholic who is pursued by many men but lives with novelist Carl Salter. One day, Tony shows up on Salter''s estate claiming that Zara is actually Maria, the wife of his close friend Bruno, claiming that her memory was destroyed during World War I. Zara doesn''t remember but leaves with Tony to Salter''s dismay. Bruno, now an officer in the Italian Army, tries to coax Maria''s memory back on his large estate. No one is really sure if Zara is Maria, and when Salter shows up with a mental case from Trieste that he claims is the real Maria, everyone on Bruno''s estate is desperately searching for the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeBVdQgy1tP83JxmsOZpkwQjzSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150397'),
  ('439550715076768218', 'As You Like It', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Paul Czinner, Harold Rosson, Teddy Baird', 'Robert Cullen', 'Laurence Olivier, Felix Aylmer, Elisabeth Bergner, John Laurie, Lionel Braham, Austin Trevor, Sophie Stewart, Henry Ainley', 'NR', 'Film version of Shakespeare''s comedy of a young woman who disguises herself as a man to win the attention of the one she loves.', 'Film version of Shakespeare''s comedy of a young woman who disguises herself as a man to win the attention of the one she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFqeRUmLdW00qmRvxXFOsRQ0mfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43870'),
  ('474574676733293833', 'As You Like It', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kenneth Branagh, Roger Lanser, Josh Robertson', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'Romola Garai, Kevin Kline, Bryce Dallas Howard, Adrian Lester, Janet McTeer, Alfred Molina, David Oyelowo, Jimmy Yuill', 'PG', 'Witty, playful and utterly magical, the story is a compelling romantic adventure in which Rosalind and Orlando''s celebrated courtship is played out against a backdrop of political rivalry, banishment and exile in the Forest of Arden - set in 19th-century Japan.', 'Witty, playful and utterly magical, the story is a compelling romantic adventure in which Rosalind and Orlando''s celebrated courtship is played out against a backdrop of political rivalry, banishment and exile in the Forest of Arden - set in 19th-century Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/628YkM5wHmunTdXANWgJEJYbFdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19103'),
  ('824772926502287747', 'As You Want Me', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carmine Amoroso, Raffaele Mertes', 'Carmine Amoroso', 'Enrico Lo Verso, Vincent Cassel, Monica Bellucci, Francesco Casale, Urbano Barberini, Memè Perlini, Edoardo Rossi, Bed Cerchiai', null, 'Pasquale is a policeman in Roma. During a roundup he meets Desideria. He/she is a transsexual, living together with other two trans , Gaia and Gioia. But overall Desideria is an old friend of Pasquale, they already been attending the same schools. Desideria immediately fall in love for Pasquale. But the policeman has a fiancé, Nellina, even if too far so they meet rarely. That''s why Pasquale could change idea about Desideria.', 'Pasquale is a policeman in Roma. During a roundup he meets Desideria. He/she is a transsexual, living together with other two trans , Gaia and Gioia. But overall Desideria is an old friend of Pasquale, they already been attending the same schools. Desideria immediately fall in love for Pasquale. But the policeman has a fiancé, Nellina, even if too far so they meet rarely. That''s why Pasquale could change idea about Desideria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JGdM4irWjHedORKLnBFVHoHEdM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409509'),
  ('228812622021068322', 'As Young as You Feel', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Harmon Jones, Joseph MacDonald', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Monty Woolley, Thelma Ritter, David Wayne, Jean Peters, Constance Bennett, Marilyn Monroe, Allyn Joslyn, Albert Dekker', 'NR', 'Sixty-five-year-old John Hodges must retire from Acme Printing. He later impersonates the president of the parent company and arrives at his old plant on an inspection tour. Acme president McKinley is so nervous not even his beautiful secretary Harriet can calm him. McKinley''s wife Lucille becomes infatuated with Hodges. Many further complications ensue.', 'Sixty-five-year-old John Hodges must retire from Acme Printing. He later impersonates the president of the parent company and arrives at his old plant on an inspection tour. Acme president McKinley is so nervous not even his beautiful secretary Harriet can calm him. McKinley''s wife Lucille becomes infatuated with Hodges. Many further complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XuI2PYIt3bUBVeiSwrGsIOBclU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45581'),
