  ('702825191471308234', 'Asebamu Akahadaka Tsuma', 2017, null, null, null, 'Saeko Matsushita', null, 'One day in midsummer, Uchida, a contractor, visits Sawako''s house to check the air conditioner. Seeing Uchida''s wide chest muscles tanned with her moderate chocolate color, her married woman Sawako felt the trembling of her chest in an instant. She tries hard to hide her feelings, but her Uchida penetrates Sawako''s heart and approaches her...', 'One day in midsummer, Uchida, a contractor, visits Sawako''s house to check the air conditioner. Seeing Uchida''s wide chest muscles tanned with her moderate chocolate color, her married woman Sawako felt the trembling of her chest in an instant. She tries hard to hide her feelings, but her Uchida penetrates Sawako''s heart and approaches her...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faJskm5nNutoxfORCtODQewzKDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860410'),
  ('296396712533239508', 'Asesinato en la Universidad', 2018, 'Drama, History, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Iñaki Peñafiel, Teo Delgado', 'Joaquín Llamas, Antonio Asencio, Clara Pérez Escrivá', 'Leonor Watling, Patrick Criado, Daniel Grao, Macarena Sanz, Fernando Soto, Chani Martín, Fernando Albizu, Ramon Agirre', null, 'In 1543, at the University of Salamanca, in Spain, Fray Antonio Román, an Augustinian monk who spreads humanist ideas, considered heretical, among his more inquisitive students, a clandestine group of four led by the brilliant novice Luis de León, mysteriously dies in unspeakable circumstances. In the present day, the historian Lara Cabanes is hired to find out if the monk was murdered, as is suspected and she is told, but the task will not be easy to achieve.', 'In 1543, at the University of Salamanca, in Spain, Fray Antonio Román, an Augustinian monk who spreads humanist ideas, considered heretical, among his more inquisitive students, a clandestine group of four led by the brilliant novice Luis de León, mysteriously dies in unspeakable circumstances. In the present day, the historian Lara Cabanes is hired to find out if the monk was murdered, as is suspected and she is told, but the task will not be easy to achieve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e95XScueS35iJBOX2KGD3lqPxfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558295'),
  ('657946078297538773', 'Asfalto', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Daniel Calparsoro', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Frank Palacios, Santiago Tabernero', 'Najwa Nimri, Juan Diego Botto, Gustavo Salmerón, Antonia San Juan, Rubén Ochandiano', null, 'Three young and desperate inhabitants of Madrid attempt to rise above their circumstances by any means available to them in that sun-drenched city. This tight-knit trio must scramble when their hasty plans become derailed by a demanding matriarch, an abusive older brother, and the entire corrupt underclass with which they deal.', 'Three young and desperate inhabitants of Madrid attempt to rise above their circumstances by any means available to them in that sun-drenched city. This tight-knit trio must scramble when their hasty plans become derailed by a demanding matriarch, an abusive older brother, and the entire corrupt underclass with which they deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqGIqDz7Eh0pnkk0neQC6qiAvmI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167087'),
