  ('964439017172654486', 'Ash Is Purest White', 2018, 'Crime, Romance, Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Éric Gautier, Wang Jing', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Zhao Tao, Liao Fan, Diao Yinan, Ding Jiali, Dong Zijian, Xu Zheng, Zhang Yibai, Zhang Yi', 'NR', 'Set in China''s underworld, this tale of love and betrayal follows a dancer who fired a gun to protect her mobster boyfriend during a fight. On release from prison 5 years later, she sets out to find him.', 'Set in China''s underworld, this tale of love and betrayal follows a dancer who fired a gun to protect her mobster boyfriend during a fight. On release from prison 5 years later, she sets out to find him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6UkF23uWkO25x7UEMnT0H4R5GR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441393'),
