  ('84159266701146467', 'Ashakal Aayiram', 2026, 'Family, Drama', 'G. Prajith, Swaroop Philip', 'Aravind Rajendran, Jude Anthany Joseph', 'Jayaram, Kalidas Jayaram, Asha Sarath, Sharafudheen, Ramesh Pisharody', null, 'A social media enthusiast chases fame until a major film production arrives in his neighborhood, suddenly bringing his dreams of stardom within reach in ways he never imagined.', 'A social media enthusiast chases fame until a major film production arrives in his neighborhood, suddenly bringing his dreams of stardom within reach in ways he never imagined.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fdn025nJaG2ZKDA19ymPfZWUwPEH.jpg', 'plex:movie:ashakal-aayiram-2026'),
  ('825718859526707176', 'Ashamed', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kim Soo-hyun', 'Kim Soo-hyun', 'Kim Hyo-jin, Kim Kkob-bi, Kim Sang Hyeon, Seo Hyun-jin, Kim Sun-hyuk', null, 'Arts professor Jung Ji Woo is searching for a nude model for a video clip that will be played at her exhibition. When Hee-jin, one of her students, recommends Yoon Ji Woo for the job, the three woman head to the beach to shoot the video. As they spend time together, Yoon Ji Woo begins to share pieces of her past relationship with Kang Ji Woo. The film weaves the pasts and presents of the three Ji Woos and focuses on their intersecting relationship.', 'Arts professor Jung Ji Woo is searching for a nude model for a video clip that will be played at her exhibition. When Hee-jin, one of her students, recommends Yoon Ji Woo for the job, the three woman head to the beach to shoot the video. As they spend time together, Yoon Ji Woo begins to share pieces of her past relationship with Kang Ji Woo. The film weaves the pasts and presents of the three Ji Woos and focuses on their intersecting relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ol1ecl1QNAde5ejmuMJNcFWY3Kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272431'),
  ('286894281583688982', 'Ashanti', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Richard Fleischer, Tony Brandt, Alan Elledge', 'Stephen Geller', 'Michael Caine, Peter Ustinov, Kabir Bedi, Omar Sharif, Beverly Johnson, Rex Harrison, William Holden, Zia Mohyeddin', 'R', 'Dr. Anansa Linderby is kidnapped in a medical mission in Africa by a slave trader. From this moment, her husband will do anything to recover her and to punish the bad guys, but that will be not an easy task.', 'Dr. Anansa Linderby is kidnapped in a medical mission in Africa by a slave trader. From this moment, her husband will do anything to recover her and to punish the bad guys, but that will be not an easy task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26Xd07LUsQorC11D9dL6MAVBWkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57926'),
  ('685874844097848841', 'Ashby', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Tony McNamara, Christopher Baffa, Jonathan Southard', 'Tony McNamara', 'Mickey Rourke, Nat Wolff, Emma Roberts, Sarah Silverman, Adam Aalderks, Seth Dousman, Kevin Dunn, Zachary Knighton', 'R', 'When new kid in town Ed Wallis is given an assignment to interview an older person, he turns to his mysterious neighbor, Ashby Holt for help. That new connection leads to unexpected journeys for both of them, as Ashby – who turns out to be a retired CIA assassin – deals with a terminal prognosis, and Ed deals with adjusting to life with his newly single mom and developing relationship with a brainy classmate, Eloise.', 'When new kid in town Ed Wallis is given an assignment to interview an older person, he turns to his mysterious neighbor, Ashby Holt for help. That new connection leads to unexpected journeys for both of them, as Ashby – who turns out to be a retired CIA assassin – deals with a terminal prognosis, and Ed deals with adjusting to life with his newly single mom and developing relationship with a brainy classmate, Eloise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQDEvfqoYD33JnMWKccVDeWOkVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330112'),
  ('355772736212070133', 'Asher', 2018, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Denis Crossan, Daniel Sharnoff', 'Jay Zaretsky', 'Ron Perlman, Famke Janssen, Richard Dreyfuss, Jacqueline Bisset, Peter Facinelli, Guy Burnet, Jay Hieron, Blake Perlman', 'R', 'Asher is a former Mossad agent turned gun for hire, living an austere life in an ever-changing Brooklyn. Approaching the end of his career, he breaks the oath he took as a young man when he meets Sophie on a hit gone wrong. In order to have love in his life before it''s too late, he must kill the man he was, for a chance at becoming the man he wants to be.', 'Asher is a former Mossad agent turned gun for hire, living an austere life in an ever-changing Brooklyn. Approaching the end of his career, he breaks the oath he took as a young man when he meets Sophie on a hit gone wrong. In order to have love in his life before it''s too late, he must kill the man he was, for a chance at becoming the man he wants to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5p4Ev49KVR4itGWy3OHyqnRsz8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529982'),
  ('566622720415804943', 'Ashes', 1917, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Febo Mari', 'Eleonora Duse, Febo Mari', 'Eleonora Duse, Febo Mari, Nietta Mordeglia, Ettore Casarotti, Ilda Sibiglia, Carmen Casarotti', null, 'Dame Eleonora Duse plays a poor woman who, incapable of raising and feed him, leaves her illegitimate son with foster parents. Before she leaves her boy, the woman gives to the child an amulet in order to protect him. The amulet will be the key to put him in connection with his old mother when the boy grows up.', 'Dame Eleonora Duse plays a poor woman who, incapable of raising and feed him, leaves her illegitimate son with foster parents. Before she leaves her boy, the woman gives to the child an amulet in order to protect him. The amulet will be the key to put him in connection with his old mother when the boy grows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/widIXenTsV5uTkziSjR5CoKKbqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174555'),
  ('1148836357404838637', 'Ashes', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Apichatpong Weerasethakul', 'Chaisiri Jiwarangsan, Tilda Swinton', null, 'In collaboration with Lomo, an Austrian camera company, and Mubi, a global film website, Weerasethakul was invited to make a work to launch the new LomoKino, a portable motion picture camera. Ashes juxtaposes the intimacy of his daily routine with the destruction of memories and his observations of the dark side of Thailand’s social realities.', 'In collaboration with Lomo, an Austrian camera company, and Mubi, a global film website, Weerasethakul was invited to make a work to launch the new LomoKino, a portable motion picture camera. Ashes juxtaposes the intimacy of his daily routine with the destruction of memories and his observations of the dark side of Thailand’s social realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZNBahr0GikHUp3Xa9o9svOMA0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113102'),
  ('998522991591146163', 'Ashes', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'Hayk Kirakosyan, Erdem Tepegöz, Arda Aybek', 'Erdi Işık', 'Funda Eryiğit, Alperen Duymaz, Mehmet Günsür, Nur Sürer, Yıldıray Şahinler, Gökçe Eyüboğlu, Seda Türkmen, Canan Atalay', null, 'From an intoxicating fantasy to a dangerous affair, a wealthy married woman finds her life irreversibly shattered after picking up an unpublished novel.', 'From an intoxicating fantasy to a dangerous affair, a wealthy married woman finds her life irreversibly shattered after picking up an unpublished novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v7e4WvlEY4JnO62OEuw3zllmAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1230085'),
  ('1059698406778631035', 'Ashes and Diamonds', 1958, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Andrzej Wajda, Jerzy Wójcik, Anita Janeczkowa', 'Jerzy Andrzejewski, Andrzej Wajda', 'Zbigniew Cybulski, Ewa Krzyżewska, Wacław Zastrzeżynski, Adam Pawlikowski, Bogumił Kobiela, Jan Ciecierski, Stanisław Milski, Artur Młodnicki', null, 'A young academy soldier, Maciek Chelmicki, is ordered to shoot the secretary of the KW PPR. A coincidence causes him to kill someone else. Meeting face to face with his victim, he gets a shock. He faces the necessity of repeating the assassination. He meets Krystyna, a girl working as a barmaid in the restaurant of the "Monopol" hotel. His affection for her makes him even more aware of the senselessness of killing at the end of the war. Loyalty to the oath he took, and thus the obligation to obey the order, tips the scales.', 'A young academy soldier, Maciek Chelmicki, is ordered to shoot the secretary of the KW PPR. A coincidence causes him to kill someone else. Meeting face to face with his victim, he gets a shock. He faces the necessity of repeating the assassination. He meets Krystyna, a girl working as a barmaid in the restaurant of the "Monopol" hotel. His affection for her makes him even more aware of the senselessness of killing at the end of the war. Loyalty to the oath he took, and thus the obligation to obey the order, tips the scales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE8aqRvVnRQEqskiarnFhdJdk8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5055'),
  ('182222899422972786', 'Ashes and Snow', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Gregory Colbert', 'Gregory Colbert', 'Laurence Fishburne', null, 'Ashes and Snow, a film by Gregory Colbert, uses both still and movie cameras to explore extraordinary interactions between humans and animals. The 60-minute feature is a poetic narrative rather than a documentary. It aims to lift the natural and artificial barriers between humans and other species, dissolving the distance that exists between them.', 'Ashes and Snow, a film by Gregory Colbert, uses both still and movie cameras to explore extraordinary interactions between humans and animals. The 60-minute feature is a poetic narrative rather than a documentary. It aims to lift the natural and artificial barriers between humans and other species, dissolving the distance that exists between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os5iwmKFD2Q1b66zeBa8nkDOXkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20110'),
  ('867014358647565105', 'Ashes from the Sun', 2008, 'Drama', 'José Antonio Quirós', 'Ignacio del Moral, Dionisio Pérez, José Antonio Quirós', 'Celso Bugallo, Gary Piquer, Clara Segura, Beatriz Rico, Fran Sariego, Txema Blasco, Eduardo Antuña, Adriano Prieto', null, 'Environmental drama set in Asturias, Spain. A Scottish travel writer is forced to stay in a valley town in northern Spain when his camper van breaks down. There he gets to know the different inhabitants, some of them struggling to close down the nearby power station and some trying to make it more prosperous.', 'Environmental drama set in Asturias, Spain. A Scottish travel writer is forced to stay in a valley town in northern Spain when his camper van breaks down. There he gets to know the different inhabitants, some of them struggling to close down the nearby power station and some trying to make it more prosperous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whHHPFQXdwAnCLeHFTocFNOoMBG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75195'),
  ('530976928755750357', 'Ashes in the Sky', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Marc Zumbach, Mercè Batalla, David Larraz', 'Lydia Zimmermann', 'Nausicaa Bonnín, Rachel Lascar, Iria del Río, Laura Conejero, Núria Adrián Campbell, Natalia Barrientos, Roger Batalla, Thomas Sauerteig', null, 'In 1945, at the end of World War II, Neus Català returns to France, where she recalls her life under the Nazi yoke.', 'In 1945, at the end of World War II, Neus Català returns to France, where she recalls her life under the Nazi yoke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6Sy1rPwnWW5yMymn8TAXyhRg3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1117782'),
  ('487438335083792170', 'Ashes in the Snow', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ramūnas Greičius, Marius Markevicius, Francesc Prat', 'Ben York Jones', 'Bel Powley, Lisa Loven Kongsli, Martin Wallström, Jonah Hauer-King, Peter Franzén, Sam Hazeldine, Tom Sweet, Adrian Schiller', null, 'The coming-of-age tale of 16-year-old Lina Vilkas who is deported to Siberia amid Stalin''s reign of terror in the Baltic region during WWII. An aspiring artist, she secretly documents her harrowing journey with her drawings.', 'The coming-of-age tale of 16-year-old Lina Vilkas who is deported to Siberia amid Stalin''s reign of terror in the Baltic region during WWII. An aspiring artist, she secretly documents her harrowing journey with her drawings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRMgle7vPFvSMq5R76JhsH54W4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390874'),
  ('1097523782857960843', 'Ashes of Time', 1994, 'Drama, Action', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Fanny Lee Fan-Nei, Catherine Sie', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Leslie Cheung, Brigitte Lin, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Carina Lau, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Maggie Cheung', 'R', 'Ouyang Feng is a heartbroken and cynical man who spends his days in the desert, connecting expert swordsmen with those seeking revenge and willing to pay for it. Throughout five seasons in exile, Ouyang spins tales of his clients'' unrequited loves and unusual acts of bravery.', 'Ouyang Feng is a heartbroken and cynical man who spends his days in the desert, connecting expert swordsmen with those seeking revenge and willing to pay for it. Throughout five seasons in exile, Ouyang spins tales of his clients'' unrequited loves and unusual acts of bravery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciyEwAbvoMHPP3281cgSnfslu43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40751'),
  ('700878175408049486', 'Ashfall', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Choi Rin, Kim Sung-han, Park Si-hwan', 'Lim Joon-hyung, Kim Tae-yun, Kwak Jieong-duk', 'Lee Byung-hun, Ha Jung-woo, Don Lee, Jeon Hye-jin, Suzy, Lee Kyung-young, Kim Si-a, Lee Sang-won', null, 'A group of unlikely heroes from across the Korean peninsula try to save the day after a volcano erupts on the mythical and majestic Baekdu Mountain.', 'A group of unlikely heroes from across the Korean peninsula try to save the day after a volcano erupts on the mythical and majestic Baekdu Mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCZ0RHifBxZGedde7WPWSgjpyZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581387'),
  ('777493692166702039', 'Ashik Kerib', 1988, 'Drama, History, Fantasy', 'Sergei Parajanov, Albert Yavuryan, David Abashidze', 'Gia Badridze', 'Yuri Mgoyan, Sofiko Chiaureli, Ramaz Chkhikvadze, Kostiantyn Stepankov, Baia Dvalishvili, Nodar Dugladze, Veronika Metonidze, Levan Natroshvili', null, 'Wandering minstrel Ashik Kerib falls in love with a rich merchant''s daughter, but is spurned by her father and forced to roam the world for a thousand and one nights. Now presumed dead by those he loves, he performs for the poor and unfortunate on his journeys through the wilderness. Parajanov''s visually ravishing ''tableaux vivants'' tell Lermontov''s romantic tale while Turkish and Azerbaijani folk songs transport us into its mystical landscapes.', 'Wandering minstrel Ashik Kerib falls in love with a rich merchant''s daughter, but is spurned by her father and forced to roam the world for a thousand and one nights. Now presumed dead by those he loves, he performs for the poor and unfortunate on his journeys through the wilderness. Parajanov''s visually ravishing ''tableaux vivants'' tell Lermontov''s romantic tale while Turkish and Azerbaijani folk songs transport us into its mystical landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcaXCtZusW6x30xG2iLgn2JRFNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92663'),
  ('1006154695259601509', 'Ashkal: The Tunisian Investigation', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Youssef Chebbi, Hazem Berrabah', 'Youssef Chebbi, François-Michel Allegrini', 'Fatma Oussaifi, Mohamed Grayaâ, Aymen Ben Hmida, Rami Harrabi, Ghalia Jebali, Adel Monam Khemis, Barrie Marleen, Oumaima Mehrzi', null, 'Set amongst derelict, half-finished apartment complexes of a former regime, the discovery of a mysterious burnt body by two police officers reveals a puzzling repetition of events. As the investigation progresses, a network of violence and corruption is uncovered throughout the city.', 'Set amongst derelict, half-finished apartment complexes of a former regime, the discovery of a mysterious burnt body by two police officers reveals a puzzling repetition of events. As the investigation progresses, a network of violence and corruption is uncovered throughout the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A6dupkEpWIyWz7xAvuXaioe4O7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964679'),
  ('272067350137821652', 'Ashura', 2005, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror', 'Yojiro Takita, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Masashi Todayama, Hare Kawaguchi', 'Rie Miyazawa, Matsumoto Kōshirō X, Kanako Higuchi, Atsuro Watabe, Fumiyo Kohinata, Takashi Naito, Erika Sawajiri, Yukijiro Hotaru', null, 'Adapted from the successful play, the film takes place in 19th-century Japan, where a war between demons and their slayers is fought. Izumo, a kabuki actor with a demon-slaying past, meets and falls in love with Tsubaki. However, something is not right, as mysterious marks appear on her body as time progresses. At the same time, it is announced that Ashura, the queen of all demons, will be resurrected and bring destruction to the universe.', 'Adapted from the successful play, the film takes place in 19th-century Japan, where a war between demons and their slayers is fought. Izumo, a kabuki actor with a demon-slaying past, meets and falls in love with Tsubaki. However, something is not right, as mysterious marks appear on her body as time progresses. At the same time, it is announced that Ashura, the queen of all demons, will be resurrected and bring destruction to the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6W0kQVitLMGt0vc8jJIuAW3Oqr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45384'),
  ('1126028690249213112', 'Así es mi tierra', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Arkady Boytler, Víctor Herrera', 'Arkady Boytler', 'Antonio R. Frausto, Mercedes Soler, Cantinflas, Manuel Medel, Luis G. Barreiro, Margarita Cortés, Juan José Martínez Casado, Amelia Wilhelmy', null, 'With revolutionary Mexico as a backdrop, a successful local rancher returns triumphant from the war to the praise of townsfolk, and "El General" is ready to take a wife. However the senorita of choice already has fallen for a secret admirer, and a boyhood rival who is threatened by the General''s popularity in turn plots against his life.', 'With revolutionary Mexico as a backdrop, a successful local rancher returns triumphant from the war to the praise of townsfolk, and "El General" is ready to take a wife. However the senorita of choice already has fallen for a secret admirer, and a boyhood rival who is threatened by the General''s popularity in turn plots against his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DPhX5AswATArFKyCo0ky8MJXZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82773'),
