  ('681044767972501520', 'Ask Any Girl', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Al Jennings, Robert J. Bronner, Charles Walters', 'George Wells', 'David Niven, Shirley MacLaine, Gig Young, Rod Taylor, Jim Backus, Claire Kelly, Elisabeth Fraser, Dodie Heath', null, 'Meg is a young wide-eyed girl who is endures many calamities in her search for a husband in modern-day New York. After losing her suitcase at Penn Station, being kicked out by her roommate, and changing bosses because her boss made a pass at her, she finds herself looking for work at a Manhattan motivational research agency run by punctilious Miles Doughton and his playboy brother, Evan.', 'Meg is a young wide-eyed girl who is endures many calamities in her search for a husband in modern-day New York. After losing her suitcase at Penn Station, being kicked out by her roommate, and changing bosses because her boss made a pass at her, she finds herself looking for work at a Manhattan motivational research agency run by punctilious Miles Doughton and his playboy brother, Evan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMNEkx33NOA1i49qEJi4Zrb2ZrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76863'),
  ('712228961180942654', 'Aşk Kırmızı', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Osman Sınav', 'Osman Sınav', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Tayanç Ayaydın, Ezgi Asaroğlu, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı, Sait Genay, Şebnem Dilligil, Serdar Yeğin, Ayda Aksel', null, 'The film asks the question would have been triple love. Ferhat and Zeynep is a happily married couple. Karlıdağ outside of marriage appears happy couple, the first love of life remained in the years ahead will be turned upside down with the introduction of the Euphrates Nazlıgül again. Zeynep even a night encounter with the former love of her husband Nazlıgül powdery mildew that can not bear to be separated , and that is the love in his heart can not prevent the re-ignition.', 'The film asks the question would have been triple love. Ferhat and Zeynep is a happily married couple. Karlıdağ outside of marriage appears happy couple, the first love of life remained in the years ahead will be turned upside down with the introduction of the Euphrates Nazlıgül again. Zeynep even a night encounter with the former love of her husband Nazlıgül powdery mildew that can not bear to be separated , and that is the love in his heart can not prevent the re-ignition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGjWeHKU7zyZD9wLBJv4PqRl3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210408'),
  ('404895636587663499', 'Ask Me Anything', 2014, 'Drama', 'Allison Burnett, Patrice Lucien Cochet', 'Allison Burnett', 'Britt Robertson, Molly Hagan, Andy Buckley, Robert Patrick, Zuleikha Robinson, Christian Slater, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, Max Carver', 'R', 'Beautiful, wild, funny, and lost, Katie Kampenfelt takes a year off before college to find herself, all the while chronicling her adventures in an anonymous blog into which she pours her innermost secrets. Eventually, Katie''s fearless narrative begins to crack, and dark pieces of her past emerge.', 'Beautiful, wild, funny, and lost, Katie Kampenfelt takes a year off before college to find herself, all the while chronicling her adventures in an anonymous blog into which she pours her innermost secrets. Eventually, Katie''s fearless narrative begins to crack, and dark pieces of her past emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0rEtOp6jI7oU6u3m7v1aAOJNQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271185'),
  ('59295081816873538', 'Aşk Sadece Bir An', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mustafa Kotan, Oktay Başpınar', 'Aslı Zengin', 'Emirhan Çakal, Nilsu Berfin Aktaş, Tuba Ünsal, Tuana Naz Tiryaki, Emre Kınay, Burcu Kara, Gonca Vuslateri, Teoman', null, 'A young man and woman from very different backgrounds fall in love but their relationship faces obstacles from his troubled past and her overprotective parents.', 'A young man and woman from very different backgrounds fall in love but their relationship faces obstacles from his troubled past and her overprotective parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwiMs8Lr6FAjvXEiQzTJyxLqZee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422227'),
  ('703590838198697878', 'Ask the Dust', 2006, 'Romance, Drama', 'Robert Towne, Caleb Deschanel, Sarah Purser', 'Robert Towne', 'Colin Farrell, Salma Hayek Pinault, Donald Sutherland, Eileen Atkins, Idina Menzel, Justin Kirk, William Mapother, Tamara Marie Watson', 'R', 'Mexican beauty Camilla hopes to rise above her station by marrying a wealthy American. That is complicated by meeting Arturo Bandini, a first-generation Italian hoping to land a writing career and a blue-eyed blonde on his arm.', 'Mexican beauty Camilla hopes to rise above her station by marrying a wealthy American. That is complicated by meeting Arturo Bandini, a first-generation Italian hoping to land a writing career and a blue-eyed blonde on his arm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuJZyJNiQxnmMBBqu40mF0a2nuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1967'),
  ('216681596174697311', 'Ask This of Rikyu', 2013, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Mitsutoshi Tanaka, Tatsuya Hama, Takeshi Hamada', 'Eriko Komatsu', 'Ichikawa Ebizo XI, Miki Nakatani, Nao Omori, Clara Lee, Yūsuke Iseya, Ichikawa Danjūrō XII, Riko Narumi, Seiji Fukushi', 'NR', 'Sen no Rikyu (Ebizo Ichikawa) is the son of a fish shop owner. Sen no Rikyu then studies tea and eventually becomes one of the primary influences upon the Japanese tea ceremony. With his elegant esthetics, Sen no Rikyu is favored by the most powerful man in Japan Toyotomi Hideyoshi (Nao Omori) and becomes one of his closest advisors. Due to conflicts, Toyotomi Hideyoshi then orders Sen no Rikyu to commit seppuku (suicide). Director Mitsutoshi Tanaka''s adaptation of Kenichi Yamamoto''s award-winning novel of the same name received the Best Artistic Contribution Award at the 37th Montréal World Film Festival, the Best Director Award at the 2014 Osaka Cinema Festival, the 30th Fumiko Yamaji Cultural Award and the 37th Japan Academy Film Prize in nine categories, including Best Art Direction, Excellent Film and Excellent Actor.', 'Sen no Rikyu (Ebizo Ichikawa) is the son of a fish shop owner. Sen no Rikyu then studies tea and eventually becomes one of the primary influences upon the Japanese tea ceremony. With his elegant esthetics, Sen no Rikyu is favored by the most powerful man in Japan Toyotomi Hideyoshi (Nao Omori) and becomes one of his closest advisors. Due to conflicts, Toyotomi Hideyoshi then orders Sen no Rikyu to commit seppuku (suicide). Director Mitsutoshi Tanaka''s adaptation of Kenichi Yamamoto''s award-winning novel of the same name received the Best Artistic Contribution Award at the 37th Montréal World Film Festival, the Best Director Award at the 2014 Osaka Cinema Festival, the 30th Fumiko Yamaji Cultural Award and the 37th Japan Academy Film Prize in nine categories, including Best Art Direction, Excellent Film and Excellent Actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WNYhh9aePhVHx46B9cybXAzVfW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266985'),
  ('103632707300214555', 'Aşk Tutulması', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Tolgahan Sayışman, Fahriye Evcen, Ali Erkazan, Tim Seyfi, Suzan Aksoy, Murat Akkoyunlu, Yasemin Öztürk, Rahşan Gülşan', null, 'Uğur, a fanatical Fenerbahçe fan, is a pharmaceutical representative. While he has a very calm personality in his daily life, he becomes a completely different person when it comes to football. His desire to win and his totems are what set him apart from other fanatics. Uğur, who lives with his mother and sister, is tired of his mother''s pressure to get married. When it comes to marriage, Pınar also faces the same pressure from her mother. Uğur and Pınar meet by chance after a traffic accident. This encounter will bring about profound changes in both Uğur''s and Pınar''s lives.', 'Uğur, a fanatical Fenerbahçe fan, is a pharmaceutical representative. While he has a very calm personality in his daily life, he becomes a completely different person when it comes to football. His desire to win and his totems are what set him apart from other fanatics. Uğur, who lives with his mother and sister, is tired of his mother''s pressure to get married. When it comes to marriage, Pınar also faces the same pressure from her mother. Uğur and Pınar meet by chance after a traffic accident. This encounter will bring about profound changes in both Uğur''s and Pınar''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz3urmK63RGRWWAId4x4lFQhq6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52284'),
  ('35109606344991553', 'Ask Your Heart', 2010, 'Drama', 'Yusuf Kurçenli', 'Yusuf Kurçenli', 'Tuba Büyüküstün, Kenan Ece, Hakan Eratik, Ayla Algan, Hakan Karahan, Tomris Oğuzalp, Civan Canova, Alp Öyken', null, 'A love affair threatened by a barrier as great as itself... Can differences of faith stand in the way of an innocent love affair? Two young people, Esma and Mustafa, fall in love. For them, the future only has meaning if they are together. Failing this, life is meaningless. However, overhanging their love is a barrier unique to the period and location: Mustafa is a clandestine Christian, when everyone including Esma thinks he is Muslim. In the meantime, the Ottoman Empire introduces a series of reforms giving Christians the same rights as Muslims. From this point on, the Church urges secret Christians to reveal their faith. This poses a dilemma for Mustafa: he is caught between his love and the Church.', 'A love affair threatened by a barrier as great as itself... Can differences of faith stand in the way of an innocent love affair? Two young people, Esma and Mustafa, fall in love. For them, the future only has meaning if they are together. Failing this, life is meaningless. However, overhanging their love is a barrier unique to the period and location: Mustafa is a clandestine Christian, when everyone including Esma thinks he is Muslim. In the meantime, the Ottoman Empire introduces a series of reforms giving Christians the same rights as Muslims. From this point on, the Church urges secret Christians to reveal their faith. This poses a dilemma for Mustafa: he is caught between his love and the Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9tQvXDDtxsL6tOUu0aAjCxNBAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52149'),
  ('778209580545758661', 'Asking For It', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Eamon O''Rourke', 'Eamon O''Rourke', 'Kiersey Clemons, Alexandra Shipp, Vanessa Hudgens, Radha Mitchell, Ezra Miller, Luke Hemsworth, Leyna Bloom, Leslie Stratton', 'R', 'After small town waitress Joey is sexually assaulted after a date with her old friend Mike, she befriends mysterious stranger Regina. Regina introducers her to The Cherry Bombers, an all femme gang including Beatrice, Lily, Sal, Jett, Angie, and Fala. All suffering from past traumas, together they fight a misogynistic society by targeting violent frat boys, a corrupt police force of human traffickers led by Sheriff Morel, and the dangerous alt-right group MFM (Men’s First Movement) headed by Mark Vanderhill. As Joey is drawn further into their chaotic world, Sal’s old flame, Logan County Sheriff Vernon, investigates MFM, leading to a thrilling showdown.', 'After small town waitress Joey is sexually assaulted after a date with her old friend Mike, she befriends mysterious stranger Regina. Regina introducers her to The Cherry Bombers, an all femme gang including Beatrice, Lily, Sal, Jett, Angie, and Fala. All suffering from past traumas, together they fight a misogynistic society by targeting violent frat boys, a corrupt police force of human traffickers led by Sheriff Morel, and the dangerous alt-right group MFM (Men’s First Movement) headed by Mark Vanderhill. As Joey is drawn further into their chaotic world, Sal’s old flame, Logan County Sheriff Vernon, investigates MFM, leading to a thrilling showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro3yvVbzT2zI2KrHWBA81a2x5iR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:825672'),
  ('336827593066932343', 'Asmodexia', 2014, 'Horror', 'Marc Carreté, Xavi Garriga, Joan Soler', 'Mike Hostench, Marc Carreté', 'Clàudia Pons, Irene Montalà, Silvia Sabaté, Mireia Ros, Ramon Canals, Maurice Nash, Albert Baró, Marta Belmonte', 'R', 'Eloy de Palma is an exorcist pastor roaming the darkest corners of the country with his granddaughter Alba. Their mission is to help those possessed by The Evil One, an infection of the soul that is spreading fast. Each exorcism is tougher than the one before, and every battle reveals a piece of Alba’s forgotten past – an enigma that if unconcealed could change the world as we know it.', 'Eloy de Palma is an exorcist pastor roaming the darkest corners of the country with his granddaughter Alba. Their mission is to help those possessed by The Evil One, an infection of the soul that is spreading fast. Each exorcism is tougher than the one before, and every battle reveals a piece of Alba’s forgotten past – an enigma that if unconcealed could change the world as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9rhEvc1FvU1EnEkOgxEGF8W4YJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280016'),
  ('1003413594997743014', 'Aśoka', 2001, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History, Romance, War', 'Santosh Sivan, Santosh Sivan, Ghanteshwar T Guru', 'Saket Chaudhary, Santosh Sivan', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Hrishitaa Bhatt, Danny Denzongpa, Sooraj Balaji, Rahul Dev, Ajith Kumar, Gerson Da Cunha', 'R', 'A young Prince Asoka works to perfect his skills in battle and also deals with family conflict. During a struggle with one of his step-brothers, his mother urges Asoka to escape to stay alive. While away, Asoka meets Kaurwaki and falls in love, but must use his skills as a warrior to protect her. A dangerous and heartbreaking web of conspiracy follows, which leads Asoka to embrace a Buddhist path.', 'A young Prince Asoka works to perfect his skills in battle and also deals with family conflict. During a struggle with one of his step-brothers, his mother urges Asoka to escape to stay alive. While away, Asoka meets Kaurwaki and falls in love, but must use his skills as a warrior to protect her. A dangerous and heartbreaking web of conspiracy follows, which leads Asoka to embrace a Buddhist path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckFDMqLjhsYo2kH3X5auV1NnjPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4435'),
  ('873159155663742093', 'Asparagus', 1979, 'Animation', 'Suzan Pitt', null, null, null, 'A symbolic reflection on issues of female sexuality, art and identity constructs.', 'A symbolic reflection on issues of female sexuality, art and identity constructs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vt5shhypt7fGzm1GslyUhCXN5dH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36881'),
  ('75027865288970091', 'Aspen Extreme', 1993, 'Adventure', 'Steven Fierberg, Robert Primes, Patrick Hasburgh', 'Patrick Hasburgh', 'Paul Gross, Peter Berg, Finola Hughes, Teri Polo, William Russ, Trevor Eve, Martin Kemp, William McNamara', 'PG-13', 'T.J. and his friend Dexter quit their jobs in Detroit to become ski-instructors in Aspen. While T.J. advances to the most popular instructor of the school during the season, he has to take care for Dexter, who''s future is less bright and who''s eventually thinking about jobbing as drug courier - bringing their friendship to a test. Meanwhile the rich business woman Brice supports T.J. in his writing ambitions and invites him to live at her home. But in her absence he falls in love with the stunningly beautiful blond radio moderator Robin.', 'T.J. and his friend Dexter quit their jobs in Detroit to become ski-instructors in Aspen. While T.J. advances to the most popular instructor of the school during the season, he has to take care for Dexter, who''s future is less bright and who''s eventually thinking about jobbing as drug courier - bringing their friendship to a test. Meanwhile the rich business woman Brice supports T.J. in his writing ambitions and invites him to live at her home. But in her absence he falls in love with the stunningly beautiful blond radio moderator Robin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbXb9XvMZW6GmLJoFf7gkoLBvUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16370'),
  ('245511254057007111', 'Asphalt', 1929, 'Drama', 'Joe May, Günther Rittau', 'Joe May, Hans Székely, Rolf E. Vanloo', 'Albert Steinrück, Else Heller, Gustav Fröhlich, Betty Amann, Hans Adalbert Schlettow, Hans Albers, Rosa Valetti, Paul Hörbiger', null, 'Starring Betty Amann in her most famous leading role, Joe May''s Asphalt is a luxuriously produced German Expressionist classic where tragic liaisons and fatal encounters are shaped alongside the constant roar of Berlin traffic.', 'Starring Betty Amann in her most famous leading role, Joe May''s Asphalt is a luxuriously produced German Expressionist classic where tragic liaisons and fatal encounters are shaped alongside the constant roar of Berlin traffic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlAQ3fEkoTOn4WNF9Zh9Rk2bMEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55584'),
  ('180561807273747757', 'Asphalt', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Denis Amar, Robert Fraisse', 'Jean-Pierre Petrolacci', 'Carole Laure, Jean Yanne, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Philippe Ogouz, Christopher Lambert, Richard Anconina, Louis Seigner, Danièle Lebrun', null, 'Heavy traffic in the summer. Bad luck for Juliet, Albert, Jaeger and Arthur who does not reach their destination. Involved in a terrible accident that will change their lives forever.', 'Heavy traffic in the summer. Bad luck for Juliet, Albert, Jaeger and Arthur who does not reach their destination. Involved in a terrible accident that will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1upp35ZXRStLQ1eV8bNrGxHWdG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354848'),
  ('1023174778424407196', 'Asphalt Burning', 2020, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hallvard Bræin, Askild Vik Edvardsen', 'Kjetil Indregard, Christopher Grøndahl', 'Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Ida Husøy, Sven Nordin, Otto Jespersen, Henrik Mestad, Ruby O. Fee, Alexandra Maria Lara, Kostja Ullmann', 'NR', 'The third and final instalment in the Burnout trilogy. This time, the road leads through Norway, to Sweden, Denmark and finally Germany to race on the famous racing track, Nürburgring.', 'The third and final instalment in the Burnout trilogy. This time, the road leads through Norway, to Sweden, Denmark and finally Germany to race on the famous racing track, Nürburgring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xga1DMRKfdkS6uzLwzCGvbRiyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505746'),
  ('124427968832673407', 'Asphalt City', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'David Ungaro, Urs Hirschbiegel, Scott Bowers', 'Ben Mac Brown, Ryan King', 'Sean Penn, Tye Sheridan, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Raquel Nave, Kali Reis, Michael Pitt, Katherine Waterston, Mike Tyson', 'R', 'A young paramedic is paired with a seasoned partner on the night shift in New York revealing a city in crisis. Discovering the chaos firsthand, he is tested with the ethical ambiguity that can be the difference between life and death.', 'A young paramedic is paired with a seasoned partner on the night shift in New York revealing a city in crisis. Discovering the chaos firsthand, he is tested with the ethical ambiguity that can be the difference between life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXcd7wY7MmRs36fQt83iSMJelvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628922'),
  ('903221196821710257', 'Asphalt Goddess', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Cantú, Julián Hernández', 'Inés Morales', 'Ximena Romo, Mabel Cadena, Nelly González, Alejandra Herrera, Raquel Robles, Jimena Mancilla, Paulina Goto, Pascacio López', null, 'Max returns to her slum turned into the vocalist of a rock band. There, the memories await, the latest news and the truths that were silent for years: Sonia is a voice that speaks from the death.', 'Max returns to her slum turned into the vocalist of a rock band. There, the memories await, the latest news and the truths that were silent for years: Sonia is a voice that speaks from the death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDn3JtWeqHYAWmKEKx8oJB5ItnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572637'),
  ('412928091232880135', 'Asphalt Playground', 2013, 'Drama', 'Julien Abraham, Julien Meurice', 'Julien Abraham, Jimmy Laporal-Trésor, Diouc Koma', 'Azize Diabate Abdoulaye, Idrissa Diabaté, Ismaël Ouazzani, Zouher Rahim, Anaïs Begue, Ibrahim Koma, Juliette Lamboley, David Ribeiro', null, 'Mitraillette is 12 years old and lives in Rose City, a housing estate he would not leave for anything. His whole world comprises his family, especially his 16 year-old cousin Isma, who has taken a fancy to Narcisse, the local crime boss. His older brother Djibril is 22, a student at the Sorbonne who dreams of becoming a lawyer. As for Mitraillette, he has his eye on Océane, the most beautiful girl in his school...', 'Mitraillette is 12 years old and lives in Rose City, a housing estate he would not leave for anything. His whole world comprises his family, especially his 16 year-old cousin Isma, who has taken a fancy to Narcisse, the local crime boss. His older brother Djibril is 22, a student at the Sorbonne who dreams of becoming a lawyer. As for Mitraillette, he has his eye on Océane, the most beautiful girl in his school...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZRed1DCyIf6tjJXOMgy0hsEd1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180420'),
  ('448507312391331488', 'Asphalt Tango', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nae Caranfil, Cristian Comeaga', 'Nae Caranfil', 'Charlotte Rampling, Mircea Diaconu, Florin Călinescu, Cătălina Răhăianu, Marthe Felten, Adina Cartianu, Delia Nartea, Constantin Cotimanis', null, 'A desperate husband chases a bus full of beautiful women headed for Paris, France.', 'A desperate husband chases a bus full of beautiful women headed for Paris, France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KYoB9dDfAZVMFxW6Piyd6FbJz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8380'),
  ('613280120303606980', 'Asphaltgorillas', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Detlev Buck, Marc Achenbach', 'Detlev Buck, Constantin Lieb, Cüneyt Kaya', 'Samuel Schneider, Ella Rumpf, Jannis Niewöhner, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Oktay Özdemir, Uisenma Borchu, Stefanie Giesinger, Georg Friedrich', null, 'Small-time crook Atris is tired of working for Berlin crime lord El Keitar. Yet in order to build his own syndicate, he needs money. When his friend Frank offers him a lucrative deal, Atris thinks his chance has finally come, not knowing that he is about to set in motion a fateful chain of events.', 'Small-time crook Atris is tired of working for Berlin crime lord El Keitar. Yet in order to build his own syndicate, he needs money. When his friend Frank offers him a lucrative deal, Atris thinks his chance has finally come, not knowing that he is about to set in motion a fateful chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqJ3J3H0E06383ZGmoqDGtpbnAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427032'),
  ('962480042661573698', 'Aspirante vedovo', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Venier, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Marcella Libonati', 'Piero Guerrera', 'Fabio De Luigi, Luciana Littizzetto, Ale, Francesco Brandi, Clizia Fornasier, Bebo Storti, Antonino Bruschetta, Fulvio Falzarano', null, 'A ne''er-do-well who''s married to a millionnaire realizes his financial trouble might be solved if his wife was dead - and sets out a plot to achieve just that. A remake of Dino Risi''s "il vedovo".', 'A ne''er-do-well who''s married to a millionnaire realizes his financial trouble might be solved if his wife was dead - and sets out a plot to achieve just that. A remake of Dino Risi''s "il vedovo".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4Bc0uYEFOnFSFa88ZX0qmZqIbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226936'),
  ('643771952609339237', 'Aspromonte: Land of The Forgotten', 2019, 'Drama', 'Mimmo Calopresti, Stefano Falivene', 'Monica Zapelli, Mimmo Calopresti', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Francesco Colella, Marcello Fonte, Marco Leonardi, Sergio Rubini, Elisabetta Gregoraci, Romina Mondello, Carlo Marrapodi', null, 'At the end of the 1950s in Africo, a small village in the southern valley of Aspromonte, a woman dies in childbirth because a doctor fails to arrive on time. No road connects Africo with the other villages. In the wake of this tragedy, all of Africo’s citizens -including children - abandon their usual occupations and unite to build their own road. Giulia, the new schoolteacher, comes from the North with a mission to teach standard Italian to help bring cultural cohesion with Africo and the rest of Italy. But she will have to contend with the local maﬁoso Don Totó, who is determined to ensure this the town remains cut off, and thus, under his power.', 'At the end of the 1950s in Africo, a small village in the southern valley of Aspromonte, a woman dies in childbirth because a doctor fails to arrive on time. No road connects Africo with the other villages. In the wake of this tragedy, all of Africo’s citizens -including children - abandon their usual occupations and unite to build their own road. Giulia, the new schoolteacher, comes from the North with a mission to teach standard Italian to help bring cultural cohesion with Africo and the rest of Italy. But she will have to contend with the local maﬁoso Don Totó, who is determined to ensure this the town remains cut off, and thus, under his power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acegb881gcQFZmbh3JvYbuxWSiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630382'),
  ('722864934327026286', 'Ass Backwards', 2013, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Chris Nelson, Andre Lascaris', 'Casey Wilson, June Diane Raphael', 'June Diane Raphael, Casey Wilson, Vincent D''Onofrio, Alicia Silverstone, Jon Cryer, Brian Geraghty, Bob Odenkirk, Paul Scheer', null, 'Two best friends embark on a cross country trip back to their hometown to attempt to win a pageant that eluded them as children.', 'Two best friends embark on a cross country trip back to their hometown to attempt to win a pageant that eluded them as children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZdFaN8UiRfsUjuDHmSWy1mmXkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159024'),
  ('1002694482772633680', 'Assa', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Sergey Solovyov, Pavel Lebeshev, Ekaterina Popova-Evans', 'Sergey Livnev, Sergey Solovyov', 'Sergei Bugayev, Tatyana Drubich, Stanislav Govorukhin, Aleksandr Bashirov, Alexandr Domogarov, Kirill Kozakov, Viktor Tsoi, Aleksandr Sporykhin', null, 'A young musician falls for a mobster''s young mistress.', 'A young musician falls for a mobster''s young mistress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fl1UIUaWK8KouCOUwN506ys5VP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47985'),
  ('944982027837855089', 'Assandira', 2020, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Mereu, Laura Biagini, Sandro Chessa', 'Salvatore Mereu', 'Gavino Ledda, Anna König, Marco Zucca, Matthias Lier, Alex Robinson, Timo Jacobs', null, 'Soaked to the skin, Costantino sinks into the haystack like old timber left on the shore by a stormy sea. Torrential rain has just put out the fire that in a single night ravaged Assandira, a farmstay deep in the woods of Sardinia. But the rain hasn''t quenched the pain, the endless remorse for the son lost to the flames, the son he was unable to save. The first to arrive are the carabinieri and the young investigating magistrate: Costantino tries to tell them what happened the previous night, to explain how it all began.', 'Soaked to the skin, Costantino sinks into the haystack like old timber left on the shore by a stormy sea. Torrential rain has just put out the fire that in a single night ravaged Assandira, a farmstay deep in the woods of Sardinia. But the rain hasn''t quenched the pain, the endless remorse for the son lost to the flames, the son he was unable to save. The first to arrive are the carabinieri and the young investigating magistrate: Costantino tries to tell them what happened the previous night, to explain how it all began.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dLi0OOKmj2Myv32mUwonobKw0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726892'),
  ('489403477660559308', 'Assassin', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Jesse Atlas, Bryan Koss', 'Jesse Atlas, Aaron Wolfe', 'Bruce Willis, Nomzamo Mbatha, Dominic Purcell, Andy Allo, Mustafa Shakir, Fernanda Andrade, Barry Jay Minoff, Eugenia Kuzmina', 'R', 'A private military operation invents futuristic microchip tech that enables the mind of an agent to inhabit the body of another person to carry out covert, deadly missions. But when an agent is killed during a secret mission, his wife takes his place in an attempt to bring the man responsible to justice.', 'A private military operation invents futuristic microchip tech that enables the mind of an agent to inhabit the body of another person to carry out covert, deadly missions. But when an agent is killed during a secret mission, his wife takes his place in an attempt to bring the man responsible to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N0BJPs616SSwE4hVs0jjWuiy5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921355'),
  ('468517418872979180', 'Assassin', 2025, 'Action', 'Zhou Jiuqin', null, 'Ray Lui, Ming Wang', null, 'In 1932 Shanghai, a resistance leader and a gangster join forces to eliminate a Japanese military strategist. Their mission leads to violent encounters, public uprising, and ultimate sacrifice in the fight for freedom.', 'In 1932 Shanghai, a resistance leader and a gangster join forces to eliminate a Japanese military strategist. Their mission leads to violent encounters, public uprising, and ultimate sacrifice in the fight for freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLRCNUz3MsnC0MdhaWpw3hp4Eye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1552819'),
  ('1110660223309598840', 'Assassin 33 A.D.', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Jim Carroll', 'Jim Carroll', 'Donny Boaz, Susan Gallagher, Heidi Montag, Beau Davidson, Johnny Rey Diaz, Anthony Crivello, Gerardo Davila, Corey Cannon', 'PG-13', 'When a billionaire gives a group of young scientists unlimited resources to study the science of matter transfer, the scientists unlock the secrets of time travel. But they soon find out that the project is backed by a militant extremist group, and the billionaire plans to go back in time and prove that Jesus never rose from the dead.', 'When a billionaire gives a group of young scientists unlimited resources to study the science of matter transfer, the scientists unlock the secrets of time travel. But they soon find out that the project is backed by a militant extremist group, and the billionaire plans to go back in time and prove that Jesus never rose from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jDvtdH327I8TgX3UPdkAsZF1dA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582306'),
  ('453306824433011098', 'Assassin Club', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Camille Delamarre, Matthew Chuang', 'Thomas Dunn', 'Henry Golding, Noomi Rapace, Daniela Melchior, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Sam Neill, Anastasia Doaga, Claudio Del Falco, Gabriele Mira Rossi', 'R', 'In this world of contract killers, Morgan Gaines is the best of the best. When Morgan is hired to kill six people around the world, he soon discovers all the targets are also assassins unknowingly hired to kill each other.', 'In this world of contract killers, Morgan Gaines is the best of the best. When Morgan is hired to kill six people around the world, he soon discovers all the targets are also assassins unknowingly hired to kill each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2d2SBqK33mGOG2CqAYMo3YbWE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876969'),
  ('1015856293723926699', 'Assassin of the Tsar', 1991, 'History, Drama', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Nikolay Nemolyaev, Larisa Makhlayeva', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov', 'Oleg Yankovskiy, Malcolm McDowell, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Yuriy Sherstnyov, Olga Antonova, Anzhela Ptashuk, Yevgeniya Kryukova, Anastasiya Nemolyaeva', null, 'A new doctor from Moscow arrives at a provincial mental institution. His interest is the peculiarities of the psyche of a patient who believes that he is Yakov Yurovsky, the man who assassinated the last Russian tsar. In the course of their conversations it transpires that the patient is a kind of philosopher, not without a gift for suggestion. In a while the doctor himself falls under his patient’s influence: he tends to relive that fatal night of June 16-17, 1918 when, without any investigation or trial, Tsar Nicholas II, who had recently abdicated, was murdered, together with his wife, daughters and incurably ill heir. Soon the doctor realizes that the tragedy of the last Russian tsar is in part his own tragedy, too...', 'A new doctor from Moscow arrives at a provincial mental institution. His interest is the peculiarities of the psyche of a patient who believes that he is Yakov Yurovsky, the man who assassinated the last Russian tsar. In the course of their conversations it transpires that the patient is a kind of philosopher, not without a gift for suggestion. In a while the doctor himself falls under his patient’s influence: he tends to relive that fatal night of June 16-17, 1918 when, without any investigation or trial, Tsar Nicholas II, who had recently abdicated, was murdered, together with his wife, daughters and incurably ill heir. Soon the doctor realizes that the tragedy of the last Russian tsar is in part his own tragedy, too...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYg6Ckyq58gE28kA2kWXsXkfuM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147164'),
  ('989998883939825811', 'Assassin of Youth', 1938, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Elmer Clifton, Edward Linden', 'Charles A. Browne, Elmer Clifton', 'Luana Walters, Arthur Gardner, Fay McKenzie, Michael Owen, Dorothy Short, Earl Dwire, Fern Emmett, Henry Roquemore', 'NR', 'A high-school girl gets involved with a ring of teenage marijuana smokers and starts down the road to ruin. A reporter poses as a soda jerk to infiltrate the gang of teen dope fiends.', 'A high-school girl gets involved with a ring of teenage marijuana smokers and starts down the road to ruin. A reporter poses as a soda jerk to infiltrate the gang of teen dope fiends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l21da4JKVpixfdqCpUzCG9qvt1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89513'),
  ('525628693673122845', 'Assassin''s Bullet', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Nancy L. Babine', 'Christian Slater, Donald Sutherland, Elika Portnoy, Timothy Spall, Ivaylo Geraskov, Ivan Kotsev, Tanya Mickov, Vassil Mihajlov', 'R', 'In Assassin''s Bullet, Slater plays Robert Diggs, a black ops agent who comes to work for Ambassador Ashdown (Hunger Games star Donald Sutherland), tracking down a vigilante assassin in Eastern Europe. The maverick hit(wo)man has been taking out high-profile targets on the U.S. hit list, and Diggs must uncover the killer''s identity before there''s an international incident. The usual game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'In Assassin''s Bullet, Slater plays Robert Diggs, a black ops agent who comes to work for Ambassador Ashdown (Hunger Games star Donald Sutherland), tracking down a vigilante assassin in Eastern Europe. The maverick hit(wo)man has been taking out high-profile targets on the U.S. hit list, and Diggs must uncover the killer''s identity before there''s an international incident. The usual game of cat and mouse ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8MsZDOsM3SFw7ihvZPYQBMPle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117923'),
  ('902411857506421370', 'Assassin''s Creed', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Justin Kurzel, Dan Bradley, Marc Homes', 'Adam Cooper, Bill Collage, Michael Lesslie', 'Michael Fassbender, Marion Cotillard, Jeremy Irons, Brendan Gleeson, Charlotte Rampling, Michael Kenneth Williams, Ariane Labed, James Sobol Kelly', 'PG-13', 'Through a technology that unlocks the genetic memories of his ancestor in 15th century Spain, Callum Lynch discovers he is a descendant of an ancient line of Assassins and amasses lethal skills to take on the oppressive Templar Order.', 'Through a technology that unlocks the genetic memories of his ancestor in 15th century Spain, Callum Lynch discovers he is a descendant of an ancient line of Assassins and amasses lethal skills to take on the oppressive Templar Order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDXewoEcvbn0pUvJ8W3vfkuWgHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121856'),
  ('822417698219656392', 'Assassin''s Creed: Embers', 2011, 'Animation', 'Laurent Bernier', 'Darby McDevitt', 'Roger Craig Smith, Anna Tuveri, Angela Galuppo, Peter Arpesella', null, 'Taking place after the events of Assassin''s Creed: Revelations in the year 1524 in Tuscany, follow the retired Assassin Ezio Auditore as he teams up with Shao Jun during his final battles.', 'Taking place after the events of Assassin''s Creed: Revelations in the year 1524 in Tuscany, follow the retired Assassin Ezio Auditore as he teams up with Shao Jun during his final battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aeKG4ko7hAd80sakNw49ktrcPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79089'),
  ('375853839690731084', 'Assassin(s)', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Pierre Aïm', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Michel Serrault, Mathieu Kassovitz, Mehdi Benoufa, Robert Gendreu, Danièle Lebrun, François Levantal, Karim Belkhadra, Roland Marchisio', null, 'Old professional killer Wagner seeks someone to teach what he knows as long as he is already dying, and he chooses Max, young and passionless thief to be his successor.', 'Old professional killer Wagner seeks someone to teach what he knows as long as he is already dying, and he chooses Max, young and passionless thief to be his successor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cq6qzZTrBtMfGaoco5SMgOd4IlI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34068'),
  ('781903088244943832', 'Assassination', 1964, 'Drama', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Masao Kosugi, Kiyoshi Kikuchi', 'Nobuo Yamada', 'Tetsuro Tamba, Eiji Okada, Eitarō Ozawa, Isao Kimura, Shima Iwashita, Keiji Sada, Takeshi Kusaka, Sumio Takatsu', 'NR', 'In 1863, when American warships approach Japan, an enigmatic ronin becomes an important figure in a complex game of power between the Shogunate and the empire.', 'In 1863, when American warships approach Japan, an enigmatic ronin becomes an important figure in a complex game of power between the Shogunate and the empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw6MpSwdAqluU1sNov0DdZya5Rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88562'),
  ('157765679814457007', 'Assassination', 1965, 'War, Drama, History', 'Rudolf Milič, Miloš Vacek, Otakar Fuka', 'Kamil Pixa, Miloslav Fábera, Jiří Sequens', 'Radoslav Brzobohatý, Rudolf Jelínek, Ladislav Mrkvička, Luděk Munzar, Josef Vinklář, Siegfried Loyda, Harry Studt, Wolf Goette', null, 'In autumn 1941, Reich Protector Reinhard Heydrich’s brutal rule in occupied Bohemia and Moravia fuels Czech resistance. In spring 1942, the government-in-exile sends trained paratroopers led by Lt. Král on a mission to assassinate him. Masters Strnad and Vyskočil ambush Heydrich’s open Mercedes in Prague’s Libeň district, mortally wounding him despite a jammed submachine gun. Their success triggers harsh Nazi reprisals, mass executions, and an intense manhunt for the operatives.', 'In autumn 1941, Reich Protector Reinhard Heydrich’s brutal rule in occupied Bohemia and Moravia fuels Czech resistance. In spring 1942, the government-in-exile sends trained paratroopers led by Lt. Král on a mission to assassinate him. Masters Strnad and Vyskočil ambush Heydrich’s open Mercedes in Prague’s Libeň district, mortally wounding him despite a jammed submachine gun. Their success triggers harsh Nazi reprisals, mass executions, and an intense manhunt for the operatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryepW3Rjhorhtv7f4VuM6ETSUo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136446'),
  ('197798313966451211', 'Assassination', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Peter R. Hunt, Jack Gill, Hanania Baer', 'Richard Sale', 'Charles Bronson, Jill Ireland, Stephen Elliott, Jan Gan Boyd, James Staley, Frank Zagarino, Randy Brooks, James Lemp', 'PG-13', 'Jay Killon is the bodyguard of the recently elected US president, but he is assigned to the first lady (Lara Royce). Lara hates Killon so she does all she can to escape. The story complicates when someone tries to kill Lara.', 'Jay Killon is the bodyguard of the recently elected US president, but he is assigned to the first lady (Lara Royce). Lara hates Killon so she does all she can to escape. The story complicates when someone tries to kill Lara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wGAfVATbWAL6g91XMnMZeMKz5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48686'),
  ('33338886421527103', 'Assassination', 2015, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Lee Woong-kyu, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Lee Ki-cheol, Choi Dong-hoon', 'Gianna Jun, Ha Jung-woo, Lee Jung-jae, Oh Dal-su, Cho Jin-woong, Lee Kyung-young, Choi Deok-moon, Kim Eui-sung', 'NR', 'In Japanese-occupied Korea, three freedom fighters are assigned a mission to assassinate a genocidal military leader and his top collaborator. But the plan goes completely awry amidst double-crossings, counter-assassinations, and a shocking revelation about one of the assassins'' past.', 'In Japanese-occupied Korea, three freedom fighters are assigned a mission to assassinate a genocidal military leader and his top collaborator. But the plan goes completely awry amidst double-crossings, counter-assassinations, and a shocking revelation about one of the assassins'' past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4waWHgfIaqcFfMQ38aKDs6Pkw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291549'),
  ('223578989943612879', 'Assassination Classroom', 2015, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Eiichiro Hasumi, Yûsuke Tsurumi, Hiroko Kinoshita', 'Tatsuya Kanazawa', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Ryosuke Yamada, Masaki Suda, Maika Yamamoto, Haruka, Mio Yuki, Miku Uehara, Kippei Shiina', null, 'A mysterious creature destroys part of the moon and then warns that, if it is not destroyed before March of the following year, Earth will be next. It also demands to become the homeroom teacher of Class E, a third-year class at Kunugigaoka High School.', 'A mysterious creature destroys part of the moon and then warns that, if it is not destroyed before March of the following year, Earth will be next. It also demands to become the homeroom teacher of Class E, a third-year class at Kunugigaoka High School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h752DXxIvf4diBtnVd6JRQCm0OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349176'),
  ('345879647097448527', 'Assassination Classroom the Movie: 365 Days'' Time', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Seiji Kishi', 'Makoto Uezu', 'Jun Fukuyama, Mai Fuchigami, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Aya Suzaki, Ayaka Suwa, Chie Matsuura, Eiji Miyashita, Fuuko Saito', 'PG-13', 'The killer class is back in session—sort of. Relive every moment through the eyes of the top two students: Nagisa and Karma!', 'The killer class is back in session—sort of. Relive every moment through the eyes of the top two students: Nagisa and Karma!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61gRLHlmI0pRXc7rfIo6BWiI5DJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431808'),
  ('341811719814597820', 'Assassination Classroom: Graduation', 2016, 'Comedy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Eiichiro Hasumi, Junya Hirota, Minoru Hattori', 'Tatsuya Kanazawa', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Masaki Suda, Maika Yamamoto, Haruka, Mio Yuki, Miku Uehara, Seishirou Katou, Kanna Hashimoto', null, 'A mysterious creature destroys part of the moon and then warns that if it is not destroyed before March of the following year, Earth will be next. It also demands to become the homeroom teacher of Class E, a third-year class at Kunugigaoka High School. As the deadline for the assassination and the date of the end of the world approach, the students discover their true abilities and Koro-sensei''s shocking identity.', 'A mysterious creature destroys part of the moon and then warns that if it is not destroyed before March of the following year, Earth will be next. It also demands to become the homeroom teacher of Class E, a third-year class at Kunugigaoka High School. As the deadline for the assassination and the date of the end of the world approach, the students discover their true abilities and Koro-sensei''s shocking identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77fTE8nJY5ZMm7b4Nk8ntBC6ccf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359628'),
  ('987367336300044023', 'Assassination Games', 2011, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Phil Parmet, Ernie Barbarash, Stanimir Stamatov', 'Aaron Rahsaan Thomas', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Scott Adkins, Ivan Kaye, Kevin Chapman, Marija Karan, Bianca Bree, Michael Higgs, Valentin Teodosiu', 'R', 'Brazil is a contract killer, willing to take any job if the price is right. Flint left the assassin game when a ruthless drug dealer’s brutal attack left his wife in a coma. When a contract is put out on the same coldblooded drug dealer, both Brazil and Flint want him dead – one for the money, the other for revenge. With crooked Interpol agents and vicious members of the criminal underworld hot on their trail, these two assassins reluctantly join forces to quickly take out their target before they themselves are terminated.', 'Brazil is a contract killer, willing to take any job if the price is right. Flint left the assassin game when a ruthless drug dealer’s brutal attack left his wife in a coma. When a contract is put out on the same coldblooded drug dealer, both Brazil and Flint want him dead – one for the money, the other for revenge. With crooked Interpol agents and vicious members of the criminal underworld hot on their trail, these two assassins reluctantly join forces to quickly take out their target before they themselves are terminated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quJ0kXiQmP7rOg1m6WGmallQiJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71677'),
  ('893398812775429466', 'Assassination Nation', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Ben LeDoux, Chelsea Donison, Sam Levinson', 'Sam Levinson', 'Odessa Young, Hari Nef, ABRA, Suki Waterhouse, Anika Noni Rose, Colman Domingo, Maude Apatow, Bella Thorne', null, 'After an anonymous hacker begins leaking the private data of thousands living in a small American town, the townspeople spiral into madness, with four high school seniors at the center of the maelstrom.', 'After an anonymous hacker begins leaking the private data of thousands living in a small American town, the townspeople spiral into madness, with four high school seniors at the center of the maelstrom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMg1wPakqPx54yMzm0OuHn1jl42.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446101'),
  ('437702861311665646', 'Assassination of a High School President', 2008, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Brett Simon, M. David Mullen', 'Tim Calpin, Kevin Jakubowski', 'Reece Thompson, Mischa Barton, Bruce Willis, Patrick Taylor, Melonie Díaz, Luke Grimes, Michael Rapaport, Kathryn Morris', 'R', 'After the theft of copies of SAT exams from a principal''s office, teenage reporter Bobby Funke sets out to unmask the thief.', 'After the theft of copies of SAT exams from a principal''s office, teenage reporter Bobby Funke sets out to unmask the thief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHpyczADOGI0OXLliT4k4A1stFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18176'),
  ('527277945035324311', 'Assassination on the Tiber', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Ciarlo, Roberto Tatti', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Tomas Milian, Marina Ripa di Meana, Roberta Manfredi, Alberto Farnese, Massimo Vanni, Enzo Liberti, Marino Masé, Angelo Pellegrino', null, 'A black-out occurs during the meeting of a gang of criminals. When the light is back one of them is found killed with a stab on his back and all the clues point to a penniless man who had an argument with the victim a short time before the murder.', 'A black-out occurs during the meeting of a gang of criminals. When the light is back one of them is found killed with a stab on his back and all the clues point to a penniless man who had an argument with the victim a short time before the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mja3IPGvuTZubYlWPGSD2IwMo46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62715'),
  ('1148278697470079014', 'Assassination Tango', 2003, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Robert Duvall, Walter Rippell, Fernando Altschul', 'Robert Duvall', 'Robert Duvall, Rubén Blades, Kathy Baker, Luciana Pedraza, James Keane, Natalia Lobo, Alejandra Radano, María Nieves Rego', null, 'John J. is a seasoned hit man sent on a job to Argentina. When the General he''s sent to kill delays his return to the country, John passes the time with Manuela, a beautiful dancer who becomes his teacher and guide into Argentina''s sensual world of the tango.', 'John J. is a seasoned hit man sent on a job to Argentina. When the General he''s sent to kill delays his return to the country, John passes the time with Manuela, a beautiful dancer who becomes his teacher and guide into Argentina''s sensual world of the tango.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3muiZ9yF1RpKfzn9eqAxqA1YFWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16425'),
  ('646487218223652795', 'Assassins', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Donner, Vilmos Zsigmond, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Lilly Wachowski, Lana Wachowski, Brian Helgeland', 'Sylvester Stallone, Antonio Banderas, Julianne Moore, Anatoli Davydov, Muse Watson, Steve Kahan, Kelly Rowan, Reed Diamond', 'R', 'Assassin Robert Rath arrives at a funeral to kill a prominent mobster, only to witness a rival hired gun complete the job for him -- with grisly results. Horrified by the murder of innocent bystanders, Rath decides to take one last job and then return to civilian life. But finding his way out of the world of contract killing grows ever more dangerous as Rath falls for his female target and becomes a marked man himself.', 'Assassin Robert Rath arrives at a funeral to kill a prominent mobster, only to witness a rival hired gun complete the job for him -- with grisly results. Horrified by the murder of innocent bystanders, Rath decides to take one last job and then return to civilian life. But finding his way out of the world of contract killing grows ever more dangerous as Rath falls for his female target and becomes a marked man himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wPmZYnaQpxwoHmwNwVhZ2IY0UbF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9691'),
  ('809476080787991926', 'Assassins', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Ryan White, John Benam', null, 'Siti Aisyah, Doan Thi Huong, Hadi Azmi, Anna Fifield, Kim Jong-nam, Kim Jong-un, Donald Trump, Ri Sol-ju', null, 'True crime meets global spy thriller in this gripping account of the assassination of Kim Jong-nam, the half brother of the North Korean leader. The film follows the trial of the two female assassins, probing the question: were the women trained killers or innocent pawns of North Korea?', 'True crime meets global spy thriller in this gripping account of the assassination of Kim Jong-nam, the half brother of the North Korean leader. The film follows the trial of the two female assassins, probing the question: were the women trained killers or innocent pawns of North Korea?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guEH393qNWWh2wBJoGP7oqmjTK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653740'),
  ('34415658076155412', 'Assault', 1971, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Sidney Hayers, Ken Hodges, Stuart Freeman', 'John Kruse', 'Suzy Kendall, Frank Finlay, Freddie Jones, James Laurenson, Lesley-Anne Down, Tony Beckley, Anthony Ainley, Dilys Hamlett', 'R', 'After a schoolgirl is raped while taking a short cut through the local woods, and another murdered a few days later, the police are baffled. With the help of a reporter, and against the wishes of a local psychologist, a young schoolteacher uses herself as bait to lure the perpetrator out.', 'After a schoolgirl is raped while taking a short cut through the local woods, and another murdered a few days later, the police are baffled. With the help of a reporter, and against the wishes of a local psychologist, a young schoolteacher uses herself as bait to lure the perpetrator out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zx4xaFck68SuahsGvo2WCPaHpdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106046'),
  ('771221755673822854', 'Assault at West Point: The Court-Martial of Johnson Whittaker', 1994, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Harry Moses, Ken Kelsch, Timothy J. Lonsdale', 'Harry Moses', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Sam Waterston, Mason Adams, Val Avery, Eddie Bracken, Gene Canfield, Robert Clohessy, Al Freeman Jr.', null, 'The story of Johnson Whittaker, one of the first African-American cadets admitted to West Point. Tied down and beaten by his fellow cadets', 'The story of Johnson Whittaker, one of the first African-American cadets admitted to West Point. Tied down and beaten by his fellow cadets', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC53VlxlUv9whTS25k51fWog1NU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66799'),
  ('978554191864038502', 'Assault Girls', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Hiroaki Yuasa, Mamoru Oshii, Kazuhiro Wakabayashi', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Meisa Kuroki, Rinko Kikuchi, Hinako Saeki, Yoshikazu Fujiki, Ian Moore', null, 'Three women and one man - with an assortment of weaponry - wage war against giant mutant sandwhales in a barren digital landscape, all to achieve points within the virtual reality video game called Avalon.', 'Three women and one man - with an assortment of weaponry - wage war against giant mutant sandwhales in a barren digital landscape, all to achieve points within the virtual reality video game called Avalon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2m71925BHKULBlAkLtw0pazLUit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41373'),
  ('755583337291380708', 'Assault of the Killer Bimbos', 1988, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Anita Rosenberg, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, Christina Whitaker, Tammara Souza, Nick Cassavetes, Griffin O''Neal, Jamie Bozian, Mike Muscat, Patti Astor', 'R', 'Two go-go dancers, Lulu and Peaches, are framed for the murder of their employer by the real killer, sleazy gangster Vinnie. Picking up waitress Darlene along the way, the three are involved in wild car chases with cops as they head south to cross the border into Mexico, where they unexpectedly encounter Vinnie in a fleabag Mexican motel.', 'Two go-go dancers, Lulu and Peaches, are framed for the murder of their employer by the real killer, sleazy gangster Vinnie. Picking up waitress Darlene along the way, the three are involved in wild car chases with cops as they head south to cross the border into Mexico, where they unexpectedly encounter Vinnie in a fleabag Mexican motel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD4mgkM8Qq6N1rrfCDbv93FxGHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67387'),
  ('131622110217551877', 'Assault of the Party Nerds', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Richard Gabai, Howard Wexler, M. Alex Becker', 'Richard Gabai', 'Troy Donahue, Linnea Quigley, Michelle Bauer, Deborah Roush, Joe Whyte, Marc Silverberg, Christopher Dempsey, Kevin Glover', 'R', 'Ritchie Spencer and his friends have a problem. They are the only four members of their fraternity, and they are all graduating. They must find a way to bring in more members before they leave, and dodge their way around the rival jock fraternity.', 'Ritchie Spencer and his friends have a problem. They are the only four members of their fraternity, and they are all graduating. They must find a way to bring in more members before they leave, and dodge their way around the rival jock fraternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wJBQMS8vl8tNKkIaDCThA1Xk7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30027'),
  ('883338975373827978', 'Assault on a Queen', 1966, 'Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Donohue, William H. Daniels, Robert D. Webb', 'Rod Serling', 'Frank Sinatra, Virna Lisi, Anthony Franciosa, Richard Conte, Alf Kjellin, Errol John, Murray Matheson, Reginald Denny', 'NR', 'A group of adventurers refloat a WWII German submarine and prepare to use it to pull a very large heist; The Queen Mary which they plan to rob on the high seas.', 'A group of adventurers refloat a WWII German submarine and prepare to use it to pull a very large heist; The Queen Mary which they plan to rob on the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njPVhwl192zIJOpy5agbzY7XCEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42716'),
  ('702381750758948423', 'Assault on Death Mountain', 1999, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Jon Cassar, David Geddes', 'Calvin Clements Jr.', 'Hulk Hogan, Shannon Tweed, Carl Weathers, Martin Kove, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Gerard Plunkett, Ken Kirzinger, Lisa Schrage', null, 'The Shadow Warriors hire on to reclaim the daughter of a woman whose ex-husband kidnapped the child after a custody battle. At the same time, they uncover a terrorist plot to attack Seattle.', 'The Shadow Warriors hire on to reclaim the daughter of a woman whose ex-husband kidnapped the child after a custody battle. At the same time, they uncover a terrorist plot to attack Seattle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fETOOFeqO6D1N2jHP0OGTzsoxxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68121'),
  ('199308679283737591', 'Assault on Devil''s Island', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Jon Cassar, Gregory J. Barnett, Fernando Castroman', 'Calvin Clements Jr.', 'Hulk Hogan, Carl Weathers, Shannon Tweed, Martin Kove, Trevor Goddard, Christopher Douglas, Mike White, Billy Blanks', 'R', 'When one of Mike McBride''s men goes rogue and takes a group of gymnasts hostage to Devil''s Island in exchange for the return of drug lord Carlos Gallindo, the SEALS face their most perilous assignment yet.', 'When one of Mike McBride''s men goes rogue and takes a group of gymnasts hostage to Devil''s Island in exchange for the return of drug lord Carlos Gallindo, the SEALS face their most perilous assignment yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWewLlQQR51ckBgHYtY6NUuZ0wI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92011'),
  ('1000768808975405084', 'Assault on Dome 4', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Gilbert Po, David Mackay', 'Hersh Rephun', 'Bruce Campbell, Joseph Culp, Jocelyn Seagrave, Brion James, Ray Baker, Jack Nance, James Lew, Mark Bringelson', null, 'In this science-fiction action opus, intergalactic extremist Alex Windham has seized control of Dome 4, a scientific outpost on another planet, after escaping from a penal colony on Mars. Windham is forcing the staff of Dome 4 to construct new weapons that he can use to destroy his enemies, but what he doesn''t know is that one of his captives is the wife of interstellar lawman Chase Moran, and Mor', 'In this science-fiction action opus, intergalactic extremist Alex Windham has seized control of Dome 4, a scientific outpost on another planet, after escaping from a penal colony on Mars. Windham is forcing the staff of Dome 4 to construct new weapons that he can use to destroy his enemies, but what he doesn''t know is that one of his captives is the wife of interstellar lawman Chase Moran, and Mor', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN9V1WeP9NiIUGdwDsYwpfTFGBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35983'),
  ('271822258515408072', 'Assault on Precinct 13', 1976, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'John Carpenter, Douglas Knapp, James Nichols', 'John Carpenter', 'Austin Stoker, Darwin Joston, Laurie Zimmer, Martin West, Tony Burton, Charles Cyphers, Nancy Kyes, Peter Bruni', 'R', 'A highway patrol officer, two criminals, and a station secretary form an unlikely alliance to defend a defunct Los Angeles precinct against a siege by a bloodthirsty street gang.', 'A highway patrol officer, two criminals, and a station secretary form an unlikely alliance to defend a defunct Los Angeles precinct against a siege by a bloodthirsty street gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RtGDEmXbSxE8NThCCY1SXFXLLw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17814'),
  ('544987265596584095', 'Assault on Precinct 13', 2005, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Jean-François Richet, Robert Gantz, Jennifer Heimpel', 'John Carpenter', 'Ethan Hawke, Laurence Fishburne, Gabriel Byrne, Maria Bello, Drea De Matteo, John Leguizamo, Brian Dennehy, Ja Rule', 'R', 'On New Year''s Eve, inside a police station that''s about to be closed for good, officer Jake Roenick must cobble together a force made up cops and criminals to save themselves from a mob looking to kill mobster Marion Bishop.', 'On New Year''s Eve, inside a police station that''s about to be closed for good, officer Jake Roenick must cobble together a force made up cops and criminals to save themselves from a mob looking to kill mobster Marion Bishop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBpsRvMN1ONl8oFHuWt1rasDYFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8978'),
  ('1150852724716752345', 'Assault on the Pay Train', 1962, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roberto Farias, Amleto Daissé', 'Roberto Farias', 'Eliezer Gomes, Reginaldo Faria, Jorge Dória, Átila Iório, Grande Otelo, Ruth de Souza, Luiza Maranhão, Helena Ignez', null, 'Based on true events in Rio de Janeiro, in 1960, when a gang having the infamous outlaw Tião Medonho as a leader performed a sensational railroad hold-up on a train carrying a small fortune.', 'Based on true events in Rio de Janeiro, in 1960, when a gang having the infamous outlaw Tião Medonho as a leader performed a sensational railroad hold-up on a train carrying a small fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLdxavZ6BsnjA5BRMRBTCCX5fL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86379'),
  ('854280102288749872', 'Assault on VA-33', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Alexander Yellen, Greg Lamberson, Dylan Hoffman', 'Scott Thomas Reynolds', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Michael Jai White, Mark Dacascos, Weston Cage, Rob Szatkowski, Gina Holden, Abigail Hawk, Brittany Underwood', 'R', 'Decorated army veteran Jason Hill is on a routine visit to the local VA hospital when organized terrorists infiltrate the building and take hostages, including a decorated general, and Hill’s wife. The highly trained veteran is outnumbered and the last line of defense, taking on a building full of armed insurgents before it’s too late.', 'Decorated army veteran Jason Hill is on a routine visit to the local VA hospital when organized terrorists infiltrate the building and take hostages, including a decorated general, and Hill’s wife. The highly trained veteran is outnumbered and the last line of defense, taking on a building full of armed insurgents before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSAvEMPr8ddriiIX2fxbaPwpa5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797294'),
  ('566110107468558547', 'Assault on Wall Street', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Mathias Neumann, Uwe Boll, Shamess Shute', 'Uwe Boll', 'Dominic Purcell, Erin Karpluk, Edward Furlong, John Heard, Keith David, Michael Paré, Lochlyn Munro, Eric Roberts', 'R', 'Jim is an average New Yorker living a peaceful life with a well paying job and a loving family. Suddenly, everything changes when the economy crashes causing Jim to lose everything. Filled with anger and rage, Jim snaps and goes to extreme lengths to seek revenge for the life taken from him.', 'Jim is an average New Yorker living a peaceful life with a well paying job and a loving family. Suddenly, everything changes when the economy crashes causing Jim to lose everything. Filled with anger and rage, Jim snaps and goes to extreme lengths to seek revenge for the life taken from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4dm5XEXIT73aB0g1nrplwYguaU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184125'),
  ('121415086770429668', 'Assault! Jack the Ripper', 1976, 'Horror, Drama, Crime', 'Yasuharu Hasebe, Masaru Mori, Nobuyuki Saitō', 'Chiho Katsura', 'Tamaki Katsura, Yutaka Hayashi, Yuri Yamashina, Rei Okamoto, Runa Takamura, Natsuko Yashiro, Naomi Oka, Masumi Jun', null, 'Two restaurant employees begin a sexual killing spree after they accidentally kill a hitch hiker and find that murder and mutilation is their mutual aphrodisiac.', 'Two restaurant employees begin a sexual killing spree after they accidentally kill a hitch hiker and find that murder and mutilation is their mutual aphrodisiac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcQTBOmfPihlhs06aboO8S8RfiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39856'),
  ('1016873452089909283', 'Assembly', 2007, 'Action, History', 'Feng Xiaogang, Zheng Chunyu, Lü Yue', 'Liu Heng', 'Zhang Hanyu, Deng Chao, Yuan Wenkang, Tang Yan, Liao Fan, Wang Baoqiang, Hu Jun, Ren Quan', null, 'Follows a soldier trying to gain recognition for comrades who died in 1948, at a turning point in the civil war between the communists and the nationalist forces of the Kuomintang.', 'Follows a soldier trying to gain recognition for comrades who died in 1948, at a turning point in the civil war between the communists and the nationalist forces of the Kuomintang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8drBimtE0UFLlIh8BrLyk0C8Ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14044'),
  ('1030313454110626350', 'Assi', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Anubhav Sinha, Ewan Mulligan, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Anubhav Sinha, Gaurav Solanki', 'Taapsee Pannu, Kani Kusruti, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Manoj Pahwa, Kumud Mishra', null, 'A gripping courtroom drama centers on unexplained sexual assault cases. An investigator and defense team fight to reveal shocking truths hidden beneath statistics and uncover the human cost behind the headlines.', 'A gripping courtroom drama centers on unexplained sexual assault cases. An investigator and defense team fight to reveal shocking truths hidden beneath statistics and uncover the human cost behind the headlines.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwBs2SZKKaYZJDmq01maIjdZwUT0.jpg', 'plex:movie:assi-2026'),
  ('1048788532935487699', 'Assignment Terror', 1970, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tulio Demicheli, Godofredo Pacheco, Eberhard Meichsner', 'Paul Naschy', 'Michael Rennie, Karin Dor, Craig Hill, Patty Shepard, Ángel del Pozo, Paul Naschy, Manuel de Blas, Ferdinando Murolo', null, 'Aliens from a dying world plot to conquer earth by preying on man''s superstitions. Bringing two dead scientists back to life, they use their knowledge to re-animate various earth monsters, including the werewolf, Frankenstein''s monster, the mummy Tao-Tet, and the vampire Count de Meirhoff.', 'Aliens from a dying world plot to conquer earth by preying on man''s superstitions. Bringing two dead scientists back to life, they use their knowledge to re-animate various earth monsters, including the werewolf, Frankenstein''s monster, the mummy Tao-Tet, and the vampire Count de Meirhoff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN38R3xfr5J5Cqn66NA257BPocc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3216'),
  ('927439201390951515', 'Assignment: Outer Space', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Antonio Margheriti, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Ennio De Concini, Jack Wallace', 'Rik Van Nutter, Gabriella Farinon, David Montresor, Archie Savage, Alain Dijon, Franco Fantasia, Joe Pollini, David Maran', null, 'Interplanetary News reporter Ray Peterson is assigned aboard a space station in the 21st Century.', 'Interplanetary News reporter Ray Peterson is assigned aboard a space station in the 21st Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydvdYJqw0p3KJP1pvouU0SHGWgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35611'),
  ('235060735284262604', 'Assignment: Paris', 1952, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Parrish, Ray Cory, Burnett Guffey', 'William Bowers', 'Dana Andrews, George Sanders, Audrey Totter, Märta Torén, Sandro Giglio, Donald Randolph, Herbert Berghof, Ben Astar', null, 'Paris-based New York Herald Tribune reporter Jimmy Race is sent by his boss behind the Iron Curtain in Budapest to investigate a meeting involving the Hungarian ambassador.', 'Paris-based New York Herald Tribune reporter Jimmy Race is sent by his boss behind the Iron Curtain in Budapest to investigate a meeting involving the Hungarian ambassador.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAaY3exbGJLVcFS2hRJeXq3FMcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87294'),
  ('322042749613278820', 'Assimilate', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Bryan Mitchell, John Murlowski, Damian Horan', 'Steven Palmer Peterson, John Murlowski', 'Andi Matichak, Cam Gigandet, Calum Worthy, Jessica Medina, Joel Courtney, Katherine McNamara, Mason McNulty, John Murlowski', 'PG-13', 'Three friends making a web series about their town discover that their neighbors are being killed and replaced by creatures who are perfect copies of their victims.', 'Three friends making a web series about their town discover that their neighbors are being killed and replaced by creatures who are perfect copies of their victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbMZEbL9FuhvHOS5Yivz5Vwbbhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528985'),
  ('278458793799227983', 'Associations', 1975, null, 'John Smith', null, null, null, '''Associations'' sets language against itself by using the ambiguities inherent in the English language. Images from magazines and color supplements accompany a voice-over reading from the book ''Word Associations and Linguistic Theory'' by academic linguistic Herbert H. Clark. Combining a wry sense of humor with word/visual games and puns, Smith explores the boundaries of cinematic montage by combining elements together and against each other in order to destroy and create multiple meanings at the same time.', '''Associations'' sets language against itself by using the ambiguities inherent in the English language. Images from magazines and color supplements accompany a voice-over reading from the book ''Word Associations and Linguistic Theory'' by academic linguistic Herbert H. Clark. Combining a wry sense of humor with word/visual games and puns, Smith explores the boundaries of cinematic montage by combining elements together and against each other in order to destroy and create multiple meanings at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfY2j1B1RQttEZsHMNMXe8vgG4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179724'),
  ('170656357485959550', 'Assolo', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Laura Morante', 'Daniele Costantini, Laura Morante', 'Laura Morante, Marco Giallini, Francesco Pannofino, Carolina Crescentini, Piera Degli Esposti, Lambert Wilson, Angela Finocchiaro, Gigio Alberti', null, 'A funny and intelligent comedy about a wonderfully flawed woman.', 'A funny and intelligent comedy about a wonderfully flawed woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opLG4wKnTvlXLflO7wx5Y2IERV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375167'),
  ('149813993277402768', 'Assunta Spina', 1915, 'Drama', 'Francesca Bertini, Gustavo Serena, Alberto G. Carta', 'Francesca Bertini, Gustavo Serena', 'Francesca Bertini, Gustavo Serena, Carlo Benetti, Luciano Albertini, Amelia Cipriani, Antonio Cruichi', null, 'Assunta and Michele are in love, but others come between them and jealousy arises. Assunta Spina stands out as an early landmark of naturalistic acting and a blueprint for the Italian Neorealist films to come.', 'Assunta and Michele are in love, but others come between them and jealousy arises. Assunta Spina stands out as an early landmark of naturalistic acting and a blueprint for the Italian Neorealist films to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5Rq27ZzhnWN8wWHkre8ZlAgyvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174203'),
  ('212574733207619339', 'Asteria', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alexandre Arpentinier, Mathieu Blanchys, Lola Grand', null, 'Benoît Allemane, Gabriel Bismuth-Bienaimé', null, 'Two astronauts attempt to plant their flag on a newly discovered planet. But first, they need to get rid of some pesky aliens whose business there is unknown.', 'Two astronauts attempt to plant their flag on a newly discovered planet. But first, they need to get rid of some pesky aliens whose business there is unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exT7XlhzMFwod0rLNzxuCyeYgSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441043'),
  ('728220274502816892', 'Asterix & Obelix: God Save Britannia', 2012, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Laurent Tirard, Catherine Pujol, Denis Rouden', 'Laurent Tirard', 'Édouard Baer, Gérard Depardieu, Guillaume Gallienne, Vincent Lacoste, Valérie Lemercier, Fabrice Luchini, Catherine Deneuve, Charlotte Le Bon', null, 'Asterix crosses the channel to help second-cousin Anticlimax face down Julius Caesar and invading Romans.', 'Asterix crosses the channel to help second-cousin Anticlimax face down Julius Caesar and invading Romans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbdGCkvLPxuSvfVwHDK4PmOqmIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99770'),
  ('335834998102286499', 'Asterix & Obelix: Mission Cleopatra', 2002, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alain Chabat, Laurent Dailland, Noureddine Aberdine', 'Alain Chabat', 'Gérard Depardieu, Christian Clavier, Jamel Debbouze, Monica Bellucci, Alain Chabat, Claude Rich, Gérard Darmon, Édouard Baer', null, 'History''s favorite Gauls assist Queen Cleopatra when she wagers that the Egyptian people can build a palace for Julius Caesar in just three months.', 'History''s favorite Gauls assist Queen Cleopatra when she wagers that the Egyptian people can build a palace for Julius Caesar in just three months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gMmVSkY7RAxb5xRk7ej7JVhXyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2899'),
  ('800036375838694073', 'Asterix & Obelix: The Middle Kingdom', 2023, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'André Chemetoff, Sandrine Jarron, Victoria Correia', 'Philippe Mechelen, Julien Hervé, Guillaume Canet', 'Guillaume Canet, Gilles Lellouche, Vincent Cassel, Jonathan Cohen, Julie Chen, Leanna Chea, Marion Cotillard, José Garcia', 'PG', 'Gallic heroes and forever friends Asterix and Obelix journey to China to help Princess Sa See save the Empress and her land from a nefarious prince.', 'Gallic heroes and forever friends Asterix and Obelix journey to China to help Princess Sa See save the Empress and her land from a nefarious prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifOqT5SmA4ANjmyEacLw3KAFKUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643215'),
  ('420310544973209839', 'Asterix and Cleopatra', 1968, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'René Goscinny, Albert Uderzo, Jean Midre', 'Pierre Tchernia', 'Roger Carel, Jacques Morel, Micheline Dax, Jacques Balutin, Jacques Bodoin, Maurice Chevit, Pierre Tornade, Claude Dasset', null, 'Popular animated hero Asterix and his faithful sidekick Obelix travel to ancient Egypt to help Cleopatra build a new summer home. Cleopatra and Julius Caesar have made a bet, with Caesar wagering the project cannot be completed in a few weeks time. With the help of a magic potion, Asterix comes to the rescue of the Queen of the Nile as Caesar and an angry architect plot against them.', 'Popular animated hero Asterix and his faithful sidekick Obelix travel to ancient Egypt to help Cleopatra build a new summer home. Cleopatra and Julius Caesar have made a bet, with Caesar wagering the project cannot be completed in a few weeks time. With the help of a magic potion, Asterix comes to the rescue of the Queen of the Nile as Caesar and an angry architect plot against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNpKAmWFsCiWKKx39Ap8pF7EWQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9929'),
  ('199543998761037330', 'Asterix and Obelix vs. Caesar', 1999, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Claude Zidi, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Denis Seurat', 'Claude Zidi', 'Christian Clavier, Gérard Depardieu, Roberto Benigni, Michel Galabru, Claude Piéplu, Daniel Prévost, Pierre Palmade, Laetitia Casta', null, 'Set in 50 B.C., Asterix and Obelix are living in a small but well-protected village in Gaul, where a magic potion concocted by Druids turns the townsfolk into mighty soldiers. When Roman troops carve a path through Gaul to reach the English Channel, Caesar and his aide de camp Detritus discover the secret elixir and capture the Druid leader who knows its formula, and Asterix and Obelix are sent off to rescue them.', 'Set in 50 B.C., Asterix and Obelix are living in a small but well-protected village in Gaul, where a magic potion concocted by Druids turns the townsfolk into mighty soldiers. When Roman troops carve a path through Gaul to reach the English Channel, Caesar and his aide de camp Detritus discover the secret elixir and capture the Druid leader who knows its formula, and Asterix and Obelix are sent off to rescue them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJ4zNakOuWcsW6ssH1qk80JehQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9564'),
  ('935751639913744166', 'Asterix and the Big Fight', 1989, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Philippe Grimond, Craig Simpson, Keith Ingham', 'Adolf Kabatek, Yannik Voight', 'Roger Carel, Pierre Tornade, Julien Guiomar, Marie-Anne Chazel, Henri Labussière, Roger Lumont, Edgar Givry, Henri Poirier', null, 'Due to an unfortunate accident involving Obelix throwing a menhir, Getafix the druid not only loses his memory, but goes completely mad. Now deprived of the wisdom of their beloved druid and the protection provided by his magic potion, the Armorican village falls prey to a proclaimed soothsayer who comes with ominous predictions and overweening ambitions. It''s up to Asterix to keep his villager friends within reason and hopefully get Getafix to remember the magic potion''s recipe before the impending Roman attack.', 'Due to an unfortunate accident involving Obelix throwing a menhir, Getafix the druid not only loses his memory, but goes completely mad. Now deprived of the wisdom of their beloved druid and the protection provided by his magic potion, the Armorican village falls prey to a proclaimed soothsayer who comes with ominous predictions and overweening ambitions. It''s up to Asterix to keep his villager friends within reason and hopefully get Getafix to remember the magic potion''s recipe before the impending Roman attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KFAtZRXzD00Zw9sWxusrInLHgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11625'),
  ('448738114214990117', 'Asterix and the Vikings', 2006, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Stefan Fjeldmark, Jesper Møller, Sergio Pablos', 'Jean-Luc Goossens, Stefan Fjeldmark', 'Roger Carel, Lorànt Deutsch, Sara Forestier, Jacques Frantz, Stéphane Fourreau, Pierre Palmade, Pierre Tchernia, Bernard Alane', null, 'Asterix and Obelix have been given a tough mission: Transform the chief''s lazy nephew Justforkix into a warrior. When the Vikings abduct him and bring him back to their homeland, Asterix and Obelix must travel to Norway to rescue Justforkix.', 'Asterix and Obelix have been given a tough mission: Transform the chief''s lazy nephew Justforkix into a warrior. When the Vikings abduct him and bring him back to their homeland, Asterix and Obelix must travel to Norway to rescue Justforkix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW9h1Ez6PRx8PnZUVT27MnG8Wu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9642'),
  ('162293169377064131', 'Asterix at the Olympic Games', 2008, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Frédéric Forestier, Thomas Langmann, Thierry Arbogast', 'Thomas Langmann, Alexandre Charlot, Olivier Dazat', 'Gérard Depardieu, Clovis Cornillac, José Garcia, Franck Dubosc, Stéphane Rousseau, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Mónica Cruz, Alain Delon', null, 'Astérix and Obélix have to win the Olympic Games in order to help their friend Alafolix marry Princess Irina. Brutus uses every trick in the book to have his own team win the game, and get rid of his father Julius Caesar in the process.', 'Astérix and Obélix have to win the Olympic Games in order to help their friend Alafolix marry Princess Irina. Brutus uses every trick in the book to have his own team win the game, and get rid of his father Julius Caesar in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNB2SrqmTJLByRDq3akDzA6Z9rC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2395'),
  ('686770064800542045', 'Asterix Conquers America', 1994, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Gerhard Hahn, Thorsten Falke, Barry Newton', 'Thomas Platt, Gerhard Hahn', 'Peer Augustinski, Ottfried Fischer, Ralf Wolter, Jürgen Scheller, Kristiane Backer, Thomas Piper, Michael Habeck, Harald Juhnke', 'G', 'When marauding Romans capture - and catapult - their pal Getafix into lands unknown, the shrewd and cunning Asterix and his able sidekick Obelix spring into action! But their journey leads them to a strange and dangerous new world, where they must face a tribe of Indians, a stampeding herd of buffalo and a medicine man with designs on their magic potion!', 'When marauding Romans capture - and catapult - their pal Getafix into lands unknown, the shrewd and cunning Asterix and his able sidekick Obelix spring into action! But their journey leads them to a strange and dangerous new world, where they must face a tribe of Indians, a stampeding herd of buffalo and a medicine man with designs on their magic potion!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKSunt7dnbITSopaEeeR7KfeSHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9369'),
  ('514288008764217778', 'Asterix in Britain', 1986, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Pino Van Lamsweerde, Philippe Lainé, Keith Ingham', 'Albert Uderzo, René Goscinny', 'Roger Carel, Pierre Tornade, Graham Bushnell, Pierre Mondy, Maurice Risch, Roger Lumont, Nicolas Silberg, Albert Augier', null, 'One little ancient British village still holds out against the Roman invaders. Asterix and Obelix are invited to help. They must face fog, rain, warm beer and boiled boar with mint sauce, but they soon have Governor Encyclopaedius Britannicus''s Romans declining and falling. Until a wild race for a barrel of magic potion lands them in the drink.', 'One little ancient British village still holds out against the Roman invaders. Asterix and Obelix are invited to help. They must face fog, rain, warm beer and boiled boar with mint sauce, but they soon have Governor Encyclopaedius Britannicus''s Romans declining and falling. Until a wild race for a barrel of magic potion lands them in the drink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10L5R1l03MqDx36e0LJ99NKLGD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9318'),
  ('465281062901133880', 'Asterix the Gaul', 1967, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ray Goossens, Étienne Schürmann, Georges Lapeyronnie', 'Willy Lateste, Jos Marissen, László Molnár', 'Roger Carel, Jacques Morel, Pierre Tornade, Lucien Raimbourg, Pierre Trabaud, Bernard Lavalette, Robert Vattier, Georges Carmier', null, 'In the year 50 BC, Gaul is occupied by the Romans - nearly. But the small village of Asterix and his friends still resists the Roman legions with the aid of their druid''s magic potion, which gives superhuman strength. Learning of this potion, a Roman centurion kidnaps the druid to get the secret formula out of him.', 'In the year 50 BC, Gaul is occupied by the Romans - nearly. But the small village of Asterix and his friends still resists the Roman legions with the aid of their druid''s magic potion, which gives superhuman strength. Learning of this potion, a Roman centurion kidnaps the druid to get the secret formula out of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2dlVs5WRmAwIPVS5vODhAOkNy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11047'),
  ('331241094888974141', 'Asterix vs. Caesar', 1985, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Paul Brizzi, Philippe Lainé, Gaëtan Brizzi', 'Pierre Tchernia', 'Roger Carel, Pierre Tornade, Pierre Mondy, Serge Sauvion, Henri Labussière, Roger Lumont, Michel Barbey, Patrick Préjean', null, 'Obelix falls for a new arrival in his home village in Gaul, but is heartbroken when her true love arrives to visit her. However, the lovers are kidnapped by Romans; Asterix and Obelix set out to rescue them on a dangerous journey that will involve gladiators, slavers and beauracracy - and a personal encounter with the Emperor himself, Julius Caesar...', 'Obelix falls for a new arrival in his home village in Gaul, but is heartbroken when her true love arrives to visit her. However, the lovers are kidnapped by Romans; Asterix and Obelix set out to rescue them on a dangerous journey that will involve gladiators, slavers and beauracracy - and a personal encounter with the Emperor himself, Julius Caesar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LlqOgKKU0BeZzEo1PMMIjtLuj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8868'),
  ('153448623234283170', 'Asterix: The Mansions of the Gods', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Alexandre Astier, Louis Clichy', 'Alexandre Astier, Jean-Rémi François, Albert Uderzo', 'Roger Carel, Alexandre Astier, Lionnel Astier, Serge Papagalli, François Morel, Élie Semoun, Guillaume Briat, Lorànt Deutsch', null, 'In order to wipe out the Gaulish village by any means necessary, Caesar plans to absorb the villagers into Roman culture by having an estate built next to the village to start a new Roman colony.', 'In order to wipe out the Gaulish village by any means necessary, Caesar plans to absorb the villagers into Roman culture by having an estate built next to the village to start a new Roman colony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oppvIr8jmTXEVkzRHtipxcmvdQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170522'),
  ('944491942682051915', 'Asterix: The Secret of the Magic Potion', 2018, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Alexandre Astier, Louis Clichy', 'Albert Uderzo, Alexandre Astier, René Goscinny', 'Christian Clavier, Guillaume Briat, Alex Lutz, Alexandre Astier, Élie Semoun, Daniel Mesguich, Bernard Alane, François Morel', null, 'Following a fall during mistletoe picking, Druid Getafix decides that it is time to secure the future of the village. Accompanied by Asterix and Obelix, he undertakes to travel the Gallic world in search of a talented young druid to transmit the Secret of the Magic Potion.', 'Following a fall during mistletoe picking, Druid Getafix decides that it is time to secure the future of the village. Accompanied by Asterix and Obelix, he undertakes to travel the Gallic world in search of a talented young druid to transmit the Secret of the Magic Potion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OvHpzWXBzOvgZwOoUsqNSouSwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527729'),
  ('1038584636412712646', 'Asteroid', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Hennings, Thomas Del Ruth, Bradford May', 'Scott Sturgeon, Robbyn Burger', 'Michael Biehn, Annabella Sciorra, Zachary Charles, Don Franklin, Carlos Gómez, Michael Weatherly, Jensen Daggett, Anne-Marie Johnson', 'PG', 'With the discovery of an incoming asteroid, the government of America formulate a plan to destroy it. When the plan fails, all the world can do is wait. The main impact zone is revealed to be Dallas, Texas. Generally, the plot follows the lives and reactions of several characters: an astronomer, her father, her son, two firefighters from Kansas, two young doctors in Dallas and the heads of the government agency in charge of the situation.', 'With the discovery of an incoming asteroid, the government of America formulate a plan to destroy it. When the plan fails, all the world can do is wait. The main impact zone is revealed to be Dallas, Texas. Generally, the plot follows the lives and reactions of several characters: an astronomer, her father, her son, two firefighters from Kansas, two young doctors in Dallas and the heads of the government agency in charge of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5J99UfKU8xv66OF3uqi8sqlEAVO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36609'),
  ('985102077670945280', 'Asteroid', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Dylan Avery', 'Korey Rowe, Dylan Avery', 'Cuyle Carvin, Mattie Jo Cowsert, Miley Rose, LeJon Woods, Richard Waddingham, Elise Rovinsky, Angela Relucio, Bristol Pomeroy', null, 'An out of touch family man moves with his wife and daughter from the big city to his dream house on the outskirts of a small town just in time for the apocalypse.', 'An out of touch family man moves with his wife and daughter from the big city to his dream house on the outskirts of a small town just in time for the apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aT6HnC9Sv6b0UJwbxVnH5HTXml5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876502'),
  ('1004821131354825914', 'Asteroid City', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert D. Yeoman, Stéphane Cressend, Gemma Nunn', 'Wes Anderson', 'Jason Schwartzman, Scarlett Johansson, Tom Hanks, Jeffrey Wright, Tilda Swinton, Bryan Cranston, Edward Norton, Adrien Brody', 'PG-13', 'In an American desert town circa 1955, the itinerary of a Junior Stargazer/Space Cadet convention is spectacularly disrupted by world-changing events.', 'In an American desert town circa 1955, the itinerary of a Junior Stargazer/Space Cadet convention is spectacularly disrupted by world-changing events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfo7pvL9Fys7rocfL4VOzw9qDEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747188'),
  ('1066936950470199558', 'Asteroid vs Earth', 2014, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Christopher Ray, Laura Beth Love, Irwin Miller', 'Adam Lipsius', 'Tia Carrere, Robert Davi, Tim Russ, Jason Brooks, Darin Cooper, Robert R. Shafer, Craig Blair, Gerald Webb', null, 'When a shower of massive meteors threatens an extinction level on Earth, the world''s greatest minds devise a dangerous plan that will take the planet off its axis in order to avoid the impact.', 'When a shower of massive meteors threatens an extinction level on Earth, the world''s greatest minds devise a dangerous plan that will take the planet off its axis in order to avoid the impact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGm87aggFQF8oAmzNYWITL0NVVv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273756'),
  ('85825437413066898', 'Asteroid-a-Geddon', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Noah Luke, Nicholas Ryan, Amy Covell', 'Geoff Meed', 'Eric Roberts, Veronika Issa, Jennifer Lee Wiggins, Craig Gellis, Terry Woodberry, D''Artagnan Woods, Gigi Gustin, Isaac J. Cruz', null, 'A global scientific summit debates and fails on a plan to stop a massive asteroid heading straight for Earth, with all countries blaming each other for the impeding disaster. With communications tense, the daughter of a tech billionaire assembles her own team of specialists to try to destroy the asteroid before it is too late.', 'A global scientific summit debates and fails on a plan to stop a massive asteroid heading straight for Earth, with all countries blaming each other for the impeding disaster. With communications tense, the daughter of a tech billionaire assembles her own team of specialists to try to destroy the asteroid before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8zzGwkkOqial1BsoY8e8yrAIUxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756499'),
  ('746835841977410330', 'Asteroid: Final Impact', 2015, 'Action', 'Jason Bourque', 'Daniel Winters', 'Mark Lutz, Robin Dunne, Emilie Ullerup, Lochlyn Munro, Peter Brown, Viv Leacock, Sharon Taylor, Gary Jones', null, 'A deadly meteor storm has been labeled a one-time celestial occurrence, but astrophysicist Steve Thomas believes something worse is yet to come. After discovering his asteroid tracking satellite is secretly being used for military surveillance, Steve leaks the truth to the press, and it costs him his reputation, his job, and his friends. With the backlash of being a whistle-blower, the pressure threatens to tear his family apart, just when Steve discovers a threat to the entire planet: a giant dark asteroid invisible to current detection systems will soon strike the Earth. Barred from using his own satellite to prove the asteroid''s existence, Steve is forced to work in the shadows in a desperate attempt to save humanity.', 'A deadly meteor storm has been labeled a one-time celestial occurrence, but astrophysicist Steve Thomas believes something worse is yet to come. After discovering his asteroid tracking satellite is secretly being used for military surveillance, Steve leaks the truth to the press, and it costs him his reputation, his job, and his friends. With the backlash of being a whistle-blower, the pressure threatens to tear his family apart, just when Steve discovers a threat to the entire planet: a giant dark asteroid invisible to current detection systems will soon strike the Earth. Barred from using his own satellite to prove the asteroid''s existence, Steve is forced to work in the shadows in a desperate attempt to save humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQwvL9kK28XX1bYvTsU8hSdUURD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380088'),
  ('795914022879028553', 'Asthma', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jake Hoffman', 'Jake Hoffman', 'Benedict Samuel, Krysten Ritter, Nick Nolte, Rosanna Arquette, Goran Višnjić, Iggy Pop, Dov Tiefenbach, Gillian Zinser', null, 'A young musician takes a beautiful tattoo artist on a ride in a stolen classic car.', 'A young musician takes a beautiful tattoo artist on a ride in a stolen classic car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k88Dza68BhQXsEImgrXHVbRQ6M5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280922'),
  ('347651016891935054', 'Astragal', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Brigitte Sy, Frédéric Serve', 'Brigitte Sy, Serge Le Péron', 'Leïla Bekhti, Reda Kateb, Esther Garrel, India Hair, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Jocelyne Desverchère, Louis Garrel, Jean-Charles Dumay', null, 'On a night of April 1957, Albertine, a brillant and rebel 19-year-old girl, jumps from the wall of the prison where she’s serving a sentence for a holdup. In her fall, a bone from her ankle breaks: the astragal. She is rescued by Julien, a justice fugitive, and so is born a burning passion between them. He takes her to Paris and hides her. But while he leads his gangster life here and there, the young woman struggles for her freedom and against the wounds inflicted by Julien’s absence, and writes poetry.', 'On a night of April 1957, Albertine, a brillant and rebel 19-year-old girl, jumps from the wall of the prison where she’s serving a sentence for a holdup. In her fall, a bone from her ankle breaks: the astragal. She is rescued by Julien, a justice fugitive, and so is born a burning passion between them. He takes her to Paris and hides her. But while he leads his gangster life here and there, the young woman struggles for her freedom and against the wounds inflicted by Julien’s absence, and writes poetry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agivxVoWqDNmOo8pg2gTQhKPkzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329967'),
  ('43182197279991473', 'Astrakan', 2022, 'Drama', 'David Depesseville, Simon Beaufils, Julie Chojnacki', 'David Depesseville, Clara Bourreau', 'Mirko Gianinni, Jehnny Beth, Bastien Bouillon, Théo Costa-Marini, Lorine Delin, Paul Blain, Nathaël Bertrand, Cameron Bertrand', 'NR', 'Samuel is a wild-looking twelve-year-old orphan who has been placed with a nanny, Marie, for several weeks. Marie, who is struggling between her feelings and her need for money, is married to Clément with whom she has two sons, Alexis and Dimitri. Very quickly Samuel will have to get to know this new family and their possible secrets.', 'Samuel is a wild-looking twelve-year-old orphan who has been placed with a nanny, Marie, for several weeks. Marie, who is struggling between her feelings and her need for money, is married to Clément with whom she has two sons, Alexis and Dimitri. Very quickly Samuel will have to get to know this new family and their possible secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGYGRTLtHXVVasRM2h2SlHeflUm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984294'),
  ('889287431800557459', 'Astral', 2018, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chris Mul', 'Chris Mul, Michael Mul', 'Frank Dillane, Catherine Steadman, Trevor White, Darwin Shaw, Vanessa Grasse, Ned Porteous', 'NR', 'A detached university student faces the consequences of astral projection when he uses it to reconnect with his dead mother.', 'A detached university student faces the consequences of astral projection when he uses it to reconnect with his dead mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chqJMjTTpPhQ64vgyXEPYL3luG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419407'),
  ('497972837555772504', 'Astral City 2: The Messengers', 2024, 'Drama', 'Wagner de Assis, Lia Rezende, Lílis Soares', 'Wagner de Assis', 'Edson Celulari, Renato Prieto, Fábio Lago, Nando Brandão, Aline Prado, Ju Colombo, Othon Bastos, Felipe de Carolis', null, 'A group of messenger spirits led by Aniceto, including doctor André Luiz, are tasked with going to Earth to help rescue three proteges whose interconnected stories are about to fail.', 'A group of messenger spirits led by Aniceto, including doctor André Luiz, are tasked with going to Earth to help rescue three proteges whose interconnected stories are about to fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFkkq0xOiGc8nCmw5h0ugZM9wNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004284'),
  ('1131625886285398935', 'Astral City: A Spiritual Journey', 2010, 'Drama', 'Wagner de Assis, Ueli Steiger', 'Wagner de Assis', 'Renato Prieto, Fernando Alves Pinto, Rosanne Mulholland, Inez Viana, Rodrigo dos Santos, Werner Schünemann, Clemente Viscaíno, Ana Rosa', null, 'The selfish Dr. André Luiz dies and awakes in the limbo called "Umbral". After a painful period in the gruesome swamp, he is rescued and brought in a white light to "Nosso Lar" (meaning "Our Home"). He finds a place of harmony, where people live in peace awaiting', 'The selfish Dr. André Luiz dies and awakes in the limbo called "Umbral". After a painful period in the gruesome swamp, he is rescued and brought in a white light to "Nosso Lar" (meaning "Our Home"). He finds a place of harmony, where people live in peace awaiting', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUsqP3347kkNIbcx05uglDIs5jb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52333'),
  ('646963376118392972', 'Astro Boy', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Family, Science Fiction', 'David Bowers, Pepe Valencia, Jakob Hjort Jensen', 'Timothy Harris, David Bowers', 'Freddie Highmore, Kristen Bell, Nathan Lane, Eugene Levy, Matt Lucas, Bill Nighy, Donald Sutherland, Charlize Theron', 'PG', 'Set in the futuristic Metro City, Astro Boy (Atom) is a young robot with incredible powers created by a brilliant scientist in the image of the son he had lost. Unable to fulfill his creator''s expectations, Astro embarks on a journey in search of acceptance, experiencing betrayal and a netherworld of robot gladiators, before returning to save Metro City and reconcile with the father who rejected him.', 'Set in the futuristic Metro City, Astro Boy (Atom) is a young robot with incredible powers created by a brilliant scientist in the image of the son he had lost. Unable to fulfill his creator''s expectations, Astro embarks on a journey in search of acceptance, experiencing betrayal and a netherworld of robot gladiators, before returning to save Metro City and reconcile with the father who rejected him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6AK3uOHaIbl6EDaytHYe4FinZMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16577'),
  ('666627724650552792', 'Astro Kid', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Eric Tosti', 'David Alaux, Eric Tosti, Jean-François Tosti', 'Timothé Vom Dorp, Édouard Baer, Marie-Eugénie Maréchal, Guillaume Lebon, Barbara Tissier', 'PG', 'Terra Willy: Unexplored Planet — Upon the destruction of their ship, Willy is separated from his parents. He lands on a wild and unexplored planet and with the help of Buck, a survival robot, he will have to hold until the arrival of a rescue mission.', 'Terra Willy: Unexplored Planet — Upon the destruction of their ship, Willy is separated from his parents. He lands on a wild and unexplored planet and with the help of Buck, a survival robot, he will have to hold until the arrival of a rescue mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwqEIL5SrsZFVvileNe9LuHbJy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580600'),
  ('1062455131170724651', 'Astronaut: The Last Push', 2012, 'Science Fiction', 'Eric Hayden, A.J. Raitano', 'Eric Hayden', 'Khary Payton, Brian Baumgartner, Lance Henriksen, James Madio, Alec Gillis, Tom Woodruff Jr., Lira Angel, Sachiyo K', null, 'When a tragic accident cuts short the first manned mission to explore life on the moons of Jupiter, Michael Forrest must make the 3 year journey home to Earth in pure solitude', 'When a tragic accident cuts short the first manned mission to explore life on the moons of Jupiter, Michael Forrest must make the 3 year journey home to Earth in pure solitude', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auysnhVJ3ztKSLsyfCgJc2NbOxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110122'),
  ('276061750882223592', 'Astronautas', 2003, 'Drama', 'Santi Amodeo', null, 'Nancho Novo, Teresa Hurtado de Ory, Juan Motilla, Álex O''Dogherty, Manolo Solo', null, 'Daniel is approaching forty. Laura is almost sixteen. From what they say about him he must be a poet or a comic-strip illustrator, or both. He has just overcome a long addiction and, once back home, is trying to recongnize his life based on a strategy which consists basically in DOING EXACTLY WHAT A "NORMAL" PERSON DOES. Everything that happens to Daniel is, more or less, foreseeable because that''s what it''s all about: he should look after his personal grooming, take care of the small things, immerse himself in the real world... and so on until he has completed the ten small achievements in his manual, a set of COMMANDMENTS devised by an insipid public health system psychiatrist. And, in the midst of all this, an unexpected happening: Laura arrives in the city searching for her brother Andres, Daniel''s neighbor. But the brother is not home and she decides to wait for him, while organizing around Daniel what could be his "perfect world".', 'Daniel is approaching forty. Laura is almost sixteen. From what they say about him he must be a poet or a comic-strip illustrator, or both. He has just overcome a long addiction and, once back home, is trying to recongnize his life based on a strategy which consists basically in DOING EXACTLY WHAT A "NORMAL" PERSON DOES. Everything that happens to Daniel is, more or less, foreseeable because that''s what it''s all about: he should look after his personal grooming, take care of the small things, immerse himself in the real world... and so on until he has completed the ten small achievements in his manual, a set of COMMANDMENTS devised by an insipid public health system psychiatrist. And, in the midst of all this, an unexpected happening: Laura arrives in the city searching for her brother Andres, Daniel''s neighbor. But the brother is not home and she decides to wait for him, while organizing around Daniel what could be his "perfect world".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3sdjImE2MJRHFRoIIzctd8XtRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71439'),
  ('764358934464493532', 'Astrosamantha', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Gianluca Cerasola', null, 'Samantha Cristoforetti, Giancarlo Giannini', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7iW3kLRAabF6jZQPsYI3nNsAMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385673'),
  ('1002722941770283950', 'Asura', 2012, 'Animation, Drama, History, Horror', 'Keiichi Sato', 'Ikuko Takahashi', 'Masako Nozawa, Hiroaki Hirata, Kinya Kitaoji, Megumi Hayashibara, Tessyo Genda, Bin Shimada, Kaori Yamagata, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'Abandoned in the barren wasteland of Kyoto, a savage, enraged orphan does whatever it takes to survive in the wild. When he crosses paths with civilization, he must learn to tame the beast within.', 'Abandoned in the barren wasteland of Kyoto, a savage, enraged orphan does whatever it takes to survive in the wild. When he crosses paths with civilization, he must learn to tame the beast within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g61EUqJhjoqeDrztp77BJKcidNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181656'),
  ('158289981207794564', 'Asura: The City of Madness', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-han, Kim Sung-soo, Lee Mo-gae', 'Kim Sung-soo', 'Jung Woo-sung, Hwang Jung-min, Ju Ji-hoon, Kwak Do-won, Jeong Man-sik, Kim Won-hae, Kim Jong-soo, Kim Hae-gon', null, 'A shady cop finds himself in over his head when he gets caught between Internal Affairs and the city’s corrupt mayor.', 'A shady cop finds himself in over his head when he gets caught between Internal Affairs and the city’s corrupt mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJmSw2QFvX5vqdGQSBGe1x7HEcJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408620'),
  ('110153554702301450', 'Asuran', 2019, 'Action, Drama', 'Manimaran, Vetrimaaran, R. Velraj', 'Manimaran, Vetrimaaran', 'Dhanush, Manju Warrier, Ken Karunaas, Teejay, Pasupathy, Prakash Raj, Ammu Abhirami, Balaji Sakthivel', null, 'A family from the underprivileged class is on the run after the teenaged son kills a rich man from the upper caste. Can the pacifist father be able to save his hot-blooded son?', 'A family from the underprivileged class is on the run after the teenaged son kills a rich man from the upper caste. Can the pacifist father be able to save his hot-blooded son?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Elnp3XrAlMM30dil8rbL7D9XeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576928'),
  ('285913402746688580', 'Aswang', 1994, 'Horror', 'Barry Poltermann, Wrye Martin, Jim Zabilla', 'Wrye Martin, Barry Poltermann', 'Norman Moses, Tina Ona Paukstelis, John Kishline, Flora Coker, Victor DeLorenzo, Mildred Nierras, Jamie Jacobs Anderson, Daniel Demarco', null, 'A young, unwed, pregnant girl is made an offer she can''t refuse. Marry a rich young man with a wealthy estate to please his dying mother, and she''ll be well taken care of. What she doesn''t know is the family has plans to sacrifice her baby!', 'A young, unwed, pregnant girl is made an offer she can''t refuse. Marry a rich young man with a wealthy estate to please his dying mother, and she''ll be well taken care of. What she doesn''t know is the family has plans to sacrifice her baby!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yckKBNVXkq0PLasOEY2vhTxUzoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133535'),
  ('178973023410421721', 'Asylum', 1972, 'Horror', 'Roy Ward Baker, Denys N. Coop', 'Robert Bloch', 'Peter Cushing, Patrick Magee, Herbert Lom, Britt Ekland, Barry Morse, Charlotte Rampling, Barbara Parkins, Robert Powell', 'PG', 'A young psychiatrist applies for a job at a mental asylum and must pass a test by interviewing four patients. He must figure out which of the patients, is in fact, the doctor that he would be replacing if hired.', 'A young psychiatrist applies for a job at a mental asylum and must pass a test by interviewing four patients. He must figure out which of the patients, is in fact, the doctor that he would be replacing if hired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vETvqWG44fgj4XLAU135Z2rncwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25993'),
  ('834922694414054619', 'Asylum', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'David Mackenzie, Giles Nuttgens', 'Chrysanthy Balis, Patrick Marber', 'Natasha Richardson, Hugh Bonneville, Ian McKellen, Joss Ackland, Gus Lewis, Wanda Ventham, Maria Aitken, Hazel Douglas', null, 'A woman becomes very curious about one of her psychiatrist husband''s inmates, a man who was found guilty in the murder and disfigurement of his former wife.', 'A woman becomes very curious about one of her psychiatrist husband''s inmates, a man who was found guilty in the murder and disfigurement of his former wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dj0F0u5TJBZxsKf0xEtxgfGekxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24461'),
  ('408833023216147190', 'Asylum', 2008, 'Horror', 'David R. Ellis, Gary Capo, Oakley Lehman', 'Ethan Lawrence', 'Sarah Roemer, Mark Rolston, Jake Muxworthy, Travis Van Winkle, Ellen Hollman, Joel Heyman, Lin Shaye, Cody Kasch', 'R', 'The teenager Madison McBride is traumatized by the loss of her deranged father when she was nine years old and the suicide of her beloved brother Brandon one year ago. She decides to join the Richard Miller University, where Brandon committed suicide, to overcome her demons. While walking to her dorm, she meets the weird janitor Wilbur Mackey that tells her that the place is haunted.', 'The teenager Madison McBride is traumatized by the loss of her deranged father when she was nine years old and the suicide of her beloved brother Brandon one year ago. She decides to join the Richard Miller University, where Brandon committed suicide, to overcome her demons. While walking to her dorm, she meets the weird janitor Wilbur Mackey that tells her that the place is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BqosTy8fBZxoo06vuCAnRKwXUs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19116'),
  ('1071960724154259265', 'Asylum Blackout', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alexandre Courtes, Laurent Tangy, Kelly Valentine Hendry', 'S. Craig Zahler', 'Kenny Doughty, Rupert Evans, Dave Legeno, Richard Brake, Darren Kent, Anna Skellern, Éric Godon, Ian Lyons', null, 'A group of cooks at an asylum for the criminally insane get locked in with the inmates during a massive thunderstorm', 'A group of cooks at an asylum for the criminally insane get locked in with the inmates during a massive thunderstorm', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xjm939J8yb8jCfSi8T9ABopqhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96648'),
  ('413977140185696330', 'Asylum of Fear', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Louis Wong, Craig Deering', 'Craig Deering, Allen Murphy', 'Maurice Demus, Callie Stephens, Michael Medford, James Doherty, Allen Murphy, Joe Mack, Ann Hagemann, Charles Straka', null, 'A team of paranormal investigators go on one last job to a haunted mental institution where children have reportedly gone missing. While searching for evidence of what is haunting the abandoned building, they stumble upon clues that reveal what made the former head doctor snap and go on a killing spree through the halls decades earlier. Unfortunately, the more they uncover, the more they struggle to make it out of the asylum alive because something inside wants that mystery to stay dead and buried.', 'A team of paranormal investigators go on one last job to a haunted mental institution where children have reportedly gone missing. While searching for evidence of what is haunting the abandoned building, they stumble upon clues that reveal what made the former head doctor snap and go on a killing spree through the halls decades earlier. Unfortunately, the more they uncover, the more they struggle to make it out of the asylum alive because something inside wants that mystery to stay dead and buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxXaogii3ZVZ5PswHynsrWLG1dP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497327'),
  ('755589901070473312', 'Asylum: Twisted Horror and Fantasy Tales', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Caye Casas, Alejandro Damiani, Kheireddine El-Helou', 'Mauro Croche, Guillermo Lockhart', 'Raymond E. Lee, Ariadna Asturzzi, Sam Jaeger, Heather Morris, Neil Grays, Jessica Mann, Cheetah Platt, Cameron Simmons', null, 'Brandon prepares to give his last stand-up comedy show. As his stories and jokes pass, the public begins to cheer up. But at that precise moment Brandon will realize that these stories have a strong relationship with his past. More than he imagines.', 'Brandon prepares to give his last stand-up comedy show. As his stories and jokes pass, the public begins to cheer up. But at that precise moment Brandon will realize that these stories have a strong relationship with his past. More than he imagines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rxKic2PDrheSXMCG82vm9LAm8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704630'),
  ('709225232062675733', 'AT (Welcome to the Dark Side)', 2026, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Don Max, Ravi Chandran', 'Don Max', 'Arun Mohanan, Sujith Sadasivan, Shaju Sreedhar, Rachel David, Nayana Elza', null, 'At is based on the actual facts that explores the rise of a new Internet; beyond everything you thought you knew about the dangers, and promise, of the Darkweb', 'At is based on the actual facts that explores the rise of a new Internet; beyond everything you thought you knew about the dangers, and promise, of the Darkweb', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FarkvG2T7GYec8z1tZQ6tk4GUQPA.jpg', 'plex:movie:at-welcome-to-the-dark-side');
